   "summary": "以三峽大型複合工程為背景，進一步追蹤預報偏差如何耗用防洪空間、長庫區流量如何轉成不均勻水位，以及泥砂和溫度如何改變調度判斷。學員把船閘用水、機組淨水頭及電力爬坡列成可核對帳本，避免只用總裝機容量代表每個時段的可供電力。",
   "summaryEn": "Using Three Gorges as context, trace how forecast bias consumes flood space, how flow produces spatially varying levels, and how sediment and temperature affect decisions. Build auditable accounts of lock water, turbine net head and electrical ramping, recognizing that installed capacity cannot describe deliverable power in every interval.",
