       "instruction": "將逐時預報與事後入流各列一欄，以相同起訖時間積分並核對水位庫容表推算的增量。另查出流儀表是否延遲，若流量偏差與水位變化不閉合，先排除時間戳及曲線版本不同，不直接調整防洪限制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Tabulate hourly forecasts beside reconstructed inflow, integrate over identical limits and compare the increment with the stage-storage relation. Check release-meter delay separately. If flow imbalance and level change disagree, investigate timestamps and curve versions before interpreting the discrepancy as lost flood space. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：建立六小時誤差帳，再把偏差改成前半正值、後半負值，分別比較最大暫存量與期末淨增量，說明兩者對預留空間的意義不同。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Build a six-hour error account, then reverse the bias sign halfway through. Compare maximum temporary storage with the final net increment and explain why they imply different space requirements.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：預報低估若與出流受限同時發生，庫容偏差會持續累積；但水位異常也可能來自回水或量測基準漂移，必須以第二種水量證據區分，不能只憑單站水位判斷預報失準。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Underprediction combined with constrained release accumulates storage error. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "three-gorges-v15-03-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "將逐時預報與事後入流各列一欄，以相同起訖時間積分並核對水位庫容表推算的增量。另查出流儀表是否延遲，若流量偏差與水位變化不閉合，先排除時間戳及曲線版本不同，不直接調整防洪限制。",
         "textEn": "Tabulate hourly forecasts beside reconstructed inflow, integrate over identical limits and compare the increment with the stage-storage relation. Check release-meter delay separately. If flow imbalance and level change disagree, investigate timestamps and curve versions before interpreting the discrepancy as lost flood space.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v5-place-c445157198d7",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "three-gorges-v15-03-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "建立六小時誤差帳，再把偏差改成前半正值、後半負值，分別比較最大暫存量與期末淨增量，說明兩者對預留空間的意義不同。",
         "textEn": "Build a six-hour error account, then reverse the bias sign halfway through. Compare maximum temporary storage with the final net increment and explain why they imply different space requirements.",
