       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「洪峰預報偏差帳」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Flood forecast bias account” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "預報低估若與出流受限同時發生，庫容偏差會持續累積；但水位異常也可能來自回水或量測基準漂移，必須以第二種水量證據區分，不能只憑單站水位判斷預報失準。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Underprediction combined with constrained release accumulates storage error. An unusual level can also reflect backwater or datum drift, so a second water-balance observation is needed before assigning the discrepancy to forecast failure. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：逐時正負誤差可能在期末抵消，但最大累積偏差仍決定需要保留的暫時空間，應同時報告兩種量。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Positive and negative hourly errors may cancel at the endpoint, while the maximum cumulative error still determines temporary space requirements; report both quantities.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「每次預報更新都應另加一筆來水」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Every forecast revision should be counted as an additional inflow.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "three-gorges-v15-04-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
