         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: A1=380 km2; A2=420 km2; dz=2 m; dV=(A1+A2)/2*1e6*dz=800000000 m3. Model boundary: area changes linearly with elevation between observations and the surface is level; this is not a complete capacity curve.",
