       "instruction": "岸線插值錯誤會讓可用庫容被高估，尤其在淹沒平台突然展寬的位置；這類幾何誤差與蒸發損失的時間特徵不同，可用靜水測量及多次水量閉合分辨。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Incorrect shoreline interpolation can overstate usable storage, especially where a submerged terrace widens abruptly. This geometric error behaves differently from evaporation loss and can be distinguished using static surveys and repeated balance closure. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
