       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Q=2000 m3/s; C=0.30 kg/m3; t=86400 s; f=0.60 (dimensionless); rhoDry=1200 kg/m3; V=Q*C*t*f/rhoDry=25920 m3.",
