       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Deposited volume can be calculated directly using particle density.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「泥砂質量與淤積」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
