       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Sediment mass and deposition” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "只用表層濃度容易漏掉近底高濃度流，低估留庫質量；若直接用顆粒實體密度換算，還會忽略孔隙而低估沉積體積，兩項誤差可能同向疊加。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Surface samples can miss concentrated near-bed flow and understate retained mass. Converting with particle density also ignores pore space and understates deposited volume, allowing both errors to reinforce one another. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：乾容重包含沉積孔隙的體積效應，壓密後即使乾質量不變，對應占據庫容仍可能減少，需明示測量齡期。",
