       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Layered withdrawal temperature mixing” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Three Gorges Dam Engineering”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "深庫水溫分層會讓相同總流量具有不同下游熱負荷。理想混合先以各支流質量流率乘比熱與溫度作能量守恆，再求共同出口溫度；開口所在高程不等於實際吸入水層，因取水流束可能跨越密度界面，必須量測垂向剖面。 熱量帳應明示共同參考溫度；在相同比熱近似下參考值會相消，但水流的實際來源與交換路徑不能省略。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「分層取水混溫」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Thermal stratification allows equal total releases to carry different downstream heat loads. Ideal mixing conserves each stream mass flow multiplied by heat capacity and temperature. The elevation of an opening does not uniquely identify the withdrawn layer, because the intake flow can entrain water across a density interface. The heat account needs a common reference temperature; it cancels under equal heat capacities, while stream origins and exchange paths still require explicit identification. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Layered withdrawal temperature mixing” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：Qwarm=120 m3/s; Twarm=22 degC; Qcold=80 m3/s; Tcold=12 degC; Tout=(Qwarm*Twarm+Qcold*Tcold)/(Qwarm+Qcold)=18 degC。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Qwarm=120 m3/s; Twarm=22 degC; Qcold=80 m3/s; Tcold=12 degC; Tout=(Qwarm*Twarm+Qcold*Tcold)/(Qwarm+Qcold)=18 degC.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「出口平均溫度就是整段河川溫度」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"The average outlet temperature represents the entire receiving river reach.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「分層取水混溫」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Layered withdrawal temperature mixing”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
