         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Qwarm=120 m3/s; Twarm=22 degC; Qcold=80 m3/s; Tcold=12 degC; Tout=(Qwarm*Twarm+Qcold*Tcold)/(Qwarm+Qcold)=18 degC. Model boundary: equal density and heat capacity, complete mixing and no external heat exchange; not an ecological compliance temperature.",
