       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「分層取水混溫」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Layered withdrawal temperature mixing” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "在取水口上游布設垂向溫度剖面，並量測混合後斷面的橫向差異。以總流量與熱量殘差檢查混合是否完成；若出口單點溫度符合算值而橫向差異仍大，不能宣稱整個河段具有同一熱環境。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure an upstream vertical temperature profile and lateral differences after mixing. Check total flow and heat residuals. If one outlet sensor matches the calculation while lateral differences remain large, the entire receiving reach cannot be described by that single temperature. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：固定總出流，求得另一目標溫度所需冷暖流量比例，再列出若冷水層厚度不足時模型失效的證據，以及需補充的剖面量測。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Hold total release constant and solve the warm-to-cold flow ratio for another target temperature. List observations showing that insufficient cold-layer thickness invalidates the assumption and specify additional profile measurements.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：水躍或分層流可能使冷水沿底部延伸，表面測值會掩蓋底層熱衝擊；感測器反應慢也可能削弱短時變化，應將空間不均與儀器滯後分別辨識。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Stratified release can carry cold water along the bed while surface readings hide the thermal change. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
