       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Layered withdrawal temperature mixing” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "水躍或分層流可能使冷水沿底部延伸，表面測值會掩蓋底層熱衝擊；感測器反應慢也可能削弱短時變化，應將空間不均與儀器滯後分別辨識。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Stratified release can carry cold water along the bed while surface readings hide the thermal change. Slow sensor response can also suppress short events, so spatial nonuniformity and instrument lag require separate diagnosis. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：熱量帳應明示共同參考溫度；在相同比熱近似下參考值會相消，但水流的實際來源與交換路徑不能省略。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: The heat account needs a common reference temperature; it cancels under equal heat capacities, while stream origins and exchange paths still require explicit identification.",
