     "description": "本階段聚焦「船閘用水時序」與「升船機平衡偏差」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Lockage water timing\" and \"Ship lift balance imbalance\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "three-gorges-v15-17",
       "title": "船閘用水時序：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Lockage water timing: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
