       "objective": "說明「船閘用水時序」如何影響長江三峽大壩工程的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Lockage water timing” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Three Gorges Dam Engineering”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "船閘升降依靠閘室水位變化，船隻排水量在同船進出且水位轉換完整時不應重複計入。教材先用閘室平面積乘水位差建立一個升降階段的幾何水量，再把循環次數放到時段帳中；多級閘室之間的共享水及回收系統必須另建連接關係。 每個閘室都應有控制體，級間移轉在整體帳內會互相抵消，只有跨越外部邊界的水量才形成淨耗用。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「船閘用水時序」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A lock changes chamber level to move vessels. Vessel displacement must not be counted repeatedly when the same vessel enters and leaves a complete level-change cycle. Chamber area times lift gives one stage geometric volume; the number and timing of cycles then enter the water account. Shared water between stages requires an explicit connection model. Each chamber needs a control volume; interstage transfers cancel in the overall account, and only flow crossing its external boundary contributes to net use. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Lockage water timing” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：A=4200 m2; dh=18 m; N=12 cycles/day; V=A*dh*N=907200 m3/day。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: A=4200 m2; dh=18 m; N=12 cycles/day; V=A*dh*N=907200 m3/day.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「通船艘數就是獨立升降循環數」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Vessel count is the same as the number of independent lockage cycles.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「船閘用水時序」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Lockage water timing”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
