       "objective": "從症狀倒推「船閘用水時序」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Lockage water timing” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "閥門漏水會使停等期間仍有水量移轉，幾何升降帳因而不能閉合；但多艘共閘與級間調水也會造成表面差異，應先辨認流程再指認設備洩漏。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Valve leakage transfers water during waiting periods and prevents geometric closure. Shared lockages and interstage transfers can produce similar apparent differences, so the operating sequence must be reconstructed before diagnosing equipment leakage. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：每個閘室都應有控制體，級間移轉在整體帳內會互相抵消，只有跨越外部邊界的水量才形成淨耗用。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Each chamber needs a control volume; interstage transfers cancel in the overall account, and only flow crossing its external boundary contributes to net use.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「通船艘數就是獨立升降循環數」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
