       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Ship lift balance imbalance” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：dm=18000 kg; g=9.81 m/s2; v=0.08 m/s; eta=0.80 (dimensionless); P=dm*g*v/eta=17658 W。模型邊界：僅算固定速度下不平衡重力功率，不含摩擦加速及制動冗餘。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: dm=18000 kg; g=9.81 m/s2; v=0.08 m/s; eta=0.80 (dimensionless); P=dm*g*v/eta=17658 W. Model boundary: gravitational imbalance power at constant speed only; excludes friction, acceleration and braking redundancy. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：以槽水位、排出水量和稱重記錄核對浮力替代關係，再比較空槽與載船的同速電流。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Compare trough level, displaced water and weighing records, then compare empty and occupied trough current at equal speed.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
