       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Ship lift balance imbalance” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以槽水位、排出水量和稱重記錄核對浮力替代關係，再比較空槽與載船的同速電流。若差值隨運動方向改變，應檢查摩擦與導向偏載；若與水位偏差一致，才支持殘餘重量解釋。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare trough level, displaced water and weighing records, then compare empty and occupied trough current at equal speed. Direction-dependent differences suggest friction or guide loading, whereas a consistent relation with level error supports an imbalance-weight explanation for the extra demand. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：把水位誤差換算成新增水重，與給定不平衡質量比較，再列出加速度與導向摩擦所需額外資料，繪製完整功率帳而不把缺項設成零。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Convert a level error into added water mass and compare it with the stated imbalance. List additional data needed for acceleration and guide friction, and build a complete power account without silently setting missing terms to zero.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：水位控制失準會改變槽內總重，造成原先平衡假設不成立；導輪卡阻也會提高電流，但不會以相同方式改變靜態重量，兩者需靠停機稱重與方向試驗區分。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Incorrect level control changes total trough weight and invalidates the balance assumption. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
