         "text": "以槽水位、排出水量和稱重記錄核對浮力替代關係，再比較空槽與載船的同速電流。若差值隨運動方向改變，應檢查摩擦與導向偏載；若與水位偏差一致，才支持殘餘重量解釋。",
         "textEn": "Compare trough level, displaced water and weighing records, then compare empty and occupied trough current at equal speed. Direction-dependent differences suggest friction or guide loading, whereas a consistent relation with level error supports an imbalance-weight explanation for the extra demand.",
