         "text": "水位控制失準會改變槽內總重，造成原先平衡假設不成立；導輪卡阻也會提高電流，但不會以相同方式改變靜態重量，兩者需靠停機稱重與方向試驗區分。",
         "textEn": "Incorrect level control changes total trough weight and invalidates the balance assumption. A binding guide also raises current without the same static weight change, allowing weighing and direction tests to distinguish the two mechanisms.",
         "sourceIds": [
