    {
     "id": "three-gorges-v15-s4",
     "title": "試驗、量測與監測驗證",
     "titleEn": "Testing, measurement and monitoring",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「淨水頭功率帳」與「電力爬坡能量」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Net head power account\" and \"Electrical ramp energy\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "three-gorges-v15-25",
       "title": "淨水頭功率帳：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Net head power account: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v5-place-c445157198d7",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "three-gorges-v15-24"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「淨水頭功率帳」如何影響長江三峽大壩工程的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Net head power account” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Three Gorges Dam Engineering”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "發電水頭是能量高程差扣除引水系統損失，不是壩高或水庫高程的同義詞。尾水抬升與攔污柵阻塞都會降低淨水頭，卻有不同的量測位置及維修責任。把水力功率、軸功率與電功率依效率串接，才能避免在不同儀表邊界間重複扣損。 速度水頭必須和壓力水頭使用相容斷面，若兩端斷面差異很大，僅以靜水位差代替能量差會有偏差。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「淨水頭功率帳」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Generating head is the energy-level difference after conveyance losses, not dam height or reservoir elevation. Tailwater rise and trash-rack blockage both reduce net head but have different measurement locations and maintenance implications. Distinguish hydraulic, shaft and electrical power when applying efficiencies so that losses are not deducted twice across instrument boundaries. Velocity and pressure heads require compatible sections; markedly different inlet and outlet sections make a simple static-level difference an incomplete estimate of energy difference. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Net head power account” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：Q=650 m3/s; Hg=92 m; hL=4 m; rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; eta=0.91 (dimensionless); P=rho*g*Q*(Hg-hL)*eta/1e6=510.63012 MW。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Q=650 m3/s; Hg=92 m; hL=4 m; rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; eta=0.91 (dimensionless); P=rho*g*Q*(Hg-hL)*eta/1e6=510.63012 MW.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「壩高可直接當作機組淨水頭」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Dam height can be used directly as turbine net head.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「淨水頭功率帳」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Net head power account”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "three-gorges-v15-25-k1",
         "title": "淨水頭功率帳",
         "titleEn": "Net head power account",
         "text": "發電水頭是能量高程差扣除引水系統損失，不是壩高或水庫高程的同義詞。尾水抬升與攔污柵阻塞都會降低淨水頭，卻有不同的量測位置及維修責任。",
         "textEn": "Generating head is the energy-level difference after conveyance losses, not dam height or reservoir elevation. Tailwater rise and trash-rack blockage both reduce net head but have different measurement locations and maintenance implications.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v5-place-c445157198d7",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
