         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：壩高可直接當作機組淨水頭 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Dam height can be used directly as turbine net head. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
