       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「淨水頭功率帳」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Net head power account” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "同步讀取進出口能量高程、流量與電端功率，以同一時段計算效率，並核對壓力計高程補償。若損失隨流量平方增加而機組效率曲線正常，先查引水阻力，不把全部差值歸因於轉輪劣化。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Synchronize inlet and outlet energy levels, discharge and terminal power, including pressure-tap elevation corrections. If loss grows approximately with flow squared while the turbine efficiency trend remains normal, investigate conveyance resistance before assigning the entire discrepancy to runner deterioration. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：分別增加尾水高程及柵損失，保持其他輸入不變重算功率，再畫出兩個情境所需量測位置，說明相同功率下降為何需要不同處理。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Increase tailwater level and rack loss in separate scenarios while holding other inputs constant. Recalculate power and locate the measurements needed to explain why equal power reductions require different responses.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：尾水資料延遲會造成虛假的效率升降，尤其在快速增載後；堵塞柵前後的壓差才是局部損失證據，不能僅由電力降低推定必須更換機組。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Delayed tailwater data create artificial efficiency changes after load increases. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
