         "text": "同步讀取進出口能量高程、流量與電端功率，以同一時段計算效率，並核對壓力計高程補償。若損失隨流量平方增加而機組效率曲線正常，先查引水阻力，不把全部差值歸因於轉輪劣化。",
         "textEn": "Synchronize inlet and outlet energy levels, discharge and terminal power, including pressure-tap elevation corrections. If loss grows approximately with flow squared while the turbine efficiency trend remains normal, investigate conveyance resistance before assigning the entire discrepancy to runner deterioration.",
         "sourceIds": [
