       "objective": "從症狀倒推「淨水頭功率帳」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Net head power account” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "尾水資料延遲會造成虛假的效率升降，尤其在快速增載後；堵塞柵前後的壓差才是局部損失證據，不能僅由電力降低推定必須更換機組。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Delayed tailwater data create artificial efficiency changes after load increases. Differential pressure across a blocked rack is evidence of local loss; reduced electrical output alone does not establish that the generating unit needs replacement. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：速度水頭必須和壓力水頭使用相容斷面，若兩端斷面差異很大，僅以靜水位差代替能量差會有偏差。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Velocity and pressure heads require compatible sections; markedly different inlet and outlet sections make a simple static-level difference an incomplete estimate of energy difference.",
