       "objective": "說明「電力爬坡能量」如何影響長江三峽大壩工程的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Electrical ramp energy” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Three Gorges Dam Engineering”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "電網要求的功率爬坡會沿水力傳動鏈改變流量及壓力，但功率斜率與累計能量是不同維度。先以功率時間曲線求能量，再檢查水量及暫態約束是否容許該曲線；額外能量只是相對基線的面積，不能將爬坡末值乘全時段而忽略初值。 功率曲線下面積的單位是能量，曲線斜率則是功率每時間，將兩者分開才能對照不同調度合約要求。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「電力爬坡能量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A grid power ramp changes flow and pressure through the hydraulic chain, but ramp rate and accumulated energy have different dimensions. Integrate the power-time curve first, then check water and transient constraints. Additional energy is the area above a baseline, not the final power multiplied by the whole ramp duration. Area under a power curve is energy, whereas its slope is power per time; separating them permits comparison with different dispatch requirements and limits. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Electrical ramp energy” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：P0=400 MW; P1=700 MW; dt=0.25 h; E=(P0+P1)/2*dt=137.5 MWh。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: P0=400 MW; P1=700 MW; dt=0.25 h; E=(P0+P1)/2*dt=137.5 MWh.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「總電量相同就代表爬坡影響相同」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Equal total energy means that ramp trajectories have equivalent effects.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「電力爬坡能量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Electrical ramp energy”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "three-gorges-v15-29-k1",
         "title": "電力爬坡能量",
         "titleEn": "Electrical ramp energy",
         "text": "電網要求的功率爬坡會沿水力傳動鏈改變流量及壓力，但功率斜率與累計能量是不同維度。先以功率時間曲線求能量，再檢查水量及暫態約束是否容許該曲線；額外能量只是相對基線的面積，不能將爬坡末值乘全時段而忽略初值。",
         "textEn": "A grid power ramp changes flow and pressure through the hydraulic chain, but ramp rate and accumulated energy have different dimensions. Integrate the power-time curve first, then check water and transient constraints.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v5-place-c445157198d7",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
