         "id": "three-gorges-v15-29-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：總電量相同就代表爬坡影響相同 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Equal total energy means that ramp trajectories have equivalent effects. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
