         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: P0=400 MW; P1=700 MW; dt=0.25 h; E=(P0+P1)/2*dt=137.5 MWh. Model boundary: linear electrical power ramp only; hydraulic transient and grid constraints are not thereby satisfied.",
