       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「電力爬坡能量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Electrical ramp energy” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以秒級電功率積分核對時段電表，再將調度命令、導葉位置與壓力峰值按時間對齊。若總電量正確但壓力有尖峰，問題屬爬坡形狀而非能量帳；應保留原始波形，不只保存十五分鐘平均值。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Integrate second-scale terminal power and compare the interval meter, then align dispatch commands, guide-vane position and pressure peaks. Correct total energy with a pressure spike indicates a ramp-shape problem, so retain raw waveforms instead of only fifteen-minute averages for the diagnosis. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：比較線性爬坡與先快後慢的兩段曲線，使兩者總電量相同，再指出哪幾個水力與電氣量必須高頻記錄才能判斷各自限制。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Compare a linear ramp with a two-stage fast-then-slow ramp having equal energy. Identify the hydraulic and electrical variables requiring rapid recording to determine the different constraints on each trajectory.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：只核對時段電量會漏掉短時壓力超越或機組振動，因正負功率偏差可能互相抵消；若時間戳錯位，也會把先前的壓力事件錯配到後續命令。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Checking interval energy alone can miss brief pressure or vibration excursions because positive and negative power errors cancel. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "three-gorges-v15-31-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "以秒級電功率積分核對時段電表，再將調度命令、導葉位置與壓力峰值按時間對齊。若總電量正確但壓力有尖峰，問題屬爬坡形狀而非能量帳；應保留原始波形，不只保存十五分鐘平均值。",
         "textEn": "Integrate second-scale terminal power and compare the interval meter, then align dispatch commands, guide-vane position and pressure peaks. Correct total energy with a pressure spike indicates a ramp-shape problem, so retain raw waveforms instead of only fifteen-minute averages for the diagnosis.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v5-place-c445157198d7",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
