       "objective": "從症狀倒推「電力爬坡能量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Electrical ramp energy” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "只核對時段電量會漏掉短時壓力超越或機組振動，因正負功率偏差可能互相抵消；若時間戳錯位，也會把先前的壓力事件錯配到後續命令。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Checking interval energy alone can miss brief pressure or vibration excursions because positive and negative power errors cancel. Timestamp misalignment can additionally attach an earlier pressure event to a later dispatch command. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：功率曲線下面積的單位是能量，曲線斜率則是功率每時間，將兩者分開才能對照不同調度合約要求。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Area under a power curve is energy, whereas its slope is power per time; separating them permits comparison with different dispatch requirements and limits.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「總電量相同就代表爬坡影響相同」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Equal total energy means that ramp trajectories have equivalent effects.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "three-gorges-v15-32-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "只核對時段電量會漏掉短時壓力超越或機組振動，因正負功率偏差可能互相抵消；若時間戳錯位，也會把先前的壓力事件錯配到後續命令。",
         "textEn": "Checking interval energy alone can miss brief pressure or vibration excursions because positive and negative power errors cancel. Timestamp misalignment can additionally attach an earlier pressure event to a later dispatch command.",
