       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「長庫區回水高差」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Long reservoir backwater difference” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "先統一兩站水準基準並校正訊號時間，再比較低流量與洪水時的高差。若高差會隨流量改變而基準點穩定，支持水力回水解釋；若所有流量下都出現固定偏移，應先檢查測站基準。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Unify gauge datums and synchronize signals before comparing low-flow and flood differences. A flow-dependent difference with stable benchmarks supports a hydraulic explanation. A fixed offset across all flow conditions instead calls for checking the reference elevations and calibration of the gauges. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：在同一長度下試算兩倍坡度的高差，並畫出支流匯入口前後應設的測站，說明哪些資料可檢查平均坡度假設，哪些需一維或二維模型。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Double the slope over the same length, then locate gauges around a tributary junction. Explain which observations test the mean-slope assumption and which questions require a one- or two-dimensional hydraulic model.",
