       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Multiple sensor residual diagnosis” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Three Gorges Dam Engineering”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "監測值可先扣除已校準的水位與季節效應，留下用來追查異常的殘差。標準化殘差有助比較不同單位的量測，但前提是基線期間與變異估計有效；相鄰感測器常受共同環境影響，不能把相關訊號誤當成多份獨立證據。 標準差估計須對應同一殘差定義，原始位移的季節變幅不能直接充當去季節後模型誤差的標準差。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「多感測殘差判讀」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A monitoring model can remove calibrated reservoir-level and seasonal effects to expose residuals for investigation. Standardization helps compare variables with different units only when the baseline period and variance estimate are valid. Nearby instruments often share environmental effects, so correlated signals must not be counted as several independent confirmations. The standard deviation must match the residual definition; seasonal variation in raw displacement cannot directly represent uncertainty after those seasonal effects have been removed. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Multiple sensor residual diagnosis” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：y=7.2 mm; yhat=5.4 mm; sigma=0.6 mm; z=(y-yhat)/sigma=3。",
