       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「多感測殘差判讀」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Multiple sensor residual diagnosis” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "同時檢查溫度、庫水位、量測基準及維修紀錄，將殘差與附近不同原理儀器比較。若僅單一通道偏離而獨立測量穩定，先查儀器；若多種原理同時偏離，再追查共同結構或水力原因。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Review temperature, reservoir level, reference control and maintenance records together, then compare residuals with nearby instruments using different physical principles. An isolated channel suggests an instrument issue; coherent changes across independent methods justify investigating a shared structural or hydraulic mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：建立包含季節項的假想量測序列，分別加入感測器跳值與緩慢結構位移，畫出原始值和殘差，提出可區分兩種原因的獨立觀測。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Create a hypothetical seasonal series and separately insert a sensor jump and slow structural movement. Plot observations and residuals, then propose an independent measurement that can distinguish the two underlying causes.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：基線若含長期漂移，標準差會被放大而掩蓋新異常；若校準資料只涵蓋低水位，外推至高水位也會產生假殘差，不能直接宣告壩體劣化。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A drifting baseline inflates the standard deviation and can conceal new changes. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
