       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Multiple sensor residual diagnosis” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "基線若含長期漂移，標準差會被放大而掩蓋新異常；若校準資料只涵蓋低水位，外推至高水位也會產生假殘差，不能直接宣告壩體劣化。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A drifting baseline inflates the standard deviation and can conceal new changes. A model trained only at low reservoir levels can also create false residuals at high levels, which do not alone demonstrate dam deterioration. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
