   "summary": "以胡佛壩為背景，區分自重抗滑與拱向傳力、裂縫連通與揚壓，以及冷卻收縮與接縫閉合。後半部把壓力瞬變、低水頭出力、排砂與量測溫漂連結，讓學員用相互獨立的證據判斷異常原因。所有試算都明示幾何與材料是假想值，不替代既有壩評估。",
   "summaryEn": "Using Hoover as context, distinguish gravity resistance from arch transfer, crack connectivity from uplift, and cooling contraction from joint closure. Later units connect pressure transients, low-head output, sediment and measurement drift, requiring independent evidence to distinguish causes. Every calculation uses declared hypothetical geometry or material data and cannot replace assessment of the existing dam.",
