       "objective": "說明「拱座相容與分力」如何影響胡佛壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Abutment compatibility and load sharing” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Hoover Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "拱重力壩把一部分水平荷載沿拱圈送到兩岸，也把一部分荷載透過壩底傳入基礎。教材以同位移的平行彈簧理解剛度與分力，不把它當成真實拱壩公式。岩體節理、施工縫及溫度會改變相容條件，所以增加某路徑剛度也會改變其他路徑分擔。 平行彈簧共同位移來自相容條件，若兩岸支承本身移動，需把支承位移加入，分力比例就不再只由剛度決定。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「拱座相容與分力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "An arch-gravity dam transfers some horizontal load toward the abutments and some through its base. Parallel springs with equal displacement illustrate stiffness-controlled sharing, not a real arch-dam design equation. Rock joints, construction joints and temperature alter compatibility, so stiffening one path changes the load carried by the other path as well. Equal spring displacement follows compatibility; moving supports introduce imposed displacements, after which stiffness ratios alone no longer determine the force shares between the paths. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Abutment compatibility and load sharing” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：ka=8 GN/m; kg=12 GN/m; F=100 MN; Fa=F*ka/(ka+kg)=40 MN。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: ka=8 GN/m; kg=12 GN/m; F=100 MN; Fa=F*ka/(ka+kg)=40 MN.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「只知道壩高就能決定拱向分力」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Dam height alone determines the arch load share.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「拱座相容與分力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
