       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Abutment compatibility and load sharing” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "在同一水位下比較壩體位移、拱座變形及溫度，避免用不同季節的位移直接反推剛度。以改變一個路徑剛度的敏感度分析檢查分力總和是否保持外力，並用多點量測辨認左右岸反應不對稱。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare dam displacement, abutment deformation and temperature at the same reservoir level before inferring stiffness. Change one path stiffness and confirm that load shares still sum to the applied force. Use several observations to distinguish an asymmetric abutment response from a uniform translation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：把拱座路徑剛度減半，重算兩種分力與共同位移，畫出每個路徑的自由體圖，列出需要岩體試驗才能確認的模型參數。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Halve the abutment-path stiffness and recalculate both load shares and common displacement. Draw a free-body diagram for each path and identify the parameters that require rock-mass testing before interpretation.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：拱座節理張開會使承載路徑變軟並把荷載移向其他部位；若只校準壩頂單點位移，可能得到看似正確的總剛度，卻完全錯判局部應力集中。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
