         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：只要量得裂縫長度就知道全部揚壓 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Crack length alone determines the complete uplift pressure distribution. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
