         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: V=5000 m3; rho=2400 kg/m3; c=900 J/(kg*K); dT=8 K; E=V*rho*c*dT/1e9=86.4 GJ. Model boundary: constant heat capacity and uniform cooling; continuing hydration heat and thermal stress are excluded.",
