       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「混凝土冷卻熱量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Concrete cooling heat account” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以核心、中間和表面溫度檢查均勻假設，再用冷卻水流量乘進出口溫差積分熱量。若水側移熱量大於混凝土顯熱減少，應查水化熱與邊界交換，不可立即認定溫度儀表故障。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check the uniform-temperature assumption using core, intermediate and surface readings, then integrate cooling-water flow times temperature rise. If water-side heat removal exceeds the concrete sensible-energy decrease, investigate hydration and boundary exchange before assuming the temperature instruments are defective. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：對同一熱量設計均勻與偏側冷卻兩個假想溫度剖面，指出哪些測點能區分兩者，再估算多移除一開爾文顯熱所需的額外能量。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Construct uniform and one-sided cooling profiles with the same total heat removal. Identify sensors that distinguish them, then calculate the additional sensible energy associated with one more kelvin of cooling.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：冷卻太集中會造成局部溫度梯度及裂縫，即使平均溫度下降符合目標也可能出現問題；裂縫又改變水密與局部傳熱，因此不能只以總移熱量驗收冷卻品質。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Concentrated cooling can create local gradients and cracking even when average temperature meets its target. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b202-v15-11-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "以核心、中間和表面溫度檢查均勻假設，再用冷卻水流量乘進出口溫差積分熱量。若水側移熱量大於混凝土顯熱減少，應查水化熱與邊界交換，不可立即認定溫度儀表故障。",
         "textEn": "Check the uniform-temperature assumption using core, intermediate and surface readings, then integrate cooling-water flow times temperature rise. If water-side heat removal exceeds the concrete sensible-energy decrease, investigate hydration and boundary exchange before assuming the temperature instruments are defective.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v6-hoover-dam",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
          "v15s-usace-catalog"
