       "objective": "從症狀倒推「混凝土冷卻熱量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Concrete cooling heat account” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "冷卻太集中會造成局部溫度梯度及裂縫，即使平均溫度下降符合目標也可能出現問題；裂縫又改變水密與局部傳熱，因此不能只以總移熱量驗收冷卻品質。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Concentrated cooling can create local gradients and cracking even when average temperature meets its target. Cracks subsequently alter watertightness and heat transfer, so total extracted energy alone cannot establish the quality of the cooling process. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：熱擴散時間隨特徵長度平方變化，縮小試件的冷卻曲線不能直接按時間等比例搬到大體積壩塊。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Thermal diffusion time scales with characteristic length squared, so cooling observations from small specimens cannot be transferred to massive blocks by simple linear time scaling.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「平均降溫達標就表示沒有梯度風險」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Meeting an average cooling target proves there is no gradient risk.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b202-v15-12-k1",
