       ],
       "objective": "說明「接縫閉合與溫度」如何影響胡佛壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Joint closure and temperature” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Hoover Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "分塊澆置留下的接縫，其開合取決於塊體自由熱變形、相鄰約束與水壓。線膨脹模型只描述未受約束的長度變化，接縫灌漿後的應力則需用實際約束分析。不能把某溫度下的縫寬直接解讀為永久缺陷，也不能把所有縫寬變化都歸於氣溫。 接縫量測方向若與縫面法線不一致，需將位移投影分解，否則剪切位移也可能混入開合讀值。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「接縫閉合與溫度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A joint between concrete blocks opens or closes through thermal strain, neighboring restraint and water loading. Linear expansion describes free length change only; stress after grouting depends on actual restraint. Joint width at one temperature is not automatically a permanent defect, and not every width change can be attributed to air temperature. A gauge not aligned with the joint normal requires displacement projection; otherwise tangential movement can contaminate the apparent opening or closure of the joint. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Joint closure and temperature” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=18 m; dT=12 K; dL=alpha*L*dT*1000=2.16 mm。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=18 m; dT=12 K; dL=alpha*L*dT*1000=2.16 mm.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「自由熱伸長就是受約束接縫閉合量」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Free thermal extension equals closure of a restrained joint.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「接縫閉合與溫度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Joint closure and temperature”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b202-v15-13-k1",
         "title": "接縫閉合與溫度",
         "titleEn": "Joint closure and temperature",
         "text": "分塊澆置留下的接縫，其開合取決於塊體自由熱變形、相鄰約束與水壓。線膨脹模型只描述未受約束的長度變化，接縫灌漿後的應力則需用實際約束分析。",
         "textEn": "A joint between concrete blocks opens or closes through thermal strain, neighboring restraint and water loading. Linear expansion describes free length change only; stress after grouting depends on actual restraint.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v6-hoover-dam",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
          "v15s-usace-catalog"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b202-v15-13-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：自由熱伸長就是受約束接縫閉合量 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Free thermal extension equals closure of a restrained joint. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v6-hoover-dam",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
