         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=18 m; dT=12 K; dL=alpha*L*dT*1000=2.16 mm. Model boundary: free expansion of one block along the measurement axis; not the actual closure of a restrained joint.",
