       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Joint closure and temperature” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "將接縫計讀值與塊體內部溫度及庫水位同步繪圖，查看升溫與降溫路徑是否重合。若有遲滯，再查接觸摩擦與裂縫連通；量測基座本身的熱伸縮也必須先校正，避免誤判壩體變形。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Plot joint readings with internal block temperature and reservoir level, checking whether warming and cooling paths coincide. Hysteresis calls for investigating contact friction or crack connectivity. Correct thermal movement of the instrument mounting itself before assigning the observed change to the dam. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：用三種熱膨脹係數重算自由伸長，另畫受約束與無約束兩個自由體圖，列出從位移轉成應力還缺少的剛度及接觸條件。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Recalculate free extension for three thermal expansion coefficients. Draw restrained and unrestrained free-body diagrams, then list stiffness and contact information still needed to convert displacement into a stress estimate.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：灌漿溫度與後續運轉溫度不相容時，可能造成過高接觸壓力或縫面重新張開；但單支接縫計也可能因固定端鬆動而跳值，需以附近位移證據區分。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
