       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Joint closure and temperature” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "灌漿溫度與後續運轉溫度不相容時，可能造成過高接觸壓力或縫面重新張開；但單支接縫計也可能因固定端鬆動而跳值，需以附近位移證據區分。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "An incompatible grouting and service-temperature range can produce excessive contact pressure or reopening. A loose gauge anchor can also cause a sudden reading change, requiring neighboring displacement evidence to distinguish the instrument fault from physical joint behavior. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：接縫量測方向若與縫面法線不一致，需將位移投影分解，否則剪切位移也可能混入開合讀值。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: A gauge not aligned with the joint normal requires displacement projection; otherwise tangential movement can contaminate the apparent opening or closure of the joint.",
