       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Penstock water hammer” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：rho=1000 kg/m3; a=900 m/s; dv=0.7 m/s; dp=rho*a*dv/1e6=0.63 MPa。模型邊界：速度變化快於相關往返波時間，單相彈性首波；未含汽穴與反射疊加。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: rho=1000 kg/m3; a=900 m/s; dv=0.7 m/s; dp=rho*a*dv/1e6=0.63 MPa. Model boundary: velocity change is faster than the relevant wave round-trip time; single-phase elastic first wave without cavitation or reflected-wave superposition. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：先以管長與波速估算往返時間，再比較控制動作時間及高速壓力記錄。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Estimate round-trip time from pipe length and wave speed, then compare actuator timing with rapid pressure records.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
