         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: rho=1000 kg/m3; a=900 m/s; dv=0.7 m/s; dp=rho*a*dv/1e6=0.63 MPa. Model boundary: velocity change is faster than the relevant wave round-trip time; single-phase elastic first wave without cavitation or reflected-wave superposition.",
