       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「壓力鋼管水錘」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Penstock water hammer” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "先以管長與波速估算往返時間，再比較控制動作時間及高速壓力記錄。用兩測點峰值到達差檢查波速，若訊號含低壓平台或不連續回升，應追查汽穴及氣體效應，而非只修改阻力係數。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Estimate round-trip time from pipe length and wave speed, then compare actuator timing with rapid pressure records. Arrival differences between two sensors test wave speed. Low-pressure plateaus or abrupt recovery warrant investigation of cavitation and gas effects rather than merely changing friction coefficients. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：分別把速度變化減半及波速降低，計算首波幅度，再用示意時空圖標出反射路徑，寫明何時必須改用完整特徵線暫態模型。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Halve the velocity change and reduce wave speed in separate cases. Calculate first-wave amplitudes, mark reflection paths on a space-time diagram, and state when a full method-of-characteristics transient model is required.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：延遲關閉或不協調的保護動作可能形成多次反射峰值，最大壓力不一定在首波；低壓端的液柱分離也可能在重新接合時產生更大衝擊。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Delayed or uncoordinated protective actions can produce repeated reflected peaks, with the maximum occurring after the first wave. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b202-v15-19-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "先以管長與波速估算往返時間，再比較控制動作時間及高速壓力記錄。用兩測點峰值到達差檢查波速，若訊號含低壓平台或不連續回升，應追查汽穴及氣體效應，而非只修改阻力係數。",
         "textEn": "Estimate round-trip time from pipe length and wave speed, then compare actuator timing with rapid pressure records. Arrival differences between two sensors test wave speed. Low-pressure plateaus or abrupt recovery warrant investigation of cavitation and gas effects rather than merely changing friction coefficients.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v6-hoover-dam",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
