       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：pabs=85000 Pa; pv=2500 Pa; rho=1000 kg/m3; v=25 m/s; sigma=(pabs-pv)/(0.5*rho*v*v)=0.264。模型邊界：使用局部平均絕對壓力；未給臨界汽蝕數或損傷速率。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: pabs=85000 Pa; pv=2500 Pa; rho=1000 kg/m3; v=25 m/s; sigma=(pabs-pv)/(0.5*rho*v*v)=0.264. Model boundary: uses local mean absolute pressure; no critical cavitation value or erosion rate is supplied. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
