       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「溢洪面汽蝕指標」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Spillway cavitation indicator” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "核對壓力感測器是表壓還是絕對壓，並量測水溫以選取蒸氣壓。將壓力波動、表面缺口及含氣記錄對齊，若平均值平穩但瞬時低壓頻繁，應分析低尾分布，不能以平均汽蝕數排除損傷。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Confirm whether the sensor reports gauge or absolute pressure and measure water temperature for vapor pressure. Align pressure fluctuations with surface defects and aeration observations. Frequent low-pressure excursions require analysis of the lower distribution tail even if the mean cavitation number appears steady. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：在固定壓力下把流速提高兩成，重算指標並說明平方效應，再列出判斷實際損傷還需的粗糙度、含氣與壓力波動證據。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Increase velocity by twenty percent at fixed pressure and recompute the indicator, explaining the squared effect. List roughness, aeration and pressure-fluctuation evidence still needed before assessing actual surface damage.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：錯把表壓當絕對壓會嚴重改變指標，表面錯台又可能使局部最低壓遠低於平均值；若只看總流量，就無法區分幾何缺陷與通氣不足的來源。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Confusing gauge with absolute pressure distorts the indicator, while a surface offset can make minimum pressure much lower than its mean. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
