         "text": "核對壓力感測器是表壓還是絕對壓，並量測水溫以選取蒸氣壓。將壓力波動、表面缺口及含氣記錄對齊，若平均值平穩但瞬時低壓頻繁，應分析低尾分布，不能以平均汽蝕數排除損傷。",
         "textEn": "Confirm whether the sensor reports gauge or absolute pressure and measure water temperature for vapor pressure. Align pressure fluctuations with surface defects and aeration observations. Frequent low-pressure excursions require analysis of the lower distribution tail even if the mean cavitation number appears steady.",
