       "objective": "從症狀倒推「溢洪面汽蝕指標」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Spillway cavitation indicator” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "錯把表壓當絕對壓會嚴重改變指標，表面錯台又可能使局部最低壓遠低於平均值；若只看總流量，就無法區分幾何缺陷與通氣不足的來源。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Confusing gauge with absolute pressure distorts the indicator, while a surface offset can make minimum pressure much lower than its mean. Total discharge alone cannot distinguish a geometric defect from inadequate air supply as the cause of damage. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：蒸氣壓取決於水溫，而局部絕對壓也受大氣壓影響，兩者均應使用與事件同時的條件比較。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Vapor pressure depends on water temperature and absolute local pressure depends on atmospheric conditions; both should represent the same event rather than unrelated reference conditions.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「所有表面可採同一汽蝕數界線」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
