       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b202-v15-24-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "錯把表壓當絕對壓會嚴重改變指標，表面錯台又可能使局部最低壓遠低於平均值；若只看總流量，就無法區分幾何缺陷與通氣不足的來源。",
         "textEn": "Confusing gauge with absolute pressure distorts the indicator, while a surface offset can make minimum pressure much lower than its mean. Total discharge alone cannot distinguish a geometric defect from inadequate air supply as the cause of damage.",
         "sourceIds": [
