       "objective": "說明「低水頭機組出力」如何影響胡佛壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Low head generating output” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Hoover Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "庫水位下降使可用水頭改變，維持同一功率可能需要增加流量，但管路損失和機組運轉範圍限制這種補償。教材先固定流量與效率比較水頭對出力的直接作用，再要求用機組特性曲線檢查效率假設，不能線性外推至所有低水位。 導葉開度與流量的關係隨水頭改變，固定開度不等於固定流量，比較模型時必須明確哪一項受到控制。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「低水頭機組出力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Falling reservoir level changes available head, and maintaining power may require more discharge. Conveyance losses and the machine operating range limit that compensation. First hold flow and efficiency constant to isolate the direct head effect, then consult machine characteristics; the assumed efficiency cannot be extrapolated to every low-water condition. The relation between guide-vane opening and discharge changes with head; fixed opening is not fixed flow, so the controlled quantity must be stated explicitly. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Low head generating output” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; Q=180 m3/s; H=70 m; eta=0.90 (dimensionless); P=rho*g*Q*H*eta/1e6=111.2454 MW。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; Q=180 m3/s; H=70 m; eta=0.90 (dimensionless); P=rho*g*Q*H*eta/1e6=111.2454 MW.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「低水頭可藉無限增加流量完全補償」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Any low head can be fully compensated by unlimited discharge.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「低水頭機組出力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Low head generating output”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b202-v15-25-k1",
         "title": "低水頭機組出力",
         "titleEn": "Low head generating output",
         "text": "庫水位下降使可用水頭改變，維持同一功率可能需要增加流量，但管路損失和機組運轉範圍限制這種補償。教材先固定流量與效率比較水頭對出力的直接作用，再要求用機組特性曲線檢查效率假設，不能線性外推至所有低水位。",
         "textEn": "Falling reservoir level changes available head, and maintaining power may require more discharge. Conveyance losses and the machine operating range limit that compensation.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v6-hoover-dam",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
