       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「低水頭機組出力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Low head generating output” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "將同步流量、淨水頭與電功率換算成效率，並按導葉開度分類比較，避免把不同工況混成一條趨勢。另查振動與壓力脈動，若功率模型符合而脈動增大，仍須研究運轉區域限制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Calculate efficiency from synchronized discharge, net head and terminal power, grouping observations by guide-vane position. Check vibration and pressure pulsation separately. Agreement with the power equation does not resolve an increasing pulsation level or establish suitability of that operating region. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以相同效率計算恢復原功率所需流量，再加入與流量平方相關的損失重算，繪出補償效果遞減的原因並列出機組曲線的必要資料。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Calculate the discharge needed to restore original power at fixed efficiency, then introduce flow-squared losses. Show why compensation diminishes and list the machine-curve data required to assess the revised point.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：為補償低水頭而增加流量，可能提高損失與不穩定流動，使預期增益落空；若流量計受流態改變影響，也會出現虛假的效率提升，需用獨立量測核對。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Increasing flow to compensate for low head may raise losses and unstable-flow effects enough to defeat the expected gain. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
