       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「沉積三角洲前移」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Sediment delta advance” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "重複測量同一基準的縱剖面及橫斷面，將前緣位置、頂積層厚度與粒徑一起比較。若測得體積增加但前緣未動，應查垂向加積或側向展寬，不能因簡式預測前移便宣稱測量錯誤。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Repeat longitudinal and cross-sectional surveys on one datum, comparing front position, topset thickness and grain size. If volume rises without front advance, investigate vertical aggradation or lateral widening rather than rejecting measurements because the simple translation model predicted movement. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：保持沉積體積不變，分別加倍前緣寬度與厚度，計算前移距離，再規劃足以分辨前移和垂向加積的三條重複測線。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Keep deposited volume fixed and separately double front width and thickness. Calculate advance distances, then plan three repeat survey lines that distinguish frontal translation from vertical accumulation.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：只追蹤表面岸線可能漏掉水下前緣逼近取水區；反之，水位變化造成的岸線位移也可能被誤作淤積，應以固定高程下的水下地形辨識。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Tracking only the visible shoreline can miss an underwater front approaching an intake. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b202-v15-31-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "重複測量同一基準的縱剖面及橫斷面，將前緣位置、頂積層厚度與粒徑一起比較。若測得體積增加但前緣未動，應查垂向加積或側向展寬，不能因簡式預測前移便宣稱測量錯誤。",
         "textEn": "Repeat longitudinal and cross-sectional surveys on one datum, comparing front position, topset thickness and grain size. If volume rises without front advance, investigate vertical aggradation or lateral widening rather than rejecting measurements because the simple translation model predicted movement.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v6-hoover-dam",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
          "v15s-usace-catalog"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b202-v15-31-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "保持沉積體積不變，分別加倍前緣寬度與厚度，計算前移距離，再規劃足以分辨前移和垂向加積的三條重複測線。",
         "textEn": "Keep deposited volume fixed and separately double front width and thickness. Calculate advance distances, then plan three repeat survey lines that distinguish frontal translation from vertical accumulation.",
         "sourceIds": [
