       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pendulum monitoring thermal drift” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "在儀器不移動的控制條件下校準溫度係數，再用現地獨立測量檢查修正後殘差。若季節訊號在不同原理儀器都出現，不應全部當成儀器漂移；並記錄更換支架前後的零點差。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Calibrate temperature sensitivity under controlled fixed-position conditions, then compare corrected residuals with independent field observations. Seasonal signals shared by different instrument principles should not all be removed as drift. Record zero shifts before and after replacement of mounting components as a separate effect. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：產生同時含壩體季節位移和儀器溫漂的序列，分別用獨立係數及錯誤回歸係數校正，展示兩種方法對異常偵測的不同結果。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Generate a series containing structural seasonal movement and instrument thermal drift. Correct it using an independent calibration and an incorrect regression coefficient, then demonstrate how the two approaches alter anomaly detection.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：用壩體量測本身回歸儀器溫度係數，可能把真正結構反應吸收到校正項而掩蓋變化；固定端鬆動則可能造成非線性跳值，線性溫漂公式無法修復。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
