       "objective": "從症狀倒推「垂線監測溫漂」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pendulum monitoring thermal drift” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "用壩體量測本身回歸儀器溫度係數，可能把真正結構反應吸收到校正項而掩蓋變化；固定端鬆動則可能造成非線性跳值，線性溫漂公式無法修復。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Regressing instrument sensitivity from dam movement itself can absorb genuine structural behavior into a correction term and conceal changes. A loose mounting point can cause nonlinear jumps that a linear thermal-drift equation cannot repair. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：溫漂係數具有量測軸向與安裝條件，儀器移位或更換支架後須重新檢查，不能沿用舊校準而未記錄。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: A drift coefficient belongs to a measurement axis and mounting arrangement; relocation or replacement of the support requires renewed checks and documented calibration continuity.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「溫漂校正應消除所有壩體季節位移」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Thermal drift correction should remove all seasonal movement of the dam.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b202-v15-36-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "用壩體量測本身回歸儀器溫度係數，可能把真正結構反應吸收到校正項而掩蓋變化；固定端鬆動則可能造成非線性跳值，線性溫漂公式無法修復。",
         "textEn": "Regressing instrument sensitivity from dam movement itself can absorb genuine structural behavior into a correction term and conceal changes. A loose mounting point can cause nonlinear jumps that a linear thermal-drift equation cannot repair.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v6-hoover-dam",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
          "v15s-usace-catalog"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b202-v15-36-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v6-hoover-dam",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
