         "text": "用設備接線圖與管線圖找出共同電源、閥件與吸入口，逐項核對測試是否真正涵蓋切換。把無需求時停機與有需求時失效分開統計；若兩泵常在同一事件失效，就不能保留獨立假設。",
         "textEn": "Trace shared power, valves and suction paths on electrical and hydraulic diagrams, then check whether tests actually exercise transfer. Distinguish planned idle states from failures on demand. Repeated simultaneous failures during one event invalidate the independence assumption used by the simple probability product.",
