       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; Q=45 m3/s; H=95 m; eta=0.86 (dimensionless); Pin=rho*g*Q*H/eta/1e6=48.76482558 MW.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「抽水電端功率等於水力功率乘效率」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
