         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; Q=45 m3/s; H=95 m; eta=0.86 (dimensionless); Pin=rho*g*Q*H/eta/1e6=48.76482558 MW. Model boundary: head includes assumed hydraulic losses and efficiency is overall electrical-to-hydraulic efficiency; steady operation.",
         "sourceIds": [
