       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「灌溉抽水能量帳」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Irrigation pumping energy account” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "同步量測流量、上下游壓力與高程及電端功率，先確認揚程是總揚程而非單一壓差。將實測耗電按每立方米水量表示，若隨水位降低而升高，須區分靜揚程增加與設備效率下降。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Synchronize flow, pressure, elevations and terminal power, confirming that head is total head rather than one pressure difference. Express consumption per cubic metre. If it rises as the source level falls, distinguish increased static lift from deterioration of equipment efficiency. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：固定輸送體積，分別比較高水位短時抽水與低水位長時抽水的總耗電，列出效率及管路阻力資料，避免只用尖峰功率選方案。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: For a fixed delivered volume, compare short pumping at a high source level with longer pumping at a low level. List efficiency and resistance data needed before choosing a schedule from peak power alone.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：進水柵堵塞會提高損失且可能降低吸入壓力，單靠增加馬達功率不一定恢復流量；電表和流量計時間窗不同也會偽造效率變化，需先檢查資料對齊。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: An obstructed intake raises losses and may reduce suction pressure, so increasing motor input need not restore discharge. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b203-v15-03-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "同步量測流量、上下游壓力與高程及電端功率，先確認揚程是總揚程而非單一壓差。將實測耗電按每立方米水量表示，若隨水位降低而升高，須區分靜揚程增加與設備效率下降。",
         "textEn": "Synchronize flow, pressure, elevations and terminal power, confirming that head is total head rather than one pressure difference. Express consumption per cubic metre. If it rises as the source level falls, distinguish increased static lift from deterioration of equipment efficiency.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-coulee-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
          "v15s-usace-catalog"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b203-v15-03-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "固定輸送體積，分別比較高水位短時抽水與低水位長時抽水的總耗電，列出效率及管路阻力資料，避免只用尖峰功率選方案。",
         "textEn": "For a fixed delivered volume, compare short pumping at a high source level with longer pumping at a low level. List efficiency and resistance data needed before choosing a schedule from peak power alone.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-coulee-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
