        "explanation": "同步量測流量、上下游壓力與高程及電端功率，先確認揚程是總揚程而非單一壓差。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。",
        "explanationEn": "Synchronize flow, pressure, elevations and terminal power, confirming that head is total head rather than one pressure difference. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."
