      {
       "id": "b203-v15-05",
       "title": "發電抽水淨交換：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Generation pumping net exchange: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-coulee-owner",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments",
        "v15s-usace-catalog"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b203-v15-04"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「發電抽水淨交換」如何影響大古力水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Generation pumping net exchange” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Grand Coulee Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "電站邊界的淨外送是發電、抽水及輔機耗電的代數和，卻不能代表各設備內部效率。不同設備的電表可能位於變壓器前後，必須統一計量邊界再作加減。水量帳也需另列，因取水到灌區的時間延遲不等於電力交換時段。 輔機可能由外部電網供電而非機組母線供電，淨外送與自用電帳必須依實際接線拓撲定義。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「發電抽水淨交換」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Net export at the station boundary is the algebraic sum of generation, pumping and auxiliary demand, but it does not describe internal equipment efficiency. Meters may sit on different sides of transformers, requiring a common boundary. Maintain a separate water account because delivery time to irrigation areas differs from the electrical exchange interval. Auxiliaries may draw from an external grid rather than the generating bus, so net export and internal consumption depend on the actual electrical connection topology. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Generation pumping net exchange” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：Pgen=620 MW; Ppump=180 MW; Paux=12 MW; Pnet=Pgen-Ppump-Paux=428 MW。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Pgen=620 MW; Ppump=180 MW; Paux=12 MW; Pnet=Pgen-Ppump-Paux=428 MW.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「淨外送減少必定表示發電效率下降」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Reduced net export always demonstrates lower generating efficiency.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「發電抽水淨交換」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Generation pumping net exchange”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b203-v15-05-k1",
         "title": "發電抽水淨交換",
         "titleEn": "Generation pumping net exchange",
         "text": "電站邊界的淨外送是發電、抽水及輔機耗電的代數和，卻不能代表各設備內部效率。不同設備的電表可能位於變壓器前後，必須統一計量邊界再作加減。",
         "textEn": "Net export at the station boundary is the algebraic sum of generation, pumping and auxiliary demand, but it does not describe internal equipment efficiency. Meters may sit on different sides of transformers, requiring a common boundary.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-coulee-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
          "v15s-usace-catalog"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b203-v15-05-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：淨外送減少必定表示發電效率下降 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Reduced net export always demonstrates lower generating efficiency. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-coulee-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
          "v15s-usace-catalog"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "關於「發電抽水淨交換」，下列哪一項敘述正確？",
        "questionEn": "Which statement about \"Generation pumping net exchange\" is correct?",
