       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Generation pumping net exchange” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：Pgen=620 MW; Ppump=180 MW; Paux=12 MW; Pnet=Pgen-Ppump-Paux=428 MW。模型邊界：所有功率同一時間與電端邊界，不另重扣已含於電表的損失。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Pgen=620 MW; Ppump=180 MW; Paux=12 MW; Pnet=Pgen-Ppump-Paux=428 MW. Model boundary: all powers use the same interval and electrical boundary; losses already included in readings are not deducted again. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：畫出每只電表相對母線及變壓器的位置，逐項核對輔機是否已含於淨電表，再比較各分表積分與外送總表。",
