       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Generation pumping net exchange” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "畫出每只電表相對母線及變壓器的位置，逐項核對輔機是否已含於淨電表，再比較各分表積分與外送總表。若殘差隨抽水啟停改變，應追查漏列負載或不同量測邊界，不先假設發電機效率跳變。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Map each meter relative to buses and transformers, check whether auxiliaries are already included, and compare integrated submeters with export metering. A residual that changes with pump switching suggests a missing load or inconsistent boundary before it suggests a sudden generator-efficiency change. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：為三種抽水時程計算日淨外送電量，並讓總抽水量相同，說明電價時序、灌溉需求與設備效率各需何種附加資料才能比較。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Calculate daily net export for three pumping schedules with equal delivered water. Explain the additional price timing, irrigation-demand and equipment-efficiency information needed to compare their practical consequences.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把抽水耗電同時列為輔機與獨立項目會重複扣除，造成虛假的低外送；若時間平均方式不同，短時啟動尖峰也可能被錯配到另一設備的時段。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Counting pump demand both as an auxiliary and a separate item double-deducts energy and understates export. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
