       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Generation pumping net exchange” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把抽水耗電同時列為輔機與獨立項目會重複扣除，造成虛假的低外送；若時間平均方式不同，短時啟動尖峰也可能被錯配到另一設備的時段。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Counting pump demand both as an auxiliary and a separate item double-deducts energy and understates export. Different averaging windows can also assign a brief starting peak to the wrong equipment interval, producing an apparent unexplained loss. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：輔機可能由外部電網供電而非機組母線供電，淨外送與自用電帳必須依實際接線拓撲定義。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Auxiliaries may draw from an external grid rather than the generating bus, so net export and internal consumption depend on the actual electrical connection topology.",
