    {
     "id": "b203-v15-s2",
     "title": "水力機制、材料與定量模型",
     "titleEn": "Hydraulics, materials and quantitative models",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「前池水位緩衝」與「輸水管摩阻尺度」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Forebay level buffering\" and \"Conveyance friction scaling\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b203-v15-09",
       "title": "前池水位緩衝：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Forebay level buffering: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-coulee-owner",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments",
        "v15s-usace-catalog"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b203-v15-08"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「前池水位緩衝」如何影響大古力水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Forebay level buffering” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Grand Coulee Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "前池可緩衝短時間的入出流不平衡，但水位變化會反過來影響泵揚程與進水條件。矩形水池的面積模型適合建立短時反應尺度；若池形變化大、波浪明顯或連接渠道長，則需把儲存與傳播分開，不能把所有測點當成同時同高。 渠道水面振盪能使局部水位先升後降而總儲量近乎不變，多站平均與流量積分提供不同但互補的資訊。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「前池水位緩衝」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A forebay buffers brief inflow-outflow imbalances, while changing level feeds back into pump head and intake conditions. A constant-area model establishes a short-term response scale. Strongly varying geometry, waves or long connecting canals require separate treatment of storage and propagation instead of assuming every gauge changes simultaneously. Surface oscillation can raise and lower a local level with little total storage change; multi-gauge averages and flow integration provide distinct complementary information. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Forebay level buffering” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：Qin=80 m3/s; Qout=95 m3/s; dt=600 s; A=300000 m2; dz=(Qin-Qout)*dt/A=-0.03 m。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Qin=80 m3/s; Qout=95 m3/s; dt=600 s; A=300000 m2; dz=(Qin-Qout)*dt/A=-0.03 m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「單點瞬時水位完全代表前池儲量」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"One instantaneous local level fully represents total forebay storage.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「前池水位緩衝」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Forebay level buffering”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b203-v15-09-k1",
         "title": "前池水位緩衝",
         "titleEn": "Forebay level buffering",
         "text": "前池可緩衝短時間的入出流不平衡，但水位變化會反過來影響泵揚程與進水條件。矩形水池的面積模型適合建立短時反應尺度；若池形變化大、波浪明顯或連接渠道長，則需把儲存與傳播分開，不能把所有測點當成同時同高。",
         "textEn": "A forebay buffers brief inflow-outflow imbalances, while changing level feeds back into pump head and intake conditions. A constant-area model establishes a short-term response scale.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-coulee-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
          "v15s-usace-catalog"
