         "text": "誤解：單點瞬時水位完全代表前池儲量 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: One instantaneous local level fully represents total forebay storage. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
