       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「前池水位緩衝」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Forebay level buffering” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以同時段入出流積分預測水位，再比較多站平均水位與單點波動。若單點振盪而平均儲量變化符合帳本，應研究水面振盪；若所有站都偏離，先檢查流量偏差與實際面積。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Integrate inflow and outflow to predict level, then compare the average of several gauges with local fluctuations. Oscillation at one station with a closing storage balance suggests surface motion. Coherent disagreement across stations instead calls for checking discharge bias and actual surface area. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將緩衝面積減半並改成兩段出流，逐段計算水位，畫出泵啟動前後的測站佈置，指出何時常面積模型不再足夠。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Halve the buffering area and use two successive outflows. Compute the level segment by segment, locate gauges around pump starting, and identify observations that would invalidate the constant-area model.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：前池太小可能讓短時抽水不平衡造成快速降水位，影響進水淹沒深度；感測器若設在局部流速大處，也會把動壓效應誤當成整池儲量下降。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Insufficient buffering can make a short pumping imbalance lower the level quickly and reduce intake submergence. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b203-v15-11-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "以同時段入出流積分預測水位，再比較多站平均水位與單點波動。若單點振盪而平均儲量變化符合帳本，應研究水面振盪；若所有站都偏離，先檢查流量偏差與實際面積。",
         "textEn": "Integrate inflow and outflow to predict level, then compare the average of several gauges with local fluctuations. Oscillation at one station with a closing storage balance suggests surface motion. Coherent disagreement across stations instead calls for checking discharge bias and actual surface area.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-coulee-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
          "v15s-usace-catalog"
         ]
        },
