         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "將緩衝面積減半並改成兩段出流，逐段計算水位，畫出泵啟動前後的測站佈置，指出何時常面積模型不再足夠。",
         "textEn": "Halve the buffering area and use two successive outflows. Compute the level segment by segment, locate gauges around pump starting, and identify observations that would invalidate the constant-area model.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-coulee-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
