      {
       "id": "b203-v15-13",
       "title": "輸水管摩阻尺度：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Conveyance friction scaling: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-coulee-owner",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments",
        "v15s-usace-catalog"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b203-v15-12"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「輸水管摩阻尺度」如何影響大古力水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Conveyance friction scaling” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Grand Coulee Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "灌溉輸水損失隨流速增大而快速上升，達西摩阻式把管長、直徑與粗糙影響放在同一能量帳。摩阻因子並非固定材料常數，會受雷諾數及相對粗糙度控制。教材固定因子只為隔離流速效應，實際比較前必須核對流況與局部構件。 截面直徑改變也會改變速度水頭，壓力差不全是耗散，必須先扣除可逆的動能與高程變化。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「輸水管摩阻尺度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Conveyance loss rises rapidly with velocity, and Darcy-Weisbach places length, diameter and roughness effects in one energy account. The friction factor is not a fixed material property; Reynolds number and relative roughness matter. Holding it constant isolates velocity effects for teaching, while field comparisons require flow-regime and fitting checks. A diameter change also changes velocity head, so pressure difference is not entirely dissipation; first account for reversible kinetic and elevation-energy changes between sections. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Conveyance friction scaling” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：f=0.018 (dimensionless); L=900 m; D=4 m; v=3 m/s; g=9.81 m/s2; hf=f*(L/D)*v*v/(2*g)=1.857798165 m。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: f=0.018 (dimensionless); L=900 m; D=4 m; v=3 m/s; g=9.81 m/s2; hf=f*(L/D)*v*v/(2*g)=1.857798165 m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「不同定義的摩阻因子可以直接互換」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Friction factors using different conventions can be interchanged directly.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「輸水管摩阻尺度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Conveyance friction scaling”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
