       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「輸水管摩阻尺度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Conveyance friction scaling” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "量測兩斷面壓力並補正高程及速度水頭，再把剩餘能量差與摩阻式比較。改變流量時查看損失與流速平方是否一致；若僅某閥位下突增，應分列局部損失而非把全部效應塞進管壁粗糙度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure pressure at two sections and correct elevation and velocity heads before comparing energy loss. Vary discharge to examine velocity-squared behavior. A jump associated with one valve position should be treated as local loss rather than absorbed entirely into inferred wall roughness. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：把流量提高兩成，在直徑不變下重算流速與摩阻，再增加一個已知局部損失係數，分別列出兩種損失對總揚程的貢獻。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Increase flow by twenty percent at unchanged diameter and recalculate velocity and friction. Add one known local-loss coefficient and separately account for each contribution to the total pumping head.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：混用范寧與達西因子會造成四倍誤差，粗糙度反算因而失真；管內空氣或未滿管流也會破壞原式假設，需要從壓力波動及排氣記錄辨識。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Mixing Fanning and Darcy factors creates a fourfold error and corrupts inferred roughness. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b203-v15-15-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "量測兩斷面壓力並補正高程及速度水頭，再把剩餘能量差與摩阻式比較。改變流量時查看損失與流速平方是否一致；若僅某閥位下突增，應分列局部損失而非把全部效應塞進管壁粗糙度。",
         "textEn": "Measure pressure at two sections and correct elevation and velocity heads before comparing energy loss. Vary discharge to examine velocity-squared behavior. A jump associated with one valve position should be treated as local loss rather than absorbed entirely into inferred wall roughness.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-coulee-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
          "v15s-usace-catalog"
