       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Irrigation return flow accounting” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：W=1200000 m3/day; ET=650000 m3/day; E=50000 m3/day; dS=100000 m3/day; R=W-ET-E-dS=400000 m3/day。模型邊界：所有項目同一灌區邊界與日尺度，正儲存表示留在區內。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: W=1200000 m3/day; ET=650000 m3/day; E=50000 m3/day; dS=100000 m3/day; R=W-ET-E-dS=400000 m3/day. Model boundary: all terms share one irrigation-area boundary and daily interval; positive storage remains within the area. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：將渠道進出流、土壤含水與作物蒸散估計對齊到同一天，另核對回歸水在下游的延遲。",
