       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「灌溉回歸流水帳」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Irrigation return flow accounting” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "將渠道進出流、土壤含水與作物蒸散估計對齊到同一天，另核對回歸水在下游的延遲。若日帳不閉合而多日累計閉合，可能是地下儲存及到達時間問題，不宜直接指認未計量取水。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Align canal flows, soil-water observations and evapotranspiration estimates to the same day, checking downstream return-flow delay separately. Daily imbalance that closes over several days may reflect subsurface storage and travel time rather than an unmetered withdrawal from the irrigation system. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：加入一日延遲的回歸流，建立連續三日水量表，再比較單日與三日淨消耗，提出一項能檢查地下儲存變化的現地觀測。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Add a one-day delay to return flow and construct a three-day balance. Compare daily and cumulative consumption, then propose a field observation that can test the inferred change in subsurface storage.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：將深層滲漏一律稱為浪費，可能忽略可回收地下水；但把所有滲漏都視為可利用回歸流也會高估供水，因水質、流向與時間均可能不符合需求。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Calling all deep percolation waste can ignore recoverable groundwater. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b203-v15-19-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "將渠道進出流、土壤含水與作物蒸散估計對齊到同一天，另核對回歸水在下游的延遲。若日帳不閉合而多日累計閉合，可能是地下儲存及到達時間問題，不宜直接指認未計量取水。",
         "textEn": "Align canal flows, soil-water observations and evapotranspiration estimates to the same day, checking downstream return-flow delay separately. Daily imbalance that closes over several days may reflect subsurface storage and travel time rather than an unmetered withdrawal from the irrigation system.",
         "sourceIds": [
