       "quiz": {
        "question": "在「灌溉回歸流水帳」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？",
        "questionEn": "When \"Irrigation return flow accounting\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?",
        "options": [
         "症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。",
