       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Concrete block temperature mismatch” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：alpha=0.00001 1/K; dTA=10 K; dTB=4 K; deps=alpha*(dTA-dTB)*1e6=60 microstrain。模型邊界：兩塊熱膨脹係數相同且只算自由應變差，不計徐變與約束。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: alpha=0.00001 1/K; dTA=10 K; dTB=4 K; deps=alpha*(dTA-dTB)*1e6=60 microstrain. Model boundary: equal thermal expansion coefficients and free-strain difference only, excluding creep and restraint. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：以埋入式溫度量測還原各塊核心歷程，配對接縫計及澆置日期，避免用外氣溫代表內部。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Reconstruct core temperature histories from embedded sensors and pair them with joint gauges and placement dates.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
