         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: alpha=0.00001 1/K; dTA=10 K; dTB=4 K; deps=alpha*(dTA-dTB)*1e6=60 microstrain. Model boundary: equal thermal expansion coefficients and free-strain difference only, excluding creep and restraint.",
