       "objective": "從症狀倒推「混凝土分塊溫差」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Concrete block temperature mismatch” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "只按相同日曆時間比較不同齡期混凝土，會忽略剛度及徐變發展；量測點離冷卻管太近也可能把局部溫度當成整塊平均，導致錯估相容差。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Comparing blocks only by calendar time ignores age-dependent stiffness and creep. A sensor too close to a cooling pipe can also represent a local temperature rather than the block average and distort the inferred compatibility difference. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：兩塊混凝土即使最終溫度相同，也可能因不同齡期的約束與徐變而留下不同殘餘應力，不能只比較終值。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Two blocks reaching the same final temperature may retain different stresses because restraint and creep developed at different ages; matching endpoints does not establish equivalent histories.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「兩塊自由應變差就是接縫裂縫寬度」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The free-strain difference of two blocks equals the joint crack width.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b203-v15-24-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "只按相同日曆時間比較不同齡期混凝土，會忽略剛度及徐變發展；量測點離冷卻管太近也可能把局部溫度當成整塊平均，導致錯估相容差。",
         "textEn": "Comparing blocks only by calendar time ignores age-dependent stiffness and creep. A sensor too close to a cooling pipe can also represent a local temperature rather than the block average and distort the inferred compatibility difference.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-coulee-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
          "v15s-usace-catalog"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b203-v15-24-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-coulee-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
          "v15s-usace-catalog"
         ]
