         "text": "在相近庫水位下配對測壓與排水量，將清孔前後的導水率反算並比較。若清孔後流量增加而孔壓下降，與恢復排水一致；若孔壓同升，須追查上游連通變化，不把所有增流都稱為維修成功。",
         "textEn": "Pair pressure and drainage at similar reservoir levels and infer conductance before and after cleaning. Increased flow with lower pressure supports restored drainage. If pressure also rises, investigate changed upstream connectivity rather than describing every increase in discharge as a successful repair.",
