       "objective": "從症狀倒推「基礎排水阻力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Foundation drainage resistance” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "排水出口淤塞會讓孔壓上升而流量下降，單看低流量可能誤以為滲漏改善；測壓管自身堵塞則會使反應遲緩，需要獨立水位變化試驗辨識。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "An obstructed outlet raises pressure while reducing discharge, so low flow alone may be mistaken for improved tightness. Blockage in the measuring tube instead produces a delayed response and needs an independent response test to identify. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：導水率的單位是面積每時間，與材料滲透係數的長度每時間不同，兩者還差流路幾何因子。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Hydraulic conductance has area-per-time units, unlike conductivity in length per time; a flow-path geometry factor is required before one can be converted into the other.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「排水量下降必定證明滲漏改善」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A decrease in drain flow always proves improved seepage control.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b203-v15-28-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "排水出口淤塞會讓孔壓上升而流量下降，單看低流量可能誤以為滲漏改善；測壓管自身堵塞則會使反應遲緩，需要獨立水位變化試驗辨識。",
         "textEn": "An obstructed outlet raises pressure while reducing discharge, so low flow alone may be mistaken for improved tightness. Blockage in the measuring tube instead produces a delayed response and needs an independent response test to identify.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-coulee-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
          "v15s-usace-catalog"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b203-v15-28-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-coulee-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
          "v15s-usace-catalog"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "在「基礎排水阻力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？",
        "questionEn": "When \"Foundation drainage resistance\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?",
        "options": [
         "所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。",
         "排水出口淤塞會讓孔壓上升而流量下降，單看低流量可能誤以為滲漏改善；測壓管自身堵塞則會使反應遲緩，需要獨立水位變化試驗辨識。",
         "可用機組台數足以保證同時滿載"
