        "answer": 1,
        "explanation": "排水出口淤塞會讓孔壓上升而流量下降，單看低流量可能誤以為滲漏改善；測壓管自身堵塞則會使反應遲緩，需要獨立水位變化試驗辨識。 需以量測區分可能原因。",
        "explanationEn": "An obstructed outlet raises pressure while reducing discharge, so low flow alone may be mistaken for improved tightness. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."
