        {
         "id": "b203-v15-29-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：可用機組台數足以保證同時滿載 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Available unit count alone guarantees simultaneous full-load operation. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-coulee-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
          "v15s-usace-catalog"
