         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: N=8 units; nout=2 units; Pu=120 MW/unit; Pav=(N-nout)*Pu=720 MW. Model boundary: equal output for remaining units and no shared constraints; hypothetical unit capacity only.",
