       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「停機容量與水量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Outage capacity and water allocation” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "將停機時程與水頭、可用流量和輸電限制放在同一張表，核對未停機機組是否真的可同時滿載。比較實際放流與發電流量，若差額經旁通排放，應在能量帳列明而非把它視為流量量測錯誤。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Combine outage timing with head, available discharge and transmission limits, checking whether the remaining units can actually reach full output simultaneously. Compare total release with turbine flow and account explicitly for bypassed water instead of treating the difference as a metering error. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：排列兩種檢修重疊方案，加入一項共同變壓器容量限制，逐時求可用容量並比較旁通水量，說明選擇方案還需哪些河道限制。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Arrange two overlapping-maintenance schedules, add a shared transformer limit and calculate hourly available capacity. Compare bypassed water and explain the downstream constraints still needed before selecting a maintenance plan.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：同時檢修共用變壓器可能讓更多機組失去外送能力，機組台數法因而高估容量；洪水時可用水量增加也不會解除電氣或機械共同限制。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Maintenance of a shared transformer may remove export capability from additional units, making unit counting overstate capacity. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b203-v15-31-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "將停機時程與水頭、可用流量和輸電限制放在同一張表，核對未停機機組是否真的可同時滿載。比較實際放流與發電流量，若差額經旁通排放，應在能量帳列明而非把它視為流量量測錯誤。",
         "textEn": "Combine outage timing with head, available discharge and transmission limits, checking whether the remaining units can actually reach full output simultaneously. Compare total release with turbine flow and account explicitly for bypassed water instead of treating the difference as a metering error.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-coulee-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
