       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Outage capacity and water allocation” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "同時檢修共用變壓器可能讓更多機組失去外送能力，機組台數法因而高估容量；洪水時可用水量增加也不會解除電氣或機械共同限制。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Maintenance of a shared transformer may remove export capability from additional units, making unit counting overstate capacity. Greater water availability during a flood does not remove a shared electrical or mechanical limit on the remaining machines. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：未被發電利用的水可能仍履行必要河道放流，因此旁通量應記入水量帳，而非自動視為可避免的浪費。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Water bypassing turbines may still satisfy required river release; account for its volume without automatically treating all bypass as an avoidable operational waste.",
