         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: dh1=1.245 m; dh2=-0.630 m; dh3=-0.612 m; e=(dh1+dh2+dh3)*1000=3 mm. Model boundary: sum of height differences around a three-leg closed loop, without an acceptance limit or adjustment rule.",
