      {
       "id": "b203-v15-35",
       "title": "水準基準閉合：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Level reference closure: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-coulee-owner",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments",
        "v15s-usace-catalog"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b203-v15-34"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「水準基準閉合」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Level reference closure” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "保留往返觀測、尺溫與儀器整平紀錄，先重測異常測段再決定是否配賦。將閉合差與外部穩定點連測結果分開呈現；若內部閉合良好但外部連測變動，應研究共同基準移動而非強行歸零。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Retain forward and backward observations, staff temperature and leveling checks. Remeasure an anomalous leg before adjustment. Present loop closure separately from the external-control tie; good internal closure with a changing external tie calls for investigating common benchmark movement rather than forcing zero displacement. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：製作一組單段粗差及一組所有基準共同移動的觀測，分別計算閉合差，說明哪一組需外部控制才能發現，並設計復測路線。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Create observations with a single-leg blunder and another set with common benchmark movement. Compute closure for each, identify which requires external control to detect, and design the confirming survey route.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：自動把閉合差平均分配，可能掩蓋單一測段粗差；若基準點位於會隨庫水位變形的區域，所有相對高程都可能受影響而仍表面自洽。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Automatically distributing closure equally can hide a blunder in one leg. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b203-v15-35-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "保留往返觀測、尺溫與儀器整平紀錄，先重測異常測段再決定是否配賦。將閉合差與外部穩定點連測結果分開呈現；若內部閉合良好但外部連測變動，應研究共同基準移動而非強行歸零。",
         "textEn": "Retain forward and backward observations, staff temperature and leveling checks. Remeasure an anomalous leg before adjustment. Present loop closure separately from the external-control tie; good internal closure with a changing external tie calls for investigating common benchmark movement rather than forcing zero displacement.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-coulee-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments",
          "v15s-usace-catalog"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b203-v15-35-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "製作一組單段粗差及一組所有基準共同移動的觀測，分別計算閉合差，說明哪一組需外部控制才能發現，並設計復測路線。",
