       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; Q=220 m3/s; H=80 m; etaOld=0.88 (dimensionless); etaNew=0.92 (dimensionless); dP=rho*g*Q*H*(etaNew-etaOld)/1e6=6.90624 MW。模型邊界：同一淨水頭流量的效率差，未含可用率與全年水文分布。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; Q=220 m3/s; H=80 m; etaOld=0.88 (dimensionless); etaNew=0.92 (dimensionless); dP=rho*g*Q*H*(etaNew-etaOld)/1e6=6.90624 MW. Model boundary: efficiency difference at identical net head and discharge; excludes availability and annual hydrologic distribution. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：在更新前後選取可比工況，校驗流量與功率儀表並重複測試，將不確定度與效率差並列。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Select comparable conditions before and after renewal, calibrate discharge and power instruments, and repeat measurements.",
