         "textEn": "Select comparable conditions before and after renewal, calibrate discharge and power instruments, and repeat measurements. Report uncertainty beside the efficiency difference. If the difference is below measurement resolution, state that improvement was not resolved rather than presenting a rounded positive value as a demonstrated gain.",
