     "id": "b204-v15-s1",
     "title": "水文條件、邊界與工程系統",
     "titleEn": "Hydrology, boundaries and engineering system",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「頻率極數與轉速」與「異頻換流能量」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Frequency poles and speed\" and \"Asynchronous conversion energy\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b204-v15-01",
       "title": "頻率極數與轉速：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Frequency poles and speed: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-itaipu-owner",
        "v6-science-itaipu-history",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
