         "id": "b204-v15-05-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：不同頻率換流後必定沒有能量損失 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Conversion between different frequencies necessarily has no energy loss. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
