         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Pin=900 MW; t=4 h; eta=0.965 (dimensionless); Eout=Pin*t*eta=3474 MWh. Model boundary: constant input and overall transfer efficiency, excluding dynamic limits and outages.",
