       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「異頻換流能量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Asynchronous conversion energy” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "比較送端與受端同一時窗的電表，先校正時鐘並明確列出換流及線路邊界。把損失與功率、環境溫度及設備狀態作圖，若差額只在切換時段出現，應先查積分時間與計量路徑。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare sending and receiving meters over one synchronized interval and define converter and line boundaries. Plot loss against power, ambient temperature and equipment state. A discrepancy confined to switching intervals calls for checking integration windows and meter paths before assigning a physical efficiency change. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：保持送端電量相同，設定兩種負載效率曲線比較受端電量，再列出換流站與線路應分設哪些電表才能驗證各項損失。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Hold sending energy fixed and compare received energy under two load-dependent efficiency curves. Identify the converter and line meters needed to verify the individual loss components rather than only the final balance.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：漏列換流輔機會使受端電量預測偏高，重複扣線損則使預測偏低；兩種帳務錯誤可能互相抵消，因此總數吻合仍需逐項核對計量邊界。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Omitting converter auxiliaries overpredicts received energy, while deducting line losses twice underpredicts it. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b204-v15-07-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "比較送端與受端同一時窗的電表，先校正時鐘並明確列出換流及線路邊界。把損失與功率、環境溫度及設備狀態作圖，若差額只在切換時段出現，應先查積分時間與計量路徑。",
         "textEn": "Compare sending and receiving meters over one synchronized interval and define converter and line boundaries. Plot loss against power, ambient temperature and equipment state. A discrepancy confined to switching intervals calls for checking integration windows and meter paths before assigning a physical efficiency change.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-itaipu-owner",
          "v6-science-itaipu-history",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
