       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Asynchronous conversion energy” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "漏列換流輔機會使受端電量預測偏高，重複扣線損則使預測偏低；兩種帳務錯誤可能互相抵消，因此總數吻合仍需逐項核對計量邊界。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Omitting converter auxiliaries overpredicts received energy, while deducting line losses twice underpredicts it. These accounting errors can cancel, so agreement in the final total still requires checking the physical boundary of every metered term. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：換流損失可包含固定輔助耗電及隨負載改變的部分，低負載效率因此未必與額定點相同，需保留負載曲線。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Conversion losses can include fixed auxiliaries and load-dependent components, making low-load efficiency differ from the rated point; retain the load curve in comparisons.",
