       "instruction": "同時讀取三相電壓電流、實功與無功，核對功率因數是否依同一基波定義。若總電流增加而實功不變，應查無功及諧波，不立即把它解讀成水輪機提供更多有用機械功率。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Read three-phase voltage, current, active and reactive power together, checking the definition of power factor. If current increases without greater active power, investigate reactive flow and harmonics rather than assuming that the turbine is delivering additional useful mechanical power. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：固定視在容量計算三種功率因數下的實功與無功，畫功率三角形，再標明哪些設備限制不能由這張三角形推知。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: At fixed apparent capacity, calculate active and reactive power for three power factors. Draw their power triangles and identify equipment limits that cannot be inferred from the triangles alone.",
