       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b204-v15-12-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "將視在額定值全部當實功，會忽略供應無功時的電流負擔；即使實功低於名目值，過勵磁或冷卻不足仍可能形成限制，需要核對能力曲線與溫度。",
         "textEn": "Treating the apparent rating entirely as active power ignores current loading while supplying reactive power. Overexcitation or inadequate cooling can constrain operation even below nominal active output, requiring checks of the capability curve and temperatures.",
         "sourceIds": [
