         "textEn": "Plot rising and falling total-flow paths against synchronized tailwater level and check downstream influences. Different levels at the same discharge require retaining hysteresis or boundary conditions rather than forcing one mean line and interpreting the residual as a turbine-efficiency fault.",
         "sourceIds": [
