         "id": "b204-v15-16-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "洪水期間下游控制抬升可能主導尾水，原先低流量線性係數就不再有效；若仍沿用該係數，會高估可用水頭並誤排機組負載。",
         "textEn": "During flooding, downstream control can dominate tailwater and invalidate a coefficient fitted at low discharge. Continuing to use that coefficient overstates available head and can lead to an inappropriate allocation of generating load among units.",
         "sourceIds": [
