       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Spillway jet momentum” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "先畫控制體標出流入流出方向，量測斷面平均速度而非表面最高速度，再比較壓力與水位所帶來的額外作用。若動量估算與支承反力不同，先檢查遺漏的壓力項，不直接調整流量使兩者吻合。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Draw the control volume and flow directions, use section-average rather than peak surface velocity, and assess additional pressure and level forces. If the momentum estimate differs from measured reaction, examine omitted pressure terms before altering discharge merely to force agreement. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：改變出口水舌方向而保持速率，計算水平與垂直動量改變，畫出反力方向，再列出含氣模型試驗需要保持的相似條件。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Change the outlet jet direction at fixed speed, calculate horizontal and vertical momentum changes, and draw reaction directions. Identify similarity conditions needed for an aerated hydraulic model experiment.",
