       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Unit cooling water temperature rise” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：Qheat=8000000 W; mdot=400 kg/s; cp=4180 J/(kg*K); dT=Qheat/(mdot*cp)=4.784688995 K。模型邊界：穩態完全混合且熱負荷全由水帶走，不含對環境散熱。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Qheat=8000000 W; mdot=400 kg/s; cp=4180 J/(kg*K); dT=Qheat/(mdot*cp)=4.784688995 K. Model boundary: steady complete mixing with all stated heat carried by water and no ambient loss. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：校驗進出口溫度差及水流量，檢查感測器是否位於已混合斷面，再將水側熱量與電機損失估計比較。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Calibrate inlet-outlet temperature difference and water flow, locating sensors at mixed sections.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
