         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Qheat=8000000 W; mdot=400 kg/s; cp=4180 J/(kg*K); dT=Qheat/(mdot*cp)=4.784688995 K. Model boundary: steady complete mixing with all stated heat carried by water and no ambient loss.",
