       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「機組冷卻水熱升」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Unit cooling water temperature rise” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "校驗進出口溫度差及水流量，檢查感測器是否位於已混合斷面，再將水側熱量與電機損失估計比較。若總熱量符合而局部繞組升溫，應檢查流道分配與接觸熱阻，而非只增加總流量。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Calibrate inlet-outlet temperature difference and water flow, locating sensors at mixed sections. Compare water-side heat with estimated machine loss. If total heat removal agrees while one winding heats up, investigate flow distribution and contact resistance rather than simply increasing total cooling flow. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：令一部分水繞過換熱器，分別計算有效通道與混合出口溫升，說明為何總出口量測可能掩蓋局部過熱，並設計補充測點。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Let part of the water bypass the exchanger. Calculate active-channel and mixed-outlet temperature rises, explain how total-outlet measurements can conceal overheating, and design additional sensing locations.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：換熱管結垢可能提高設備溫度卻不明顯改變總水量，僅監看流量會漏報；溫度感測器安裝在旁通流也會顯示偏低溫升，掩蓋實際熱負荷。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Exchanger fouling can raise equipment temperature without much change in total water flow, escaping flow-only monitoring. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
