         "id": "b204-v15-23-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "校驗進出口溫度差及水流量，檢查感測器是否位於已混合斷面，再將水側熱量與電機損失估計比較。若總熱量符合而局部繞組升溫，應檢查流道分配與接觸熱阻，而非只增加總流量。",
         "textEn": "Calibrate inlet-outlet temperature difference and water flow, locating sensors at mixed sections. Compare water-side heat with estimated machine loss. If total heat removal agrees while one winding heats up, investigate flow distribution and contact resistance rather than simply increasing total cooling flow.",
