       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Unit cooling water temperature rise” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "換熱管結垢可能提高設備溫度卻不明顯改變總水量，僅監看流量會漏報；溫度感測器安裝在旁通流也會顯示偏低溫升，掩蓋實際熱負荷。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Exchanger fouling can raise equipment temperature without much change in total water flow, escaping flow-only monitoring. A temperature probe in a bypass stream can also indicate an artificially small rise and hide the actual thermal load. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：量測水溫差通常遠小於絕對溫度，因此成對感測器的差值校準可能比各自絕對精度更影響熱量帳。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: The water temperature rise is often small relative to absolute temperature, so paired differential calibration can matter more than each sensor absolute accuracy for heat accounting.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「冷卻水流量正常就保證所有熱點安全」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Normal cooling-water flow guarantees that every local hotspot is safe.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
