       "instructionEn": "Acquire speed and multidirectional vibration together and create an order map separating speed-dependent peaks from fixed structural frequencies. A peak strengthening only at certain heads calls for pressure-pulsation evidence, rather than identifying mechanical imbalance solely from a frequency match. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：對兩種轉速計算葉片通過頻率，畫出與固定模態交會的位置，再設定足夠取樣率，說明尚需哪些振幅與相位證據判斷共振。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Calculate blade-passing frequency at two speeds and mark crossings with a fixed mode. Select a sufficient sampling rate and identify amplitude and phase evidence still needed to diagnose resonance.",
