       "objective": "從症狀倒推「轉子激振頻率」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Rotor excitation frequency” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "感測取樣率不足會把高頻折返成低頻峰，導致錯誤維修方向；只有單軸量測也可能漏掉主要模態，因此需先核對防混疊與測點方向。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Insufficient sampling can alias a high frequency into a low-frequency peak and misdirect maintenance. A single measurement axis may miss the dominant mode, so anti-alias filtering and sensor orientation must be checked before interpreting the spectrum. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：階次追蹤應使用同步轉速訊號，轉速掃描時固定頻率分析窗可能把峰值展寬，造成誤判阻尼增加。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Order tracking needs a synchronized speed reference; during a speed sweep, a fixed-frequency analysis window can smear a peak and falsely suggest greater damping.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「頻率接近就足以證明發生共振」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Frequency proximity alone is enough to prove resonance.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
