       "objective": "說明「跨境資料時間對齊」如何影響伊泰普水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Cross border data time alignment” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Itaipu Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "跨機構水文與電力資料若使用不同時間基準，兩邊各自正確的曲線仍可能在合併後不守恆。對齊時必須辨認時間戳代表區間起點、終點或平均中心，並保存原始時區資訊。教材以固定流量乘時間錯移估計可能被錯配的體積，凸顯資料語義也是工程介面。 區間平均與瞬時樣本不可混用積分規則，時間戳相同仍可能代表不同觀測語義，必須保留欄位定義。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「跨境資料時間對齊」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Hydrologic and power records from different institutions can each be correct yet fail conservation after merging if time conventions differ. Determine whether timestamps mark interval starts, ends or centers and retain original time-zone information. Flow times an offset estimates misassigned volume and shows that data semantics form an engineering interface. Interval averages and instantaneous samples require different integration treatment; matching timestamps can still represent different observation meanings, so field definitions must accompany the data. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Cross border data time alignment” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：Q=2500 m3/s; dt=15 min; Vmis=Q*dt*60=2250000 m3。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Q=2500 m3/s; dt=15 min; Vmis=Q*dt*60=2250000 m3.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「日總量吻合就保證每小時資料對齊」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Matching daily totals guarantees that hourly records are aligned.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「跨境資料時間對齊」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Cross border data time alignment”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
