      {
       "id": "b204-v15-31",
       "title": "跨境資料時間對齊：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Cross border data time alignment: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-itaipu-owner",
        "v6-science-itaipu-history",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b204-v15-30"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「跨境資料時間對齊」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Cross border data time alignment” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以同一測站的原始記錄和匯總記錄核對時間戳定義，使用明確時區轉成統一時間後再積分。把尖峰事件作為對齊檢查，若總日量相同但時段殘差很大，先查時間位移而非創造額外水源項。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check timestamp definitions against raw and aggregated records from one station, convert explicit time zones to a common basis, and then integrate. Use identifiable peaks for alignment. Equal daily totals with large interval residuals suggest a time shift before an additional physical water source. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：建立一條洪水尖峰曲線並將另一份資料錯移十五分鐘，比較日量與時段殘差，再寫出可重現的時間欄位規格與缺測旗標。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Create a flood-peak series and shift a second copy by fifteen minutes. Compare daily volume and interval residuals, then specify reproducible timestamp fields and flags for missing or reconstructed values.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：系統自動套用錯誤夏令時間規則會讓資料跳一小時，且日總量可能仍看似合理；缺測補值若未加旗標，也會讓跨境比較誤判為真實調度差異。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: An incorrect automatic daylight-saving rule can shift data by an hour while daily totals still look plausible. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b204-v15-31-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "以同一測站的原始記錄和匯總記錄核對時間戳定義，使用明確時區轉成統一時間後再積分。把尖峰事件作為對齊檢查，若總日量相同但時段殘差很大，先查時間位移而非創造額外水源項。",
         "textEn": "Check timestamp definitions against raw and aggregated records from one station, convert explicit time zones to a common basis, and then integrate. Use identifiable peaks for alignment. Equal daily totals with large interval residuals suggest a time shift before an additional physical water source.",
         "sourceIds": [
