       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: N=10 units; T=24 h; nout=2 units; tout=6 h; A=N*T-nout*tout=228 unit*h.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「可用台時減少一定等比例減少發電量」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
