       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Gate drive power requirement” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Itaipu Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "閘門驅動需要克服水力作用、門重及摩擦，但水流通過閘孔的水力功率並不全由啟閉機提供。教材使用已知提升力與速度估算電端需求，並把啟動峰值、制動和結構反力另列。力的取得應來自明確載重組合，不能由總洩洪量任意換算。 提升力可能隨門位改變，完整動作能量需沿行程積分力，固定力乘行程只適用於明示的簡化情境。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「閘門驅動功率」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A gate drive overcomes hydraulic effects, weight and friction, but it does not supply all hydraulic power passing through the opening. Estimate electrical demand from a stated lifting force and speed, separating startup peaks, braking and structural reaction. The force must come from a defined load combination rather than an arbitrary conversion of spill discharge. Lifting force can vary with position, so complete travel energy integrates force along displacement; constant force times travel applies only to the declared simplified case. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Gate drive power requirement” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：F=1600000 N; v=0.015 m/s; eta=0.75 (dimensionless); P=F*v/eta=32000 W。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: F=1600000 N; v=0.015 m/s; eta=0.75 (dimensionless); P=F*v/eta=32000 W.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「啟閉機需提供通過閘孔的全部水力功率」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"The gate drive must supply all hydraulic power flowing through the opening.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「閘門驅動功率」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Gate drive power requirement”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
