       "instruction": "同步比較啟閉電流、位移速度與兩側吊點力，檢查門體是否偏斜及摩擦是否隨方向改變。若功率高而位移低，應查卡阻與制動未釋放；不能只靠額定馬達容量推定閘門能正常動作。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare drive current, movement speed and forces at both lifting points, checking skew and direction-dependent friction. High power with little movement suggests binding or an unreleased brake; nameplate motor capacity alone does not establish that the gate can perform its intended movement. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：把提升速度減半而力保持不變，重算功率與動作時間，再加入不對稱吊點荷載，說明總功率計算為何不能驗證門體抗扭能力。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Halve lifting speed at unchanged force and recalculate power and travel time. Add unequal lifting-point loads and explain why the total power calculation cannot verify the gate resistance to twisting.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：一側傳動不同步可能讓門體扭斜並提高局部摩擦，即使總提升力仍低於名目值也會卡住；潤滑改善不能解決幾何錯位，需先辨識偏載來源。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Unsynchronized drives can skew the gate and increase local friction even below nominal total lifting force. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
