       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「閘門驅動功率」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Gate drive power requirement” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "一側傳動不同步可能讓門體扭斜並提高局部摩擦，即使總提升力仍低於名目值也會卡住；潤滑改善不能解決幾何錯位，需先辨識偏載來源。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Unsynchronized drives can skew the gate and increase local friction even below nominal total lifting force. Lubrication cannot correct geometric misalignment, so the source of unequal loading must be identified before choosing a maintenance response. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：提升力可能隨門位改變，完整動作能量需沿行程積分力，固定力乘行程只適用於明示的簡化情境。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Lifting force can vary with position, so complete travel energy integrates force along displacement; constant force times travel applies only to the declared simplified case.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「啟閉機需提供通過閘孔的全部水力功率」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The gate drive must supply all hydraulic power flowing through the opening.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
