         "textEn": "Unsynchronized drives can skew the gate and increase local friction even below nominal total lifting force. Lubrication cannot correct geometric misalignment, so the source of unequal loading must be identified before choosing a maintenance response.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-itaipu-owner",
          "v6-science-itaipu-history",
