       "objective": "說明「效率試驗不確定度」如何影響古里水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Efficiency test uncertainty” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Guri Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "更新驗收先定義電端輸出與水力輸入的量測邊界，再討論效率差是否大於量測不確定度。流量、水頭與功率誤差會共同傳到效率；獨立小誤差可用平方和開根近似，但共用校準或同一基準造成的相關誤差必須保留協方差，不能假裝會互相抵消。 標準不確定度與擴充不確定度不能直接相混，若資料給涵蓋因子，應先換成同一層級再進行傳播。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「效率試驗不確定度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Renewal acceptance first defines electrical-output and hydraulic-input boundaries, then asks whether an efficiency change exceeds measurement uncertainty. Flow, head and power errors all propagate into efficiency. Independent small errors permit a root-sum-square approximation, while shared calibration or reference errors require covariance and cannot be assumed to cancel. Standard and expanded uncertainties cannot be mixed directly; when a coverage factor is supplied, convert every input to the same uncertainty level before propagation. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Efficiency test uncertainty” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：uP=0.004 (dimensionless); uQ=0.008 (dimensionless); uH=0.003 (dimensionless); uEta=(uP*uP+uQ*uQ+uH*uH)**0.5=0.009433981。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: uP=0.004 (dimensionless); uQ=0.008 (dimensionless); uH=0.003 (dimensionless); uEta=(uP*uP+uQ*uQ+uH*uH)**0.5=0.009433981.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「重複測試足夠多次就能消除所有偏差」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Enough repeated tests eliminate every systematic measurement bias.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「效率試驗不確定度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Efficiency test uncertainty”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b205-v15-01-k1",
         "title": "效率試驗不確定度",
         "titleEn": "Efficiency test uncertainty",
         "text": "更新驗收先定義電端輸出與水力輸入的量測邊界，再討論效率差是否大於量測不確定度。流量、水頭與功率誤差會共同傳到效率；獨立小誤差可用平方和開根近似，但共用校準或同一基準造成的相關誤差必須保留協方差，不能假裝會互相抵消。",
         "textEn": "Renewal acceptance first defines electrical-output and hydraulic-input boundaries, then asks whether an efficiency change exceeds measurement uncertainty. Flow, head and power errors all propagate into efficiency.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-guri-andritz",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
