        {
         "id": "b205-v15-01-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：重複測試足夠多次就能消除所有偏差 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Enough repeated tests eliminate every systematic measurement bias. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
