         "text": "原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：uP=0.004 (dimensionless); uQ=0.008 (dimensionless); uH=0.003 (dimensionless); uEta=(uP*uP+uQ*uQ+uH*uH)**0.5=0.009433981。模型邊界：各輸入為無因次相對標準不確定度，互相獨立且誤差小；不是擴充信賴區間。",
         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: uP=0.004 (dimensionless); uQ=0.008 (dimensionless); uH=0.003 (dimensionless); uEta=(uP*uP+uQ*uQ+uH*uH)**0.5=0.009433981. Model boundary: dimensionless relative standard uncertainties, mutually independent and small; not an expanded confidence interval.",
         "sourceIds": [
