         "text": "為三個量測項建立不確定度表，再加入流量與水頭正相關情境，重算效率不確定度，指出改善哪一項儀表最能提高辨識能力。",
         "textEn": "Build an uncertainty budget for the three measurements, add positive correlation between head and flow, and recompute efficiency uncertainty. Identify the instrument improvement that most increases the ability to resolve a performance change.",
         "sourceIds": [
