         "text": "同步量測尾水高程、大氣壓與水溫，核對轉輪基準點定義，再將壓力脈動及表面檢查與運轉工況配對。若水溫上升時問題加重，應檢查蒸氣壓變化，而不只調整淹沒深度假設。",
         "textEn": "Measure tailwater elevation, atmospheric pressure and water temperature together, checking the runner reference definition. Pair pressure pulsation and surface inspection with operating condition. Deterioration at warmer water calls for investigating vapor-pressure changes rather than modifying only the assumed submergence depth.",
