         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "高海拔較低大氣壓會減少可用壓力餘量，溫水又提高蒸氣壓；若誤用海平面常數及固定水溫，可能在相同淨水頭下錯判汽蝕條件。",
         "textEn": "Lower atmospheric pressure reduces available margin, and warmer water raises vapor pressure. Using sea-level pressure and a fixed temperature can therefore misrepresent cavitation conditions even when the net generating head remains unchanged during comparison.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-guri-andritz",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
