       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Large torque at low speed” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Guri Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "大型水輪機在低轉速傳遞高功率時，軸系轉矩可非常大，因此功率相同不代表機械尺寸相同。利用功率除以角速度取得平均轉矩，先釐清每分鐘轉數與弧度每秒的換算。軸徑、鍵接與法蘭還受彎矩、疲勞及動態扭振控制，不能只由平均值定尺寸。 平均扭矩對應平均軸功率，電氣輸出還需透過發電機損失換算，兩個邊界不得未經說明直接混合。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「低速巨型轉矩」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A large hydro turbine transmitting high power at low speed develops substantial shaft torque, so equal power does not imply equal mechanical dimensions. Divide power by angular speed to obtain mean torque, converting revolutions per minute correctly. Shaft, coupling and flange design also depends on bending, fatigue and torsional dynamics. Mean torque corresponds to shaft power; electrical output requires conversion through generator losses, and the two measurement boundaries cannot be silently interchanged in the calculation. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Large torque at low speed” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：P=600 MW; n=100 rpm; omega=2*pi*n/60; T=P*1e6/omega/1e6=57.29577951 MN*m。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: P=600 MW; n=100 rpm; omega=2*pi*n/60; T=P*1e6/omega/1e6=57.29577951 MN*m.",
