       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「低速巨型轉矩」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Large torque at low speed” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "對齊機械功率估計、軸速與扭振量測，確認電端功率是否已換算到軸端。用不同負載下的平均轉矩趨勢檢查模型，若振動峰值增加而平均值正常，應研究動態扭振而非只增加靜態安全係數。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Align shaft-power estimates, speed and torsional measurements, checking conversion from terminal electrical power. Compare mean torque over several loads. Increasing oscillatory peaks with a normal mean calls for dynamic investigation rather than simply raising a static factor in the calculation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：在功率不變下比較兩種轉速的轉矩，畫出反比例曲線，再指出軸系強度評估仍需的彎矩、疲勞循環與接頭幾何資料。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Compare torque at two speeds while holding power constant and plot the inverse relationship. Identify bending, fatigue-cycle and connection-geometry data still needed to assess the shaft system.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把每分鐘轉數直接當角速度會造成嚴重單位錯誤，並低估低速傳動需求；負載拒絕時轉速與轉矩同時變動，穩態公式也不能描述整個暫態。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
