         "textEn": "Align shaft-power estimates, speed and torsional measurements, checking conversion from terminal electrical power. Compare mean torque over several loads. Increasing oscillatory peaks with a normal mean calls for dynamic investigation rather than simply raising a static factor in the calculation.",
