       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「低速巨型轉矩」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Large torque at low speed” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把每分鐘轉數直接當角速度會造成嚴重單位錯誤，並低估低速傳動需求；負載拒絕時轉速與轉矩同時變動，穩態公式也不能描述整個暫態。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Using revolutions per minute directly as angular speed creates a major unit error and misrepresents low-speed transmission demand. Speed and torque change together during load rejection, which a constant-speed mean calculation cannot describe over the complete transient. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：平均扭矩對應平均軸功率，電氣輸出還需透過發電機損失換算，兩個邊界不得未經說明直接混合。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Mean torque corresponds to shaft power; electrical output requires conversion through generator losses, and the two measurement boundaries cannot be silently interchanged in the calculation.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「相同功率的所有機組都具有相同轉矩」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"All machines delivering equal power necessarily have equal torque.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b205-v15-12-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "把每分鐘轉數直接當角速度會造成嚴重單位錯誤，並低估低速傳動需求；負載拒絕時轉速與轉矩同時變動，穩態公式也不能描述整個暫態。",
         "textEn": "Using revolutions per minute directly as angular speed creates a major unit error and misrepresents low-speed transmission demand. Speed and torque change together during load rejection, which a constant-speed mean calculation cannot describe over the complete transient.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-guri-andritz",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b205-v15-12-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-guri-andritz",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
