         "text": "原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：U=500 kg*m; n=100 rpm; F=U*(2*pi*n/60)**2=54831.13556 N。模型邊界：剛性轉子單一不平衡量的力幅，未含支承傳遞與共振放大。",
         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: U=500 kg*m; n=100 rpm; F=U*(2*pi*n/60)**2=54831.13556 N. Model boundary: force amplitude from one rigid-rotor unbalance, without support transmission or resonant amplification.",
