       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「轉子不平衡力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Rotor unbalance force” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "同步量測鍵相信號與軸承兩方向振動，比較空轉及帶水負載的相位穩定性。若相位隨水頭大幅改變，應檢查水力激振；若試重後反應不符線性比例，需研究支承非線性或轉子柔性。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure phase reference and two bearing-vibration directions, comparing unloaded and hydraulic-load phase stability. Strong head-dependent phase changes suggest hydraulic excitation. A trial-weight response inconsistent with linear proportionality calls for investigating support nonlinearity or rotor flexibility before applying a simple balance correction. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將轉速提高一成，重算不平衡力並與線性增加的錯誤預測比較，再列出平衡試驗必須保存的相位、方向及試重位置。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Increase speed by ten percent, recompute unbalance force and compare it with an incorrect linear prediction. List the phase, direction and trial-weight positions that a balance experiment must preserve.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：將所有轉頻振動都當成不平衡，可能加上錯誤配重而增加軸承負荷；感測器方向或相位基準反轉也會把修正位置推到錯誤角度，必須先確認座標。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Treating every rotational-frequency vibration as unbalance can lead to an incorrect correction mass and greater bearing load. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b205-v15-15-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "同步量測鍵相信號與軸承兩方向振動，比較空轉及帶水負載的相位穩定性。若相位隨水頭大幅改變，應檢查水力激振；若試重後反應不符線性比例，需研究支承非線性或轉子柔性。",
         "textEn": "Measure phase reference and two bearing-vibration directions, comparing unloaded and hydraulic-load phase stability. Strong head-dependent phase changes suggest hydraulic excitation. A trial-weight response inconsistent with linear proportionality calls for investigating support nonlinearity or rotor flexibility before applying a simple balance correction.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-guri-andritz",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b205-v15-15-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "將轉速提高一成，重算不平衡力並與線性增加的錯誤預測比較，再列出平衡試驗必須保存的相位、方向及試重位置。",
         "textEn": "Increase speed by ten percent, recompute unbalance force and compare it with an incorrect linear prediction. List the phase, direction and trial-weight positions that a balance experiment must preserve.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-guri-andritz",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
