      {
       "id": "b205-v15-16",
       "title": "轉子不平衡力：失效診斷",
       "titleEn": "Rotor unbalance force: failure diagnosis",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-guri-andritz",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b205-v15-15"
       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「轉子不平衡力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Rotor unbalance force” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "將所有轉頻振動都當成不平衡，可能加上錯誤配重而增加軸承負荷；感測器方向或相位基準反轉也會把修正位置推到錯誤角度，必須先確認座標。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Treating every rotational-frequency vibration as unbalance can lead to an incorrect correction mass and greater bearing load. Reversed sensor orientation or phase reference can also place a correction at the wrong angle, making coordinate verification essential. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：不平衡力是隨軸旋轉的向量，固定方向感測器看到其投影，量測相位可提供配重位置而振幅單獨不能。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Unbalance force rotates as a vector; a fixed sensor observes its projection, making phase information essential for locating a correction mass rather than amplitude alone.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「出現轉頻振動就一定是轉子不平衡」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A vibration at rotational frequency always proves rotor unbalance.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b205-v15-16-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "將所有轉頻振動都當成不平衡，可能加上錯誤配重而增加軸承負荷；感測器方向或相位基準反轉也會把修正位置推到錯誤角度，必須先確認座標。",
         "textEn": "Treating every rotational-frequency vibration as unbalance can lead to an incorrect correction mass and greater bearing load. Reversed sensor orientation or phase reference can also place a correction at the wrong angle, making coordinate verification essential.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-guri-andritz",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b205-v15-16-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-guri-andritz",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "在「轉子不平衡力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？",
        "questionEn": "When \"Rotor unbalance force\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?",
        "options": [
         "先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。",
         "將所有轉頻振動都當成不平衡，可能加上錯誤配重而增加軸承負荷；感測器方向或相位基準反轉也會把修正位置推到錯誤角度，必須先確認座標。",
         "冷態對心合格就保證熱態對心不變"
