        "answer": 1,
        "explanation": "將所有轉頻振動都當成不平衡，可能加上錯誤配重而增加軸承負荷；感測器方向或相位基準反轉也會把修正位置推到錯誤角度，必須先確認座標。 需以量測區分可能原因。",
        "explanationEn": "Treating every rotational-frequency vibration as unbalance can lead to an incorrect correction mass and greater bearing load. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."
