       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Thermal operating alignment” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Guri Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "冷態安裝時的軸線對心不一定等於運轉熱態對心，支承座與基礎的溫升差可能改變相對位置。教材以一支承構件的自由熱伸長估算偏移來源，再要求把方向與約束列明。實際軸承中心移動需同時考慮連接件與溫度場，不能只量外殼表面。 相對對心取決於兩支承位移之差，共同熱膨脹可能不改變相對偏移，卻仍影響管路或外部連接。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「熱態軸線對心」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Cold installation alignment need not equal hot operating alignment because support and foundation temperature changes can shift relative positions. Free expansion of one support illustrates a possible offset, with direction and restraint stated explicitly. Actual bearing-center movement also depends on connections and temperature distribution rather than one external surface temperature. Relative alignment depends on the difference between support movements; common expansion may leave alignment unchanged while still affecting piping or other external connections. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Thermal operating alignment” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：alpha=0.000012 1/K; L=1.8 m; dT=30 K; dL=alpha*L*dT*1000=0.648 mm。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: alpha=0.000012 1/K; L=1.8 m; dT=30 K; dL=alpha*L*dT*1000=0.648 mm.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「冷態對心合格就保證熱態對心不變」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Acceptable cold alignment guarantees unchanged alignment during hot operation.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
