         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: alpha=0.000012 1/K; L=1.8 m; dT=30 K; dL=alpha*L*dT*1000=0.648 mm. Model boundary: uniform free extension along one support length, not the actual displacement of the entire shaft line.",
