       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「熱態軸線對心」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Thermal operating alignment” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "量測支承內外溫度及軸承中心熱態位置，與冷態基線使用同一座標系比較。若偏移隨負載穩定重現，支持熱變形解釋；若卸載後不回復，應查接合滑移、墊片或基礎沉陷。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure internal and external support temperatures and the hot bearing-center position on the same coordinate system as the cold baseline. Repeatable load-dependent movement supports thermal deformation. Movement that remains after cooling requires investigation of connection slip, shims or foundation settlement. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：比較兩個不同長度及溫升的支承自由伸長，求相對偏移，再畫出受約束時可能不同的變形方向，提出熱態對心所需測點。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Compare free expansion of two supports with different lengths and temperature rises, calculate relative offset, and draw how restraint could change movement directions. Propose measurement points for hot alignment verification.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：只以冷態對心合格作結論，可能漏掉運轉中接頭偏角與軸承附加力；但熱態量測基座若同時伸長，也會混入儀器效應，應設獨立基準。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Accepting cold alignment alone can overlook operating coupling angles and additional bearing force. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
