       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Thermal operating alignment” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "只以冷態對心合格作結論，可能漏掉運轉中接頭偏角與軸承附加力；但熱態量測基座若同時伸長，也會混入儀器效應，應設獨立基準。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Accepting cold alignment alone can overlook operating coupling angles and additional bearing force. A measurement mounting that expands simultaneously can also contaminate the apparent movement, requiring an independent reference before attributing the entire offset to the machine. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：相對對心取決於兩支承位移之差，共同熱膨脹可能不改變相對偏移，卻仍影響管路或外部連接。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Relative alignment depends on the difference between support movements; common expansion may leave alignment unchanged while still affecting piping or other external connections.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「冷態對心合格就保證熱態對心不變」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
