       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Local thermal resistance and hotspots” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Guri Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "電機繞組或軸承熱點由熱源與散熱路徑共同控制，總冷卻流量正常不代表局部熱阻正常。等效熱阻乘熱流可估算兩節點溫差，但接觸、導熱與對流應按實際路徑串並聯。教材把單一路徑作基準，再要求辨認旁路及熱容量造成的暫態。 串聯熱阻相加而並聯導熱能力相加，選錯連接方式會錯判熱流方向及熱點，應先畫熱路圖。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「局部熱阻與熱點」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A winding or bearing hotspot depends on heat generation and its removal path, so normal total cooling flow does not establish normal local thermal resistance. Heat flow times equivalent resistance estimates a two-node temperature difference. Contact, conduction and convection must be connected according to the real path, including bypasses and thermal storage. Series thermal resistances add, while parallel conductances add; choosing the wrong connection misrepresents heat paths and hotspots, so draw the thermal network first. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Local thermal resistance and hotspots” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：Qheat=400000 W; Rth=0.00008 K/W; dT=Qheat*Rth=32 K。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Qheat=400000 W; Rth=0.00008 K/W; dT=Qheat*Rth=32 K.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「總冷卻流量正常就代表局部熱阻正常」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Normal total cooling flow proves that local thermal resistance is normal.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
