         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Qheat=400000 W; Rth=0.00008 K/W; dT=Qheat*Rth=32 K. Model boundary: steady single equivalent thermal resistance with all stated heat following that path.",
