         "text": "接觸面鬆動會增加熱阻並形成局部高溫，平均出口水溫可能仍正常；若感測器離熱點太遠，訊號會被導熱平滑，延後發現絕緣或潤滑問題。",
         "textEn": "A loose contact increases thermal resistance and local temperature while average outlet water can remain normal. A sensor far from the hotspot smooths the signal through conduction and can delay recognition of insulation or lubrication deterioration.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-guri-andritz",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
