         "text": "誤解：相同平均功率就保證相同疲勞壽命 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Equal mean power guarantees equal fatigue life. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
