         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: n1=200000 cycles; N1=1000000 cycles; n2=1000000 cycles; N2=5000000 cycles; D=n1/N1+n2/N2=0.4. Model boundary: two assumed fatigue lives and linear accumulation, not a field life guarantee.",
