         "id": "b205-v15-27-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "保持總循環數，將一部分低幅循環改為高幅循環，重算損傷和，再列出平均應力與腐蝕環境會如何限制這個簡化比較。",
         "textEn": "Keep total cycle count fixed while replacing some low-amplitude cycles with high-amplitude cycles. Recalculate the damage sum and explain how mean stress and corrosion constrain the simplified comparison.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-guri-andritz",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        }
