       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「疲勞循環累積」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Fatigue cycle accumulation” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "少量高幅值事件可能主導疲勞，低頻平均紀錄會把它們抹平；若將不同應力集中位置混成一張循環表，也會使線性損傷值失去物理意義。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A few high-amplitude events can dominate fatigue and disappear in low-frequency averages. Combining histories from different stress-concentration locations into one cycle table can also remove the physical meaning of a nominal linear damage sum. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：每一組疲勞壽命必須對應同一應力幅定義，範圍與振幅差一倍，混用會嚴重改變材料曲線取值。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Every fatigue life must use the same stress definition; stress range and amplitude differ by a factor of two, strongly affecting the selected material-curve value.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「相同平均功率就保證相同疲勞壽命」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Equal mean power guarantees equal fatigue life.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b205-v15-28-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "少量高幅值事件可能主導疲勞，低頻平均紀錄會把它們抹平；若將不同應力集中位置混成一張循環表，也會使線性損傷值失去物理意義。",
         "textEn": "A few high-amplitude events can dominate fatigue and disappear in low-frequency averages. Combining histories from different stress-concentration locations into one cycle table can also remove the physical meaning of a nominal linear damage sum.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-guri-andritz",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
