         "text": "原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：A=12 m2; dt=0.0008 m; rho=7800 kg/m3; dm=A*dt*rho=74.88 kg。模型邊界：平均均勻厚度損失的體積近似，未描述局部坑蝕。",
         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: A=12 m2; dt=0.0008 m; rho=7800 kg/m3; dm=A*dt*rho=74.88 kg. Model boundary: volume approximation for mean uniform thickness loss, without describing local pitting.",
         "sourceIds": [
