        "explanation": "原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：A=12 m2; dt=0.0008 m; rho=7800 kg/m3; dm=A*dt*rho=74.88 kg。 重算時請保留單位。",
        "explanationEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: A=12 m2; dt=0.0008 m; rho=7800 kg/m3; dm=A*dt*rho=74.88 kg. Keep units when recalculating."
