         "text": "掃描對位誤差可在整片表面製造假磨耗，修補塗層又可能掩蓋下方缺陷；如果只以總重量驗收，會漏掉局部形狀造成的水力性能及疲勞問題。",
         "textEn": "Registration error can create apparent wear over a large surface, while a repair layer can conceal underlying defects. Acceptance based only on total weight can miss local geometry effects on hydraulic performance and fatigue behavior.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-guri-andritz",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
