       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「檢測陽性與基率」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Inspection positives and base rates” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "用已知缺陷試件與盲測樣本估計混淆矩陣，區分操作者、材料厚度與表面條件。將陽性部位交由不同物理原理複核，並記錄未檢出案例；若只保留陽性樣本，就無法可靠估計漏失率及基率。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Estimate a confusion matrix using known-defect specimens and blind samples, separating operator, thickness and surface conditions. Confirm indications with another physical principle and retain missed-defect cases. Keeping only positive samples prevents reliable estimation of prevalence and the missed-detection rate. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以一萬個假想檢查位置建立真陽性與假陽性人數表，將基率提高後重算，解釋檢查能力不變時陽性可信度為何仍會改變。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Build true-positive and false-positive counts for ten thousand hypothetical inspection locations. Increase prevalence and recalculate, explaining why predictive value changes even though the inspection sensitivity and specificity remain unchanged.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：將靈敏度直接當成陽性可信度會高估低基率群的確診比例；第二次檢查若使用同樣缺陷敏感性與共同誤差，也不能當成完全獨立的確認。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Treating sensitivity as positive predictive value overstates confirmed defects in a low-prevalence population. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b205-v15-35-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "用已知缺陷試件與盲測樣本估計混淆矩陣，區分操作者、材料厚度與表面條件。將陽性部位交由不同物理原理複核，並記錄未檢出案例；若只保留陽性樣本，就無法可靠估計漏失率及基率。",
         "textEn": "Estimate a confusion matrix using known-defect specimens and blind samples, separating operator, thickness and surface conditions. Confirm indications with another physical principle and retain missed-defect cases. Keeping only positive samples prevents reliable estimation of prevalence and the missed-detection rate.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-guri-andritz",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
