         "id": "b205-v15-35-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "以一萬個假想檢查位置建立真陽性與假陽性人數表，將基率提高後重算，解釋檢查能力不變時陽性可信度為何仍會改變。",
         "textEn": "Build true-positive and false-positive counts for ten thousand hypothetical inspection locations. Increase prevalence and recalculate, explaining why predictive value changes even though the inspection sensitivity and specificity remain unchanged.",
