       ],
       "objective": "說明「更新停機能量機會」如何影響古里水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Renewal outage energy opportunity” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Guri Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "機組更新需要停機窗口，其機會成本取決於原本可發功率與水量能否由其他機組利用。以假定功率乘停機時數得到的是潛在電量差，不是必然實際損失。若水可留待稍後使用或轉移到其他機組，仍需建立跨時段水量及效率帳才能比較更新方案。 被延後發出的電量與永遠旁通的能量必須分別記帳，時間價值可能不同，但不能因此混淆物理能量損失。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「更新停機能量機會」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Renewal requires outage windows whose opportunity cost depends on counterfactual output and whether other units can use the water. Assumed power times outage duration gives potential energy difference, not inevitable loss. Storage for later use or transfer to other machines requires a multi-interval water and efficiency account before comparing renewal plans. Energy generated later and energy permanently bypassed require separate accounts; their time value may differ without making both quantities the same physical energy loss. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Renewal outage energy opportunity” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：Pcounter=300 MW; tout=18 h; Epotential=Pcounter*tout=5400 MWh。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Pcounter=300 MW; tout=18 h; Epotential=Pcounter*tout=5400 MWh.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「停機時數乘額定功率就是必然損失電量」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Outage hours times rated power always equal unavoidable lost generation.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「更新停機能量機會」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Renewal outage energy opportunity”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b205-v15-37-k1",
         "title": "更新停機能量機會",
         "titleEn": "Renewal outage energy opportunity",
         "text": "機組更新需要停機窗口，其機會成本取決於原本可發功率與水量能否由其他機組利用。以假定功率乘停機時數得到的是潛在電量差，不是必然實際損失。",
         "textEn": "Renewal requires outage windows whose opportunity cost depends on counterfactual output and whether other units can use the water. Assumed power times outage duration gives potential energy difference, not inevitable loss.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-guri-andritz",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b205-v15-37-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：停機時數乘額定功率就是必然損失電量 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Outage hours times rated power always equal unavoidable lost generation. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
