         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Pcounter=300 MW; tout=18 h; Epotential=Pcounter*tout=5400 MWh. Model boundary: assumes continuous counterfactual generation and no substitute water use; an upper scenario for displaced energy.",
