         "text": "將檢修時程與逐時來水、其他機組餘裕及水庫可用空間配對，核對實際旁通水量。若停機期間水被儲存，需追蹤後續發電而不能在停機當日把全部潛在電量列為永久損失。",
         "textEn": "Pair the outage schedule with hourly inflow, spare unit capacity and available storage, checking actual bypassed water. If water is retained during the outage, follow its later generation rather than booking the entire potential energy difference as a permanent loss on that day.",
         "sourceIds": [
