      {
       "id": "b205-v15-40",
       "title": "更新停機能量機會：失效診斷",
       "titleEn": "Renewal outage energy opportunity: failure diagnosis",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-guri-andritz",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b205-v15-39"
       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「更新停機能量機會」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Renewal outage energy opportunity” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "檢修延誤若跨入高流量期間，原可儲存的水可能轉為旁通，損失機制因而改變；只用全年平均功率估算，會漏掉停機時序與其他設備限制的關聯。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "An outage delay into a high-flow period can turn storable water into bypassed release and change the loss mechanism. Annual mean power misses the relationship among outage timing, hydrology and restrictions on the other equipment. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：被延後發出的電量與永遠旁通的能量必須分別記帳，時間價值可能不同，但不能因此混淆物理能量損失。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Energy generated later and energy permanently bypassed require separate accounts; their time value may differ without making both quantities the same physical energy loss.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「停機時數乘額定功率就是必然損失電量」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Outage hours times rated power always equal unavoidable lost generation.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b205-v15-40-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "檢修延誤若跨入高流量期間，原可儲存的水可能轉為旁通，損失機制因而改變；只用全年平均功率估算，會漏掉停機時序與其他設備限制的關聯。",
         "textEn": "An outage delay into a high-flow period can turn storable water into bypassed release and change the loss mechanism. Annual mean power misses the relationship among outage timing, hydrology and restrictions on the other equipment.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-guri-andritz",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b205-v15-40-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-guri-andritz",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "在「更新停機能量機會」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？",
        "questionEn": "When \"Renewal outage energy opportunity\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?",
        "options": [
         "先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。",
