    "titleEn": "Original hypothetical example and boundaries",
    "text": "以下為本課原創情境串接，所有數值是假設，不能視為業主設計圖或操作許可。先完成「開挖卸荷彈性回復」的守恆與邊界檢核，再比較「方向剛度與傳力」及「岩楔有效正向力」的不同控制量。第一組計算為 dsigma=2 MPa; E=15000 MPa; strain=dsigma/E*1e6=133.3333333 microstrain；第二組為 F=90 MN; L=12 m; E=18000 MPa; A=12 m2; u=F*1e6*L/(E*1e6*A)*1000=5 mm。學員須保留量綱、資料時間與量測位置，討論誤差如何傳到結果，將第三單元的限制寫入同一張決策表。任何未納入的結構、河道或機組耦合都列為下一階段工作，不由單一得數推論全工程安全。",
    "textEn": "This original sequence connects the first three units using assumed inputs; none is an owner drawing or an operating authorization. First establish conservation and boundaries for Elastic rebound after excavation, then compare the controlling variables in Directional stiffness and load transfer and Rock wedge effective normal force. The first calculation is dsigma=2 MPa; E=15000 MPa; strain=dsigma/E*1e6=133.3333333 microstrain; the second is F=90 MN; L=12 m; E=18000 MPa; A=12 m2; u=F*1e6*L/(E*1e6*A)*1000=5 mm. Preserve dimensions, observation times, and measurement locations in the working sheet. Explain how input uncertainty changes each conclusion and include the third unit limitations in the same decision table. Structural, river, and machine interactions omitted by a model remain subsequent work; a single numerical answer cannot demonstrate safety of the complete project.",
    "assumptions": "數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。",
