         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: dsigma=2 MPa; E=15000 MPa; strain=dsigma/E*1e6=133.3333333 microstrain. Model boundary: one-dimensional linear elastic unloading strain magnitude, excluding joint opening and plastic damage.",
