      {
       "id": "b206-v15-03",
       "title": "開挖卸荷彈性回復：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Elastic rebound after excavation: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-xiaowan-huaneng",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b206-v15-02"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「開挖卸荷彈性回復」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Elastic rebound after excavation” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "將開挖步序、伸縮計與地表位移時間對齊，分辨每次卸荷後的即時反應與持續變形。若持續位移在停工後仍增長，應查節理水壓或漸進破壞，不以單次彈性模數任意擬合所有時段。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Align excavation stages with extensometer and surface-displacement records, separating immediate rebound from continuing movement. Growth during a pause calls for investigating joint pressure or progressive deformation rather than fitting every interval by arbitrarily changing one elastic modulus in the simple unloading model. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將卸載模數減半重算應變，再把假想伸縮計長度換成位移，畫出即時彈性及持續變形兩種時間曲線並提出區分證據。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Halve unloading modulus and recompute strain, convert it to movement over an assumed extensometer length, and draw immediate elastic and continuing-deformation histories with observations that distinguish them.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：開挖擾動可能形成方向性鬆弛帶，若仍用開挖前模數會低估位移；測點支架受爆破振動鬆動也可能造成跳值，需用深部與地表量測互相確認。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Excavation can produce a directional loosened zone, making the pre-excavation modulus underpredict movement. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b206-v15-03-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "將開挖步序、伸縮計與地表位移時間對齊，分辨每次卸荷後的即時反應與持續變形。若持續位移在停工後仍增長，應查節理水壓或漸進破壞，不以單次彈性模數任意擬合所有時段。",
         "textEn": "Align excavation stages with extensometer and surface-displacement records, separating immediate rebound from continuing movement. Growth during a pause calls for investigating joint pressure or progressive deformation rather than fitting every interval by arbitrarily changing one elastic modulus in the simple unloading model.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiaowan-huaneng",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b206-v15-03-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "將卸載模數減半重算應變，再把假想伸縮計長度換成位移，畫出即時彈性及持續變形兩種時間曲線並提出區分證據。",
         "textEn": "Halve unloading modulus and recompute strain, convert it to movement over an assumed extensometer length, and draw immediate elastic and continuing-deformation histories with observations that distinguish them.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiaowan-huaneng",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
