         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: F=90 MN; L=12 m; E=18000 MPa; A=12 m2; u=F*1e6*L/(E*1e6*A)*1000=5 mm. Model boundary: homogeneous linear elastic prism loaded along one axis, excluding three-dimensional abutment shear.",
