       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「方向剛度與傳力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Directional stiffness and load transfer” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以不同方向的現地載重或波速資料辨認方向差，再用多點位移場檢查所選傳力長度。若一方向模型需要不合理模數才能擬合，應研究幾何及節理控制，而不是只調大有效面積壓低位移。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Use directional field loading or wave-speed observations to identify anisotropy, then check transfer length against a multipoint displacement field. If one direction needs an implausible modulus, investigate geometry and joint control rather than merely enlarging the effective area to suppress movement. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：分別把模數與面積減半重算位移，說明相同數值結果可能對應不同物理原因，再設計三個測點以辨別變形方向及轉動。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Halve modulus and area in separate cases and recompute displacement. Explain why equal numerical results may have different physical causes, then place three sensors to distinguish directional deformation and rotation.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：某組節理剪切滑動會破壞單軸連續體假設，使反力重新分配；單點位移不足以分辨整體平移與局部轉動，可能掩蓋拱座接觸條件改變。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Sliding on a joint set invalidates the continuous uniaxial model and redistributes reactions. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
