         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "以不同方向的現地載重或波速資料辨認方向差，再用多點位移場檢查所選傳力長度。若一方向模型需要不合理模數才能擬合，應研究幾何及節理控制，而不是只調大有效面積壓低位移。",
         "textEn": "Use directional field loading or wave-speed observations to identify anisotropy, then check transfer length against a multipoint displacement field. If one direction needs an implausible modulus, investigate geometry and joint control rather than merely enlarging the effective area to suppress movement.",
         "sourceIds": [
