       "objective": "從症狀倒推「方向剛度與傳力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Directional stiffness and load transfer” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "某組節理剪切滑動會破壞單軸連續體假設，使反力重新分配；單點位移不足以分辨整體平移與局部轉動，可能掩蓋拱座接觸條件改變。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Sliding on a joint set invalidates the continuous uniaxial model and redistributes reactions. One displacement point cannot distinguish translation from local rotation and may conceal a change in the contact conditions supporting the arch. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：等效面積代表模型傳力範圍而非任意外觀面積，需與荷載方向和觀察尺度一起定義，才可比較剛度。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Effective area represents the modeled load-transfer region, not an arbitrary visible surface; define it with load direction and observation scale before comparing stiffness estimates.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「拱座各方向都可使用相同等效剛度」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Every abutment direction can use the same effective stiffness.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
