       "instruction": "用節理測繪確認滑面方向及出露，再把降雨、孔壓與位移對齊檢查水壓假說。將剪力與正向力的解析方向畫在自由體圖上，若計算抗力大但位移持續，應研究峰值強度是否已退化。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Confirm orientation and daylighting through joint mapping, then align rainfall, pressure and movement. Show resolved shear and normal directions on a free-body diagram. Continued movement despite a large calculated resistance requires investigating whether peak strength has already degraded or the assumed surface is incorrect. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將水壓合力加倍並去除黏聚合力，分別計算抗滑力比，列出哪些情境需要殘餘強度試驗，以及如何確認假想滑面是否出露。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Double the water-pressure resultant and remove cohesion in separate cases. Calculate the force ratios, identify situations requiring residual-strength tests, and explain how to confirm that the assumed sliding plane daylights.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：排水失效會提高滑面水壓並降低摩擦，抗力未必隨總重量增加而等量增加；若使用峰值黏聚力描述已滑動面，會把殘餘強度問題隱藏在漂亮的力比中。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Drain failure raises plane pressure and reduces friction, so resistance does not necessarily increase in proportion to total weight. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
