         "textEn": "Confirm orientation and daylighting through joint mapping, then align rainfall, pressure and movement. Show resolved shear and normal directions on a free-body diagram. Continued movement despite a large calculated resistance requires investigating whether peak strength has already degraded or the assumed surface is incorrect.",
