       "objective": "從症狀倒推「岩楔有效正向力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Rock wedge effective normal force” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "排水失效會提高滑面水壓並降低摩擦，抗力未必隨總重量增加而等量增加；若使用峰值黏聚力描述已滑動面，會把殘餘強度問題隱藏在漂亮的力比中。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Drain failure raises plane pressure and reduces friction, so resistance does not necessarily increase in proportion to total weight. Using peak cohesion on an already displaced surface hides a residual-strength problem behind an apparently favorable force ratio. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若水壓大到使接觸面張開，摩擦抗力不能繼續按負有效正向力延伸，必須改變接觸狀態。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: If pressure opens the contact, friction cannot be extrapolated using a negative effective normal force; the model must change its contact state and load path.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「岩楔總重量可直接當作滑面有效正向力」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Total wedge weight can directly be used as effective normal force on the sliding plane.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b206-v15-12-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "排水失效會提高滑面水壓並降低摩擦，抗力未必隨總重量增加而等量增加；若使用峰值黏聚力描述已滑動面，會把殘餘強度問題隱藏在漂亮的力比中。",
         "textEn": "Drain failure raises plane pressure and reduces friction, so resistance does not necessarily increase in proportion to total weight. Using peak cohesion on an already displaced surface hides a residual-strength problem behind an apparently favorable force ratio.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiaowan-huaneng",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b206-v15-12-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiaowan-huaneng",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        }
