         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: h0=10 m; t=24 h; tau=24 h; hExcess=h0*exp(-t/tau)=3.678794412 m. Model boundary: excess head in a linear single-relaxation model, not a full transient seepage solution.",
