       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「降水位孔壓滯後」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pore pressure lag during drawdown” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "同步紀錄庫水位及不同深度孔壓，以水位階段性變化檢查延遲，並比較上升與下降路徑。若深淺測點時間常數不同，應保留分層或裂隙效應，不把所有訊號平均成一條假想同步曲線。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Record reservoir level and pore pressure at several depths, using staged changes to examine lag and comparing rising and falling paths. Different deep and shallow response times require retaining layering or fracture effects rather than averaging every signal into one artificial synchronous curve. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以兩種鬆弛時間畫出一天內超額水頭衰減，與同一降水位曲線比較，指出何處可能出現最大內外水頭差及所需補測深度。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Plot one-day excess-head decay for two relaxation times and compare them with the same drawdown curve. Identify the possible maximum internal-external head difference and the additional depths that should be monitored.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：快速降水位可能在內部高孔壓尚未消散時移除外部支撐，使岸坡有效應力與受力條件不利；但測壓管堵塞也會假造長滯後，需先驗證儀器反應。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Rapid drawdown can remove external support before internal pressure dissipates, creating unfavorable effective-stress conditions. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b206-v15-15-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "同步紀錄庫水位及不同深度孔壓，以水位階段性變化檢查延遲，並比較上升與下降路徑。若深淺測點時間常數不同，應保留分層或裂隙效應，不把所有訊號平均成一條假想同步曲線。",
         "textEn": "Record reservoir level and pore pressure at several depths, using staged changes to examine lag and comparing rising and falling paths. Different deep and shallow response times require retaining layering or fracture effects rather than averaging every signal into one artificial synchronous curve.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiaowan-huaneng",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
