         "text": "以兩種鬆弛時間畫出一天內超額水頭衰減，與同一降水位曲線比較，指出何處可能出現最大內外水頭差及所需補測深度。",
         "textEn": "Plot one-day excess-head decay for two relaxation times and compare them with the same drawdown curve. Identify the possible maximum internal-external head difference and the additional depths that should be monitored.",
         "sourceIds": [
