      {
       "id": "b206-v15-16",
       "title": "降水位孔壓滯後：失效診斷",
       "titleEn": "Pore pressure lag during drawdown: failure diagnosis",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-xiaowan-huaneng",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b206-v15-15"
       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「降水位孔壓滯後」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pore pressure lag during drawdown” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "快速降水位可能在內部高孔壓尚未消散時移除外部支撐，使岸坡有效應力與受力條件不利；但測壓管堵塞也會假造長滯後，需先驗證儀器反應。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Rapid drawdown can remove external support before internal pressure dissipates, creating unfavorable effective-stress conditions. A blocked piezometer can imitate a long lag, so instrument response must be verified before attributing the entire delay to slope drainage. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：鬆弛時間描述系統幾何與排水路徑的綜合反應，增設排水後需要重新識別，不能直接沿用處理前數值。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Relaxation time combines geometry and drainage pathways; adding drains changes that system, so the parameter must be identified again rather than inherited unchanged from earlier conditions.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「水庫水位下降時岸坡孔壓必定同步下降」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Slope pore pressure always falls simultaneously with reservoir level.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b206-v15-16-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "快速降水位可能在內部高孔壓尚未消散時移除外部支撐，使岸坡有效應力與受力條件不利；但測壓管堵塞也會假造長滯後，需先驗證儀器反應。",
         "textEn": "Rapid drawdown can remove external support before internal pressure dissipates, creating unfavorable effective-stress conditions. A blocked piezometer can imitate a long lag, so instrument response must be verified before attributing the entire delay to slope drainage.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiaowan-huaneng",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b206-v15-16-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiaowan-huaneng",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "在「降水位孔壓滯後」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？",
        "questionEn": "When \"Pore pressure lag during drawdown\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?",
        "options": [
