       ],
       "objective": "說明「地震慣性力尺度」如何影響小灣水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Seismic inertia force scale” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Xiaowan Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "地震加速度對質量產生慣性力，但高拱壩、岩體與水庫形成耦合振動，不能把整體都當成一個剛性質點。教材先算一個假想等效質量的慣性尺度，再辨認方向、模態及水體附加作用。靜力等效算值不含頻率內容與相位，不能代替動力分析。 等效質量須說明對應方向與模態參與程度，壩體總質量不一定等於單一反應模態可使用的有效質量。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「地震慣性力尺度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Ground acceleration generates inertia, while a high arch, rock supports and reservoir form a coupled dynamic system rather than one rigid particle. Calculate inertia for one assumed equivalent mass, then identify direction, modes and hydrodynamic contributions. A static-equivalent number contains neither frequency content nor phase and cannot replace dynamic analysis. An equivalent mass needs a direction and modal participation definition; total structural mass is not automatically the effective mass appropriate for one response mode. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Seismic inertia force scale” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：m=120000000 kg; ah=0.15 (dimensionless); g=9.81 m/s2; F=m*ah*g/1e6=176.58 MN。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: m=120000000 kg; ah=0.15 (dimensionless); g=9.81 m/s2; F=m*ah*g/1e6=176.58 MN.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「等效靜力較大就保證所有動力反應保守」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A larger equivalent static force guarantees conservative dynamic response in every mode.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「地震慣性力尺度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Seismic inertia force scale”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
