         "textEn": "Ground acceleration generates inertia, while a high arch, rock supports and reservoir form a coupled dynamic system rather than one rigid particle. Calculate inertia for one assumed equivalent mass, then identify direction, modes and hydrodynamic contributions.",
         "sourceIds": [
