         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: m=120000000 kg; ah=0.15 (dimensionless); g=9.81 m/s2; F=m*ah*g/1e6=176.58 MN. Model boundary: ah is a dimensionless fraction of gravity; horizontal inertia scale for one assumed mass.",
