       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「地震慣性力尺度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Seismic inertia force scale” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "對照加速度計方向、時間同步與基線修正，並比較壩頂及基礎頻譜以觀察放大。若反應包含多個模態，應以分布質量及阻尼模型處理，不把峰值位移除以一個靜力直接反算全壩剛度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check accelerometer orientation, synchronization and baseline correction, comparing crest and foundation spectra for amplification. Multiple response modes require distributed mass and damping models; peak displacement divided into one static force does not reliably identify stiffness of the entire dam. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：固定加速度比較兩個等效質量，並畫出兩種頻率不同但峰值相同的輸入波，說明為何慣性尺度相同仍可能產生不同位移反應。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Compare two equivalent masses at fixed acceleration, then draw inputs with equal peaks but different frequencies. Explain why an equal inertia scale can still produce different displacement responses in the coupled system.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：不同方向地震分量的峰值未必同時發生，任意相加可能扭曲載重組合；忽略庫水與基礎互制也會錯估頻率，表面上保守的力值不保證反應保守。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Peaks of different earthquake components need not coincide, so arbitrary addition distorts combinations. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
