         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: E=25000 MPa; alpha=0.00001 1/K; dT=12 K; sigmaC=E*alpha*dT=3 MPa. Model boundary: compressive stress magnitude for uniaxial fully restrained heating, excluding creep and modulus change.",
