       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「受約束溫升應力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Restrained heating stress” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以混凝土齡期試驗取得模數與熱膨脹係數，將埋入溫度和應變計讀值配對，並分離自由熱應變。若實測壓應變小於完全約束模型，應研究徐變與接縫釋放，不應直接認定感測器低估。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Obtain age-specific modulus and expansion coefficients, pair embedded temperature and strain readings, and separate free thermal strain. Lower measured compressive response than the fully restrained estimate calls for investigating creep and joint release rather than immediately assuming sensor under-reading. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以同一參考溫度計算升溫與降溫兩個情境，標示應力符號，再將約束比例改成一半，說明何種資料可支持這個部分約束假設。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Calculate heating and cooling from one stress-free reference, showing stress signs. Halve the restraint fraction and explain what displacement or connection evidence would support that partially restrained assumption.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把升溫壓應力的符號誤作拉應力會顛倒開裂判斷，而冷卻受約束可能產生拉應力；若未追蹤應力自由溫度，單看當前溫度也無法決定應力方向。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Reversing the sign of heating stress reverses the cracking interpretation, while restrained cooling can create tension. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b206-v15-23-k1",
