         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "以混凝土齡期試驗取得模數與熱膨脹係數，將埋入溫度和應變計讀值配對，並分離自由熱應變。若實測壓應變小於完全約束模型，應研究徐變與接縫釋放，不應直接認定感測器低估。",
         "textEn": "Obtain age-specific modulus and expansion coefficients, pair embedded temperature and strain readings, and separate free thermal strain. Lower measured compressive response than the fully restrained estimate calls for investigating creep and joint release rather than immediately assuming sensor under-reading.",
