       "objective": "從症狀倒推「受約束溫升應力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Restrained heating stress” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把升溫壓應力的符號誤作拉應力會顛倒開裂判斷，而冷卻受約束可能產生拉應力；若未追蹤應力自由溫度，單看當前溫度也無法決定應力方向。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Reversing the sign of heating stress reverses the cracking interpretation, while restrained cooling can create tension. Without tracking the stress-free temperature, current temperature alone cannot determine whether the mechanical stress is tensile or compressive. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：完全約束的總應變為零，但自由熱應變與機械應變各自非零，這個分解是辨認應力符號的關鍵。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Total strain is zero under complete restraint, while thermal and mechanical strains are individually nonzero; their decomposition is essential for assigning the correct stress sign.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「混凝土目前溫度高就必定承受拉應力」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Concrete at a high current temperature must be in thermal tension.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
