       "objective": "說明「季節調蓄水量」如何影響小灣水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Seasonal storage water balance” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Xiaowan Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "季節性調蓄把豐水期來水延後使用，但可移轉水量受庫容、蒸發、環境流量與下游需求共同限制。教材先以平均入出流差積分一個月，建立可檢核的水量尺度；月平均不能描述月內洪峰，故仍要保留較短時段的操作與水位約束。 入出流平均值的採樣方法應一致，不等間隔觀測需要時間加權，否則算術平均可能偏向密集觀測的洪峰時段。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「季節調蓄水量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Seasonal regulation shifts water use from wet periods, subject to storage, evaporation, environmental releases and downstream demand. Integrate mean inflow minus outflow over one month as an auditable volume scale. A monthly average does not represent within-month flood peaks, so shorter-interval level and release constraints remain necessary. Inflow and outflow averaging must be consistent; irregular observations require time weights or an arithmetic mean can overrepresent flood peaks sampled more densely than other periods. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Seasonal storage water balance” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：Qin=1200 m3/s; Qout=900 m3/s; days=30; dS=(Qin-Qout)*days*86400=777600000 m3。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Qin=1200 m3/s; Qout=900 m3/s; days=30; dS=(Qin-Qout)*days*86400=777600000 m3.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「月底水量平衡就保證月內沒有庫容限制」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A month-end water balance guarantees no capacity constraint within the month.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「季節調蓄水量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Seasonal storage water balance”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
