         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Qin=1200 m3/s; Qout=900 m3/s; days=30; dS=(Qin-Qout)*days*86400=777600000 m3. Model boundary: constant monthly mean flows with evaporation and withdrawals omitted; available capacity is not verified.",
