      {
       "id": "b206-v15-27",
       "title": "季節調蓄水量：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Seasonal storage water balance: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-xiaowan-huaneng",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b206-v15-26"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「季節調蓄水量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Seasonal storage water balance” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "將每日入出流與水位庫容變化比較，再核對月底帳本，保留日內最大水位而非只有月末值。若月總量閉合但日間頻繁超出假定空間，表示平均尺度掩蓋限制，需要重做逐時或逐日調度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare daily flow balances with stage-storage changes and reconcile the month-end account, retaining maximum levels rather than only final values. A closing monthly total with repeated short-term space exceedances means averaging has hidden constraints and finer scheduling is required. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：設計相同月總入流但不同洪峰集中度的兩條日曲線，逐日計算儲量，指出哪一條需要旁通放流，並比較其期末可用水量。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Construct two daily inflow sequences with equal monthly volume but different peak concentration. Calculate storage daily, identify which requires bypass release, and compare usable water remaining at the end of the month.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：將月平均餘水全部當成可儲水量，會忽略洪水期間空間已滿的可能；水庫面積隨水位增加又使蒸發量變動，固定損失比例未必適合整季。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Treating all average surplus as storable ignores periods when flood storage is already full. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b206-v15-27-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "將每日入出流與水位庫容變化比較，再核對月底帳本，保留日內最大水位而非只有月末值。若月總量閉合但日間頻繁超出假定空間，表示平均尺度掩蓋限制，需要重做逐時或逐日調度。",
         "textEn": "Compare daily flow balances with stage-storage changes and reconcile the month-end account, retaining maximum levels rather than only final values. A closing monthly total with repeated short-term space exceedances means averaging has hidden constraints and finer scheduling is required.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiaowan-huaneng",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
