         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "設計相同月總入流但不同洪峰集中度的兩條日曲線，逐日計算儲量，指出哪一條需要旁通放流，並比較其期末可用水量。",
         "textEn": "Construct two daily inflow sequences with equal monthly volume but different peak concentration. Calculate storage daily, identify which requires bypass release, and compare usable water remaining at the end of the month.",
         "sourceIds": [
