        "questionEn": "According to the quantitative model for \"Cascade release wave arrival\", which statement holds?",
        "options": [
         "原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：L=80000 m; c=2 m/s; t=L/c/3600=11.11111111 h。",
