      {
       "id": "b206-v15-31",
       "title": "梯級變流到達：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Cascade release wave arrival: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-xiaowan-huaneng",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b206-v15-30"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「梯級變流到達」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Cascade release wave arrival” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "用上下游同步水位與流量事件做互相關，並在不同基流下比較延遲與峰形。若高流量事件到達更快，應建立隨流況變化的傳播關係，不把一次事件的延遲當作所有調度命令的固定等待時間。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Cross-correlate synchronized upstream and downstream level-flow events and compare delay and shape at different base flows. Faster arrival at high discharge calls for a flow-dependent propagation relation rather than a fixed waiting period inferred from one event and applied to all dispatch changes. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：對兩種波速計算到達時間，加入中途支流事件並畫出可能疊加區間，再提出測站位置以辨識傳播延遲與支流新增來水。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Calculate arrival times for two celerities, add a tributary event and mark possible overlap intervals. Place gauges that distinguish propagation delay from additional tributary inflow along the route.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把平均流速當波速可能錯配下游調度時機，忽略支流洪峰又可能讓波形疊加；若只看最高水位時間，會漏掉較早開始的流量變化。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Using mean particle velocity as celerity can mistime downstream coordination, while ignoring a tributary peak can miss superposition. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b206-v15-31-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "用上下游同步水位與流量事件做互相關，並在不同基流下比較延遲與峰形。若高流量事件到達更快，應建立隨流況變化的傳播關係，不把一次事件的延遲當作所有調度命令的固定等待時間。",
         "textEn": "Cross-correlate synchronized upstream and downstream level-flow events and compare delay and shape at different base flows. Faster arrival at high discharge calls for a flow-dependent propagation relation rather than a fixed waiting period inferred from one event and applied to all dispatch changes.",
