       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「密度界面流態」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Density interface flow regime” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "量測溫度與必要的溶質資料以換算密度剖面，再配合流速垂向分布，確認所選厚度代表哪一水層。若界面模糊或存在多層，應改用更完整剖面分析，不把所有密度差集中在單一界面。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure temperature and relevant dissolved constituents to estimate density, paired with vertical velocity profiles. Define which layer the thickness represents. A diffuse or multilayer interface requires fuller profile analysis rather than concentrating the entire density contrast into one artificial surface. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：保持流速與厚度不變，把密度差減半重算比值，畫出兩種剖面並說明需增加哪些垂向測點，才能檢查雙層近似。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Halve density contrast at fixed speed and thickness and recalculate the ratio. Draw both profiles and identify additional vertical sampling points needed to test whether the two-layer approximation remains reasonable.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：僅以溫度推估密度而忽略含砂或溶質，可能把重流方向判錯；感測垂向間距過大則會漏掉薄界面，使內部波速與混合判斷失真。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Estimating density from temperature alone can miss sediment or dissolved-material effects and misidentify density-current direction. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b206-v15-35-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "量測溫度與必要的溶質資料以換算密度剖面，再配合流速垂向分布，確認所選厚度代表哪一水層。若界面模糊或存在多層，應改用更完整剖面分析，不把所有密度差集中在單一界面。",
         "textEn": "Measure temperature and relevant dissolved constituents to estimate density, paired with vertical velocity profiles. Define which layer the thickness represents. A diffuse or multilayer interface requires fuller profile analysis rather than concentrating the entire density contrast into one artificial surface.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiaowan-huaneng",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
