       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Density interface flow regime” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "僅以溫度推估密度而忽略含砂或溶質，可能把重流方向判錯；感測垂向間距過大則會漏掉薄界面，使內部波速與混合判斷失真。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Estimating density from temperature alone can miss sediment or dissolved-material effects and misidentify density-current direction. Coarse vertical sampling can also miss a thin interface and distort the inferred internal-wave speed and mixing interpretation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：密度差符號反映穩定或不穩定排列，若重水在上則原先穩定內波尺度不適用，需改研究翻轉混合。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: The density-contrast sign identifies stable or unstable layering; dense water above light water invalidates the stable internal-wave scale and calls for an overturning analysis.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「分層界面恢復力一律使用完整重力加速度」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The restoring force at a stratified interface always uses full gravity without density contrast.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
