         "textEn": "Check reference stability and timestamps, plotting displacement, rate and uncertainty together. An apparent increase caused by one jump calls for instrument checks. Sustained acceleration across independent measurements justifies investigating pore pressure and rock-mass mechanisms rather than relying on a single processed channel.",
         "sourceIds": [
