      {
       "id": "b206-v15-40",
       "title": "岸坡位移速率：失效診斷",
       "titleEn": "Abutment slope movement rate: failure diagnosis",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-xiaowan-huaneng",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b206-v15-39"
       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「岸坡位移速率」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Abutment slope movement rate” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "將長時間平均速率外推會漏掉近期加速，過度平滑也可能延後辨識；反之，差分噪音能製造假加速度，必須用原始位移及獨立測點支持解釋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Extrapolating a long-term mean can miss recent acceleration, and heavy smoothing can delay recognition. Conversely, differencing noise creates false acceleration, requiring raw displacement and independent observation points to support the interpreted change. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：速率差分的兩次位移若有共同基準誤差，部分偏差可能相消，但不同日期的基準跳動反而會放大假速率。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: A shared reference bias can partly cancel in displacement differencing, while a reference jump between dates can create a large false rate; distinguish the two errors.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「任何正位移速率都能直接推算破壞日期」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Any positive movement rate can directly predict the date of failure.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b206-v15-40-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "將長時間平均速率外推會漏掉近期加速，過度平滑也可能延後辨識；反之，差分噪音能製造假加速度，必須用原始位移及獨立測點支持解釋。",
         "textEn": "Extrapolating a long-term mean can miss recent acceleration, and heavy smoothing can delay recognition. Conversely, differencing noise creates false acceleration, requiring raw displacement and independent observation points to support the interpreted change.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiaowan-huaneng",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b206-v15-40-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiaowan-huaneng",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "在「岸坡位移速率」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？",
        "questionEn": "When \"Abutment slope movement rate\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?",
        "options": [
         "先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。",
         "將長時間平均速率外推會漏掉近期加速，過度平滑也可能延後辨識；反之，差分噪音能製造假加速度，必須用原始位移及獨立測點支持解釋。",
         "完整岩芯彈性模數可直接代表整座岩坡"
        ],
        "optionsEn": [
         "Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.",
         "Extrapolating a long-term mean can miss recent acceleration, and heavy smoothing can delay recognition.",
         "An intact-core modulus directly represents the entire rock slope."
