        "answer": 1,
        "explanation": "將長時間平均速率外推會漏掉近期加速，過度平滑也可能延後辨識；反之，差分噪音能製造假加速度，必須用原始位移及獨立測點支持解釋。 需以量測區分可能原因。",
        "explanationEn": "Extrapolating a long-term mean can miss recent acceleration, and heavy smoothing can delay recognition. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."
