       "objective": "說明「高壩水壓投影」如何影響錦屏一級水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “High dam pressure projection” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Jinping-I Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "靜水壓隨水深增加，沿垂直投影積分可得每單位壩長的水平合力，作用點位於壓力三角形形心。這是外力帳，並未說明拱壩如何把力傳向兩岸。實際雙曲面上的法向壓力需向量積分，不能把投影條帶合力直接當成每條拱圈的反力。 合力作用點由壓力一階矩決定，不是幾何深度中點；分段壓力圖改變時，力與力矩都需重新積分。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「高壩水壓投影」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Hydrostatic pressure increases with depth, and integration over a vertical projection gives horizontal force per unit dam length at the triangular pressure centroid. This accounts for external load, not arch transfer to the banks. Normal pressure on a double-curved surface requires vector integration; a projected strip is not an individual arch reaction. The resultant location follows the first pressure moment, not the geometric midpoint; changing a piecewise pressure diagram requires recalculating both force and moment. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “High dam pressure projection” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：gamma=9.81 kN/m3; h=260 m; w=1 m; F=0.5*gamma*h*h*w=331578 kN。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: gamma=9.81 kN/m3; h=260 m; w=1 m; F=0.5*gamma*h*h*w=331578 kN.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「壩頂海拔可直接代替壓力積分水深」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Crest elevation above sea level can directly replace water depth in pressure integration.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「高壩水壓投影」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “High dam pressure projection”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b207-v15-01-k1",
         "title": "高壩水壓投影",
         "titleEn": "High dam pressure projection",
         "text": "靜水壓隨水深增加，沿垂直投影積分可得每單位壩長的水平合力，作用點位於壓力三角形形心。這是外力帳，並未說明拱壩如何把力傳向兩岸。",
         "textEn": "Hydrostatic pressure increases with depth, and integration over a vertical projection gives horizontal force per unit dam length at the triangular pressure centroid. This accounts for external load, not arch transfer to the banks.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-jinping-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b207-v15-01-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：壩頂海拔可直接代替壓力積分水深 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Crest elevation above sea level can directly replace water depth in pressure integration. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
