       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「高壩水壓投影」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “High dam pressure projection” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "先標出水面與投影面幾何，確認壓力深度不等於海拔高程，再以分層矩形積分接近三角形結果。將外力方向與拱圈傳力圖分開繪製，若兩者合力不平衡，應查漏列尾水或幾何投影。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Mark the water surface and projected geometry, ensuring depth is not confused with elevation, then refine rectangular pressure integration toward the triangular result. Draw external loading separately from arch transfer. An unbalanced resultant calls for checking omitted tailwater or projection geometry rather than adjusting support reactions arbitrarily. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將水深降低一成，重算合力與作用點並比較非線性變化，再畫出有尾水時的差壓圖，說明哪些力尚未進入投影條帶模型。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Reduce depth by ten percent, recalculate resultant and location, and compare the nonlinear change. Draw a differential-pressure diagram with tailwater and identify forces still absent from the projected-strip model.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：使用壩頂高程代替水深會把基準誤差平方放大，造成外力嚴重失真；忽略曲面法向分量也可能漏掉垂直作用，不能由水平投影帳宣稱全壩荷載已完整。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Substituting crest elevation for depth squares a datum error in the load estimate. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b207-v15-03-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "先標出水面與投影面幾何，確認壓力深度不等於海拔高程，再以分層矩形積分接近三角形結果。將外力方向與拱圈傳力圖分開繪製，若兩者合力不平衡，應查漏列尾水或幾何投影。",
         "textEn": "Mark the water surface and projected geometry, ensuring depth is not confused with elevation, then refine rectangular pressure integration toward the triangular result. Draw external loading separately from arch transfer. An unbalanced resultant calls for checking omitted tailwater or projection geometry rather than adjusting support reactions arbitrarily.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-jinping-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b207-v15-03-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "將水深降低一成，重算合力與作用點並比較非線性變化，再畫出有尾水時的差壓圖，說明哪些力尚未進入投影條帶模型。",
         "textEn": "Reduce depth by ten percent, recalculate resultant and location, and compare the nonlinear change. Draw a differential-pressure diagram with tailwater and identify forces still absent from the projected-strip model.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-jinping-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
