       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Thin arch ring membrane scale” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Jinping-I Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "理想圓拱圈在均勻徑向壓力下可藉膜壓縮傳力，壓力乘半徑再除厚度提供一個應力尺度。雙曲拱壩還有豎向懸臂、扭曲及不同剛度拱座，不能當成孤立薄圓環。教材特意保留薄度與荷載假設，讓學員指出何處需要三維殼或實體分析。 膜應力尺度不含外壓失穩與局部缺陷效應，即使材料壓縮強度足夠，也不能由這一式排除所有失效機制。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「薄拱圈膜力尺度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "An ideal circular ring under uniform radial pressure carries membrane compression, with pressure times radius divided by thickness giving a stress scale. A double-curvature dam also has vertical cantilever action, distortion and unequal abutment stiffness, unlike an isolated thin ring. State slenderness and loading assumptions before identifying questions requiring shell or solid analysis. The membrane scale omits external-pressure instability and local defects; adequate compressive material strength therefore does not exclude every failure mechanism through this one equation. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Thin arch ring membrane scale” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：p=2 MPa; R=180 m; t=12 m; sigma=p*R/t=30 MPa。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: p=2 MPa; R=180 m; t=12 m; sigma=p*R/t=30 MPa.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「平均膜壓縮很大就不可能出現局部拉應力」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Large mean membrane compression makes local tensile stress impossible.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
