         "textEn": "An ideal circular ring under uniform radial pressure carries membrane compression, with pressure times radius divided by thickness giving a stress scale. A double-curvature dam also has vertical cantilever action, distortion and unequal abutment stiffness, unlike an isolated thin ring.",
