       "instruction": "檢查半徑與厚度定義及其比例，畫出截開半環的平衡圖，再以粗細網格比較理想模型。若加入不對稱支承後出現彎矩，應承認膜力近似缺項，不用調整半徑把彎曲反應硬塞回公式。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check radius, thickness and their ratio, draw equilibrium of a cut half-ring, and compare mesh refinements of the ideal model. Bending after introducing asymmetric supports identifies a missing mechanism; changing the radius to force agreement does not repair the membrane approximation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將厚度增加兩成重算膜應力，再加入概念性的拱座轉角，指出哪些新內力無法由原式得到，並規劃三維模型需輸入的邊界資料。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Increase thickness by twenty percent and recompute membrane stress. Introduce an abutment rotation conceptually, identify internal forces missing from the formula, and list boundary data required for a three-dimensional model.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：拱座變形不相容會引入彎曲與局部拉應力，平均膜壓縮仍可能很大；所以正的平均壓應力不能排除接縫張開，也不能代替混凝土與岩體接觸檢核。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Incompatible abutment movement introduces bending and local tension while mean membrane compression remains large. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
