         "textEn": "Check radius, thickness and their ratio, draw equilibrium of a cut half-ring, and compare mesh refinements of the ideal model. Bending after introducing asymmetric supports identifies a missing mechanism; changing the radius to force agreement does not repair the membrane approximation.",
