       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Thin arch ring membrane scale” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "拱座變形不相容會引入彎曲與局部拉應力，平均膜壓縮仍可能很大；所以正的平均壓應力不能排除接縫張開，也不能代替混凝土與岩體接觸檢核。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Incompatible abutment movement introduces bending and local tension while mean membrane compression remains large. A positive average compressive stress therefore does not exclude joint opening or replace checks of concrete-rock contact and local stress distribution. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
