       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: N1=30 MN; U1=6 MN; mu1=0.6 (dimensionless); N2=20 MN; U2=4 MN; mu2=0.5 (dimensionless); R=mu1*(N1-U1)+mu2*(N2-U2)=22.4 MN.",
