       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Two plane wedge resistance” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "用立體節理圖先確認共同交線與出露條件，再將每面水壓與反力方向畫出。比較乾季和雨季的孔壓變化，若只有一面明顯反應，應保留兩面差異，不用平均水壓抹平主導失效路徑。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Use a three-dimensional joint diagram to establish intersection and daylighting, then show pressure and reaction on each plane. Compare seasonal pressures; if one plane responds strongly, retain that distinction rather than averaging pressure and concealing the controlling resistance path. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：分別提高第一面與第二面水壓，計算抗力變化並比較敏感度，再畫出一面失去接觸時原模型需要刪除及重新求解的項目。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Increase water pressure on each plane separately and compare resistance sensitivity. Draw the case where one plane loses contact and identify terms that must be removed or solved again in the revised model.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：一面節理連通高水壓會重新分配接觸反力，原先固定反力假設可能失效；若某面脫開，其摩擦不能繼續按原正向力計入，需重新求運動學與平衡。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: High pressure connected to one plane can redistribute contact reactions and invalidate their assumed fixed values. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
