         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "將張拉、鎖定與後續量測的時間及溫度分別記錄，對照載重計校準與重新提離試驗。若多支同時下降，先查共同岩體位移或溫度；若單支突變，則需檢查接頭滑移及儀器。",
         "textEn": "Record stressing, lock-off and later readings with times and temperatures, checking load-cell calibration against lift-off testing. A coherent decline across anchors suggests shared rock movement or temperature, while one abrupt change requires investigation of connection slip or measurement failure.",
