         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: vx=25 m/s; drop=120 m; g=9.81 m/s2; x=vx*(2*drop/g)**0.5=123.6548417 m. Model boundary: horizontal launch with zero initial vertical velocity in a drag-free projectile model, excluding jet breakup.",
