         "text": "以影像追蹤水舌外緣與中心線，核對出射角及速度範圍，再比較不同流量的落水帶寬度。若落點展寬而中心位置近似不變，應研究破碎與含氣，不能只調整平均出射速度。",
         "textEn": "Track the jet envelope and centerline with imagery, checking launch angle and velocity range, then compare impact-zone width at different discharges. A wider landing band with a similar center suggests breakup or aeration rather than merely a change in average launch speed.",
