       "objective": "從症狀倒推「挑流水舌射程」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Ski jump jet travel” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "出射角或流束不均會使局部水舌偏向邊坡，即使平均射程符合估算仍有側向衝擊；忽略尾水淹沒也會錯估真正能量耗散區域。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Uneven flow or launch angle can direct part of the jet toward a slope even when mean range matches the calculation. Ignoring tailwater submergence additionally misidentifies where the jet actually dissipates its energy and transfers momentum. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：水平射出時下落時間由高差決定，但若鼻坎提供向上速度，需解完整垂向方程，不能沿用相同飛行時間。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: For horizontal launch, drop determines flight time; an upward launch component requires the full vertical equation and cannot retain the same time of flight.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「理想拋體落點就是實際沖刷坑中心」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The ideal projectile landing point is the actual center of the scour hole.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b207-v15-20-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
