         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: rho=1000 kg/m3; v=35 m/s; q=0.5*rho*v*v/1000=612.5 kPa. Model boundary: dynamic-pressure scale for single-phase velocity, not a measured plunge-pool bottom peak.",
