       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「水舌衝擊壓力尺度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Jet impact pressure scale” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "在模型或合適量測資料中比較不同位置的平均、峰值與相關性，核對感測器頻寬及通氣影響。若鄰近測點峰值不同時發生，不能把各點最大值同時相加成總力，需保留同步壓力場。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare mean pressure, peaks and spatial correlation using model or suitable measured data, checking sensor bandwidth and aeration effects. Peaks at neighboring locations that occur at different times cannot simply be added into one total force; retain synchronized pressure fields for integration. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將速度提高一成計算動壓變化，再建立兩個不同相位的壓力時序，對比逐點最大值總和與同步積分最大值的差異。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Increase velocity by ten percent and recalculate dynamic pressure. Create two out-of-phase pressure histories and compare the sum of individual maxima with the maximum of their synchronized integral.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：岩節理中的壓力脈動可能向內傳播並抬動岩塊，即使表面平均壓力不高；含氣改變可壓縮性與脈動傳遞，因此清水動壓尺度無法單獨描述剝離。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Pressure fluctuations can penetrate rock joints and lift blocks despite modest mean surface pressure. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b207-v15-23-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "在模型或合適量測資料中比較不同位置的平均、峰值與相關性，核對感測器頻寬及通氣影響。若鄰近測點峰值不同時發生，不能把各點最大值同時相加成總力，需保留同步壓力場。",
         "textEn": "Compare mean pressure, peaks and spatial correlation using model or suitable measured data, checking sensor bandwidth and aeration effects. Peaks at neighboring locations that occur at different times cannot simply be added into one total force; retain synchronized pressure fields for integration.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-jinping-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b207-v15-23-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "將速度提高一成計算動壓變化，再建立兩個不同相位的壓力時序，對比逐點最大值總和與同步積分最大值的差異。",
         "textEn": "Increase velocity by ten percent and recalculate dynamic pressure. Create two out-of-phase pressure histories and compare the sum of individual maxima with the maximum of their synchronized integral.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-jinping-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
