       "objective": "從症狀倒推「水舌衝擊壓力尺度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Jet impact pressure scale” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "岩節理中的壓力脈動可能向內傳播並抬動岩塊，即使表面平均壓力不高；含氣改變可壓縮性與脈動傳遞，因此清水動壓尺度無法單獨描述剝離。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Pressure fluctuations can penetrate rock joints and lift blocks despite modest mean surface pressure. Aeration changes compressibility and fluctuation transmission, so a clear-water dynamic-pressure scale alone cannot describe block removal or the progression of scour. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：動壓的帕斯卡與每立方米焦耳量綱相同，代表能量密度而非總能量，乘體積或面積後才得到不同物理量。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Pascals share dimensions with joules per cubic metre, expressing energy density rather than total energy; multiplying by volume or area produces different physical quantities.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「所有測點最大壓力可直接同時相加」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Maximum pressures from all sensors can always be added as simultaneous loads.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b207-v15-24-k1",
