     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Dam block free contraction\" and \"Stratified exchange potential energy\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b207-v15-25",
       "title": "壩塊自由收縮：機制與系統路徑",
