       "objective": "說明「壩塊自由收縮」如何影響錦屏一級水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Dam block free contraction” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Jinping-I Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "高壩混凝土塊體降溫會產生自由收縮，但拱圈閉合、岩體約束及灌漿時機會決定實際縫寬與應力。教材先算一段假想塊體的自由長度減少，明確以幅度表示；不能把它直接當接縫開度，因相鄰塊體也在變形且整體幾何可能限制位移。 相鄰塊體各自的無應力溫度未必相同，接縫灌漿年代及材料齡期會改變後續收縮的參考狀態。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「壩塊自由收縮」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Cooling a high-dam concrete block creates free contraction, while arch closure, rock restraint and grouting timing determine actual joint opening and stress. Compute the magnitude of free shortening in an assumed block first. It is not directly the joint opening because neighboring blocks deform and the overall geometry can restrain movement. Neighboring blocks may have different stress-free temperatures; grouting history and material age change the reference state from which subsequent contraction and restraint develop. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Dam block free contraction” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=20 m; dTcool=15 K; shortening=alpha*L*dTcool*1000=3 mm。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=20 m; dTcool=15 K; shortening=alpha*L*dTcool*1000=3 mm.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「單側位移可以直接當成相鄰接縫開度」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Displacement on one side directly equals the adjacent joint opening.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「壩塊自由收縮」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Dam block free contraction”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
