         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=20 m; dTcool=15 K; shortening=alpha*L*dTcool*1000=3 mm. Model boundary: free-shortening magnitude for uniform cooling, excluding neighboring blocks and restraint.",
