      {
       "id": "b207-v15-27",
       "title": "壩塊自由收縮：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Dam block free contraction: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-jinping-owner",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b207-v15-26"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「壩塊自由收縮」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Dam block free contraction” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "同時比較塊內溫度剖面與接縫兩側位移，核對降溫是否均勻及量測正向。若兩側都朝同方向移動，接縫差值可能很小但整體位移不小，應分別呈現絕對與相對運動。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare internal temperature profiles with displacement on both sides of the joint, checking uniformity and sign conventions. If both sides move in the same direction, relative opening may be small despite substantial overall movement, so present absolute and relative components separately. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：為兩個相鄰塊體設定不同降溫，計算各自自由收縮，再畫共同平移與相對開縫兩種位移場，指出需要哪些量測才能區分。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Assign different cooling changes to two neighboring blocks and calculate free shortening. Draw common translation and relative opening fields, identifying the measurements needed to distinguish them rather than relying on one gauge.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：用單側位移當縫寬會把整體平移誤算為開裂，溫度梯度又可能造成彎曲而非純收縮；若只保存平均溫度，將失去辨認兩種機制的關鍵資訊。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Using one-side displacement as joint width mistakes translation for opening, while a temperature gradient can produce bending rather than pure shortening. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b207-v15-27-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "同時比較塊內溫度剖面與接縫兩側位移，核對降溫是否均勻及量測正向。若兩側都朝同方向移動，接縫差值可能很小但整體位移不小，應分別呈現絕對與相對運動。",
         "textEn": "Compare internal temperature profiles with displacement on both sides of the joint, checking uniformity and sign conventions. If both sides move in the same direction, relative opening may be small despite substantial overall movement, so present absolute and relative components separately.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-jinping-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
