       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「壩塊自由收縮」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Dam block free contraction” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "用單側位移當縫寬會把整體平移誤算為開裂，溫度梯度又可能造成彎曲而非純收縮；若只保存平均溫度，將失去辨認兩種機制的關鍵資訊。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Using one-side displacement as joint width mistakes translation for opening, while a temperature gradient can produce bending rather than pure shortening. Retaining only average temperature removes information needed to distinguish those mechanisms in the observed movement. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：相鄰塊體各自的無應力溫度未必相同，接縫灌漿年代及材料齡期會改變後續收縮的參考狀態。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Neighboring blocks may have different stress-free temperatures; grouting history and material age change the reference state from which subsequent contraction and restraint develop.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「單側位移可以直接當成相鄰接縫開度」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Displacement on one side directly equals the adjacent joint opening.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b207-v15-28-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "用單側位移當縫寬會把整體平移誤算為開裂，溫度梯度又可能造成彎曲而非純收縮；若只保存平均溫度，將失去辨認兩種機制的關鍵資訊。",
         "textEn": "Using one-side displacement as joint width mistakes translation for opening, while a temperature gradient can produce bending rather than pure shortening. Retaining only average temperature removes information needed to distinguish those mechanisms in the observed movement.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-jinping-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b207-v15-28-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
