        "explanation": "分層水庫上下層交換需要克服密度差產生的浮力恢復作用。 其餘選項是常見誤解。",
        "explanationEn": "Exchanging upper and lower reservoir layers works against buoyancy associated with density contrast. The other options are common misconceptions."
