       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "依「分層交換位能」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？",
        "questionEn": "According to the quantitative model for \"Stratified exchange potential energy\", which statement holds?",
        "options": [
         "原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：drho=2 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; V=1000000 m3; dz=20 m; dE=drho*g*V*dz/1e6=392.4 MJ。",
         "壩頂海拔可直接代替壓力積分水深",
