        "answer": 0,
        "explanation": "原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：drho=2 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; V=1000000 m3; dz=20 m; dE=drho*g*V*dz/1e6=392.4 MJ。 重算時請保留單位。",
        "explanationEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: drho=2 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; V=1000000 m3; dz=20 m; dE=drho*g*V*dz/1e6=392.4 MJ. Keep units when recalculating."
