      {
       "id": "b207-v15-31",
       "title": "分層交換位能：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Stratified exchange potential energy: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-jinping-owner",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b207-v15-30"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「分層交換位能」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Stratified exchange potential energy” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以密度剖面確認上下層排列，核對水團體積及高程差定義，再將取水前後剖面比較。若溫度改變但密度界面仍存在，不能宣稱整庫已混合；需分辨局部置換、捲吸與全深混合。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Verify the upper-light lower-dense arrangement using density profiles, define exchanged volume and elevation difference, and compare profiles before and after withdrawal. Changed outlet temperature with an intact interface does not demonstrate complete reservoir mixing; distinguish local replacement, entrainment and full-depth mixing. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將密度差減半重算交換位能，保持總熱量相同卻改變垂向分布，說明何種剖面量測可辨認不同浮力結構及取水反應。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Halve density contrast and recalculate exchange energy. Keep total heat unchanged while altering its vertical distribution, and identify profile measurements that distinguish buoyancy structures and withdrawal responses.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：僅用出口溫度判斷分層消失，可能漏掉深層冷水仍被隔離的情況；含砂入流也可改變密度而非單純改變溫度，使熱量與浮力的推論分歧。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Outlet temperature alone can conceal an isolated cold deep layer and falsely suggest lost stratification. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b207-v15-31-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "以密度剖面確認上下層排列，核對水團體積及高程差定義，再將取水前後剖面比較。若溫度改變但密度界面仍存在，不能宣稱整庫已混合；需分辨局部置換、捲吸與全深混合。",
         "textEn": "Verify the upper-light lower-dense arrangement using density profiles, define exchanged volume and elevation difference, and compare profiles before and after withdrawal. Changed outlet temperature with an intact interface does not demonstrate complete reservoir mixing; distinguish local replacement, entrainment and full-depth mixing.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-jinping-owner",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b207-v15-31-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "將密度差減半重算交換位能，保持總熱量相同卻改變垂向分布，說明何種剖面量測可辨認不同浮力結構及取水反應。",
         "textEn": "Halve density contrast and recalculate exchange energy. Keep total heat unchanged while altering its vertical distribution, and identify profile measurements that distinguish buoyancy structures and withdrawal responses.",
         "sourceIds": [
