       "objective": "從症狀倒推「分層交換位能」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Stratified exchange potential energy” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "僅用出口溫度判斷分層消失，可能漏掉深層冷水仍被隔離的情況；含砂入流也可改變密度而非單純改變溫度，使熱量與浮力的推論分歧。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Outlet temperature alone can conceal an isolated cold deep layer and falsely suggest lost stratification. Sediment-laden inflow can also change density without an equivalent temperature change, separating thermal interpretation from the actual buoyancy structure. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：兩水團交換時各自有位能變化，將兩者相加才留下密度差項，不能把完整水密度直接代入浮力差。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Both exchanged parcels change potential energy; adding their contributions leaves the density-contrast term, rather than permitting full water density to represent the buoyancy difference.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「出口溫度改變就證明全庫分層消失」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A changed outlet temperature proves that stratification has disappeared throughout the reservoir.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
