       "objective": "說明「調蓄水的能量尺度」如何影響錦屏一級水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Stored water energy scale” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Jinping-I Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "儲水的可發電能量取決於放水時的淨水頭及效率，並非單由庫容決定。以固定水頭近似可先估算一小段水量的能量尺度，但大量放水會改變上下游水位，需沿儲量積分。水體還可能有灌溉與環境用途，所以潛在電能不等於可全部出售的電量。 能量換算需從焦耳轉為瓦時再轉為吉瓦時，忽略每小時秒數會造成巨大單位錯誤，應逐級檢查。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「調蓄水的能量尺度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Stored-water generation depends on net head and efficiency during release, not storage volume alone. Constant head estimates the energy scale of a limited volume, while major drawdown requires integrating changing head with storage. Other water uses further distinguish potential electrical energy from energy actually available for sale. Energy conversion must connect joules to watt-hours and then gigawatt-hours; omitting seconds per hour causes a major unit error that dimensional steps should expose. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Stored water energy scale” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; V=20000000 m3; H=180 m; eta=0.90 (dimensionless); E=rho*g*V*H*eta/3.6e12=8.829 GWh。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; V=20000000 m3; H=180 m; eta=0.90 (dimensionless); E=rho*g*V*H*eta/3.6e12=8.829 GWh.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「相同庫容在任何水頭下都代表相同電能」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Equal storage volume represents equal electrical energy at every head.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「調蓄水的能量尺度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Stored water energy scale”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
