       "objective": "說明「柱狀節理串聯柔度」如何影響白鶴灘水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Columnar joint series compliance” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Baihetan Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "柱狀節理岩體的變形不只來自完整岩塊，也包含節理壓縮與滑移。當載重路徑依序通過岩塊及節理，兩者變形可在簡化一維模型中相加，等效剛度由柔度相加求得。這種尺度分析幫助理解很薄的弱介面為何可能主導整體變形，但不代表真實三維節理網絡。 串聯元件承受相同力，平行元件則共享位移，先確認物理連接才能決定應加剛度還是加柔度。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「柱狀節理串聯柔度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Columnar-jointed rock deforms through intact blocks and joint compression or slip. A load path passing sequentially through rock and an interface permits additive displacements in a simplified one-dimensional model, with compliances added to obtain equivalent stiffness. A thin weak interface can dominate deformation, though the model does not represent a three-dimensional joint network. Elements in series carry equal force, whereas parallel elements share displacement; the physical connection determines whether stiffnesses or compliances should be added in the model. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Columnar joint series compliance” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：kb=120 GN/m; kj=30 GN/m; keq=1/(1/kb+1/kj)=24 GN/m。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: kb=120 GN/m; kj=30 GN/m; keq=1/(1/kb+1/kj)=24 GN/m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「串聯岩塊與節理的剛度可直接相加」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Stiffnesses of rock and joint elements in series can be added directly.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「柱狀節理串聯柔度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Columnar joint series compliance”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b208-v15-01-k1",
         "title": "柱狀節理串聯柔度",
