       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: binder=180 kg/m3; q=200 kJ/kg; rho=2400 kg/m3; cp=0.9 kJ/(kg*K); dT=binder*q/(rho*cp)=16.66666667 K.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「使用低熱水泥就不需要量測核心溫度」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
