       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「低熱水泥絕熱溫升」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Low heat cement adiabatic rise” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "對實際配比做絕熱或半絕熱試驗，核對試件齡期、初溫與摻料比例，再與現場核心溫度及冷卻帳比較。若現場峰值較低，應查散熱與放熱時間，而非直接宣稱水泥單位放熱量不同。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Test the actual mix adiabatically or semi-adiabatically, matching age, starting temperature and supplementary materials, then compare core temperatures and cooling accounts. A lower field peak calls for examining heat exchange and timing before concluding that the cement specific heat release has changed. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：改變膠結料用量與比熱各一成，分別重算溫升，建立敏感度表，再列出要從絕熱尺度轉成現地溫度歷程所需的邊界條件。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Change binder content and heat capacity by ten percent separately, recalculate rise and build a sensitivity table. List boundary conditions needed to convert the adiabatic scale into a field temperature history.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：低熱不等於無熱，若忽略保溫邊界仍可能低估核心溫升；過快表面降溫又可能提高梯度，所以降低總熱量不能單獨保證沒有溫度裂縫。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Low heat is not zero heat, and an insulating boundary can still permit a high core temperature. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
