       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Gigawatt unit shaft torque” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Baihetan Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "百萬千瓦級機組的低速軸系需傳遞很大的轉矩，機械功率與電端功率要先分清楚。教材把指定軸功率除以角速度，得到平均扭矩，再討論法蘭、軸承與轉輪連接的載重路徑。平均扭矩不能表示扭振峰值，也不能由單機容量推論材料應力。 若功率以兆瓦輸入而角速度以每秒計，所得扭矩自然是兆牛頓米，但弧度的無因次慣例仍需說明。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「巨型機組軸轉矩」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A low-speed gigawatt-class shaft transmits large torque, and mechanical power must be distinguished from terminal electrical power. Divide specified shaft power by angular speed for mean torque, then trace loads through flanges, bearings and runner connections. Mean torque does not describe torsional peaks or determine material stress from unit capacity alone. With megawatts and angular speed per second, torque is naturally in meganewton-metres; the dimensionless-radian convention should still be understood when checking the units. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Gigawatt unit shaft torque” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
