       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Gigawatt unit shaft torque” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "對照軸速、電端功率及損失估計，先確認功率邊界一致，再把扭振頻譜與平均轉矩分開報告。若接頭局部應變偏高而平均功率正常，應研究偏心、載重分配及應力集中，不用總功率排除機械問題。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Align shaft speed, terminal power and loss estimates to a common boundary, reporting torsional spectra separately from mean torque. High local connection strain at normal mean power calls for examining eccentricity, load distribution and stress concentration rather than using total power to dismiss a mechanical problem. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：保持軸功率並改變轉速，計算平均轉矩曲線，再畫接頭傳力圖，指出還需哪些幾何與動態資料才能評估局部螺栓或法蘭應力。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Hold shaft power fixed while varying speed and plot mean torque. Draw the connection load path and identify geometric and dynamic information needed to assess local bolt or flange stress.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：軸系接頭鬆動可能造成週期滑移與局部峰值，平均扭矩帳仍會閉合；若錯把轉速每分鐘當每秒，則會把所有後續扭矩與應力估算帶入單位錯誤。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A loose shaft connection can produce cyclic slip and local peaks while the mean torque account still closes. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
