       "objective": "從症狀倒推「巨型機組軸轉矩」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Gigawatt unit shaft torque” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "軸系接頭鬆動可能造成週期滑移與局部峰值，平均扭矩帳仍會閉合；若錯把轉速每分鐘當每秒，則會把所有後續扭矩與應力估算帶入單位錯誤。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A loose shaft connection can produce cyclic slip and local peaks while the mean torque account still closes. Confusing revolutions per minute with per second introduces a unit error into every subsequent torque and stress estimate based on that speed. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若功率以兆瓦輸入而角速度以每秒計，所得扭矩自然是兆牛頓米，但弧度的無因次慣例仍需說明。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: With megawatts and angular speed per second, torque is naturally in meganewton-metres; the dimensionless-radian convention should still be understood when checking the units.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「機組平均功率正常就代表接頭局部應力正常」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Normal mean unit power proves that local connection stresses are normal.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b208-v15-12-k1",
