         "text": "軸系接頭鬆動可能造成週期滑移與局部峰值，平均扭矩帳仍會閉合；若錯把轉速每分鐘當每秒，則會把所有後續扭矩與應力估算帶入單位錯誤。",
         "textEn": "A loose shaft connection can produce cyclic slip and local peaks while the mean torque account still closes. Confusing revolutions per minute with per second introduces a unit error into every subsequent torque and stress estimate based on that speed.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-baihetan-owner",
