       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Generator terminal current scale” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Baihetan Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "大型發電機電流由三相實功、線電壓及功率因數共同決定，電壓提高會降低同功率電流，但不能因此忽略絕緣與故障需求。教材在平衡正弦條件下計算線電流，並辨認線電壓與相電壓的差異。導體溫升、短路力及局部放電需另行驗證。 每相電流與線電流是否相等取決於接線方式，本例使用平衡系統的線量關係，不可未確認就套入繞組損失。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「發電端電流尺度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Large-generator current depends on three-phase active power, line voltage and power factor. Raising voltage lowers current at fixed power but introduces insulation and fault considerations. Calculate line current for balanced sinusoidal operation while distinguishing line from phase voltage; conductor heating, short-circuit forces and partial discharge remain separate assessments. Whether phase and line current match depends on connection; this example uses balanced-system line quantities and cannot enter winding-loss calculations without checking that distinction. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Generator terminal current scale” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：P=1000000000 W; Vline=24000 V; pf=0.90 (dimensionless); I=P/(sqrt(3)*Vline*pf)/1000=26.72917913 kA。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: P=1000000000 W; Vline=24000 V; pf=0.90 (dimensionless); I=P/(sqrt(3)*Vline*pf)/1000=26.72917913 kA.",
