       "objective": "從症狀倒推「發電端電流尺度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Generator terminal current scale” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "線電壓誤作相電壓會造成根號三倍誤差，低功率因數又可能在實功未增加時提高電流；忽略這兩項會低估導體與冷卻系統負擔。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Confusing line and phase voltage introduces a square-root-of-three error, while reduced power factor can raise current without increasing active power. Ignoring these effects understates conductor loading and cooling demand even at an unchanged generating output. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：每相電流與線電流是否相等取決於接線方式，本例使用平衡系統的線量關係，不可未確認就套入繞組損失。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Whether phase and line current match depends on connection; this example uses balanced-system line quantities and cannot enter winding-loss calculations without checking that distinction.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「實功固定時功率因數不會影響電流」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Power factor cannot affect current when active power is fixed.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
