       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Qheat=5000000 W; rhoAir=1.15 kg/m3; cpAir=1005 J/(kg*K); dT=15 K; Vdot=Qheat/(rhoAir*cpAir*dT)=288.4130074 m3/s.",
