        "b208-v15-18"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「通風散熱體積流」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Ventilation cooling volume flow” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "在進出口量測溫度、密度條件與風速分布，使用斷面積分而非單點最高風速。若總熱量帳吻合但局部繞組過熱，應查分流及死區；若風機功率增加而有效風量不增，則查阻力及漏風。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure inlet-outlet temperature, density conditions and velocity distribution, integrating the section rather than using its peak velocity. A closing total heat account with hot windings indicates flow maldistribution. Greater fan power without more effective flow calls for checking resistance and leakage. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將空氣密度降低一成重算需求風量，再加入兩條不均等風路，說明哪些測點能確認熱源真正得到冷卻，而非只看到總風量。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Lower air density by ten percent and recalculate required volume flow. Add two unequal airflow paths and identify measurements that verify cooling at the heat source rather than only total delivered airflow.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：風道旁通可讓量測總風量正常卻繞過熱源，局部堵塞也可能在平均溫升不高時形成熱點；若沿用標準密度，則會把高溫空氣的熱容量估高。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A bypass can preserve measured total airflow while avoiding the heat source, and local blockage can create hotspots despite modest mean temperature rise. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
