         "id": "b208-v15-19-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "在進出口量測溫度、密度條件與風速分布，使用斷面積分而非單點最高風速。若總熱量帳吻合但局部繞組過熱，應查分流及死區；若風機功率增加而有效風量不增，則查阻力及漏風。",
         "textEn": "Measure inlet-outlet temperature, density conditions and velocity distribution, integrating the section rather than using its peak velocity. A closing total heat account with hot windings indicates flow maldistribution. Greater fan power without more effective flow calls for checking resistance and leakage.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-baihetan-owner",
