       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Ventilation cooling volume flow” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "風道旁通可讓量測總風量正常卻繞過熱源，局部堵塞也可能在平均溫升不高時形成熱點；若沿用標準密度，則會把高溫空氣的熱容量估高。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A bypass can preserve measured total airflow while avoiding the heat source, and local blockage can create hotspots despite modest mean temperature rise. Using standard density for hot air also overestimates its heat-carrying capacity at the stated volume flow. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：空氣密度應對應量測斷面的壓力與溫度，標準風量和實際風量需要換算後才能放進同一熱量帳。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Air density must match pressure and temperature at the measurement section; standard and actual volume flows require conversion before they belong in one thermal account.",
