       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Governor droop static scale” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Baihetan Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "調速下垂使頻率降低時機組增加功率，但其靜態斜率不等於瞬時能提供的響應。導葉速度、水錘、轉動慣量及保護限制決定暫態過程。教材以無因次下垂和頻率偏差估算理想增功率，要求另查機組餘裕，避免在已滿載時仍假設無限調節能力。 下垂係數的百分比是頻率相對變化與額定功率相對變化之比，若把赫茲直接除百分數會失去量綱一致性。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「調速下垂靜態尺度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Governor droop increases requested power as frequency falls, but the static slope is not instantaneous delivered response. Guide-vane speed, water hammer, inertia and protection shape the transient. Use dimensionless droop and frequency deviation to estimate an ideal increment, then check headroom rather than assuming unlimited response from a fully loaded machine. Droop relates relative frequency change to relative rated-power change; dividing raw hertz directly by a percentage loses the dimensional consistency of the normalized relation. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Governor droop static scale” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：f0=50 Hz; df=-0.25 Hz; R=0.05 (dimensionless); Prated=1000 MW; dP=-(df/f0)/R*Prated=100 MW。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: f0=50 Hz; df=-0.25 Hz; R=0.05 (dimensionless); Prated=1000 MW; dP=-(df/f0)/R*Prated=100 MW.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「下垂公式算出的增功率會瞬間全部到位」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"The power increment from the droop formula is delivered completely and instantaneously.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
