       "instruction": "對齊頻率、功率指令、導葉開度與電端出力，分別估計靜態增益及動態延遲。若指令增加但出力受限，應檢查餘裕和水力限制；若頻率量測有濾波延遲，不能把全部延遲歸因於機械執行器。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Align frequency, power request, guide-vane position and terminal output, separating static gain from dynamic delay. A rising request with limited output requires checking headroom and hydraulic constraints. Frequency-filter delay must not be attributed entirely to the mechanical actuator in the response diagnosis. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：設定兩種可用功率餘裕，將理想響應截限後比較，再畫出有執行器延遲的概念曲線，指出哪些測試才能辨識靜態與動態參數。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Set two headroom limits, clip the ideal response and compare them. Sketch a delayed actuator response and identify tests that distinguish static droop from the dynamic parameters of the hydraulic-machine system.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：直接提高調速增益可能與水力延遲形成振盪，靜態公式看似增強支援卻降低動態穩定；忽略功率上限則會高估事故期間可提供的頻率響應。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Increasing governor gain can interact with hydraulic delay and create oscillation, improving the static formula while degrading dynamic behavior. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
