         "textEn": "Align frequency, power request, guide-vane position and terminal output, separating static gain from dynamic delay. A rising request with limited output requires checking headroom and hydraulic constraints. Frequency-filter delay must not be attributed entirely to the mechanical actuator in the response diagnosis.",
