       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Governor droop static scale” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "直接提高調速增益可能與水力延遲形成振盪，靜態公式看似增強支援卻降低動態穩定；忽略功率上限則會高估事故期間可提供的頻率響應。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Increasing governor gain can interact with hydraulic delay and create oscillation, improving the static formula while degrading dynamic behavior. Ignoring the power ceiling also overstates the frequency response available during a disturbance in the interconnected system. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
