       "objective": "說明「高頻訊號混疊」如何影響白鶴灘水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “High frequency signal aliasing” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Baihetan Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "大型機組監測若取樣頻率不足，高頻壓力或振動會折返到較低頻段，形成不存在的故障特徵。取樣理論需與類比防混疊濾波共同考慮，單純增加資料點顯示密度不會恢復已遺失資訊。教材計算一個折返頻率，再要求用原始取樣與濾波規格驗證。 取樣前的類比濾波與取樣後數位濾波作用不同，前者防止折返進入資料，後者只能處理已記錄頻帶。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「高頻訊號混疊」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Insufficient sampling folds high-frequency pressure or vibration into lower bands and creates misleading fault signatures. Sampling must be considered with analog anti-alias filtering; plotting more interpolated points cannot restore lost information. Calculate one alias frequency and verify it against the original acquisition and filtering specifications before diagnosing machinery. Analog filtering before sampling and digital filtering afterward serve different roles: the former prevents folding, while the latter only processes frequencies already represented in the record. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “High frequency signal aliasing” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：ftrue=360 Hz; fs=500 Hz; falias=abs(ftrue-fs)=140 Hz。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: ftrue=360 Hz; fs=500 Hz; falias=abs(ftrue-fs)=140 Hz.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「取樣後插值增加點數就能消除混疊」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Adding interpolated points after sampling eliminates aliasing.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「高頻訊號混疊」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “High frequency signal aliasing”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
