       "instructionEn": "Check original sampling rate, analog cutoff and sensor bandwidth, then repeat the operating point at a higher rate. A low-frequency peak moving with sample rate supports aliasing rather than a mechanical mode; a stable physical frequency still needs speed and phase evidence for interpretation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：對兩個取樣率計算同一真實頻率的顯示位置，畫出頻譜折返，再提出類比濾波與取樣設定，說明為何僅改圖表解析度無效。",
