       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “High frequency signal aliasing” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "軟體後處理低通無法移除已折返而混入有效頻帶的訊號，插值也不會創造新資訊；若據此調整機組，可能處理根本不存在的低頻激振。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A digital low-pass applied afterward cannot remove a folded signal already overlapping the useful band, and interpolation creates no new information. Acting on such a spectrum can lead to attempts to fix a low-frequency excitation that does not physically exist. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：取樣前的類比濾波與取樣後數位濾波作用不同，前者防止折返進入資料，後者只能處理已記錄頻帶。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Analog filtering before sampling and digital filtering afterward serve different roles: the former prevents folding, while the latter only processes frequencies already represented in the record.",
