       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：Qa=90 m3/s; Qw=510 m3/s; beta=Qa/(Qa+Qw)=0.15。模型邊界：氣水流量在同一壓力溫度截面，表觀流量分率而非局部空隙率。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Qa=90 m3/s; Qw=510 m3/s; beta=Qa/(Qa+Qw)=0.15. Model boundary: gas and water rates at the same pressure-temperature section; superficial flow fraction rather than local void fraction. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
