       "instructionEn": "Check standard-state conversion of the air meter and measure depth-dependent air content with floor pressure. Normal total supply with inadequate near-wall air calls for examining slip and redistribution rather than declaring protection sufficient from one reading in the air-supply pipe. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將空氣流量換成另一壓力狀態後重算分率，再設計兩個相同平均含氣量但近壁分布不同的剖面，指出需要哪種量測區分。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Convert air flow to another pressure condition and recalculate the fraction. Construct profiles with equal mean air content but different near-wall distributions and identify the measurements needed to distinguish them.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：氣管壓力升高會壓縮空氣而改變體積流率，若不換算就會錯估分率；水氣相對速度不同又可能使高平均含氣量與低近壁含氣量同時存在。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
