       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Aeration volume fraction” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "氣管壓力升高會壓縮空氣而改變體積流率，若不換算就會錯估分率；水氣相對速度不同又可能使高平均含氣量與低近壁含氣量同時存在。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Increasing air-line pressure compresses gas and changes volume rate, distorting the fraction if no conversion is made. Different phase velocities can also allow high average air content to coexist with inadequate air close to the solid boundary. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
