         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: lambdaL=40 (dimensionless); Qm=0.12 m3/s; Qp=Qm*lambdaL**2.5=1214.3146215 m3/s. Model boundary: length ratio is prototype divided by model with equal gravity and Froude discharge scaling.",
