         "textEn": "Verify geometric scale and sensor positions, then cross-check velocity, depth and discharge scaling. Compare aeration and surface behavior in different model sizes. Size-dependent results require identifying scale effects rather than treating more detailed photographs as inherently more accurate prototype predictions.",
         "sourceIds": [
