       "objective": "從症狀倒推「水工模型尺度律」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Hydraulic model scaling law” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "小模型表面張力及黏性可能相對放大，含氣與小尺度破碎不再保持相似；直接把模型汽穴或侵蝕量按幾何比例放大，會超出福祿相似能支持的結論。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Surface tension and viscosity can be relatively stronger in a small model, preventing similarity of aeration and fine breakup. Scaling cavitation or erosion directly by geometry therefore exceeds what Froude similarity alone can support for the prototype. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：福祿尺度下時間比為長度比平方根，影像播放速度若未換算，會錯判原型水舌波動與閘門變動的時序。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Under Froude scaling, time ratio is the square root of length ratio; unconverted video speed can misrepresent prototype jet fluctuations and gate-motion timing.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「福祿相似會自動保證所有水力現象相似」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Froude similarity automatically preserves every hydraulic phenomenon.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
