       "objective": "說明「獨立量測加權估計」如何影響白鶴灘水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Independent measurement weighted estimate” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Baihetan Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "多種儀器觀察同一位移時，可在誤差獨立且無偏的條件下依變異倒數加權，但精度高不代表沒有共同基準偏差。教材比較兩筆不同不確定度的量測，說明權重反映可信度而非簡單平均。融合前須確認兩者觀察同一位置、方向與時間，不可把不同物理量硬合併。 權重由標準差平方的倒數取得，而非標準差本身的倒數；兩者混用會讓低精度資料取得過大影響。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「獨立量測加權估計」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Measurements of one displacement can be weighted by inverse variance when errors are independent and unbiased, but precision does not exclude shared reference bias. Two observations with different uncertainties illustrate why weighting differs from a simple mean. Confirm matching location, direction and time before combining them as estimates of the same physical quantity. Weights use inverse variance, not inverse standard deviation; confusing the two gives the less precise observation too much influence in the combined displacement estimate. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Independent measurement weighted estimate” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：x1=5 mm; s1=0.5 mm; x2=6 mm; s2=1 mm; xhat=(x1/s1**2+x2/s2**2)/(1/s1**2+1/s2**2)=5.2 mm。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: x1=5 mm; s1=0.5 mm; x2=6 mm; s2=1 mm; xhat=(x1/s1**2+x2/s2**2)/(1/s1**2+1/s2**2)=5.2 mm.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「加權平均一定能消除所有共同基準偏差」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Weighted averaging always removes every shared reference bias.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「獨立量測加權估計」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Independent measurement weighted estimate”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b208-v15-37-k1",
         "title": "獨立量測加權估計",
         "titleEn": "Independent measurement weighted estimate",
         "text": "多種儀器觀察同一位移時，可在誤差獨立且無偏的條件下依變異倒數加權，但精度高不代表沒有共同基準偏差。教材比較兩筆不同不確定度的量測，說明權重反映可信度而非簡單平均。",
         "textEn": "Measurements of one displacement can be weighted by inverse variance when errors are independent and unbiased, but precision does not exclude shared reference bias. Two observations with different uncertainties illustrate why weighting differs from a simple mean.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-baihetan-owner",
          "v15s-baihetan-construction",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
