        {
         "id": "b208-v15-37-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：加權平均一定能消除所有共同基準偏差 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Weighted averaging always removes every shared reference bias. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
