         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: x1=5 mm; s1=0.5 mm; x2=6 mm; s2=1 mm; xhat=(x1/s1**2+x2/s2**2)/(1/s1**2+1/s2**2)=5.2 mm. Model boundary: weighted mean for independent unbiased Gaussian observations, excluding shared drift.",
