        "b208-v15-38"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「獨立量測加權估計」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Independent measurement weighted estimate” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "查校準資料與量測基準是否共用，將兩儀器差值與時間、溫度作圖，再檢查權重是否穩定。若兩者一起偏移但差值不變，需要外部基準；加權平均無法從兩份共同錯誤中恢復真值。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check calibration and shared references, plot the instrument difference against time and temperature, and test weight stability. If both drift together while their difference remains constant, an external reference is required; weighted averaging cannot recover truth from two observations with the same bias. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：對兩筆量測同時加入相同偏差，重算融合值並比較差值是否改變，再提出可揭露共同漂移的第三種獨立觀測與基準設計。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Add the same bias to both observations, recompute the fused estimate and check whether their difference changes. Propose a third independent observation and reference arrangement capable of exposing the shared drift.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：過度相信精度標示會讓有偏的儀器取得過大權重，融合值看似平滑卻偏離真實位移；若兩儀器不同步，水位變化也可能偽裝成量測差異。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: An overtrusted precision specification gives a biased instrument excessive weight, producing a smooth but wrong estimate. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b208-v15-39-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "查校準資料與量測基準是否共用，將兩儀器差值與時間、溫度作圖，再檢查權重是否穩定。若兩者一起偏移但差值不變，需要外部基準；加權平均無法從兩份共同錯誤中恢復真值。",
         "textEn": "Check calibration and shared references, plot the instrument difference against time and temperature, and test weight stability. If both drift together while their difference remains constant, an external reference is required; weighted averaging cannot recover truth from two observations with the same bias.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-baihetan-owner",
          "v15s-baihetan-construction",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b208-v15-39-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "對兩筆量測同時加入相同偏差，重算融合值並比較差值是否改變，再提出可揭露共同漂移的第三種獨立觀測與基準設計。",
         "textEn": "Add the same bias to both observations, recompute the fused estimate and check whether their difference changes. Propose a third independent observation and reference arrangement capable of exposing the shared drift.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-baihetan-owner",
          "v15s-baihetan-construction",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
