       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b208-v15-39"
       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「獨立量測加權估計」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Independent measurement weighted estimate” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "過度相信精度標示會讓有偏的儀器取得過大權重，融合值看似平滑卻偏離真實位移；若兩儀器不同步，水位變化也可能偽裝成量測差異。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "An overtrusted precision specification gives a biased instrument excessive weight, producing a smooth but wrong estimate. Unsynchronized observations can also turn a genuine reservoir-response change into an apparent disagreement between instruments observing the structure. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：權重由標準差平方的倒數取得，而非標準差本身的倒數；兩者混用會讓低精度資料取得過大影響。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Weights use inverse variance, not inverse standard deviation; confusing the two gives the less precise observation too much influence in the combined displacement estimate.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「加權平均一定能消除所有共同基準偏差」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Weighted averaging always removes every shared reference bias.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b208-v15-40-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "過度相信精度標示會讓有偏的儀器取得過大權重，融合值看似平滑卻偏離真實位移；若兩儀器不同步，水位變化也可能偽裝成量測差異。",
         "textEn": "An overtrusted precision specification gives a biased instrument excessive weight, producing a smooth but wrong estimate. Unsynchronized observations can also turn a genuine reservoir-response change into an apparent disagreement between instruments observing the structure.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-baihetan-owner",
          "v15s-baihetan-construction",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b208-v15-40-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-baihetan-owner",
          "v15s-baihetan-construction",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        }
