       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Apparent capacity and reactive power” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：S=800 MVA; P=640 MW; Qreactive=(S*S-P*P)**0.5=480 Mvar。模型邊界：平衡正弦條件的功率三角形，未區分超前滯後無功符號。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: S=800 MVA; P=640 MW; Qreactive=(S*S-P*P)**0.5=480 Mvar. Model boundary: power triangle under balanced sinusoidal conditions, without assigning leading or lagging reactive sign. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：核對功率表的無功正負定義與三相電流，再把實功無功工作點放到設備能力圖上。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Check the meter reactive-sign convention and phase currents, then place active-reactive operating points on the machine capability diagram.",
