        "answer": 2,
        "explanation": "水輪發電機轉子儲存的旋轉動能可在短時間功率不平衡時交換，但不是可持續供電的水庫能量。 其餘選項是常見誤解。",
        "explanationEn": "Rotor kinetic energy can exchange during brief power imbalance but is not sustained reservoir generation. The other options are common misconceptions."
