       "objective": "以數值模型估算「轉子旋轉儲能」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。",
       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Rotor rotational stored energy” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：J=40000000 kg*m2; n=125 rpm; E=0.5*J*(2*pi*n/60)**2/1e9=3.426945973 GJ。模型邊界：剛性等效轉子且慣量固定，未計水柱動能與控制作用。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: J=40000000 kg*m2; n=125 rpm; E=0.5*J*(2*pi*n/60)**2/1e9=3.426945973 GJ. Model boundary: rigid equivalent rotor with fixed inertia, excluding water-column energy and controls. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：查慣量定義及是否包含水輪機與發電機全部旋轉件，將轉速變化與瞬時功率不平衡積分比較。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Check which rotating components the inertia includes and compare speed change with integrated instantaneous power imbalance.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
       "checkEn": "Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-06-k1",
         "title": "定量模型",
         "titleEn": "Quantitative model",
         "text": "原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：J=40000000 kg*m2; n=125 rpm; E=0.5*J*(2*pi*n/60)**2/1e9=3.426945973 GJ。模型邊界：剛性等效轉子且慣量固定，未計水柱動能與控制作用。",
         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: J=40000000 kg*m2; n=125 rpm; E=0.5*J*(2*pi*n/60)**2/1e9=3.426945973 GJ. Model boundary: rigid equivalent rotor with fixed inertia, excluding water-column energy and controls.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
