        "answer": 0,
        "explanation": "原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：J=40000000 kg*m2; n=125 rpm; E=0.5*J*(2*pi*n/60)**2/1e9=3.426945973 GJ。 重算時請保留單位。",
        "explanationEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: J=40000000 kg*m2; n=125 rpm; E=0.5*J*(2*pi*n/60)**2/1e9=3.426945973 GJ. Keep units when recalculating."
