      {
       "id": "b209-v15-07",
       "title": "轉子旋轉儲能：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Rotor rotational stored energy: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b209-v15-06"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「轉子旋轉儲能」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Rotor rotational stored energy” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "查慣量定義及是否包含水輪機與發電機全部旋轉件，將轉速變化與瞬時功率不平衡積分比較。若動能差不閉合，應查水力轉矩、控制延遲及損失，不任意調慣量使每次事件都符合。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check which rotating components the inertia includes and compare speed change with integrated instantaneous power imbalance. If kinetic-energy change does not close, investigate hydraulic torque, control delay and losses rather than retuning inertia separately to fit every event recorded by the system. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將轉速降低百分之一，計算可釋出的動能而非總動能，再除以假想功率缺口估算短時尺度，列出此估算忽略的控制作用。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Reduce speed by one percent and calculate released rather than total kinetic energy. Divide it by an assumed power deficit to estimate a short time scale and list the control actions omitted by that estimate.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把轉子總動能全當成可用支援，會忽略允許轉速範圍；柔性軸系還可能把能量分配到扭振模態，使平均轉速不足以描述局部動態。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Treating all rotor kinetic energy as available support ignores the permitted speed range. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-07-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "查慣量定義及是否包含水輪機與發電機全部旋轉件，將轉速變化與瞬時功率不平衡積分比較。若動能差不閉合，應查水力轉矩、控制延遲及損失，不任意調慣量使每次事件都符合。",
         "textEn": "Check which rotating components the inertia includes and compare speed change with integrated instantaneous power imbalance. If kinetic-energy change does not close, investigate hydraulic torque, control delay and losses rather than retuning inertia separately to fit every event recorded by the system.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-07-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "將轉速降低百分之一，計算可釋出的動能而非總動能，再除以假想功率缺口估算短時尺度，列出此估算忽略的控制作用。",
