         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: P1=1 MW; ratioN=1.10 (dimensionless); P2=P1*ratioN**3=1.331 MW. Model boundary: similar operating points with unchanged geometry, density and approximate efficiency, not arbitrary duct conditions.",
