       ],
       "objective": "說明「定子銅損邊界」如何影響溪洛渡水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Stator copper loss boundary” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Xiluodu Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "定子繞組的電阻損失與電流平方成正比，且電阻會隨溫度上升。教材以每相有效電阻與相電流計算三相損失，必須先辨認接法及所給電流定義。交流附加損失、鐵損與機械損失不在此式中，不能將三相銅損誤當成發電機全部損失。 每相有效電阻需和電流頻率及溫度相符，直流電阻只提供部分基礎，不能自動涵蓋所有交流附加效應。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「定子銅損邊界」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Stator resistive loss scales with current squared and resistance increases with temperature. Calculate three-phase loss using effective per-phase resistance and phase current, first identifying winding connection and current definition. Additional AC, iron and mechanical losses remain outside this equation, so copper loss is not the entire generator loss account. Effective per-phase resistance must match temperature and frequency; a DC resistance measurement supplies only part of the basis and does not automatically include all AC effects. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Stator copper loss boundary” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：Iphase=24000 A; Rphase=0.0007 ohm; Pcu=3*Iphase*Iphase*Rphase/1e6=1.2096 MW。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Iphase=24000 A; Rphase=0.0007 ohm; Pcu=3*Iphase*Iphase*Rphase/1e6=1.2096 MW.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「三相銅損就是發電機全部能量損失」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Three-phase copper loss is the complete energy loss of the generator.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「定子銅損邊界」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Stator copper loss boundary”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-13-k1",
         "title": "定子銅損邊界",
         "titleEn": "Stator copper loss boundary",
         "text": "定子繞組的電阻損失與電流平方成正比，且電阻會隨溫度上升。教材以每相有效電阻與相電流計算三相損失，必須先辨認接法及所給電流定義。",
         "textEn": "Stator resistive loss scales with current squared and resistance increases with temperature. Calculate three-phase loss using effective per-phase resistance and phase current, first identifying winding connection and current definition.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
