         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：三相銅損就是發電機全部能量損失 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Three-phase copper loss is the complete energy loss of the generator. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
