         "title": "定量模型",
         "titleEn": "Quantitative model",
         "text": "原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：Iphase=24000 A; Rphase=0.0007 ohm; Pcu=3*Iphase*Iphase*Rphase/1e6=1.2096 MW。模型邊界：三相相同相電流與每相運轉溫度電阻，未含其他損失。",
         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: Iphase=24000 A; Rphase=0.0007 ohm; Pcu=3*Iphase*Iphase*Rphase/1e6=1.2096 MW. Model boundary: equal phase currents and per-phase resistance at operating temperature, excluding other losses.",
         "sourceIds": [
