       "objective": "從症狀倒推「定子銅損邊界」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Stator copper loss boundary” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "用冷態電阻計算熱態損失會偏低，將線電流直接套到不相容接法也會造成比例錯誤；局部接頭高電阻可能集中發熱，平均每相值不能排除熱點。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Cold resistance understates hot-state loss, and using line current with an incompatible winding connection creates another ratio error. A high-resistance local joint can concentrate heat even when the mean per-phase value appears reasonable for the winding as a whole. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：每相有效電阻需和電流頻率及溫度相符，直流電阻只提供部分基礎，不能自動涵蓋所有交流附加效應。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Effective per-phase resistance must match temperature and frequency; a DC resistance measurement supplies only part of the basis and does not automatically include all AC effects.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「三相銅損就是發電機全部能量損失」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Three-phase copper loss is the complete energy loss of the generator.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-16-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "用冷態電阻計算熱態損失會偏低，將線電流直接套到不相容接法也會造成比例錯誤；局部接頭高電阻可能集中發熱，平均每相值不能排除熱點。",
         "textEn": "Cold resistance understates hot-state loss, and using line current with an incompatible winding connection creates another ratio error. A high-resistance local joint can concentrate heat even when the mean per-phase value appears reasonable for the winding as a whole.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-16-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        }
