         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：油槽平均溫度正常就保證軸瓦沒有熱點 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Normal average oil-tank temperature guarantees no bearing hotspot. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
