      {
       "id": "b209-v15-19",
       "title": "軸承油熱容量：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Bearing oil thermal storage: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b209-v15-18"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「軸承油熱容量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Bearing oil thermal storage” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以進出口油溫、槽內多點溫度與流量檢查混合假設，將負載變化與冷卻器狀態對齊。若槽溫反應慢而軸瓦溫度迅速上升，應查局部供油與接觸熱點，不能用油槽平均溫度證明潤滑正常。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Use inlet-outlet and multiple tank temperatures with flow to test mixing, aligning load changes and cooler state. Rapid bearing-metal heating despite a slowly changing tank temperature calls for local supply and contact checks rather than declaring lubrication normal from the tank average. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：在相同熱輸入下比較兩種油量的初期升溫速率，再加入金屬熱容量，說明需哪些溫度測點才能區分儲熱與散熱不足。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Compare initial heating rates for two oil inventories under equal heat input, then add metal heat capacity. Identify temperature measurements that distinguish thermal storage from inadequate heat removal in the system.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：油槽分層或旁通會使單點溫度低估高溫油區，油量不足又會縮短熱緩衝時間；如果只按穩態溫差分析，就可能漏掉短時供油中斷。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Stratification or bypass can make one tank sensor understate a hot region, while low oil inventory reduces thermal buffering time. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-19-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "以進出口油溫、槽內多點溫度與流量檢查混合假設，將負載變化與冷卻器狀態對齊。若槽溫反應慢而軸瓦溫度迅速上升，應查局部供油與接觸熱點，不能用油槽平均溫度證明潤滑正常。",
         "textEn": "Use inlet-outlet and multiple tank temperatures with flow to test mixing, aligning load changes and cooler state. Rapid bearing-metal heating despite a slowly changing tank temperature calls for local supply and contact checks rather than declaring lubrication normal from the tank average.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-19-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "在相同熱輸入下比較兩種油量的初期升溫速率，再加入金屬熱容量，說明需哪些溫度測點才能區分儲熱與散熱不足。",
         "textEn": "Compare initial heating rates for two oil inventories under equal heat input, then add metal heat capacity. Identify temperature measurements that distinguish thermal storage from inadequate heat removal in the system.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        }
