       "quiz": {
        "question": "要驗證「軸承油熱容量」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？",
        "questionEn": "Which approach best verifies \"Bearing oil thermal storage\"?",
        "options": [
         "允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。",
         "以進出口油溫、槽內多點溫度與流量檢查混合假設，將負載變化與冷卻器狀態對齊。",
         "轉子全部動能都可在不改變轉速下輸出"
        ],
        "optionsEn": [
         "Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.",
         "Use inlet-outlet and multiple tank temperatures with flow to test mixing, aligning load changes and cooler state.",
         "All rotor kinetic energy can be delivered without changing rotational speed."
        ],
        "answer": 1,
        "explanation": "以進出口油溫、槽內多點溫度與流量檢查混合假設，將負載變化與冷卻器狀態對齊。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。",
        "explanationEn": "Use inlet-outlet and multiple tank temperatures with flow to test mixing, aligning load changes and cooler state. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."
       },
       "unit": 5,
       "unitFacet": "verification"
