       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b209-v15-19"
       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「軸承油熱容量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Bearing oil thermal storage” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "油槽分層或旁通會使單點溫度低估高溫油區，油量不足又會縮短熱緩衝時間；如果只按穩態溫差分析，就可能漏掉短時供油中斷。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Stratification or bypass can make one tank sensor understate a hot region, while low oil inventory reduces thermal buffering time. A steady-state temperature difference alone may therefore miss a brief interruption of supply to the bearing. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：熱容量只改變升溫時間尺度，長時間穩態仍需足夠散熱能力，增加油量不能永久抵消持續熱負荷。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Heat capacity changes the heating time scale, while long-term steady operation still needs adequate heat removal; adding oil cannot indefinitely offset a continuous thermal load.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「油槽平均溫度正常就保證軸瓦沒有熱點」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Normal average oil-tank temperature guarantees no bearing hotspot.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-20-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "油槽分層或旁通會使單點溫度低估高溫油區，油量不足又會縮短熱緩衝時間；如果只按穩態溫差分析，就可能漏掉短時供油中斷。",
         "textEn": "Stratification or bypass can make one tank sensor understate a hot region, while low oil inventory reduces thermal buffering time. A steady-state temperature difference alone may therefore miss a brief interruption of supply to the bearing.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-20-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "在「軸承油熱容量」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？",
        "questionEn": "When \"Bearing oil thermal storage\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?",
        "options": [
         "症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。",
         "谷幅縮短必定由左右岸平均分擔",
         "油槽分層或旁通會使單點溫度低估高溫油區，油量不足又會縮短熱緩衝時間；如果只按穩態溫差分析，就可能漏掉短時供油中斷。"
        ],
        "optionsEn": [
