        "answer": 2,
        "explanation": "油槽分層或旁通會使單點溫度低估高溫油區，油量不足又會縮短熱緩衝時間；如果只按穩態溫差分析，就可能漏掉短時供油中斷。 需以量測區分可能原因。",
        "explanationEn": "Stratification or bypass can make one tank sensor understate a hot region, while low oil inventory reduces thermal buffering time. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."
