      {
       "id": "b209-v15-21",
       "title": "谷幅變形基準：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Valley closure reference geometry: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b209-v15-20"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「谷幅變形基準」如何影響溪洛渡水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Valley closure reference geometry” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Xiluodu Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "蓄水後兩岸變形會改變谷幅，但距離縮短可能來自一岸、兩岸或測量基準移動。教材把兩點間距變化除初始距離表示平均幾何應變尺度，不把它當成岩體各處的局部應變。需保留左右岸絕對位移與方向，才能把谷幅反應連結到拱座相容條件。 兩點距離只提供沿連線方向的投影，垂直於連線的共同位移可能幾乎看不到，需要完整三維控制網。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「谷幅變形基準」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Reservoir filling can change valley width through movement of either bank, both banks or the measurement reference. Distance change divided by initial separation gives a mean geometric strain scale, not local strain everywhere in the rock. Absolute movement and direction on each side are needed to connect closure to abutment compatibility. Two-point distance supplies a projection along the line; shared movement perpendicular to it can remain almost invisible, requiring a complete three-dimensional control network. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Valley closure reference geometry” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：closure=0.012 m; width=500 m; e=closure/width*1e6=24 microstrain。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: closure=0.012 m; width=500 m; e=closure/width*1e6=24 microstrain.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「谷幅縮短必定由左右岸平均分擔」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Valley closure is always shared equally by the two banks.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「谷幅變形基準」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Valley closure reference geometry”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-21-k1",
         "title": "谷幅變形基準",
         "titleEn": "Valley closure reference geometry",
         "text": "蓄水後兩岸變形會改變谷幅，但距離縮短可能來自一岸、兩岸或測量基準移動。教材把兩點間距變化除初始距離表示平均幾何應變尺度，不把它當成岩體各處的局部應變。",
         "textEn": "Reservoir filling can change valley width through movement of either bank, both banks or the measurement reference. Distance change divided by initial separation gives a mean geometric strain scale, not local strain everywhere in the rock.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-21-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：谷幅縮短必定由左右岸平均分擔 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Valley closure is always shared equally by the two banks. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        }
