       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Valley closure reference geometry” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以外部穩定控制網分別追蹤兩岸點位，校正大氣折射與距離儀溫度，再比對庫水位及地下水變化。若谷幅縮短但單側位移占多數，模型應保留不對稱，不把一半變形平均分配給兩岸。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Track both banks against an external stable network, correcting atmospheric refraction and instrument temperature, then compare reservoir and groundwater changes. Closure dominated by one bank requires an asymmetric model rather than allocating half the measured distance change to each side by assumption. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：製作相同谷幅變化但左右岸位移分配不同的兩個情境，畫位移向量，說明對拱座相容的影響，以及需哪些外部控制點才能辨識。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Create two cases with equal closure but different bank displacement shares. Draw their vectors, explain effects on abutment compatibility and identify external controls needed to distinguish the cases.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：共同基準位移可能不改變谷幅卻改變整體位置，單純距離量測因而漏掉剛體運動；大氣折射的季節變化也可能偽裝成與庫水位相關的地形變形。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Shared reference motion can change absolute position without changing width, so distance alone misses rigid-body movement. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
