       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Valley closure reference geometry” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "共同基準位移可能不改變谷幅卻改變整體位置，單純距離量測因而漏掉剛體運動；大氣折射的季節變化也可能偽裝成與庫水位相關的地形變形。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Shared reference motion can change absolute position without changing width, so distance alone misses rigid-body movement. Seasonal atmospheric refraction can also imitate terrain deformation correlated with reservoir level unless corrected through an independent control and observation strategy. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
