       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「裂隙開度與滲流」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Fracture aperture and flow” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "在受控壓差下量測流量與溫度以修正黏度，重複升降壓檢查開度是否隨壓力改變。若流量與壓差非線性，應先辨識變形或流況，不直接以三次方律推算裂縫已增加多少。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure flow and temperature under controlled pressure difference to account for viscosity, repeating pressure increase and decrease to test aperture stability. Nonlinearity requires investigating deformation or flow regime before using the cubic law to claim a particular increase in physical crack opening. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將開度提高兩成重算流量，再只降低黏度作比較，展示兩種增流原因，並設計能區分幾何變化與流體性質變化的量測組合。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Increase aperture by twenty percent and recompute flow, then compare a change in viscosity alone. Show the two causes of increased discharge and design measurements that distinguish geometry from fluid-property changes.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：接觸點閉合與局部堵塞會使有效水力開度不同於量得的平均幾何開度；若溫度變化降低黏度，流量也會增加，不能把所有增流都認定為裂隙擴張。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Contact closure and local blockage make hydraulic aperture differ from mean geometric aperture. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-27-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "在受控壓差下量測流量與溫度以修正黏度，重複升降壓檢查開度是否隨壓力改變。若流量與壓差非線性，應先辨識變形或流況，不直接以三次方律推算裂縫已增加多少。",
         "textEn": "Measure flow and temperature under controlled pressure difference to account for viscosity, repeating pressure increase and decrease to test aperture stability. Nonlinearity requires investigating deformation or flow regime before using the cubic law to claim a particular increase in physical crack opening.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-27-k2",
