         "text": "將開度提高兩成重算流量，再只降低黏度作比較，展示兩種增流原因，並設計能區分幾何變化與流體性質變化的量測組合。",
         "textEn": "Increase aperture by twenty percent and recompute flow, then compare a change in viscosity alone. Show the two causes of increased discharge and design measurements that distinguish geometry from fluid-property changes.",
