         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: K=2.5 (dimensionless); rho=1.2 kg/m3; v=12 m/s; dp=K*0.5*rho*v*v=216 Pa. Model boundary: steady approximately incompressible air with a specified reference-section velocity, excluding distributed friction.",
