       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「通風局部阻力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Ventilation local resistance” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "在構件前後設壓力測點，避開強烈旋流區並量測截面速度分布，再核對所用係數的參考面積。若多個支路同時調整，須重算風網，不能把一支路壓損直接當整個風機所需壓升。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure pressure before and after the fitting away from strong swirl, map section velocity and verify the coefficient reference area. Simultaneous branch changes require a network recalculation; one branch loss cannot simply be treated as the pressure rise required from the entire fan system. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：固定風道面積提高風量兩成，重算局部壓損，再加入一個並聯支路，說明為何分支流量必須由共同壓差及各自阻力一起求解。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Increase flow by twenty percent at fixed duct area and recalculate local loss. Add a parallel branch and explain why branch flows must be solved from the shared pressure difference and their individual resistances.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：格柵堵塞或風門位置偏差會改變係數，舊調試值未必適用；若壓力測點位於回流區，也可能產生非代表讀值，導致錯判風機能力不足。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A blocked screen or changed damper position alters the coefficient and can invalidate commissioning values. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-31-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "在構件前後設壓力測點，避開強烈旋流區並量測截面速度分布，再核對所用係數的參考面積。若多個支路同時調整，須重算風網，不能把一支路壓損直接當整個風機所需壓升。",
         "textEn": "Measure pressure before and after the fitting away from strong swirl, map section velocity and verify the coefficient reference area. Simultaneous branch changes require a network recalculation; one branch loss cannot simply be treated as the pressure rise required from the entire fan system.",
         "sourceIds": [
