         "text": "固定風道面積提高風量兩成，重算局部壓損，再加入一個並聯支路，說明為何分支流量必須由共同壓差及各自阻力一起求解。",
         "textEn": "Increase flow by twenty percent at fixed duct area and recalculate local loss. Add a parallel branch and explain why branch flows must be solved from the shared pressure difference and their individual resistances.",
