       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「通風局部阻力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Ventilation local resistance” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "格柵堵塞或風門位置偏差會改變係數，舊調試值未必適用；若壓力測點位於回流區，也可能產生非代表讀值，導致錯判風機能力不足。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A blocked screen or changed damper position alters the coefficient and can invalidate commissioning values. A tap inside a recirculation zone can also give an unrepresentative reading and falsely suggest inadequate fan capability in the ventilation network. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：阻力係數使用的參考速度可能位於不同斷面，串接多構件時應換成一致能量帳，不能直接加不相容的係數。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Loss coefficients may use velocities at different sections; connecting several fittings requires a consistent energy account rather than directly adding coefficients with incompatible reference velocities.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「單一構件壓損就是整座風機所需壓升」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The loss across one fitting equals the pressure rise required for the whole fan system.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-32-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "格柵堵塞或風門位置偏差會改變係數，舊調試值未必適用；若壓力測點位於回流區，也可能產生非代表讀值，導致錯判風機能力不足。",
         "textEn": "A blocked screen or changed damper position alters the coefficient and can invalidate commissioning values. A tap inside a recirculation zone can also give an unrepresentative reading and falsely suggest inadequate fan capability in the ventilation network.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-32-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
