    {
     "id": "b209-v15-s5",
     "title": "耐久、維護與工程交接",
     "titleEn": "Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「梯級重複用水發電」與「增流邊際功率」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Cascade reuse of release water\" and \"Marginal power from added flow\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b209-v15-33",
       "title": "梯級重複用水發電：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Cascade reuse of release water: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
