       ],
       "objective": "以數值模型估算「梯級重複用水發電」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。",
       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Cascade reuse of release water” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; Q=500 m3/s; H1=90 m; eta1=0.91 (dimensionless); H2=70 m; eta2=0.90 (dimensionless); P=rho*g*Q*(H1*eta1+H2*eta2)/1e6=710.7345 MW。模型邊界：相同穩態流量與不重疊淨水頭，忽略中間取水及儲量變化。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; Q=500 m3/s; H1=90 m; eta1=0.91 (dimensionless); H2=70 m; eta2=0.90 (dimensionless); P=rho*g*Q*(H1*eta1+H2*eta2)/1e6=710.7345 MW. Model boundary: equal steady flow through nonoverlapping net heads, omitting intermediate withdrawals and storage changes. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：以河段高程圖標明兩段淨水頭及尾水控制，再核對上下游流量時間對齊與中間儲量。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Mark both net heads and tailwater controls on an elevation profile and reconcile flow timing and intermediate storage.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
       "checkEn": "Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-34-k1",
         "title": "定量模型",
         "titleEn": "Quantitative model",
         "text": "原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; Q=500 m3/s; H1=90 m; eta1=0.91 (dimensionless); H2=70 m; eta2=0.90 (dimensionless); P=rho*g*Q*(H1*eta1+H2*eta2)/1e6=710.7345 MW。模型邊界：相同穩態流量與不重疊淨水頭，忽略中間取水及儲量變化。",
         "textEn": "Original hypothetical example; inputs are not operating parameters of this project: rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; Q=500 m3/s; H1=90 m; eta1=0.91 (dimensionless); H2=70 m; eta2=0.90 (dimensionless); P=rho*g*Q*(H1*eta1+H2*eta2)/1e6=710.7345 MW. Model boundary: equal steady flow through nonoverlapping net heads, omitting intermediate withdrawals and storage changes.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-34-k2",
         "title": "模型邊界",
         "titleEn": "Model boundary",
         "text": "本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。",
         "textEn": "These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.",
         "sourceIds": [
