       "quiz": {
        "question": "依「梯級重複用水發電」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？",
        "questionEn": "According to the quantitative model for \"Cascade reuse of release water\", which statement holds?",
        "options": [
         "轉子全部動能都可在不改變轉速下輸出",
         "原創假想算例，輸入均非本工程操作參數：rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; Q=500 m3/s; H1=90 m; eta1=0.91 (dimensionless); H2=70 m; eta2=0.90 (dimensionless); P=rho*g*Q*(H1*eta1+H2*eta2)/1e6=710.7345 MW。",
         "三相銅損就是發電機全部能量損失"
