      {
       "id": "b209-v15-35",
       "title": "梯級重複用水發電：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Cascade reuse of release water: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-instruments"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b209-v15-34"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「梯級重複用水發電」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Cascade reuse of release water” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以河段高程圖標明兩段淨水頭及尾水控制，再核對上下游流量時間對齊與中間儲量。若同時流量不同，先做河段水量帳與傳播分析，不把差值直接列為漏水或發電效率損失。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Mark both net heads and tailwater controls on an elevation profile and reconcile flow timing and intermediate storage. Different simultaneous discharges require reach water accounting and routing before the difference is labeled leakage or a generating-efficiency loss between the two plants. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將總落差固定而改變兩站分配及效率，計算總功率差，再加入一段中間取水，說明何時相同流量假設失效及應如何修正。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Hold total drop fixed while changing its allocation and the two efficiencies, then calculate total power. Introduce an intermediate withdrawal and explain when the equal-flow assumption fails and how the account must change.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：將上游總落差再次列入下游水頭會重複計算位能，忽略流量延遲又會使逐時能量帳不閉合；兩者可能在月平均下被掩蓋，需保留分段基準。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Including the upstream drop again in downstream head double-counts potential energy. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-35-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "以河段高程圖標明兩段淨水頭及尾水控制，再核對上下游流量時間對齊與中間儲量。若同時流量不同，先做河段水量帳與傳播分析，不把差值直接列為漏水或發電效率損失。",
         "textEn": "Mark both net heads and tailwater controls on an elevation profile and reconcile flow timing and intermediate storage. Different simultaneous discharges require reach water accounting and routing before the difference is labeled leakage or a generating-efficiency loss between the two plants.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b209-v15-35-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "將總落差固定而改變兩站分配及效率，計算總功率差，再加入一段中間取水，說明何時相同流量假設失效及應如何修正。",
         "textEn": "Hold total drop fixed while changing its allocation and the two efficiencies, then calculate total power. Introduce an intermediate withdrawal and explain when the equal-flow assumption fails and how the account must change.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-xiluodu-voith",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-instruments"
         ]
        }
