        "answer": 2,
        "explanation": "以河段高程圖標明兩段淨水頭及尾水控制，再核對上下游流量時間對齊與中間儲量。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。",
        "explanationEn": "Mark both net heads and tailwater controls on an elevation profile and reconcile flow timing and intermediate storage. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."
