       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「增流邊際功率」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Marginal power from added flow” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以小幅流量增量重算原功率式，用有限差分檢查導數，再以量測曲線驗證損失係數在該區間是否近似固定。若大增量與局部預測不同，應縮小區間或更新模型，不把導數當成全域線性關係。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Recompute the original power equation with a small flow increment and compare its finite difference with the derivative. Verify approximately constant loss coefficient over that interval. A large-increment disagreement calls for a smaller interval or revised model rather than treating a local derivative as a global linear law. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以一個很小及一個較大流量增量比較有限差分與導數，畫出誤差隨步長變化，再加入效率下降情境指出原導數缺少的項目。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Compare finite differences using a small and a larger flow increment with the derivative, plot error against step size, and introduce declining efficiency to identify the additional derivative term missing from the original model.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：忽略損失導數會高估增流收益，效率若在高流量區下降則偏差更大；把局部最大功率當成允許運轉點，也可能越過汽蝕、振動或電氣限制。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Ignoring the derivative of head loss overstates added-flow benefit, especially if efficiency falls at higher discharge. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
