   "workedExample": {
    "title": "原創假想算例與邊界",
    "titleEn": "Original hypothetical example and boundaries",
    "text": "整合算例輸入全為教學假設，先檢查跨季庫容水量帳：InitialStorage=8 km3; seasonalInflow=5 km3; releases=4 km3; netLoss=0.6 km3; finalStorage=8+5-4-0.6=8.4 km3；再獨立檢查大湖蒸發與面積：HypotheticalArea=500 km2; evaporationDepth=1.8 m/year; lossVolume=500e6*1.8/1e9=0.90 km3/year。敏感度：同面積500km2下年蒸發深度由1.8增至2.1m，水量損失由0.90增至1.05km3，增加0.15km3；實際湖面積會隨水位變化，故需逐時或逐月積分。 兩個結果須按各自量綱解釋，不能直接相加或當成完整設計。公開工程事實與假想算例分開；下列尺寸水量及材料參數均不是阿斯旺設計或操作資料。 將核對水庫出口用水端與回歸水的同時水量帳作為獨立驗證，明確列出尚缺的現地輸入及其對結論的影響。",
    "textEn": "Every input in this integrated example is a teaching assumption. First examine Seasonal reservoir water balance: InitialStorage=8 km3; seasonalInflow=5 km3; releases=4 km3; netLoss=0.6 km3; finalStorage=8+5-4-0.6=8.4 km3. Independently examine Lake evaporation and surface area: HypotheticalArea=500 km2; evaporationDepth=1.8 m/year; lossVolume=500e6*1.8/1e9=0.90 km3/year. Sensitivity: over a fixed500km2 surface, annual evaporation increasing from1.8 to2.1m changes loss from0.90 to1.05km3, an increase of0.15km3. Real surface area varies with stage and requires time integration. Interpret each result in its own dimensions rather than adding them or treating them as a complete design. Public project facts are separate from hypothetical calculations; dimensions flows and material parameters below are not Aswan design or operating data. Use the following independent check: Reconcile simultaneous volumes at release, delivery and return-flow boundaries. Identify missing field inputs and state which conclusions depend on them.",
    "assumptions": "數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。",
    "assumptionsEn": "Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.",
    "sourceScope": "原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。",
    "sourceScopeEn": "Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."
   },
