     "教學假設：大湖蒸發與面積；HypotheticalArea=500 km2; evaporationDepth=1.8 m/year; lossVolume=500e6*1.8/1e9=0.90 km3/year",
     "教學假設：防滲核心串聯阻力；Equal areaA=100 m2; deltaHead=40 m; layers L1=10 m,k1=1e-7 m/s; L2=20 m,k2=1e-5 m/s; Q=100*40/(10/1e-7+20/1e-5)=0.0000392157 m3/s",
