         "text": "以庫水位容量曲線交叉核對同期流量積分的庫存變化。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「把所有水量殘差當蒸發會掩蓋量測或漏列放流」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。",
         "textEn": "Cross-check integrated flows against storage change from the stage-capacity curve. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Assigning every residual to evaporation conceals measurement errors or omitted releases. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted.",
         "sourceIds": [
