         "textEn": "Assigning every residual to evaporation conceals measurement errors or omitted releases. Diagnose it by the following check: Cross-check integrated flows against storage change from the stage-capacity curve. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
