       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：Equal areaA=100 m2; deltaHead=40 m; layers L1=10 m,k1=1e-7 m/s; L2=20 m,k2=1e-5 m/s; Q=100*40/(10/1e-7+20/1e-5)=0.0000392157 m3/s。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: Equal areaA=100 m2; deltaHead=40 m; layers L1=10 m,k1=1e-7 m/s; L2=20 m,k2=1e-5 m/s; Q=100*40/(10/1e-7+20/1e-5)=0.0000392157 m3/s. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：以分層孔壓分配核對主要水頭損失是否位於低滲區。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Use layered piezometric heads to locate the dominant head loss.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
       "checkEn": "Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.",
