       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Use layered piezometric heads to locate the dominant head loss. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Contact bypass can avoid the low-permeability core that controls the ideal model. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
