       ],
       "objective": "說明「填築含水與乾密度」如何影響阿斯旺高壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Placement moisture and dry density” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Aswan High Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "土石壩填築品質需把含水量與乾密度連結，濕密度較高不一定代表骨架更密實，可能只是水較多。質量含水率的乾密度換算只核對試樣狀態，仍須依材料與試驗方法判定施工適用；層厚與壓實設備需共同驗證。 驗證時應將現地密度與同期含水樣品配對並核對分層位置，並辨識以下失效情境：濕土含水增加可能掩蓋乾密度不足。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「填築含水與乾密度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Placement quality requires both moisture and dry density. Higher wet density may reflect more water rather than a denser skeleton. Conversion using mass water content checks sample state only; material-specific testing, lift thickness and compaction equipment still determine whether placement is suitable. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Pair field density with simultaneous moisture samples and identify the placement lift. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Increasing water content can conceal inadequate dry density. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Placement moisture and dry density” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設：wetDensity=2100 kg/m3; waterMassContent=0.12; dryDensity=2100/(1+0.12)=1875 kg/m3。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: wetDensity=2100 kg/m3; waterMassContent=0.12; dryDensity=2100/(1+0.12)=1875 kg/m3.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「濕密度較高就必定代表壓實骨架更密」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Higher wet density always proves a denser compacted skeleton\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「填築含水與乾密度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Placement moisture and dry density”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
