       "instructionEn": "Pair field density with simultaneous moisture samples and identify the placement lift. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Increasing water content can conceal inadequate dry density. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
