    {
     "id": "b210-v15-s3",
     "title": "施工方法與施工階段控制",
     "titleEn": "Construction methods and stage control",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「核心沉陷與接觸」與「發電淨水頭與出力」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Core settlement and interfaces\" and \"Net head and power output\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b210-v15-17",
       "title": "核心沉陷與接觸：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Core settlement and interfaces: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "b-src-water-manuals",
        "v15s-mwri-aswan",
        "v15s-wapda-tarbela",
        "v15s-usbr-filters"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b210-v15-16"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「核心沉陷與接觸」如何影響阿斯旺高壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Core settlement and interfaces” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Aswan High Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "核心與壩殼的壓縮性差異會造成相對變形，剛性穿越構造附近尤其需要檢查接觸與反濾連續。相鄰沉陷差只能描述幾何需求，不能直接預測裂縫寬度；施工時序、材料非線性與三維約束會改變實際應變分布。 驗證時應比較跨土區沉陷測點與剛性構造接觸觀測，並辨識以下失效情境：差異沉陷集中於接觸面可能形成優先滲流路徑。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「核心沉陷與接觸」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Different compressibility in core and shell creates relative movement, especially near rigid penetrations. Settlement difference describes geometric demand but does not directly predict crack aperture. Construction sequence, nonlinear material response and three-dimensional restraint govern the actual strain distribution and filter continuity. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Compare settlement markers across zones with observations at rigid interfaces. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Concentrated differential settlement at an interface can create preferential seepage. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Core settlement and interfaces” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設：coreSettlement=0.32 m; shellSettlement=0.20 m; relativeSettlement=0.32-0.20=0.12 m。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: coreSettlement=0.32 m; shellSettlement=0.20 m; relativeSettlement=0.32-0.20=0.12 m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「相鄰沉陷差就必定等於核心裂縫寬度」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Settlement difference necessarily equals the width of a core crack\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「核心沉陷與接觸」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Core settlement and interfaces”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b210-v15-17-k1",
         "title": "核心沉陷與接觸",
         "titleEn": "Core settlement and interfaces",
         "text": "核心與壩殼的壓縮性差異會造成相對變形，剛性穿越構造附近尤其需要檢查接觸與反濾連續。相鄰沉陷差只能描述幾何需求，不能直接預測裂縫寬度；施工時序、材料非線性與三維約束會改變實際應變分布。",
         "textEn": "Different compressibility in core and shell creates relative movement, especially near rigid penetrations. Settlement difference describes geometric demand but does not directly predict crack aperture.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "b-src-water-manuals",
          "v15s-mwri-aswan",
          "v15s-wapda-tarbela",
          "v15s-usbr-filters"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b210-v15-17-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：相鄰沉陷差就必定等於核心裂縫寬度 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Settlement difference necessarily equals the width of a core crack Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "b-src-water-manuals",
          "v15s-mwri-aswan",
          "v15s-wapda-tarbela",
