       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Core settlement and interfaces” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "比較跨土區沉陷測點與剛性構造接觸觀測。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「差異沉陷集中於接觸面可能形成優先滲流路徑」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare settlement markers across zones with observations at rigid interfaces. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Concentrated differential settlement at an interface can create preferential seepage. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：交接時以比較跨土區沉陷測點與剛性構造接觸觀測作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對差異沉陷集中於接觸面可能形成優先滲流路徑，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Compare settlement markers across zones with observations at rigid interfaces. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Concentrated differential settlement at an interface can create preferential seepage. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：差異沉陷集中於接觸面可能形成優先滲流路徑。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
