       "objective": "說明「發電淨水頭與出力」如何影響阿斯旺高壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Net head and power output” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Aswan High Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "大型蓄水壩的發電能力由流量、淨水頭與效率共同控制，庫水位只是上游水頭的一部分。尾水上升與水路損失會降低淨落差，裝置容量也不等於任何時刻能達到的出力；應以一致工況的量測核對能量轉換。 驗證時應同步記錄上下游水位流量與機組功率並列水路損失，並辨識以下失效情境：只用壩高當發電水頭會高估可用能量。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「發電淨水頭與出力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Power depends on flow, net head and efficiency. Reservoir level is only one upstream contribution; tailwater and conveyance losses reduce usable head. Installed capacity is not guaranteed output at every stage, so compare energy conversion using measurements from the same operating condition. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Record upstream and downstream levels, flow and unit power and itemize waterway losses. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Using dam height as generating head overstates usable energy. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Net head and power output” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設：rho=1000 kg/m3; Q=180 m3/s; netHead=55 m; efficiency=0.90; power=1000*9.81*180*55*0.90/1e6=87.4071 MW。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: rho=1000 kg/m3; Q=180 m3/s; netHead=55 m; efficiency=0.90; power=1000*9.81*180*55*0.90/1e6=87.4071 MW.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「壩體高度就是所有水位下的機組淨水頭」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Dam height equals turbine net head at every reservoir level\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「發電淨水頭與出力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Net head and power output”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b210-v15-21-k1",
         "title": "發電淨水頭與出力",
