       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Sediment storage and dry density” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "忽略壓密會把容量變化誤讀成同量泥砂增減。診斷時應採取以下查核：以測深差與分層乾密度交叉核算沉積質量，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Ignoring consolidation confuses storage change with an equal change in sediment mass. Diagnose it by the following check: Cross-check bathymetric change and layered dry density against sediment mass. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
