       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「放流輸配與需水」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Release conveyance and demand” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "核對水庫出口用水端與回歸水的同時水量帳。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「把回歸水全當消耗會高估流域淨需水」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Reconcile simultaneous volumes at release, delivery and return-flow boundaries. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Treating all return water as consumption overstates basin net demand. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：交接時以核對水庫出口用水端與回歸水的同時水量帳作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對把回歸水全當消耗會高估流域淨需水，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Reconcile simultaneous volumes at release, delivery and return-flow boundaries. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Treating all return water as consumption overstates basin net demand. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把回歸水全當消耗會高估流域淨需水。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Treating all return water as consumption overstates basin net demand. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
