         "textEn": "Reconcile simultaneous volumes at release, delivery and return-flow boundaries. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Treating all return water as consumption overstates basin net demand. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted.",
