       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「枯水連續與備援」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Drought sequence and reserve” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "比較不同乾旱排列下的最低庫容並保留需求假設。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「只用平均入流會忽略連年不足的累積效應」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare minimum storage under different drought sequences and retain demand assumptions. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Mean inflow alone hides cumulative deficits over consecutive dry years. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：交接時以比較不同乾旱排列下的最低庫容並保留需求假設作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對只用平均入流會忽略連年不足的累積效應，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Compare minimum storage under different drought sequences and retain demand assumptions. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Mean inflow alone hides cumulative deficits over consecutive dry years. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：只用平均入流會忽略連年不足的累積效應。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
