         "textEn": "Extrapolation beyond historical stages can be mistaken for structural deterioration. Diagnose it by the following check: Compare independent instruments and manual surveys and check the baseline stage range. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
