    "title": "原創假想算例與邊界",
    "titleEn": "Original hypothetical example and boundaries",
    "text": "整合算例輸入全為教學假設，先檢查大體積填築物流：trucks=20; payload=18 m3; cyclesPerHour=2; productiveHours=8; looseVolume=20*18*2*8=5760 m3/day；再獨立檢查鋪蓋延伸與流路：k=0.0001 m/s; effectiveArea=2000 m2; headDifference=60 m; pathLength=400 m; Q=0.0001*2000*60/400=0.030 m3/s。敏感度：同滲透係數與面積下，示意水路長度由400增至600m，達西流量減至三分之二；鋪蓋延長的真實效果需二維或三維流網，不能用此比例直接估算實際壩基改善。 兩個結果須按各自量綱解釋，不能直接相加或當成完整設計。合成土石壩與水路模型不重現塔貝拉現況，實際地層、設備與調度須以業主資料另行建立。 將比較改接前後能量線與接頭壓力並核對實際構形作為獨立驗證，明確列出尚缺的現地輸入及其對結論的影響。",
    "textEn": "Every input in this integrated example is a teaching assumption. First examine Bulk placement logistics: trucks=20; payload=18 m3; cyclesPerHour=2; productiveHours=8; looseVolume=20*18*2*8=5760 m3/day. Independently examine Blanket extension and seepage paths: k=0.0001 m/s; effectiveArea=2000 m2; headDifference=60 m; pathLength=400 m; Q=0.0001*2000*60/400=0.030 m3/s. Sensitivity: at fixed conductivity and area, increasing an illustrative seepage path from400 to600m reduces Darcy flow to two-thirds. Real blanket extension requires a two- or three-dimensional flow model rather than direct use of this ratio. Interpret each result in its own dimensions rather than adding them or treating them as a complete design. Synthetic embankment and waterway models do not reconstruct Tarbela conditions; owner data must establish actual geology equipment and operations. Use the following independent check: Compare energy lines and joint pressures before and after connection and verify geometry. Identify missing field inputs and state which conclusions depend on them.",
    "assumptions": "數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。",
