       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Reconcile haul cycles with placement acceptance and distinguish loose from compacted volume. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Counting loose volume as completed compacted volume overstates progress. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
