       "objective": "說明「鋪蓋延伸與流路」如何影響塔貝拉水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Blanket extension and seepage paths” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tarbela Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "上游防滲鋪蓋可改變進入地基的水頭分布與流路長度，不能只看壩體核心而忽略深部地基。均質一維達西式只是方向性示意，鋪蓋邊緣、分層及局部穿透會產生二維效應；需以孔壓分布和分區流量檢驗。 驗證時應用鋪蓋前後及壩基孔壓剖面檢查實際水頭分配，並辨識以下失效情境：鋪蓋局部缺口可能形成短流路而削弱整體效果。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「鋪蓋延伸與流路」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "An upstream blanket changes foundation entry heads and seepage paths, making foundation control distinct from the core. A uniform one-dimensional Darcy calculation illustrates direction only. Blanket edges, layering and penetrations create two-dimensional effects that require piezometric and zoned-discharge validation. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Compare heads across the blanket and foundation to establish the actual distribution. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: A local blanket opening can create a short path that undermines overall performance. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Blanket extension and seepage paths” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設：k=0.0001 m/s; effectiveArea=2000 m2; headDifference=60 m; pathLength=400 m; Q=0.0001*2000*60/400=0.030 m3/s。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: k=0.0001 m/s; effectiveArea=2000 m2; headDifference=60 m; pathLength=400 m; Q=0.0001*2000*60/400=0.030 m3/s.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「鋪蓋越長就可不必檢查局部破損與邊緣效應」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A longer blanket removes the need to inspect defects and edge effects\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「鋪蓋延伸與流路」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Blanket extension and seepage paths”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b211-v15-05-k1",
         "title": "鋪蓋延伸與流路",
         "titleEn": "Blanket extension and seepage paths",
         "text": "上游防滲鋪蓋可改變進入地基的水頭分布與流路長度，不能只看壩體核心而忽略深部地基。均質一維達西式只是方向性示意，鋪蓋邊緣、分層及局部穿透會產生二維效應；需以孔壓分布和分區流量檢驗。",
         "textEn": "An upstream blanket changes foundation entry heads and seepage paths, making foundation control distinct from the core. A uniform one-dimensional Darcy calculation illustrates direction only.",
         "sourceIds": [
