       "objective": "說明「三角洲推進與測深」如何影響塔貝拉水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Delta advance and bathymetry” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tarbela Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "水庫泥砂三角洲推進會改變有效庫容與進水口周邊地形，前緣位移不等於沉積體積。用平均剖面積乘推進距離僅作稜柱近似，沿寬變化和壓密需另處理；應把斷面追蹤、粒徑與輸砂帳連結。 驗證時應沿多條測線追蹤前緣及斷面變化並核對沉積乾密度，並辨識以下失效情境：用單一中心線推進代表全庫寬會誤估沉積體積。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「三角洲推進與測深」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Delta advance changes storage and intake surroundings, but front movement alone is not deposit volume. Mean cross-sectional area times advance is a prism approximation that omits lateral changes and consolidation. Link repeated sections, grain-size observations and sediment budgets before interpreting long-term progression. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Track front and section changes along several transects and check deposit dry density. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Using one centerline advance for the full width misestimates deposit volume. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Delta advance and bathymetry” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設：MeanDepositionalCrossSection=2500 m2; frontAdvance=120 m; prismDepositVolume=2500*120=300000 m3。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: MeanDepositionalCrossSection=2500 m2; frontAdvance=120 m; prismDepositVolume=2500*120=300000 m3.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「三角洲前緣前進距離本身就是淤積體積」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Delta-front advance distance itself equals deposited volume\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「三角洲推進與測深」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Delta advance and bathymetry”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
