         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions: MeanDepositionalCrossSection=2500 m2; frontAdvance=120 m; prismDepositVolume=2500*120=300000 m3. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds.",
