         "titleEn": "Quantitative model",
         "text": "原創教學假設：IntakeLowerLipElevation=300 m; localSedimentElevation=292 m; verticalClearance=300-292=8 m。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。",
         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions: IntakeLowerLipElevation=300 m; localSedimentElevation=292 m; verticalClearance=300-292=8 m. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds.",
