         "textEn": "A distant mean bed level misses a local mound in front of the intake. Diagnose it by the following check: Resurvey the intake bed and compare sediment ingestion with local velocity. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
