         "text": "新增轉接損失會降低機組可用淨水頭。診斷時應採取以下查核：比較改接前後能量線與接頭壓力並核對實際構形，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。",
         "textEn": "Added connection losses reduce net head available to the generating unit. Diagnose it by the following check: Compare energy lines and joint pressures before and after connection and verify geometry. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
