         "textEn": "Counting outages or water-limited periods as full output overstates annual energy. Diagnose it by the following check: Compare metered energy with release volumes over the same generating window. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
