         "textEn": "Abutment softening can invalidate the assumed arch-force distribution. Diagnose it by the following check: Compare dam displacement and abutment geology with assumed arch load transfer. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
