      {
       "id": "b212-v15-05",
       "title": "水位荷載與非線性：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Reservoir load and nonlinear response: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "b-src-water-manuals",
        "v15s-zra-history",
        "v15s-zra-pool",
        "v15s-zra-gates",
        "v15s-worldbank-tarbela-audit"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b212-v15-04"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「水位荷載與非線性」如何影響卡里巴水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Reservoir load and nonlinear response” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Kariba Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "水位變化同時改變受壓高度與壓力大小，合力因此不與水深線性成長。用矩形投影估水平靜水力可說明尺度，拱壩實際位移還受溫度及接縫開合影響；監測比較必須分離水位與季節效應。 驗證時應以不同季節相同水位的位移資料比較可逆反應，並辨識以下失效情境：把溫度變形全歸因水位會錯估荷載敏感度。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「水位荷載與非線性」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Stage changes both loaded height and pressure, so resultant force does not grow linearly with depth. A projected rectangular surface illustrates horizontal loading, while actual arch displacement also depends on temperature and joint opening. Monitoring comparisons must separate stage and seasonal effects. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Compare displacement at the same stage in different seasons to identify reversible response. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Attributing all thermal movement to stage misstates load sensitivity. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Reservoir load and nonlinear response” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設：Unit projected width=1 m; waterDepth=80 m; horizontalForce=0.5*9.81*80**2=31392 kN per m width。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: Unit projected width=1 m; waterDepth=80 m; horizontalForce=0.5*9.81*80**2=31392 kN per m width.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「水深增加一成靜水合力也必定只增加一成」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A ten-percent depth increase always raises hydrostatic force only ten percent\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「水位荷載與非線性」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Reservoir load and nonlinear response”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b212-v15-05-k1",
         "title": "水位荷載與非線性",
         "titleEn": "Reservoir load and nonlinear response",
         "text": "水位變化同時改變受壓高度與壓力大小，合力因此不與水深線性成長。用矩形投影估水平靜水力可說明尺度，拱壩實際位移還受溫度及接縫開合影響；監測比較必須分離水位與季節效應。",
         "textEn": "Stage changes both loaded height and pressure, so resultant force does not grow linearly with depth. A projected rectangular surface illustrates horizontal loading, while actual arch displacement also depends on temperature and joint opening.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "b-src-water-manuals",
          "v15s-zra-history",
          "v15s-zra-pool",
          "v15s-zra-gates",
          "v15s-worldbank-tarbela-audit"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b212-v15-05-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：水深增加一成靜水合力也必定只增加一成 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: A ten-percent depth increase always raises hydrostatic force only ten percent Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "b-src-water-manuals",
          "v15s-zra-history",
