       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Record gate flows, levels and jet footprints together with bed pressures. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Equal total flow with different gate combinations can shift concentrated impact. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
