       "objective": "說明「水墊展寬與平均壓力」如何影響卡里巴水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Pool spreading and mean pressure” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Kariba Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "水墊整形希望改善射流擴散與下游出流，不能把增加體積直接解讀為所有壓力都按比例下降。平均合力除面積只是整體量級，局部脈壓與回流仍可能集中；需用多點同步壓力與流場驗證整形後的分布。 驗證時應比較整形前後同工況下的壓力分布及回流範圍，並辨識以下失效情境：只報平均壓力下降會掩蓋新形成的局部高壓點。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「水墊展寬與平均壓力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Pool reshaping aims to improve spreading and downstream conveyance. More volume does not make every pressure fall proportionally. Force divided by area describes an average, while pulses and recirculation may remain concentrated; validate distributions with synchronized pressure arrays and flow observations. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Compare pressure distributions and recirculation before and after reshaping at matched conditions. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: A reduced mean can conceal a newly concentrated high-pressure location. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Pool spreading and mean pressure” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設：PrescribedResultant=900 kN; effectiveArea=45 m2; meanPressure=900/45=20 kPa。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: PrescribedResultant=900 kN; effectiveArea=45 m2; meanPressure=900/45=20 kPa.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「水墊體積增加就保證所有局部脈壓同比下降」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A larger pool guarantees a proportional reduction in every local pressure pulse\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「水墊展寬與平均壓力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Pool spreading and mean pressure”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
