       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Compare pressure distributions and recirculation before and after reshaping at matched conditions. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: A reduced mean can conceal a newly concentrated high-pressure location. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
