       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Joint pressure and block removal” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "同步量測節理內外壓力並核對岩塊形狀及連通裂隙。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「連通節理可使低平均水面壓力下仍發生局部拔出」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure pressures inside and outside joints and map block geometry and connectivity. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Connected joints can enable local plucking despite low mean surface pressure. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：交接時以同步量測節理內外壓力並核對岩塊形狀及連通裂隙作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對連通節理可使低平均水面壓力下仍發生局部拔出，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Measure pressures inside and outside joints and map block geometry and connectivity. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Connected joints can enable local plucking despite low mean surface pressure. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：連通節理可使低平均水面壓力下仍發生局部拔出。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Connected joints can enable local plucking despite low mean surface pressure. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
