       "objective": "從症狀倒推「節理壓差與拔出」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Joint pressure and block removal” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "連通節理可使低平均水面壓力下仍發生局部拔出。診斷時應採取以下查核：同步量測節理內外壓力並核對岩塊形狀及連通裂隙，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Connected joints can enable local plucking despite low mean surface pressure. Diagnose it by the following check: Measure pressures inside and outside joints and map block geometry and connectivity. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「完整岩石強度高就不需檢查節理壓差」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"High intact strength removes the need to check pressure across joints\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b212-v15-20-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "連通節理可使低平均水面壓力下仍發生局部拔出。診斷時應採取以下查核：同步量測節理內外壓力並核對岩塊形狀及連通裂隙，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。",
         "textEn": "Connected joints can enable local plucking despite low mean surface pressure. Diagnose it by the following check: Measure pressures inside and outside joints and map block geometry and connectivity. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "b-src-water-manuals",
          "v15s-zra-history",
