       "objective": "說明「回向沖蝕與距離」如何影響卡里巴水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Backward scour and separation distance” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Kariba Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "沖坑朝壩基方向擴展的後果與相對位置有關，不能只追蹤最大深度。平面最短距離可做監測指標，但安全判定還需三維岩體、可能滑移面與水力作用；量測基準和沖坑邊界定義應保持一致。 驗證時應以同基準三維地形比較沖坑邊緣深度與壩基相對位置，並辨識以下失效情境：只測最深點會漏掉較淺但朝壩基推進的侵蝕。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「回向沖蝕與距離」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Scour moving toward the foundation matters through location as well as maximum depth. Plan separation is a monitoring indicator, not a safety verdict. Three-dimensional rock geometry, potential sliding surfaces and hydraulics still govern consequences; maintain consistent survey datums and edge definitions over time. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Compare scour edges and depths relative to the foundation using consistent three-dimensional surveys. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Tracking only the deepest point misses shallower erosion advancing toward the foundation. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Backward scour and separation distance” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設：FoundationReferenceX=0 m; scourEdgeOld=75 m; scourEdgeNew=68 m; approachDistance=75-68=7 m。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: FoundationReferenceX=0 m; scourEdgeOld=75 m; scourEdgeNew=68 m; approachDistance=75-68=7 m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「最大沖深不變就表示沖坑完全沒有不利變化」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Unchanged maximum depth proves that no adverse scour change has occurred\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「回向沖蝕與距離」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Backward scour and separation distance”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
