       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Backward scour and separation distance” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以同基準三維地形比較沖坑邊緣深度與壩基相對位置。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「只測最深點會漏掉較淺但朝壩基推進的侵蝕」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare scour edges and depths relative to the foundation using consistent three-dimensional surveys. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Tracking only the deepest point misses shallower erosion advancing toward the foundation. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：交接時以以同基準三維地形比較沖坑邊緣深度與壩基相對位置作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對只測最深點會漏掉較淺但朝壩基推進的侵蝕，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Compare scour edges and depths relative to the foundation using consistent three-dimensional surveys. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Tracking only the deepest point misses shallower erosion advancing toward the foundation. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
