       "objective": "從症狀倒推「圍堰抽排與水量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Cofferdam dewatering balance” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "抽排加快可能增大內外水頭差而改變地基風險。診斷時應採取以下查核：記錄抽排量內外水位與地基孔壓並核對停泵反應，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Faster dewatering can enlarge differential head and alter foundation risk. Diagnose it by the following check: Record pumping, inside and outside levels and foundation pressures and examine pump-stop response. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。",
