       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Backup isolation and loading” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "維修側排乾後壓差增加可能超出平常操作荷載。診斷時應採取以下查核：將隔離前後水位組合列入荷載表並檢查導軌反力，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Dewatering the maintenance side increases differential load beyond normal operation. Diagnose it by the following check: List pre- and post-isolation water levels and check guide reactions. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。",
