       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Rehabilitation benefit and matched states” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "用匹配工況資料比較壓力頻譜與空間分布而非只比較均值。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「未匹配流量就計改善百分比可能製造虛假成效」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare spectra and spatial pressure distributions at matched conditions, not only means. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: An improvement percentage without matched discharge can be misleading. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
