       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Compare spectra and spatial pressure distributions at matched conditions, not only means. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: An improvement percentage without matched discharge can be misleading. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：未匹配流量就計改善百分比可能製造虛假成效。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
