       "objective": "從症狀倒推「修復效益與同工況」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Rehabilitation benefit and matched states” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "未匹配流量就計改善百分比可能製造虛假成效。診斷時應採取以下查核：用匹配工況資料比較壓力頻譜與空間分布而非只比較均值，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "An improvement percentage without matched discharge can be misleading. Diagnose it by the following check: Compare spectra and spatial pressure distributions at matched conditions, not only means. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「任意兩次量測相減就能證明修復成效」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
