         "textEn": "An improvement percentage without matched discharge can be misleading. Diagnose it by the following check: Compare spectra and spatial pressure distributions at matched conditions, not only means. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
