    "text": "整合算例輸入全為教學假設，先檢查堆石濕陷與水位：SyntheticLayerThickness=40 m; prescribedWettingStrain=0.004; uniformSettlement=40*0.004=0.16 m；再獨立檢查合成核心應力轉移：PrescribedNormalTotalStress=500 kPa; porePressure=350 kPa; effectiveNormalStress=500-350=150 kPa。敏感度：固定淨水頭60m與效率0.9，流量由200增至250m3/s，出力由105.948增至132.435MW；若尾水隨放流上升，實際增加會小於此固定水頭推估。 兩個結果須按各自量綱解釋，不能直接相加或當成完整設計。業主確認壩型與建設年代；公開頁高度長度互有矛盾故不採用，下列工程數值全為教學假設。 將比較壩前水位波浪紀錄與壩頂沉陷並標明浪向作為獨立驗證，明確列出尚缺的現地輸入及其對結論的影響。",
    "textEn": "Every input in this integrated example is a teaching assumption. First examine Rockfill wetting and settlement: SyntheticLayerThickness=40 m; prescribedWettingStrain=0.004; uniformSettlement=40*0.004=0.16 m. Independently examine Synthetic core stress transfer: PrescribedNormalTotalStress=500 kPa; porePressure=350 kPa; effectiveNormalStress=500-350=150 kPa. Sensitivity: at fixed60m net head and0.9 efficiency, increasing discharge from200 to250m3/s raises output from105.948 to132.435MW. Rising tailwater would reduce the gain relative to this fixed-head estimate. Interpret each result in its own dimensions rather than adding them or treating them as a complete design. The owner confirms dam type and construction dates; conflicting published heights and lengths are excluded and all lesson engineering values are hypothetical. Use the following independent check: Compare near-dam water levels and waves with crest settlement and wave direction. Identify missing field inputs and state which conclusions depend on them.",
    "assumptions": "數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。",
    "assumptionsEn": "Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.",
    "sourceScope": "原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。",
    "sourceScopeEn": "Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."
   },
