         "textEn": "Wetting can change rockfill contacts and breakage, and its deformation should be separated from construction settlement. Mean axial strain times thickness describes uniform compression only, not the three-dimensional dam.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "b-src-water-manuals",
          "v15s-vra-akosombo",
          "v15s-usbr-filters",
