         "id": "b213-v15-03-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "交接時以比對分層沉陷與濕潤前緣孔壓時序並核對材料破碎作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對濕陷集中於局部區帶可能增加核心與壩殼相對變形，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。",
         "textEn": "At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Compare layered settlement with wetting-front pressure histories and material breakage. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Localized wetting settlement can increase differential movement between core and shell. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
