         "textEn": "Localized wetting settlement can increase differential movement between core and shell. Diagnose it by the following check: Compare layered settlement with wetting-front pressure histories and material breakage. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
