       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Multiple bays and uneven discharge” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Akosombo Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "多孔溢洪道的總流量由各孔實際開度與水頭決定，孔數平均不代表局部水舌或下游壓力相同。合成各孔流量加總只是水量帳；閘門組合改變可能使相鄰水舌交互作用，須對照下游消能與岸坡反應。 驗證時應同步記錄各孔開度與下游水舌位置並核對總流量，並辨識以下失效情境：相同總洩量的不同孔組合可能集中衝擊單側岸坡。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「分孔洩流與不均流」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Total spillway flow sums actual bay discharges, not an assumed uniform share. Adding synthetic bay flows is only mass accounting. Different combinations can alter jet interaction and downstream pressure, so check dissipation and bank response alongside opening and head at each bay. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Record bay openings and downstream jet positions together and check total flow. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Different bay combinations at equal total flow can concentrate impact on one bank. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Multiple bays and uneven discharge” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設：Three hypothetical bays discharge=120,100,80 m3/s; totalQ=120+100+80=300 m3/s。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: Three hypothetical bays discharge=120,100,80 m3/s; totalQ=120+100+80=300 m3/s.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「總洩量相同就表示所有閘門組合效果相同」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Equal total release means every gate combination has the same effect\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「分孔洩流與不均流」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Multiple bays and uneven discharge”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
