       "instructionEn": "Different bay combinations at equal total flow can concentrate impact on one bank. Diagnose it by the following check: Record bay openings and downstream jet positions together and check total flow. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
