         "textEn": "A shared hoist outage can constrain several otherwise functional gates. Diagnose it by the following check: Use maintenance records to distinguish shared and independent equipment and check alternative actuation. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
