         "id": "b213-v15-21-k1",
         "title": "機組出力與水頭",
         "titleEn": "Generating output and hydraulic head",
         "text": "阿科松博提供水庫發電與放流協調的案例，機組出力需用淨水頭而不是壩高。尾水與進水損失會隨流量改變，效率也受工作點影響；合成定效率算例只是能量量級，不能以裝置容量倒推出未量測的流量。",
         "textEn": "Akosombo provides context for coordinated reservoir generation and releases. Output uses net head rather than dam height; tailwater, losses and efficiency vary with operating point.",
         "sourceIds": [
