         "textEn": "Applying peak efficiency to every operating state overstates generation. Diagnose it by the following check: Check efficiency using simultaneous electrical power, flow and both water levels. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
