    {
     "id": "b213-v15-s4",
     "title": "試驗、量測與監測驗證",
     "titleEn": "Testing, measurement and monitoring",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「廣域湖面與庫容」與「風浪水位與壩頂」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Broad lake surface and storage\" and \"Wind setup and crest checks\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b213-v15-25",
       "title": "廣域湖面與庫容：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Broad lake surface and storage: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "b-src-water-manuals",
        "v15s-vra-akosombo",
        "v15s-usbr-filters",
        "v15s-hoover-owner"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b213-v15-24"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「廣域湖面與庫容」如何影響阿科松博水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Broad lake surface and storage” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Akosombo Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "大面積湖泊的小幅水位變化可能對應大量庫容，但面積並非固定，岸線地形使水位容量關係非線性。以定面積近似只適用短範圍示意，應使用實測地形更新曲線；不同高程基準不能直接拼接成容量變化。 驗證時應以分水位面積曲線與重複測深核對局部容量斜率，並辨識以下失效情境：固定面積外推大幅洩降會錯估可用庫容。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「廣域湖面與庫容」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A small level change over a broad lake can represent substantial storage, but shoreline geometry makes area variable. A constant-area approximation covers a limited range only. Update the relation from bathymetry and keep vertical datums consistent rather than joining unlike surveys into a storage trend. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Check local storage slope using stage-area curves and repeat bathymetry. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Constant-area extrapolation over large drawdown misstates usable storage. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Broad lake surface and storage” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設：HypotheticalMeanArea=1000 km2; stageChange=0.20 m; localStorageChange=1000e6*0.20/1e6=200 million m3。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: HypotheticalMeanArea=1000 km2; stageChange=0.20 m; localStorageChange=1000e6*0.20/1e6=200 million m3.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「湖面積一旦量過就能固定用於所有水位」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"One measured lake area applies unchanged at every stage\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「廣域湖面與庫容」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Broad lake surface and storage”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b213-v15-25-k1",
         "title": "廣域湖面與庫容",
         "titleEn": "Broad lake surface and storage",
         "text": "大面積湖泊的小幅水位變化可能對應大量庫容，但面積並非固定，岸線地形使水位容量關係非線性。以定面積近似只適用短範圍示意，應使用實測地形更新曲線；不同高程基準不能直接拼接成容量變化。",
         "textEn": "A small level change over a broad lake can represent substantial storage, but shoreline geometry makes area variable. A constant-area approximation covers a limited range only.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "b-src-water-manuals",
          "v15s-vra-akosombo",
          "v15s-usbr-filters",
          "v15s-hoover-owner"
         ]
