         "text": "誤解：湖面積一旦量過就能固定用於所有水位 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: One measured lake area applies unchanged at every stage Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
