       "instruction": "以分水位面積曲線與重複測深核對局部容量斜率。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「固定面積外推大幅洩降會錯估可用庫容」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check local storage slope using stage-area curves and repeat bathymetry. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Constant-area extrapolation over large drawdown misstates usable storage. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
