       ],
       "objective": "說明「風浪水位與壩頂」如何影響阿科松博水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Wind setup and crest checks” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Akosombo Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "廣域湖泊的風作用可能造成平均水位壅高與短時波浪，兩者應分開並與壩頂高程比較。簡化淨餘高只是已指定工況的幾何帳，不能替代波浪爬升或可靠度分析；還需考慮沉陷、浪向與岸形聚焦。 驗證時應比較壩前水位波浪紀錄與壩頂沉陷並標明浪向，並辨識以下失效情境：忽略壩頂長期沉陷會高估剩餘餘高。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「風浪水位與壩頂」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Wind over a broad lake can produce both setup and waves, which must be distinguished in crest checks. A geometric clearance calculation applies to a prescribed case and does not replace runup or reliability analysis. Settlement, direction and shoreline focusing also affect local conditions. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Compare near-dam water levels and waves with crest settlement and wave direction. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Ignoring long-term crest settlement overstates remaining freeboard. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Wind setup and crest checks” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設：crestElevation=102 m; stillWater=99 m; setup=0.3 m; prescribedRunup=1.2 m; clearance=102-99-0.3-1.2=1.5 m。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: crestElevation=102 m; stillWater=99 m; setup=0.3 m; prescribedRunup=1.2 m; clearance=102-99-0.3-1.2=1.5 m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「靜水位低於壩頂就保證不會有波浪越頂」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Still water below the crest guarantees no wave overtopping\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「風浪水位與壩頂」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Wind setup and crest checks”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b213-v15-29-k1",
         "title": "風浪水位與壩頂",
         "titleEn": "Wind setup and crest checks",
         "text": "廣域湖泊的風作用可能造成平均水位壅高與短時波浪，兩者應分開並與壩頂高程比較。簡化淨餘高只是已指定工況的幾何帳，不能替代波浪爬升或可靠度分析；還需考慮沉陷、浪向與岸形聚焦。",
         "textEn": "Wind over a broad lake can produce both setup and waves, which must be distinguished in crest checks. A geometric clearance calculation applies to a prescribed case and does not replace runup or reliability analysis.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "b-src-water-manuals",
          "v15s-vra-akosombo",
          "v15s-usbr-filters",
          "v15s-hoover-owner"
