         "id": "b213-v15-29-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：靜水位低於壩頂就保證不會有波浪越頂 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Still water below the crest guarantees no wave overtopping Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
