       "instructionEn": "Record plant release and downstream levels at several stations to identify travel delay. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Equating outlet discharge ramp with settlement-area level rise confuses dimensions. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：交接時以同步記錄電廠放流與下游多站水位以辨認傳播延遲作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對把出口流量變率直接當居民區水位升速會混淆量綱，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Record plant release and downstream levels at several stations to identify travel delay. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Equating outlet discharge ramp with settlement-area level rise confuses dimensions. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
