       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「下游流量爬升」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Downstream discharge ramping” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把出口流量變率直接當居民區水位升速會混淆量綱。診斷時應採取以下查核：同步記錄電廠放流與下游多站水位以辨認傳播延遲，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Equating outlet discharge ramp with settlement-area level rise confuses dimensions. Diagnose it by the following check: Record plant release and downstream levels at several stations to identify travel delay. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「每天總放流量相同就表示下游影響完全相同」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Equal daily release volume guarantees identical downstream effects\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
