         "textEn": "Equating outlet discharge ramp with settlement-area level rise confuses dimensions. Diagnose it by the following check: Record plant release and downstream levels at several stations to identify travel delay. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
         "sourceIds": [
