       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Compare outages, inflow and curtailment causes with annual energy rather than one ratio. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: A lower capacity factor may reflect water shortage rather than degraded unit efficiency. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
