    "title": "原創假想算例與邊界",
    "titleEn": "Original hypothetical example and boundaries",
    "text": "整合算例輸入全為教學假設，先檢查高山集水與季節庫存：SyntheticCollectedFlow=12 m3/s for20 days; collectedVolume=12*20*86400/1e6=20.736 million m3；再獨立檢查高壩投影水壓：SyntheticWaterDepth=180 m; unitWidth=1 m; hydrostaticForce=0.5*9.81*180**2=158922 kN per m width。敏感度：合成底面總下向力90000kN與摩擦係數0.7不變，揚力由20000增至30000kN，摩擦抗力由49000降至42000kN，減少14.29%；不能假設排水永久維持初始效果。 兩個結果須按各自量綱解釋，不能直接相加或當成完整設計。公開高度與年代僅作案例背景，合成斷面不等於真實壩形，所有安全比值均非設計評定。 將保持試段長度壓差一致並比較帷幕上下游孔壓作為獨立驗證，明確列出尚缺的現地輸入及其對結論的影響。",
    "textEn": "Every input in this integrated example is a teaching assumption. First examine Alpine collection and seasonal storage: SyntheticCollectedFlow=12 m3/s for20 days; collectedVolume=12*20*86400/1e6=20.736 million m3. Independently examine High dam projected hydrostatic load: SyntheticWaterDepth=180 m; unitWidth=1 m; hydrostaticForce=0.5*9.81*180**2=158922 kN per m width. Sensitivity: with90000kN downward force and0.7 friction coefficient, raising uplift from20000 to30000kN reduces frictional resistance from49000 to42000kN, or14.29 percent. Drainage cannot be assumed permanently effective at its initial state. Interpret each result in its own dimensions rather than adding them or treating them as a complete design. Public height and dates provide context only; synthetic sections are not the actual dam and calculated ratios are not design assessments. Use the following independent check: Match interval length and pressure and compare heads on both sides of the curtain. Identify missing field inputs and state which conclusions depend on them.",
    "assumptions": "數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。",
