         "text": "原創教學假設：SyntheticCollectedFlow=12 m3/s for20 days; collectedVolume=12*20*86400/1e6=20.736 million m3。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。",
         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions: SyntheticCollectedFlow=12 m3/s for20 days; collectedVolume=12*20*86400/1e6=20.736 million m3. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds.",
