         "textEn": "At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Reconcile tributary collection with storage and distinguish pumped from natural inflow. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Summing collection alone omits conveyance losses and nongenerating releases. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
