         "text": "只加總取水量會漏掉輸水損失與非發電放流。診斷時應採取以下查核：將各支流取水與庫存變化對帳並區分抽水輸入與自然入流，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。",
         "textEn": "Summing collection alone omits conveyance losses and nongenerating releases. Diagnose it by the following check: Reconcile tributary collection with storage and distinguish pumped from natural inflow. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
