      {
       "id": "b214-v15-05",
       "title": "高壩投影水壓：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "High dam projected hydrostatic load: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "b-src-water-manuals",
        "v15s-grande-dixence-owner",
        "v15s-grande-dixence-history",
        "v15s-usbr-monitoring",
        "v15s-usace-hss"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b214-v15-04"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「高壩投影水壓」如何影響大迪克桑斯壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “High dam projected hydrostatic load” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Grande Dixence Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "重力壩以自身重量及地基作用抵抗水平水壓，水深增加使三角分布合力按平方成長。單寬投影式只是二維自由體的一項，壩體實際幾何、尾水與地震水動力需另列；不能以公共壩高直接替代運轉水深。 驗證時應以同時庫尾水位及實測斷面建立完整荷載圖，並辨識以下失效情境：把結構總高度當滿水深會錯置受壓範圍與力矩。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「高壩投影水壓」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A gravity dam resists horizontal water action through weight and foundation interaction. The triangular resultant grows with depth squared. A unit-width projection is one term in a two-dimensional free body; actual geometry, tailwater and seismic hydrodynamics remain separate, and public dam height is not operating depth. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Build the complete load diagram from simultaneous reservoir and tailwater levels and surveyed sections. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Using total structural height as water depth misplaces the loaded area and moment. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “High dam projected hydrostatic load” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設：SyntheticWaterDepth=180 m; unitWidth=1 m; hydrostaticForce=0.5*9.81*180**2=158922 kN per m width。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: SyntheticWaterDepth=180 m; unitWidth=1 m; hydrostaticForce=0.5*9.81*180**2=158922 kN per m width.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「公開壩高就是任何工況下的實際水深」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Published dam height equals actual water depth in every condition\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「高壩投影水壓」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “High dam projected hydrostatic load”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b214-v15-05-k1",
         "title": "高壩投影水壓",
         "titleEn": "High dam projected hydrostatic load",
         "text": "重力壩以自身重量及地基作用抵抗水平水壓，水深增加使三角分布合力按平方成長。單寬投影式只是二維自由體的一項，壩體實際幾何、尾水與地震水動力需另列；不能以公共壩高直接替代運轉水深。",
         "textEn": "A gravity dam resists horizontal water action through weight and foundation interaction. The triangular resultant grows with depth squared.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "b-src-water-manuals",
          "v15s-grande-dixence-owner",
          "v15s-grande-dixence-history",
          "v15s-usbr-monitoring",
          "v15s-usace-hss"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b214-v15-05-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：公開壩高就是任何工況下的實際水深 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
