    {
     "id": "b214-v15-s2",
     "title": "水力機制、材料與定量模型",
     "titleEn": "Hydraulics, materials and quantitative models",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「混凝土自重與質量」與「底面揚力與排水」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Concrete weight and mass\" and \"Base uplift and drainage\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b214-v15-09",
       "title": "混凝土自重與質量：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Concrete weight and mass: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "b-src-water-manuals",
        "v15s-grande-dixence-owner",
        "v15s-grande-dixence-history",
        "v15s-usbr-monitoring",
        "v15s-usace-hss"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b214-v15-08"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「混凝土自重與質量」如何影響大迪克桑斯壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Concrete weight and mass” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Grande Dixence Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "壩體混凝土的密度與體積先給質量，再乘重力才得到重量，兩者不可混用。合成單寬斷面自重須使用斷面面積與厚度，廊道和空洞另扣；重心位置同樣重要，因其決定抵抗力矩而不只總重量。 驗證時應核對廊道扣除與重心位置並分別列出質量及重量單位，並辨識以下失效情境：漏扣大廊道或錯置重心會同時影響自重與穩定力矩。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「混凝土自重與質量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Density and volume yield mass; multiplying by gravity yields weight. A synthetic unit-width section needs area and thickness, with galleries and voids deducted. The centroid matters as much as total weight because it sets the resisting moment rather than merely the downward force. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Check gallery deductions and centroid and distinguish mass units from force units. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Omitted galleries or a misplaced centroid alter weight and stability moments. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Concrete weight and mass” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設：SyntheticSectionArea=12000 m2; width=1 m; concreteDensity=2400 kg/m3; weight=12000*1*2400*9.81/1000=282528 kN。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: SyntheticSectionArea=12000 m2; width=1 m; concreteDensity=2400 kg/m3; weight=12000*1*2400*9.81/1000=282528 kN.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「混凝土質量的噸數可以直接當作千牛頓重量」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Concrete mass in tonnes can be used directly as weight in kilonewtons\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「混凝土自重與質量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Concrete weight and mass”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b214-v15-09-k1",
         "title": "混凝土自重與質量",
         "titleEn": "Concrete weight and mass",
         "text": "壩體混凝土的密度與體積先給質量，再乘重力才得到重量，兩者不可混用。合成單寬斷面自重須使用斷面面積與厚度，廊道和空洞另扣；重心位置同樣重要，因其決定抵抗力矩而不只總重量。",
         "textEn": "Density and volume yield mass; multiplying by gravity yields weight. A synthetic unit-width section needs area and thickness, with galleries and voids deducted.",
