         "textEn": "Omitted galleries or a misplaced centroid alter weight and stability moments. Diagnose it by the following check: Check gallery deductions and centroid and distinguish mass units from force units. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
