       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Compare gallery piezometers and drainage flow with the assumed base-pressure profile. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Drain blockage invalidates an assumed low-pressure profile. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
