         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "交接時以以完整荷載力矩求合力位置並核對接觸模型是否允許拉力作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對超出全接觸適用範圍仍用線性式會錯估壓縮區，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。",
         "textEn": "At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Locate the resultant from all moments and check whether the contact model permits tension. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Using full-contact equations beyond their range misstates the compressed area. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
