       "objective": "從症狀倒推「合力偏心與接觸」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Resultant eccentricity and contact” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "超出全接觸適用範圍仍用線性式會錯估壓縮區。診斷時應採取以下查核：以完整荷載力矩求合力位置並核對接觸模型是否允許拉力，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Using full-contact equations beyond their range misstates the compressed area. Diagnose it by the following check: Locate the resultant from all moments and check whether the contact model permits tension. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。",
