       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A resultant anywhere inside the base guarantees compression over the entire base\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
