       "objective": "說明「抗滑摩擦與揚壓」如何影響大迪克桑斯壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Sliding friction and uplift” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Grande Dixence Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "摩擦抗力取決於有效正力而非總自重，揚壓、地震與不同荷載組合會改變可用接觸。無黏聚簡式只估一項抗力，不能代表含節理岩體的完整穩定；接觸面粗糙、剪脹及強度退化需由適當試驗與分析建立。 驗證時應核對揚壓量測與接觸剪力試驗並分列各荷載組合，並辨識以下失效情境：用總自重計摩擦會高估有揚壓時的抗滑能力。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「抗滑摩擦與揚壓」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Friction depends on effective normal force rather than gross weight. Uplift and load combinations alter contact. A cohesionless expression estimates one resistance component, not complete stability in jointed rock; roughness, dilation and degradation require suitable testing and analysis before using a strength parameter. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Check measured uplift and interface shear testing and list load combinations separately. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Using gross weight for friction overstates resistance when uplift acts. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Sliding friction and uplift” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設：totalDownwardForce=90000 kN; uplift=20000 kN; frictionCoefficient=0.7; frictionResistance=(90000-20000)*0.7=49000 kN。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: totalDownwardForce=90000 kN; uplift=20000 kN; frictionCoefficient=0.7; frictionResistance=(90000-20000)*0.7=49000 kN.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「揚壓只影響抗浮而不影響滑動摩擦」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Uplift affects flotation only and never sliding friction\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「抗滑摩擦與揚壓」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Sliding friction and uplift”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
