         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions: totalDownwardForce=90000 kN; uplift=20000 kN; frictionCoefficient=0.7; frictionResistance=(90000-20000)*0.7=49000 kN. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds.",
