         "textEn": "Check measured uplift and interface shear testing and list load combinations separately. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Using gross weight for friction overstates resistance when uplift acts. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted.",
