         "textEn": "Using gross weight for friction overstates resistance when uplift acts. Diagnose it by the following check: Check measured uplift and interface shear testing and list load combinations separately. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
