         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions: Uniaxial full axial restraint with free lateral deformation: E=25 GPa; alpha=10e-6 perK; cooling=12 K; elasticStress=25e9*10e-6*12/1e6=3 MPa. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds.",
