       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Compare core and surface temperatures with embedded strain and concrete age. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Ignoring creep or restraint differences turns an elastic estimate into a false measured stress. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
