       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Hydration heat and restraint” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "忽略徐變或拘束差異會使彈性熱應力被誤當實測值。診斷時應採取以下查核：比較核心表面溫度與埋設應變並記錄混凝土齡期，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Ignoring creep or restraint differences turns an elastic estimate into a false measured stress. Diagnose it by the following check: Compare core and surface temperatures with embedded strain and concrete age. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。",
