         "textEn": "Large grout take can represent loss elsewhere instead of effective sealing. Diagnose it by the following check: Match interval length and pressure and compare heads on both sides of the curtain. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
