       ],
       "objective": "說明「垂線位移與溫度」如何影響大迪克桑斯壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Plumb-line movement and temperature” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Grande Dixence Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "壩內垂線與外部測量可追蹤壩體位移，但基準點穩定與溫度水位效應需分開。差值代表相對運動而非絕對地盤移動，參考端本身若漂移需額外控制；應用長期可逆模式辨認新的不可逆殘差。 驗證時應以外部控制網與倒垂線比較基準穩定並核對季節循環，並辨識以下失效情境：基準端移動可使壩體看似發生相反方向位移。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「垂線位移與溫度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Internal plumb lines and external surveys track movement, but reference stability and temperature-stage effects need separation. A difference is relative motion, not absolute ground movement. If the reference moves, independent control is needed; use reversible long-term patterns to identify a new irreversible residual. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Compare reference stability using external control and inverted plumb lines and check seasonal cycles. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Reference movement can make the dam appear to move in the opposite direction. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Plumb-line movement and temperature” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設：MeasuredRelativeDisplacement=18 mm; temperatureStageBaseline=13 mm; residual=18-13=5 mm。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: MeasuredRelativeDisplacement=18 mm; temperatureStageBaseline=13 mm; residual=18-13=5 mm.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「垂線差值必定就是壩體絕對地理位移」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A plumb-line difference necessarily equals absolute geographic dam movement\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「垂線位移與溫度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Plumb-line movement and temperature”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
