       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Plumb-line movement and temperature” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以外部控制網與倒垂線比較基準穩定並核對季節循環。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「基準端移動可使壩體看似發生相反方向位移」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare reference stability using external control and inverted plumb lines and check seasonal cycles. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Reference movement can make the dam appear to move in the opposite direction. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
