       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Compare reference stability using external control and inverted plumb lines and check seasonal cycles. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Reference movement can make the dam appear to move in the opposite direction. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
