       ],
       "objective": "說明「高落差輸水與淨能量」如何影響大迪克桑斯壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “High-head conveyance and net energy” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Grande Dixence Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "高山蓄水到低處電廠的高程差提供勢能，輸水損失與抽水投入則影響淨能量。以指定流量與淨水頭估出力只代表單一工作點，不能把壩高等同全系統落差；水路壓力、暫態與機組效率需另作聯合驗證。 驗證時應同步核對上下游能量線機組功率及抽水投入，並辨識以下失效情境：把發電毛能量當淨收益會漏掉抽水與輸水損失。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「高落差輸水與淨能量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Elevation difference from alpine storage to lower generating plants supplies potential energy, while losses and pumping inputs affect net benefit. Power at specified flow and net head is one operating point. Dam height is not total scheme head; waterway pressures, transients and efficiency require joint verification. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Check energy lines, generating power and pumping input over matching periods. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Treating gross generation as net benefit omits pumping input and conveyance losses. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “High-head conveyance and net energy” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設：HypotheticalQ=25 m3/s; netHead=900 m; efficiency=0.92; power=1000*9.81*25*900*0.92/1e6=203.067 MW。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: HypotheticalQ=25 m3/s; netHead=900 m; efficiency=0.92; power=1000*9.81*25*900*0.92/1e6=203.067 MW.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「壩高就是整個高山水電系統的總發電落差」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Dam height equals the full generating head of an alpine scheme\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「高落差輸水與淨能量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “High-head conveyance and net energy”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
