       "objective": "從症狀倒推「融雪脈衝與蓄量帳」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Snowmelt pulses and storage” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把日平均流量與六小時洪峰混用，會把尖峰放流錯配到整日；即使總水量看似相符，短時最高水位仍可能被平滑掉，失去檢查蓄洪空間的意義。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Mixing a daily mean with a six-hour pulse assigns peak release to the wrong duration. Even an apparently correct daily volume can conceal the short-term level maximum that matters to storage checks. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：融雪產流還受積雪含水量與土壤暫存控制，同一氣溫未必產生同一入流；庫內水量平衡只核算已到達的水。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Identical air temperatures need not produce identical inflows; this reservoir balance accounts only for water that has already arrived.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「蓄量增加必然讓水位以固定比例上升」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Every storage increase raises level in a fixed proportion\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
