       ],
       "objective": "說明「理想拱圈膜壓應力」如何影響黑部水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Ideal arch membrane compression” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Kurobe Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "曲線壩體可把水壓轉成沿拱圈傳到兩岸的壓縮力。把一條水平窄帶理想化為等厚圓環，只保留膜作用，可從局部力平衡看見半徑與厚度如何改變平均壓應力；實際雙曲率壩仍有懸臂及彎曲。 薄膜模型的壓力乘半徑是每單位高度的環向內力，再除厚度才成為平均應力；這兩個量的單位與用途應分開。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「理想拱圈膜壓應力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Curvature transfers water loading into compression delivered toward the valley sides. An ideal constant-thickness circular strip retains membrane action and reveals radius and thickness sensitivity, while the real double-curvature body also carries cantilever and bending effects. Pressure times radius is circumferential force per unit height; division by thickness converts it to mean stress. Distinguishing force resultant from stress makes the approximation and its units explicit. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Ideal arch membrane compression” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：p=0.8 MPa; R=120 m; t=10 m; sigma=pR/t=9.6 MPa。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: p=0.8 MPa; R=120 m; t=10 m; sigma=pR/t=9.6 MPa.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「只靠圓環平均壓應力就足以完成整座拱壩設計」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Mean ring compression alone is sufficient for complete arch-dam design\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「理想拱圈膜壓應力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Ideal arch membrane compression”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b215-v15-05-k1",
         "title": "理想拱圈膜壓應力",
         "titleEn": "Ideal arch membrane compression",
         "text": "曲線壩體可把水壓轉成沿拱圈傳到兩岸的壓縮力。把一條水平窄帶理想化為等厚圓環，只保留膜作用，可從局部力平衡看見半徑與厚度如何改變平均壓應力；實際雙曲率壩仍有懸臂及彎曲。",
         "textEn": "Curvature transfers water loading into compression delivered toward the valley sides. An ideal constant-thickness circular strip retains membrane action and reveals radius and thickness sensitivity, while the real double-curvature body also carries cantilever and bending effects.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-kurobe-owner",
          "v15s-usace-arch",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b215-v15-05-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：只靠圓環平均壓應力就足以完成整座拱壩設計 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Mean ring compression alone is sufficient for complete arch-dam design Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-kurobe-owner",
          "v15s-usace-arch",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "關於「理想拱圈膜壓應力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？",
        "questionEn": "Which statement about \"Ideal arch membrane compression\" is correct?",
        "options": [
         "只靠圓環平均壓應力就足以完成整座拱壩設計",
         "岩石彈性模數可直接當成支承彈簧剛度",
