      {
       "id": "b215-v15-06",
       "title": "理想拱圈膜壓應力：定量估算",
       "titleEn": "Ideal arch membrane compression: quantitative estimate",
       "estimatedMinutes": 30,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-kurobe-owner",
        "v15s-usace-arch",
        "b-src-water"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b215-v15-05"
       ],
       "objective": "以數值模型估算「理想拱圈膜壓應力」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。",
       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Ideal arch membrane compression” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：p=0.8 MPa; R=120 m; t=10 m; sigma=pR/t=9.6 MPa。適用邊界：均勻法向壓力與連續理想拱圈，忽略接縫、基岩順應及三維彎矩。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: p=0.8 MPa; R=120 m; t=10 m; sigma=pR/t=9.6 MPa. Applicable boundary: Uniform normal pressure on a continuous ideal arch strip; joints, foundation compliance and three-dimensional bending are excluded. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：在紙上切出微小圓弧並畫兩端壓力與外水壓，檢查徑向平衡是否得到同一式子。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Draw a small arc with compression at both ends and external pressure, then recover the equation from radial equilibrium.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
       "checkEn": "Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b215-v15-06-k1",
         "title": "定量模型",
         "titleEn": "Quantitative model",
         "text": "原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：p=0.8 MPa; R=120 m; t=10 m; sigma=pR/t=9.6 MPa。適用邊界：均勻法向壓力與連續理想拱圈，忽略接縫、基岩順應及三維彎矩。",
         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: p=0.8 MPa; R=120 m; t=10 m; sigma=pR/t=9.6 MPa. Applicable boundary: Uniform normal pressure on a continuous ideal arch strip; joints, foundation compliance and three-dimensional bending are excluded.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-kurobe-owner",
          "v15s-usace-arch",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b215-v15-06-k2",
         "title": "模型邊界",
