       "instructionEn": "Draw a small arc with compression at both ends and external pressure, then recover the equation from radial equilibrium. Change thickness and radius separately at fixed pressure, check the trends and identify support conditions that must return in a three-dimensional model. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
