       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Ideal arch membrane compression” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "將平均膜壓應力當作所有位置的最大應力，會忽略壩踵、接縫與岩盤轉角附近的彎曲集中；一個看似低的平均值不能證明局部拉裂不會發生。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Treating mean membrane compression as the maximum everywhere hides bending near heel regions, joints and foundation transitions. A low average cannot establish that local tensile cracking is absent. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
