     "description": "本階段聚焦「岩盤順應與推力位移」與「混凝土受拘束溫降」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Abutment compliance under thrust\" and \"Restrained concrete cooling\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b215-v15-09",
       "title": "岩盤順應與推力位移：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Abutment compliance under thrust: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
