       "objective": "說明「岩盤順應與推力位移」如何影響黑部水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Abutment compliance under thrust” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Kurobe Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "拱圈推力到達岩盤後，支承不會絕對不動；節理與岩體剛度決定反力下的位移。以一個等效彈簧表示局部岩盤，可把推力與位移連起來，但剛度應包含受力範圍，不能只拿完整岩芯彈性模數直接代入。 同一模數配上不同受力面積或岩盤有效深度，會形成不同支承剛度，因而需要先說明彈簧代表的幾何尺度。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「岩盤順應與推力位移」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Arch thrust reaches a deformable rock support whose joints and loaded extent affect movement. A local equivalent spring relates force to displacement, but its stiffness includes geometry and cannot simply be replaced by the elastic modulus of an intact core sample. The same modulus combined with different loaded areas or effective rock depths produces different support stiffnesses. The equivalent spring therefore needs a declared geometric scale before its displacement has physical meaning. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Abutment compliance under thrust” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：F=90 MN; k=18000 MN/m; u=F/k=0.005 m。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: F=90 MN; k=18000 MN/m; u=F/k=0.005 m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「岩石彈性模數可直接當成支承彈簧剛度」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Rock elastic modulus can directly substitute for support spring stiffness\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「岩盤順應與推力位移」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Abutment compliance under thrust”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b215-v15-09-k1",
         "title": "岩盤順應與推力位移",
         "titleEn": "Abutment compliance under thrust",
         "text": "拱圈推力到達岩盤後，支承不會絕對不動；節理與岩體剛度決定反力下的位移。以一個等效彈簧表示局部岩盤，可把推力與位移連起來，但剛度應包含受力範圍，不能只拿完整岩芯彈性模數直接代入。",
         "textEn": "Arch thrust reaches a deformable rock support whose joints and loaded extent affect movement. A local equivalent spring relates force to displacement, but its stiffness includes geometry and cannot simply be replaced by the elastic modulus of an intact core sample.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-kurobe-owner",
          "v15s-usace-arch",
          "b-src-water"
