         "text": "誤解：岩石彈性模數可直接當成支承彈簧剛度 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Rock elastic modulus can directly substitute for support spring stiffness Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
