       "objective": "以數值模型估算「岩盤順應與推力位移」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。",
       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Abutment compliance under thrust” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：F=90 MN; k=18000 MN/m; u=F/k=0.005 m。適用邊界：單一線彈性反力方向，剛度屬假想整體支承，不表示岩盤試驗值。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: F=90 MN; k=18000 MN/m; u=F/k=0.005 m. Applicable boundary: One linear reaction direction; stiffness represents a hypothetical support assembly rather than a measured rock property. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：把同一水位區間的岩盤位移與壩體位移並列，確認基準點位在受影響區之外。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Compare rock and dam displacement over matching reservoir-level intervals using a reference outside the affected zone.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
