       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Abutment compliance under thrust” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "把同一水位區間的岩盤位移與壩體位移並列，確認基準點位在受影響區之外。使用載入與卸載兩段斜率比較等效剛度，若回程無法閉合，應另外檢查節理滑移與儀器基座變動。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare rock and dam displacement over matching reservoir-level intervals using a reference outside the affected zone. Estimate stiffness from both loading and unloading slopes. If the loop does not close, investigate joint slip and movement of the instrument base separately. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：另設左岸剛度為一萬二千兆牛頓每公尺，在相同反力下比較兩岸位移，討論差異位移可能如何改變拱圈變形，並指出仍缺少哪些三維平衡條件。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Assign the left support a stiffness of twelve thousand meganewtons per metre and compare movements under equal reactions. Discuss possible arch distortion and identify the missing equilibrium conditions needed before predicting redistribution.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把岩盤設成無限剛會低估支承移動造成的內力重分配；反過來把所有位移都歸因於軟岩，也會漏掉溫度造成的可逆壩體伸縮及基準漂移。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: An infinitely rigid support suppresses load redistribution caused by rock movement. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
