         "textEn": "Compare rock and dam displacement over matching reservoir-level intervals using a reference outside the affected zone. Estimate stiffness from both loading and unloading slopes. If the loop does not close, investigate joint slip and movement of the instrument base separately.",
         "sourceIds": [
