       "objective": "從症狀倒推「岩盤順應與推力位移」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Abutment compliance under thrust” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把岩盤設成無限剛會低估支承移動造成的內力重分配；反過來把所有位移都歸因於軟岩，也會漏掉溫度造成的可逆壩體伸縮及基準漂移。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "An infinitely rigid support suppresses load redistribution caused by rock movement. Attributing every observed displacement to weak rock is equally misleading because thermal expansion and reference drift can create reversible changes. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：同一模數配上不同受力面積或岩盤有效深度，會形成不同支承剛度，因而需要先說明彈簧代表的幾何尺度。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: The equivalent spring therefore needs a declared geometric scale before its displacement has physical meaning.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「岩石彈性模數可直接當成支承彈簧剛度」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Rock elastic modulus can directly substitute for support spring stiffness\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
