         "id": "b215-v15-12-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "把岩盤設成無限剛會低估支承移動造成的內力重分配；反過來把所有位移都歸因於軟岩，也會漏掉溫度造成的可逆壩體伸縮及基準漂移。",
         "textEn": "An infinitely rigid support suppresses load redistribution caused by rock movement. Attributing every observed displacement to weak rock is equally misleading because thermal expansion and reference drift can create reversible changes.",
         "sourceIds": [
