         "text": "原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：E=30000 MPa; alpha=0.00001 1/K; dT=12 K; sigma=E alpha dT=3.6 MPa。適用邊界：完全軸向拘束、線彈性且忽略徐變；正值表示冷卻所致拉應力量級。",
         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: E=30000 MPa; alpha=0.00001 1/K; dT=12 K; sigma=E alpha dT=3.6 MPa. Applicable boundary: Full axial restraint, linear elasticity and no creep; the positive value is the tensile stress scale from cooling.",
