       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「混凝土受拘束溫降」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Restrained concrete cooling” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "比較表面與內部溫度計的相位差，先決定哪個溫度代表受拘束體積。另以自由試件量得熱膨脹係數，核對應變計零點與季節基準，避免把儀器自身溫漂誤當混凝土拉伸。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare phase lag between surface and internal thermometers before selecting a representative restrained-volume temperature. Measure thermal expansion on an unrestrained specimen and check strain-gauge zero and seasonal reference so instrument temperature drift is not mistaken for concrete tension. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：把拘束比例改為零點四並重算拉應力量級，另畫自由收縮與完全拘束兩個極端，說明實際接縫開合與徐變會如何移動答案的位置。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Recalculate with a restraint fraction of zero point four and sketch free contraction and full restraint as limiting cases. Explain how joint opening and creep can move the actual response between or beyond those simple bounds.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：直接以每日氣溫降幅代替整塊混凝土溫降，通常誇大深部瞬時應力；若忽略長期徐變的鬆弛，也可能把彈性上限誤讀成持續存在的實際應力。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Using daily air cooling as the temperature change of an entire block exaggerates immediate interior response. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
