         "text": "比較表面與內部溫度計的相位差，先決定哪個溫度代表受拘束體積。另以自由試件量得熱膨脹係數，核對應變計零點與季節基準，避免把儀器自身溫漂誤當混凝土拉伸。",
         "textEn": "Compare phase lag between surface and internal thermometers before selecting a representative restrained-volume temperature. Measure thermal expansion on an unrestrained specimen and check strain-gauge zero and seasonal reference so instrument temperature drift is not mistaken for concrete tension.",
