    {
     "id": "b215-v15-s3",
     "title": "施工方法與施工階段控制",
     "titleEn": "Construction methods and stage control",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「長引水管的沿程損失」與「高水頭水能轉換」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Friction in a long conduit\" and \"High head energy conversion\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b215-v15-17",
       "title": "長引水管的沿程損失：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Friction in a long conduit: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-kurobe-owner",
        "v15s-usace-arch",
        "b-src-water"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b215-v15-16"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「長引水管的沿程損失」如何影響黑部水壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Friction in a long conduit” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Kurobe Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "高水頭發電的毛落差不會全部到達機組，長輸水通道把部分機械能耗散成熱。達西摩擦式將長徑比與速度平方連結，黑部背景下可用來比較增大管徑與增加流量的代價，但粗糙度與局部損失仍需另計。 能量線沿流向下降，而壓力線還受高程和速度影響；把兩者分開可避免看到局部低壓便誤判全部水頭耗失。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「長引水管的沿程損失」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Gross mountain head does not all reach a generating unit because a long waterway dissipates mechanical energy. Darcy friction connects length-to-diameter ratio with velocity squared, allowing comparison of diameter and discharge choices while roughness and local losses remain separate inputs. The energy line falls along the conduit, while the pressure line also depends on elevation and velocity. Separating them prevents local low pressure from being mistaken for total head dissipation. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Friction in a long conduit” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：f=0.018; L=1600 m; D=3 m; v=4 m/s; g=9.81 m/s2; hf=f(L/D)v2/(2g)=7.82875 m。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: f=0.018; L=1600 m; D=3 m; v=4 m/s; g=9.81 m/s2; hf=f(L/D)v2/(2g)=7.82875 m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「沿程水頭損失只與流速一次方成比例」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Friction head loss is proportional only to the first power of velocity\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「長引水管的沿程損失」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Friction in a long conduit”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b215-v15-17-k1",
         "title": "長引水管的沿程損失",
         "titleEn": "Friction in a long conduit",
         "text": "高水頭發電的毛落差不會全部到達機組，長輸水通道把部分機械能耗散成熱。達西摩擦式將長徑比與速度平方連結，黑部背景下可用來比較增大管徑與增加流量的代價，但粗糙度與局部損失仍需另計。",
         "textEn": "Gross mountain head does not all reach a generating unit because a long waterway dissipates mechanical energy. Darcy friction connects length-to-diameter ratio with velocity squared, allowing comparison of diameter and discharge choices while roughness and local losses remain separate inputs.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-kurobe-owner",
          "v15s-usace-arch",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b215-v15-17-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：沿程水頭損失只與流速一次方成比例 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Friction head loss is proportional only to the first power of velocity Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-kurobe-owner",
          "v15s-usace-arch",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "關於「長引水管的沿程損失」，下列哪一項敘述正確？",
        "questionEn": "Which statement about \"Friction in a long conduit\" is correct?",
        "options": [
         "沿程水頭損失只與流速一次方成比例",
         "機組功率乘秒仍可直接標成兆瓦小時",
         "高水頭發電的毛落差不會全部到達機組，長輸水通道把部分機械能耗散成熱。"
        ],
