       "instructionEn": "Estimate round-trip travel time from pipe length and wave speed, then confirm that pressure sampling resolves the peak. Compare arrival times and reflection signs at different locations and check whether sensor saturation clips the recorded maximum. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：在紙上比較波速七百與一千公尺每秒的壓力增量，說明管壁柔度如何影響結果，再列出需要瞬變模擬才能回答的反射與負壓問題。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Compare pressure increments for wave speeds of seven hundred and one thousand metres per second. Explain the role of wall flexibility and identify reflection and sub-atmospheric-pressure questions that require a transient model.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：若局部壓力降到汽化條件，液柱分離及再結合可能改變峰值，簡單線性式不再完整；只把平均壓力加上算得增量也會忽略反射與高程分布。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: If local pressure reaches vapor conditions, column separation and rejoining can alter peaks beyond the simple linear model. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
