       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; Q=0.25 m3/s; H=35 m; eta=0.7; Pin=rho g Q H/eta/1000=122.625 kW。適用邊界：穩定清水與總揚程，未計堵塞、含砂磨耗及備援需求，不是現場抽水計畫。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; Q=0.25 m3/s; H=35 m; eta=0.7; Pin=rho g Q H/eta/1000=122.625 kW. Applicable boundary: Steady clean-water flow and total head; blockage, abrasion and standby requirements are excluded, so this is not a site dewatering plan. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
