       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「施工湧水的抽排功率」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pumping energy for tunnel inflow” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "核對出口高程、管路摩擦與水位變化後再定總揚程，將電表輸入與實測排水量對照。以多個來水時段建立範圍，並檢查集水坑儲量變化，避免把坑內暫存水誤當穩定地下水補注。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Establish total head from outlet elevation, friction and water-level variation, then compare electrical input with measured discharge. Examine several inflow periods and sump storage changes so temporarily stored water is not mistaken for sustained groundwater recharge. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：把效率降到零點五五，計算相同排水量所需輸入功率，再另列水位上升時總揚程改變的方向，說明不能只用電費判斷抽排能力。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Reduce efficiency to zero point five five and recalculate input power at the same flow. Separately determine how changing sump level alters head and explain why electricity consumption alone cannot demonstrate dewatering capacity.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把泵額定流量直接視為實際排水能力會忽略揚程工作點；含砂或堵塞造成效率下降時，即使電流升高也不代表排水量增加，水位仍可能持續上升。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Rated pump flow does not establish discharge at the actual head. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b215-v15-31-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "核對出口高程、管路摩擦與水位變化後再定總揚程，將電表輸入與實測排水量對照。以多個來水時段建立範圍，並檢查集水坑儲量變化，避免把坑內暫存水誤當穩定地下水補注。",
         "textEn": "Establish total head from outlet elevation, friction and water-level variation, then compare electrical input with measured discharge. Examine several inflow periods and sump storage changes so temporarily stored water is not mistaken for sustained groundwater recharge.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-kurobe-owner",
          "v15s-usace-arch",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b215-v15-31-k2",
