       "instructionEn": "Separate calibration and validation years and test whether residuals still correlate with season, temperature or level. Cross-check independent instruments and references over matching periods, investigating replacement, zero resets and interpolation records before interpreting an abrupt residual jump. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：加入一個一毫米的儀器零點偏移後重新求殘差，說明如何用鄰近儀器區分共同結構位移與單一測點故障，並列出不能只靠回歸辨識的因素。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Add a one-millimetre zero shift and recalculate the residual. Explain how nearby instruments could distinguish common structural movement from a single-point fault and identify causes that regression alone cannot resolve.",
