       "objective": "從症狀倒推「水位溫度與位移殘差」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Level temperature and displacement residuals” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "以同一組資料擬合又驗證會掩蓋過度擬合；把未曾出現的高水位輸入線性模型，可能得到看似精確卻無外推根據的預測，延誤必要的人工判讀。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Fitting and validating on identical records conceals overfitting. Feeding an unprecedented high level into a linear model can produce a precise-looking prediction without extrapolation support and distract from the need for expert interpretation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：係數描述既有資料中的統計關聯，不保證每一項都是獨立因果；水位與季節高度相關時，係數可變得難以辨識。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Strong correlation between reservoir level and season can make individual parameter estimates difficult to identify even when overall fit is good.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「監測回歸殘差很小即可證明結構完全安全」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A small monitoring regression residual proves complete structural safety\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b215-v15-36-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "以同一組資料擬合又驗證會掩蓋過度擬合；把未曾出現的高水位輸入線性模型，可能得到看似精確卻無外推根據的預測，延誤必要的人工判讀。",
         "textEn": "Fitting and validating on identical records conceals overfitting. Feeding an unprecedented high level into a linear model can produce a precise-looking prediction without extrapolation support and distract from the need for expert interpretation.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-kurobe-owner",
          "v15s-usace-arch",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
