         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Qin=24 m3/s; Qout=16 m3/s; dt=1800 s; dV=(Qin-Qout)dt=14400 m3. Applicable boundary: A thirty-minute rectangular inflow pulse with fixed outlet and no overflow, without specifying real downstream operation.",
