       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「下游緩衝池的時段蓄量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Downstream buffer storage” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "將入流與出流歷線畫在同一時間軸，用曲線間面積核對蓄量增加，再檢查下一時段是否有足夠差額排回初始狀態。加入可用庫容上限時，要同時保留初始蓄量，不可從零開始假設。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Plot inlet and outlet hydrographs on one time axis and verify storage from the area between them. Check whether subsequent flow differences restore the initial state, retaining initial storage explicitly when comparing against an available-volume limit. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：設第二個相同脈衝在一小時後到達，安排中間假想出流大於入流的時段，計算恢復所需時間並說明若恢復不足會如何累積庫水。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Place a second identical pulse one hour later and specify an intervening period with outlet greater than inlet. Calculate recovery time and show how incomplete recovery accumulates water over repeated cycles.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：緩衝池連續接收多次脈衝卻沒有恢復時段，會逐步累積水量；只驗證一次脈衝容積而忽略重複週期，可能錯誤宣稱固定容積永遠足夠。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Repeated pulses without recovery accumulate storage. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
