       "objective": "從症狀倒推「下游緩衝池的時段蓄量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Downstream buffer storage” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "緩衝池連續接收多次脈衝卻沒有恢復時段，會逐步累積水量；只驗證一次脈衝容積而忽略重複週期，可能錯誤宣稱固定容積永遠足夠。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Repeated pulses without recovery accumulate storage. Checking a single pulse while ignoring the repeated cycle can falsely suggest that one fixed buffer volume will always accommodate the upstream release pattern. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：緩衝所需容積是累積差額曲線的最大與最小之差，若脈衝並非矩形，必須先積分完整歷線才能辨認容量需求。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Nonrectangular pulses require integration of the complete hydrograph before the relevant volume can be identified.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「每個放流脈衝都能重新使用緩衝池的全部容量」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Every release pulse can reuse the entire buffer capacity from scratch\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b215-v15-40-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "緩衝池連續接收多次脈衝卻沒有恢復時段，會逐步累積水量；只驗證一次脈衝容積而忽略重複週期，可能錯誤宣稱固定容積永遠足夠。",
         "textEn": "Repeated pulses without recovery accumulate storage. Checking a single pulse while ignoring the repeated cycle can falsely suggest that one fixed buffer volume will always accommodate the upstream release pattern.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-kurobe-owner",
          "v15s-usace-arch",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b215-v15-40-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-kurobe-owner",
          "v15s-usace-arch",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
