       "objective": "說明「名目停留時間與水齡」如何影響翡翠水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Nominal residence and water age” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Feitsui Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "供水水庫的體積除以平均取水率得到名目周轉時間，適合比較儲水量與需求尺度。翡翠背景下的真實水齡還取決於密度分層、入流短路及死水區，所以這個商不能代表每滴水都在庫內停留相同天數。 名目時間只包含一個平均流率，若入流沿某深度快速通過，水庫可同時存在很年輕的水團與多年未交換的深層水。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「名目停留時間與水齡」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Stored volume divided by mean withdrawal gives a nominal turnover scale useful for comparing storage and demand. Actual water age also depends on stratification, short-circuit inflows and stagnant zones, so the quotient does not describe the travel time of every parcel. A nominal time contains only one averaged flow. Rapid passage along one depth can coexist with young water parcels and deep water that exchanges much more slowly, creating a broad age distribution. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Nominal residence and water age” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：V=20000000 m3; Q=4 m3/s; tau=V/Q/86400=57.87037 day。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: V=20000000 m3; Q=4 m3/s; tau=V/Q/86400=57.87037 day.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「名目停留時間就是每滴水完全相同的水齡」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Nominal residence time is the identical age of every water parcel\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「名目停留時間與水齡」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Nominal residence and water age”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
