       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Hydrostatic horizontal projected force” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把平均水壓誤設為底部最大水壓會使合力加倍；又若把投影條帶的合力直接均分給所有拱圈，便忽略深度變化與三維承載分配，產生錯誤應力圖。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Using bottom pressure as average pressure doubles the resultant. Distributing the projected-strip force equally among every arch ring then ignores depth variation and three-dimensional load sharing, producing a misleading stress picture. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：積分可用水平分力逐點相加，也可先投影再積分，兩種路徑在靜水條件下應一致，這提供幾何模型的獨立檢核。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Under hydrostatic conditions these routes must agree, providing an independent geometric check without assuming a structural load path.",
