       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b216-v15-08-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "把平均水壓誤設為底部最大水壓會使合力加倍；又若把投影條帶的合力直接均分給所有拱圈，便忽略深度變化與三維承載分配，產生錯誤應力圖。",
         "textEn": "Using bottom pressure as average pressure doubles the resultant. Distributing the projected-strip force equally among every arch ring then ignores depth variation and three-dimensional load sharing, producing a misleading stress picture.",
         "sourceIds": [
