     "description": "本階段聚焦「拱與懸臂剛度分力」與「岩盤層面有效正向力」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Arch and cantilever load sharing\" and \"Effective force on rock bedding\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
