         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: ka=3000 MN/m; kc=2000 MN/m; F=50 MN; Fa=F ka/(ka+kc)=30 MN. Applicable boundary: Linear parallel paths with shared displacement illustrate force distribution without predicting local stresses.",
