       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Arch and cantilever load sharing” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "分別用總剛度求位移，再以兩個剛度乘位移重建分力，確認分力相加等於外力。改變其中一條路徑剛度時，同時記錄另一條分力如何增加，並說明真實壩體需要何種接縫及基礎資料。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Find displacement from total stiffness, recover each force from stiffness times displacement and verify equilibrium. Change one path stiffness while tracking the other force, then identify joint and foundation information required to move beyond this simple compatibility analogy. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
