       "objective": "從症狀倒推「拱與懸臂剛度分力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Arch and cantilever load sharing” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "認為一條力路變軟只會減少整體受力，漏掉荷載向另一力路轉移；若仍保留原分力卻改用新剛度，則位移不相容，模型已失去共同變形的基本前提。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Softening one path does not simply remove load; it redirects force into the other path. Keeping old force shares with new stiffnesses creates incompatible displacements and violates the model's central assumption. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：總剛度相加來自同位移條件，與串聯彈簧的同力條件不同；分力比恰為剛度比，只在這個線性並聯模型成立。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: The force ratio equals the stiffness ratio only within this linear parallel model, not as a universal dam property.",
