       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Effective force on rock bedding” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "先核對兆帕乘平方公尺等於兆牛頓，再以測壓管代表範圍估算壓力分布。比較排水前後孔壓與位移趨勢，注意單一測點不能代表整條層面，並另列未知的剪力需求與力矩。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Verify that megapascals times square metres produce meganewtons, then examine how piezometers represent the pressure field. Compare pressure and movement before and after drainage, noting that one point cannot characterize the entire plane and that shear demand remains unspecified. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：把均勻孔壓提高到零點四兆帕，重算摩擦抗力並畫孔壓與抗力關係，再討論何時有效正向力趨近零會使簡化接觸假設失效。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Raise uniform pore pressure to zero point four megapascals, recalculate resistance and plot its pressure dependence. Discuss why the contact assumption breaks down as effective normal force approaches zero.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把總正向力直接乘摩擦係數會高估抗力；若測壓點位在局部低壓排水孔旁，可能漏掉遠處高壓區，使看似合理的平均孔壓掩蓋層面有效力不足。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Multiplying total normal force by friction coefficient overestimates resistance. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
