       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Effective force on rock bedding” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把總正向力直接乘摩擦係數會高估抗力；若測壓點位在局部低壓排水孔旁，可能漏掉遠處高壓區，使看似合理的平均孔壓掩蓋層面有效力不足。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Multiplying total normal force by friction coefficient overestimates resistance. A sensor beside a local drain may miss a remote high-pressure zone, so an apparently reasonable average can conceal reduced effective contact force. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：孔壓作用的方向垂直層面，水壓與總正向力使用相同符號約定才能相減；孔壓上升不是直接增加摩擦的壓緊力。",
