    {
     "id": "b216-v15-s3",
     "title": "施工方法與施工階段控制",
     "titleEn": "Construction methods and stage control",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「溫度變形與接縫開度」與「密度分層與取水慣性」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Thermal movement and joint gap\" and \"Stratification and withdrawal inertia\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b216-v15-17",
       "title": "溫度變形與接縫開度：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Thermal movement and joint gap: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-feitsui-owner",
        "v15s-feitsui-history",
        "v15s-usace-arch",
        "b-src-water"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b216-v15-16"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「溫度變形與接縫開度」如何影響翡翠水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Thermal movement and joint gap” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Feitsui Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "拱壩接縫的相對開合會受到塊體溫度、拘束及水壓共同影響。自由熱伸縮長度可以當作幾何尺度，但不能直接等同實際縫寬；縫面接觸後可能傳力，張開後傳力條件又會改變，形成非線性問題。 若接縫兩側都朝縫面伸長，相對閉合量可能大於單塊伸長；若一起平移則縫寬不變，顯示絕對與相對位移不同。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「溫度變形與接縫開度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Relative joint movement responds to block temperature, restraint and hydraulic loading. Free thermal movement provides a geometric scale rather than the actual gap, because contact can transmit force while opening changes the load path and introduces nonlinearity. When both blocks expand toward a joint, relative closure can exceed one block expansion. Common translation leaves gap unchanged, demonstrating why absolute movement and relative aperture are different observables. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Thermal movement and joint gap” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=24 m; dT=15 K; dL=alpha L dT*1000=3.6 mm。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=24 m; dT=15 K; dL=alpha L dT*1000=3.6 mm.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「單塊自由伸長必然等於接縫實際開口增量」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Free expansion of one block necessarily equals actual joint opening\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「溫度變形與接縫開度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Thermal movement and joint gap”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b216-v15-17-k1",
         "title": "溫度變形與接縫開度",
         "titleEn": "Thermal movement and joint gap",
         "text": "拱壩接縫的相對開合會受到塊體溫度、拘束及水壓共同影響。自由熱伸縮長度可以當作幾何尺度，但不能直接等同實際縫寬；縫面接觸後可能傳力，張開後傳力條件又會改變，形成非線性問題。",
         "textEn": "Relative joint movement responds to block temperature, restraint and hydraulic loading. Free thermal movement provides a geometric scale rather than the actual gap, because contact can transmit force while opening changes the load path and introduces nonlinearity.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-feitsui-owner",
          "v15s-feitsui-history",
          "v15s-usace-arch",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        },
