         "id": "b216-v15-17-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：單塊自由伸長必然等於接縫實際開口增量 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Free expansion of one block necessarily equals actual joint opening Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-feitsui-owner",
          "v15s-feitsui-history",
          "v15s-usace-arch",
