       "objective": "說明「密度分層與取水慣性」如何影響翡翠水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Stratification and withdrawal inertia” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Feitsui Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "水庫冷暖水層的密度差提供恢復浮力，取水流速則會拉動界面。以約化重力及密度福祿數比較慣性與浮力，可討論選擇性取水是否容易擾動水層，但實際取水形狀、界面厚度與三維流場仍不可省略。 約化重力只保留密度差造成的浮力尺度，不能用完整重力取代；其平方根與水深共同形成可與流速比較的特徵速度。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「密度分層與取水慣性」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Density contrast between warm and cool layers supplies restoring buoyancy while withdrawal velocity disturbs the interface. Reduced gravity and a densimetric Froude number compare inertia with buoyancy, without resolving intake geometry, interface thickness or the three-dimensional withdrawal field. Reduced gravity retains the buoyancy associated with density difference and cannot be replaced by full gravitational acceleration. Combined with depth under a square root, it produces a characteristic velocity comparable with withdrawal speed. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Stratification and withdrawal inertia” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：g=9.81 m/s2; drho=2 kg/m3; rho=1000 kg/m3; h=8 m; v=0.2 m/s; Fr=v/sqrt(g drho h/rho)=0.50482。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: g=9.81 m/s2; drho=2 kg/m3; rho=1000 kg/m3; h=8 m; v=0.2 m/s; Fr=v/sqrt(g drho h/rho)=0.50482.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「密度福祿數有適用所有取水口的固定允許值」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Densimetric Froude number has one fixed permitted value for all intakes\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「密度分層與取水慣性」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Stratification and withdrawal inertia”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b216-v15-21-k1",
         "title": "密度分層與取水慣性",
         "titleEn": "Stratification and withdrawal inertia",
         "text": "水庫冷暖水層的密度差提供恢復浮力，取水流速則會拉動界面。以約化重力及密度福祿數比較慣性與浮力，可討論選擇性取水是否容易擾動水層，但實際取水形狀、界面厚度與三維流場仍不可省略。",
         "textEn": "Density contrast between warm and cool layers supplies restoring buoyancy while withdrawal velocity disturbs the interface. Reduced gravity and a densimetric Froude number compare inertia with buoyancy, without resolving intake geometry, interface thickness or the three-dimensional withdrawal field.",
         "sourceIds": [
