         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: g=9.81 m/s2; drho=2 kg/m3; rho=1000 kg/m3; h=8 m; v=0.2 m/s; Fr=v/sqrt(g drho h/rho)=0.50482. Applicable boundary: A small-density-difference two-layer approximation with hypothetical depth scale, not an equipment threshold.",
