       "instructionEn": "Integrate hourly inlet and outlet flows for volume, then use neighboring elevation-area data to estimate level and compare with the fixed-area result. Retain initial level and survey date, checking rainfall, lateral inflow and measurement timing in the balance. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：把水面積改成隨水位增加的兩段值，分段解同一體積的水位增量，再比較固定面積近似的高估或低估方向，註明地形曲線的不確定性。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Use two surface-area segments that increase with elevation, solve the level change for the same volume and determine whether constant area overestimates or underestimates it, retaining uncertainty in the geometry curve.",
