       "objective": "從症狀倒推「颱風入流與短時水位」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Storm inflow and short term level” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "只用暴雨峰值流量乘整場歷時會放大蓄量；反之以日平均淹沒短時洪峰，可能低估最大水位。沒有初始水位的增加量無法判斷剩餘空間是否足夠。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Multiplying a storm peak by the whole event overstates volume, while daily averaging can suppress the maximum level. A level increment without the initial elevation cannot establish how much storage space remains. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
