       "objective": "說明「水躍共軛水深」如何影響翡翠水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Hydraulic jump conjugate depths” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Feitsui Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "溢流後的高速淺水若轉成低速深水，可透過水躍耗散能量。矩形渠道的動量平衡給出上下游共軛水深，這不代表任意尾水都能穩住水躍；實際消能池還受床面、空氣摻混及側向流動影響。 躍前與躍後流量相同但速度與水深改變，動量函數相等不代表比能相等，兩斷面的比能差才是耗散的量。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「水躍共軛水深」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A hydraulic jump converts fast shallow flow into slower deeper flow while dissipating energy. Rectangular-channel momentum gives conjugate depths, but arbitrary tailwater will not necessarily hold the jump in place, and actual basins involve aeration, bed details and lateral effects. Discharge is conserved across the jump while depth and velocity change. Equal momentum functions do not imply equal specific energies; their specific-energy difference quantifies the mechanical energy dissipated in the transition. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Hydraulic jump conjugate depths” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：y1=1 m; v1=8 m/s; g=9.81 m/s2; Fr1=v1/sqrt(g y1); y2=y1(sqrt(1+8Fr1^2)-1)/2=3.14663 m。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: y1=1 m; v1=8 m/s; g=9.81 m/s2; Fr1=v1/sqrt(g y1); y2=y1(sqrt(1+8Fr1^2)-1)/2=3.14663 m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「水躍同時保持動量函數與機械比能不變」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A hydraulic jump conserves both momentum function and mechanical specific energy\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「水躍共軛水深」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Hydraulic jump conjugate depths”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
