       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「水躍共軛水深」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Hydraulic jump conjugate depths” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "先用連續方程求下游平均速度，再核對兩斷面的動量函數接近相等，最後比較比能以確認能量下降。水槽觀察應記錄水躍位置與尾水變化，不能只量一張照片中的水深。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Use continuity to recover downstream velocity, check equality of momentum functions and compare specific energy to confirm dissipation. In a flume, record jump location as tailwater changes rather than relying on depths captured in a single photograph. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將入口速度改為六公尺每秒，重新求共軛水深和出口速度，說明為何水躍高度改變，並列出需要尾水曲線才能判斷的定位問題。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Reduce inlet velocity to six metres per second, recalculate conjugate depth and downstream velocity, and explain the height change. Identify jump-location questions that require a tailwater relationship.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把共軛水深當成保證穩定水躍的尾水設定，可能忽略掃出或淹沒；若又把耗能量當作局部壓力，將無法辨識床面脈動、氣蝕與沖刷的不同機制。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A conjugate depth does not guarantee a stable jump; sweep-out or submergence may occur. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
