         "text": "先用連續方程求下游平均速度，再核對兩斷面的動量函數接近相等，最後比較比能以確認能量下降。水槽觀察應記錄水躍位置與尾水變化，不能只量一張照片中的水深。",
         "textEn": "Use continuity to recover downstream velocity, check equality of momentum functions and compare specific energy to confirm dissipation. In a flume, record jump location as tailwater changes rather than relying on depths captured in a single photograph.",
