         "textEn": "Discharge times suspended-solids mass concentration gives a solids delivery rate linking catchment erosion to reservoir storage. Turbidity is an optical response rather than mass concentration, so it cannot be multiplied directly by flow without a site-specific conversion and its uncertainty.",
