         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Q=12 m3/s; C=0.35 kg/m3; dt=7200 s; M=Q C dt=30240 kg. Applicable boundary: Constant representative concentration and flow for two hours; suspended load only, excluding bed load and reservoir deposition.",
