        "explanation": "同時採集斷面流量與混合代表水樣，以過濾乾燥法取得質量濃度，再用濁度建立有誤差範圍的輔助關係。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。",
        "explanationEn": "Pair cross-section discharge with representative composite samples, determine mass concentration by filtration and drying, and use turbidity only through an uncertain calibration. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."
