       "objective": "說明「原水保守溶質混合」如何影響翡翠水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Conservative raw water mixing” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Feitsui Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "不同深度原水混合後，保守溶質濃度由流量加權質量守恆求得。這個概念能教導取水來源比例的重要性，但濁度、藻類與會反應的物質不一定線性混合，不能把保守示蹤物公式套到所有水質指標。 質量守恆以溶質通量為基礎，濃度本身不能直接相加；每股流量權重的總和必須等於一，混合濃度應介於兩來源之間。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「原水保守溶質混合」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A conservative dissolved constituent mixes according to flow-weighted mass balance, illustrating the importance of source proportions. Turbidity, algae and reactive substances need not mix linearly, so the tracer equation is not a universal relationship for every water-quality indicator. Mass conservation applies to solute flux rather than concentration alone. Flow weights must sum to unity, and a conservative two-source blend should lie between the source concentrations when both flows are positive. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Conservative raw water mixing” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Q1=3 m3/s; C1=20 mg/L; Q2=2 m3/s; C2=50 mg/L; Cm=(Q1C1+Q2C2)/(Q1+Q2)=32 mg/L。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Q1=3 m3/s; C1=20 mg/L; Q2=2 m3/s; C2=50 mg/L; Cm=(Q1C1+Q2C2)/(Q1+Q2)=32 mg/L.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「兩股流量不同時仍可把濃度直接取算術平均」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Two concentrations can be averaged arithmetically even when source flows differ\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「原水保守溶質混合」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Conservative raw water mixing”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
