       "objective": "從症狀倒推「原水保守溶質混合」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Conservative raw water mixing” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "拿濁度直接做保守濃度混合可能因顆粒絮凝而失準；若取樣位置尚未混勻，單點量值會偏向某股來源，即使整體質量守恆正確仍看似不符合公式。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Applying conservative mixing to turbidity can fail because particles flocculate. Before complete mixing, a single sample may favor one source, appearing to violate the equation even when the overall mass balance is correct. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：質量守恆以溶質通量為基礎，濃度本身不能直接相加；每股流量權重的總和必須等於一，混合濃度應介於兩來源之間。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Flow weights must sum to unity, and a conservative two-source blend should lie between the source concentrations when both flows are positive.",
