         "title": "分層心層的串聯滲流",
         "titleEn": "Series seepage through core layers",
         "text": "中央心層靠低滲透材料限制穿壩水量，不同材料沿流向排列時，每層通過相同流量但消耗不同水頭。等效滲透係數因此是厚度加權的調和平均，較不透水的一層可能支配阻力。",
         "textEn": "A central core limits flow with low-permeability material. Layers arranged along the flow direction carry the same discharge but consume different head losses, giving a thickness-weighted harmonic equivalent permeability.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-shihmen-owner",
          "v15s-shihmen-facilities",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
