         "text": "誤解：沿流向串聯材料的係數應直接取算術平均 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Permeabilities of layers in series should simply be averaged arithmetically Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
