       "title": "分層心層的串聯滲流：失效診斷",
       "titleEn": "Series seepage through core layers: failure diagnosis",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-shihmen-owner",
        "v15s-shihmen-facilities",
        "b-src-water"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b217-v15-03"
       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「分層心層的串聯滲流」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Series seepage through core layers” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把兩層係數直接平均會低估低滲透層的控制作用；但若低滲透層已有裂縫，仍堅持完整材料模型又會低估集中流量，兩種錯誤方向並不相同。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Arithmetic averaging underestimates control by the less permeable layer. Conversely, retaining an intact-material model after cracking can understate concentrated flow, so the two modeling errors do not share the same direction. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：這與平行流路的算術平均不同，也不能把分層公式套到裂縫形成的集中流，因為後者改變流路與有效截面。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: This differs from parallel-path averaging and does not describe a crack carrying concentrated flow, because that feature changes both geometry and the effective flow area.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「沿流向串聯材料的係數應直接取算術平均」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Permeabilities of layers in series should simply be averaged arithmetically\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b217-v15-04-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "把兩層係數直接平均會低估低滲透層的控制作用；但若低滲透層已有裂縫，仍堅持完整材料模型又會低估集中流量，兩種錯誤方向並不相同。",
         "textEn": "Arithmetic averaging underestimates control by the less permeable layer. Conversely, retaining an intact-material model after cracking can understate concentrated flow, so the two modeling errors do not share the same direction.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-shihmen-owner",
          "v15s-shihmen-facilities",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b217-v15-04-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-shihmen-owner",
          "v15s-shihmen-facilities",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "在「分層心層的串聯滲流」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？",
        "questionEn": "When \"Series seepage through core layers\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?",
        "options": [
         "所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。",
         "把兩層係數直接平均會低估低滲透層的控制作用；但若低滲透層已有裂縫，仍堅持完整材料模型又會低估集中流量，兩種錯誤方向並不相同。",
         "只要一個粒徑比值很小就可保證濾層合格"
