      {
       "id": "b217-v15-05",
       "title": "濾層粒徑比例篩查：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Filter gradation ratio screening: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-shihmen-owner",
        "v15s-shihmen-facilities",
        "b-src-water"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b217-v15-04"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「濾層粒徑比例篩查」如何影響石門水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Filter gradation ratio screening” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Shihmen Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "心層旁的濾層既要容許水排出，也要阻止細料隨流失去。粒徑分位數比例可作初步相容性討論，但其物理目的與材料分布形狀都要清楚。單一比例沒有描述間斷級配、塑性細料或施工離析，因此本課只計算幾何比值，不提供通用驗收門檻或取代專門濾層試驗。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「濾層粒徑比例篩查」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A filter beside the core must pass water while retaining soil particles. Ratios of grain-size percentiles support preliminary compatibility discussion only when their physical purpose and the full gradation shape are understood. One ratio does not capture gap grading, plastic fines or construction segregation, so the calculation reports geometry rather than a universal acceptance threshold and does not replace a dedicated filter test. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Filter gradation ratio screening” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：D15filter=0.7 mm; d85base=0.25 mm; ratio=D15filter/d85base=2.8。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: D15filter=0.7 mm; d85base=0.25 mm; ratio=D15filter/d85base=2.8.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「只要一個粒徑比值很小就可保證濾層合格」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A sufficiently small single grain-size ratio guarantees filter acceptance\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「濾層粒徑比例篩查」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Filter gradation ratio screening”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
