         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: rhoWet=2100 kg/m3; w=0.12 kg/kg; rhoDry=rhoWet/(1+w)=1875 kg/m3. Applicable boundary: Water content uses dry-solid mass and density uses the original wet specimen volume, without oversize correction.",
