       "objective": "從症狀倒推「含水率與壓實乾密度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Water content and compacted density” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把百分之十二直接代入十二會得到不合理低密度；若以濕土質量當含水率分母卻仍用此式，也會系統性偏差，使壓實紀錄看似精確但定義不一致。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Entering twelve instead of zero point one two produces an implausible low density. Using wet mass as the water-content denominator while retaining this equation creates a systematic definition error in otherwise precise-looking records. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：相同乾密度也不代表相同滲透性，因為土的組成、含水狀態、壓實能量與顆粒排列仍可能不同。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Even equal dry density does not ensure equal permeability, since composition, moisture condition, compactive effort and particle arrangement may still differ substantially between specimens or placed layers.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「含水率百分之十二可直接以十二代入換算式」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Twelve percent water content can be entered as twelve in the conversion\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
