       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Drawdown and pore pressure lag” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Shihmen Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "水庫水位下降會減少上游坡面外側水壓，但心層與土體內孔壓未必同速消散，造成內外支撐條件改變。有效正向力計算能展示孔壓滯後對摩擦來源的影響；真正快速降水位問題還需土體不排水強度、滲流時程及滑動幾何，不能僅用一個力值定安全。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「快速降水位與孔壓滯後」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Falling reservoir level reduces external water support while pore pressure within embankment material may dissipate more slowly. Effective normal force illustrates how retained pressure changes the source of friction. A true rapid-drawdown assessment also requires drainage timescale, appropriate soil strength and slip geometry; a single force calculation cannot establish stability or represent the entire upstream slope during rapidly changing hydraulic and drainage conditions. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Drawdown and pore pressure lag” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：N=900 kN; u=45 kPa; A=12 m2; Neff=N-uA=360 kN。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: N=900 kN; u=45 kPa; A=12 m2; Neff=N-uA=360 kN.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「庫水位下降時土內孔壓一定立即等幅下降」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Internal pore pressure always falls immediately by the same amount as reservoir level\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
