       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「快速降水位與孔壓滯後」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Drawdown and pore pressure lag” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "同步繪製庫水位與坡內測壓管歷線，比較峰值及回落的時間差。量測點須標明高程和濾管位置，再將多點孔壓分布沿假想面積積分，檢查均勻孔壓近似是否掩蓋局部高壓。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Plot reservoir level and slope piezometer histories together to compare peak and recession timing. Identify sensor elevations and screen positions, then integrate multiple pressures over the hypothetical plane to test whether a uniform approximation hides locally retained pressure. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：另設孔壓只降低十千帕，重算有效力並比較完全排水的極端，指出還需要哪些強度試驗與時程資料，才能把受力示範延伸到坡面穩定分析。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Reduce pore pressure by only ten kilopascals, recalculate effective force and compare with a fully drained extreme. Identify strength tests and time-history data needed before extending the illustration into slope stability analysis.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：以當日庫水位直接替代土體孔壓，會錯誤假設內外同步排水；水位已低但孔壓仍高時，這種代換可能高估有效力而低估降水位後的暫態不利狀態。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Replacing internal pore pressure with that day's reservoir level assumes instantaneous drainage. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
