         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "同步繪製庫水位與坡內測壓管歷線，比較峰值及回落的時間差。量測點須標明高程和濾管位置，再將多點孔壓分布沿假想面積積分，檢查均勻孔壓近似是否掩蓋局部高壓。",
         "textEn": "Plot reservoir level and slope piezometer histories together to compare peak and recession timing. Identify sensor elevations and screen positions, then integrate multiple pressures over the hypothetical plane to test whether a uniform approximation hides locally retained pressure.",
