       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「快速降水位與孔壓滯後」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Drawdown and pore pressure lag” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "以當日庫水位直接替代土體孔壓，會錯誤假設內外同步排水；水位已低但孔壓仍高時，這種代換可能高估有效力而低估降水位後的暫態不利狀態。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Replacing internal pore pressure with that day's reservoir level assumes instantaneous drainage. When the reservoir has fallen but soil pressure remains high, this substitution overstates effective force and hides an adverse transient condition. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：有效正向力計算能展示孔壓滯後對摩擦來源的影響；真正快速降水位問題還需土體不排水強度、滲流時程及滑動幾何，不能僅用一個力值定安全。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: A true rapid-drawdown assessment also requires drainage timescale, appropriate soil strength and slip geometry; a single force calculation cannot establish stability or represent the entire upstream slope during rapidly changing hydraulic and drainage conditions.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「庫水位下降時土內孔壓一定立即等幅下降」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Internal pore pressure always falls immediately by the same amount as reservoir level\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b217-v15-16-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "以當日庫水位直接替代土體孔壓，會錯誤假設內外同步排水；水位已低但孔壓仍高時，這種代換可能高估有效力而低估降水位後的暫態不利狀態。",
         "textEn": "Replacing internal pore pressure with that day's reservoir level assumes instantaneous drainage. When the reservoir has fallen but soil pressure remains high, this substitution overstates effective force and hides an adverse transient condition.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-shihmen-owner",
          "v15s-shihmen-facilities",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
