       "objective": "說明「地震慣性力的受力帳」如何影響石門水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Seismic inertia force bookkeeping” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Shihmen Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "地震加速度使壩體質量產生慣性力，簡化水平係數乘重量可建立靜力等效的受力帳。這個係數無因次，不應與以公尺每秒平方表示的加速度混用。土石壩實際反應還包括動態放大、孔壓增加、永久位移及材料非線性，所以等效力只是受力討論的初步起點。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「地震慣性力的受力帳」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Earthquake acceleration produces inertial force in the embankment mass. A dimensionless horizontal coefficient times weight gives a static-equivalent force for bookkeeping and must not be confused with acceleration in metres per second squared. Actual response also involves amplification, pore-pressure generation, permanent displacement and nonlinear soil behavior, making this equivalent force a starting point rather than a complete site-specific seismic performance assessment. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Seismic inertia force bookkeeping” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：kh=0.15; W=24000 kN; Fh=kh W=3600 kN。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: kh=0.15; W=24000 kN; Fh=kh W=3600 kN.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「等效水平力計算完成就能排除地震永久變形」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Calculating equivalent horizontal force rules out permanent seismic deformation\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
