       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Seismic inertia force bookkeeping” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "先由質量乘重力驗證重量單位，再用加速度等於係數乘重力的另一條路徑重算慣性力。畫出作用位置及方向，將孔壓與材料強度列成獨立問題，不把單一係數當作整段地震歷時。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Verify weight from mass times gravity, then independently recover inertia using acceleration equal to the coefficient times gravity. Draw force location and direction, treating pore pressure and strength as separate issues rather than representing a whole earthquake by one coefficient. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：用係數零點一與零點二比較慣性力，保持同一重量並解釋線性比例，再列出地震頻率內容與土層反應為何不能由這兩個力值推得。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Compare inertia for coefficients of zero point one and zero point two at the same weight. Explain the linear scaling and why neither earthquake frequency content nor soil response follows from these force values.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把已是重量的量再乘重力會多出一次重力因子；只檢查等效水平力而忽略變形累積，則可能錯把靜力平衡當成壩頂不沉陷或材料不損傷的證據。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Multiplying weight by gravity again introduces an extra gravity factor. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
