       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「地震慣性力的受力帳」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Seismic inertia force bookkeeping” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把已是重量的量再乘重力會多出一次重力因子；只檢查等效水平力而忽略變形累積，則可能錯把靜力平衡當成壩頂不沉陷或材料不損傷的證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Multiplying weight by gravity again introduces an extra gravity factor. Checking equivalent force alone while ignoring accumulated deformation can falsely turn static equilibrium into evidence of no crest settlement or material damage. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：土石壩實際反應還包括動態放大、孔壓增加、永久位移及材料非線性，所以等效力只是受力討論的初步起點。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Actual response also involves amplification, pore-pressure generation, permanent displacement and nonlinear soil behavior, making this equivalent force a starting point rather than a complete site-specific seismic performance assessment.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「等效水平力計算完成就能排除地震永久變形」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Calculating equivalent horizontal force rules out permanent seismic deformation\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b217-v15-20-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "把已是重量的量再乘重力會多出一次重力因子；只檢查等效水平力而忽略變形累積，則可能錯把靜力平衡當成壩頂不沉陷或材料不損傷的證據。",
         "textEn": "Multiplying weight by gravity again introduces an extra gravity factor. Checking equivalent force alone while ignoring accumulated deformation can falsely turn static equilibrium into evidence of no crest settlement or material damage.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-shihmen-owner",
          "v15s-shihmen-facilities",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
