       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Sediment budget and occupied storage” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Min=1800000 kg; Mout=600000 kg; rhoDry=1200 kg/m3; Vdep=(Min-Mout)/rhoDry=1000 m3。適用邊界：一時段乾固體收支閉合且密度均勻，未計庫岸崩塌與再懸浮交換。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Min=1800000 kg; Mout=600000 kg; rhoDry=1200 kg/m3; Vdep=(Min-Mout)/rhoDry=1000 m3. Applicable boundary: Closed dry-solids balance for one interval with uniform density, excluding bank failures and resuspension exchanges. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：將入出庫懸砂與可觀測推移質分開估計，核對每筆質量是乾重還是濕重。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Estimate incoming and outgoing suspended and observable bed loads separately, identifying dry versus wet mass.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
       "checkEn": "Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.",
