         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Min=1800000 kg; Mout=600000 kg; rhoDry=1200 kg/m3; Vdep=(Min-Mout)/rhoDry=1000 m3. Applicable boundary: Closed dry-solids balance for one interval with uniform density, excluding bank failures and resuspension exchanges.",
