         "text": "將入出庫懸砂與可觀測推移質分開估計，核對每筆質量是乾重還是濕重。以沉積取芯取得乾容重，再與重複水深測量的體積差比較，保留兩者的不確定度及不同測區範圍。",
         "textEn": "Estimate incoming and outgoing suspended and observable bed loads separately, identifying dry versus wet mass. Obtain dry bulk density from sediment cores and compare with repeated bathymetric volume differences, retaining uncertainty and differences in surveyed coverage.",
