       "objective": "從症狀倒推「泥砂收支與占容轉換」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Sediment budget and occupied storage” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把濕泥密度當乾容重會低估固體對應占容；若排砂輸出與入流統計期間不同，又可能出現虛假的負沉積，誤認庫容已恢復而其實只是資料不同步。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Using wet-mud density as dry bulk density understates occupied volume. Mismatched inlet and outlet accounting periods can create false negative deposition, suggesting recovered capacity when the records are merely asynchronous. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：乾容重會隨顆粒組成、壓密與時間改變，因此每年相同固體質量不必占據相同體積，庫容測量仍是重要獨立證據。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Bulk density changes with grading, consolidation and age, so equal annual solid masses need not occupy equal volumes; bathymetric capacity surveys remain an important independent line of evidence.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「入庫泥砂總質量全部等於當期永久庫容損失」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"All incoming sediment mass equals permanent capacity loss in that period\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b217-v15-24-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "把濕泥密度當乾容重會低估固體對應占容；若排砂輸出與入流統計期間不同，又可能出現虛假的負沉積，誤認庫容已恢復而其實只是資料不同步。",
         "textEn": "Using wet-mud density as dry bulk density understates occupied volume. Mismatched inlet and outlet accounting periods can create false negative deposition, suggesting recovered capacity when the records are merely asynchronous.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-shihmen-owner",
          "v15s-shihmen-facilities",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b217-v15-24-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-shihmen-owner",
          "v15s-shihmen-facilities",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        }
