       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Local intake orifice discharge” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以量水槽或校準流量計求實際流量，再對多個水頭反算係數，檢查是否維持穩定。記錄孔口中心高程與下游水位，若變成淹沒出流，應重新定義壓差而不是沿用自由出流水頭。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure actual discharge using a calibrated device, infer the coefficient over several heads and test its consistency. Record opening-center elevation and downstream level; if submerged, redefine the pressure difference instead of retaining the free-discharge head. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將水頭增為原值四倍，預測並計算流量倍率，再另列流量係數不變的假設，說明若下游水位同時上升，應如何改寫有效水頭。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Increase head fourfold and calculate the discharge multiplier, explicitly retaining constant coefficient. Explain how the effective head must be rewritten if downstream water level rises at the same time.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把水面到孔口底部的距離當中心水頭會造成幾何偏差；出口被尾水淹沒後仍用單側水深，則高估可用壓差，導致流量與質量平衡同時失準。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Referencing head to the opening bottom instead of its center introduces geometric bias. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
