       "objective": "從症狀倒推「取水孔口的局部流量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Local intake orifice discharge” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把水面到孔口底部的距離當中心水頭會造成幾何偏差；出口被尾水淹沒後仍用單側水深，則高估可用壓差，導致流量與質量平衡同時失準。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Referencing head to the opening bottom instead of its center introduces geometric bias. After submergence, using upstream depth alone overstates the available pressure difference and corrupts both discharge and mass balance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：係數與開口形狀、邊緣及上下游條件有關，不能把另一設備的係數直接搬來代表石門現地真實取水口的校準結果。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: That coefficient depends on edge shape, geometry and upstream and downstream conditions, so a value assumed here cannot be transferred directly to a real Shihmen intake or another differently shaped installed structure.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「孔口流量與水頭成正比而不是平方根關係」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Orifice discharge is proportional to head rather than its square root\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b217-v15-28-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "把水面到孔口底部的距離當中心水頭會造成幾何偏差；出口被尾水淹沒後仍用單側水深，則高估可用壓差，導致流量與質量平衡同時失準。",
         "textEn": "Referencing head to the opening bottom instead of its center introduces geometric bias. After submergence, using upstream depth alone overstates the available pressure difference and corrupts both discharge and mass balance.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-shihmen-owner",
          "v15s-shihmen-facilities",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b217-v15-28-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
