       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Solids export during sluicing” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Q=9 m3/s; C=8 kg/m3; dt=2400 s; M=Q C dt/1000=172.8 tonne。適用邊界：流量與代表濃度固定四十分鐘，質量為乾固體，不宣稱沉積全被移除。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Q=9 m3/s; C=8 kg/m3; dt=2400 s; M=Q C dt/1000=172.8 tonne. Applicable boundary: Constant representative discharge and concentration for forty minutes; mass is dry solids, without claiming complete deposit removal. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：採樣與流量計必須共用時間區間，對洪砂脈衝增加取樣密度，並標示截面代表方式。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Synchronize sampling and discharge intervals, increase sampling density during pulses and state cross-section representation.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
       "checkEn": "Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.",
       "knowledge": [
