         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Q=9 m3/s; C=8 kg/m3; dt=2400 s; M=Q C dt/1000=172.8 tonne. Applicable boundary: Constant representative discharge and concentration for forty minutes; mass is dry solids, without claiming complete deposit removal.",
