         "id": "b217-v15-31-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "採樣與流量計必須共用時間區間，對洪砂脈衝增加取樣密度，並標示截面代表方式。把輸出質量與對應放流水量同時報告，再與排砂前後地形比較，避免把輸砂通過誤認為庫底完全清除。",
         "textEn": "Synchronize sampling and discharge intervals, increase sampling density during pulses and state cross-section representation. Report exported mass alongside water volume and compare with before-and-after bed surveys rather than equating transported material with complete bed clearance.",
