      {
       "id": "b217-v15-32",
       "title": "排砂時段的固體輸出：失效診斷",
       "titleEn": "Solids export during sluicing: failure diagnosis",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-shihmen-owner",
        "v15s-shihmen-facilities",
        "b-src-water"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b217-v15-31"
       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「排砂時段的固體輸出」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Solids export during sluicing” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "濃度峰值若只維持短時間卻被乘整段放流歷時，會誇大排砂量；取樣管堵塞則可能反向低估粗粒部分，讓看似穩定的濃度紀錄缺少主要固體。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Multiplying a brief concentration peak by the entire release duration exaggerates export. A blocked sampler can instead miss coarse material, producing a smooth-looking concentration record that omits important solids. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：高濃度時顆粒交互作用可能改變流變，簡單稀薄懸浮假設及採樣代表性與乾重定義都需要仔細檢查。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: At high concentrations, particle interaction may alter rheology, so dilute-suspension assumptions and sampling representativeness need examination before the simple mass calculation is interpreted as operational performance.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「只要放流水量大就能保證排出的泥砂很多」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A large water release guarantees a large exported sediment mass\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b217-v15-32-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "濃度峰值若只維持短時間卻被乘整段放流歷時，會誇大排砂量；取樣管堵塞則可能反向低估粗粒部分，讓看似穩定的濃度紀錄缺少主要固體。",
         "textEn": "Multiplying a brief concentration peak by the entire release duration exaggerates export. A blocked sampler can instead miss coarse material, producing a smooth-looking concentration record that omits important solids.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-shihmen-owner",
          "v15s-shihmen-facilities",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b217-v15-32-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-shihmen-owner",
          "v15s-shihmen-facilities",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "在「排砂時段的固體輸出」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？",
        "questionEn": "When \"Solids export during sluicing\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?",
        "options": [
         "補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。",
         "每次脈衝都可以重新使用整座後池總容量",
         "濃度峰值若只維持短時間卻被乘整段放流歷時，會誇大排砂量；取樣管堵塞則可能反向低估粗粒部分，讓看似穩定的濃度紀錄缺少主要固體。"
        ],
        "optionsEn": [
         "Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.",
         "Every new pulse can reuse the entire gross afterbay capacity",
         "Multiplying a brief concentration peak by the entire release duration exaggerates export."
        ],
        "answer": 2,
        "explanation": "濃度峰值若只維持短時間卻被乘整段放流歷時，會誇大排砂量；取樣管堵塞則可能反向低估粗粒部分，讓看似穩定的濃度紀錄缺少主要固體。 需以量測區分可能原因。",
        "explanationEn": "Multiplying a brief concentration peak by the entire release duration exaggerates export. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."
       },
       "unit": 8,
       "unitFacet": "failure"
      }
     ]
