       "objective": "說明「後池吸收放流變化」如何影響石門水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Afterbay absorption of release changes” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Shihmen Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "後池可暫存上游放流與下游需求之間的差額，降低短時流量波動傳遞。它不是增加總水量的來源，所有暫存都必須在後續時段釋放或保留成庫存。比較容量時應使用可用水位範圍對應的容積，而非整座後池總容量，並明確保留時段開始時的初始蓄量位置。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「後池吸收放流變化」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "An afterbay temporarily stores the difference between upstream release and downstream demand, reducing transmission of short-term fluctuations. It creates no additional water; stored volume must later be released or remain as inventory. Capacity comparison must use the volume available within the relevant level range rather than gross basin capacity, while retaining the initial storage position and the duration of subsequent recovery periods. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Afterbay absorption of release changes” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Qin=18 m3/s; Qout=11 m3/s; dt=2700 s; dV=(Qin-Qout)dt=18900 m3。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Qin=18 m3/s; Qout=11 m3/s; dt=2700 s; dV=(Qin-Qout)dt=18900 m3.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「每次脈衝都可以重新使用整座後池總容量」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Every new pulse can reuse the entire gross afterbay capacity\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「後池吸收放流變化」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
