         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Qin=18 m3/s; Qout=11 m3/s; dt=2700 s; dV=(Qin-Qout)dt=18900 m3. Applicable boundary: Constant imbalance for forty-five minutes with other inflows and evaporation omitted, without specifying actual afterbay capacity.",
