         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "由水位容積曲線計算時段起迄蓄量，與流量差積分互相比較，檢查流量計延遲及回水影響。把下一時段回復所需的出入流差也畫上圖，確認緩衝不是靠不斷累積水量維持。",
         "textEn": "Calculate endpoint storage from the level-volume curve and compare with integrated flow imbalance, checking meter lag and backwater effects. Plot the subsequent imbalance needed for recovery to confirm that buffering does not depend on indefinitely accumulating water.",
         "sourceIds": [
