         "text": "設定可用空間只有兩萬立方公尺，計算一次脈衝後剩餘空間，再增加第二次脈衝並求中間必須恢復的水量，將初始狀態畫入水量帳。",
         "textEn": "Set available space to twenty thousand cubic metres, calculate the remainder after one pulse and add a second pulse. Determine the intervening recovery volume and include the initial state explicitly in the account.",
