         "id": "b217-v15-38-k1",
         "title": "定量模型",
         "titleEn": "Quantitative model",
         "text": "原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Q=0.004 m3/s; dh=20 m; G=Q/dh=0.0002 m2/s。適用邊界：單一路徑近似穩態，排除降雨脈衝與出口回水；不是滲透係數本身。",
         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Q=0.004 m3/s; dh=20 m; G=Q/dh=0.0002 m2/s. Applicable boundary: One approximately steady path excluding rainfall pulses and outlet backwater; conductance is not permeability itself.",
         "sourceIds": [
