   "workedExample": {
    "title": "原創假想算例與邊界",
    "titleEn": "Original hypothetical example and boundaries",
    "text": "假想兩級發電共用每秒十五立方公尺流量，淨水頭為二百及一百二十公尺、效率為零點九及零點八八，總功率由各級功率相加得四十二點零二六兆瓦。第二級效率下降到零點八時總量成四十點六一三四兆瓦，不能把兩級流量相加後再乘總水頭。另一個假想鋼管半徑一點二公尺、壁厚零點零二公尺、內壓二兆帕，薄壁環向應力為一百二十兆帕；此式屬受拉管壁，不是受壓拱壩的設計應力。 核驗：rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; Q=15 m3/s; H1=200 m; H2=120 m; eta1=0.9; eta2=0.88; P=rho g Q(H1 eta1+H2 eta2)/1e6=42.02604 MW。分別畫每級進出口能量線，檢查中間尾水是否也是下一級上游基準。以各級電表與同時段流量比對，將中間蓄水變化另外入帳，再核對總電能沒有超過共同水流的可用位能。",
    "textEn": "Assume two generating stages carry the same 15 m3/s, with net heads 200 and 120 m and efficiencies 0.9 and 0.88. Adding stage powers gives 42.026 MW. If the second efficiency falls to 0.8, the total becomes 40.6134 MW; adding the two discharges and multiplying by combined head would double count water. A separate hypothetical steel pipe with radius 1.2 m, thickness 0.02 m and pressure 2 MPa has thin-wall hoop tension of 120 MPa. This pipe equation describes tension and is not an arch-dam compressive stress calculation. Verification: Draw inlet and outlet energy lines for each stage and check how intermediate tailwater connects to the next inlet. Compare stage electrical meters with synchronized flow, account separately for intermediate storage and verify that total energy stays below the water's available potential.",
    "assumptions": "數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。",
    "assumptionsEn": "Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.",
