     "description": "本階段聚焦「梯級發電的能量相加」與「高壩底壓與水推力」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Energy addition across a cascade\" and \"Base pressure and water resultant\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b218-v15-01",
       "title": "梯級發電的能量相加：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Energy addition across a cascade: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
