      {
       "id": "b218-v15-05",
       "title": "高壩底壓與水推力：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Base pressure and water resultant: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v11x-techi",
        "v15s-deji-wra",
        "v15s-usace-arch",
        "b-src-water"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b218-v15-04"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「高壩底壓與水推力」如何影響德基水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Base pressure and water resultant” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Deji Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "德基高拱壩背景可用來區分局部壓力與整體水推力：底部靜水壓隨水深一次增加，但固定寬度投影上的合力隨深度平方增加。壓力的單位是力除面積，而合力才可進入整體受力平衡。水深應由自由水面量到計算點，不能直接把壩高當成每一時刻的有效水深，也不能忽略尾水反壓。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「高壩底壓與水推力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A high arch dam illustrates the difference between local pressure and integrated water force. Bottom hydrostatic pressure increases linearly with depth, while force on a fixed-width projection grows with depth squared. Pressure is force per area, whereas the resultant enters overall equilibrium. Depth is measured from the free surface to the point, not automatically equated with structural height, and downstream counterpressure must be considered when relevant. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Base pressure and water resultant” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; H=140 m; pbase=rho g H/1e6=1.3734 MPa。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; H=140 m; pbase=rho g H/1e6=1.3734 MPa.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「壩高就是任何水位下都應使用的靜水深度」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
