       "objective": "說明「兩岸差異位移的應變尺度」如何影響德基水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Differential abutment movement scale” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Deji Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "拱壩兩岸共同平移與兩岸相對位移有不同結構意義，後者才會改變跨距或扭曲形狀。以相對位移除基準長度可得到平均幾何應變，便於比較監測量級；這不是局部混凝土應變，也沒有包含支承轉角。儀器的共同基準若一起移動，可能掩蓋絕對運動卻仍保留部分相對量。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「兩岸差異位移的應變尺度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Common translation of both abutments differs from relative movement, which can change span or distort the arch. Relative displacement divided by reference length gives an average geometric strain useful for comparing measurement scales, not local concrete strain and not support rotation. Movement of a shared instrument reference may hide absolute motion while leaving some relative measurements intact, so reference geometry belongs in the interpretation. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Differential abutment movement scale” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：uR=5 mm; uL=1 mm; L=200 m; eps=(uR-uL)/1000/L=0.00002。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: uR=5 mm; uL=1 mm; L=200 m; eps=(uR-uL)/1000/L=0.00002.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「兩岸同向等量平移必然造成跨距增加」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Equal translation of both abutments in one direction necessarily increases span\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「兩岸差異位移的應變尺度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Differential abutment movement scale”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b218-v15-09-k1",
         "title": "兩岸差異位移的應變尺度",
         "titleEn": "Differential abutment movement scale",
         "text": "拱壩兩岸共同平移與兩岸相對位移有不同結構意義，後者才會改變跨距或扭曲形狀。以相對位移除基準長度可得到平均幾何應變，便於比較監測量級；這不是局部混凝土應變，也沒有包含支承轉角。",
         "textEn": "Common translation of both abutments differs from relative movement, which can change span or distort the arch. Relative displacement divided by reference length gives an average geometric strain useful for comparing measurement scales, not local concrete strain and not support rotation.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v11x-techi",
          "v15s-deji-wra",
          "v15s-usace-arch",
