         "text": "誤解：兩岸同向等量平移必然造成跨距增加 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Equal translation of both abutments in one direction necessarily increases span Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
