         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: uR=5 mm; uL=1 mm; L=200 m; eps=(uR-uL)/1000/L=0.00002. Applicable boundary: Both movements are axial projections along the original span line, using small deformation and one stable datum; only span-average normal strain is calculated.",
