       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「兩岸差異位移的應變尺度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Differential abutment movement scale” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "先將左右岸位移投影到原跨距連線軸線並確認小變形假設，再扣除共同平移量，確認毫米與公尺已轉換。以外部穩定測點閉合測量網，另記旋轉與垂直位移，避免一個水平差值被誤認為完整岩盤變形。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Project both movements onto the original span axis and verify the small-deformation assumption, remove common translation and convert millimetres to metres. Close the survey network against external stable points while separately recording rotation and vertical motion, so one horizontal difference is not treated as complete rock deformation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將左右岸都額外平移三毫米，重算相對應變並比較絕對位移，然後增加一個支承轉角，說明為何單一跨距應變無法描述新的變形模式。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Add three millimetres of common translation to both sides and compare relative strain with absolute movement. Then introduce support rotation and explain why one span-average strain cannot describe the added deformation mode.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把左右岸位移絕對值相加而不看方向，可能把共同平移誤認為跨距改變；若基準點位於同一移動岩塊上，則可能得到很小差值而漏掉整體位移。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Adding absolute movement magnitudes without direction can turn common translation into apparent span change. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b218-v15-11-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "先將左右岸位移投影到原跨距連線軸線並確認小變形假設，再扣除共同平移量，確認毫米與公尺已轉換。以外部穩定測點閉合測量網，另記旋轉與垂直位移，避免一個水平差值被誤認為完整岩盤變形。",
         "textEn": "Project both movements onto the original span axis and verify the small-deformation assumption, remove common translation and convert millimetres to metres. Close the survey network against external stable points while separately recording rotation and vertical motion, so one horizontal difference is not treated as complete rock deformation.",
         "sourceIds": [
