       "objective": "從症狀倒推「兩岸差異位移的應變尺度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Differential abutment movement scale” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把左右岸位移絕對值相加而不看方向，可能把共同平移誤認為跨距改變；若基準點位於同一移動岩塊上，則可能得到很小差值而漏掉整體位移。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Adding absolute movement magnitudes without direction can turn common translation into apparent span change. A reference on the same moving rock block may instead produce a small difference that misses larger absolute movement. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：儀器的共同基準若一起移動，可能掩蓋絕對運動卻仍保留部分相對量。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Movement of a shared instrument reference may hide absolute motion while leaving some relative measurements intact, so reference geometry belongs in the interpretation.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「兩岸同向等量平移必然造成跨距增加」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
