         "text": "把左右岸位移絕對值相加而不看方向，可能把共同平移誤認為跨距改變；若基準點位於同一移動岩塊上，則可能得到很小差值而漏掉整體位移。",
         "textEn": "Adding absolute movement magnitudes without direction can turn common translation into apparent span change. A reference on the same moving rock block may instead produce a small difference that misses larger absolute movement.",
