       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: VinLocal=900000 m3/day; Vdiv=250000 m3/day; Vout=1000000 m3/day; Vloss=30000 m3/day; dV=120000 m3/day.",
