       "quiz": {
        "question": "在「越域引水的獨立水量帳」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？",
        "questionEn": "When \"Separate diversion water accounting\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?",
        "options": [
         "症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。",
