       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: pabs=80000 Pa; pv=2500 Pa; rho=1000 kg/m3; v=18 m/s; sigma=(pabs-pv)/(0.5 rho v2)=0.478395.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「表壓可以直接減去絕對蒸氣壓來算氣蝕指數」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Gauge pressure can directly subtract absolute vapor pressure in a cavitation index\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
