         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: pabs=80000 Pa; pv=2500 Pa; rho=1000 kg/m3; v=18 m/s; sigma=(pabs-pv)/(0.5 rho v2)=0.478395. Applicable boundary: A hypothetical local absolute pressure and specified vapor pressure, without assigning an equipment cavitation threshold.",
