       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「局部低壓與汽化裕度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Local pressure and cavitation index” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "核對壓力儀表是否已加大氣壓，並記錄水溫以選對蒸氣壓。以局部速度而非管道平均值估算動壓，對照表面形狀與脈動資料，將氣蝕、磨蝕及化學侵蝕的證據分開檢查。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Confirm whether atmospheric pressure has been included and record water temperature for vapor pressure. Use local rather than blindly averaged velocity, compare geometry and pressure fluctuations, and distinguish evidence of cavitation from abrasion and chemical deterioration. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：保持局部壓力不變，把速度提高百分之十，重算指數並說明平方速度的影響，再列出真實流場中壓力也可能同步改變的原因。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Hold local pressure fixed, increase velocity ten percent and recalculate the index. Explain the squared-velocity effect and identify reasons why pressure itself may change simultaneously in a real flow field.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把表壓代替絕對壓力會嚴重改變裕度；即使平均指數相同，表面突起引起的局部加速與壓力脈動仍可能不同，因此不能用單一平均數排除局部氣蝕。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Substituting gauge for absolute pressure substantially changes the margin. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
