       "objective": "說明「壓力波往返時間」如何影響德基水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Pressure wave round trip time” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Deji Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "瞬變分析先要知道壓力訊息在水路中的傳播尺度，往返時間由兩倍管長除波速得到。它不是水粒子通過管線所需時間，也不是機組旋轉週期。把假想流量變化時間與往返時間比較，可判斷反射是否會在變化過程中返回，但多分支、調壓室及氣穴會使單管圖像需要擴充。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「壓力波往返時間」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Transient interpretation starts with the time for a pressure signal to travel through the waterway and return, equal to twice length divided by wave speed. This is neither water-particle travel time nor machine rotation period. Comparing a hypothetical flow-change duration with this scale reveals whether reflections return during the change, while branches, surge chambers and cavities require more than the single-pipe picture. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Pressure wave round trip time” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：L=1200 m; a=800 m/s; tr=2L/a=3 s。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: L=1200 m; a=800 m/s; tr=2L/a=3 s.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「壓力波傳播速度就是管內水的平均流速」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Pressure-wave speed equals the mean velocity of water in the pipe\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「壓力波往返時間」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Pressure wave round trip time”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
