      {
       "id": "b218-v15-31",
       "title": "壓力波往返時間：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Pressure wave round trip time: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v11x-techi",
        "v15s-deji-wra",
        "v15s-usace-arch",
        "b-src-water"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b218-v15-30"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「壓力波往返時間」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pressure wave round trip time” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "從兩支壓力感測器波峰的時間差估算波速，確認取樣時鐘同步並保留量測距離。再辨識反射峰而非把每個局部脈動都視為往返訊號，對多支管路應畫出各自傳播路徑。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Estimate wave speed from peak arrival differences at two synchronized pressure sensors with a known separation. Distinguish reflected peaks from unrelated local fluctuations, and draw separate propagation paths where multiple branches prevent one round-trip time from describing the network. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將管長加倍並將波速減少四分之一，重算往返時間，再比較一秒與十秒假想變化的尺度，僅說明分類而不推定真實操作方式。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Double length and reduce wave speed by one quarter, recalculate round-trip time and compare hypothetical one-second and ten-second changes. Describe the timescale classification without prescribing actual operating procedures.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：用平均流速代替波速會把秒級訊息傳播誤算成很長的旅行時間；只因變化時間大於往返時間就宣告沒有水錘，也忽略反射疊加及邊界條件可能仍產生瞬變。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Using mean flow velocity instead of wave speed converts a seconds-scale signal into a much longer travel time. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b218-v15-31-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "從兩支壓力感測器波峰的時間差估算波速，確認取樣時鐘同步並保留量測距離。再辨識反射峰而非把每個局部脈動都視為往返訊號，對多支管路應畫出各自傳播路徑。",
         "textEn": "Estimate wave speed from peak arrival differences at two synchronized pressure sensors with a known separation. Distinguish reflected peaks from unrelated local fluctuations, and draw separate propagation paths where multiple branches prevent one round-trip time from describing the network.",
