       "objective": "說明「停機發電量與留存水量」如何影響德基水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Outage energy and retained water” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Deji Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "機組停機少發的電能可以用原可用功率乘時段估算，但水不會因此消失，可能留在水庫、改道或後續使用。德基梯級背景的停機帳應同時追蹤水量，避免把短期延後發電誤稱永久損失。若水位因留存上升，後續淨水頭也可能變動，使固定功率估計只是一階比較。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「停機發電量與留存水量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Energy not generated during an outage can be estimated from otherwise available power times duration, but the water remains in storage, is bypassed or is used later. A cascade outage account must therefore follow water as well as electricity, distinguishing delayed generation from permanent loss. Retained water may change level and subsequent net head, making constant-power multiplication only a first-order comparison. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Outage energy and retained water” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Pavailable=36 MW; dt=5 h; Edeferred=Pavailable dt=180 MWh。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Pavailable=36 MW; dt=5 h; Edeferred=Pavailable dt=180 MWh.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「停機時段少發的電能必然全部永久損失」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"All generation absent during an outage is necessarily lost permanently\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「停機發電量與留存水量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Outage energy and retained water”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b218-v15-37-k1",
