         "text": "原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Vin=1200000 m3/day; demand=700000 m3/day; lossUpper=100000 m3/day; lossLower=50000 m3/day; dVsystem=Vin-demand-lossUpper-lossLower=350000 m3/day。適用邊界：同一日封閉雙池系統，內部轉水抵銷，沒有額外下游天然入流。",
         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Vin=1200000 m3/day; demand=700000 m3/day; lossUpper=100000 m3/day; lossLower=50000 m3/day; dVsystem=Vin-demand-lossUpper-lossLower=350000 m3/day. Applicable boundary: A two-pool daily system with internal transfers cancelling and no additional natural inflow to the lower pool.",
