         "text": "土石壩顆粒骨架承擔有效應力，水的孔隙壓力則分擔總法向應力。以總應力減孔壓可說明排水與蓄水變化如何影響骨架受力，但這是單點應力關係，不直接等於整體抗滑能力。",
         "textEn": "The soil skeleton carries effective stress while pore water contributes to total normal stress. Subtracting pore pressure illustrates how drainage and reservoir changes affect skeleton loading, but this point relation does not establish whole-slope resistance.",
