       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「排水層的導水阻力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Hydraulic resistance of a drain layer” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以排水層前後的測壓差與總排水量反算導水能力，確認出口未被回水淹沒。將維護清理、細料出現與降雨時段一起標記，再檢查水頭升高是來水增加還是阻力增加，不能只看流量。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Infer conductance from head difference and total drainage while checking for outlet submergence. Mark cleaning, observed fines and rainfall periods, then determine whether rising head reflects increased inflow or increased resistance rather than interpreting discharge alone. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：把滲透係數減半並保持流量不變，重算所需水頭差，再把截面也減少四分之一，比較兩種劣化疊加的效果與量測所需證據。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Halve permeability at fixed flow and recalculate required head difference, then also reduce area by one quarter. Compare the combined effects and identify measurements needed to distinguish the two deterioration mechanisms.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：出口回水會改變水頭邊界，若仍把出口當零壓就錯估阻力；局部堵塞也可能讓水改走旁路，使總排水量近似不變卻在壩內形成不同孔壓分布。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Outlet backwater changes the hydraulic boundary, so assuming zero outlet pressure misestimates resistance. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
