         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Cd=0.65; b=4 m; opening=0.8 m; g=9.81 m/s2; H=9 m; Q=Cd b opening sqrt(2gH)=27.63975 m3/s. Applicable boundary: A hypothetical rectangular free-discharge opening with head measured to its center and no tailwater submergence.",
