         "text": "畫出開口中心與自由水面，核對水頭定義後用量水設施求實際係數。比較不同開度的係數是否穩定，記錄尾水變化和水面波動，再決定簡單孔口式是否足以描述該測試區間。",
         "textEn": "Draw opening center and free surface, verify the head definition and infer discharge coefficient from measurements. Compare coefficients across openings while recording tailwater and surface fluctuations before deciding whether a simple orifice relation describes the tested range.",
