         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; Q=35 m3/s; dH=18 m; A=140 m2; flux=rho g Q dH/A/1000=44.145 kW/m2. Applicable boundary: Mean dissipated power over a hypothetical area, not local impact pressure or scour depth.",
