       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「消能區的功率通量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Power flux in a dissipating reach” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "先以總功率核對流量與水頭損失，再確認除以面積後單位仍含每秒能量。比較水槽中的流態與壓力脈動量測，將面功率圖與沖刷地形分開呈現，避免以同一色階暗示兩者一一對應。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check total power from flow and head loss, then retain the energy-per-time unit after division by area. Compare flume flow patterns and pressure fluctuations, presenting power-flux and scour maps separately rather than suggesting a one-to-one relationship through shared coloring. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：把分配面積加倍求平均通量變化，再畫一半功率集中在十分之一面積的情境，計算局部通量並說明平均值何時可能掩蓋集中作用。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Double the assumed distribution area and recalculate mean flux, then concentrate half the power in one tenth of the area. Calculate local flux and explain how a mean can hide concentration.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把千瓦每平方公尺誤寫成千帕會混淆能量速率與受力；平均分散範圍即使很大，局部射流仍可能集中撞擊，因此均值低不能排除局部侵蝕熱點。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Relabeling kilowatts per square metre as kilopascals confuses energy rate with force. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
