       "objective": "從症狀倒推「消能區的功率通量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Power flux in a dissipating reach” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把千瓦每平方公尺誤寫成千帕會混淆能量速率與受力；平均分散範圍即使很大，局部射流仍可能集中撞擊，因此均值低不能排除局部侵蝕熱點。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Relabeling kilowatts per square metre as kilopascals confuses energy rate with force. Even a broad mean dissipation area may contain a concentrated jet, so low average flux cannot exclude a local erosion hotspot. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：局部沖刷還取決於流向、脈動、材料與持續時間。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Local scour additionally depends on flow direction, fluctuations, material resistance and duration, so equal mean flux does not imply equal damage.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「每平方公尺耗散功率就是同數值的局部壓力」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Dissipated power per area is the same numerical local pressure\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b219-v15-20-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "把千瓦每平方公尺誤寫成千帕會混淆能量速率與受力；平均分散範圍即使很大，局部射流仍可能集中撞擊，因此均值低不能排除局部侵蝕熱點。",
         "textEn": "Relabeling kilowatts per square metre as kilopascals confuses energy rate with force. Even a broad mean dissipation area may contain a concentrated jet, so low average flux cannot exclude a local erosion hotspot.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-tsengwen-owner",
          "v15s-tsengwen-history",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
