       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Solids concentration in bottom withdrawal” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Q=6 m3/s; C=15 kg/m3; dt=3600 s; M=Q C dt/1000=324 tonne。適用邊界：一小時均勻假想懸浮濃度，非曾文實際設備排砂率或操作條件。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Q=6 m3/s; C=15 kg/m3; dt=3600 s; M=Q C dt/1000=324 tonne. Applicable boundary: One hour of uniform hypothetical suspended concentration, not actual Tsengwen equipment performance or operation. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
