         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Q=6 m3/s; C=15 kg/m3; dt=3600 s; M=Q C dt/1000=324 tonne. Applicable boundary: One hour of uniform hypothetical suspended concentration, not actual Tsengwen equipment performance or operation.",
