      {
       "id": "b219-v15-23",
       "title": "近底取水的輸砂效率：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Solids concentration in bottom withdrawal: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-tsengwen-owner",
        "v15s-tsengwen-history",
        "b-src-water"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b219-v15-22"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「近底取水的輸砂效率」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Solids concentration in bottom withdrawal” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "將代表水樣乾燥後求固體濃度，核對採樣口是否避開粗粒沉降而偏低。同步積分放流水量，再以取水前後庫底測量檢查材料來源，區分新入流通過與既有沉積再搬運。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Dry representative samples to determine solids concentration and check whether sampler placement misses settling coarse grains. Integrate released water simultaneously and compare bed surveys to distinguish passage of new incoming sediment from remobilization of previously deposited material. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：設另一時段流量加倍但濃度降為三分之一，計算等長時段的輸出質量和用水量，分別比較總輸砂與每單位水的輸砂，不混為同一效率。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Double flow while reducing concentration to one third for an equal duration. Compare total solids, water volume and solids per unit water, keeping those performance measures distinct rather than combining them into one undefined efficiency.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：只以高濃度宣稱效率高可能忽略放流水量很小，總輸出仍有限；反之大量低濃度放流可能耗水多而帶走固體少，兩者需要同一質量與水量邊界才可比較。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: High concentration alone may accompany little water and limited total export. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b219-v15-23-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "將代表水樣乾燥後求固體濃度，核對採樣口是否避開粗粒沉降而偏低。同步積分放流水量，再以取水前後庫底測量檢查材料來源，區分新入流通過與既有沉積再搬運。",
         "textEn": "Dry representative samples to determine solids concentration and check whether sampler placement misses settling coarse grains. Integrate released water simultaneously and compare bed surveys to distinguish passage of new incoming sediment from remobilization of previously deposited material.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-tsengwen-owner",
          "v15s-tsengwen-history",
          "b-src-water"
