       "objective": "從症狀倒推「近底取水的輸砂效率」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Solids concentration in bottom withdrawal” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "只以高濃度宣稱效率高可能忽略放流水量很小，總輸出仍有限；反之大量低濃度放流可能耗水多而帶走固體少，兩者需要同一質量與水量邊界才可比較。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "High concentration alone may accompany little water and limited total export. A large dilute release may consume much water while carrying few solids; both cases require consistent mass and water boundaries for comparison. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：沉積物是否能被帶到入口，還取決於地形與流場，計算輸出不等於證明整個庫底被清除。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Whether deposits reach the inlet depends on bed geometry and flow, so a calculated export does not demonstrate clearance of the entire reservoir floor or uniform sediment removal.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「原水越濁就一定代表該時段排出總泥砂越多」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Darker water necessarily means more total sediment was exported during the interval\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
