         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; Q=8 m3/s; H=60 m; eta=0.86; P=rho g Q H eta/1e6=4.049568 MW. Applicable boundary: One release passes a hypothetical unit before downstream use, excluding canal losses and actual withdrawal configuration.",
