      {
       "id": "b219-v15-27",
       "title": "共同放流的發電與灌溉：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Energy and irrigation from one release: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-tsengwen-owner",
        "v15s-tsengwen-history",
        "b-src-water"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b219-v15-26"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「共同放流的發電與灌溉」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Energy and irrigation from one release” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "在流程圖上用一條水線連接發電與灌溉，另畫能量輸出箭頭，核對單位不混用。比較機組出口及渠道入口累積流量，將中間損失或暫存另外列帳，確認沒有因兩種用途而重複計水。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Draw one water path through generation to irrigation with a separate energy-output arrow, checking units. Compare cumulative turbine-outlet and canal-inlet flows, accounting for intermediate losses or storage so two services do not create duplicate water allocations. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：用同一流量求一日通過水量，再計一日發電量，將兩者以各自單位並列。若渠道另損失百分之五，只修改下游水量帳並說明是否改變已發出的電。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Calculate daily water throughput and energy at the same flow, displaying their distinct units. Apply a separate five-percent canal loss only to downstream water and explain whether it changes electricity already generated.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把機組效率低於一解讀成同樣比例水被消耗，會錯估下游可用水；把發電用水與灌溉用水相加成總需求，又可能對同一串聯放流重複扣帳。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Interpreting efficiency below unity as an equal loss of water misstates downstream availability. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b219-v15-27-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "在流程圖上用一條水線連接發電與灌溉，另畫能量輸出箭頭，核對單位不混用。比較機組出口及渠道入口累積流量，將中間損失或暫存另外列帳，確認沒有因兩種用途而重複計水。",
         "textEn": "Draw one water path through generation to irrigation with a separate energy-output arrow, checking units. Compare cumulative turbine-outlet and canal-inlet flows, accounting for intermediate losses or storage so two services do not create duplicate water allocations.",
