       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「共同放流的發電與灌溉」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Energy and irrigation from one release” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把機組效率低於一解讀成同樣比例水被消耗，會錯估下游可用水；把發電用水與灌溉用水相加成總需求，又可能對同一串聯放流重複扣帳。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Interpreting efficiency below unity as an equal loss of water misstates downstream availability. Adding generation and irrigation water as separate demands can likewise subtract the same serial release twice. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：發電效率影響能量轉換，不直接把相同比例水量變成不可用。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Conversion efficiency changes electrical output, not the fraction of water physically remaining, so energy and water ledgers must use different units and boundaries.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「發電效率八成就表示兩成水量已被機組消耗」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Eighty percent generation efficiency means the unit consumes twenty percent of the water\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
