         "title": "灌溉明渠的曼寧尺度",
         "titleEn": "Manning scale for an irrigation canal",
         "text": "開放渠道的平均流速受斷面形狀、濕周、坡度及粗糙阻力共同控制。矩形斷面水力半徑是面積除濕周，不等於水深，尤其窄渠道差異顯著。",
         "textEn": "Mean open-channel velocity depends on geometry, wetted perimeter, slope and roughness. For a rectangular section, hydraulic radius is area divided by wetted perimeter, not simply depth, especially in a narrow canal.",
