         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: b=5 m; y=1.2 m; n=0.025 s/m^(1/3); S=0.0004; A=by=6 m2; R=A/(b+2y); Q=A R^(2/3)sqrt(S)/n=4.173697 m3/s. Applicable boundary: SI Manning relation for uniform flow in a prismatic rectangular canal, with assumed roughness.",
