      {
       "id": "b219-v15-31",
       "title": "灌溉明渠的曼寧尺度：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Manning scale for an irrigation canal: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-tsengwen-owner",
        "v15s-tsengwen-history",
        "b-src-water"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b219-v15-30"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「灌溉明渠的曼寧尺度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Manning scale for an irrigation canal” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "由實測斷面計算面積與濕周，確認側壁也納入濕周；以沿程水面高程檢查是否近似均勻流。比較量得流量與不同糙率結果，保留植物、沉積與維護狀態，不把糙率當永久固定常數。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Calculate area and wetted perimeter from a surveyed section including both sidewalls, and inspect longitudinal water levels for near-uniform flow. Compare measured discharge across plausible roughness values while documenting vegetation, deposits and maintenance rather than treating roughness as permanently fixed. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：把渠道糙率增至零點零三，保持幾何與坡度重算流量，再比較擴寬一公尺的結果，說明兩種改善或劣化不能只用斷面面積判斷。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Raise roughness to zero point zero three at fixed geometry and slope, then compare with widening the canal by one metre. Explain why area alone cannot characterize either change in conveyance.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：直接把水深當水力半徑會高估窄渠通量；若下游閘門回水卻仍採底坡為能量坡，則可能得到不符合現地水面線的流量，連帶錯估供水能力。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Replacing hydraulic radius with depth overstates narrow-channel flow. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
