         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "由實測斷面計算面積與濕周，確認側壁也納入濕周；以沿程水面高程檢查是否近似均勻流。比較量得流量與不同糙率結果，保留植物、沉積與維護狀態，不把糙率當永久固定常數。",
         "textEn": "Calculate area and wetted perimeter from a surveyed section including both sidewalls, and inspect longitudinal water levels for near-uniform flow. Compare measured discharge across plausible roughness values while documenting vegetation, deposits and maintenance rather than treating roughness as permanently fixed.",
         "sourceIds": [
