       "objective": "從症狀倒推「灌溉明渠的曼寧尺度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Manning scale for an irrigation canal” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "直接把水深當水力半徑會高估窄渠通量；若下游閘門回水卻仍採底坡為能量坡，則可能得到不符合現地水面線的流量，連帶錯估供水能力。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Replacing hydraulic radius with depth overstates narrow-channel flow. Using bed slope as energy slope under downstream backwater can produce a discharge inconsistent with the observed water surface and misstate delivery capacity. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：曼寧式可估算均勻流通水量，但回水、閘門控制或急變流會破壞水面坡與底坡近似相同的條件，需要另作水面線分析。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Manning's relation estimates uniform-flow capacity, while backwater, gates or rapidly varied flow can invalidate the approximation that energy slope follows bed slope and require a water-surface-profile calculation instead.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「矩形渠道的水力半徑永遠等於水深」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Hydraulic radius of a rectangular canal always equals its depth\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b219-v15-32-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
