         "textEn": "Replacing hydraulic radius with depth overstates narrow-channel flow. Using bed slope as energy slope under downstream backwater can produce a discharge inconsistent with the observed water surface and misstate delivery capacity.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-tsengwen-owner",
          "v15s-tsengwen-history",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        },
