       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Interpreting crest settlement rate” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以閉合水準測量核對基準穩定，將同日庫水位、氣溫與儀器變更標在沉陷圖上。比較多個壩頂點的差異沉陷，並用至少三個時段查看速率是否加快，避免兩點直線掩蓋曲線轉折。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Close the leveling survey against stable references and annotate reservoir level, temperature and instrument changes. Compare differential settlement across crest points and examine at least three intervals for acceleration, rather than letting a two-point straight line conceal curvature in the trend. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：增加第三次測量，假設再過一百八十日只增加三毫米，計算兩段速率並畫累積曲線，說明平均值相同或不同時仍需查看空間差異。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Add a third survey after another one hundred eighty days with only three millimetres of additional settlement. Compare interval rates and cumulative curves, explaining why spatial differences still matter alongside averaged trends.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：用兩次量測直接外推多年會忽略蠕變速率改變；基準點下沉可能讓壩頂看似上升，若未檢查閉合誤差與外部參考，便可能把量測網變動誤判為壩體回彈。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Extrapolating years from two observations ignores changing creep rate. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b219-v15-35-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "以閉合水準測量核對基準穩定，將同日庫水位、氣溫與儀器變更標在沉陷圖上。比較多個壩頂點的差異沉陷，並用至少三個時段查看速率是否加快，避免兩點直線掩蓋曲線轉折。",
         "textEn": "Close the leveling survey against stable references and annotate reservoir level, temperature and instrument changes. Compare differential settlement across crest points and examine at least three intervals for acceleration, rather than letting a two-point straight line conceal curvature in the trend.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-tsengwen-owner",
          "v15s-tsengwen-history",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
