       "objective": "從症狀倒推「壩頂沉陷的速率解讀」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Interpreting crest settlement rate” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "用兩次量測直接外推多年會忽略蠕變速率改變；基準點下沉可能讓壩頂看似上升，若未檢查閉合誤差與外部參考，便可能把量測網變動誤判為壩體回彈。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Extrapolating years from two observations ignores changing creep rate. A settling reference can make the crest appear to rise, so absent network closure and external checks, reference motion may be mistaken for structural rebound. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：比較不同測點的空間形狀和時間曲線，通常比單一點的總沉陷量更能辨識差異變形與儀器問題。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Spatial patterns across several points and the shape of the time history are often more informative than one accumulated displacement for distinguishing differential deformation from measurement problems.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「兩次量測求出的平均沉陷速率必定可永久線性外推」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An average settlement rate from two surveys can always be extrapolated indefinitely\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b219-v15-36-k1",
