         "text": "用兩次量測直接外推多年會忽略蠕變速率改變；基準點下沉可能讓壩頂看似上升，若未檢查閉合誤差與外部參考，便可能把量測網變動誤判為壩體回彈。",
         "textEn": "Extrapolating years from two observations ignores changing creep rate. A settling reference can make the crest appear to rise, so absent network closure and external checks, reference motion may be mistaken for structural rebound.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-tsengwen-owner",
          "v15s-tsengwen-history",
