       "instruction": "先將公頃換成平方公尺、毫米換成公尺，再分別列淨需水與毛取水，核對效率分子分母。以渠道入流及田間供水比較估計效率時，要對齊時段並考慮暫存，不能把回歸水直接當完全損失。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Convert hectares to square metres and millimetres to metres, then list net need and gross withdrawal separately with explicit efficiency boundaries. When comparing canal input and field delivery, align periods and account for storage rather than treating all return flow as irrecoverable loss. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
