       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「田間淨需水與毛取水」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Net field need and gross withdrawal” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "以淨需水乘效率會把水源需求算得比田間需求還小；若先除效率又再加同一渠道損失，則重複放大需求，導致不同方案比較只是帳目定義不同而非真正節水。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Multiplying net need by efficiency makes source demand smaller than field need. Dividing by efficiency and then adding the same canal loss inflates demand twice, making apparent savings depend on inconsistent accounting rather than physical improvement. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：不同作物、降雨及回歸水會改變真正需求，這個固定深度例子只用來練習單位與邊界，不代表實際配水規則。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Crop choice, rainfall and return flows alter real demand, so this fixed-depth exercise teaches units and accounting rather than prescribing allocation or representing a measured seasonal irrigation requirement.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「毛取水量應把田間淨需水乘上輸配效率」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Gross withdrawal equals net field requirement multiplied by delivery efficiency\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
