       "objective": "說明「本地入流與越域供水」如何影響南化水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Local inflow and imported supply” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Nanhua Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "南化的本地集水與甲仙越域引水屬不同來源，應分別記錄實際到庫水量，再與供水及損失相減。來源河川有水不代表全數都能引入，因為輸水能力、時段與其他用水需求各有限制。水量帳以清楚邊界避免重複計算，並保留入庫延遲，不能只用來源地降雨面積推定目的水庫已收到多少水。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「本地入流與越域供水」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Local catchment inflow and imported water are distinct sources and must be measured as volumes actually received before subtracting supply and losses. Water present in a source river is not necessarily transferable because capacity, timing and competing needs constrain delivery. Explicit boundaries and travel delay prevent double counting; rainfall over a source area cannot by itself establish how much water has already reached the destination reservoir. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Local inflow and imported supply” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Vlocal=500000 m3/day; Vimport=300000 m3/day; Vsupply=600000 m3/day; Vloss=40000 m3/day; dV=160000 m3/day。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Vlocal=500000 m3/day; Vimport=300000 m3/day; Vsupply=600000 m3/day; Vloss=40000 m3/day; dV=160000 m3/day.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「來源河川的全部流量都可直接列為水庫實收入流」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"All source-river discharge can be entered as water actually received by the reservoir\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「本地入流與越域供水」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Local inflow and imported supply”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
