       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「本地入流與越域供水」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Local inflow and imported supply” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "對齊本地入流、引水出口和供水流量計的累積時段，以庫水位曲線反推蓄量差核對。標記引水中斷或旅行時間跨日的區段，再將管路暫存補入帳，避免把延遲誤判為水量損失。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Align cumulative intervals for local inflow, diversion outlet and supply meters, then compare storage inferred from reservoir levels. Mark interruptions and transfers crossing a daily boundary, adding conveyance storage so travel delay is not misidentified as a water loss. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將越域水量減半並重算，再把一天拆成兩個時段分別設定引水中斷與恢復，檢查總量及時段最低蓄量，說明日平均可能隱藏的變化。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Halve imported volume and recalculate, then split the day into interruption and recovery intervals. Compare total volume and minimum interim storage to show what a daily average can conceal.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把來源河川流量直接當目的水庫入流會忽略未引走水量；若引水停止卻仍使用長期平均值，短期蓄量估算可能保持正值而實際已接近持平或下降。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Treating source-river flow as destination inflow ignores water not diverted. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b220-v15-03-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "對齊本地入流、引水出口和供水流量計的累積時段，以庫水位曲線反推蓄量差核對。標記引水中斷或旅行時間跨日的區段，再將管路暫存補入帳，避免把延遲誤判為水量損失。",
         "textEn": "Align cumulative intervals for local inflow, diversion outlet and supply meters, then compare storage inferred from reservoir levels. Mark interruptions and transfers crossing a daily boundary, adding conveyance storage so travel delay is not misidentified as a water loss.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-nanhua-history",
          "b-src-water",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b220-v15-03-k2",
