       "objective": "從症狀倒推「本地入流與越域供水」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Local inflow and imported supply” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把來源河川流量直接當目的水庫入流會忽略未引走水量；若引水停止卻仍使用長期平均值，短期蓄量估算可能保持正值而實際已接近持平或下降。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Treating source-river flow as destination inflow ignores water not diverted. Retaining a long-term import average during an interruption can predict growing storage even when the short-term balance is nearly zero or negative. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：水量帳以清楚邊界避免重複計算，並保留入庫延遲，不能只用來源地降雨面積推定目的水庫已收到多少水。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Explicit boundaries and travel delay prevent double counting; rainfall over a source area cannot by itself establish how much water has already reached the destination reservoir.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「來源河川的全部流量都可直接列為水庫實收入流」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"All source-river discharge can be entered as water actually received by the reservoir\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b220-v15-04-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
