       "instructionEn": "Convert areas to square metres, plot area against elevation and verify the integral geometrically. Add a midpoint area to compare trapezoidal and Simpson estimates, then check survey datums so discretization error remains separate from instrument error. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
