       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Pumping energy in an intertie” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Nanhua Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "跨區聯通管線可增加供水路徑，但若需要抽升就必須付出位能與摩擦耗能。總揚程把地形高差與沿程局部損失加總，輸入電功率再除泵組效率求得。效率應明確包含哪些設備，不能把馬達、泵及變頻損失在不同位置重複扣除，也不能把輸水能耗誤認為實際水量全部被消耗。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「聯通管輸水的抽水能源」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A connecting pipeline adds a supply path but requires energy when water must be lifted against elevation and hydraulic losses. Total head combines static lift with distributed and local losses, and electrical input divides hydraulic power by pump-set efficiency. The efficiency boundary must identify included equipment so motor, pump and drive losses are not deducted twice, while energy consumption must remain distinct from physical water loss. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Pumping energy in an intertie” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
