       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「聯通管輸水的抽水能源」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pumping energy in an intertie” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以吸入與排出總水頭差檢查揚程，核對電表是否含輔機，再用同一時段流量計求單位水耗能。比較不同流量下損失水頭的變化，避免只用固定高差解釋全部耗電差異。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check head from suction and discharge total energy levels, identify auxiliary loads in the electrical meter and pair it with simultaneous flow for energy per delivered volume. Compare losses across flows rather than explaining every power change by static elevation alone. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將損失水頭增至十八公尺，保持流量與效率重算，再把效率降至零點七，分別比較兩種因素對耗電的影響，避免將所有變化歸因於泵老化。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Raise loss head to eighteen metres at unchanged flow and efficiency, then reduce efficiency to zero point seven. Compare the two effects separately rather than attributing every energy increase to pump aging.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：只算地形高差會漏掉管路摩擦；把效率乘在水力功率上則得到低於理想需求的輸入值，違反能量方向，可能使備援電源容量評估失真。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Using static lift alone omits hydraulic losses. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
