       "objective": "從症狀倒推「聯通管輸水的抽水能源」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pumping energy in an intertie” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "只算地形高差會漏掉管路摩擦；把效率乘在水力功率上則得到低於理想需求的輸入值，違反能量方向，可能使備援電源容量評估失真。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Using static lift alone omits hydraulic losses. Multiplying hydraulic power by efficiency gives an input below the ideal requirement and reverses the energy relationship, distorting an illustrative backup-power assessment. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：效率應明確包含哪些設備，不能把馬達、泵及變頻損失在不同位置重複扣除，也不能把輸水能耗誤認為實際水量全部被消耗。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: The efficiency boundary must identify included equipment so motor, pump and drive losses are not deducted twice, while energy consumption must remain distinct from physical water loss.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「抽水輸入功率應低於同流量揚程的理想水力功率」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Pumping electrical input should be lower than the ideal hydraulic power at the same duty\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
