       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Backup paths and common cause failure” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Nanhua Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "兩條供水路徑只有在失效近似獨立時，才可用失效率乘積估算同時失效。共同電源、同一河川污染或相同控制系統可能同時切斷兩路，使表面上的雙路備援效果下降。以條件機率把共因事件與獨立事件分開，可以檢查可靠度假設；數值不是歷史故障統計，也不是供水保證。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「備援路徑與共因失效」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Two supply paths benefit from multiplying failure probabilities only when failures are approximately independent. Shared electricity, source contamination or control systems can disable both paths together and reduce apparent redundancy. A conditional-probability model separates a common-cause event from otherwise independent failures, exposing the assumption behind a reliability estimate. Its numbers are hypothetical, not historical outage statistics or a guarantee that supply will remain available during an actual event. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Backup paths and common cause failure” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
