       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「備援路徑與共因失效」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Backup paths and common cause failure” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "先畫共同電源與各自設備的故障樹，檢查事件是否重複包含，再把同時段事件紀錄整理成條件機率。比較有無共因的答案，並列出資料不足的相依事件，不能以路線數量直接當可靠度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Draw a fault tree containing shared utilities and separate equipment, checking for duplicated events before estimating conditional probabilities from matching intervals. Compare results with and without common cause and identify unresolved dependencies rather than using route count as a reliability measure. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：把共因機率減半重算，另把其中一路獨立失效機率減半比較改善幅度，說明為何先處理共用設備有時比再增加單一路徑可靠度更有效。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Halve common-cause probability and recalculate, then separately halve one route's independent failure probability. Compare improvements and explain why addressing a shared dependency can sometimes matter more than improving one individual path.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：直接把兩條路的失效機率相乘會漏掉共因；反之將已含共同事件的總失效率再加入共因項，會重複計算，讓保守外觀掩蓋不一致的機率定義。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Multiplying route failure probabilities alone misses common cause. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
