       "objective": "從症狀倒推「備援路徑與共因失效」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Backup paths and common cause failure” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "直接把兩條路的失效機率相乘會漏掉共因；反之將已含共同事件的總失效率再加入共因項，會重複計算，讓保守外觀掩蓋不一致的機率定義。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Multiplying route failure probabilities alone misses common cause. Conversely, adding common cause to route probabilities that already include it double counts events, producing a conservative-looking but internally inconsistent probability model. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：以條件機率把共因事件與獨立事件分開，可以檢查可靠度假設；數值不是歷史故障統計，也不是供水保證。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Its numbers are hypothetical, not historical outage statistics or a guarantee that supply will remain available during an actual event.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「有兩條供水路徑就可以保證故障彼此獨立」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Having two supply routes guarantees that their failures are independent\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
