       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: crest=108 m; water=103 m; runup=1.2 m; setup=0.3 m; settlement=0.4 m; margin=crest-water-runup-setup-settlement=3.1 m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「只要幾何壩頂高於靜水面就完全不必考慮波浪」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A crest above still water never needs any wave consideration\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「幾何超高與波浪餘量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Geometric freeboard and wave allowance”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
