       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Geometric freeboard and wave allowance” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "將已反映在實測壩頂的沉陷再扣一次會重複保守；忽略局部低點則可能反向樂觀。只看算得正餘量而未說明波浪情境，無法支持任何真實超高判定。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Subtracting settlement already included in a measured crest double counts it, while ignoring local low points can be unconservative. A positive arithmetic remainder without a defined wave scenario cannot support a real freeboard conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：各項未必同時達峰，實際組合需符合適用設計情境，而且壩頂局部低點比平均高程更相關。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Peaks need not coincide, actual combinations require an applicable design scenario, and local low crest points matter more than an average elevation when assessing possible overtopping.",
