       "failure": "常見誤解：「總逕流體積可直接當作暴雨洪峰流量」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Total runoff volume can directly be treated as peak storm discharge\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
