         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: P=0.12 m; A=40000000 m2; C=0.45; Vrunoff=P A C=2160000 m3. Applicable boundary: Event volume with a dimensionless coefficient, excluding peak flow, routing duration and abstraction constraints.",
