       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Nominal sediment occupation horizon” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Nanhua Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "可用庫容除以每年淨淤積量得到名目占容年數，這只是固定速率下的比例尺，不是水庫壽命預報。侵蝕事件、壓密、排砂與供水最低水位都會改變可用空間與損失速率。南化背景的教學應把容量曲線年代與年淤積定義寫明，並區分總庫容消失、有效庫容不足及取水口受影響等不同問題。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「淤積占容的名目年數」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Available storage divided by annual net deposition gives a nominal occupation horizon under constant rate, not a reservoir-life forecast. Erosion events, consolidation, sediment removal and minimum supply level change both usable space and loss rate. The storage-curve date and deposition definition must remain explicit, while loss of gross capacity, inadequate usable storage and interference with an intake are distinct outcomes rather than interchangeable meanings of reservoir lifetime. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Nominal sediment occupation horizon” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Vavailable=30000000 m3; Snet=600000 m3/year; T=Vavailable/Snet=50 year。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Vavailable=30000000 m3; Snet=600000 m3/year; T=Vavailable/Snet=50 year.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「庫容除年淤積量就是確定無誤的水庫剩餘壽命」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Storage divided by annual deposition is the exact remaining reservoir lifetime\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「淤積占容的名目年數」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Nominal sediment occupation horizon”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
