       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Nominal sediment occupation horizon” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "使用同基準的重複水深測量求淨體積差，註明測區與取水高程，並將單次極端事件與多年背景分開。比較沉積乾容重變化和庫容曲線修訂，確認年損失不是量測覆蓋改變造成。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Use repeated surveys with a common datum to estimate net volume change, documenting coverage and intake elevation. Separate extreme-event deposits from background years and compare bulk-density change and curve revisions so apparent annual loss is not merely changed survey coverage. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：將背景淤積率減半但每十年加入一次三百萬立方公尺事件，求二十年占容並與固定速率比較，指出事件發生時間還會影響短期供水功能。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Halve background deposition but add one three-million-cubic-metre event every ten years. Calculate twenty-year occupation, compare with a constant rate and explain why event timing can still affect short-term supply function.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把一場極端事件的淤積量當作每年固定值可能過度縮短名目年數；只看全庫剩餘體積又可能漏掉取水口附近局部埋積，讓總量充足掩蓋功能先受影響。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Repeating one extreme event every year can artificially shorten the nominal horizon. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
