       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Nominal sediment occupation horizon” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把一場極端事件的淤積量當作每年固定值可能過度縮短名目年數；只看全庫剩餘體積又可能漏掉取水口附近局部埋積，讓總量充足掩蓋功能先受影響。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Repeating one extreme event every year can artificially shorten the nominal horizon. Conversely, adequate reservoir-wide volume may hide local accumulation near an intake, where function can be impaired before total storage becomes small. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
