       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Vusable=12000000 m3; Dbase=500000 m3/day; reduction=0.15; Dnew=Dbase(1-reduction); T=Vusable/Dnew=28.235294 day.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「需求降低百分之十五就使續供天數恰增加百分之十五」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
