       "instructionEn": "Verify whether usable storage excludes inaccessible water, then recalculate over observed daily-demand ranges rather than using one unusually low day as the long-term mean. Record the start and realization of savings and treat inflow and quality constraints as separate sensitivities. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：比較零、百分之十五及百分之二十五削減情境的續供時間，再加入每日兩萬立方公尺其他損失，說明用水與損失邊界改變後為何需重算而非加固定天數。",
