       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Demand adjustment and static supply duration” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把百分之十五節水誤讀成續供天數也增加百分之十五，忽略倒數關係；若實際需求沒有達標，仍用假設削減後需求外推，就會把政策目標當成已實現的供水能力。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A fifteen-percent demand reduction does not increase duration by exactly fifteen percent because duration is inversely related to demand. Using an unrealized reduction treats a policy target as achieved supply performance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：比較不同需求情境時應使用同一有效庫存邊界，保留不能動用的水量，而非把總庫容全部拿來相除。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Scenarios need the same usable-storage boundary and should retain unavailable water rather than dividing gross reservoir capacity by demand and ignoring physical access constraints.",
