       "objective": "說明「管網水量差與誤差範圍」如何影響南化水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Network imbalance and uncertainty” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Nanhua Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "聯通管路進出水量之差可提示漏失或暫存，但量測誤差也能形成殘差。若兩個流量計誤差獨立，以平方和開根號合成不確定度，再將殘差除以該尺度可比較訊號大小。這個比值不是漏水機率；共同校準偏差、旅行延遲或管內儲水改變都可能破壞獨立假設，應先檢查再判讀。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「管網水量差與誤差範圍」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "The difference between pipeline input and output may indicate leakage or storage, but measurement error also creates residuals. Independent meter uncertainties combine by root sum of squares, allowing residual magnitude to be compared with an uncertainty scale. The ratio is not a leakage probability; shared calibration bias, travel delay and changing pipe storage can violate the assumptions and must be examined before interpreting the imbalance as physical loss. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Network imbalance and uncertainty” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Qin=1.8 m3/s; Qout=1.74 m3/s; uin=0.02 m3/s; uout=0.018 m3/s; z=(Qin-Qout)/sqrt(uin2+uout2)=2.229882。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Qin=1.8 m3/s; Qout=1.74 m3/s; uin=0.02 m3/s; uout=0.018 m3/s; z=(Qin-Qout)/sqrt(uin2+uout2)=2.229882.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「正規化水量差數值就是管線漏水的百分比機率」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"The normalized flow imbalance directly equals the percentage probability of leakage\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「管網水量差與誤差範圍」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Network imbalance and uncertainty”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
