         "id": "b220-v15-37-k1",
         "title": "管網水量差與誤差範圍",
         "titleEn": "Network imbalance and uncertainty",
         "text": "聯通管路進出水量之差可提示漏失或暫存，但量測誤差也能形成殘差。若兩個流量計誤差獨立，以平方和開根號合成不確定度，再將殘差除以該尺度可比較訊號大小。",
         "textEn": "The difference between pipeline input and output may indicate leakage or storage, but measurement error also creates residuals. Independent meter uncertainties combine by root sum of squares, allowing residual magnitude to be compared with an uncertainty scale.",
