       "objective": "以數值模型估算「管網水量差與誤差範圍」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。",
       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Network imbalance and uncertainty” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Qin=1.8 m3/s; Qout=1.74 m3/s; uin=0.02 m3/s; uout=0.018 m3/s; z=(Qin-Qout)/sqrt(uin2+uout2)=2.229882。適用邊界：兩標準不確定度獨立且流量同步穩態，無蓄量變化；比值不是機率。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Qin=1.8 m3/s; Qout=1.74 m3/s; uin=0.02 m3/s; uout=0.018 m3/s; z=(Qin-Qout)/sqrt(uin2+uout2)=2.229882. Applicable boundary: Independent standard uncertainties and synchronized steady flows with no storage change; the ratio is not a probability. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：使用共同時鐘比較累積水量，先排除充水、排空及壓力改變造成的暫存，再檢查流量計校準是否共享偏差。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Compare cumulative volumes on a shared clock, excluding filling, draining and pressure-related storage before checking shared calibration bias.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
       "checkEn": "Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b220-v15-38-k1",
         "title": "定量模型",
