       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「管網水量差與誤差範圍」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Network imbalance and uncertainty” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "使用共同時鐘比較累積水量，先排除充水、排空及壓力改變造成的暫存，再檢查流量計校準是否共享偏差。以多日殘差趨勢搭配分段量測定位，不把一次超出誤差尺度直接當成漏水位置。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare cumulative volumes on a shared clock, excluding filling, draining and pressure-related storage before checking shared calibration bias. Combine multi-day residual trends with sectional measurements for localization rather than treating one large normalized residual as a leak location. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：把兩儀表標準不確定度各加倍，重算比值並保持水量差不變，再說明若共享系統偏差存在，應如何改寫變異數而非繼續套獨立公式。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Double both meter standard uncertainties while keeping imbalance fixed, recalculate the ratio and explain how a shared systematic component requires a covariance term rather than continued use of the independent-error formula.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把比值二點多說成漏水機率百分之二點多，混淆無因次尺度與機率；若兩流量計誤差高度相關卻仍用獨立平方和，則不確定度可能被錯估，診斷信心隨之失真。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Interpreting a ratio near two as a two-percent leak probability confuses a scale with probability. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
