       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「管網水量差與誤差範圍」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Network imbalance and uncertainty” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把比值二點多說成漏水機率百分之二點多，混淆無因次尺度與機率；若兩流量計誤差高度相關卻仍用獨立平方和，則不確定度可能被錯估，診斷信心隨之失真。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Interpreting a ratio near two as a two-percent leak probability confuses a scale with probability. Applying independent root-sum-square uncertainty to correlated meters can misstate uncertainty and distort confidence in the diagnosis. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：這個比值不是漏水機率；共同校準偏差、旅行延遲或管內儲水改變都可能破壞獨立假設，應先檢查再判讀。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: The ratio is not a leakage probability; shared calibration bias, travel delay and changing pipe storage can violate the assumptions and must be examined before interpreting the imbalance as physical loss.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「正規化水量差數值就是管線漏水的百分比機率」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The normalized flow imbalance directly equals the percentage probability of leakage\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b220-v15-40-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
