         "text": "把比值二點多說成漏水機率百分之二點多，混淆無因次尺度與機率；若兩流量計誤差高度相關卻仍用獨立平方和，則不確定度可能被錯估，診斷信心隨之失真。",
         "textEn": "Interpreting a ratio near two as a two-percent leak probability confuses a scale with probability. Applying independent root-sum-square uncertainty to correlated meters can misstate uncertainty and distort confidence in the diagnosis.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-nanhua-history",
          "b-src-water",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b220-v15-40-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
