   "workedExample": {
    "title": "原創假想算例與邊界",
    "titleEn": "Original hypothetical example and boundaries",
    "text": "本課原創比較練習分兩個相互獨立的物理模型。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設總流量6000 m³/s、有效開口3000 m²，平均流速Q/A=2 m/s；局部面積減20%則為2.5 m/s。只比較準穩定斷面，不模擬迴流。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設海灣有效面積80 km²、潮差2 m，棱體AΔh=160 million m³；若完全混合且交換率0.3，等效新水為48 million m³，不含河流。先逐一圈出公式內的控制體、力方向或時間尺度，再把每項輸入的量綱換成一致單位。第二人只根據輸入重算結果，不抄第一人的中間數字。最後指出這兩個估算尚未包含的空間變化、非線性及量測誤差；若將結果用於另一座工程，必須重建其幾何、材料與邊界條件，不能挪用本練習的假設。",
    "textEn": "This original comparison exercise uses two independent physical models. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume discharge 6000 m³/s and effective area 3000 m²: Q/A=2 m/s. Reducing area by twenty percent gives 2.5 m/s. This compares quasi-steady sections and excludes recirculation. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume effective bay area 80 km² and tidal range 2 m: AΔh=160 million m³. With complete mixing and exchange efficiency 0.3, effective new water is 48 million m³, excluding rivers. First identify the control volume, force direction or time scale in each relation, then convert every input to consistent units. A second reviewer recalculates from the inputs without copying intermediate numbers. Finally identify spatial variability, nonlinear effects and measurement errors omitted by both estimates. Transfer to another structure requires rebuilding its geometry, material description and boundary conditions; the assumed classroom inputs are not transferable design or operating parameters.",
    "assumptions": "數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。",
    "assumptionsEn": "Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.",
    "sourceScope": "原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。",
    "sourceScopeEn": "Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."
   },
