     "description": "本階段聚焦「開口流速與收縮」與「潮稜體與生態交換」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Opening velocity and contraction\" and \"Tidal prism and ecological exchange\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b221-v15-01",
       "title": "開口流速與收縮：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Opening velocity and contraction: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
