       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「開口流速與收縮」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Opening velocity and contraction” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "把聲學流速剖面按同一潮相積分，核對斷面流量與上下游水位差；另取閘緣測線，避免以河道中央的單點值代表整個收縮流場。以收縮前後斷面重複量測檢查連續方程的閉合，量化遺漏側向流的大小。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Integrate acoustic velocity profiles at matched tidal phases and compare section discharge with the water-level difference. Add gate-edge transects instead of treating a central point as the entire contracted flow field. Repeat upstream and downstream transects to close continuity and quantify any omitted lateral flow contribution. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以開口流速與收縮編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。把聲學流速剖面按同一潮相積分，核對斷面流量與上下游水位差；另取閘緣測線，避免以河道中央的單點值代表整個收縮流場。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for opening velocity and contraction, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Integrate acoustic velocity profiles at matched tidal phases and compare section discharge with the water-level difference. Add gate-edge transects instead of treating a central point as the entire contracted flow field.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：局部高速帶若穿過未保護接縫，平均流速正常仍可能淘空床層。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A narrow fast jet crossing an unprotected joint may erode the bed despite an acceptable average velocity. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
