         "textEn": "Integrate acoustic velocity profiles at matched tidal phases and compare section discharge with the water-level difference. Add gate-edge transects instead of treating a central point as the entire contracted flow field. Repeat upstream and downstream transects to close continuity and quantify any omitted lateral flow contribution.",
