       "objective": "從症狀倒推「開口流速與收縮」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Opening velocity and contraction” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "局部高速帶若穿過未保護接縫，平均流速正常仍可能淘空床層。潮向翻轉會把危險區換邊，因此只有單向測線無法確認完整保護範圍。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A narrow fast jet crossing an unprotected joint may erode the bed despite an acceptable average velocity. Tidal reversal moves the vulnerable side, so one-direction transects cannot establish the full protection footprint. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：潮向翻轉會把危險區換邊，因此只有單向測線無法確認完整保護範圍。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Tidal reversal moves the vulnerable side, so one-direction transects cannot establish the full protection footprint.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「開口平均流速相同就能保證閘緣沖刷完全相同。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Equal opening-average velocity guarantees identical gate-edge scour.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b221-v15-04-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "局部高速帶若穿過未保護接縫，平均流速正常仍可能淘空床層。潮向翻轉會把危險區換邊，因此只有單向測線無法確認完整保護範圍。",
         "textEn": "A narrow fast jet crossing an unprotected joint may erode the bed despite an acceptable average velocity. Tidal reversal moves the vulnerable side, so one-direction transects cannot establish the full protection footprint.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-rws-east",
          "v15s-rws-east-work",
          "v15s-rws-maeslant",
          "v15s-usace-steel",
