         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：潮汐交換體積大就能保證每個灣角都迅速換水。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: A large tidal prism guarantees rapid renewal in every bay corner. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
