         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume effective bay area 80 km² and tidal range 2 m: AΔh=160 million m³. With complete mixing and exchange efficiency 0.3, effective new water is 48 million m³, excluding rivers.",
