       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b221-v15-06"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「潮稜體與生態交換」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Tidal prism and ecological exchange” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "對齊潮位基準、濕潤面積曲線與鹽度剖面；比較漲落潮的示蹤訊號是否返回，並以多個分支測站判斷完全混合假設在哪些區域失效。以退潮示蹤回返比例估算再循環，將實際更新率與純幾何潮稜體分開報告。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Align tidal datum, wetted-area curves and salinity profiles. Compare tracer returns between flood and ebb, using stations in several branches to identify where the complete-mixing assumption fails. Estimate recirculation from returning ebb tracers and report actual renewal separately from the geometric tidal prism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以潮稜體與生態交換編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。對齊潮位基準、濕潤面積曲線與鹽度剖面；比較漲落潮的示蹤訊號是否返回，並以多個分支測站判斷完全混合假設在哪些區域失效。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for tidal prism and ecological exchange, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Align tidal datum, wetted-area curves and salinity profiles. Compare tracer returns between flood and ebb, using stations in several branches to identify where the complete-mixing assumption fails.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：只用固定面積乘潮差可能漏掉潮灘乾濕變化；把同一團回流海水重複計為新水，也會低估污染物停留時間，掩蓋局部缺氧風險。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A fixed area times tidal range misses wetting and drying of tidal flats. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b221-v15-07-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "對齊潮位基準、濕潤面積曲線與鹽度剖面；比較漲落潮的示蹤訊號是否返回，並以多個分支測站判斷完全混合假設在哪些區域失效。以退潮示蹤回返比例估算再循環，將實際更新率與純幾何潮稜體分開報告。",
         "textEn": "Align tidal datum, wetted-area curves and salinity profiles. Compare tracer returns between flood and ebb, using stations in several branches to identify where the complete-mixing assumption fails. Estimate recirculation from returning ebb tracers and report actual renewal separately from the geometric tidal prism.",
         "sourceIds": [
