        {
         "id": "b221-v15-07-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "以潮稜體與生態交換編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。對齊潮位基準、濕潤面積曲線與鹽度剖面；比較漲落潮的示蹤訊號是否返回，並以多個分支測站判斷完全混合假設在哪些區域失效。",
         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for tidal prism and ecological exchange, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Align tidal datum, wetted-area curves and salinity profiles. Compare tracer returns between flood and ebb, using stations in several branches to identify where the complete-mixing assumption fails.",
