       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Tidal prism and ecological exchange” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "只用固定面積乘潮差可能漏掉潮灘乾濕變化；把同一團回流海水重複計為新水，也會低估污染物停留時間，掩蓋局部缺氧風險。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A fixed area times tidal range misses wetting and drying of tidal flats. Counting recirculated seawater repeatedly as new inflow underestimates contaminant residence and can conceal localized oxygen depletion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
