       "instruction": "分別繪出兩側壓力圖後相減，再對底部積分求彎矩；將水位計的共同基準與閘門幾何測量交叉核對，不能用壓差單值猜合力作用點。檢查壓力積分同時滿足合力及力矩平衡，並對水位基準偏差作敏感度分析。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Plot both pressure diagrams, subtract them and integrate moments about the base. Cross-check the gauges common datum against surveyed gate geometry rather than inferring the resultant elevation from one pressure difference. Check that pressure integration satisfies both force and moment balance and test sensitivity to gauge-datum offsets. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以雙側水壓合力編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。分別繪出兩側壓力圖後相減，再對底部積分求彎矩；將水位計的共同基準與閘門幾何測量交叉核對，不能用壓差單值猜合力作用點。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for differential hydrostatic gate force, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Plot both pressure diagrams, subtract them and integrate moments about the base. Cross-check the gauges common datum against surveyed gate geometry rather than inferring the resultant elevation from one pressure difference.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：測站基準差會造成虛假淨水頭，導致支承反力估計偏移。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A gauge datum mismatch creates false net head and shifts inferred reactions. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
