       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Differential hydrostatic gate force” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "測站基準差會造成虛假淨水頭，導致支承反力估計偏移。若忽略波浪瞬時吸力或門體變形，靜水合力相符仍不能證明焊縫與導輪安全。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A gauge datum mismatch creates false net head and shifts inferred reactions. Ignoring transient wave suction or gate deformation means agreement with hydrostatic force cannot demonstrate weld or guide-wheel adequacy. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若忽略波浪瞬時吸力或門體變形，靜水合力相符仍不能證明焊縫與導輪安全。",
