        "v15s-usace-steel",
        "v15s-usace-mechanical"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b221-v15-12"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「反濾層顆粒保持」如何影響荷蘭東斯海爾德防潮閘的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Filter particle retention” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Oosterschelde storm-surge barrier”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "護床石下方的細土不能被水流穿過大孔隙帶走，反濾層須同時保持基土並讓水排出。單一粒徑比例只是初步篩選；廣級配、分散性與流向反轉需要材料試驗，不能靠增厚大石代替細部相容。 假設基土d85=0.5 mm、反濾料D15=1.8 mm，保持比D15/d85=3.6；只作粒徑比較，不宣稱適用所有土類的驗收門檻。 粗料看似排水良好卻可能放走細土，過細反濾層則會堵塞並增加上浮水壓。若只檢查料場樣品，現場離析形成的薄弱帶可能完全漏判。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「反濾層顆粒保持」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Fine foundation soil must not migrate through voids beneath armor. Filters must retain the base soil while allowing drainage. A grain-size ratio is only screening evidence; broad grading, dispersivity and flow reversal require material testing rather than simply placing thicker large rock. Assume base-soil d85=0.5 mm and filter D15=1.8 mm. Their retention ratio is 3.6, a grading comparison rather than an acceptance limit applicable to every soil. Coarse material may drain freely while losing soil; an overly fine filter can clog and raise uplift. Stockpile-only testing can entirely miss weak bands produced by segregation during placement. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Filter particle retention” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設基土d85=0.5 mm、反濾料D15=1.8 mm，保持比D15/d85=3.6；只作粒徑比較，不宣稱適用所有土類的驗收門檻。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume base-soil d85=0.5 mm and filter D15=1.8 mm.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「反濾料越粗越厚就一定越能阻止基土流失。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Coarser and thicker filter material always prevents more base-soil loss.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「反濾層顆粒保持」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Filter particle retention”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
