         "text": "教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。假設床剪應力30 Pa、石密度2650、水密度1000 kg/m³、粒徑0.1 m；θ=30/((2650−1000)9.81×0.1)=0.01853，非通用臨界值。",
         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s². Assume shear stress 30 Pa, rock and water densities 2650 and 1000 kg/m³, diameter 0.1 m: θ=30/((2650−1000)9.81×0.1)=0.01853. This is not a universal critical value.",
         "sourceIds": [
