       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「護床起動與尺度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Armor mobility and scale” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "比較不同潮相的近床紊流與重複測深，將石粒移位標記到坡面、邊界和接縫；用試驗確認起動分散程度，而非只查一個平均粒徑。沿護床外緣建立固定測深斷面，辨認淘刷坑是否朝基礎方向持續後退侵蝕。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare near-bed turbulence and repeat bathymetry across tidal phases. Map displaced stones to slopes, edges and joints, and use tests to characterize variability in initiation rather than checking only mean diameter. Establish repeatable edge bathymetry sections and determine whether scour holes progressively retreat toward the foundation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以護床起動與尺度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。比較不同潮相的近床紊流與重複測深，將石粒移位標記到坡面、邊界和接縫；用試驗確認起動分散程度，而非只查一個平均粒徑。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for armor mobility and scale, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare near-bed turbulence and repeat bathymetry across tidal phases. Map displaced stones to slopes, edges and joints, and use tests to characterize variability in initiation rather than checking only mean diameter.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：邊緣保護長度不足會產生淘刷坑，再向墩底倒退侵蝕。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Insufficient edge protection creates a scour hole that can migrate back toward the pier. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
