      {
       "id": "b221-v15-21",
       "title": "墩底接觸偏心：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Eccentric pier bearing: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-rws-east",
        "v15s-rws-east-work",
        "v15s-rws-maeslant",
        "v15s-usace-steel",
        "v15s-usace-mechanical"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b221-v15-20"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「墩底接觸偏心」如何影響荷蘭東斯海爾德防潮閘的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Eccentric pier bearing” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Oosterschelde storm-surge barrier”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "巨型墩底將門體水平荷載轉成基礎壓力分布，偏心越大越可能出現局部脫離。線性接觸模型只有在全底面受壓時適用；海床不平、局部沖刷與土體壓縮會使剛體假設改變。 假設每延米底寬12 m、豎力2400 kN/m、偏心1 m，全壓線性模型q=V/B(1±6e/B)，得到300及100 kPa；未考慮上浮。 把總重量直接當有效正向力會高估抗滑與接觸壓力。若線性式算出拉應力仍保留全接觸面積，後續承載力分析會系統性低估局部集中。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「墩底接觸偏心」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A large pier converts gate horizontal loading into foundation pressure. Increasing eccentricity can cause partial separation. Linear contact stress applies only with full compression; uneven seabed, local scour and compressible ground can invalidate the assumed rigid-base behavior. Assume base width 12 m, vertical force 2400 kN/m and eccentricity 1 m. Full-contact linear q=V/B(1±6e/B) gives 300 and 100 kPa, before uplift is considered. Treating gross weight as effective normal force overestimates sliding resistance and contact loading. Keeping a full contact area after the linear solution predicts tension systematically understates local stress concentration. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Eccentric pier bearing” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設每延米底寬12 m、豎力2400 kN/m、偏心1 m，全壓線性模型q=V/B(1±6e/B)，得到300及100 kPa；未考慮上浮。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume base width 12 m, vertical force 2400 kN/m and eccentricity 1 m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「基底算出拉力時仍可直接沿用全接觸線性壓力式。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Full-contact linear base-pressure equations remain valid after predicting tension.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「墩底接觸偏心」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Eccentric pier bearing”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b221-v15-21-k1",
         "title": "墩底接觸偏心",
         "titleEn": "Eccentric pier bearing",
         "text": "巨型墩底將門體水平荷載轉成基礎壓力分布，偏心越大越可能出現局部脫離。線性接觸模型只有在全底面受壓時適用；海床不平、局部沖刷與土體壓縮會使剛體假設改變。",
         "textEn": "A large pier converts gate horizontal loading into foundation pressure. Increasing eccentricity can cause partial separation.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-rws-east",
          "v15s-rws-east-work",
          "v15s-rws-maeslant",
          "v15s-usace-steel",
          "v15s-usace-mechanical"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b221-v15-21-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：基底算出拉力時仍可直接沿用全接觸線性壓力式。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Full-contact linear base-pressure equations remain valid after predicting tension. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
