       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「墩底接觸偏心」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Eccentric pier bearing” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "把傾斜、沉降與底部孔壓的時間序列同步，先扣除潮汐彈性反應，再查反覆荷載後是否留下殘餘位移；重算淨豎力和接觸面積。分別計算扣除孔壓前後的合力位置，檢查最小接觸應力是否仍保持受壓。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Synchronize tilt, settlement and foundation pore-pressure histories. Separate reversible tidal response from residual displacement after loading, then recalculate net vertical force and actual contact area. Calculate resultant locations before and after uplift subtraction and confirm the minimum contact stress remains compressive. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以墩底接觸偏心編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。把傾斜、沉降與底部孔壓的時間序列同步，先扣除潮汐彈性反應，再查反覆荷載後是否留下殘餘位移；重算淨豎力和接觸面積。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for eccentric pier bearing, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Synchronize tilt, settlement and foundation pore-pressure histories. Separate reversible tidal response from residual displacement after loading, then recalculate net vertical force and actual contact area.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把總重量直接當有效正向力會高估抗滑與接觸壓力。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Treating gross weight as effective normal force overestimates sliding resistance and contact loading. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
