    {
     "id": "b221-v15-s4",
     "title": "試驗、量測與監測驗證",
     "titleEn": "Testing, measurement and monitoring",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「潮位滯後與上浮」與「弗勞德縮尺相似」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Tidal lag and uplift\" and \"Froude model similarity\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b221-v15-25",
       "title": "潮位滯後與上浮：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Tidal lag and uplift: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-rws-east",
        "v15s-rws-east-work",
        "v15s-rws-maeslant",
        "v15s-usace-steel",
        "v15s-usace-mechanical"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b221-v15-24"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「潮位滯後與上浮」如何影響荷蘭東斯海爾德防潮閘的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Tidal lag and uplift” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Oosterschelde storm-surge barrier”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "潮水變化傳入地基孔隙需要時間，因此外部低潮不保證墩底孔壓也低。排水路徑與滲透率決定壓力滯後，必須用同時刻的外水位與基底壓力計算有效重量。靜態最高水位包絡未必捕捉最差組合。 假設墩底面積200 m²、平均超額孔壓25 kPa，附加上浮U=ΔuA=5000 kN；均勻孔壓為簡化，不含沿底面相位差。 排水堵塞可能先表現為退潮後孔壓消散變慢，而不是最大讀數突然增高。只看每日峰值會錯過有效重量最低的短暫階段，掩蓋滑動敏感期。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「潮位滯後與上浮」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Tidal changes take time to propagate through foundation pores, so low external water does not ensure low pressure beneath a pier. Drainage paths and permeability control lag. Effective weight requires simultaneous external and basal pressures, not unrelated maximum-level envelopes. Assume base area 200 m² and mean excess pore pressure 25 kPa. Additional uplift U=ΔuA=5000 kN. Uniform pressure is assumed, excluding phase differences across the base. Drainage blockage may first appear as slower dissipation after ebb rather than a higher peak reading. Daily maxima alone miss brief minimum-effective-weight periods and conceal increased sliding sensitivity. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Tidal lag and uplift” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設墩底面積200 m²、平均超額孔壓25 kPa，附加上浮U=ΔuA=5000 kN；均勻孔壓為簡化，不含沿底面相位差。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume base area 200 m² and mean excess pore pressure 25 kPa.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「外海達到低潮時，基底孔壓必定同時達到最低。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Foundation pore pressure necessarily reaches its minimum at external low tide.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「潮位滯後與上浮」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Tidal lag and uplift”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b221-v15-25-k1",
         "title": "潮位滯後與上浮",
         "titleEn": "Tidal lag and uplift",
         "text": "潮水變化傳入地基孔隙需要時間，因此外部低潮不保證墩底孔壓也低。排水路徑與滲透率決定壓力滯後，必須用同時刻的外水位與基底壓力計算有效重量。",
         "textEn": "Tidal changes take time to propagate through foundation pores, so low external water does not ensure low pressure beneath a pier. Drainage paths and permeability control lag.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-rws-east",
          "v15s-rws-east-work",
          "v15s-rws-maeslant",
          "v15s-usace-steel",
