         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b221-v15-25-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：外海達到低潮時，基底孔壓必定同時達到最低。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Foundation pore pressure necessarily reaches its minimum at external low tide. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
