         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume base area 200 m² and mean excess pore pressure 25 kPa. Additional uplift U=ΔuA=5000 kN. Uniform pressure is assumed, excluding phase differences across the base.",
