       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「潮位滯後與上浮」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Tidal lag and uplift” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以不同深度孔壓計追蹤漲退潮的相位與幅度，並確認儀器氣泡、零點漂移和資料延遲；將孔壓積分的上浮結果與傾斜事件時間對照。計算外水位與孔壓的交叉相關延遲，確認滯後可在多個完整潮週期重現。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Track phase and amplitude using piezometers at several depths, checking trapped air, zero drift and logging delay. Compare integrated uplift with the timing of observed pier tilting. Calculate the cross-correlation lag between external level and pore pressure and confirm repeatability across complete tidal cycles. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以潮位滯後與上浮編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以不同深度孔壓計追蹤漲退潮的相位與幅度，並確認儀器氣泡、零點漂移和資料延遲；將孔壓積分的上浮結果與傾斜事件時間對照。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for tidal lag and uplift, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Track phase and amplitude using piezometers at several depths, checking trapped air, zero drift and logging delay. Compare integrated uplift with the timing of observed pier tilting.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：排水堵塞可能先表現為退潮後孔壓消散變慢，而不是最大讀數突然增高。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Drainage blockage may first appear as slower dissipation after ebb rather than a higher peak reading. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
