       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Froude model similarity” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Oosterschelde storm-surge barrier”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "重力主導自由水面的試驗需保持弗勞德數，速度和時間按長度平方根縮放。黏性與表面張力通常不能同時滿足相似，所以模型中的薄水層與小顆粒運動可能失真，量測結果必須附尺度限制。 假設原型與模型長度比25:1，模型流速0.4 m/s；原型速度為0.4√25=2 m/s，模型60 s對應原型300 s；僅適用重力相似。 把模型砂直接按幾何比例替換，可能改變黏聚性與起動機制。即使水面曲線相似，沖刷深度仍可能受到顆粒尺度效應支配，不能只靠影片判斷。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「弗勞德縮尺相似」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Gravity-dominated free-surface tests preserve Froude number, scaling velocity and time with the square root of length. Viscosity and surface tension generally cannot also be matched, so thin flows and small particle motions may distort and require explicit scale qualifications. Assume prototype-to-model length ratio 25:1 and model velocity 0.4 m/s. Prototype velocity is 0.4√25=2 m/s; model 60 s represents 300 s, under gravity similarity only. Geometrically scaling sand can change cohesion and the initiation mechanism. Even similar water-surface curves may accompany scale-dependent scour depths, so visual similarity alone is not adequate validation. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Froude model similarity” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設原型與模型長度比25:1，模型流速0.4 m/s；原型速度為0.4√25=2 m/s，模型60 s對應原型300 s；僅適用重力相似。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume prototype-to-model length ratio 25:1 and model velocity 0.4 m/s.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「模型水面符合弗勞德相似，顆粒運動就必然正確縮尺。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
