       ],
       "objective": "說明「預報偏差與時間裕度」如何影響荷蘭東斯海爾德防潮閘的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Forecast bias and time margin” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Oosterschelde storm-surge barrier”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "防潮決策必須在危險水位抵達前完成資訊、判斷與機械動作。預報水位誤差和到達時間誤差是不同量，海象快速惡化時不能互相替代。課堂只分析時間預算，不重建任何設施的實際關閘規則。 假設預警提前150 min、判讀20 min、準備15 min、動作75 min，剩餘裕度40 min；各值皆假設，未含相關延遲與預報不確定度。 通訊中斷、供電擾動與人員確認可能同受一場風暴影響，直接相加獨立平均值會高估裕度。時間戳不一致也可能把資料延遲誤認為機械遲緩。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「預報偏差與時間裕度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A protective decision must accommodate information, assessment and mechanical response before hazardous water arrives. Water-level error differs from arrival-time error and cannot substitute for it during rapid change. The classroom model examines a time budget without reproducing operational closure rules. Assume warning lead 150 min, assessment 20 min, preparation 15 min and movement 75 min. Remaining margin is 40 min; all are assumed and exclude correlated delays and forecast uncertainty. Communications, power and confirmation can be impaired by the same storm, making independent average delays optimistic. Inconsistent timestamps can also make data latency appear to be slow machinery. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Forecast bias and time margin” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設預警提前150 min、判讀20 min、準備15 min、動作75 min，剩餘裕度40 min；各值皆假設，未含相關延遲與預報不確定度。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume warning lead 150 min, assessment 20 min, preparation 15 min and movement 75 min.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「平均完成時間足以代表任何風暴中的最差時間裕度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Average completion time adequately represents the worst margin in every storm.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「預報偏差與時間裕度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Forecast bias and time margin”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
