         "text": "誤解：平均完成時間足以代表任何風暴中的最差時間裕度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Average completion time adequately represents the worst margin in every storm. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
