       "objective": "以數值模型估算「預報偏差與時間裕度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。",
       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Forecast bias and time margin” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設預警提前150 min、判讀20 min、準備15 min、動作75 min，剩餘裕度40 min；各值皆假設，未含相關延遲與預報不確定度。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume warning lead 150 min, assessment 20 min, preparation 15 min and movement 75 min. Remaining margin is 40 min; all are assumed and exclude correlated delays and forecast uncertainty. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：在歷次演練資料標註預報發行、接收、確認與完成時間，以同一時鐘計算分布；另列漏報與假警報，不能只報平均完成時間來評價決策品質。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Timestamp forecast issue, receipt, confirmation and completion in exercise records using one clock.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
       "checkEn": "Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.",
