         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume warning lead 150 min, assessment 20 min, preparation 15 min and movement 75 min. Remaining margin is 40 min; all are assumed and exclude correlated delays and forecast uncertainty.",
