       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「預報偏差與時間裕度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Forecast bias and time margin” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "在歷次演練資料標註預報發行、接收、確認與完成時間，以同一時鐘計算分布；另列漏報與假警報，不能只報平均完成時間來評價決策品質。以最慢實測階段重建時間預算，檢查不確定度同時放大時是否仍有足夠裕度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Timestamp forecast issue, receipt, confirmation and completion in exercise records using one clock. Evaluate missed events and false alarms separately instead of judging decisions solely by average completion time. Rebuild the budget using slow observed stages and assess remaining margin when several uncertainties increase together. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以預報偏差與時間裕度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。在歷次演練資料標註預報發行、接收、確認與完成時間，以同一時鐘計算分布；另列漏報與假警報，不能只報平均完成時間來評價決策品質。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for forecast bias and time margin, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Timestamp forecast issue, receipt, confirmation and completion in exercise records using one clock. Evaluate missed events and false alarms separately instead of judging decisions solely by average completion time.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：通訊中斷、供電擾動與人員確認可能同受一場風暴影響，直接相加獨立平均值會高估裕度。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Communications, power and confirmation can be impaired by the same storm, making independent average delays optimistic. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b221-v15-35-k1",
