         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "在歷次演練資料標註預報發行、接收、確認與完成時間，以同一時鐘計算分布；另列漏報與假警報，不能只報平均完成時間來評價決策品質。以最慢實測階段重建時間預算，檢查不確定度同時放大時是否仍有足夠裕度。",
         "textEn": "Timestamp forecast issue, receipt, confirmation and completion in exercise records using one clock. Evaluate missed events and false alarms separately instead of judging decisions solely by average completion time. Rebuild the budget using slow observed stages and assess remaining margin when several uncertainties increase together.",
