         "text": "以預報偏差與時間裕度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。在歷次演練資料標註預報發行、接收、確認與完成時間，以同一時鐘計算分布；另列漏報與假警報，不能只報平均完成時間來評價決策品質。",
         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for forecast bias and time margin, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Timestamp forecast issue, receipt, confirmation and completion in exercise records using one clock. Evaluate missed events and false alarms separately instead of judging decisions solely by average completion time.",
