       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Forecast bias and time margin” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "通訊中斷、供電擾動與人員確認可能同受一場風暴影響，直接相加獨立平均值會高估裕度。時間戳不一致也可能把資料延遲誤認為機械遲緩。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Communications, power and confirmation can be impaired by the same storm, making independent average delays optimistic. Inconsistent timestamps can also make data latency appear to be slow machinery. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
