       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「腐蝕餘厚與疲勞」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Corrosion allowance and fatigue” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "固定網格重複超音波測厚，特別覆蓋水線、焊縫與積水角；以塗層狀況和裂紋檢測對照厚度趨勢，保留儀器校正及量測位置重現性。對最薄位置做獨立重測並檢查焊趾，將平均腐蝕率與局部極值分別存檔。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Repeat ultrasonic thickness measurements on a fixed grid covering waterlines, welds and trapped-water corners. Compare coating condition and crack inspection with thickness trends, preserving calibration and location repeatability. Independently repeat the thinnest readings and inspect weld toes, preserving mean corrosion rate separately from local extremes. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以腐蝕餘厚與疲勞編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。固定網格重複超音波測厚，特別覆蓋水線、焊縫與積水角；以塗層狀況和裂紋檢測對照厚度趨勢，保留儀器校正及量測位置重現性。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for corrosion allowance and fatigue, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Repeat ultrasonic thickness measurements on a fixed grid covering waterlines, welds and trapped-water corners. Compare coating condition and crack inspection with thickness trends, preserving calibration and location repeatability.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：以平均厚度遮蔽單個深坑會高估局部承載能力；反過來把表面粗糙造成的回波誤差當真減薄也會誤導維護。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Average thickness can conceal a deep local pit and overstate resistance, while roughness-related echo error can imitate thinning. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
