         "textEn": "Repeat ultrasonic thickness measurements on a fixed grid covering waterlines, welds and trapped-water corners. Compare coating condition and crack inspection with thickness trends, preserving calibration and location repeatability. Independently repeat the thinnest readings and inspect weld toes, preserving mean corrosion rate separately from local extremes.",
