         "text": "以平均厚度遮蔽單個深坑會高估局部承載能力；反過來把表面粗糙造成的回波誤差當真減薄也會誤導維護。焊趾裂紋可在餘厚足夠時擴展。",
         "textEn": "Average thickness can conceal a deep local pit and overstate resistance, while roughness-related echo error can imitate thinning. Weld-toe cracks may continue growing even where remaining gross thickness appears adequate.",
