   "workedExample": {
    "title": "原創假想算例與邊界",
    "titleEn": "Original hypothetical example and boundaries",
    "text": "本課原創比較練習分兩個相互獨立的物理模型。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設水線面積1200 m²、加入淡水質量600 t，外水密度1025 kg/m³；ΔT=m/(ρA)=0.4878 m，限小吃水與固定水線面積。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設水平合力8 MN、對基礎有效力臂60 m，外力矩M=Fr=480 MN·m；這是整體平衡量，非球鉸直接承受的純彎矩。先逐一圈出公式內的控制體、力方向或時間尺度，再把每項輸入的量綱換成一致單位。第二人只根據輸入重算結果，不抄第一人的中間數字。最後指出這兩個估算尚未包含的空間變化、非線性及量測誤差；若將結果用於另一座工程，必須重建其幾何、材料與邊界條件，不能挪用本練習的假設。 單參數敏感度：固定水線面積1200 m²及外水密度1025 kg/m³，只把新增質量由600 t降至300 t。ΔT=m/(ρA)由0.4878 m降至0.2439 m，恰為一半；此比例限小吃水變化與固定水線面積，不適用浸沒後水線形狀明顯改變的狀態。",
    "textEn": "This original comparison exercise uses two independent physical models. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume waterplane area 1200 m², added mass 600 t and external density 1025 kg/m³. ΔT=m/(ρA)=0.4878 m, for small changes and constant waterplane area. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume horizontal resultant 8 MN and effective foundation lever arm 60 m. External moment M=Fr=480 MN·m is a global equilibrium quantity, not a pure moment carried directly by the ball joint. First identify the control volume, force direction or time scale in each relation, then convert every input to consistent units. A second reviewer recalculates from the inputs without copying intermediate numbers. Finally identify spatial variability, nonlinear effects and measurement errors omitted by both estimates. Transfer to another structure requires rebuilding its geometry, material description and boundary conditions; the assumed classroom inputs are not transferable design or operating parameters. For a one-parameter sensitivity comparison, hold waterplane area at 1200 m² and external density at 1025 kg/m³, reducing only added mass from 600 t to 300 t. ΔT=m/(ρA) falls from 0.4878 m to 0.2439 m, exactly half. This scaling assumes small draft changes and a constant waterplane, not substantially changed submerged geometry.",
    "assumptions": "數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。",
    "assumptionsEn": "Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.",
    "sourceScope": "原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。",
    "sourceScopeEn": "Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."
   },
