     "description": "本階段聚焦「浮運吃水與壓載」與「球鉸支臂力矩」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Floating draft and ballast\" and \"Spherical-joint arm moment\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
