         "id": "b222-v15-01-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：浮力與重量平衡就能保證門體漂浮姿態穩定。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Balanced buoyancy and weight guarantee a stable floating attitude. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
