       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「浮運吃水與壓載」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Floating draft and ballast” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "同步比較左右吃水、艙內水量與門體傾角，檢查壓載質量是否與排水增量一致；把鹽度引起的外水密度變化另外列出。利用各艙液位推算重心移動，核對觀測傾斜方向是否符合新增壓載的位置。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare port and starboard drafts, ballast volume and tilt synchronously. Check added mass against displaced volume and record salinity-related external density changes separately. Infer center-of-gravity movement from individual tank levels and check that observed heel matches the added ballast location. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以浮運吃水與壓載編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。同步比較左右吃水、艙內水量與門體傾角，檢查壓載質量是否與排水增量一致；把鹽度引起的外水密度變化另外列出。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for floating draft and ballast, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare port and starboard drafts, ballast volume and tilt synchronously. Check added mass against displaced volume and record salinity-related external density changes separately.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：艙內自由液面會削弱穩定性，即使總浮力平衡也可能出現傾斜。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Internal free surfaces reduce stability even when total buoyancy balances weight. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
