       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「支臂壓桿穩定」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Arm compression-member stability” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以測量所得桿件初彎曲建立幾何模型，核對節點轉動和側向支撐位置；比較不同有效長度的敏感性，不直接把理論臨界力當容許荷載。比較支點轉角和壓桿側向位移的關係，以辨認實際端部是否近似鉸接或有拘束。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Model measured initial curvature, joint rotation and lateral bracing locations. Compare sensitivity to effective length instead of treating the theoretical critical force as an allowable load. Compare support rotation with member lateral displacement to identify whether real ends approximate pins or restrained connections. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以支臂壓桿穩定編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以測量所得桿件初彎曲建立幾何模型，核對節點轉動和側向支撐位置；比較不同有效長度的敏感性，不直接把理論臨界力當容許荷載。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for arm compression-member stability, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Model measured initial curvature, joint rotation and lateral bracing locations. Compare sensitivity to effective length instead of treating the theoretical critical force as an allowable load.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：節點腐蝕或鬆動會改變端部拘束，讓先前的有效長度假設失效。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Joint corrosion or looseness changes end restraint and invalidates an earlier effective length. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b222-v15-11-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "以測量所得桿件初彎曲建立幾何模型，核對節點轉動和側向支撐位置；比較不同有效長度的敏感性，不直接把理論臨界力當容許荷載。比較支點轉角和壓桿側向位移的關係，以辨認實際端部是否近似鉸接或有拘束。",
         "textEn": "Model measured initial curvature, joint rotation and lateral bracing locations. Compare sensitivity to effective length instead of treating the theoretical critical force as an allowable load. Compare support rotation with member lateral displacement to identify whether real ends approximate pins or restrained connections.",
