       "objective": "從症狀倒推「支臂壓桿穩定」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Arm compression-member stability” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "節點腐蝕或鬆動會改變端部拘束，讓先前的有效長度假設失效。若只檢查材料強度，便可能漏掉受壓桿件突然出現的側向失穩。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Joint corrosion or looseness changes end restraint and invalidates an earlier effective length. Checking material strength alone can miss sudden lateral instability in an otherwise apparently adequate compression member. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
