       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「曲面門水壓分解」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Resolving pressure on curved gates” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "分別畫水平與垂直投影，對照多點壓力計積分與結構反力；若潮水淹過門頂或兩側皆有水，須更新濕潤邊界再計算。以相同水位的獨立積分重算垂直分量，確認水平投影沒有被當成全部濕潤面。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Draw separate horizontal and vertical projections, comparing integrated pressure measurements with reactions. Revise wetted boundaries whenever water overtops the gate or occupies both sides. Independently integrate the vertical component at matching levels and verify that projected area is not mistaken for wetted area. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以曲面門水壓分解編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。分別畫水平與垂直投影，對照多點壓力計積分與結構反力；若潮水淹過門頂或兩側皆有水，須更新濕潤邊界再計算。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for resolving pressure on curved gates, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Draw separate horizontal and vertical projections, comparing integrated pressure measurements with reactions. Revise wetted boundaries whenever water overtops the gate or occupies both sides.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把水壓視為全水平會漏掉浮沉方向荷載，影響壓載與接觸判斷。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Treating all pressure as horizontal misses vertical loading that affects ballast and contact. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
