         "textEn": "Draw separate horizontal and vertical projections, comparing integrated pressure measurements with reactions. Revise wetted boundaries whenever water overtops the gate or occupies both sides. Independently integrate the vertical component at matching levels and verify that projected area is not mistaken for wetted area.",
