       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for free-surface stability correction, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Calculate free-surface moments from tank shape and level, checking whether baffles actually restrict transverse flow. Relate heel measurements to each filling stage rather than only initial and final conditions.",
