       "objective": "從症狀倒推「自由液面穩定修正」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Free-surface stability correction” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "部分充水的過渡階段可能比空艙或滿艙更不利。若把隔板當成密閉分艙而實際有大開孔，計算會低估液體轉移和動態晃蕩。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "An intermediate filling stage may be less stable than empty or full tanks. Treating perforated baffles as sealed subdivisions understates liquid transfer and dynamic sloshing across the available free surface. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若把隔板當成密閉分艙而實際有大開孔，計算會低估液體轉移和動態晃蕩。",
