       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Under-gate flow before seating” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。假設狹縫寬30 m、高0.2 m、壓差水頭1 m、Cd=0.65；Q=CdA√(2gΔh)=17.27 m³/s，僅為穩定孔口近似。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s². Assume slot width 30 m, height 0.2 m, head difference 1 m and Cd=0.65. Q=CdA√(2gΔh)=17.27 m³/s, a steady-orifice approximation only. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：對照底隙幾何、上下游水位與局部聲學流速，檢查孔口係數是否隨門位改變；把渦動頻率與門體振動頻譜比較而非只看流量。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Compare gap geometry, head and local acoustic velocities, checking how the discharge coefficient varies with position.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
