       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「止水縫漏流診斷」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Seal leakage diagnosis” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以漏流除水頭平方根作初步正規化，再核對門位、溫度與止水接觸痕；用分區集水找出漏流位置，保留每次比較的潮向。對相同水頭的重複試驗比較流量斜率，並以密封接觸影像區分縫寬改變和雜物卡塞。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Normalize leakage initially by square root of head, then compare position, temperature and contact marks. Locate leakage using sectional collection while retaining the tidal direction for each comparison. Compare repeated flow-head slopes at equal heads and use contact imagery to distinguish gap growth from trapped debris. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以止水縫漏流診斷編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以漏流除水頭平方根作初步正規化，再核對門位、溫度與止水接觸痕；用分區集水找出漏流位置，保留每次比較的潮向。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for seal leakage diagnosis, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Normalize leakage initially by square root of head, then compare position, temperature and contact marks. Locate leakage using sectional collection while retaining the tidal direction for each comparison.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：小縫中的黏性流可能不遵守孔口平方根關係，不能把正規化曲線偏移全歸於磨耗。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Viscous flow through a very narrow gap may not follow the orifice square-root law. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
