       "objective": "從症狀倒推「止水縫漏流診斷」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Seal leakage diagnosis” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "小縫中的黏性流可能不遵守孔口平方根關係，不能把正規化曲線偏移全歸於磨耗。雜物卡縫與門體歪斜也會產生相似漏水訊號。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Viscous flow through a very narrow gap may not follow the orifice square-root law. Debris and gate misalignment can imitate wear, so normalized curve changes do not uniquely identify material deterioration. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：雜物卡縫與門體歪斜也會產生相似漏水訊號。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Debris and gate misalignment can imitate wear, so normalized curve changes do not uniquely identify material deterioration.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「漏流增加就足以證明止水橡膠老化，無須檢查水頭。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Increasing leakage proves seal ageing without checking the head difference.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
