      {
       "id": "b222-v15-29",
       "title": "共同原因與備援：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Common cause and redundancy: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-rws-maeslant",
        "v15s-hollandia-maeslant",
        "v15s-rws-east",
        "v15s-usace-steel",
        "v15s-usace-mechanical"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b222-v15-28"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「共同原因與備援」如何影響荷蘭馬仕朗防潮閘的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Common cause and redundancy” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Maeslant storm-surge barrier”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "兩套備援設備若共用電源、機房或感測來源，就不是完全獨立。風暴可能同時破壞多條功能鏈，可靠度計算必須把共同原因與單機失效分開。 假設兩單元各獨立失效機率0.02，共同原因機率0.005；簡化總失效q=0.005+0.995×0.02²=0.005398，非本站實測可靠度。 將共用電纜路徑的兩套系統視為獨立會大幅低估失效。備援設備即使定期空載測試合格，也未必能在淹水、斷電和高荷載同時出現時接替。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「共同原因與備援」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Redundant equipment sharing power, rooms or sensing is not fully independent. One storm may damage several functional chains, requiring common-cause events to be separated from individual equipment failures. Assume independent unit-failure probabilities 0.02 and common-cause probability 0.005. Simplified total q=0.005+0.995×0.02²=0.005398, not a measured site reliability. Treating two systems in one cable route as independent understates failure. Successful unloaded backup tests do not prove takeover during simultaneous flooding, power loss and high mechanical demand. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Common cause and redundancy” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設兩單元各獨立失效機率0.02，共同原因機率0.005；簡化總失效q=0.005+0.995×0.02²=0.005398，非本站實測可靠度。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume independent unit-failure probabilities 0.02 and common-cause probability 0.005.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「設備數量加倍就能直接把整體失效機率平方。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Doubling equipment automatically squares the complete system failure probability.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「共同原因與備援」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Common cause and redundancy”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b222-v15-29-k1",
         "title": "共同原因與備援",
         "titleEn": "Common cause and redundancy",
         "text": "兩套備援設備若共用電源、機房或感測來源，就不是完全獨立。風暴可能同時破壞多條功能鏈，可靠度計算必須把共同原因與單機失效分開。",
         "textEn": "Redundant equipment sharing power, rooms or sensing is not fully independent. One storm may damage several functional chains, requiring common-cause events to be separated from individual equipment failures.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-rws-maeslant",
          "v15s-hollandia-maeslant",
          "v15s-rws-east",
          "v15s-usace-steel",
          "v15s-usace-mechanical"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b222-v15-29-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：設備數量加倍就能直接把整體失效機率平方。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
