       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for common cause and redundancy, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Trace shared power, cooling, network, sensing and maintenance dependencies. Use exercise events to verify actual separation and document the justification for each independence assumption in the fault tree.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：將共用電纜路徑的兩套系統視為獨立會大幅低估失效。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Treating two systems in one cable route as independent understates failure. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
