       "objective": "說明「資料延遲與判斷鏈」如何影響荷蘭馬仕朗防潮閘的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Data latency in decisions” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Maeslant storm-surge barrier”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "自動判斷取決於資料的新鮮度、時鐘與品質旗標，畫面顯示合理水位仍可能是舊值。將取樣延遲和運算時間分開，才能定位錯誤。 假設水位線性上升0.12 m/min、資料延遲4 min，未補償的水位差0.48 m；只示範短時線性估算，不外推真實暴潮。 重傳機制可能讓資料最後到達卻已失去時效；以接收時刻覆蓋原始時間戳會掩蓋問題。多站同時延遲不能被誤當成一致的高品質證據。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「資料延遲與判斷鏈」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Automated decisions depend on data age, synchronized clocks and quality flags. A plausible displayed water level may be stale, so sampling latency must be separated from computation time to diagnose the chain. Assume level rises linearly at 0.12 m/min and data latency is 4 min. Uncompensated difference is 0.48 m, a short-term linear illustration rather than a storm-surge forecast. Retransmission may deliver data too late for its purpose. Replacing measurement time with arrival time conceals this defect, and several equally delayed stations do not constitute independent high-quality confirmation. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Data latency in decisions” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設水位線性上升0.12 m/min、資料延遲4 min，未補償的水位差0.48 m；只示範短時線性估算，不外推真實暴潮。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume level rises linearly at 0.12 m/min and data latency is 4 min.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「多個測站讀數一致就能證明資料沒有過時問題。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Agreement among several stations proves that none of their data is stale.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「資料延遲與判斷鏈」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Data latency in decisions”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
