       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「資料延遲與判斷鏈」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Data latency in decisions” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "在離線回放中保留量測時刻與接收時刻，注入舊資料、跳值及缺測，確認品質旗標可追溯；把錯誤定位到傳輸或推估階段。以原始量測時間重排事件，核對資料更新旗標能否辨識通訊恢復後抵達的過期讀數。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "In offline replay, preserve measurement and receipt times and inject stale, discontinuous or missing records. Verify traceable quality flags and distinguish transmission errors from estimation errors. Reorder events by measurement time and verify that freshness flags identify stale readings arriving after communications recover. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以資料延遲與判斷鏈編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。在離線回放中保留量測時刻與接收時刻，注入舊資料、跳值及缺測，確認品質旗標可追溯；把錯誤定位到傳輸或推估階段。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for data latency in decisions, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. In offline replay, preserve measurement and receipt times and inject stale, discontinuous or missing records. Verify traceable quality flags and distinguish transmission errors from estimation errors.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：重傳機制可能讓資料最後到達卻已失去時效；以接收時刻覆蓋原始時間戳會掩蓋問題。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Retransmission may deliver data too late for its purpose. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
