       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「荷載循環與疲勞累積」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Load cycles and fatigue accumulation” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "從局部應變時間史辨認循環範圍，核對焊縫細節和腐蝕狀態；將不同運動模式分開計數，並以裂紋檢查挑戰無損傷的計算假設。以局部應變循環重新分箱計數，將雨流計數所得範圍與所用疲勞細節曲線一致對應。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Identify stress cycles from local strain histories and check weld detail and corrosion condition. Count movement modes separately and use crack inspection to challenge the calculation assumption of an intact detail. Rebin local strain cycles and consistently match rainflow stress ranges to the selected fatigue-detail curve. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
