       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for load cycles and fatigue accumulation, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Identify stress cycles from local strain histories and check weld detail and corrosion condition. Count movement modes separately and use crack inspection to challenge the calculation assumption of an intact detail.",
