       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A damage sum below one does not prove absence of cracks; initial defects, stress concentration and corrosion alter life. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
