         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for rotating-gate drive torque, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Build component moment curves against angle and compare pressure, position and speed. Separate breakaway friction from running resistance instead of explaining an entire movement by the final water level.",
