      {
       "id": "b223-v15-05",
       "title": "暴潮相位與潮汐疊加：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Surge phase and tidal superposition: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-ea-thames",
        "v15s-ea-thames40",
        "v15s-archives-thames",
        "v15s-usace-steel",
        "v15s-usace-mechanical"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b223-v15-04"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「暴潮相位與潮汐疊加」如何影響泰晤士河防洪閘的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Surge phase and tidal superposition” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Thames Barrier”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "天文潮與氣象暴潮的峰值可能不同時到達。簡單線性相加可說明相位重要性，真實河口中摩擦與水深又使交互作用非線性。 假設潮位2cosθ m、暴潮1cos(θ+60°) m，合成振幅√(2²+1²+2×2×1cos60°)=2.646 m，非兩峰直接相加3 m。 取兩個不同時刻的最大值相加可能過度保守，也可能忽略風暴改變潮波傳播後的新峰值。模型驗證若只比最高水位，會漏掉危險持續時間。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「暴潮相位與潮汐疊加」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Astronomical tide and meteorological surge can peak at different times. Linear addition illustrates phase effects, while friction and changing depth make real estuarine interaction nonlinear. Assume tide 2cosθ m and surge 1cos(θ+60°) m. Combined amplitude is √(2²+1²+2×2×1cos60°)=2.646 m, rather than the direct peak sum of 3 m. Adding maxima from separate times can be overly conservative yet still miss peaks created by changed tidal propagation. Validation limited to peak level overlooks the duration of hazardous conditions. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Surge phase and tidal superposition” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設潮位2cosθ m、暴潮1cos(θ+60°) m，合成振幅√(2²+1²+2×2×1cos60°)=2.646 m，非兩峰直接相加3 m。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume tide 2cosθ m and surge 1cos(θ+60°) m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「兩個不同時刻的水位峰值相加就是實際聯合峰值。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Adding water-level peaks from different times gives the actual combined peak.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「暴潮相位與潮汐疊加」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Surge phase and tidal superposition”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b223-v15-05-k1",
         "title": "暴潮相位與潮汐疊加",
         "titleEn": "Surge phase and tidal superposition",
         "text": "天文潮與氣象暴潮的峰值可能不同時到達。簡單線性相加可說明相位重要性，真實河口中摩擦與水深又使交互作用非線性。",
         "textEn": "Astronomical tide and meteorological surge can peak at different times. Linear addition illustrates phase effects, while friction and changing depth make real estuarine interaction nonlinear.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-ea-thames",
          "v15s-ea-thames40",
          "v15s-archives-thames",
          "v15s-usace-steel",
          "v15s-usace-mechanical"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b223-v15-05-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
