       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「關閉期間河水蓄積」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “River storage during closure” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "用上游流量、支流雨量與多站水位建立同期水量平衡，檢查水面坡度是否仍可用單一儲水面積描述；另計未量測的側向流入。檢查各支流入流與儲水增量之和，量化忽略側向入流對上游水位估算的影響。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Build a synchronized balance from river flow, tributary rainfall and multiple water-level stations. Test whether one storage area still represents the water-surface slope and estimate unmeasured lateral inflow separately. Close tributary inflows against storage increase and quantify how omitted lateral inflow changes the upstream level estimate. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以關閉期間河水蓄積編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。用上游流量、支流雨量與多站水位建立同期水量平衡，檢查水面坡度是否仍可用單一儲水面積描述；另計未量測的側向流入。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for river storage during closure, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Build a synchronized balance from river flow, tributary rainfall and multiple water-level stations. Test whether one storage area still represents the water-surface slope and estimate unmeasured lateral inflow separately.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：只防海側高水位而忽略河流洪峰，可能把洪水留在防線內側。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Excluding the sea while overlooking a river flood can retain water inside the defence. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
