       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Replacing a long river gradient with a flat surface can underestimate levels near particular tributary junctions.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「關閘排除海水後，上游水位就不可能繼續上升。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
