       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Navigation windows and scheduling” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "用匿名化船舶到達與通過時間畫累積曲線，核對服務率是否受船型和潮向影響；將安全間隔和商業需求分列，避免把理論容量當保證。從累積到達與離開曲線的垂直距離求隊列，並核對復原斜率是否真正大於到達率。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Plot cumulative anonymous arrival and transit records, checking vessel-type and tidal effects on service rate. Separate safety spacing from commercial demand instead of presenting theoretical capacity as guaranteed throughput. Derive queue size from cumulative arrival-departure separation and verify that recovery service genuinely exceeds arrivals. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以通航窗口與排程編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。用匿名化船舶到達與通過時間畫累積曲線，核對服務率是否受船型和潮向影響；將安全間隔和商業需求分列，避免把理論容量當保證。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for navigation windows and scheduling, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Plot cumulative anonymous arrival and transit records, checking vessel-type and tidal effects on service rate. Separate safety spacing from commercial demand instead of presenting theoretical capacity as guaranteed throughput.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：若重開後服務率只等於到達率，既有隊列永遠無法消散。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: If reopened service merely matches arrivals, the existing queue never clears. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
