       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「門槽沉積與淨空」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Gate-recess sediment and clearance” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "用可重複定位的測深與影像核對槽底高點，區分鬆散泥砂和硬質異物；把門體掃掠幾何疊合測量面，保存清理前後差異。逐格比較測深不確定度與門體幾何裕度，對最接近掃掠包絡的高點安排獨立複測。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Use repeatable bathymetry and imagery to identify high spots and distinguish loose sediment from hard debris. Overlay the gate swept volume on surveyed surfaces and preserve before-and-after changes. Compare sounding uncertainty with geometric allowance cell by cell and independently resurvey high spots nearest the swept envelope. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以門槽沉積與淨空編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。用可重複定位的測深與影像核對槽底高點，區分鬆散泥砂和硬質異物；把門體掃掠幾何疊合測量面，保存清理前後差異。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for gate-recess sediment and clearance, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Use repeatable bathymetry and imagery to identify high spots and distinguish loose sediment from hard debris. Overlay the gate swept volume on surveyed surfaces and preserve before-and-after changes.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：均勻沉積假設會低估孤立塊體造成的卡阻，移除沉積也可能暴露既有底板損傷。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Uniform deposits underestimate jamming from isolated blocks, and removal can expose existing sill damage. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
