       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Gate-recess sediment and clearance” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "均勻沉積假設會低估孤立塊體造成的卡阻，移除沉積也可能暴露既有底板損傷。若只用挖除體積驗收，不能證明全部運動空間已恢復。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Uniform deposits underestimate jamming from isolated blocks, and removal can expose existing sill damage. Excavated volume alone cannot establish that the entire required swept space has been restored. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若只用挖除體積驗收，不能證明全部運動空間已恢復。",
