         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume pressure difference 12 MPa, flow 0.02 m³/s and overall efficiency 0.8. Input ΔpQ/η=300 kW, for steady flow without acceleration or accumulator transients.",
