        "v15s-ea-thames40",
        "v15s-archives-thames",
        "v15s-usace-steel",
        "v15s-usace-mechanical"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b223-v15-22"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「液壓功率與效率」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Hydraulic power and efficiency” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "同步量測油壓、流量、溫度和門位速率，比較液壓輸入與機械輸出；確認量測位置是在泵側或缸側，避免把管路損失重複計入。將能量差換算成熱產生量並核對油溫趨勢，確認內漏推論符合能量守恆。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure pressure, flow, temperature and gate speed together, comparing hydraulic input with mechanical output. Identify pump-side versus cylinder-side measurements to avoid double-counting line losses. Convert the power difference into heat generation and compare temperature trends to test the leakage interpretation against energy conservation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以液壓功率與效率編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。同步量測油壓、流量、溫度和門位速率，比較液壓輸入與機械輸出；確認量測位置是在泵側或缸側，避免把管路損失重複計入。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for hydraulic power and efficiency, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure pressure, flow, temperature and gate speed together, comparing hydraulic input with mechanical output. Identify pump-side versus cylinder-side measurements to avoid double-counting line losses.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：內漏使壓力維持但有效行程流量減少，油溫上升又改變黏度。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Internal leakage can preserve pressure while reducing useful cylinder flow, and heating changes viscosity. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b223-v15-23-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "同步量測油壓、流量、溫度和門位速率，比較液壓輸入與機械輸出；確認量測位置是在泵側或缸側，避免把管路損失重複計入。將能量差換算成熱產生量並核對油溫趨勢，確認內漏推論符合能量守恆。",
         "textEn": "Measure pressure, flow, temperature and gate speed together, comparing hydraulic input with mechanical output. Identify pump-side versus cylinder-side measurements to avoid double-counting line losses. Convert the power difference into heat generation and compare temperature trends to test the leakage interpretation against energy conservation.",
