         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for hydraulic power and efficiency, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure pressure, flow, temperature and gate speed together, comparing hydraulic input with mechanical output. Identify pump-side versus cylinder-side measurements to avoid double-counting line losses.",
