         "text": "沿整條防線進行共同基準閉合水準測量，標出接頭、道路與管線穿越低點；將最新沉降速率與地圖版本一起保存，避免混用不同年代高程。對最低接續點進行反向水準複測，將量測閉合差納入幾何超高的不確定度。",
         "textEn": "Run closed leveling on a common datum along the full defence, marking joints, roads and utility crossings. Retain settlement rates and map versions to prevent mixing elevations from different surveys. Repeat leveling in reverse at the lowest connection and include survey closure error in the freeboard uncertainty.",
