         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume a triangular force pulse with peak 2 MN and duration 0.4 s. Impulse J=FmaxΔt/2=0.4 MN·s; displacement and fatigue are not obtained from this alone.",
         "sourceIds": [
