       "objective": "說明「檢測覆蓋與可用度」如何影響泰晤士河防洪閘的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Test coverage and availability” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Thames Barrier”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "定期測試只能發現被測功能的故障，無法保證未施加的環境與荷載。檢測間隔與潛伏失效機率相關，但獨立恆定失效率只是基礎模型。 假設潛伏失效率λ=0.0002/day、完全檢測間隔30 days，平均不可用度近似λT/2=0.003；限λT很小及完美檢測。 若測試只能檢出部分故障，延續使用完美檢測公式會低估風險。維修造成的暫時停用也屬可用度問題，不能因主設備故障率低就忽略。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「檢測覆蓋與可用度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Periodic tests reveal only exercised failures, not untested environments and loads. Test interval influences latent unavailability, but constant independent failure rate is only a basic model. Assume latent failure rate λ=0.0002/day and perfect-test interval 30 days. Mean unavailability is approximately λT/2=0.003, for small λT and complete detection. Using perfect-test formulas when only some failures are detectable understates risk. Maintenance outages also reduce availability and cannot be ignored merely because the main equipment has a low failure rate. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Test coverage and availability” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設潛伏失效率λ=0.0002/day、完全檢測間隔30 days，平均不可用度近似λT/2=0.003；限λT很小及完美檢測。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume latent failure rate λ=0.0002/day and perfect-test interval 30 days.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「一次測試成功就代表所有設備失效模式均已受測。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"One successful test means every equipment failure mode has been exercised.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「檢測覆蓋與可用度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Test coverage and availability”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
