         "text": "教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設潛伏失效率λ=0.0002/day、完全檢測間隔30 days，平均不可用度近似λT/2=0.003；限λT很小及完美檢測。",
         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume latent failure rate λ=0.0002/day and perfect-test interval 30 days. Mean unavailability is approximately λT/2=0.003, for small λT and complete detection.",
