       "instructionEn": "List sensors, transmission paths and loading conditions covered by each exercise, retaining uncovered functions in the assessment. Record discovery time, repair time and outage cause separately. Map uncovered failure modes to alternative evidence and verify that maintenance downtime remains in the availability denominator. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以檢測覆蓋與可用度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。列出每項演練涵蓋的感測、傳動與負載條件，將未涵蓋功能保留在分析中；把檢出時間、修復時間和停機原因分別記錄。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for test coverage and availability, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. List sensors, transmission paths and loading conditions covered by each exercise, retaining uncovered functions in the assessment. Record discovery time, repair time and outage cause separately.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：若測試只能檢出部分故障，延續使用完美檢測公式會低估風險。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Using perfect-test formulas when only some failures are detectable understates risk. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
