       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「檢測覆蓋與可用度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Test coverage and availability” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "若測試只能檢出部分故障，延續使用完美檢測公式會低估風險。維修造成的暫時停用也屬可用度問題，不能因主設備故障率低就忽略。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Using perfect-test formulas when only some failures are detectable understates risk. Maintenance outages also reduce availability and cannot be ignored merely because the main equipment has a low failure rate. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：維修造成的暫時停用也屬可用度問題，不能因主設備故障率低就忽略。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Maintenance outages also reduce availability and cannot be ignored merely because the main equipment has a low failure rate.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「一次測試成功就代表所有設備失效模式均已受測。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"One successful test means every equipment failure mode has been exercised.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b223-v15-36-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "若測試只能檢出部分故障，延續使用完美檢測公式會低估風險。維修造成的暫時停用也屬可用度問題，不能因主設備故障率低就忽略。",
         "textEn": "Using perfect-test formulas when only some failures are detectable understates risk. Maintenance outages also reduce availability and cannot be ignored merely because the main equipment has a low failure rate.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-ea-thames",
          "v15s-ea-thames40",
          "v15s-archives-thames",
          "v15s-usace-steel",
