       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for sea-level scenarios and adaptation, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Align baseline years for tide gauges, land movement and scenarios. Separate observed trends from planning assumptions and compare freeboard, drainage duration and equipment-cycle sensitivity across scenarios.",
