   "workedExample": {
    "title": "原創假想算例與邊界",
    "titleEn": "Original hypothetical example and boundaries",
    "text": "本課原創比較練習分兩個相互獨立的物理模型。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。假設有效排水體積500 m³、海水密度1025 kg/m³、浮力臂3 m，自重3 MN、重心臂4 m；淨復原矩為3.083 MN·m，限靜水姿態。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。假設海水深8 m、密度1025 kg/m³、大氣壓101.3 kPa，靜水表壓80.442 kPa、絕壓181.742 kPa；不含管損與動態壓差。先逐一圈出公式內的控制體、力方向或時間尺度，再把每項輸入的量綱換成一致單位。第二人只根據輸入重算結果，不抄第一人的中間數字。最後指出這兩個估算尚未包含的空間變化、非線性及量測誤差；若將結果用於另一座工程，必須重建其幾何、材料與邊界條件，不能挪用本練習的假設。 靜水壓敏感度固定ρ=1025 kg/m³、g=9.81 m/s²及大氣壓101.3 kPa，只將水深8 m增為10 m。表壓ρgh由80.442增至100.5525 kPa，增加25%；絕壓則由181.742增至201.8525 kPa，其增幅不是25%。比較只包含靜水柱，不推定送氣管損、閘門浮力或動態壓力同步變化。",
    "textEn": "This original comparison exercise uses two independent physical models. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s². Assume displaced volume 500 m³, seawater density 1025 kg/m³, buoyancy arm 3 m, weight 3 MN and weight arm 4 m. Net restoring moment is 3.083 MN·m for that hydrostatic posture. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s². Assume seawater depth 8 m, density 1025 kg/m³ and atmospheric pressure 101.3 kPa. Gauge pressure is 80.442 kPa and absolute pressure 181.742 kPa, excluding piping losses and dynamics. First identify the control volume, force direction or time scale in each relation, then convert every input to consistent units. A second reviewer recalculates from the inputs without copying intermediate numbers. Finally identify spatial variability, nonlinear effects and measurement errors omitted by both estimates. Transfer to another structure requires rebuilding its geometry, material description and boundary conditions; the assumed classroom inputs are not transferable design or operating parameters. For hydrostatic sensitivity, hold ρ=1025 kg/m³, g=9.81 m/s² and atmospheric pressure 101.3 kPa fixed, increasing only depth from 8 m to 10 m. Gauge pressure ρgh rises from 80.442 to 100.5525 kPa, or 25%; absolute pressure rises from 181.742 to 201.8525 kPa, not by 25%. This column calculation does not infer pipe losses, gate buoyancy or dynamic pressures.",
    "assumptions": "數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。",
    "assumptionsEn": "Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.",
    "sourceScope": "原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。",
    "sourceScopeEn": "Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."
   },
   "dossier": {
    "facts": [
     "官方試升共78座閘門，分布於4組屏障。",
     "官方Lido兩組為21與20門，Malamocco19門、Chioggia18門。",
     "教學8 m海水深對應表壓80.442 kPa。",
     "教學壓比2的理想等溫壓縮功率138.63 kW。",
     "教學濕態小振幅模型週期12.566 s。",
     "教學兩片門相位差120度時相對振幅0.06928 m。"
    ],
    "factsEn": [
     "The official full test covers 78 gates in four barrier groups.",
     "Official groups comprise Lido 21 and 20, Malamocco 19 and Chioggia 18 gates.",
