     "description": "本階段聚焦「浮力翻轉與重心」與「氣壓水深與絕對壓力」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Buoyant rotation and centroids\" and \"Air pressure and absolute pressure\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b224-v15-01",
       "title": "浮力翻轉與重心：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Buoyant rotation and centroids: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-mose-test",
        "v15s-venice-first",
        "v15s-abb-mose",
