         "id": "b224-v15-01-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：總浮力大於自重就能直接決定翻板的唯一平衡角。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Buoyancy exceeding weight directly determines the unique flap equilibrium angle. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
