      {
       "id": "b224-v15-03",
       "title": "浮力翻轉與重心：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Buoyant rotation and centroids: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-mose-test",
        "v15s-venice-first",
        "v15s-abb-mose",
        "v15s-usace-steel",
        "v15s-usace-mechanical"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b224-v15-02"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「浮力翻轉與重心」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Buoyant rotation and centroids” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以門角、內外水位與艙氣壓同步重建排水體積，將浮心與重心分開定位；檢查力矩符號是否隨角度改變，避免只比較總浮力與重量。逐角度積分濕潤體積與浮心位置，確認門體開始露出水面後仍使用正確幾何。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Reconstruct displacement from synchronized angle, internal and external levels and air pressure. Locate buoyancy and gravity centroids separately and check moment signs as angle changes instead of comparing forces alone. Integrate wetted volume and buoyancy centroid at each angle, checking geometry after the gate begins emerging above water. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以浮力翻轉與重心編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以門角、內外水位與艙氣壓同步重建排水體積，將浮心與重心分開定位；檢查力矩符號是否隨角度改變，避免只比較總浮力與重量。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for buoyant rotation and centroids, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Reconstruct displacement from synchronized angle, internal and external levels and air pressure. Locate buoyancy and gravity centroids separately and check moment signs as angle changes instead of comparing forces alone.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：氣室進水不均會移動重心，改變各鉸座受力。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Unequal flooding shifts the center of gravity and hinge reactions. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
