         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "以門角、內外水位與艙氣壓同步重建排水體積，將浮心與重心分開定位；檢查力矩符號是否隨角度改變，避免只比較總浮力與重量。逐角度積分濕潤體積與浮心位置，確認門體開始露出水面後仍使用正確幾何。",
         "textEn": "Reconstruct displacement from synchronized angle, internal and external levels and air pressure. Locate buoyancy and gravity centroids separately and check moment signs as angle changes instead of comparing forces alone. Integrate wetted volume and buoyancy centroid at each angle, checking geometry after the gate begins emerging above water.",
