         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for buoyant rotation and centroids, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Reconstruct displacement from synchronized angle, internal and external levels and air pressure. Locate buoyancy and gravity centroids separately and check moment signs as angle changes instead of comparing forces alone.",
