       "objective": "從症狀倒推「浮力翻轉與重心」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Buoyant rotation and centroids” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "氣室進水不均會移動重心，改變各鉸座受力。若把完全浸沒的浮力公式沿用到出水後，排水體積與力臂都會錯，進而誤判平衡角度。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Unequal flooding shifts the center of gravity and hinge reactions. Reusing fully submerged buoyancy after emergence gives incorrect displacement and lever arms, leading to a false equilibrium angle. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若把完全浸沒的浮力公式沿用到出水後，排水體積與力臂都會錯，進而誤判平衡角度。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Reusing fully submerged buoyancy after emergence gives incorrect displacement and lever arms, leading to a false equilibrium angle.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「總浮力大於自重就能直接決定翻板的唯一平衡角。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Buoyancy exceeding weight directly determines the unique flap equilibrium angle.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
