       "objective": "說明「氣壓水深與絕對壓力」如何影響威尼斯 MOSE 防潮系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Air pressure and absolute pressure” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Venice MOSE flood barriers”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "排水用空氣必須克服水深造成的外壓，壓縮氣體的狀態方程則使用絕對壓力。把表壓帶入氣體體積換算，會造成系統性的質量估算錯誤。 取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。假設海水深8 m、密度1025 kg/m³、大氣壓101.3 kPa，靜水表壓80.442 kPa、絕壓181.742 kPa；不含管損與動態壓差。 導壓管積水會改變零點，溫度變動也會使封閉氣體壓力改變。若只用壓力上升判斷門位，可能把管路堵塞或熱效應當成正常浮升。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「氣壓水深與絕對壓力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Displacement air must overcome external water pressure, while gas state relations require absolute pressure. Inserting gauge pressure into volume conversion systematically miscalculates air mass. Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s². Assume seawater depth 8 m, density 1025 kg/m³ and atmospheric pressure 101.3 kPa. Gauge pressure is 80.442 kPa and absolute pressure 181.742 kPa, excluding piping losses and dynamics. Water in impulse lines changes zero, and temperature changes pressure in confined air. Pressure rise alone can therefore mistake blockage or thermal effects for the expected gate movement. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Air pressure and absolute pressure” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s².",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「氣體狀態換算可以直接用表壓取代絕對壓力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Gas-state calculations can directly substitute gauge pressure for absolute pressure.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「氣壓水深與絕對壓力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Air pressure and absolute pressure”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b224-v15-05-k1",
         "title": "氣壓水深與絕對壓力",
         "titleEn": "Air pressure and absolute pressure",
         "text": "排水用空氣必須克服水深造成的外壓，壓縮氣體的狀態方程則使用絕對壓力。把表壓帶入氣體體積換算，會造成系統性的質量估算錯誤。",
         "textEn": "Displacement air must overcome external water pressure, while gas state relations require absolute pressure. Inserting gauge pressure into volume conversion systematically miscalculates air mass.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-mose-test",
          "v15s-venice-first",
          "v15s-abb-mose",
          "v15s-usace-steel",
