         "text": "誤解：氣體狀態換算可以直接用表壓取代絕對壓力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Gas-state calculations can directly substitute gauge pressure for absolute pressure. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
