       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Air pressure and absolute pressure” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "標明每支壓力計為表壓或絕壓，核對取壓點高程和當時大氣壓；利用獨立水位量測交叉檢查氣壓所推得的水柱高度。用靜止水柱核驗表壓轉換，檢查導壓管高差是否被正確加回水深推估。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Identify each gauge as relative or absolute, checking tapping elevation and atmospheric pressure. Cross-check the water-column height inferred from air pressure against independent level measurements. Verify gauge conversion with a stationary water column and check that impulse-line elevation is correctly included in depth inference. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以氣壓水深與絕對壓力編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。標明每支壓力計為表壓或絕壓，核對取壓點高程和當時大氣壓；利用獨立水位量測交叉檢查氣壓所推得的水柱高度。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for air pressure and absolute pressure, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Identify each gauge as relative or absolute, checking tapping elevation and atmospheric pressure. Cross-check the water-column height inferred from air pressure against independent level measurements.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：導壓管積水會改變零點，溫度變動也會使封閉氣體壓力改變。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Water in impulse lines changes zero, and temperature changes pressure in confined air. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
