       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Air pressure and absolute pressure” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "導壓管積水會改變零點，溫度變動也會使封閉氣體壓力改變。若只用壓力上升判斷門位，可能把管路堵塞或熱效應當成正常浮升。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Water in impulse lines changes zero, and temperature changes pressure in confined air. Pressure rise alone can therefore mistake blockage or thermal effects for the expected gate movement. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若只用壓力上升判斷門位，可能把管路堵塞或熱效應當成正常浮升。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Pressure rise alone can therefore mistake blockage or thermal effects for the expected gate movement.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「氣體狀態換算可以直接用表壓取代絕對壓力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
