       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for air supply and compression work, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Record flow reference temperature and pressure, comparing compressor inlet and outlet states with electrical power. Cross-check air balance using storage-pressure change rather than treating transient filling as a steady average.",
