       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Air supply and compression work” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "壓縮熱若未散去，等溫假設會低估功率；漏氣又使供氣量不等於有效排水量。把氣量和門體位移直接一對一換算，會漏掉可壓縮儲能。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Incomplete heat rejection makes the isothermal estimate optimistic, and leakage separates supplied air from effective displacement. Equating air volume directly with gate movement ignores compressible energy stored in the system. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：把氣量和門體位移直接一對一換算，會漏掉可壓縮儲能。",
