       "objective": "說明「鉸座荷載分配」如何影響威尼斯 MOSE 防潮系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Hinge reaction distribution” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Venice MOSE flood barriers”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "多鉸座承受門體合力時，構件剛度與安裝高差控制分配，均分只適用對稱理想情況。局部接觸與變形會讓一個鉸座先承載。 假設兩鉸座間距8 m、合力6 MN偏心1 m，靜力反力R1=3+6/8=3.75 MN、R2=2.25 MN；限剛性門體與平面荷載。 把兩鉸座固定均分會低估偏心側承載，腐蝕或間隙改變又可能造成重新分配。只有總合力監測，無法辨識單個連接件的局部超載。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「鉸座荷載分配」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "When several hinges share a gate resultant, stiffness and installation offsets govern distribution. Equal sharing is an ideal symmetric case; local contact and deformation may load one support first. Assume hinge spacing 8 m and resultant 6 MN offset 1 m. Reactions are R1=3+6/8=3.75 MN and R2=2.25 MN, for a rigid gate under planar loading. Fixed equal sharing underestimates the eccentric side, while corrosion and clearance changes redistribute load. Monitoring total resultant alone cannot identify overload in one individual connection or bearing. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Hinge reaction distribution” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設兩鉸座間距8 m、合力6 MN偏心1 m，靜力反力R1=3+6/8=3.75 MN、R2=2.25 MN；限剛性門體與平面荷載。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume hinge spacing 8 m and resultant 6 MN offset 1 m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「只要有兩座鉸鏈，每座就永遠承受一半荷載。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"With two hinges each always carries exactly half the applied load.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「鉸座荷載分配」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Hinge reaction distribution”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
