         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume hinge spacing 8 m and resultant 6 MN offset 1 m. Reactions are R1=3+6/8=3.75 MN and R2=2.25 MN, for a rigid gate under planar loading.",
