       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for hinge reaction distribution, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare hinge geometry, bearing clearance and strain, checking that reactions sum to applied load and balance its moment. Plot separate gate angles to identify changes in contact.",
