       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Hinge reaction distribution” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把兩鉸座固定均分會低估偏心側承載，腐蝕或間隙改變又可能造成重新分配。只有總合力監測，無法辨識單個連接件的局部超載。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Fixed equal sharing underestimates the eccentric side, while corrosion and clearance changes redistribute load. Monitoring total resultant alone cannot identify overload in one individual connection or bearing. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：只有總合力監測，無法辨識單個連接件的局部超載。",
