    {
     "id": "b224-v15-s3",
     "title": "施工方法與施工階段控制",
     "titleEn": "Construction methods and stage control",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「波浪激振與自振」與「相鄰門片相對位移」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Wave excitation and natural period\" and \"Relative motion between gates\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b224-v15-17",
       "title": "波浪激振與自振：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Wave excitation and natural period: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-mose-test",
        "v15s-venice-first",
        "v15s-abb-mose",
        "v15s-usace-steel",
