       ],
       "objective": "說明「波浪激振與自振」如何影響威尼斯 MOSE 防潮系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Wave excitation and natural period” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Venice MOSE flood barriers”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "浮動門體具有轉動慣性、復原剛度與水體附加慣性，波浪頻率接近自振時可能放大運動。乾態模態不能直接替代濕態動力特性。 假設含附加水慣性的I=8×10⁸ kg·m²、線性轉動剛度K=2×10⁸ N·m/rad，T=2π√(I/K)=12.566 s；限小擾動。 大角度運動會改變浮力剛度，破壞線性週期假設；相鄰門片的流體耦合也會產生集體模態。以單片門的小振幅結果代表整列，可能漏掉相對運動。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「波浪激振與自振」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A buoyant gate has rotational inertia, restoring stiffness and added hydrodynamic inertia. Excitation near its natural frequency can amplify motion, so dry structural modes cannot replace wet dynamic properties. Assume inertia including added water I=8×10⁸ kg·m² and linear rotational stiffness K=2×10⁸ N·m/rad. T=2π√(I/K)=12.566 s, for small disturbances. Large angles alter restoring stiffness and invalidate a linear period. Hydrodynamic coupling produces collective modes, so a single-gate small-motion result can miss relative movement across the full barrier. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Wave excitation and natural period” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設含附加水慣性的I=8×10⁸ kg·m²、線性轉動剛度K=2×10⁸ N·m/rad，T=2π√(I/K)=12.566 s；限小擾動。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume inertia including added water I=8×10⁸ kg·m² and linear rotational stiffness K=2×10⁸ N·m/rad.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「浮門乾態自振週期可以直接當成水中的自振週期。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A dry gate natural period can directly represent its wet natural period.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「波浪激振與自振」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Wave excitation and natural period”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
