         "title": "波浪激振與自振",
         "titleEn": "Wave excitation and natural period",
         "text": "浮動門體具有轉動慣性、復原剛度與水體附加慣性，波浪頻率接近自振時可能放大運動。乾態模態不能直接替代濕態動力特性。",
         "textEn": "A buoyant gate has rotational inertia, restoring stiffness and added hydrodynamic inertia. Excitation near its natural frequency can amplify motion, so dry structural modes cannot replace wet dynamic properties.",
         "sourceIds": [
