       "objective": "從症狀倒推「波浪激振與自振」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Wave excitation and natural period” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "大角度運動會改變浮力剛度，破壞線性週期假設；相鄰門片的流體耦合也會產生集體模態。以單片門的小振幅結果代表整列，可能漏掉相對運動。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Large angles alter restoring stiffness and invalidate a linear period. Hydrodynamic coupling produces collective modes, so a single-gate small-motion result can miss relative movement across the full barrier. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
