      {
       "id": "b224-v15-21",
       "title": "相鄰門片相對位移：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Relative motion between gates: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-mose-test",
        "v15s-venice-first",
        "v15s-abb-mose",
        "v15s-usace-steel",
        "v15s-usace-mechanical"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b224-v15-20"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「相鄰門片相對位移」如何影響威尼斯 MOSE 防潮系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Relative motion between gates” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Venice MOSE flood barriers”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "兩片門同方向移動時，相對間隙可能很小；反相時則可能最大。接觸風險取決於相對運動與公差，不能只看每片門的最大位移。 假設兩門邊緣振幅各0.04 m、相位差120°，相對振幅√(A1²+A2²−2A1A2cosφ)=0.06928 m；同頻正弦近似。 兩套感測器若時鐘不一致，可能製造假的反相訊號。反之只存最大振幅會丟失相位，無法判定是否同時接近，造成不必要或不足的碰撞評估。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「相鄰門片相對位移」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Two gates moving together can have small relative displacement, while opposing phases can maximize it. Contact risk depends on relative motion and tolerances, not each gate maximum independently. Assume edge amplitudes 0.04 m each and phase difference 120°. Relative amplitude √(A1²+A2²−2A1A2cosφ)=0.06928 m, for equal-frequency sinusoidal motion. Unsynchronized clocks can create a false out-of-phase response. Saving only maximum amplitudes loses phase, preventing determination of simultaneous approach and producing either excessive or insufficient collision assessment. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Relative motion between gates” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設兩門邊緣振幅各0.04 m、相位差120°，相對振幅√(A1²+A2²−2A1A2cosφ)=0.06928 m；同頻正弦近似。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume edge amplitudes 0.04 m each and phase difference 120°.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「兩片門振幅相同就表示它們沒有相對運動。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Two gates with equal amplitudes have no relative motion between them.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「相鄰門片相對位移」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Relative motion between gates”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b224-v15-21-k1",
         "title": "相鄰門片相對位移",
         "titleEn": "Relative motion between gates",
         "text": "兩片門同方向移動時，相對間隙可能很小；反相時則可能最大。接觸風險取決於相對運動與公差，不能只看每片門的最大位移。",
         "textEn": "Two gates moving together can have small relative displacement, while opposing phases can maximize it. Contact risk depends on relative motion and tolerances, not each gate maximum independently.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-mose-test",
