       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「海口關閉後，潟湖內水量就必定保持固定。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Once the inlets close the lagoon water volume must remain constant.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
