       "objective": "說明「鹽分混合與交換」如何影響威尼斯 MOSE 防潮系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Salinity mixing and exchange” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Venice MOSE flood barriers”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "鹽分守恆可追蹤海水與淡水比例，但潟湖並非瞬間完全混合。底層密度流和局部滯水會讓平均鹽度掩蓋生態差異。 假設初始100 million m³水體鹽度30 g/kg，加入5 million m³淡水，同密度完全混合；新鹽度30×100/105=28.571 g/kg，無蒸發。 底層高鹽水可在表面變淡時仍滯留，造成密度分層並限制氧氣交換。把所有鹽度變化都歸因於門片動作，會漏掉河流、風和蒸發影響。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「鹽分混合與交換」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Salt conservation tracks seawater and freshwater fractions, but a lagoon does not mix instantly. Bottom density currents and stagnant regions allow a mean salinity to conceal ecological variation. Assume 100 million m³ at 30 g/kg plus 5 million m³ freshwater, equal densities and complete mixing. New salinity is 30×100/105=28.571 g/kg, without evaporation. Saline bottom water can remain after surface freshening, maintaining stratification and limiting oxygen exchange. Attributing every salinity change to gate movement overlooks river, wind and evaporation effects. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Salinity mixing and exchange” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設初始100 million m³水體鹽度30 g/kg，加入5 million m³淡水，同密度完全混合；新鹽度30×100/105=28.571 g/kg，無蒸發。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume 100 million m³ at 30 g/kg plus 5 million m³ freshwater, equal densities and complete mixing.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「平均鹽度降低就證明底層高鹽水已完全排出。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Lower mean salinity proves that all saline bottom water has been removed.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「鹽分混合與交換」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Salinity mixing and exchange”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
