       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「鹽分混合與交換」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Salinity mixing and exchange” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "採集表中底層鹽溫剖面，核對混合前後水量與導電度校正；對照潮相與支流入流，判斷單一平均值是否足以描述鹽分分布。以各層水量加權鹽度重建總鹽質量，檢查表面淡化是否只是分層而非整體排鹽。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Sample surface, middle and bottom salinity-temperature profiles and verify volume balance and conductivity calibration. Compare tides and tributary inputs to test whether one average adequately describes the distribution. Reconstruct total salt from layer-volume-weighted salinity and check whether surface freshening reflects stratification rather than salt removal. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以鹽分混合與交換編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。採集表中底層鹽溫剖面，核對混合前後水量與導電度校正；對照潮相與支流入流，判斷單一平均值是否足以描述鹽分分布。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for salinity mixing and exchange, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Sample surface, middle and bottom salinity-temperature profiles and verify volume balance and conductivity calibration. Compare tides and tributary inputs to test whether one average adequately describes the distribution.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：底層高鹽水可在表面變淡時仍滯留，造成密度分層並限制氧氣交換。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Saline bottom water can remain after surface freshening, maintaining stratification and limiting oxygen exchange. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
