       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「壓力量測與不確定度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pressure measurement uncertainty” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以可追溯壓力基準校正量測鏈，檢查零點和跨度，再與獨立水位及溫鹽資料比較；把隨機不確定度和共同基準偏差分開列帳。另以密度不確定度傳播計算水深影響，對共同基準偏差採獨立外部測量核驗。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Calibrate the measurement chain with a traceable pressure reference, checking zero and span. Compare independent level and temperature-salinity data, separating random uncertainty from common datum bias. Propagate density uncertainty separately and use independent external measurements to test common reference bias in inferred depth. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以壓力量測與不確定度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以可追溯壓力基準校正量測鏈，檢查零點和跨度，再與獨立水位及溫鹽資料比較；把隨機不確定度和共同基準偏差分開列帳。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for pressure measurement uncertainty, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Calibrate the measurement chain with a traceable pressure reference, checking zero and span. Compare independent level and temperature-salinity data, separating random uncertainty from common datum bias.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：共同導壓管堵塞會讓多支感測器一致但錯誤，不能用數字吻合當獨立證據。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A shared blocked impulse line can make several sensors agree incorrectly. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b224-v15-35-k1",
