         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "以可追溯壓力基準校正量測鏈，檢查零點和跨度，再與獨立水位及溫鹽資料比較；把隨機不確定度和共同基準偏差分開列帳。另以密度不確定度傳播計算水深影響，對共同基準偏差採獨立外部測量核驗。",
         "textEn": "Calibrate the measurement chain with a traceable pressure reference, checking zero and span. Compare independent level and temperature-salinity data, separating random uncertainty from common datum bias. Propagate density uncertainty separately and use independent external measurements to test common reference bias in inferred depth.",
         "sourceIds": [
