       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pressure measurement uncertainty” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "共同導壓管堵塞會讓多支感測器一致但錯誤，不能用數字吻合當獨立證據。若海水密度變動仍沿用淡水換算，也會產生持續水深偏差。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A shared blocked impulse line can make several sensors agree incorrectly. Agreement is not independence, and using freshwater density for changing seawater creates a persistent inferred-depth bias. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若海水密度變動仍沿用淡水換算，也會產生持續水深偏差。",
