       "objective": "說明「供氣網路可用度」如何影響威尼斯 MOSE 防潮系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Air-network availability” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Venice MOSE flood barriers”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "供氣系統由壓縮、儲存、分配與閥件共同構成，備援壓縮機無法補償所有共用管路故障。可靠度必須先定義功能成功條件再計算。 假設兩台獨立壓縮機可用度各0.98、任一足夠，並串聯共同分配系統0.99；A=(1−0.02²)×0.99=0.989604，忽略修復動態。 共用閥卡住或管道淹水會使兩台壓縮機同時無法供氣，即使各自運轉正常。將設備啟動成功當作末端功能成功，會高估整體可用度。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「供氣網路可用度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Air supply comprises compression, storage, distribution and valves. A spare compressor cannot compensate for every shared-pipe fault, so reliability calculations require a defined functional success condition. Assume two independent compressors each available 0.98, either sufficient, in series with distribution availability 0.99. A=(1−0.02²)×0.99=0.989604, excluding repair dynamics. A stuck shared valve or flooded pipe can defeat both running compressors. Equating successful equipment start with successful terminal delivery overstates availability of the complete functional supply chain. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Air-network availability” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設兩台獨立壓縮機可用度各0.98、任一足夠，並串聯共同分配系統0.99；A=(1−0.02²)×0.99=0.989604，忽略修復動態。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume two independent compressors each available 0.98, either sufficient, in series with distribution availability 0.99.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「備援壓縮機能啟動就保證末端閥件取得足夠供氣。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A starting standby compressor guarantees sufficient air delivery at terminal valves.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「供氣網路可用度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Air-network availability”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
