       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「供氣網路可用度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Air-network availability” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "從供氣需求追蹤至末端閥件，標出共用電源和管段，核對備機是否真能滿足所需流量；用歷史故障分類檢查獨立性假設。以末端壓力和流量證明功能交付，檢查共用分配管故障是否仍能使備機失去作用。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Trace supply demand to terminal valves, marking common power and pipe sections. Verify that a spare truly provides required flow and use historical failure categories to test independence assumptions. Demonstrate terminal pressure and flow delivery and test whether shared distribution faults still defeat the standby unit. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以供氣網路可用度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。從供氣需求追蹤至末端閥件，標出共用電源和管段，核對備機是否真能滿足所需流量；用歷史故障分類檢查獨立性假設。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for air-network availability, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Trace supply demand to terminal valves, marking common power and pipe sections. Verify that a spare truly provides required flow and use historical failure categories to test independence assumptions.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：共用閥卡住或管道淹水會使兩台壓縮機同時無法供氣，即使各自運轉正常。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A stuck shared valve or flooded pipe can defeat both running compressors. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
