         "textEn": "Trace supply demand to terminal valves, marking common power and pipe sections. Verify that a spare truly provides required flow and use historical failure categories to test independence assumptions. Demonstrate terminal pressure and flow delivery and test whether shared distribution faults still defeat the standby unit.",
