       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「供氣網路可用度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Air-network availability” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "共用閥卡住或管道淹水會使兩台壓縮機同時無法供氣，即使各自運轉正常。將設備啟動成功當作末端功能成功，會高估整體可用度。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A stuck shared valve or flooded pipe can defeat both running compressors. Equating successful equipment start with successful terminal delivery overstates availability of the complete functional supply chain. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：將設備啟動成功當作末端功能成功，會高估整體可用度。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Equating successful equipment start with successful terminal delivery overstates availability of the complete functional supply chain.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「備援壓縮機能啟動就保證末端閥件取得足夠供氣。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A starting standby compressor guarantees sufficient air delivery at terminal valves.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
