         "text": "共用閥卡住或管道淹水會使兩台壓縮機同時無法供氣，即使各自運轉正常。將設備啟動成功當作末端功能成功，會高估整體可用度。",
         "textEn": "A stuck shared valve or flooded pipe can defeat both running compressors. Equating successful equipment start with successful terminal delivery overstates availability of the complete functional supply chain.",
