   "workedExample": {
    "title": "原創假想算例與邊界",
    "titleEn": "Original hypothetical example and boundaries",
    "text": "本課原創比較練習分兩個相互獨立的物理模型。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設集水區2 km²、C=0.75、雨強60 mm/h且歷時超過集流時間；Q=0.278CiA=25.02 m³/s，未含渠道滯蓄。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設淨入流80 m³/s持續30 min、有效水面3 km²，Δh=Qt/A=0.048 m；只作固定面積短時估算。先逐一圈出公式內的控制體、力方向或時間尺度，再把每項輸入的量綱換成一致單位。第二人只根據輸入重算結果，不抄第一人的中間數字。最後指出這兩個估算尚未包含的空間變化、非線性及量測誤差；若將結果用於另一座工程，必須重建其幾何、材料與邊界條件，不能挪用本練習的假設。 降雨敏感度固定集水區A=2 km²與逕流係數C=0.75，只將雨強i由60改為90 mm/h；兩情境都假設降雨歷時超過集流時間。沿用同一單位換算式Q=0.278CiA，流量由25.02增至37.53 m³/s，增加50%。此線性比較未納入C隨飽和改變或渠道滯蓄，也不是泵站所需容量的直接決定。",
    "textEn": "This original comparison exercise uses two independent physical models. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume area 2 km², C=0.75 and intensity 60 mm/h lasting beyond concentration time. Q=0.278CiA=25.02 m³/s, excluding channel storage. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume net inflow 80 m³/s over thirty minutes and effective area 3 km². Δh=Qt/A=0.048 m, a short-duration constant-area estimate. First identify the control volume, force direction or time scale in each relation, then convert every input to consistent units. A second reviewer recalculates from the inputs without copying intermediate numbers. Finally identify spatial variability, nonlinear effects and measurement errors omitted by both estimates. Transfer to another structure requires rebuilding its geometry, material description and boundary conditions; the assumed classroom inputs are not transferable design or operating parameters. Hold catchment area A=2 km² and runoff coefficient C=0.75 fixed, changing only rainfall intensity i from 60 to 90 mm/h; both storms last beyond concentration time. With the same unit-converted relation Q=0.278CiA, flow increases from 25.02 to 37.53 m³/s, or 50%. This linear comparison excludes saturation-related changes in C and channel storage and does not directly determine pumping capacity.",
    "assumptions": "數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。",
    "assumptionsEn": "Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.",
    "sourceScope": "原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。",
    "sourceScopeEn": "Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."
   },
