     "id": "b225-v15-s1",
     "title": "水文條件、邊界與工程系統",
     "titleEn": "Hydrology, boundaries and engineering system",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「集水區逕流峰值」與「庫容與淨入流」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Catchment runoff peak\" and \"Storage and net inflow\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b225-v15-01",
       "title": "集水區逕流峰值：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Catchment runoff peak: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-pub-marina",
        "v15s-pub-marina-faq",
        "v15s-pub-marina-book",
        "v15s-usace-steel",
