       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Catchment runoff peak” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "用雨量站與雷達核對雨強是否覆蓋集水區，再比較出口流量和延遲；將土地利用變更、排水分區和所選集流時間附在計算表。對雨量歷時與集流時間的比值作檢查，確認峰值公式沒有用在尚未全區貢獻的短雨。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check rain-gauge and radar coverage, then compare outlet flow and lag. Attach land-use changes, drainage boundaries and chosen concentration time to the calculation record. Compare storm duration with concentration time to ensure the peak formula is not applied before the full catchment contributes. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以集水區逕流峰值編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。用雨量站與雷達核對雨強是否覆蓋集水區，再比較出口流量和延遲；將土地利用變更、排水分區和所選集流時間附在計算表。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for catchment runoff peak, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check rain-gauge and radar coverage, then compare outlet flow and lag. Attach land-use changes, drainage boundaries and chosen concentration time to the calculation record.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：短時局部暴雨可能不符合均勻降雨假設，排水瓶頸也會改變峰值時間。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Brief localized storms violate uniform rainfall assumptions, and drainage bottlenecks alter peak timing. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
