       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Storage and net inflow” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Marina Barrage”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "水庫水位變化由入流減去閘排、抽水及其他出流決定。庫面不是永遠固定，低窪岸帶開始淹沒時，水位與庫容的關係會改變。 假設淨入流80 m³/s持續30 min、有效水面3 km²，Δh=Qt/A=0.048 m；只作固定面積短時估算。 抽水流量若採額定值而非當時揚程下的實際值，會產生虛假的未量測入流。時間步太長又可能把短時高峰平滑掉，低估岸邊淹水機會。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「庫容與淨入流」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Reservoir level changes with inflow minus gravity discharge, pumping and other losses. Surface area is not always constant; inundating low banks changes the stage-storage relation. Assume net inflow 80 m³/s over thirty minutes and effective area 3 km². Δh=Qt/A=0.048 m, a short-duration constant-area estimate. Using rated pump discharge instead of flow at actual head creates false unexplained inflow. Long time steps smooth brief peaks and can underestimate opportunities for flooding along the reservoir edge. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Storage and net inflow” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設淨入流80 m³/s持續30 min、有效水面3 km²，Δh=Qt/A=0.048 m；只作固定面積短時估算。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume net inflow 80 m³/s over thirty minutes and effective area 3 km². Δh=Qt/A=0.048 m, a short-duration constant-area estimate.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「水庫水位不變就表示沒有大量水量流入與流出。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"An unchanged reservoir level means there is no substantial inflow or outflow.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
