       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「庫容與淨入流」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Storage and net inflow” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "將每個流量來源按相同時間步積分，對照實測庫容變化；檢查水位站是否受局部風浪或排水噴流影響，再辨認水量平衡殘差。縮短積分時間步再做水量閉合，檢查估算最大水位是否隨解析度提高而穩定。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Integrate each flow source on identical time steps and compare measured storage change. Check gauges for local waves or discharge jets before interpreting the water-balance residual. Repeat storage closure with shorter integration steps and check whether maximum estimated level converges as resolution improves. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以庫容與淨入流編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。將每個流量來源按相同時間步積分，對照實測庫容變化；檢查水位站是否受局部風浪或排水噴流影響，再辨認水量平衡殘差。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for storage and net inflow, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Integrate each flow source on identical time steps and compare measured storage change. Check gauges for local waves or discharge jets before interpreting the water-balance residual.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：抽水流量若採額定值而非當時揚程下的實際值，會產生虛假的未量測入流。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Using rated pump discharge instead of flow at actual head creates false unexplained inflow. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
