       "objective": "從症狀倒推「低潮重力排水」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Low-tide gravity drainage” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "水頭接近零時儀器偏差可能比真實差值更大，造成錯判流向。忽略海側波浪與回流時，即使平均水頭為正，也不能保證瞬間全向外排水。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Near zero head, instrument bias may exceed the real difference and reverse the inferred direction. Waves and return currents can create inward flow even with positive mean outward head. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：忽略海側波浪與回流時，即使平均水頭為正，也不能保證瞬間全向外排水。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Waves and return currents can create inward flow even with positive mean outward head.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「平均庫位高於海面就保證所有瞬間都向海排水。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A higher mean reservoir level guarantees outward flow at every instant.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
