         "text": "水頭接近零時儀器偏差可能比真實差值更大，造成錯判流向。忽略海側波浪與回流時，即使平均水頭為正，也不能保證瞬間全向外排水。",
         "textEn": "Near zero head, instrument bias may exceed the real difference and reverse the inferred direction. Waves and return currents can create inward flow even with positive mean outward head.",
