       "objective": "從症狀倒推「高平均潮位抽水」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pumping against elevated tide” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "揚程增加可能使泵流量下降，同時改變效率與振動。只看設備已通電會高估排水能力；忽略輔助設備能耗也會低估整場暴雨的能源需求。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Increasing head may reduce pump flow while changing efficiency and vibration. Energized equipment does not establish drainage capacity, and omitting auxiliary loads understates energy required for the complete storm event. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：只看設備已通電會高估排水能力；忽略輔助設備能耗也會低估整場暴雨的能源需求。",
