       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「並聯泵與系統曲線」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Parallel pumps and system curve” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "將單泵曲線換成共同總流量座標，與系統曲線交點比較實測揚程；逐台核對流量分配與逆止閥狀態，避免只看總出水量。以逐台投入的穩定工況重建系統阻力係數，檢查兩台流量分配是否符合各自泵曲線。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Convert individual pump curves to a common total-flow axis and compare the intersection with measured head. Check individual sharing and check-valve behavior instead of relying only on total discharge. Reconstruct system resistance from staged steady operation and check each pump share against its own performance curve. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以並聯泵與系統曲線編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。將單泵曲線換成共同總流量座標，與系統曲線交點比較實測揚程；逐台核對流量分配與逆止閥狀態，避免只看總出水量。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for parallel pumps and system curve, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Convert individual pump curves to a common total-flow axis and compare the intersection with measured head. Check individual sharing and check-valve behavior instead of relying only on total discharge.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：兩台老化程度不同會造成不均分流，甚至低流量機組接近不穩定區。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Unequal ageing creates unequal sharing and may place one unit near an unstable low-flow region. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
