         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for parallel pumps and system curve, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Convert individual pump curves to a common total-flow axis and compare the intersection with measured head. Check individual sharing and check-valve behavior instead of relying only on total discharge.",
