       "objective": "從症狀倒推「並聯泵與系統曲線」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Parallel pumps and system curve” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "兩台老化程度不同會造成不均分流，甚至低流量機組接近不穩定區。忽略共用管損的加倍估算，通常會高估新增泵帶來的容量提升。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Unequal ageing creates unequal sharing and may place one unit near an unstable low-flow region. Doubling capacity while ignoring shared losses typically overstates the benefit of adding another pump. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：忽略共用管損的加倍估算，通常會高估新增泵帶來的容量提升。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Doubling capacity while ignoring shared losses typically overstates the benefit of adding another pump.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「並聯兩台相同泵的總流量必定是單台的兩倍。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Two identical parallel pumps always deliver twice the single-pump flow.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
