         "text": "兩台老化程度不同會造成不均分流，甚至低流量機組接近不穩定區。忽略共用管損的加倍估算，通常會高估新增泵帶來的容量提升。",
         "textEn": "Unequal ageing creates unequal sharing and may place one unit near an unstable low-flow region. Doubling capacity while ignoring shared losses typically overstates the benefit of adding another pump.",
