         "id": "b225-v15-21-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：沒有明顯噪音就足以證明吸水條件有足夠餘裕。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Absence of obvious noise proves sufficient suction-head margin. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
