         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume atmospheric head 10.3 m, positive suction static head 1.5 m, suction loss 0.8 m and vapor head 0.3 m. NPSHa=10.3+1.5−0.8−0.3=10.7 m.",
