       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for cavitation margin and suction, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Record temperature, water level and suction pressure, checking intake vortices and screen blockage. Interpret vibration, noise and efficiency together instead of identifying cavitation from sound alone.",
