       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume freshwater volume 1 million m³ and intrusion 1000 m³ at 35 g/kg, equal densities and complete mixing.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「平均鹽度很低就表示所有深度的水質完全相同。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
