       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設淡水體積1 million m³、混入1000 m³海水鹽度35 g/kg，同密度完全混合；平均鹽度35×1000/1001000=0.03497 g/kg。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume freshwater volume 1 million m³ and intrusion 1000 m³ at 35 g/kg, equal densities and complete mixing. Mean salinity is 35×1000/1001000=0.03497 g/kg. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：沿庫底至取水口布設深度剖面，校正電導與溫度，再以水量平衡核對入侵總量；保留底層尖峰而非只輸出全庫平均。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Profile depth from the bed to the intake, calibrating conductivity and temperature.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
       "checkEn": "Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b225-v15-26-k1",
