         "text": "教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設淡水體積1 million m³、混入1000 m³海水鹽度35 g/kg，同密度完全混合；平均鹽度35×1000/1001000=0.03497 g/kg。",
         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume freshwater volume 1 million m³ and intrusion 1000 m³ at 35 g/kg, equal densities and complete mixing. Mean salinity is 35×1000/1001000=0.03497 g/kg.",
         "sourceIds": [
