       "observation": "現場實務：以鹽水入侵質量平衡編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。沿庫底至取水口布設深度剖面，校正電導與溫度，再以水量平衡核對入侵總量；保留底層尖峰而非只輸出全庫平均。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for salt intrusion mass balance, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Profile depth from the bed to the intake, calibrating conductivity and temperature. Check intrusion volume against water balance and preserve bottom-layer peaks rather than reporting only a reservoir average.",
