       "objective": "從症狀倒推「鹽水入侵質量平衡」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Salt intrusion mass balance” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "稀釋後平均值很低仍可能有高鹽舌接近取水口，風浪混合也可能突然把底水抬升。只在表層採樣，會誤認鹽水已完全排除。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A low diluted mean can coexist with a saline tongue near an intake. Wind mixing may suddenly lift bottom water, while surface-only sampling can falsely suggest intrusion has been removed. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
