       "objective": "說明「水力停留與營養鹽」如何影響新加坡濱海堤壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Residence time and nutrients” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Marina Barrage”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "停留時間影響營養鹽累積和藻類生長，但流動短路會讓部分水很快排出、其他水長期滯留。平均V/Q只是比較尺度，不能單獨預測生態反應。 假設有效庫容12 million m³、平均換水量6 m³/s，V/Q=2 million s=23.15 days；穩定完全混合近似，不代表所有水齡。 用總庫容忽略實際隔離死水區會誤判交換效率，增加出流也不必然沖走滯水。若未分離光照和水溫，不能把藻量變化全歸因於停留時間。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「水力停留與營養鹽」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Residence time influences nutrients and algae, but short-circuiting releases some water quickly while other regions stagnate. Mean V/Q is a comparison scale, not a complete ecological prediction. Assume effective volume 12 million m³ and average exchange 6 m³/s. V/Q=2 million s=23.15 days, a steady complete-mixing approximation rather than every parcel age. Ignoring isolated stagnant zones misjudges exchange, and more outflow need not flush them. Without separating light and temperature, changes in algae cannot be attributed entirely to hydraulic residence time. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Residence time and nutrients” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設有效庫容12 million m³、平均換水量6 m³/s，V/Q=2 million s=23.15 days；穩定完全混合近似，不代表所有水齡。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume effective volume 12 million m³ and average exchange 6 m³/s.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「縮短平均停留時間就能保證每個灣區都有效換水。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Shorter mean residence guarantees effective renewal in every reservoir arm.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「水力停留與營養鹽」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Residence time and nutrients”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b225-v15-29-k1",
         "title": "水力停留與營養鹽",
         "titleEn": "Residence time and nutrients",
         "text": "停留時間影響營養鹽累積和藻類生長，但流動短路會讓部分水很快排出、其他水長期滯留。平均V/Q只是比較尺度，不能單獨預測生態反應。",
         "textEn": "Residence time influences nutrients and algae, but short-circuiting releases some water quickly while other regions stagnate. Mean V/Q is a comparison scale, not a complete ecological prediction.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-pub-marina",
          "v15s-pub-marina-faq",
