         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：縮短平均停留時間就能保證每個灣區都有效換水。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Shorter mean residence guarantees effective renewal in every reservoir arm. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
