       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Residence time and nutrients” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設有效庫容12 million m³、平均換水量6 m³/s，V/Q=2 million s=23.15 days；穩定完全混合近似，不代表所有水齡。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume effective volume 12 million m³ and average exchange 6 m³/s. V/Q=2 million s=23.15 days, a steady complete-mixing approximation rather than every parcel age. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
