       "instruction": "以示蹤或導電度事件比較不同灣區到達時間，連同溶氧、溫度和葉綠素建立時序；區分物理滯留與外部營養鹽負荷增加。比較示蹤首達、峰值和尾跡時間，判斷短路流與長滯留區是否同時存在。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare tracer or conductivity-event arrival times across reservoir arms and build oxygen, temperature and chlorophyll histories. Distinguish physical retention from increased external nutrient loading. Compare tracer first arrival, peak and tail times to determine whether short-circuiting and long-retention regions coexist. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以水力停留與營養鹽編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以示蹤或導電度事件比較不同灣區到達時間，連同溶氧、溫度和葉綠素建立時序；區分物理滯留與外部營養鹽負荷增加。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for residence time and nutrients, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare tracer or conductivity-event arrival times across reservoir arms and build oxygen, temperature and chlorophyll histories. Distinguish physical retention from increased external nutrient loading.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：用總庫容忽略實際隔離死水區會誤判交換效率，增加出流也不必然沖走滯水。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Ignoring isolated stagnant zones misjudges exchange, and more outflow need not flush them. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
