       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Residence time and nutrients” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "用總庫容忽略實際隔離死水區會誤判交換效率，增加出流也不必然沖走滯水。若未分離光照和水溫，不能把藻量變化全歸因於停留時間。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Ignoring isolated stagnant zones misjudges exchange, and more outflow need not flush them. Without separating light and temperature, changes in algae cannot be attributed entirely to hydraulic residence time. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若未分離光照和水溫，不能把藻量變化全歸因於停留時間。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Without separating light and temperature, changes in algae cannot be attributed entirely to hydraulic residence time.",
