        {
         "id": "b225-v15-33-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：差壓增加只可能來自攔污柵堵塞，與流量無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Higher screen differential head only indicates blockage and is unrelated to flow. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
