       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「攔污柵損失與堵塞」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Screen losses and blockage” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "同步比較柵前後水位、流量與可見堵塞比例，建立清潔基線；檢查差壓管是否也被泥沙堵住，並將異常與雨後漂流物來源對照。將差壓除以速度平方建立清潔與堵塞曲線，確認量測差異不是單純流量增加。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare upstream and downstream levels, flow and visible blockage against a clean baseline. Check pressure connections for sediment blockage and relate anomalies to storm-driven debris sources. Normalize differential head by velocity squared and compare clean and blocked curves to exclude a simple increase in flow. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以攔污柵損失與堵塞編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。同步比較柵前後水位、流量與可見堵塞比例，建立清潔基線；檢查差壓管是否也被泥沙堵住，並將異常與雨後漂流物來源對照。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for screen losses and blockage, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare upstream and downstream levels, flow and visible blockage against a clean baseline. Check pressure connections for sediment blockage and relate anomalies to storm-driven debris sources.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：堵塞不均會把水流集中到少數開口，引發局部振動與吸氣。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Uneven blockage concentrates flow through a few openings, promoting vibration and air entrainment. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
