         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "同步比較柵前後水位、流量與可見堵塞比例，建立清潔基線；檢查差壓管是否也被泥沙堵住，並將異常與雨後漂流物來源對照。將差壓除以速度平方建立清潔與堵塞曲線，確認量測差異不是單純流量增加。",
         "textEn": "Compare upstream and downstream levels, flow and visible blockage against a clean baseline. Check pressure connections for sediment blockage and relate anomalies to storm-driven debris sources. Normalize differential head by velocity squared and compare clean and blocked curves to exclude a simple increase in flow.",
