         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for screen losses and blockage, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare upstream and downstream levels, flow and visible blockage against a clean baseline. Check pressure connections for sediment blockage and relate anomalies to storm-driven debris sources.",
