       "objective": "從症狀倒推「攔污柵損失與堵塞」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Screen losses and blockage” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "堵塞不均會把水流集中到少數開口，引發局部振動與吸氣。差壓增加也可能來自流量增大，因此未正規化的趨勢不能直接當作堵塞程度。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Uneven blockage concentrates flow through a few openings, promoting vibration and air entrainment. Increased differential head can also reflect increased flow, so an unnormalized trend does not directly measure blockage. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：差壓增加也可能來自流量增大，因此未正規化的趨勢不能直接當作堵塞程度。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Increased differential head can also reflect increased flow, so an unnormalized trend does not directly measure blockage.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「差壓增加只可能來自攔污柵堵塞，與流量無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Higher screen differential head only indicates blockage and is unrelated to flow.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b225-v15-36-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "堵塞不均會把水流集中到少數開口，引發局部振動與吸氣。差壓增加也可能來自流量增大，因此未正規化的趨勢不能直接當作堵塞程度。",
         "textEn": "Uneven blockage concentrates flow through a few openings, promoting vibration and air entrainment. Increased differential head can also reflect increased flow, so an unnormalized trend does not directly measure blockage.",
