       "instruction": "明確定義事件窗口、雨量門檻與潮位基準，核對歷史事件是否同時而非僅同年；用情境矩陣連結庫容、泵可用度與供電狀態。用相同事件時間窗口重算條件機率，並報告小樣本區間及相關性假設的敏感度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Define event window, rainfall threshold and tidal datum, checking coincidence rather than merely the same calendar year. Link storage, pump availability and power condition in a scenario matrix. Recalculate conditional probabilities with a consistent event window and report small-sample ranges and sensitivity to dependence assumptions. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以複合事件與失效組合編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。明確定義事件窗口、雨量門檻與潮位基準，核對歷史事件是否同時而非僅同年；用情境矩陣連結庫容、泵可用度與供電狀態。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for compound events and failure combinations, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Define event window, rainfall threshold and tidal datum, checking coincidence rather than merely the same calendar year. Link storage, pump availability and power condition in a scenario matrix.",
