       "objective": "從症狀倒推「複合事件與失效組合」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Compound events and failure combinations” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "樣本很少時條件機率不穩定，氣候變化又會改變共同分布。只列一個年機率而不說事件窗口，容易把短時設備容量與長期風險混為一談。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Conditional probabilities are unstable with sparse samples, and climate changes alter joint distributions. Reporting one annual probability without its event window confuses short-term capacity with long-term risk. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：只列一個年機率而不說事件窗口，容易把短時設備容量與長期風險混為一談。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Reporting one annual probability without its event window confuses short-term capacity with long-term risk.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「罕見暴雨和罕見高潮可以不經檢查直接視為獨立。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Rare rainfall and rare high tides can be assumed independent without checking.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b225-v15-40-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "樣本很少時條件機率不穩定，氣候變化又會改變共同分布。只列一個年機率而不說事件窗口，容易把短時設備容量與長期風險混為一談。",
         "textEn": "Conditional probabilities are unstable with sparse samples, and climate changes alter joint distributions. Reporting one annual probability without its event window confuses short-term capacity with long-term risk.",
         "sourceIds": [
