       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「雙池水位均衡」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Equalization between two pools” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "各自積分水位變化乘面積，檢查兩側交換體積是否相反相等；再用閥位和流量時序辨識接近均衡時變慢的原因，不能只比較終點。另算閘室下降水量與池體上升水量，核對共同終點能同時滿足兩個控制體的守恆。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Integrate area times level change on each side and check equal opposite exchange volumes. Use valve and flow histories to diagnose slowing near equilibrium instead of comparing endpoints alone. Separately calculate chamber loss and basin gain and verify that the shared endpoint closes both control-volume balances. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以雙池水位均衡編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。各自積分水位變化乘面積，檢查兩側交換體積是否相反相等；再用閥位和流量時序辨識接近均衡時變慢的原因，不能只比較終點。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for equalization between two pools, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Integrate area times level change on each side and check equal opposite exchange volumes. Use valve and flow histories to diagnose slowing near equilibrium instead of comparing endpoints alone.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把較小池當固定水頭會高估可回用水量，忽略連通管容積和漏流也會破壞守恆。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Treating the smaller basin as fixed head overstates recoverable water. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
