         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for equalization between two pools, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Integrate area times level change on each side and check equal opposite exchange volumes. Use valve and flow histories to diagnose slowing near equilibrium instead of comparing endpoints alone.",
