       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Filling hydrograph and inertia” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "用流量積分對照水位升幅，並比較室內前後水位差與船舶繫纜負荷；保留流量上升段解析度，避免用整段平均掩蓋慣性效應。把高頻流量歷線重新取樣後積分，檢查峰值保存程度與總水量的數值收斂。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare integrated flow with level rise and relate longitudinal level differences to mooring loads. Preserve the rising limb resolution instead of smoothing inertial effects into a full-cycle average. Resample the high-frequency hydrograph and integrate it, checking both peak preservation and numerical convergence of total volume. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以充水歷線與慣性編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。用流量積分對照水位升幅，並比較室內前後水位差與船舶繫纜負荷；保留流量上升段解析度，避免用整段平均掩蓋慣性效應。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for filling hydrograph and inertia, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare integrated flow with level rise and relate longitudinal level differences to mooring loads. Preserve the rising limb resolution instead of smoothing inertial effects into a full-cycle average.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：同一總水量可以由溫和或尖峰歷線達成，船舶受力卻不同。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
