    {
     "id": "b226-v15-s2",
     "title": "水力機制、材料與定量模型",
     "titleEn": "Hydraulics, materials and quantitative models",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「縱向水面坡度推力」與「密度交換前緣」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Longitudinal water-slope force\" and \"Density-exchange front\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b226-v15-09",
       "title": "縱向水面坡度推力：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Longitudinal water-slope force: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-acp-open",
        "v7-panama-basins",
        "v7-panama-expanded",
        "v15s-usace-steel",
        "v15s-usace-mechanical"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b226-v15-08"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「縱向水面坡度推力」如何影響巴拿馬運河擴建新船閘的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Longitudinal water-slope force” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Panama Canal expansion locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "充水不均會使閘室水面形成坡度，船體承受對應的長向壓力差。以排水重量乘小坡度可估算準靜態推力，但需另外處理流速阻力和繫纜動力。 取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。假設船舶排水質量50000 t、閘內坡度0.0002，長向力約mgS=98.1 kN；小坡度準靜態，不含阻力與加速度。 單一水位站無法辨認室內坡度，繫纜伸長也會造成船體動態放大。若將全部張力歸於水面坡度，可能掩蓋局部射流或不對稱流入。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「縱向水面坡度推力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Uneven filling creates a longitudinal surface slope and pressure imbalance on a vessel. Displacement weight times small slope estimates quasi-static force, with current drag and mooring dynamics treated separately. Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s². Assume vessel displacement mass 50000 t and longitudinal slope 0.0002. Approximate force mgS=98.1 kN, for a small quasi-static slope without drag or acceleration. A single gauge cannot resolve chamber slope, and elastic mooring lines can amplify motion. Attributing all tension to slope may conceal a local jet or asymmetric inflow acting on the hull. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Longitudinal water-slope force” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s².",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「閘室平均水位平穩就表示船首船尾沒有壓力差。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A steady mean chamber level means there is no bow-to-stern pressure difference.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「縱向水面坡度推力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Longitudinal water-slope force”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b226-v15-09-k1",
         "title": "縱向水面坡度推力",
         "titleEn": "Longitudinal water-slope force",
         "text": "充水不均會使閘室水面形成坡度，船體承受對應的長向壓力差。以排水重量乘小坡度可估算準靜態推力，但需另外處理流速阻力和繫纜動力。",
         "textEn": "Uneven filling creates a longitudinal surface slope and pressure imbalance on a vessel. Displacement weight times small slope estimates quasi-static force, with current drag and mooring dynamics treated separately.",
         "sourceIds": [
