       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「縱向水面坡度推力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Longitudinal water-slope force” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "在船首船尾及中段量測水位與流速，校核坡度估算和繫纜張力相位；將風力、推進器影響與繫纜剛度分離，建立可重現的比較工況。將船舶質量與坡度推力獨立重算，並檢查繫纜負荷是否存在不屬於水面坡度的相位。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure levels and currents at bow, stern and midship, comparing inferred slope with mooring-tension phase. Separate wind, propulsion effects and line stiffness to define reproducible comparison conditions. Independently recalculate displacement-slope force and check whether mooring loads contain phases inconsistent with the measured surface slope. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以縱向水面坡度推力編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。在船首船尾及中段量測水位與流速，校核坡度估算和繫纜張力相位；將風力、推進器影響與繫纜剛度分離，建立可重現的比較工況。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for longitudinal water-slope force, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure levels and currents at bow, stern and midship, comparing inferred slope with mooring-tension phase. Separate wind, propulsion effects and line stiffness to define reproducible comparison conditions.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：單一水位站無法辨認室內坡度，繫纜伸長也會造成船體動態放大。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A single gauge cannot resolve chamber slope, and elastic mooring lines can amplify motion. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
