       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for density-exchange front, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure upper and lower currents and salinity together, calculating salt flux rather than total discharge alone. Track interactions with vessel displacement and avoid treating turbidity as direct evidence of salinity.",
