       "observation": "現場實務：以閘門浮力與輪載編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。將輪載或軸承應變與水位、門位一起比對，檢查軌道高程和各輪接觸；以總反力守恆確認量測，再評估最大輪載而非平均值。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for gate buoyancy and wheel loads, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare wheel loads or bearing strains with water level and position, checking rail elevation and wheel contact. Verify total reaction equilibrium before evaluating maximum individual loads rather than averages.",
