       "objective": "從症狀倒推「閘門浮力與輪載」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Gate buoyancy and wheel loads” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "某輪懸空會把荷載轉給其他輪，平均公式仍可能看似正常。浮力艙漏水也可能增加荷載而不立即停止運動，所以移動成功不能代替承載檢查。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A lifted wheel transfers load to others while the average formula still appears normal. A leaking buoyancy compartment can increase loading without stopping motion, so movement success cannot replace bearing assessment. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：浮力艙漏水也可能增加荷載而不立即停止運動，所以移動成功不能代替承載檢查。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: A leaking buoyancy compartment can increase loading without stopping motion, so movement success cannot replace bearing assessment.",
