       "objective": "說明「管路快速減速壓峰」如何影響巴拿馬運河擴建新船閘的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Rapid conduit deceleration pressure” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Panama Canal expansion locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "充洩水管路的速度改變會形成壓力波，反射邊界和含氣量決定波速與衰減。Joukowsky式適合快速改變的初估，慢速閥動作須用歷時模型。 假設ρ=1000 kg/m³、波速800 m/s、速度減少0.3 m/s且變化快於2L/a，Δp=ρaΔv=240 kPa；非閥門操作設定。 若壓力降至汽化壓以下，水柱分離後再碰撞可能產生不同峰值，單次線性式失效。把壓力計阻尼造成的平滑當成真實衰減也會低估荷載。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「管路快速減速壓峰」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Velocity changes in filling conduits create pressure waves whose speed and decay depend on boundaries and air content. Joukowsky gives a rapid-change estimate; slower valve motion requires time-dependent analysis. Assume density 1000 kg/m³, wave speed 800 m/s and velocity change 0.3 m/s occurring faster than 2L/a. Δp=ρaΔv=240 kPa, not a valve operating setting. Column separation below vapor pressure and subsequent recombination can create different peaks, invalidating a single linear estimate. Sensor damping mistaken for physical decay can also underestimate the actual transient load. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Rapid conduit deceleration pressure” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設ρ=1000 kg/m³、波速800 m/s、速度減少0.3 m/s且變化快於2L/a，Δp=ρaΔv=240 kPa；非閥門操作設定。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume density 1000 kg/m³, wave speed 800 m/s and velocity change 0.3 m/s occurring faster than 2L/a. Δp=ρaΔv=240 kPa, not a valve operating setting.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「慢速改變流量也必須產生完整的快速水錘壓峰。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A slow flow change must generate the full rapid-waterhammer pressure peak.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「管路快速減速壓峰」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Rapid conduit deceleration pressure”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
