      {
       "id": "b226-v15-23",
       "title": "管路快速減速壓峰：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Rapid conduit deceleration pressure: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-acp-open",
        "v7-panama-basins",
        "v7-panama-expanded",
        "v15s-usace-steel",
        "v15s-usace-mechanical"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b226-v15-22"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「管路快速減速壓峰」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Rapid conduit deceleration pressure” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "核對管長、波速和動作歷時，再比較多點壓力到達時間與反射；檢查記錄取樣率足以看到波峰，並辨識氣穴與單相彈性模型的差別。以壓波往返時間核對閥動作快慢分類，並用多站到達時差反算有效波速。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check pipe length, wave speed and movement duration, comparing pressure arrival and reflection at several locations. Verify adequate sampling and distinguish vapor cavities from the single-phase elastic model. Compare valve movement time with wave round-trip time and infer effective wave speed from multi-station arrival differences. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以管路快速減速壓峰編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。核對管長、波速和動作歷時，再比較多點壓力到達時間與反射；檢查記錄取樣率足以看到波峰，並辨識氣穴與單相彈性模型的差別。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for rapid conduit deceleration pressure, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check pipe length, wave speed and movement duration, comparing pressure arrival and reflection at several locations. Verify adequate sampling and distinguish vapor cavities from the single-phase elastic model.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：若壓力降至汽化壓以下，水柱分離後再碰撞可能產生不同峰值，單次線性式失效。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Column separation below vapor pressure and subsequent recombination can create different peaks, invalidating a single linear estimate. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b226-v15-23-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
