       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「混凝土溫差拘束」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Concrete thermal restraint” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "將核心與表面溫度、接縫位移和齡期強度同步比較，辨認內外溫差與整體拘束；使用實際材料試驗修正模數，保留養護期間邊界。以齡期相符的模數與拉伸資料重新計算，檢查溫降、拘束與開裂時間是否一致。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare core and surface temperatures, joint movement and age-dependent strength synchronously. Distinguish internal gradients from overall restraint and use material tests to update modulus and curing boundaries. Recalculate using age-matched modulus and tensile data and check consistency between cooling, restraint and observed crack timing. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以混凝土溫差拘束編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。將核心與表面溫度、接縫位移和齡期強度同步比較，辨認內外溫差與整體拘束；使用實際材料試驗修正模數，保留養護期間邊界。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for concrete thermal restraint, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare core and surface temperatures, joint movement and age-dependent strength synchronously. Distinguish internal gradients from overall restraint and use material tests to update modulus and curing boundaries.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：表面快速冷卻會造成局部裂縫，即使整體平均溫降不大；徐變雖降低短時應力，也不能保證止水接縫保持完整。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Rapid surface cooling can crack concrete despite a small mean drop. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
