         "textEn": "Compare core and surface temperatures, joint movement and age-dependent strength synchronously. Distinguish internal gradients from overall restraint and use material tests to update modulus and curing boundaries. Recalculate using age-matched modulus and tensile data and check consistency between cooling, restraint and observed crack timing.",
