       "objective": "從症狀倒推「混凝土溫差拘束」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Concrete thermal restraint” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "表面快速冷卻會造成局部裂縫，即使整體平均溫降不大；徐變雖降低短時應力，也不能保證止水接縫保持完整。以成熟度單值代替拉伸能力容易誤判。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Rapid surface cooling can crack concrete despite a small mean drop. Creep reduces some stresses but does not guarantee watertight joints, and one maturity value cannot substitute for tensile capacity. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：以成熟度單值代替拉伸能力容易誤判。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Creep reduces some stresses but does not guarantee watertight joints, and one maturity value cannot substitute for tensile capacity.",
