       ],
       "objective": "說明「船底餘裕與沉降量」如何影響巴拿馬運河擴建新船閘的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Under-keel clearance and squat” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Panama Canal expansion locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "船底淨空由水深減吃水和動態變化決定，載重、鹽度和航速都會影響結果。幾何餘裕不是可直接使用的航行餘裕，須分列波動與量測不確定度。 假設水深16 m、吃水14.5 m、動態下沉0.25 m、其他保留0.35 m，可用餘裕16−14.5−0.25−0.35=0.90 m；全部為假設。 沉積高點可能在水深平均值仍足夠時造成局部淺區，密度改變亦會增加吃水。若把固定吃水值用於所有載重與水質，會產生不實的可用餘裕。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「船底餘裕與沉降量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Under-keel clearance subtracts draft and dynamic effects from depth, with loading, salinity and speed all relevant. Geometric clearance differs from usable navigation margin, requiring separate motion and measurement allowances. Assume depth 16 m, draft 14.5 m, squat 0.25 m and other allowance 0.35 m. Available margin is 16−14.5−0.25−0.35=0.90 m, with all values assumed. A deposit high spot can create a shallow patch despite adequate mean depth, and density changes alter draft. Fixed draft across different loads and water conditions creates a misleading available margin. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Under-keel clearance and squat” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設水深16 m、吃水14.5 m、動態下沉0.25 m、其他保留0.35 m，可用餘裕16−14.5−0.25−0.35=0.90 m；全部為假設。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume depth 16 m, draft 14.5 m, squat 0.25 m and other allowance 0.35 m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「平均水深足夠就能保證整條船底通道都有足夠淨空。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Adequate mean depth guarantees clearance along the entire hull route.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「船底餘裕與沉降量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Under-keel clearance and squat”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
