         "title": "船底餘裕與沉降量",
         "titleEn": "Under-keel clearance and squat",
         "text": "船底淨空由水深減吃水和動態變化決定，載重、鹽度和航速都會影響結果。幾何餘裕不是可直接使用的航行餘裕，須分列波動與量測不確定度。",
         "textEn": "Under-keel clearance subtracts draft and dynamic effects from depth, with loading, salinity and speed all relevant. Geometric clearance differs from usable navigation margin, requiring separate motion and measurement allowances.",
