         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume depth 16 m, draft 14.5 m, squat 0.25 m and other allowance 0.35 m. Available margin is 16−14.5−0.25−0.35=0.90 m, with all values assumed.",
