       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「回用率與淨淡水耗用」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Reuse ratio and net freshwater use” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "為每個水量畫清楚來源與去向，將暫存池、外海與淡水湖分成控制體；確認計量時間覆蓋完整循環，並說明船舶排水體積是否納入。以完整週期的池位回復確認沒有借用下一循環庫容，將蒸發漏流另列為水源負擔。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Map every water source and destination, separating basins, sea and freshwater lake into control volumes. Cover a complete cycle and state whether vessel displacement is included in the metering boundary. Confirm basin-level recovery over a complete cycle to exclude borrowing future storage and list evaporation and leakage separately. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以回用率與淨淡水耗用編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。為每個水量畫清楚來源與去向，將暫存池、外海與淡水湖分成控制體；確認計量時間覆蓋完整循環，並說明船舶排水體積是否納入。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for reuse ratio and net freshwater use, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Map every water source and destination, separating basins, sea and freshwater lake into control volumes. Cover a complete cycle and state whether vessel displacement is included in the metering boundary.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：只引用回用率而省略其他損失，會把單次水力效率誤當流域節水。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Quoting reuse alone confuses cycle hydraulics with watershed savings. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
