       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for outage backlog and water reserve, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Build a common calendar of anonymous transit queues, available water and other withdrawals. Separate confirmed supply constraints from adjustable schedules and check that demands are not counted twice.",
