         "text": "機械最大吞吐量可能遠高於水源允許速率，忽略這點會提出無法實現的復原計畫。若水位下降又增加抽水或通航限制，簡單固定單次需求亦會改變。",
         "textEn": "Mechanical throughput can exceed water-limited capacity, making a recovery plan infeasible. Falling levels can introduce further pumping or navigation constraints and change the assumed fixed water demand per transit.",
