      {
       "id": "b227-v15-03",
       "title": "船舶排水與船廂質量：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Vessel displacement and caisson mass: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-ctg-trial",
        "v15s-ctg-function",
        "v15s-ctg-history",
        "v15s-usace-steel",
        "v15s-usace-mechanical"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b227-v15-02"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「船舶排水與船廂質量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Vessel displacement and caisson mass” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "用進出船前後水位、船舶排水資料與交換水量交叉核對，不使用載重噸代替排水量；另記錄繫纜是否向船廂施加豎向分力。確認船體仍有底部淨空，並以水位變化推算是否真的排出與船重相等的水量。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Cross-check pre-entry and post-entry levels, vessel displacement and exchanged water. Do not substitute deadweight for displacement, and record whether moorings apply vertical forces to the caisson. Confirm under-keel clearance and use level change to verify that exchanged water actually matches the vessel displacement mass. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以船舶排水與船廂質量編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。用進出船前後水位、船舶排水資料與交換水量交叉核對，不使用載重噸代替排水量；另記錄繫纜是否向船廂施加豎向分力。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for vessel displacement and caisson mass, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Cross-check pre-entry and post-entry levels, vessel displacement and exchanged water. Do not substitute deadweight for displacement, and record whether moorings apply vertical forces to the caisson.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：船舶坐底後不再完整由浮力支承，水位改變也會破壞固定總重假設。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Grounding removes full buoyant support, while changing level breaks constant total mass. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b227-v15-03-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "用進出船前後水位、船舶排水資料與交換水量交叉核對，不使用載重噸代替排水量；另記錄繫纜是否向船廂施加豎向分力。確認船體仍有底部淨空，並以水位變化推算是否真的排出與船重相等的水量。",
         "textEn": "Cross-check pre-entry and post-entry levels, vessel displacement and exchanged water. Do not substitute deadweight for displacement, and record whether moorings apply vertical forces to the caisson. Confirm under-keel clearance and use level change to verify that exchanged water actually matches the vessel displacement mass.",
