         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for vessel displacement and caisson mass, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Cross-check pre-entry and post-entry levels, vessel displacement and exchanged water. Do not substitute deadweight for displacement, and record whether moorings apply vertical forces to the caisson.",
