       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Counterweight imbalance power” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。假設不平衡質量100 t、速度0.2 m/s，純重力功率Δmgv=196.2 kW；另有摩擦與效率損失，非整機額定功率。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s². Assume imbalance mass 100 t and speed 0.2 m/s. Gravity-only power Δmgv=196.2 kW, before friction and efficiency losses and distinct from machine-rated power. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：同步比較電功率、速度和船廂水位，區分恆速段與加減速段；在相反方向相同條件下比較損失，避免將回生電力誤記為負摩擦。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Compare power, speed and water level synchronously, separating steady motion from acceleration.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
       "checkEn": "Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.",
