       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume transverse support spacing 20 m and level difference 4 mm.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「所有馬達轉速一致就能證明支承點位置已完全同步。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
