     "description": "本階段聚焦「鋼索彈伸與溫度」與「螺旋機構自鎖判讀」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Rope extension and temperature\" and \"Self-locking of screw mechanisms\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b227-v15-17",
       "title": "鋼索彈伸與溫度：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Rope extension and temperature: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
