       "objective": "說明「鋼索彈伸與溫度」如何影響三峽升船機的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Rope extension and temperature” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Three Gorges ship lift”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "鋼索受力會伸長，等長索因有效剛度和溫度差也可能產生不同位移。鋼索等效模數與實心鋼棒不同，必須使用實測或供應者資料。 假設單索力1 MN、長100 m、有效面積0.005 m²、等效E=100 GPa，ΔL=FL/EA=0.20 m；忽略構造伸長與蠕變。 端接滑移可能表現為長度增加卻不符合索力變化，斷絲也會降低有效剛度。若把所有延伸都視為可逆彈性，便會漏掉需獨立檢查的損傷。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「鋼索彈伸與溫度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Loaded ropes extend, and equal initial lengths can move differently because of stiffness and temperature. Rope effective modulus differs from a solid steel bar and requires measured or supplier-supported values. Assume rope force 1 MN, length 100 m, effective area 0.005 m² and equivalent E=100 GPa. ΔL=FL/EA=0.20 m, excluding constructional stretch and creep. Anchorage slip produces extension inconsistent with tension, and broken wires reduce effective stiffness. Treating all elongation as reversible elasticity misses damage that requires an independent physical inspection. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Rope extension and temperature” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設單索力1 MN、長100 m、有效面積0.005 m²、等效E=100 GPa，ΔL=FL/EA=0.20 m；忽略構造伸長與蠕變。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume rope force 1 MN, length 100 m, effective area 0.005 m² and equivalent E=100 GPa. ΔL=FL/EA=0.20 m, excluding constructional stretch and creep.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「鋼索的等效彈性模數可以直接取為實心鋼棒模數。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A rope effective modulus can directly be taken as the solid-steel modulus.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「鋼索彈伸與溫度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Rope extension and temperature”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
