       "observation": "現場實務：以鋼索彈伸與溫度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。同時記錄索力、長度基準與溫度，分離載重彈伸和永久伸長；核對繩股結構、端接滑移及模數定義，避免誤用鋼材名義彈性模數。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for rope extension and temperature, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Record tension, reference length and temperature together, separating elastic from permanent extension. Check strand construction, anchorage slip and modulus definition instead of using nominal solid-steel elasticity.",
