         "text": "誤解：螺旋機構具有靜態自鎖就保證所有動態情況安全。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Static screw self-locking guarantees safety under every dynamic condition. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
