       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「螺旋機構自鎖判讀」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Self-locking of screw mechanisms” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "核對實際牙型、摩擦試驗和潤滑狀況，將靜態判讀與獨立制動功能分開；在工程文件中追蹤哪些結論來自理論，哪些已有設備驗證。對摩擦係數作上下界分析，確認導程角比較的結論是否依賴單一未驗證摩擦值。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check actual thread form, friction testing and lubrication, separating static interpretation from independent braking functions. Track which conclusions are theoretical and which have equipment-specific verification. Bound the friction coefficient and determine whether the lead-angle conclusion depends on one unverified friction value. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
