       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for self-locking of screw mechanisms, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check actual thread form, friction testing and lubrication, separating static interpretation from independent braking functions. Track which conclusions are theoretical and which have equipment-specific verification.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：潤滑使摩擦降低可能改變反驅條件，動態衝擊也不服從單純靜摩擦比較。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Lubrication can lower friction enough to change back-driving behavior, and impacts do not follow a simple static comparison. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
