       "objective": "從症狀倒推「螺旋機構自鎖判讀」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Self-locking of screw mechanisms” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "潤滑使摩擦降低可能改變反驅條件，動態衝擊也不服從單純靜摩擦比較。若把自鎖當成不需檢查的永久特性，會忽略磨耗和污染造成的改變。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Lubrication can lower friction enough to change back-driving behavior, and impacts do not follow a simple static comparison. Treating self-locking as permanent ignores wear and contamination that alter the mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若把自鎖當成不需檢查的永久特性，會忽略磨耗和污染造成的改變。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Treating self-locking as permanent ignores wear and contamination that alter the mechanism.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「螺旋機構具有靜態自鎖就保證所有動態情況安全。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Static screw self-locking guarantees safety under every dynamic condition.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b227-v15-24-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "潤滑使摩擦降低可能改變反驅條件，動態衝擊也不服從單純靜摩擦比較。若把自鎖當成不需檢查的永久特性，會忽略磨耗和污染造成的改變。",
         "textEn": "Lubrication can lower friction enough to change back-driving behavior, and impacts do not follow a simple static comparison. Treating self-locking as permanent ignores wear and contamination that alter the mechanism.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-ctg-trial",
          "v15s-ctg-function",
          "v15s-ctg-history",
          "v15s-usace-steel",
          "v15s-usace-mechanical"
         ]
        },
