        ],
        "answer": 1,
        "explanation": "波動水面可能在平均齊平時仍產生交變荷載，鎖定件間隙又會造成撞擊。 需以量測區分可能原因。",
        "explanationEn": "Fluctuating surfaces create alternating loads even when means match, while locking clearance can cause impact. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."
       },
       "unit": 7,
