         "id": "b227-v15-29-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：配重抵銷重量後，船廂與配重的運動慣性也消失。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Counterbalancing weight also eliminates caisson and counterweight inertia. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
