       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「啟停加速度與慣性」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Start-stop acceleration and inertia” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "從位置資料以適當濾波求速度和加速度，保留濾波延遲說明；比較驅動力變化與理論慣性項，並把摩擦和不平衡重力另外估計。以能量增量獨立核對加速功，確認配重和傳動旋轉件沒有從總慣性中遺漏。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Derive speed and acceleration from position using documented filtering and delay. Compare drive-force changes with predicted inertia, estimating friction and gravitational imbalance as separate terms. Independently check acceleration work from energy increase and verify that counterweights and rotating drivetrain inertia are not omitted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以啟停加速度與慣性編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。從位置資料以適當濾波求速度和加速度，保留濾波延遲說明；比較驅動力變化與理論慣性項，並把摩擦和不平衡重力另外估計。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for start-stop acceleration and inertia, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Derive speed and acceleration from position using documented filtering and delay. Compare drive-force changes with predicted inertia, estimating friction and gravitational imbalance as separate terms.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：直接二次微分雜訊會產生假的加速度峰值，過度平滑又會漏掉衝擊。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Differentiating noise twice creates false acceleration peaks, while excessive smoothing hides impacts. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
