         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for start-stop acceleration and inertia, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Derive speed and acceleration from position using documented filtering and delay. Compare drive-force changes with predicted inertia, estimating friction and gravitational imbalance as separate terms.",
