       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Start-stop acceleration and inertia” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "直接二次微分雜訊會產生假的加速度峰值，過度平滑又會漏掉衝擊。若不計配重慣性，模型會把正常加速需求誤認為摩擦突然變大。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Differentiating noise twice creates false acceleration peaks, while excessive smoothing hides impacts. Omitting counterweight inertia can make ordinary acceleration demand appear to be a sudden increase in friction. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
