       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「塔柱溫度與對中」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Tower temperature and alignment” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "把塔柱不同方位溫度、測量基準和導軌位置同步，分離日循環與長期沉降；在相似溫度條件下比較年度幾何，而非直接比較任意兩天。將左右塔柱日變形與日照方向對照，檢查固定參考點本身是否存在溫度相關位移。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Synchronize temperatures on different faces, survey references and rail positions. Separate daily cycles from long-term settlement and compare annual geometry at similar thermal conditions rather than arbitrary dates. Compare daily tower movement with solar orientation and check whether nominal reference points themselves move with temperature. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以塔柱溫度與對中編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。把塔柱不同方位溫度、測量基準和導軌位置同步，分離日循環與長期沉降；在相似溫度條件下比較年度幾何，而非直接比較任意兩天。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for tower temperature and alignment, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Synchronize temperatures on different faces, survey references and rail positions. Separate daily cycles from long-term settlement and compare annual geometry at similar thermal conditions rather than arbitrary dates.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：日照不均造成的彎曲可能比平均溫升更影響導向，測站自身也會熱變形。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Uneven solar heating can affect guidance more than mean warming, and survey stations can also deform thermally. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
