         "textEn": "Synchronize temperatures on different faces, survey references and rail positions. Separate daily cycles from long-term settlement and compare annual geometry at similar thermal conditions rather than arbitrary dates. Compare daily tower movement with solar orientation and check whether nominal reference points themselves move with temperature.",
