       "objective": "從症狀倒推「塔柱溫度與對中」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Tower temperature and alignment” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "日照不均造成的彎曲可能比平均溫升更影響導向，測站自身也會熱變形。若把可逆日變化當永久沉降，可能誤導對中診斷和維護優先次序。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Uneven solar heating can affect guidance more than mean warming, and survey stations can also deform thermally. Mistaking reversible daily movement for settlement misdirects alignment diagnosis and maintenance priorities. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
