       "instruction": "按功能拆分時間戳並保留船型與方向，核對哪些活動能重疊、哪些必須先後完成；把理論上限、實際服務率和維護不可用時間分開呈現。把每循環最長串聯作業時間加總，並確認每小時容量沒有把必要確認程序當成重疊。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Split timestamps by function and retain vessel type and direction. Identify overlapping versus sequential activities, separating theoretical upper capacity, observed service rate and maintenance unavailability. Sum the longest sequential activities per cycle and ensure hourly capacity does not treat necessary confirmations as overlapping. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
