       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for full-cycle time and capacity, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Split timestamps by function and retain vessel type and direction. Identify overlapping versus sequential activities, separating theoretical upper capacity, observed service rate and maintenance unavailability.",
