       "objective": "從症狀倒推「全流程時間與容量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Full-cycle time and capacity” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "假設所有活動都能重疊會把必要的對接與確認時間刪掉，長船與不同水位也可能改變耗時。以最短一次通過代表全年績效，會隱藏排隊和可用度差異。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Assuming universal overlap removes necessary docking and confirmation time, while vessel length and levels change durations. Using the fastest transit as annual performance hides queues and availability differences. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：以最短一次通過代表全年績效，會隱藏排隊和可用度差異。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Using the fastest transit as annual performance hides queues and availability differences.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「提升速度最快的設備必定具有最大的全年通航量。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The fastest lifting equipment necessarily has the greatest annual throughput.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
