       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Cable-group load sharing” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "建立全部索力分布並比較同組與跨組差異，用總和核對懸吊平衡；將長度校準、端接移動和均衡梁位置一起記錄，查異常能否重複。以最大值和分位數呈現分配，而非只有平均值。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Map all tensions within and between groups and check their sum against suspended load. Record length calibration, anchorage movement and equalizer position, testing whether anomalies repeat under matched conditions. Report maxima and distribution quantiles instead of presenting only the mean tension. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以纜索群載重分配編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。建立全部索力分布並比較同組與跨組差異，用總和核對懸吊平衡；將長度校準、端接移動和均衡梁位置一起記錄，查異常能否重複。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for cable-group load sharing, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Map all tensions within and between groups and check their sum against suspended load. Record length calibration, anchorage movement and equalizer position, testing whether anomalies repeat under matched conditions.",
