       "observation": "現場實務：以均衡梁槓桿關係編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。同時量測梁角、兩端位移和張力，檢查是否滿足力矩平衡；在載重反向變化時比較遲滯，並確認梁端尚未碰觸幾何行程限制。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for equalizer lever equilibrium, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure beam angle, end movement and tension together and check moment equilibrium. Compare hysteresis during opposite load changes and verify that ends have not reached geometric travel stops.",
