       "objective": "從症狀倒推「均衡梁槓桿關係」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Equalizer lever equilibrium” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "軸銷摩擦可讓張力差暫時維持而梁不轉，接近止擋時均衡功能也會退化。只確認梁體沒有裂紋，無法證明整個調平機構仍能有效動作。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Pin friction can preserve unequal tension without movement, and approaching a stop degrades equalization. An uncracked beam alone does not establish that the complete leveling mechanism still functions effectively. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
