       "objective": "說明「索輪曲率與彎曲循環」如何影響比利時斯特勒比—蒂厄升船機的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Sheave curvature and bending cycles” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Strepy-Thieu boat lift”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "鋼索反覆繞過輪槽時，單絲承受彎曲與接觸作用，輪徑對索徑比是重要幾何指標。該比值不能單獨給出疲勞壽命，還需張力譜和索結構。 假設索輪直徑4 m、鋼索直徑0.08 m，D/d=50；若一年20000次繞曲，5年為100000次，僅計數而非壽命保證。 索輪磨耗可改變接觸壓力而不改變名義輪徑，內部斷絲也未必外露。若只用循環次數或直徑比決定狀況，會漏掉局部磨擦與腐蝕。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「索輪曲率與彎曲循環」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Ropes repeatedly bending over grooves experience wire bending and contact. Sheave-to-rope diameter ratio is useful geometry, but fatigue life also depends on tension spectrum and rope construction. Assume sheave diameter 4 m and rope diameter 0.08 m, giving D/d=50. At 20000 bends annually, five years gives 100000 bends, a count rather than a life guarantee. Groove wear changes contact pressure without changing nominal diameter, and internal wire breaks may be hidden. Cycle count or diameter ratio alone misses localized rubbing and corrosion mechanisms. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Sheave curvature and bending cycles” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設索輪直徑4 m、鋼索直徑0.08 m，D/d=50；若一年20000次繞曲，5年為100000次，僅計數而非壽命保證。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume sheave diameter 4 m and rope diameter 0.08 m, giving D/d=50.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「索輪直徑比足夠大就能保證鋼索不會發生疲勞。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A sufficiently large sheave-diameter ratio guarantees that ropes cannot fatigue.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「索輪曲率與彎曲循環」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
