       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「索輪曲率與彎曲循環」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Sheave curvature and bending cycles” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "對照輪槽尺寸、索徑和彎曲循環紀錄，檢查斷絲位置是否集中於反覆繞曲區；把潤滑狀態、磁漏檢測與外觀證據合併判讀。確認檢測覆蓋同一段鋼索而非不同索段。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare groove geometry, rope diameter and bending records, locating broken wires relative to repeated bend zones. Interpret lubrication, magnetic inspection and visual evidence together rather than using any one indicator alone. Verify that repeated inspections cover the same rope section rather than different segments. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以索輪曲率與彎曲循環編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。對照輪槽尺寸、索徑和彎曲循環紀錄，檢查斷絲位置是否集中於反覆繞曲區；把潤滑狀態、磁漏檢測與外觀證據合併判讀。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for sheave curvature and bending cycles, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare groove geometry, rope diameter and bending records, locating broken wires relative to repeated bend zones. Interpret lubrication, magnetic inspection and visual evidence together rather than using any one indicator alone.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：索輪磨耗可改變接觸壓力而不改變名義輪徑，內部斷絲也未必外露。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Groove wear changes contact pressure without changing nominal diameter, and internal wire breaks may be hidden. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
