       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Sheave curvature and bending cycles” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "索輪磨耗可改變接觸壓力而不改變名義輪徑，內部斷絲也未必外露。若只用循環次數或直徑比決定狀況，會漏掉局部磨擦與腐蝕。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Groove wear changes contact pressure without changing nominal diameter, and internal wire breaks may be hidden. Cycle count or diameter ratio alone misses localized rubbing and corrosion mechanisms. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
