       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Winch speed and mechanical efficiency” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Strepy-Thieu boat lift”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "捲揚機把索的線速度轉為轉速，減速機改變轉矩和速度但不創造功率。有效鼓徑隨繞層可能改變，因此編碼器轉角不一定固定對應索長。 假設有效鼓半徑1.5 m、索速0.15 m/s，轉速n=60v/(2πr)=0.9549 rpm；單層固定半徑，未含滑移。 多層繞索使半徑改變，仍用固定換算會累積位置誤差；索在輪槽滑移又可能讓兩個轉速訊號一致但實際行程不同，必須有獨立位移證據。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「捲揚轉速與機械效率」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Winches convert rope speed to rotation. Gear reduction exchanges speed and torque without creating power, while changing winding radius can alter the relationship between encoder angle and rope travel. Assume effective drum radius 1.5 m and rope speed 0.15 m/s. n=60v/(2πr)=0.9549 rpm, for a fixed single-layer radius without slip. Multiple layers alter radius and accumulate position error under a fixed conversion. Rope slip can leave rotational signals agreeing while actual travel differs, requiring independent displacement evidence. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Winch speed and mechanical efficiency” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設有效鼓半徑1.5 m、索速0.15 m/s，轉速n=60v/(2πr)=0.9549 rpm；單層固定半徑，未含滑移。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume effective drum radius 1.5 m and rope speed 0.15 m/s. n=60v/(2πr)=0.9549 rpm, for a fixed single-layer radius without slip.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「減速比增加會在保持轉矩不變下額外創造機械功率。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
