       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Winch speed and mechanical efficiency” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "比較編碼器轉角與獨立索長量測，按繞層和鼓槽位置分組；再核對輸入轉速、輸出轉矩與功率，確認效率不超過物理上限。對獨立行程資料進行完整往返閉合檢查。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare encoder angle with independent rope travel, grouped by winding layer and groove position. Check input speed, output torque and power together to ensure inferred efficiency respects physical limits. Check independent travel measurements for closure over a complete outward and return movement. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以捲揚轉速與機械效率編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。比較編碼器轉角與獨立索長量測，按繞層和鼓槽位置分組；再核對輸入轉速、輸出轉矩與功率，確認效率不超過物理上限。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for winch speed and mechanical efficiency, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare encoder angle with independent rope travel, grouped by winding layer and groove position. Check input speed, output torque and power together to ensure inferred efficiency respects physical limits.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：多層繞索使半徑改變，仍用固定換算會累積位置誤差；索在輪槽滑移又可能讓兩個轉速訊號一致但實際行程不同，必須有獨立位移證據。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
