       "instruction": "多層繞索使半徑改變，仍用固定換算會累積位置誤差；索在輪槽滑移又可能讓兩個轉速訊號一致但實際行程不同，必須有獨立位移證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Multiple layers alter radius and accumulate position error under a fixed conversion. Rope slip can leave rotational signals agreeing while actual travel differs, requiring independent displacement evidence. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：多層繞索使半徑改變，仍用固定換算會累積位置誤差；索在輪槽滑移又可能讓兩個轉速訊號一致但實際行程不同，必須有獨立位移證據。",
