       "objective": "說明「塔架側移與導向」如何影響比利時斯特勒比—蒂厄升船機的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Tower sway and guidance” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Strepy-Thieu boat lift”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "高塔的側向柔度改變導向間隙和索具幾何，風與熱作用可能疊加。簡化懸臂模型適合比較剛度敏感性，不能替代含橫梁與基礎的整體模型。 假設等效懸臂高80 m、頂部橫力200 kN、EI=4×10¹² N·m²，δ=FL³/(3EI)=8.533 mm；線彈性單柱近似。 基礎轉動能產生近似線性側移，不能全歸因於塔柱彎曲。單點位移也可能受測站移動影響，若缺少獨立基準就會誤判導向系統的幾何變化。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「塔架側移與導向」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Tower lateral flexibility changes guide clearance and rope geometry, with wind and thermal effects interacting. A cantilever model compares stiffness sensitivity without replacing the full frame and foundation model. Assume equivalent cantilever height 80 m, top force 200 kN and EI=4×10¹² N·m². δ=FL³/(3EI)=8.533 mm, a linear-elastic single-column approximation. Foundation rotation creates near-linear displacement that should not all be attributed to bending. A moving survey station can also imitate sway and misidentify changes in guidance geometry without independent references. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Tower sway and guidance” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設等效懸臂高80 m、頂部橫力200 kN、EI=4×10¹² N·m²，δ=FL³/(3EI)=8.533 mm；線彈性單柱近似。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume equivalent cantilever height 80 m, top force 200 kN and EI=4×10¹² N·m². δ=FL³/(3EI)=8.533 mm, a linear-elastic single-column approximation.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「塔頂偏移只能由塔柱本身彎曲造成，基礎不會影響。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Top displacement can only come from tower bending and is unaffected by foundations.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「塔架側移與導向」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Tower sway and guidance”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
