       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume an ideal teaching rope constraint x+2y=constant.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「任何船廂與配重系統的移動距離都一定相同。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Every caisson-counterweight arrangement necessarily has equal travel distances.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
