       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for counterweight travel and geometric limits, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Trace length change along every rope segment, identifying fixed and moving pulleys. Verify geometry using measured endpoint travel ratios and separate extension compensation from end-clearance allowance.",
