         "text": "制動需吸收整個移動系統的動能，配重不會抵銷動能。停止距離與減速度相關，而不平衡重力可能在同一方向持續加入能量。",
         "textEn": "Brakes absorb kinetic energy of the moving system, which counterweights do not cancel. Stopping distance depends on deceleration, while imbalance gravity may continue adding energy in the direction of motion.",
