       "observation": "現場實務：以制動動能與停止距離編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。將制動起始位置、速度和停止位置同時核對，積分實測減速度驗算距離；另記錄制動熱與重力方向，區分動能吸收和持續荷載。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for braking energy and stopping distance, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check initial position, velocity and final position together, integrating measured deceleration to verify distance. Record brake heat and gravity direction separately to distinguish kinetic absorption from sustained loading.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：反應延遲會在真正減速前增加行程，固定減速度也可能因摩擦溫升而失效。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Response delay adds travel before deceleration, and heating may invalidate constant braking force. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
