       "instruction": "反應延遲會在真正減速前增加行程，固定減速度也可能因摩擦溫升而失效。只以低速空載停止測試推論高能量工況，會低估距離與熱負擔。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Response delay adds travel before deceleration, and heating may invalidate constant braking force. Extrapolating a slow unloaded stop to high-energy conditions understates distance and thermal demand on the braking system. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：只以低速空載停止測試推論高能量工況，會低估距離與熱負擔。",
