       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Docking-gap filling volume” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以間隙幾何、充水累積量與船廂水位三者互核，確認填滿後流量是否回到預期基線；將短時儲水和持續漏流分成不同判讀窗口。以充水完成後穩定流量估算持續密封漏流。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Cross-check gap geometry, cumulative filling and caisson level, verifying flow returns to its expected baseline after filling. Use separate interpretation windows for temporary storage and sustained leakage. Estimate continuing seal leakage from stable flow after the gap finishes filling. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以對接間隙充水體積編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以間隙幾何、充水累積量與船廂水位三者互核，確認填滿後流量是否回到預期基線；將短時儲水和持續漏流分成不同判讀窗口。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for docking-gap filling volume, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Cross-check gap geometry, cumulative filling and caisson level, verifying flow returns to its expected baseline after filling. Use separate interpretation windows for temporary storage and sustained leakage.",
