       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Normal gap filling can be mistaken for seal leakage, while large initial flow can conceal sustained leakage. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
