       "objective": "說明「成對船槽質量平衡」如何影響福爾柯克水輪的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Paired gondola mass balance” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Falkirk Wheel”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "水輪兩端船槽以近似相等總質量降低重力轉矩，浮船排出等重水是關鍵。但船槽水位差、積水和附著物仍會破壞理想對稱。 取淡水密度ρ=1000 kg/m³、g=9.81 m/s²。假設每槽面積200 m²、其中一槽水位多0.02 m，淡水質量差4 t；若水平力臂12 m，最大重力轉矩Δmgr=470.88 kN·m。 船舶自由浮動不代表船槽水位自動相同，排水路徑受阻時額外水量仍會增加。只看船舶重量而忽略水位，會把真正不平衡原因歸錯對象。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「成對船槽質量平衡」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Paired gondolas reduce gravitational torque by maintaining nearly equal total masses, using equal-weight displacement by floating boats. Level differences, retained water and deposits can still break the ideal symmetry. Use freshwater density ρ=1000 kg/m³ and g=9.81 m/s². Assume gondola area 200 m² and one level higher by 0.02 m, giving freshwater imbalance 4 t. At horizontal lever arm 12 m, maximum gravity torque Δmgr=470.88 kN·m. Free flotation does not automatically equalize gondola levels, and obstructed drainage can retain extra water. Looking only at vessel mass while ignoring level misidentifies the source of the gravitational imbalance. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Paired gondola mass balance” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：取淡水密度ρ=1000 kg/m³、g=9.81 m/s²。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Use freshwater density ρ=1000 kg/m³ and g=9.81 m/s².",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「兩端都有浮船時，不論水位如何都必定完全平衡。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"With floating boats on both ends the wheel is perfectly balanced at any levels.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「成對船槽質量平衡」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Paired gondola mass balance”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
