         "text": "教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：取淡水密度ρ=1000 kg/m³、g=9.81 m/s²。假設每槽面積200 m²、其中一槽水位多0.02 m，淡水質量差4 t；若水平力臂12 m，最大重力轉矩Δmgr=470.88 kN·m。",
         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Use freshwater density ρ=1000 kg/m³ and g=9.81 m/s². Assume gondola area 200 m² and one level higher by 0.02 m, giving freshwater imbalance 4 t. At horizontal lever arm 12 m, maximum gravity torque Δmgr=470.88 kN·m.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-sc-wheel",
