       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for paired gondola mass balance, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare both levels and inferred mass, separating vessel displacement from excess stored water. Use opposite-direction torque differences to check imbalance and determine whether its maximum occurs near the horizontal position.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：船舶自由浮動不代表船槽水位自動相同，排水路徑受阻時額外水量仍會增加。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
