       "objective": "從症狀倒推「成對船槽質量平衡」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Paired gondola mass balance” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "船舶自由浮動不代表船槽水位自動相同，排水路徑受阻時額外水量仍會增加。只看船舶重量而忽略水位，會把真正不平衡原因歸錯對象。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Free flotation does not automatically equalize gondola levels, and obstructed drainage can retain extra water. Looking only at vessel mass while ignoring level misidentifies the source of the gravitational imbalance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：只看船舶重量而忽略水位，會把真正不平衡原因歸錯對象。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Looking only at vessel mass while ignoring level misidentifies the source of the gravitational imbalance.",
