      {
       "id": "b229-v15-05",
       "title": "重力轉矩隨角度：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Gravity torque versus angle: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-sc-wheel",
        "v15s-sc-carbon",
        "v15s-sc-location",
        "v15s-usace-steel",
        "v15s-usace-mechanical"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b229-v15-04"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「重力轉矩隨角度」如何影響福爾柯克水輪的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Gravity torque versus angle” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Falkirk Wheel”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "質量差對旋轉軸的力臂隨角度改變，垂直位置重力轉矩可以接近零，水平位置則較大。固定轉矩模型無法描述整個半圈動作。 取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。假設質量差3000 kg、半徑12 m、相對水平角60°，τ=Δmgrcosθ=176.58 kN·m；限集中質量與平面剛體。 若把角度從垂直量起卻沿用餘弦公式，轉矩峰值位置會錯九十度。傳動摩擦和風力也可能改變曲線，不能把所有殘差當成質量差。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「重力轉矩隨角度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "The lever arm of a mass imbalance changes with angle. Gravity torque can approach zero vertically and peak horizontally, so constant torque cannot describe an entire half-turn. Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s². Assume imbalance 3000 kg, radius 12 m and angle sixty degrees above horizontal. τ=Δmgrcosθ=176.58 kN·m, for planar rigid motion with concentrated masses. Using an angle measured from vertical in a horizontal-reference cosine shifts the predicted peak by ninety degrees. Friction and wind also alter the curve, so residuals do not uniquely reveal mass imbalance. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Gravity torque versus angle” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s².",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「質量差固定時，整個旋轉過程的重力轉矩也固定。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A fixed mass imbalance creates constant gravity torque throughout rotation.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「重力轉矩隨角度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Gravity torque versus angle”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b229-v15-05-k1",
         "title": "重力轉矩隨角度",
         "titleEn": "Gravity torque versus angle",
         "text": "質量差對旋轉軸的力臂隨角度改變，垂直位置重力轉矩可以接近零，水平位置則較大。固定轉矩模型無法描述整個半圈動作。",
         "textEn": "The lever arm of a mass imbalance changes with angle. Gravity torque can approach zero vertically and peak horizontally, so constant torque cannot describe an entire half-turn.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-sc-wheel",
          "v15s-sc-carbon",
          "v15s-sc-location",
          "v15s-usace-steel",
          "v15s-usace-mechanical"
