         "text": "誤解：質量差固定時，整個旋轉過程的重力轉矩也固定。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: A fixed mass imbalance creates constant gravity torque throughout rotation. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-sc-wheel",
