       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Gravity torque versus angle” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "將實測轉矩扣除慣性項後對轉角作圖，比較餘弦形狀；再以不同旋轉方向辨別摩擦符號，確認角度零點和重力方向一致。以水平與垂直位置的理論極值檢查角度定義。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Plot measured torque minus inertia against angle and compare the cosine shape. Use opposite rotation to distinguish friction sign and verify consistent angle zero and gravity direction. Use theoretical horizontal and vertical extrema to verify the chosen angular reference. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以重力轉矩隨角度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。將實測轉矩扣除慣性項後對轉角作圖，比較餘弦形狀；再以不同旋轉方向辨別摩擦符號，確認角度零點和重力方向一致。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for gravity torque versus angle, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Plot measured torque minus inertia against angle and compare the cosine shape. Use opposite rotation to distinguish friction sign and verify consistent angle zero and gravity direction.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：若把角度從垂直量起卻沿用餘弦公式，轉矩峰值位置會錯九十度。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Using an angle measured from vertical in a horizontal-reference cosine shifts the predicted peak by ninety degrees. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
