       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Gravity torque versus angle” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "若把角度從垂直量起卻沿用餘弦公式，轉矩峰值位置會錯九十度。傳動摩擦和風力也可能改變曲線，不能把所有殘差當成質量差。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Using an angle measured from vertical in a horizontal-reference cosine shifts the predicted peak by ninety degrees. Friction and wind also alter the curve, so residuals do not uniquely reveal mass imbalance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：傳動摩擦和風力也可能改變曲線，不能把所有殘差當成質量差。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Friction and wind also alter the curve, so residuals do not uniquely reveal mass imbalance.",
