       "observation": "現場實務：以船槽水平與齒輪定向編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以地面水平基準同時量主臂和船槽角度，檢查兩角和在全行程是否穩定；將齒隙造成的換向偏差和結構撓曲分開繪製。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for gondola leveling by gearing, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure arm and gondola angles against a ground-level reference and check their sum over the full travel. Plot reversal backlash separately from structural bending instead of combining them into one orientation error.",
