      {
       "id": "b229-v15-13",
       "title": "旋轉速度與旅程：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Rotation speed and travel: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-sc-wheel",
        "v15s-sc-carbon",
        "v15s-sc-location",
        "v15s-usace-steel",
        "v15s-usace-mechanical"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b229-v15-12"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「旋轉速度與旅程」如何影響福爾柯克水輪的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Rotation speed and travel” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Falkirk Wheel”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "半圈旋轉的平均角速度與最大角速度不同，啟停段必須留出加減速。船槽線速度也隨半徑變化，不能把軸的轉速當成乘客的平移速度。 假設半圈轉動歷時300 s、勻速近似，ω=π/300=0.010472 rad/s；半徑12 m的速度v=ωr=0.12566 m/s。 將全程平均速度當成處處相同會低估加速段需求，非均勻運轉亦影響水面晃蕩。若半徑取到錯誤位置，換算船槽邊緣速度也會系統性偏差。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「旋轉速度與旅程」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Mean half-turn angular speed differs from maximum speed because start and stop need acceleration. Gondola linear speed also depends on radius, so shaft rotation is not passenger translation speed. Assume a half-turn over 300 s with uniform-speed approximation. ω=π/300=0.010472 rad/s and speed at radius 12 m is v=ωr=0.12566 m/s. Using average speed everywhere misses acceleration demand, while nonuniform movement excites water sloshing. A radius taken to the wrong point also systematically miscalculates speed at the gondola edge. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Rotation speed and travel” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設半圈轉動歷時300 s、勻速近似，ω=π/300=0.010472 rad/s；半徑12 m的速度v=ωr=0.12566 m/s。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume a half-turn over 300 s with uniform-speed approximation. ω=π/300=0.010472 rad/s and speed at radius 12 m is v=ωr=0.12566 m/s.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「半圈平均角速度就是所有時刻的實際角速度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Half-turn mean angular speed equals the actual speed at every instant.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「旋轉速度與旅程」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Rotation speed and travel”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
