       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for rotation speed and travel, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Estimate speed from angle history and verify it against linear travel, marking acceleration intervals. Compare mean and peak values and ensure filtering has not erased brief changes in speed.",
