         "text": "質量平衡消除部分重力需求，卻不消除轉動慣量。遠離軸心的質量對慣量按半徑平方增加，因此外緣附加設備對啟停需求尤其敏感。",
         "textEn": "Mass balance removes some gravity demand but not rotational inertia. Mass farther from the axis contributes with radius squared, making equipment added near the rim especially important during starting and stopping.",
