         "text": "誤解：兩端質量完全平衡就代表旋轉慣量等於零。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Perfectly balanced end masses make rotational inertia equal to zero. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
