       "quiz": {
        "question": "關於「轉動慣量與加速」，下列哪一項敘述正確？",
        "questionEn": "Which statement about \"Rotational inertia and acceleration\" is correct?",
        "options": [
         "兩端質量完全平衡就代表旋轉慣量等於零。",
