       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「轉動慣量與加速」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Rotational inertia and acceleration” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "按實際質量分布建立慣量清單，核對槽、輪臂、傳動與附加設備；以加速段轉矩扣除重力和摩擦後比較，檢查是否遺漏旋轉件。用動能變化率交叉核對加速段的機械功率。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Create an inertia inventory from actual mass distribution, including gondolas, arms, drivetrain and additions. Compare acceleration torque after subtracting gravity and friction, checking for omitted rotating components. Cross-check acceleration-phase mechanical power against the rate of kinetic-energy change. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以轉動慣量與加速編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。按實際質量分布建立慣量清單，核對槽、輪臂、傳動與附加設備；以加速段轉矩扣除重力和摩擦後比較，檢查是否遺漏旋轉件。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for rotational inertia and acceleration, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Create an inertia inventory from actual mass distribution, including gondolas, arms, drivetrain and additions. Compare acceleration torque after subtracting gravity and friction, checking for omitted rotating components.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把全部質量放在單一半徑只是簡化，輪臂分布和傳動反射慣量可能不可忽略。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A single-radius mass representation is approximate; distributed arms and reflected drivetrain inertia may matter. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
