         "textEn": "Create an inertia inventory from actual mass distribution, including gondolas, arms, drivetrain and additions. Compare acceleration torque after subtracting gravity and friction, checking for omitted rotating components. Cross-check acceleration-phase mechanical power against the rate of kinetic-energy change.",
