       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for full-cycle energy and losses, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Integrate bidirectional power over a complete cycle and identify auxiliary and standby coverage. Compare cycles at matched levels, weather and vessel conditions rather than ranking values with different energy boundaries.",
