       "instruction": "忽略待機與門控能耗會低估每次服務能源，將回生能量在不同邊界重複扣除也會失真。宣傳用水壺類比缺乏共同容量時，不能替代電表紀錄。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Omitting standby and gate-control loads understates service energy, while subtracting regeneration twice distorts the balance. Kettle analogies without common capacity and duration cannot replace metered energy records. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：宣傳用水壺類比缺乏共同容量時，不能替代電表紀錄。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Kettle analogies without common capacity and duration cannot replace metered energy records.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「設備保持重力平衡就保證整個服務循環完全不耗電。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Gravitational balance guarantees zero electrical use over the complete service cycle.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
