       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Embedment and relaxation can reduce clamp force despite intact torque marks, and separation invalidates linear sharing. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
