       "objective": "從症狀倒推「螺栓預拉與接觸」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Bolt pretension and joint contact” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "表面嵌入和鬆弛可能降低夾緊力而扭矩標記仍在，接頭分離後線性分配失效。若把全部外力忽略或全部加到螺栓，都會誤判疲勞需求。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Embedment and relaxation can reduce clamp force despite intact torque marks, and separation invalidates linear sharing. Either ignoring applied load or adding it entirely to bolts misstates fatigue demand. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若把全部外力忽略或全部加到螺栓，都會誤判疲勞需求。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Either ignoring applied load or adding it entirely to bolts misstates fatigue demand.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「預拉螺栓承受外拉力時，外力必定全部加到螺栓上。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"All external tension must be added directly to every preloaded bolt.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
