       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「管形輪臂局部剛度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Tubular-arm section stiffness” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "核對截面幾何與測厚分布，將開孔、加勁和焊縫位置納入模型；用多點應變檢查線性彎曲分布是否足夠，另查局部凹陷。對最薄壁段另行檢查局部曲率與凹陷深度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check geometry and thickness distribution, including openings, stiffeners and weld locations. Use multiple strains to test linear bending assumptions and inspect local dents separately from overall member curvature. Inspect local curvature and dent depth separately in the thinnest wall regions. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以管形輪臂局部剛度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。核對截面幾何與測厚分布，將開孔、加勁和焊縫位置納入模型；用多點應變檢查線性彎曲分布是否足夠，另查局部凹陷。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for tubular-arm section stiffness, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check geometry and thickness distribution, including openings, stiffeners and weld locations. Use multiple strains to test linear bending assumptions and inspect local dents separately from overall member curvature.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：局部凹陷可能觸發薄壁失穩，即使全截面慣性矩幾乎不變。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A local dent can trigger shell instability with little change in overall inertia. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b229-v15-31-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
