       "instruction": "比較槽內不同位置水位相位與船槽加速度頻譜，辨認駐波節點；用有船和無船資料分開驗證，並保留感測器飽和或濺水段。將船體存在與否對應不同的有效自由液面形狀。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare level phase at several positions with gondola-acceleration spectra and identify standing-wave nodes. Validate occupied and empty conditions separately, preserving sensor saturation and splash intervals in the record. Relate vessel presence to the resulting change in effective free-surface geometry. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以水面晃蕩時間尺度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。比較槽內不同位置水位相位與船槽加速度頻譜，辨認駐波節點；用有船和無船資料分開驗證，並保留感測器飽和或濺水段。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for free-surface sloshing time scale, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare level phase at several positions with gondola-acceleration spectra and identify standing-wave nodes. Validate occupied and empty conditions separately, preserving sensor saturation and splash intervals in the record.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：船體遮擋會分割水面並改變模態，大幅晃蕩與撞壁亦超出線性理論。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A hull subdivides the free surface and changes modes, while large sloshing and wall impact exceed linear theory. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
