       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Free-surface sloshing time scale” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "船體遮擋會分割水面並改變模態，大幅晃蕩與撞壁亦超出線性理論。若只取槽中央測站，可能恰好位於節點而錯認沒有晃蕩。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A hull subdivides the free surface and changes modes, while large sloshing and wall impact exceed linear theory. A central sensor may sit near a node and falsely suggest no motion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若只取槽中央測站，可能恰好位於節點而錯認沒有晃蕩。",
