         "titleEn": "Canal elevation and staged lifting",
         "text": "整個運河連接高差可以由水輪與其他船閘共同完成，不能把整體高差全歸給單一設備。分段能量與水量盤點需要明確界定每個控制體。",
         "textEn": "A canal-level difference can be shared between a wheel and additional locks. Assigning the entire difference to one device misstates geometry; staged energy and water accounting requires clear control boundaries.",
         "sourceIds": [
