         "text": "誤解：千年重現期代表一次洪水後至少一千年不會再發生。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: A thousand-year return period prevents another flood for at least one thousand years. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
