         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume annual exceedance p=0.001 with independent stationary years. At least one event in fifty years has probability 1−(1−p)⁵⁰=0.04879, or 4.879 percent, not a Dutch standard.",
         "sourceIds": [
