       "objective": "說明「串聯防線薄弱節點」如何影響荷蘭三角洲工程的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Weak links along a defence line” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Delta Works”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "保護區可能經由任一薄弱段淹入，完整防線的成功條件與平行備援不同。不同區段共受相同暴潮，獨立失效只能當教學近似。 假設三個必須全成功的區段年失效機率各0.001且獨立，系統失效1−0.999³=0.002997；不是把機率相乘成10⁻⁹。 把沿岸相鄰堤段當成互相備援會嚴重低估風險，一個缺口即可繞過其他完好區段。相反地，真正具有隔離功能的內堤又不能完全忽略。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「串聯防線薄弱節點」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Water may enter through any weak segment, so success of a continuous defence differs from parallel redundancy. Shared storm loading makes independent failures only a classroom approximation. Assume three essential segments each fail annually with probability 0.001 independently. System failure is 1−0.999³=0.002997, not the product 10⁻⁹. Treating adjacent bank segments as backups understates risk because one breach bypasses intact sections. Conversely, internal defences that genuinely isolate areas should not be omitted from the network model. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Weak links along a defence line” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設三個必須全成功的區段年失效機率各0.001且獨立，系統失效1−0.999³=0.002997；不是把機率相乘成10⁻⁹。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume three essential segments each fail annually with probability 0.001 independently.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「同一保護圈的多段堤防可以當成完全平行備援。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Several segments of one protection ring act as fully parallel backups.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
