       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「串聯防線薄弱節點」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Weak links along a defence line” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "先繪出淹水可能路徑，確認哪些區段是串聯、哪些是真正替代防線；用共同水位與地基條件檢查相關性，避免只依設備數量畫失效樹。以任一區段失效是否形成完整淹水路徑作測試。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Map possible inundation routes and identify essential versus genuinely alternative defences. Check dependence through common water levels and ground conditions rather than drawing fault trees from equipment count alone. Test whether failure of each segment creates a complete inundation pathway. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以串聯防線薄弱節點編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。先繪出淹水可能路徑，確認哪些區段是串聯、哪些是真正替代防線；用共同水位與地基條件檢查相關性，避免只依設備數量畫失效樹。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for weak links along a defence line, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Map possible inundation routes and identify essential versus genuinely alternative defences. Check dependence through common water levels and ground conditions rather than drawing fault trees from equipment count alone.",
