       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Common storm dependence” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Delta Works”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "不同屏障可能同時遭遇同一風場與海水位，聯合失效不一定等於各機率乘積。相關性須來自共同機制與資料，而不是為簡化計算而任意設定。 假設P(A)=0.02、P(B|A)=0.4，聯合P(A∩B)=0.008；若誤用P(B)=0.02獨立相乘，只得0.0004，相差20倍。 少數共同事件可能支配區域風險，分散地理位置不保證氣象獨立。若只保留單站最大值而刪除時間戳，就無法重建真正的聯合荷載。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「暴潮共同原因相關」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Different barriers can face the same wind and sea level, so joint failure need not equal the product of individual probabilities. Dependence should come from shared mechanisms and evidence rather than computational convenience. Assume P(A)=0.02 and P(B|A)=0.4. Joint probability is 0.008; incorrectly using independent P(B)=0.02 gives 0.0004, twenty times smaller. A few shared events can dominate regional risk, and geographic separation does not guarantee meteorological independence. Deleting timestamps while retaining station maxima prevents reconstruction of actual joint loading. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Common storm dependence” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
