       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「暴潮共同原因相關」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Common storm dependence” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "把共同風暴、供電和預報錯誤列成可追溯事件類別，核對兩站事件是否同時；比較條件與無條件機率的樣本量，報告稀少資料造成的區間。保留原始事件時間以便重建共同暴潮歷程。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Classify common storms, power and forecast errors as traceable events and check simultaneity. Compare sample sizes for conditional and unconditional probabilities and report uncertainty from sparse observations. Preserve original event times so the shared storm-surge history can be reconstructed. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以暴潮共同原因相關編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。把共同風暴、供電和預報錯誤列成可追溯事件類別，核對兩站事件是否同時；比較條件與無條件機率的樣本量，報告稀少資料造成的區間。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for common storm dependence, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Classify common storms, power and forecast errors as traceable events and check simultaneity. Compare sample sizes for conditional and unconditional probabilities and report uncertainty from sparse observations.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：少數共同事件可能支配區域風險，分散地理位置不保證氣象獨立。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A few shared events can dominate regional risk, and geographic separation does not guarantee meteorological independence. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
