       "objective": "從症狀倒推「暴潮共同原因相關」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Common storm dependence” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "少數共同事件可能支配區域風險，分散地理位置不保證氣象獨立。若只保留單站最大值而刪除時間戳，就無法重建真正的聯合荷載。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A few shared events can dominate regional risk, and geographic separation does not guarantee meteorological independence. Deleting timestamps while retaining station maxima prevents reconstruction of actual joint loading. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
