       "objective": "說明「防洪與潮灘面積」如何影響荷蘭三角洲工程的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Protection and tidal-flat area” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Delta Works”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "海口改變會影響潮差和潮灘濕潤頻率，防洪效益不能只以封閉長度評價。簡化斜坡幾何可連結水位變化與棲地面積，但真實地形需要測量。 假設平直潮灘長10 km、橫坡1:1000、水位帶縮小0.2 m，水平寬度差200 m，面積差2 km²；純幾何，不預測生態品質。 面積相同的棲地可能有不同淹水時長、粒徑和食物供應，不能直接當作等值生態補償。地形隨侵蝕淤積改變時，固定坡度模型也會逐年偏離。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「防洪與潮灘面積」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Inlet modification changes tidal range and intertidal wetting frequency, so protection benefits cannot be judged only by closure length. A simple slope connects level change to habitat area, while real terrain requires surveys. Assume straight tidal flat length 10 km, cross-slope 1:1000 and tidal-band reduction 0.2 m. Width changes 200 m and area 2 km², a geometric estimate rather than ecological quality. Equal habitat area can differ in inundation duration, grain size and food supply, preventing automatic ecological equivalence. Erosion and deposition also progressively invalidate a fixed-slope geometric model. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Protection and tidal-flat area” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設平直潮灘長10 km、橫坡1:1000、水位帶縮小0.2 m，水平寬度差200 m，面積差2 km²；純幾何，不預測生態品質。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume straight tidal flat length 10 km, cross-slope 1:1000 and tidal-band reduction 0.2 m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「保留相同潮灘面積就一定保留相同生態功能。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Preserving equal tidal-flat area necessarily preserves identical ecological function.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「防洪與潮灘面積」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Protection and tidal-flat area”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
