       "observation": "現場實務：以防洪與潮灘面積編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。用同基準地形網格計算濕潤頻率曲線，對照底棲生物與沉積資料；將短期潮差變化和長期地形調整分開，核查斜坡假設的代表性。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for protection and tidal-flat area, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Calculate inundation-frequency curves from common-datum terrain and compare benthic and sediment data. Separate short-term tidal change from long-term morphological adjustment and test the representative-slope assumption.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：面積相同的棲地可能有不同淹水時長、粒徑和食物供應，不能直接當作等值生態補償。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Equal habitat area can differ in inundation duration, grain size and food supply, preventing automatic ecological equivalence. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
