       "instructionEn": "Equal habitat area can differ in inundation duration, grain size and food supply, preventing automatic ecological equivalence. Erosion and deposition also progressively invalidate a fixed-slope geometric model. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
