       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for coastal sediment budget, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Combine beach and submerged-nearshore surveys on one volume reference and check nourishment accounting and boundary fluxes. Use seasonal repeats to distinguish alongshore transport, cross-shore exchange and measurement error.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：只量乾灘會把移到近岸沙洲的砂當成流失，忽略粒徑差又會誤估補砂持續時間。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Dry-beach surveys alone mistake movement to nearshore bars for loss, while grain-size differences alter nourishment persistence. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
