       "objective": "從症狀倒推「沿岸砂量收支」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Coastal sediment budget” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "只量乾灘會把移到近岸沙洲的砂當成流失，忽略粒徑差又會誤估補砂持續時間。不同年代測量範圍不一致，可能產生不存在的體積增減。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Dry-beach surveys alone mistake movement to nearshore bars for loss, while grain-size differences alter nourishment persistence. Inconsistent survey footprints can create fictitious volume gains or losses between years. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：不同年代測量範圍不一致，可能產生不存在的體積增減。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Inconsistent survey footprints can create fictitious volume gains or losses between years.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「離開乾灘的砂就一定永久離開整個海岸系統。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Sand leaving the dry beach has permanently left the entire coastal system.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
