       "instruction": "以匿名船舶時間戳核對延遲是否由屏障造成，扣除原有等待；將單船成本假設與資料來源分開，並對尖峰到達率和替代航路做敏感度。以關閉後隊列消散時間補足延遲統計範圍。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Use anonymous vessel timestamps to attribute delay to the barrier and remove pre-existing waiting. Separate assumed time values from evidence and test peak arrivals and alternative routes. Extend delay accounting through the post-closure period required to clear the queue. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
