       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for navigation cost and closure frequency, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Use anonymous vessel timestamps to attribute delay to the barrier and remove pre-existing waiting. Separate assumed time values from evidence and test peak arrivals and alternative routes.",
