       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Navigation cost and closure frequency” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把所有港口延遲都歸於防洪會誇大代價，忽略關閉後隊列消散又會低估代價。若把假設時間價值當作業者實際損失，會產生不當精確感。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Attributing all port delays to defence exaggerates cost, while omitting post-closure queue recovery understates it. Presenting assumed time values as actual operator losses creates unjustified numerical precision. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若把假設時間價值當作業者實際損失，會產生不當精確感。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Presenting assumed time values as actual operator losses creates unjustified numerical precision.",
