    {
     "id": "b230-v15-s4",
     "title": "試驗、量測與監測驗證",
     "titleEn": "Testing, measurement and monitoring",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「維護組合與風險降低」與「內外防線蓄洪耦合」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Maintenance portfolio and risk reduction\" and \"Coupled outer defence and storage\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b230-v15-25",
       "title": "維護組合與風險降低：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Maintenance portfolio and risk reduction: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "b-src-delta",
        "v15s-delta-adapt",
        "v15s-rws-first",
        "v15s-usace-steel",
        "v15s-usace-mechanical"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b230-v15-24"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「維護組合與風險降低」如何影響荷蘭三角洲工程的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Maintenance portfolio and risk reduction” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Delta Works”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "維護資源有限時，應比較失效機率、後果和措施效益，而不是只修最老設備。風險降低估算需要相同時間尺度及可核對的因果鏈。 假設年失效機率由0.01降至0.004、條件損失20 million currency，期望年損失降低0.006×20 million=120000 currency；非投資建議。 把所有故障都歸於老化會錯過共因與設計缺陷，維護也可能造成暫時停用風險。若效益和成本使用不同年度貨幣，排序會受到隱藏換算影響。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「維護組合與風險降低」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Limited maintenance resources require comparing probability, consequence and intervention effect rather than simply repairing the oldest asset. Estimated risk reduction needs a common time scale and a defensible causal link. Assume annual failure probability falls from 0.01 to 0.004 with conditional loss 20 million currency. Expected annual loss falls by 120000 currency, an educational estimate rather than investment advice. Attributing every failure to age misses common causes and design defects, while maintenance itself creates temporary outages. Comparing benefits and costs in different price years introduces hidden ranking distortions. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Maintenance portfolio and risk reduction” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設年失效機率由0.01降至0.004、條件損失20 million currency，期望年損失降低0.006×20 million=120000 currency；非投資建議。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume annual failure probability falls from 0.01 to 0.004 with conditional loss 20 million currency.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「設備年齡最高就一定具有最大的維護風險降低效益。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"The oldest asset necessarily offers the greatest maintenance risk-reduction benefit.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「維護組合與風險降低」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Maintenance portfolio and risk reduction”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
