         "text": "維護資源有限時，應比較失效機率、後果和措施效益，而不是只修最老設備。風險降低估算需要相同時間尺度及可核對的因果鏈。",
         "textEn": "Limited maintenance resources require comparing probability, consequence and intervention effect rather than simply repairing the oldest asset. Estimated risk reduction needs a common time scale and a defensible causal link.",
         "sourceIds": [
