       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Maintenance portfolio and risk reduction” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "逐項列出措施改變哪個失效模式，核對機率減少是否有試驗或歷史支持；以相同價格年和分析期間比較方案，保留不可量化後果。將維修期間新增的暫時風險列為獨立項目。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Identify the failure mode changed by each measure and check evidence supporting the probability reduction. Compare options with consistent price year and horizon while retaining consequences that cannot be credibly monetized. Include temporary additional risk during maintenance as a separate assessment item. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以維護組合與風險降低編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。逐項列出措施改變哪個失效模式，核對機率減少是否有試驗或歷史支持；以相同價格年和分析期間比較方案，保留不可量化後果。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for maintenance portfolio and risk reduction, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Identify the failure mode changed by each measure and check evidence supporting the probability reduction. Compare options with consistent price year and horizon while retaining consequences that cannot be credibly monetized.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把所有故障都歸於老化會錯過共因與設計缺陷，維護也可能造成暫時停用風險。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Attributing every failure to age misses common causes and design defects, while maintenance itself creates temporary outages. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
