       "objective": "從症狀倒推「維護組合與風險降低」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Maintenance portfolio and risk reduction” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把所有故障都歸於老化會錯過共因與設計缺陷，維護也可能造成暫時停用風險。若效益和成本使用不同年度貨幣，排序會受到隱藏換算影響。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Attributing every failure to age misses common causes and design defects, while maintenance itself creates temporary outages. Comparing benefits and costs in different price years introduces hidden ranking distortions. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若效益和成本使用不同年度貨幣，排序會受到隱藏換算影響。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Comparing benefits and costs in different price years introduces hidden ranking distortions.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「設備年齡最高就一定具有最大的維護風險降低效益。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The oldest asset necessarily offers the greatest maintenance risk-reduction benefit.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b230-v15-28-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "把所有故障都歸於老化會錯過共因與設計缺陷，維護也可能造成暫時停用風險。若效益和成本使用不同年度貨幣，排序會受到隱藏換算影響。",
