       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設外閘關閉4 h、內河淨入流500 m³/s，需暫存7.2 million m³；若允許平均升水0.3 m，理想有效面積24 km²。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume outer closure four hours with net river inflow 500 m³/s, requiring storage 7.2 million m³. At allowed mean rise 0.3 m, ideal effective area is 24 km². Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：同步列出海側閉合期間和河流入流歷線，將分區庫容與連通能力一起核對；用水位坡度檢查可用蓄洪面積是否真能在事件期間被利用。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Align outer-closure periods with river hydrographs, checking compartment storage and connectivity together.",
