       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Coupled outer defence and storage” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "同步列出海側閉合期間和河流入流歷線，將分區庫容與連通能力一起核對；用水位坡度檢查可用蓄洪面積是否真能在事件期間被利用。檢查連通口流量是否足以在洪峰前使用庫容。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Align outer-closure periods with river hydrographs, checking compartment storage and connectivity together. Use water-surface gradients to test whether nominal storage area is actually accessible during the event. Check whether connection capacity can make the storage accessible before the flood peak. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以內外防線蓄洪耦合編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。同步列出海側閉合期間和河流入流歷線，將分區庫容與連通能力一起核對；用水位坡度檢查可用蓄洪面積是否真能在事件期間被利用。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for coupled outer defence and storage, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Align outer-closure periods with river hydrographs, checking compartment storage and connectivity together. Use water-surface gradients to test whether nominal storage area is actually accessible during the event.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：名義庫容若被堤路隔開或入口狹窄，可能在洪峰前無法充分使用。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Nominal storage separated by roads or narrow entrances may not fill before the peak. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
