       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Adaptation trigger and lead time” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "海平面加速或施工延期會縮短可用時間，單一速率估算不能當精確倒數。若監測指標與實際失效模式沒有關聯，提早量再長也可能觸發錯誤措施。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Accelerating change or construction delay shortens available time, so one rate is not an exact countdown. A monitoring indicator disconnected from the failure mechanism may trigger the wrong measure despite ample lead time. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若監測指標與實際失效模式沒有關聯，提早量再長也可能觸發錯誤措施。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: A monitoring indicator disconnected from the failure mechanism may trigger the wrong measure despite ample lead time.",
