       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Multi-objective weight sensitivity” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Delta Works”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "區域方案需比較防洪、生態、航運與成本，權重表達價值選擇而不是物理真理。加權分數只能在同尺度和明確方向下使用，必須測試排序是否穩健。 假設方案A防洪90生態50、B防洪75生態80，防洪權重0.6，A=74、B=77；兩方案相等時權重w=2/3，分數皆為教學假設。 以高生態分數補償不可接受的防洪失效可能不符合決策邊界，正規化方式也會改變排序。若只公布最終總分，會掩蓋價值取捨與資料不確定度。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「多目標權重敏感度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Regional options balance protection, ecology, navigation and cost. Weights express value choices rather than physical truths, so weighted scores require common scales, consistent direction and ranking-sensitivity tests. Assume protection/ecology scores A=90/50 and B=75/80 with protection weight 0.6. Scores are A=74 and B=77; equality occurs at w=2/3, with all scores assumed. A high ecology score may not compensate for an unacceptable protection failure, and normalization can change rankings. Publishing only the total conceals value tradeoffs and uncertainty in the supporting evidence. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Multi-objective weight sensitivity” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
