       "objective": "從症狀倒推「多目標權重敏感度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Multi-objective weight sensitivity” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "以高生態分數補償不可接受的防洪失效可能不符合決策邊界，正規化方式也會改變排序。若只公布最終總分，會掩蓋價值取捨與資料不確定度。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A high ecology score may not compensate for an unacceptable protection failure, and normalization can change rankings. Publishing only the total conceals value tradeoffs and uncertainty in the supporting evidence. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若只公布最終總分，會掩蓋價值取捨與資料不確定度。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Publishing only the total conceals value tradeoffs and uncertainty in the supporting evidence.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「加權總分最高的方案在任何權重與限制下都必然最佳。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The highest weighted score remains best under every weighting and constraint.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b230-v15-40-k1",
