         "text": "以高生態分數補償不可接受的防洪失效可能不符合決策邊界，正規化方式也會改變排序。若只公布最終總分，會掩蓋價值取捨與資料不確定度。",
         "textEn": "A high ecology score may not compensate for an unacceptable protection failure, and normalization can change rankings. Publishing only the total conceals value tradeoffs and uncertainty in the supporting evidence.",
