        ],
        "answer": 2,
        "explanation": "教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設膠結材180 kg/m³、累積放熱250 kJ/kg、混凝土體積熱容量2.4 MJ/(m³·K)，絕熱溫升18.75 K；不是實際峰值溫度。 重算時請保留單位。",
        "explanationEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume binder 180 kg/m³, cumulative heat 250 kJ/kg and volumetric heat capacity 2.4 MJ/(m³·K). Keep units when recalculating."
