       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「絕熱溫升與膠結材」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Adiabatic rise and binder heat” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以材料量熱試驗取得放熱歷線，核對膠結材來源與配比，再比較澆塊中心與表面溫度；用能量平衡檢查溫度初值，並分列模板、氣溫與冷卻邊界。以初始骨材溫度獨立檢查入倉混凝土熱量。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Obtain heat-release histories from calorimetry, checking binder source and mixture proportions. Compare block-core and surface temperatures, verify initial conditions by energy balance, and list formwork, air-temperature and cooling boundaries separately. Independently check placed-concrete initial heat against measured aggregate temperature. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以絕熱溫升與膠結材編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以材料量熱試驗取得放熱歷線，核對膠結材來源與配比，再比較澆塊中心與表面溫度；用能量平衡檢查溫度初值，並分列模板、氣溫與冷卻邊界。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for adiabatic rise and binder heat, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Obtain heat-release histories from calorimetry, checking binder source and mixture proportions. Compare block-core and surface temperatures, verify initial conditions by energy balance, and list formwork, air-temperature and cooling boundaries separately.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把最終總放熱瞬間施加會錯估早期峰值，忽略表面散熱則會過度保守或失去梯度資訊。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Applying ultimate heat instantly misstates early peaks, while neglecting surface loss removes gradient information. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b231-v15-03-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
