         "textEn": "Obtain heat-release histories from calorimetry, checking binder source and mixture proportions. Compare block-core and surface temperatures, verify initial conditions by energy balance, and list formwork, air-temperature and cooling boundaries separately. Independently check placed-concrete initial heat against measured aggregate temperature.",
         "sourceIds": [
