         "text": "以絕熱溫升與膠結材編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以材料量熱試驗取得放熱歷線，核對膠結材來源與配比，再比較澆塊中心與表面溫度；用能量平衡檢查溫度初值，並分列模板、氣溫與冷卻邊界。",
         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for adiabatic rise and binder heat, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Obtain heat-release histories from calorimetry, checking binder source and mixture proportions. Compare block-core and surface temperatures, verify initial conditions by energy balance, and list formwork, air-temperature and cooling boundaries separately.",
