        ],
        "answer": 1,
        "explanation": "把最終總放熱瞬間施加會錯估早期峰值，忽略表面散熱則會過度保守或失去梯度資訊。 需以量測區分可能原因。",
        "explanationEn": "Applying ultimate heat instantly misstates early peaks, while neglecting surface loss removes gradient information. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."
