       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for placement supply and cold joints, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Record delivery and covering times by location and compare temperature, workability and setting data. Map supply interruptions to actual interfaces, then examine joint quality with cores or specified interface tests rather than total volume alone.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：同一停機時間在不同溫度下會產生不同接縫狀態，盲目加水恢復工作性又會改變材料品質。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: The same interruption produces different interface states at different temperatures, and adding water to restore workability changes material quality. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
