         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume interface area 100 m², normal force 30 MN, uplift 10 MN, c=0.1 MPa and μ=0.6. Resistance cA+μ(N−U)=22 MN, using assumed peak parameters.",
