       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「層面剪力與有效正應力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Lift-joint shear and effective stress” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以層面取芯與剪切試驗核對黏結及粗糙度，將孔壓測站換算到相同層位；分列峰值與殘餘參數，檢查抗力式是否對應實際可用接觸面積。以滑移後試驗檢查是否仍可保留黏聚項。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check bond and roughness with interface cores and shear testing, referring piezometers to the same lift. Separate peak and residual parameters and verify that the resistance formula uses the actual available contact area. Use post-slip testing to check whether retaining cohesion remains defensible. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以層面剪力與有效正應力編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以層面取芯與剪切試驗核對黏結及粗糙度，將孔壓測站換算到相同層位；分列峰值與殘餘參數，檢查抗力式是否對應實際可用接觸面積。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for lift-joint shear and effective stress, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check bond and roughness with interface cores and shear testing, referring piezometers to the same lift. Separate peak and residual parameters and verify that the resistance formula uses the actual available contact area.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：漿皮或污染使層面黏結降低，孔壓增加又削弱摩擦項。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Laitance or contamination reduces bond, while pore pressure reduces friction. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b231-v15-11-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "以層面取芯與剪切試驗核對黏結及粗糙度，將孔壓測站換算到相同層位；分列峰值與殘餘參數，檢查抗力式是否對應實際可用接觸面積。以滑移後試驗檢查是否仍可保留黏聚項。",
         "textEn": "Check bond and roughness with interface cores and shear testing, referring piezometers to the same lift. Separate peak and residual parameters and verify that the resistance formula uses the actual available contact area. Use post-slip testing to check whether retaining cohesion remains defensible.",
