         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for lift-joint shear and effective stress, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check bond and roughness with interface cores and shear testing, referring piezometers to the same lift. Separate peak and residual parameters and verify that the resistance formula uses the actual available contact area.",
