       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Thermal diffusion and block dimensions” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Block-by-block concrete gravity-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "熱擴散時間大致與傳熱距離平方成正比，澆塊尺度增加會讓中心維持高溫更久。這個尺度關係說明分塊原因，但不能給出精確冷卻完成時間。 假設熱擴散係數α=10⁻⁶ m²/s、特徵距離2 m，t=L²/α=4 million s=46.30 days；僅尺度估算，不是指定等待期。 用半厚或全厚當距離會造成四倍時間差，必須與邊界定義一致。後續澆層改變表面散熱條件，原本冷卻中的塊體可能再升溫，不能只外推初期曲線。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「熱擴散與澆塊尺寸」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Thermal diffusion time scales approximately with the square of travel distance, so larger blocks retain core heat longer. This explains the value of subdivision without predicting an exact cooling-completion time. Assume diffusivity α=10⁻⁶ m²/s and characteristic distance 2 m. t=L²/α=4 million s=46.30 days, a scale estimate rather than a prescribed waiting period. Using half-thickness versus full thickness changes the time scale fourfold and must match boundary definitions. Later lifts alter heat loss and can reheat a cooling block, invalidating simple extrapolation of early records. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Thermal diffusion and block dimensions” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設熱擴散係數α=10⁻⁶ m²/s、特徵距離2 m，t=L²/α=4 million s=46.30 days；僅尺度估算，不是指定等待期。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume diffusivity α=10⁻⁶ m²/s and characteristic distance 2 m. t=L²/α=4 million s=46.30 days, a scale estimate rather than a prescribed waiting period.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「澆塊厚度加倍只會讓熱擴散時間加倍。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Doubling block thickness only doubles the thermal diffusion time.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
