       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「熱擴散與澆塊尺寸」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Thermal diffusion and block dimensions” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "比較不同深度溫度變化的相位與幅度，以實測材料導熱率和熱容量重建擴散係數；將冷卻管、表面邊界和新增澆層列入，檢查單一距離是否具代表性。比較半厚與全厚邊界定義對時間尺度的影響。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare temperature phase and amplitude at several depths and derive diffusivity from measured conductivity and heat capacity. Include cooling pipes, surface conditions and added lifts, testing whether one characteristic distance is representative. Compare half-thickness and full-thickness boundary definitions in the diffusion scale. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以熱擴散與澆塊尺寸編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。比較不同深度溫度變化的相位與幅度，以實測材料導熱率和熱容量重建擴散係數；將冷卻管、表面邊界和新增澆層列入，檢查單一距離是否具代表性。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for thermal diffusion and block dimensions, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare temperature phase and amplitude at several depths and derive diffusivity from measured conductivity and heat capacity. Include cooling pipes, surface conditions and added lifts, testing whether one characteristic distance is representative.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：用半厚或全厚當距離會造成四倍時間差，必須與邊界定義一致。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Using half-thickness versus full thickness changes the time scale fourfold and must match boundary definitions. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
