         "textEn": "Compare temperature phase and amplitude at several depths and derive diffusivity from measured conductivity and heat capacity. Include cooling pipes, surface conditions and added lifts, testing whether one characteristic distance is representative. Compare half-thickness and full-thickness boundary definitions in the diffusion scale.",
