       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Cooling-water heat removal” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Block-by-block concrete gravity-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "埋管冷卻以水流帶走熱量，進出口溫差與流量共同決定移熱率。大流量低溫差和小流量高溫差不能只憑其中一項判斷效果。 假設水流2 kg/s、比熱4.18 kJ/(kg·K)、升溫5 K，移熱率41.8 kW；持續24 h移除3.61152 GJ，忽略流量溫差變化。 冷卻過快可能加大局部溫差和拉應力，不是移熱越多就越好。進出口感測器零點差也會在小溫差時造成大比例誤差，掩蓋實際冷卻不足。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「冷卻水能量移除」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Embedded cooling removes heat through water flow, with inlet-outlet temperature difference and flow jointly determining removal. Neither flow nor temperature rise alone establishes cooling performance. Assume water flow 2 kg/s, heat capacity 4.18 kJ/(kg·K) and rise 5 K. Heat removal is 41.8 kW or 3.61152 GJ over 24 h at constant conditions. Excessively fast cooling increases local gradients and tension, so more heat removal is not always better. Sensor offset between inlet and outlet causes large relative errors at small differences and can conceal inadequate removal. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Cooling-water heat removal” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設水流2 kg/s、比熱4.18 kJ/(kg·K)、升溫5 K，移熱率41.8 kW；持續24 h移除3.61152 GJ，忽略流量溫差變化。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume water flow 2 kg/s, heat capacity 4.18 kJ/(kg·K) and rise 5 K.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「只要冷卻水流量夠大，便能保證混凝土沒有溫差裂縫。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Sufficiently high cooling-water flow guarantees freedom from thermal-gradient cracking.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「冷卻水能量移除」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Cooling-water heat removal”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
