         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume water flow 2 kg/s, heat capacity 4.18 kJ/(kg·K) and rise 5 K. Heat removal is 41.8 kW or 3.61152 GJ over 24 h at constant conditions.",
