       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「冷卻水能量移除」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Cooling-water heat removal” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "同步量測各迴路進出口溫度和流量，積分移熱量與壩內溫度下降比較；檢查旁通、儀器偏差與管路漏水，避免只以泵流量代替真正穿過埋管的流量。以分迴路熱量總和檢查主回水量測的閉合。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure temperature and flow in each circuit synchronously and compare integrated removal with internal cooling. Check bypasses, instrument bias and leaks instead of using pump discharge as the flow through embedded pipes. Check main-return measurements against the sum of individual circuit heat removal. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以冷卻水能量移除編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。同步量測各迴路進出口溫度和流量，積分移熱量與壩內溫度下降比較；檢查旁通、儀器偏差與管路漏水，避免只以泵流量代替真正穿過埋管的流量。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for cooling-water heat removal, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure temperature and flow in each circuit synchronously and compare integrated removal with internal cooling. Check bypasses, instrument bias and leaks instead of using pump discharge as the flow through embedded pipes.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：冷卻過快可能加大局部溫差和拉應力，不是移熱越多就越好。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Excessively fast cooling increases local gradients and tension, so more heat removal is not always better. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
