         "textEn": "Measure temperature and flow in each circuit synchronously and compare integrated removal with internal cooling. Check bypasses, instrument bias and leaks instead of using pump discharge as the flow through embedded pipes. Check main-return measurements against the sum of individual circuit heat removal.",
