         "text": "冷卻過快可能加大局部溫差和拉應力，不是移熱越多就越好。進出口感測器零點差也會在小溫差時造成大比例誤差，掩蓋實際冷卻不足。",
         "textEn": "Excessively fast cooling increases local gradients and tension, so more heat removal is not always better. Sensor offset between inlet and outlet causes large relative errors at small differences and can conceal inadequate removal.",
