       ],
       "objective": "說明「成熟度與強度校正」如何影響混凝土重力壩分塊澆築的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Maturity and strength calibration” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Block-by-block concrete gravity-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "成熟度把時間和溫度整合為水化歷程指標，必須經同配比強度校正才可推論能力。不同膠結材或養護濕度會改變關係，不能把成熟度當直接強度。 假設Nurse-Saul基準溫度−10°C，混凝土20°C維持48 h，M=(20−(−10))×48=1440°C·h；未由此指定任何MPa。 高早期溫度可能改變後期強度發展，乾燥也可能中斷水化。若以其他配方成熟度曲線套用，會產生看似精確但缺乏材料依據的承載判讀。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「成熟度與強度校正」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Maturity combines time and temperature into a hydration-history index and needs same-mixture calibration before implying strength. Binder and curing moisture change the relationship, so maturity is not strength itself. Assume Nurse-Saul datum −10°C and concrete at 20°C for 48 h. M=(20−(−10))×48=1440°C·h, without assigning any strength in MPa. High early temperature can alter later strength development, and drying can interrupt hydration. Borrowing another mixture maturity curve creates apparently precise capacity estimates without the required material-specific evidence. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Maturity and strength calibration” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設Nurse-Saul基準溫度−10°C，混凝土20°C維持48 h，M=(20−(−10))×48=1440°C·h；未由此指定任何MPa。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume Nurse-Saul datum −10°C and concrete at 20°C for 48 h.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「成熟度達到固定數字就代表所有混凝土具有同一強度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A fixed maturity value means every concrete mixture has the same strength.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「成熟度與強度校正」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Maturity and strength calibration”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b231-v15-21-k1",
         "title": "成熟度與強度校正",
         "titleEn": "Maturity and strength calibration",
         "text": "成熟度把時間和溫度整合為水化歷程指標，必須經同配比強度校正才可推論能力。不同膠結材或養護濕度會改變關係，不能把成熟度當直接強度。",
         "textEn": "Maturity combines time and temperature into a hydration-history index and needs same-mixture calibration before implying strength. Binder and curing moisture change the relationship, so maturity is not strength itself.",
         "sourceIds": [
