       "objective": "以數值模型估算「成熟度與強度校正」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。",
       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Maturity and strength calibration” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設Nurse-Saul基準溫度−10°C，混凝土20°C維持48 h，M=(20−(−10))×48=1440°C·h；未由此指定任何MPa。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume Nurse-Saul datum −10°C and concrete at 20°C for 48 h. M=(20−(−10))×48=1440°C·h, without assigning any strength in MPa. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：用現場溫度歷線積分而非平均氣溫，與同配比不同齡期試體建立關係；另核對濕養護和高溫歷程是否超出校正範圍，保留實際拉壓強度試驗。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Integrate concrete temperature histories rather than ambient averages and calibrate with same-mixture specimens of different ages.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
       "checkEn": "Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.",
       "knowledge": [
