      {
       "id": "b231-v15-23",
       "title": "成熟度與強度校正：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Maturity and strength calibration: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usace-gravity",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usace-rcc"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b231-v15-22"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「成熟度與強度校正」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Maturity and strength calibration” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "用現場溫度歷線積分而非平均氣溫，與同配比不同齡期試體建立關係；另核對濕養護和高溫歷程是否超出校正範圍，保留實際拉壓強度試驗。以保留試體的實測強度驗證成熟度推估。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Integrate concrete temperature histories rather than ambient averages and calibrate with same-mixture specimens of different ages. Check moisture curing and high-temperature exposure against the calibration range and retain direct tensile and compressive tests. Validate maturity-based estimates against directly measured strength of retained specimens. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以成熟度與強度校正編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。用現場溫度歷線積分而非平均氣溫，與同配比不同齡期試體建立關係；另核對濕養護和高溫歷程是否超出校正範圍，保留實際拉壓強度試驗。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for maturity and strength calibration, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Integrate concrete temperature histories rather than ambient averages and calibrate with same-mixture specimens of different ages. Check moisture curing and high-temperature exposure against the calibration range and retain direct tensile and compressive tests.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：高早期溫度可能改變後期強度發展，乾燥也可能中斷水化。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: High early temperature can alter later strength development, and drying can interrupt hydration. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b231-v15-23-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "用現場溫度歷線積分而非平均氣溫，與同配比不同齡期試體建立關係；另核對濕養護和高溫歷程是否超出校正範圍，保留實際拉壓強度試驗。以保留試體的實測強度驗證成熟度推估。",
         "textEn": "Integrate concrete temperature histories rather than ambient averages and calibrate with same-mixture specimens of different ages. Check moisture curing and high-temperature exposure against the calibration range and retain direct tensile and compressive tests. Validate maturity-based estimates against directly measured strength of retained specimens.",
         "sourceIds": [
