         "text": "以成熟度與強度校正編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。用現場溫度歷線積分而非平均氣溫，與同配比不同齡期試體建立關係；另核對濕養護和高溫歷程是否超出校正範圍，保留實際拉壓強度試驗。",
         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for maturity and strength calibration, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Integrate concrete temperature histories rather than ambient averages and calibrate with same-mixture specimens of different ages. Check moisture curing and high-temperature exposure against the calibration range and retain direct tensile and compressive tests.",
