         "titleEn": "Joint opening and waterstop deformation",
         "text": "澆塊收縮使接縫開度改變，止水需要承受法向張開及剪向錯動。只量接縫寬度無法代表三維變形，也不能以材料伸長率直接代替完整接頭性能。",
         "textEn": "Block contraction changes joint opening, while waterstops face both normal opening and shear offset. Width alone misses three-dimensional movement, and material elongation is not complete-joint performance.",
         "sourceIds": [
