         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume effective contraction length 20 m, expansion coefficient 10⁻⁵/K and cooling 12 K. Free contraction is 2.4 mm, excluding restraint and neighboring-block movement and not an allowable waterstop opening.",
