       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「接縫開度與止水變形」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Joint opening and waterstop deformation” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "使用多方向接縫計核對張開與剪移，對照兩側溫度和庫水壓；檢查止水埋設位置與接頭試驗是否相符，並用分區漏流辨認局部通道。把接縫剪移與張開對止水的影響分列。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Use multi-axis joint meters to separate opening and shear, comparing temperatures and reservoir pressure. Check waterstop placement against tested joint geometry and use sectional leakage observations to locate preferential paths. Separate the effects of joint shear and opening on waterstop behavior. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以接縫開度與止水變形編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。使用多方向接縫計核對張開與剪移，對照兩側溫度和庫水壓；檢查止水埋設位置與接頭試驗是否相符，並用分區漏流辨認局部通道。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for joint opening and waterstop deformation, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Use multi-axis joint meters to separate opening and shear, comparing temperatures and reservoir pressure. Check waterstop placement against tested joint geometry and use sectional leakage observations to locate preferential paths.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：止水扭曲或接合不良可能在開度不大時漏水，混凝土蜂窩也會繞過完整止水。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Twisted or poorly joined waterstops may leak at small openings, while honeycombing bypasses an intact strip. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b231-v15-27-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "使用多方向接縫計核對張開與剪移，對照兩側溫度和庫水壓；檢查止水埋設位置與接頭試驗是否相符，並用分區漏流辨認局部通道。把接縫剪移與張開對止水的影響分列。",
         "textEn": "Use multi-axis joint meters to separate opening and shear, comparing temperatures and reservoir pressure. Check waterstop placement against tested joint geometry and use sectional leakage observations to locate preferential paths. Separate the effects of joint shear and opening on waterstop behavior.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-rcc"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b231-v15-27-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "以接縫開度與止水變形編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。使用多方向接縫計核對張開與剪移，對照兩側溫度和庫水壓；檢查止水埋設位置與接頭試驗是否相符，並用分區漏流辨認局部通道。",
         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for joint opening and waterstop deformation, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Use multi-axis joint meters to separate opening and shear, comparing temperatures and reservoir pressure. Check waterstop placement against tested joint geometry and use sectional leakage observations to locate preferential paths.",
         "sourceIds": [
