      {
       "id": "b231-v15-29",
       "title": "模板側壓與澆置狀態：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Form pressure and placement state: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usace-gravity",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usace-rcc"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b231-v15-28"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「模板側壓與澆置狀態」如何影響混凝土重力壩分塊澆築的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Form pressure and placement state” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Block-by-block concrete gravity-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "新拌混凝土對模板的側壓取決於澆置速率、凝結與振動，短時間內可近似液體。把已硬化混凝土的側向性質拿來估新拌壓力會嚴重失真。 假設新拌混凝土容重24 kN/m³、液態有效高3 m，底壓72 kPa；每米寬合力γh²/2=108 kN/m，作靜水上界示例。 延緩凝結或重新振動可能延長液態壓力作用，局部供料堆高也會增加側壓。只按平均澆築高估算而忽略局部集中，會低估模板與拉桿需求。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「模板側壓與澆置狀態」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Fresh-concrete form pressure depends on placing rate, setting and vibration and may initially approximate a liquid. Hardened-concrete lateral behavior cannot represent the fresh material pressure field. Assume fresh-concrete unit weight 24 kN/m³ and effective fluid height 3 m. Base pressure is 72 kPa and resultant per width is 108 kN/m, as a hydrostatic-bound example. Retarded setting or revibration can prolong fluid-like pressure, while local placement piles increase head. Average lift height can miss local concentrations and understate demand on formwork and ties. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Form pressure and placement state” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設新拌混凝土容重24 kN/m³、液態有效高3 m，底壓72 kPa；每米寬合力γh²/2=108 kN/m，作靜水上界示例。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume fresh-concrete unit weight 24 kN/m³ and effective fluid height 3 m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「混凝土剛澆入就已完全自立，所以模板不承受液態側壓。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Freshly placed concrete is immediately self-supporting and exerts no fluid-like form pressure.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「模板側壓與澆置狀態」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Form pressure and placement state”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b231-v15-29-k1",
         "title": "模板側壓與澆置狀態",
         "titleEn": "Form pressure and placement state",
         "text": "新拌混凝土對模板的側壓取決於澆置速率、凝結與振動，短時間內可近似液體。把已硬化混凝土的側向性質拿來估新拌壓力會嚴重失真。",
         "textEn": "Fresh-concrete form pressure depends on placing rate, setting and vibration and may initially approximate a liquid. Hardened-concrete lateral behavior cannot represent the fresh material pressure field.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-rcc"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b231-v15-29-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：混凝土剛澆入就已完全自立，所以模板不承受液態側壓。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Freshly placed concrete is immediately self-supporting and exerts no fluid-like form pressure. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-rcc"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "關於「模板側壓與澆置狀態」，下列哪一項敘述正確？",
        "questionEn": "Which statement about \"Form pressure and placement state\" is correct?",
        "options": [
         "混凝土剛澆入就已完全自立，所以模板不承受液態側壓。",
         "圖面有排水孔就能不量孔壓而忽略全部基底上浮。",
         "新拌混凝土對模板的側壓取決於澆置速率、凝結與振動，短時間內可近似液體。"
        ],
        "optionsEn": [
         "Freshly placed concrete is immediately self-supporting and exerts no fluid-like form pressure.",
         "Drains shown on drawings allow all foundation uplift to be ignored without pressure measurements.",
         "Fresh-concrete form pressure depends on placing rate, setting and vibration and may initially approximate a liquid."
