        "explanation": "新拌混凝土對模板的側壓取決於澆置速率、凝結與振動，短時間內可近似液體。 其餘選項是常見誤解。",
        "explanationEn": "Fresh-concrete form pressure depends on placing rate, setting and vibration and may initially approximate a liquid. The other options are common misconceptions."
