      {
       "id": "b231-v15-30",
       "title": "模板側壓與澆置狀態：定量估算",
       "titleEn": "Form pressure and placement state: quantitative estimate",
       "estimatedMinutes": 30,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usace-gravity",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usace-rcc"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b231-v15-29"
       ],
       "objective": "以數值模型估算「模板側壓與澆置狀態」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。",
       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Form pressure and placement state” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設新拌混凝土容重24 kN/m³、液態有效高3 m，底壓72 kPa；每米寬合力γh²/2=108 kN/m，作靜水上界示例。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume fresh-concrete unit weight 24 kN/m³ and effective fluid height 3 m. Base pressure is 72 kPa and resultant per width is 108 kN/m, as a hydrostatic-bound example. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：核對澆置速率、料溫與凝結試驗，將模板壓力計讀數按高度作圖；檢查振動期間峰值與拉桿反力，並確認壓力假設涵蓋實際材料工作性。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Check placing rate, temperature and setting tests and plot measured form pressures by elevation.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
       "checkEn": "Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b231-v15-30-k1",
         "title": "定量模型",
         "titleEn": "Quantitative model",
         "text": "教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設新拌混凝土容重24 kN/m³、液態有效高3 m，底壓72 kPa；每米寬合力γh²/2=108 kN/m，作靜水上界示例。",
         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume fresh-concrete unit weight 24 kN/m³ and effective fluid height 3 m. Base pressure is 72 kPa and resultant per width is 108 kN/m, as a hydrostatic-bound example.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-rcc"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b231-v15-30-k2",
         "title": "模型邊界",
         "titleEn": "Model boundary",
         "text": "本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。",
         "textEn": "These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-rcc"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "依「模板側壓與澆置狀態」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？",
        "questionEn": "According to the quantitative model for \"Form pressure and placement state\", which statement holds?",
        "options": [
         "教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設新拌混凝土容重24 kN/m³、液態有效高3 m，底壓72 kPa。",
         "絕熱溫升就是工地澆塊必定量到的最高溫度。",
         "接縫剪力能力可以直接等同完整混凝土的強度。"
        ],
