       "observation": "現場實務：以模板側壓與澆置狀態編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。核對澆置速率、料溫與凝結試驗，將模板壓力計讀數按高度作圖；檢查振動期間峰值與拉桿反力，並確認壓力假設涵蓋實際材料工作性。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for form pressure and placement state, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check placing rate, temperature and setting tests and plot measured form pressures by elevation. Examine vibration-related peaks and tie reactions, confirming that pressure assumptions cover the actual mixture workability.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：延緩凝結或重新振動可能延長液態壓力作用，局部供料堆高也會增加側壓。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Retarded setting or revibration can prolong fluid-like pressure, while local placement piles increase head. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
