       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Form pressure and placement state” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "延緩凝結或重新振動可能延長液態壓力作用，局部供料堆高也會增加側壓。只按平均澆築高估算而忽略局部集中，會低估模板與拉桿需求。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Retarded setting or revibration can prolong fluid-like pressure, while local placement piles increase head. Average lift height can miss local concentrations and understate demand on formwork and ties. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：只按平均澆築高估算而忽略局部集中，會低估模板與拉桿需求。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Average lift height can miss local concentrations and understate demand on formwork and ties.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「混凝土剛澆入就已完全自立，所以模板不承受液態側壓。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Freshly placed concrete is immediately self-supporting and exerts no fluid-like form pressure.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
