     "description": "本階段聚焦「上浮折減與抗滑」與「澆塊幾何與材料追溯」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Uplift reduction and sliding\" and \"Block geometry and material traceability\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b231-v15-33",
       "title": "上浮折減與抗滑：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Uplift reduction and sliding: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usace-gravity",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usace-rcc"
