         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：圖面有排水孔就能不量孔壓而忽略全部基底上浮。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Drains shown on drawings allow all foundation uplift to be ignored without pressure measurements. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
