         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume per-metre weight 12 MN/m, uplift 3 MN/m, μ=0.7 and horizontal force 4 MN/m. Friction-only ratio μ(W−U)/H=1.575, excluding cohesion and earthquake loading.",
