       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「上浮折減與抗滑」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Uplift reduction and sliding” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "沿基底量測孔壓並積分上浮，對照排水量和庫位變化；確認滑動面位置、材料參數與荷載組合一致，再比較排水減弱時的敏感度，而非只驗一個數字。將堵塞情境下上浮分布另做整體力矩檢查。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Integrate measured basal pressure into uplift and compare drainage and reservoir changes. Keep slip plane, material parameters and load combination consistent, then assess sensitivity to impaired drainage instead of checking one ratio alone. Check global moments separately using an uplift distribution representing blocked drains. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以上浮折減與抗滑編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。沿基底量測孔壓並積分上浮，對照排水量和庫位變化；確認滑動面位置、材料參數與荷載組合一致，再比較排水減弱時的敏感度，而非只驗一個數字。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for uplift reduction and sliding, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Integrate measured basal pressure into uplift and compare drainage and reservoir changes. Keep slip plane, material parameters and load combination consistent, then assess sensitivity to impaired drainage instead of checking one ratio alone.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：排水量變小可能代表堵塞而非更防水，孔壓升高會讓摩擦比降低。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Lower drainage may indicate clogging rather than improved impermeability, and rising pressure lowers frictional reserve. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
