         "textEn": "Integrate measured basal pressure into uplift and compare drainage and reservoir changes. Keep slip plane, material parameters and load combination consistent, then assess sensitivity to impaired drainage instead of checking one ratio alone. Check global moments separately using an uplift distribution representing blocked drains.",
