      {
       "id": "b231-v15-37",
       "title": "澆塊幾何與材料追溯：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Block geometry and material traceability: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usace-gravity",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usace-rcc"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b231-v15-36"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「澆塊幾何與材料追溯」如何影響混凝土重力壩分塊澆築的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Block geometry and material traceability” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Block-by-block concrete gravity-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "分塊施工讓每一批混凝土對應空間位置，幾何方量與材料紀錄可互相驗證。超澆、孔洞和預留廊道會影響方量，不能用進料量直接當完成實體。 假設矩形澆塊20×15×2 m，扣除廊道30 m³，淨量570 m³；若供料590 m³，差20 m³須查損耗和幾何，不能直接稱空洞。 把運輸損耗或模板外擴誤判為內部空洞會導致錯誤調查，反過來總量吻合也可能掩蓋局部蜂窩。空間追溯能找出缺陷位置，總方量卻無法。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「澆塊幾何與材料追溯」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Block construction links concrete batches to spatial locations, enabling geometric and material records to cross-check. Overpour, voids and galleries affect volume, so delivered material is not automatically completed solid geometry. Assume block 20×15×2 m minus gallery 30 m³, giving net 570 m³. Delivery 590 m³ leaves a 20 m³ difference requiring geometry and loss checks, not an automatic void diagnosis. Transport loss or form bulging can be mistaken for voids, while matching total volume can conceal local honeycombing. Spatial traceability can locate defects, whereas aggregate quantity cannot resolve their distribution. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Block geometry and material traceability” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設矩形澆塊20×15×2 m，扣除廊道30 m³，淨量570 m³；若供料590 m³，差20 m³須查損耗和幾何，不能直接稱空洞。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume block 20×15×2 m minus gallery 30 m³, giving net 570 m³.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「進料總方量與設計相符就能證明澆塊內完全沒有缺陷。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Matching delivered and design volume proves the entire block is defect-free.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「澆塊幾何與材料追溯」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Block geometry and material traceability”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b231-v15-37-k1",
         "title": "澆塊幾何與材料追溯",
         "titleEn": "Block geometry and material traceability",
         "text": "分塊施工讓每一批混凝土對應空間位置，幾何方量與材料紀錄可互相驗證。超澆、孔洞和預留廊道會影響方量，不能用進料量直接當完成實體。",
         "textEn": "Block construction links concrete batches to spatial locations, enabling geometric and material records to cross-check. Overpour, voids and galleries affect volume, so delivered material is not automatically completed solid geometry.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-rcc"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b231-v15-37-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：進料總方量與設計相符就能證明澆塊內完全沒有缺陷。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Matching delivered and design volume proves the entire block is defect-free. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-rcc"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "關於「澆塊幾何與材料追溯」，下列哪一項敘述正確？",
        "questionEn": "Which statement about \"Block geometry and material traceability\" is correct?",
        "options": [
         "進料總方量與設計相符就能證明澆塊內完全沒有缺陷。",
