       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「澆塊幾何與材料追溯」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Block geometry and material traceability” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "把測量面、預留件和批次進料分別建帳，核對每車時間與澆築位置；以收方幾何、廢料紀錄和密度試驗做閉合，對不能解釋的差異要求獨立查證。對差異最大的批次回查供料和廢料原始憑據。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Maintain separate surveyed surfaces, embedded-volume and delivery records, matching batches to placement location. Close quantities using as-built geometry, waste records and density tests, requiring independent evidence for unexplained differences. Revisit original delivery and waste records for batches with the largest discrepancies. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以澆塊幾何與材料追溯編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。把測量面、預留件和批次進料分別建帳，核對每車時間與澆築位置；以收方幾何、廢料紀錄和密度試驗做閉合，對不能解釋的差異要求獨立查證。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for block geometry and material traceability, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Maintain separate surveyed surfaces, embedded-volume and delivery records, matching batches to placement location. Close quantities using as-built geometry, waste records and density tests, requiring independent evidence for unexplained differences.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把運輸損耗或模板外擴誤判為內部空洞會導致錯誤調查，反過來總量吻合也可能掩蓋局部蜂窩。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Transport loss or form bulging can be mistaken for voids, while matching total volume can conceal local honeycombing. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
