         "textEn": "Maintain separate surveyed surfaces, embedded-volume and delivery records, matching batches to placement location. Close quantities using as-built geometry, waste records and density tests, requiring independent evidence for unexplained differences. Revisit original delivery and waste records for batches with the largest discrepancies.",
