         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for block geometry and material traceability, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Maintain separate surveyed surfaces, embedded-volume and delivery records, matching batches to placement location. Close quantities using as-built geometry, waste records and density tests, requiring independent evidence for unexplained differences.",
