       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「澆塊幾何與材料追溯」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Block geometry and material traceability” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把運輸損耗或模板外擴誤判為內部空洞會導致錯誤調查，反過來總量吻合也可能掩蓋局部蜂窩。空間追溯能找出缺陷位置，總方量卻無法。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Transport loss or form bulging can be mistaken for voids, while matching total volume can conceal local honeycombing. Spatial traceability can locate defects, whereas aggregate quantity cannot resolve their distribution. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：空間追溯能找出缺陷位置，總方量卻無法。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Spatial traceability can locate defects, whereas aggregate quantity cannot resolve their distribution.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「進料總方量與設計相符就能證明澆塊內完全沒有缺陷。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Matching delivered and design volume proves the entire block is defect-free.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b231-v15-40-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "把運輸損耗或模板外擴誤判為內部空洞會導致錯誤調查，反過來總量吻合也可能掩蓋局部蜂窩。空間追溯能找出缺陷位置，總方量卻無法。",
         "textEn": "Transport loss or form bulging can be mistaken for voids, while matching total volume can conceal local honeycombing. Spatial traceability can locate defects, whereas aggregate quantity cannot resolve their distribution.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-rcc"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b231-v15-40-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
