    "title": "原創假想算例與邊界",
    "titleEn": "Original hypothetical example and boundaries",
    "text": "本課原創比較練習分兩個相互獨立的物理模型。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設鋪層面積5000 m²、厚0.3 m，體積1500 m³；有效供料250 m³/h需6 h，未含邊緣修整和局部停頓。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設現場乾密度2320 kg/m³、參考最大乾密度2400 kg/m³，密實度96.667%；僅教學比例，不作任何工程驗收標準。先逐一圈出公式內的控制體、力方向或時間尺度，再把每項輸入的量綱換成一致單位。第二人只根據輸入重算結果，不抄第一人的中間數字。最後指出這兩個估算尚未包含的空間變化、非線性及量測誤差；若將結果用於另一座工程，必須重建其幾何、材料與邊界條件，不能挪用本練習的假設。 鋪層節拍比較固定面積5000 m²及厚度0.3 m，因此需料1500 m³不變，只將有效供料率250增至300 m³/h。t=V/Q由6 h降至5 h，供料率增加20%而時間減少16.67%。模型仍未含邊緣修整、設備等待及接縫時間限制；增加供料不能被直接解讀為所有施工工序都縮短相同比例。",
    "textEn": "This original comparison exercise uses two independent physical models. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume lift area 5000 m² and thickness 0.3 m, giving 1500 m³. Effective supply 250 m³/h requires six hours, excluding edge work and local interruptions. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume field dry density 2320 kg/m³ and reference maximum dry density 2400 kg/m³. Relative compaction is 96.667 percent, a teaching ratio rather than an acceptance criterion. First identify the control volume, force direction or time scale in each relation, then convert every input to consistent units. A second reviewer recalculates from the inputs without copying intermediate numbers. Finally identify spatial variability, nonlinear effects and measurement errors omitted by both estimates. Transfer to another structure requires rebuilding its geometry, material description and boundary conditions; the assumed classroom inputs are not transferable design or operating parameters. Keep lift area 5000 m² and thickness 0.3 m fixed, so volume remains 1500 m³, increasing only effective supply from 250 to 300 m³/h. Duration t=V/Q falls from 6 h to 5 h: 20% more supply gives 16.67% less time. Edge finishing, equipment queues and joint-time limits remain excluded; other construction tasks need not shorten by the same proportion.",
    "assumptions": "數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。",
    "assumptionsEn": "Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.",
    "sourceScope": "原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。",
    "sourceScopeEn": "Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."
   },
