         "titleEn": "Lift volume and supply rhythm",
         "text": "碾壓混凝土以薄層連續鋪築形成大體積結構，層面暴露時間由面積和供料節拍共同決定。設備名義產能不等於可持續有效供料，需考慮運輸與等待。",
         "textEn": "RCC forms mass structures through thin successive lifts. Lift exposure depends on area and delivery rhythm, while rated plant capacity differs from sustainable placement because transport and queuing intervene.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-rcc",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b232-v15-01-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：拌合廠額定產能就是每個澆築位置可持續取得的供料率。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Rated batching capacity equals sustainable delivery at every placement location. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
