      {
       "id": "b232-v15-03",
       "title": "鋪層體積與供料節拍：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Lift volume and supply rhythm: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usace-rcc",
        "v15s-usace-gravity",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b232-v15-02"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「鋪層體積與供料節拍」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Lift volume and supply rhythm” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以實際出料、運輸到達和攤鋪位置時間戳重建節拍，核對最久暴露區；將廠拌能力與運輸瓶頸分開，再用現場層面狀況檢查排程假設是否成立。將最長暴露區的時間納入層面處理證據。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Reconstruct rhythm from batching, arrival and placement timestamps and identify the longest-exposed area. Separate batching capacity from transport bottlenecks, then check scheduling assumptions against actual interface conditions. Include the longest-exposed region in the evidence for interface preparation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以鋪層體積與供料節拍編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以實際出料、運輸到達和攤鋪位置時間戳重建節拍，核對最久暴露區；將廠拌能力與運輸瓶頸分開，再用現場層面狀況檢查排程假設是否成立。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for lift volume and supply rhythm, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Reconstruct rhythm from batching, arrival and placement timestamps and identify the longest-exposed area. Separate batching capacity from transport bottlenecks, then check scheduling assumptions against actual interface conditions.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：大面積整層平均完成很快仍可能有角落長時間未覆蓋，臨時道路交錯也會造成局部延遲。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A fast average lift cycle can conceal long exposure in corners, while crossing haul routes cause local delays. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b232-v15-03-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "以實際出料、運輸到達和攤鋪位置時間戳重建節拍，核對最久暴露區；將廠拌能力與運輸瓶頸分開，再用現場層面狀況檢查排程假設是否成立。將最長暴露區的時間納入層面處理證據。",
         "textEn": "Reconstruct rhythm from batching, arrival and placement timestamps and identify the longest-exposed area. Separate batching capacity from transport bottlenecks, then check scheduling assumptions against actual interface conditions. Include the longest-exposed region in the evidence for interface preparation.",
