         "text": "大面積整層平均完成很快仍可能有角落長時間未覆蓋，臨時道路交錯也會造成局部延遲。若以最高一小時產量推算全日，便會低估冷縫風險。",
         "textEn": "A fast average lift cycle can conceal long exposure in corners, while crossing haul routes cause local delays. Extrapolating the best production hour to a full day understates cold-interface risk.",
