       ],
       "objective": "說明「壓實度與參考密度」如何影響碾壓混凝土壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Compaction and reference density” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Roller-compacted-concrete dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "RCC密實程度影響孔隙、強度與滲透性，現場密度需對應代表性參考值。參考試體的含水量與級配不同時，密實度百分比會失去可比性。 假設現場乾密度2320 kg/m³、參考最大乾密度2400 kg/m³，密實度96.667%；僅教學比例，不作任何工程驗收標準。 密度計校正偏差可能讓全層數字一致但錯誤，粗骨材集中又會改變局部讀數。只驗平均密實度可能漏掉層底或模板附近的連續鬆散帶。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「壓實度與參考密度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "RCC density influences voids, strength and permeability, and field density needs a representative reference. A percentage loses comparability if reference specimens differ in moisture or grading from the placed material. Assume field dry density 2320 kg/m³ and reference maximum dry density 2400 kg/m³. Relative compaction is 96.667 percent, a teaching ratio rather than an acceptance criterion. Calibration bias can make all readings consistently wrong, while coarse-aggregate concentration changes local response. Mean compaction alone can miss continuous loose bands at lift bottoms or beside forms. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Compaction and reference density” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設現場乾密度2320 kg/m³、參考最大乾密度2400 kg/m³，密實度96.667%；僅教學比例，不作任何工程驗收標準。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume field dry density 2320 kg/m³ and reference maximum dry density 2400 kg/m³.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「平均密實度達到要求就代表層內每個位置都同樣密實。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Meeting mean compaction requirements means every location is equally dense.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「壓實度與參考密度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Compaction and reference density”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b232-v15-05-k1",
         "title": "壓實度與參考密度",
