         "text": "RCC密實程度影響孔隙、強度與滲透性，現場密度需對應代表性參考值。參考試體的含水量與級配不同時，密實度百分比會失去可比性。",
         "textEn": "RCC density influences voids, strength and permeability, and field density needs a representative reference. A percentage loses comparability if reference specimens differ in moisture or grading from the placed material.",
         "sourceIds": [
