          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b232-v15-05-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：平均密實度達到要求就代表層內每個位置都同樣密實。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Meeting mean compaction requirements means every location is equally dense. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-rcc",
