         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume field dry density 2320 kg/m³ and reference maximum dry density 2400 kg/m³. Relative compaction is 96.667 percent, a teaching ratio rather than an acceptance criterion.",
         "sourceIds": [
