       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「壓實度與參考密度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Compaction and reference density” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "用同配比試驗確認參考密度，核對現場量測含水修正與大骨材影響；以取芯密度、孔隙和強度作交叉檢查，並將邊緣與中部樣本分組。核對粗骨材修正前後是否使用同一密度定義。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Establish reference density for the same mixture, checking moisture correction and large-aggregate effects in field measurements. Cross-check with core density, voids and strength, grouping edge and interior samples separately. Check that density definitions remain consistent before and after coarse-aggregate correction. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以壓實度與參考密度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。用同配比試驗確認參考密度，核對現場量測含水修正與大骨材影響；以取芯密度、孔隙和強度作交叉檢查，並將邊緣與中部樣本分組。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for compaction and reference density, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Establish reference density for the same mixture, checking moisture correction and large-aggregate effects in field measurements. Cross-check with core density, voids and strength, grouping edge and interior samples separately.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：密度計校正偏差可能讓全層數字一致但錯誤，粗骨材集中又會改變局部讀數。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Calibration bias can make all readings consistently wrong, while coarse-aggregate concentration changes local response. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
