         "text": "密度計校正偏差可能讓全層數字一致但錯誤，粗骨材集中又會改變局部讀數。只驗平均密實度可能漏掉層底或模板附近的連續鬆散帶。",
         "textEn": "Calibration bias can make all readings consistently wrong, while coarse-aggregate concentration changes local response. Mean compaction alone can miss continuous loose bands at lift bottoms or beside forms.",
