       ],
       "objective": "說明「含水量與膠結比」如何影響碾壓混凝土壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Moisture and water-binder ratio” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Roller-compacted-concrete dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "含水不足會降低可壓實性，過多則改變骨架和漿體孔隙。總水量需含骨材自由水，不能只看拌合機外加水；吸收水與自由水的角色不同。 假設膠結材150 kg/m³、設計有效水90 kg/m³，w/b=0.60；骨材帶入自由水15 kg/m³時，外加水應為75 kg/m³，限已知吸水修正。 把吸收水全部當成可用拌合水會低估外加需求，雨後自由水未扣除則會提高有效水膠比。現場補水若未記錄，後續強度異常將難以追溯。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「含水量與膠結比」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Too little water impairs compactability, while excess changes the aggregate skeleton and paste voids. Total mixing water includes aggregate free moisture, with absorbed and free water serving different roles. Assume binder 150 kg/m³ and effective water 90 kg/m³, giving w/b=0.60. Aggregate free water 15 kg/m³ leaves added water 75 kg/m³, with absorption already accounted for. Counting absorbed water as free mixing water understates additions, while failing to subtract rainwater increases effective ratio. Unrecorded field water makes later strength anomalies difficult to trace to their origin. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Moisture and water-binder ratio” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設膠結材150 kg/m³、設計有效水90 kg/m³，w/b=0.60；骨材帶入自由水15 kg/m³時，外加水應為75 kg/m³，限已知吸水修正。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume binder 150 kg/m³ and effective water 90 kg/m³, giving w/b=0.60.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「只記錄外加水就足以準確得到混凝土有效水膠比。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Added water alone accurately determines the concrete effective water-binder ratio.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「含水量與膠結比」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Moisture and water-binder ratio”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
