         "title": "含水量與膠結比",
         "titleEn": "Moisture and water-binder ratio",
         "text": "含水不足會降低可壓實性，過多則改變骨架和漿體孔隙。總水量需含骨材自由水，不能只看拌合機外加水；吸收水與自由水的角色不同。",
         "textEn": "Too little water impairs compactability, while excess changes the aggregate skeleton and paste voids. Total mixing water includes aggregate free moisture, with absorbed and free water serving different roles.",
         "sourceIds": [
