         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume binder 150 kg/m³ and effective water 90 kg/m³, giving w/b=0.60. Aggregate free water 15 kg/m³ leaves added water 75 kg/m³, with absorption already accounted for.",
