       "observation": "現場實務：以含水量與膠結比編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。分別量測骨材含水和吸水率，核對外加水計量與批次修正；比較稠度、壓實反應和取芯品質，確認比例變化不是單純由濕骨材質量換算錯誤造成。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for moisture and water-binder ratio, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure aggregate moisture and absorption separately and check metered additions and batch corrections. Compare consistency, compaction response and cores to ensure apparent ratio changes are not wet-mass conversion errors.",
