       "objective": "從症狀倒推「含水量與膠結比」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Moisture and water-binder ratio” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把吸收水全部當成可用拌合水會低估外加需求，雨後自由水未扣除則會提高有效水膠比。現場補水若未記錄，後續強度異常將難以追溯。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Counting absorbed water as free mixing water understates additions, while failing to subtract rainwater increases effective ratio. Unrecorded field water makes later strength anomalies difficult to trace to their origin. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：現場補水若未記錄，後續強度異常將難以追溯。",
