       "objective": "說明「壓實功與遍數解讀」如何影響碾壓混凝土壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Compaction effort and pass count” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Roller-compacted-concrete dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "碾壓遍數是施工過程指標，不是材料狀態本身；振幅、頻率、速度、層厚及骨材都影響輸入和傳遞。增加遍數可能使密度趨於平台或造成粒料破碎。 假設單遍等效輸入能量20 kJ/m²、6遍、層厚0.3 m，名義能量密度400 kJ/m³；不代表全部能量有效傳入混凝土。 表面密度達平台可能只是上部已密實而底部仍鬆散，遍數紀錄也可能因路徑重疊計算錯誤。把更多碾壓視為必然改善，會忽略破碎和離析。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「壓實功與遍數解讀」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Pass count describes process rather than material state. Amplitude, frequency, speed, thickness and aggregate affect energy transfer, while extra passes may reach a density plateau or crush particles. Assume equivalent input 20 kJ/m² per pass, six passes and lift thickness 0.3 m. Nominal energy density is 400 kJ/m³, not entirely effective energy delivered to concrete. A surface-density plateau may conceal a loose lower lift, and overlapping paths can distort pass counts. Assuming more rolling always improves quality overlooks particle breakage and segregation caused by excessive working. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Compaction effort and pass count” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設單遍等效輸入能量20 kJ/m²、6遍、層厚0.3 m，名義能量密度400 kJ/m³；不代表全部能量有效傳入混凝土。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume equivalent input 20 kJ/m² per pass, six passes and lift thickness 0.3 m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「碾壓遍數越多就必然讓所有深度的品質持續提高。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"More roller passes necessarily keep improving quality at every depth.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「壓實功與遍數解讀」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Compaction effort and pass count”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
