         "text": "碾壓遍數是施工過程指標，不是材料狀態本身；振幅、頻率、速度、層厚及骨材都影響輸入和傳遞。增加遍數可能使密度趨於平台或造成粒料破碎。",
         "textEn": "Pass count describes process rather than material state. Amplitude, frequency, speed, thickness and aggregate affect energy transfer, while extra passes may reach a density plateau or crush particles.",
