       "objective": "說明「砂漿體積與骨架空隙」如何影響碾壓混凝土壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Mortar volume and skeleton voids” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Roller-compacted-concrete dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "骨材骨架需要足夠砂漿填充空隙並形成黏結，砂漿過少可能留下連通孔隙。粗骨材堆積密度與級配影響所需體積，不能只以水泥重量評估。 假設每立方公尺粗骨材骨架空隙0.28 m³、有效砂漿0.31 m³，體積餘裕0.03 m³，即空隙的10.714%；不代表最佳配比。 砂漿充足不保證運輸後仍均勻分布，離析可在局部留下缺漿粗料。過多細料又可能增加需水與收縮，單一體積餘裕不能證明耐久性全面提升。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「砂漿體積與骨架空隙」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "The aggregate skeleton needs mortar to fill voids and bond particles. Insufficient mortar can leave connected porosity, while packing density and grading control volume demand rather than cement mass alone. Assume coarse-skeleton voids 0.28 m³ per bulk cubic metre and effective mortar 0.31 m³. Margin is 0.03 m³, or 10.714 percent of void volume, not an optimum mix. Adequate total mortar does not ensure uniform distribution after transport; segregation can leave locally deficient coarse pockets. Excess fines increase water demand and shrinkage, so one volume margin does not demonstrate overall durability. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Mortar volume and skeleton voids” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設每立方公尺粗骨材骨架空隙0.28 m³、有效砂漿0.31 m³，體積餘裕0.03 m³，即空隙的10.714%；不代表最佳配比。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume coarse-skeleton voids 0.28 m³ per bulk cubic metre and effective mortar 0.31 m³.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「總砂漿體積足夠就能保證每個局部空隙都被填滿。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Sufficient total mortar volume guarantees every local void is filled.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「砂漿體積與骨架空隙」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Mortar volume and skeleton voids”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
