         "title": "砂漿體積與骨架空隙",
         "titleEn": "Mortar volume and skeleton voids",
         "text": "骨材骨架需要足夠砂漿填充空隙並形成黏結，砂漿過少可能留下連通孔隙。粗骨材堆積密度與級配影響所需體積，不能只以水泥重量評估。",
         "textEn": "The aggregate skeleton needs mortar to fill voids and bond particles. Insufficient mortar can leave connected porosity, while packing density and grading control volume demand rather than cement mass alone.",
