         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume coarse-skeleton voids 0.28 m³ per bulk cubic metre and effective mortar 0.31 m³. Margin is 0.03 m³, or 10.714 percent of void volume, not an optimum mix.",
