       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Mortar volume and skeleton voids” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "量測骨材堆積空隙並核對砂漿實際體積，將細料吸附與骨材形狀一起考慮；用取芯孔隙連通性和界面觀察檢查是否真正填滿，而不是只看外觀。比較缺漿區與完整區芯樣的連通孔隙差異。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure aggregate packing voids and actual mortar volume, considering fines adsorption and particle shape. Use core connectivity and interface observations to verify filling instead of relying on a smooth surface appearance. Compare connected voids in cores from mortar-deficient and intact regions. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以砂漿體積與骨架空隙編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。量測骨材堆積空隙並核對砂漿實際體積，將細料吸附與骨材形狀一起考慮；用取芯孔隙連通性和界面觀察檢查是否真正填滿，而不是只看外觀。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for mortar volume and skeleton voids, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure aggregate packing voids and actual mortar volume, considering fines adsorption and particle shape. Use core connectivity and interface observations to verify filling instead of relying on a smooth surface appearance.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：砂漿充足不保證運輸後仍均勻分布，離析可在局部留下缺漿粗料。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
