       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「砂漿體積與骨架空隙」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Mortar volume and skeleton voids” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "砂漿充足不保證運輸後仍均勻分布，離析可在局部留下缺漿粗料。過多細料又可能增加需水與收縮，單一體積餘裕不能證明耐久性全面提升。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Adequate total mortar does not ensure uniform distribution after transport; segregation can leave locally deficient coarse pockets. Excess fines increase water demand and shrinkage, so one volume margin does not demonstrate overall durability. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：過多細料又可能增加需水與收縮，單一體積餘裕不能證明耐久性全面提升。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Excess fines increase water demand and shrinkage, so one volume margin does not demonstrate overall durability.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「總砂漿體積足夠就能保證每個局部空隙都被填滿。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Sufficient total mortar volume guarantees every local void is filled.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b232-v15-20-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "砂漿充足不保證運輸後仍均勻分布，離析可在局部留下缺漿粗料。過多細料又可能增加需水與收縮，單一體積餘裕不能證明耐久性全面提升。",
         "textEn": "Adequate total mortar does not ensure uniform distribution after transport; segregation can leave locally deficient coarse pockets. Excess fines increase water demand and shrinkage, so one volume margin does not demonstrate overall durability.",
