      {
       "id": "b232-v15-21",
       "title": "層間黏結與有效齡期：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Interlift bond and exposure age: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usace-rcc",
        "v15s-usace-gravity",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b232-v15-20"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「層間黏結與有效齡期」如何影響碾壓混凝土壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Interlift bond and exposure age” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Roller-compacted-concrete dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "相鄰層的黏結受暴露溫度、時間、表面乾燥與處理影響，不只是日曆時間。等效齡期可比較熱歷程，但接縫強度仍需同材料與同處理試驗。 假設簡化反應速率每升10 K加倍，基準20°C，30°C暴露4 h相當20°C的8 h；僅教學Q10模型，非接縫接受時間。 相同等效齡期下，受雨沖刷或污染的層面仍可能有不同黏結。把化學反應速度直接當作力學強度，會忽略粗糙度、乾燥和界面缺漿的作用。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「層間黏結與有效齡期」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Interlift bond depends on exposure temperature, duration, drying and treatment rather than clock time alone. Equivalent age compares thermal histories, while bond strength still needs tests of the same materials and interface preparation. Assume a simplified reaction rate doubling per ten kelvin above 20°C. Four hours at 30°C equals eight hours at 20°C, a teaching Q10 model rather than an interface acceptance time. At equal equivalent age, washed or contaminated interfaces can still bond differently. Equating reaction speed with mechanical strength ignores roughness, drying and local mortar deficiency at the interface. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Interlift bond and exposure age” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設簡化反應速率每升10 K加倍，基準20°C，30°C暴露4 h相當20°C的8 h；僅教學Q10模型，非接縫接受時間。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume a simplified reaction rate doubling per ten kelvin above 20°C.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「等效齡期相同就能保證不同表面條件的層面黏結相同。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Equal equivalent age guarantees equal bond despite different interface conditions.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「層間黏結與有效齡期」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Interlift bond and exposure age”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b232-v15-21-k1",
         "title": "層間黏結與有效齡期",
         "titleEn": "Interlift bond and exposure age",
         "text": "相鄰層的黏結受暴露溫度、時間、表面乾燥與處理影響，不只是日曆時間。等效齡期可比較熱歷程，但接縫強度仍需同材料與同處理試驗。",
         "textEn": "Interlift bond depends on exposure temperature, duration, drying and treatment rather than clock time alone. Equivalent age compares thermal histories, while bond strength still needs tests of the same materials and interface preparation.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-rcc",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b232-v15-21-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：等效齡期相同就能保證不同表面條件的層面黏結相同。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Equal equivalent age guarantees equal bond despite different interface conditions. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
