         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume a simplified reaction rate doubling per ten kelvin above 20°C. Four hours at 30°C equals eight hours at 20°C, a teaching Q10 model rather than an interface acceptance time.",
