       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「層間黏結與有效齡期」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Interlift bond and exposure age” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "將表面溫度、覆蓋時間和乾燥程度逐區記錄，用同條件層面試件量測黏結；比較表面處理前後結果，並檢查Q10近似是否超出校正溫度範圍。在相同表面處理下分別比較不同溫度歷程。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Record surface temperature, covering time and drying by area and test bond using matched interface specimens. Compare preparation conditions and verify that the Q10 approximation remains within its calibrated temperature range. Compare different temperature histories while holding interface preparation conditions constant. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以層間黏結與有效齡期編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。將表面溫度、覆蓋時間和乾燥程度逐區記錄，用同條件層面試件量測黏結；比較表面處理前後結果，並檢查Q10近似是否超出校正溫度範圍。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for interlift bond and exposure age, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Record surface temperature, covering time and drying by area and test bond using matched interface specimens. Compare preparation conditions and verify that the Q10 approximation remains within its calibrated temperature range.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：相同等效齡期下，受雨沖刷或污染的層面仍可能有不同黏結。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: At equal equivalent age, washed or contaminated interfaces can still bond differently. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
