         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：垂直芯樣滲透率很低就證明水平層面也同樣不透水。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Low vertical-core permeability proves equally low permeability along horizontal lift interfaces. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
