       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for layered permeability anisotropy, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Test specimens parallel and perpendicular to lifts, checking saturation and applied head. Overlay drain locations with interfaces and determine whether fracture flow has exceeded the assumptions of a homogeneous Darcy model.",
