       "objective": "說明「上下游面層協調」如何影響碾壓混凝土壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Facing and RCC compatibility” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Roller-compacted-concrete dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "面層和內部RCC可能具有不同彈性、收縮與溫度歷程，接合區需傳遞相對變形。外表平整不能證明內部相容，尤其在澆置時間錯開時。 假設兩材料自由收縮差150 microstrain、接合長10 m，差異位移1.5 mm；自由變形估算，不含拘束應力與裂縫分配。 面層過早變硬可能拘束後續RCC收縮，缺乏黏結則可能形成漏流路徑。若只要求兩種材料各自強度達標，仍無法證明接合區能共同工作。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「上下游面層協調」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Facing and interior RCC can differ in stiffness, shrinkage and temperature history, requiring their interface to accommodate relative movement. A smooth exterior does not establish compatibility, especially with different placement times. Assume free-shrinkage difference 150 microstrain across bonded length 10 m. Differential movement is 1.5 mm, excluding restraint stress and crack distribution. An early-stiffening facing can restrain later RCC shrinkage, while poor bond creates leakage paths. Separate strength compliance of both materials does not establish that their interface acts compatibly under service conditions. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Facing and RCC compatibility” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設兩材料自由收縮差150 microstrain、接合長10 m，差異位移1.5 mm；自由變形估算，不含拘束應力與裂縫分配。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume free-shrinkage difference 150 microstrain across bonded length 10 m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「面層和內部材料各自強度合格就代表接合區必然可靠。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Separate strength compliance of facing and RCC guarantees a reliable interface.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「上下游面層協調」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Facing and RCC compatibility”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b232-v15-29-k1",
         "title": "上下游面層協調",
         "titleEn": "Facing and RCC compatibility",
         "text": "面層和內部RCC可能具有不同彈性、收縮與溫度歷程，接合區需傳遞相對變形。外表平整不能證明內部相容，尤其在澆置時間錯開時。",
         "textEn": "Facing and interior RCC can differ in stiffness, shrinkage and temperature history, requiring their interface to accommodate relative movement. A smooth exterior does not establish compatibility, especially with different placement times.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-rcc",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b232-v15-29-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：面層和內部材料各自強度合格就代表接合區必然可靠。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Separate strength compliance of facing and RCC guarantees a reliable interface. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-rcc",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "關於「上下游面層協調」，下列哪一項敘述正確？",
        "questionEn": "Which statement about \"Facing and RCC compatibility\" is correct?",
        "options": [
         "面層和內部材料各自強度合格就代表接合區必然可靠。",
         "邊緣弱帶占總體積很小就不可能影響整壩防滲功能。",
         "面層和內部RCC可能具有不同彈性、收縮與溫度歷程，接合區需傳遞相對變形。"
        ],
        "optionsEn": [
         "Separate strength compliance of facing and RCC guarantees a reliable interface.",
