        ],
        "answer": 2,
        "explanation": "面層和內部RCC可能具有不同彈性、收縮與溫度歷程，接合區需傳遞相對變形。 其餘選項是常見誤解。",
        "explanationEn": "Facing and interior RCC can differ in stiffness, shrinkage and temperature history, requiring their interface to accommodate relative movement. The other options are common misconceptions."
       },
       "unit": 8,
       "unitFacet": "mechanism"
