        "answer": 0,
        "explanation": "教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設兩材料自由收縮差150 microstrain、接合長10 m，差異位移1.5 mm；自由變形估算，不含拘束應力與裂縫分配。 重算時請保留單位。",
        "explanationEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume free-shrinkage difference 150 microstrain across bonded length 10 m. Keep units when recalculating."
