       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「上下游面層協調」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Facing and RCC compatibility” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "同步量測面層與內部溫度和應變，核對澆置齡期及養護差異；利用界面取芯和裂縫分布檢查相容性，將自由收縮資料與受拘束現場資料分開比較。將兩側應變轉成相對位移檢查接合相容。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure facing and interior temperature and strain together, checking age and curing differences. Use interface cores and crack patterns to assess compatibility, comparing free-shrinkage specimens separately from restrained field behavior. Convert strains on both sides into relative movement to check interface compatibility. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以上下游面層協調編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。同步量測面層與內部溫度和應變，核對澆置齡期及養護差異；利用界面取芯和裂縫分布檢查相容性，將自由收縮資料與受拘束現場資料分開比較。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for facing and rcc compatibility, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure facing and interior temperature and strain together, checking age and curing differences. Use interface cores and crack patterns to assess compatibility, comparing free-shrinkage specimens separately from restrained field behavior.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：面層過早變硬可能拘束後續RCC收縮，缺乏黏結則可能形成漏流路徑。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: An early-stiffening facing can restrain later RCC shrinkage, while poor bond creates leakage paths. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b232-v15-31-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "同步量測面層與內部溫度和應變，核對澆置齡期及養護差異；利用界面取芯和裂縫分布檢查相容性，將自由收縮資料與受拘束現場資料分開比較。將兩側應變轉成相對位移檢查接合相容。",
         "textEn": "Measure facing and interior temperature and strain together, checking age and curing differences. Use interface cores and crack patterns to assess compatibility, comparing free-shrinkage specimens separately from restrained field behavior. Convert strains on both sides into relative movement to check interface compatibility.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-rcc",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b232-v15-31-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "以上下游面層協調編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。同步量測面層與內部溫度和應變，核對澆置齡期及養護差異；利用界面取芯和裂縫分布檢查相容性，將自由收縮資料與受拘束現場資料分開比較。",
         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for facing and rcc compatibility, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure facing and interior temperature and strain together, checking age and curing differences. Use interface cores and crack patterns to assess compatibility, comparing free-shrinkage specimens separately from restrained field behavior.",
         "sourceIds": [
