       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for edge compaction and restricted zones, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Overlay roller tracks with embedded items to locate uncovered areas and sample density and cores by zone. Verify alternative compaction with trials and check whether weak bands connect across successive lifts.",
