       "objective": "從症狀倒推「邊緣壓實與死角」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Edge compaction and restricted zones” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "體積占比小但若沿上游形成連續通道，可能主導滲流而非平均強度。以隨機中部取樣代表全部工程，會系統性漏掉可達性不足造成的缺陷。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A small-volume band can dominate seepage if continuous near the upstream face. Random sampling confined to central areas systematically misses defects caused by restricted equipment access along the structure. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：以隨機中部取樣代表全部工程，會系統性漏掉可達性不足造成的缺陷。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Random sampling confined to central areas systematically misses defects caused by restricted equipment access along the structure.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「邊緣弱帶占總體積很小就不可能影響整壩防滲功能。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A small-volume weak edge band cannot affect the dams overall seepage performance.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
