       "objective": "說明「強度抽樣與空間變異」如何影響碾壓混凝土壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Strength sampling and spatial variability” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Roller-compacted-concrete dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "試體平均強度描述中心趨勢，離散程度和空間分布決定是否存在局部弱區。相同平均值可能對應完全不同品質穩定性，取樣須與施工批次對應。 假設強度平均20 MPa、標準差3 MPa，變異係數15%；採教學常態近似，第五百分位20−1.645×3=15.065 MPa，非規範設計值。 不同齡期混在一起會製造假離散，選擇性刪除低值又會掩蓋真正弱區。若忽略相鄰樣本相關性，統計信心可能被高估而無法代表整個澆築範圍。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「強度抽樣與空間變異」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Mean specimen strength describes central tendency, while variability and location reveal weak zones. Equal means can hide different consistency, so samples must be linked to placement batches and spatial positions. Assume mean strength 20 MPa and standard deviation 3 MPa, giving coefficient of variation fifteen percent. A teaching normal fifth percentile is 15.065 MPa, not a code design value. Mixing ages creates false variability, while selectively deleting low results hides weak zones. Ignoring correlation between neighboring samples overstates statistical confidence and the extent represented by the testing programme. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Strength sampling and spatial variability” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設強度平均20 MPa、標準差3 MPa，變異係數15%；採教學常態近似，第五百分位20−1.645×3=15.065 MPa，非規範設計值。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume mean strength 20 MPa and standard deviation 3 MPa, giving coefficient of variation fifteen percent.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「平均強度相同就代表兩個施工區具有完全相同品質穩定性。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Equal mean strength means two construction zones have identical quality consistency.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「強度抽樣與空間變異」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Strength sampling and spatial variability”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
