         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume mean strength 20 MPa and standard deviation 3 MPa, giving coefficient of variation fifteen percent. A teaching normal fifth percentile is 15.065 MPa, not a code design value.",
