       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Strength sampling and spatial variability” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "保留每支試體位置、齡期與養護條件，畫批次和空間分布；檢查常態近似與樣本數是否合理，再以現場芯樣挑戰試體代表性，避免只報平均和最大值。核對低強度樣本是否集中於相同材料批次。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Retain specimen location, age and curing and plot batch and spatial distributions. Check sample size and normality, then challenge specimen representativeness with field cores rather than reporting only mean and maximum. Check whether low-strength specimens cluster within the same material batch. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以強度抽樣與空間變異編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。保留每支試體位置、齡期與養護條件，畫批次和空間分布；檢查常態近似與樣本數是否合理，再以現場芯樣挑戰試體代表性，避免只報平均和最大值。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for strength sampling and spatial variability, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Retain specimen location, age and curing and plot batch and spatial distributions. Check sample size and normality, then challenge specimen representativeness with field cores rather than reporting only mean and maximum.",
