         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume uniform radial pressure 0.5 MPa, radius 80 m and thickness 8 m. Thin-arch compressive stress pR/t=5 MPa, for a continuous circular arch without bending.",
         "sourceIds": [
