       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「薄拱膜力初估」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Thin-arch membrane estimate” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "從各高程截面量取曲率與厚度，對照壓力分布和應變方向；將薄拱估算與含懸臂作用模型比較，查最大的偏差位置是否接近岸坡或幾何轉折。分開報告拱冠與拱座附近的彎曲應力。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure curvature and thickness at several elevations and compare pressure and strain directions. Contrast the membrane estimate with a model including cantilever action, locating deviations near abutments or geometric transitions. Report bending stresses near the crown and abutments as separate quantities. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以薄拱膜力初估編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。從各高程截面量取曲率與厚度，對照壓力分布和應變方向；將薄拱估算與含懸臂作用模型比較，查最大的偏差位置是否接近岸坡或幾何轉折。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for thin-arch membrane estimate, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure curvature and thickness at several elevations and compare pressure and strain directions. Contrast the membrane estimate with a model including cantilever action, locating deviations near abutments or geometric transitions.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：薄拱公式不反映接縫張開或基礎變形，局部拉應力可能在平均壓應力下仍出現。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: The thin-arch relation omits joint opening and foundation deformation, allowing local tension despite mean compression. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
