       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Arch and cantilever load sharing” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "核對兩路徑在交點的位移相容及合力平衡，改變壩岩剛度做敏感度；將簡化分擔與三維位移和應變結果比較，避免只追求總反力正確。確認兩路徑分擔總和仍等於原始水壓荷載。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check displacement compatibility and force balance at shared points and vary dam-rock stiffness. Compare simplified sharing with three-dimensional displacement and strain, rather than accepting a correct total reaction alone. Verify that the sum of both load paths still equals applied water loading. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以拱與懸臂分擔編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。核對兩路徑在交點的位移相容及合力平衡，改變壩岩剛度做敏感度；將簡化分擔與三維位移和應變結果比較，避免只追求總反力正確。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for arch and cantilever load sharing, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check displacement compatibility and force balance at shared points and vary dam-rock stiffness. Compare simplified sharing with three-dimensional displacement and strain, rather than accepting a correct total reaction alone.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：一條路徑剛度被高估會把荷載過度導向該路徑，整體平衡仍可能成立。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Overstated stiffness attracts too much load to one path even while global equilibrium holds. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
