        {
         "id": "b233-v15-09-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：岸坡承受的總推力越大就必定越穩定，方向不重要。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Greater total abutment thrust always improves stability regardless of its direction. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
