       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Abutment thrust direction” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設推力20 MN與岩面法向夾角30°，法向17.3205 MN、剪向10 MN；平面向量示例，不代表三維楔體完整力系。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume thrust 20 MN at thirty degrees to the rock-surface normal. Normal component is 17.3205 MN and tangential component 10 MN, a planar illustration rather than a complete wedge force system. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：把節理法向和推力向量放到同一座標系，核對角度是相對法向還是面本身；用測繪和模型反力交叉確認，並保留各高程推力方向變化。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Put joint normals and thrust in a common coordinate system and verify whether angles reference normals or surfaces.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
