       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Abutment thrust direction” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "把節理法向和推力向量放到同一座標系，核對角度是相對法向還是面本身；用測繪和模型反力交叉確認，並保留各高程推力方向變化。以向量點積獨立重算法向與剪向分量。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Put joint normals and thrust in a common coordinate system and verify whether angles reference normals or surfaces. Cross-check mapping and model reactions, retaining changes in thrust direction with elevation. Independently recompute normal and tangential components using vector projections. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以岸坡推力方向編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。把節理法向和推力向量放到同一座標系，核對角度是相對法向還是面本身；用測繪和模型反力交叉確認，並保留各高程推力方向變化。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for abutment thrust direction, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Put joint normals and thrust in a common coordinate system and verify whether angles reference normals or surfaces. Cross-check mapping and model reactions, retaining changes in thrust direction with elevation.",
