       "objective": "說明「楔體滑動抗力」如何影響雙曲拱壩拱座分析的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Wedge sliding resistance” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Abutment analysis for double-curvature arch dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "岸坡不穩定可能沿既有節理滑動，而非岩石材料壓碎。有效正向力、節理摩擦與水壓控制抗力，幾何可動性必須先於數值安全比判讀。 假設單滑面總正力30 MN、水壓合力8 MN、摩擦角35°、驅動剪力10 MN，無黏聚比值(30−8)tan35°/10=1.5405。 即使岩石單軸強度高，光滑充填節理仍可能具有低抗剪。若忽略節理水壓或錯將不連續面當完整岩體，會高估岸坡承載並錯估壩體反力邊界。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「楔體滑動抗力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Abutments can fail by sliding on existing joints rather than crushing intact rock. Effective normal force, joint friction and water pressure govern resistance, after geometric freedom to move has been established. Assume single-plane normal force 30 MN, water resultant 8 MN, friction angle 35 degrees and driving shear 10 MN. Cohesionless resistance ratio is 1.5405. Strong intact rock can contain smooth filled joints with low shear resistance. Omitting joint pressure or treating discontinuities as intact material overstates abutment support and distorts the boundary reactions assigned to the dam. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Wedge sliding resistance” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設單滑面總正力30 MN、水壓合力8 MN、摩擦角35°、驅動剪力10 MN，無黏聚比值(30−8)tan35°/10=1.5405。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume single-plane normal force 30 MN, water resultant 8 MN, friction angle 35 degrees and driving shear 10 MN.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「岩石單軸強度很高就能排除沿節理滑動的岸坡失穩。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"High intact-rock compressive strength rules out abutment failure by joint sliding.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「楔體滑動抗力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
