       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for wedge sliding resistance, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Map continuity and daylighting of the sliding surface and locate pore pressures relative to it. Separate peak and residual friction and check whether wedge movement and crack observations support the assumed mechanism.",
