       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「楔體滑動抗力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Wedge sliding resistance” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "即使岩石單軸強度高，光滑充填節理仍可能具有低抗剪。若忽略節理水壓或錯將不連續面當完整岩體，會高估岸坡承載並錯估壩體反力邊界。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Strong intact rock can contain smooth filled joints with low shear resistance. Omitting joint pressure or treating discontinuities as intact material overstates abutment support and distorts the boundary reactions assigned to the dam. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若忽略節理水壓或錯將不連續面當完整岩體，會高估岸坡承載並錯估壩體反力邊界。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Omitting joint pressure or treating discontinuities as intact material overstates abutment support and distorts the boundary reactions assigned to the dam.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「岩石單軸強度很高就能排除沿節理滑動的岸坡失穩。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"High intact-rock compressive strength rules out abutment failure by joint sliding.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b233-v15-16-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "即使岩石單軸強度高，光滑充填節理仍可能具有低抗剪。若忽略節理水壓或錯將不連續面當完整岩體，會高估岸坡承載並錯估壩體反力邊界。",
         "textEn": "Strong intact rock can contain smooth filled joints with low shear resistance. Omitting joint pressure or treating discontinuities as intact material overstates abutment support and distorts the boundary reactions assigned to the dam.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-arch-2",
          "b-src-water-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals"
