       "objective": "說明「岩體柔度與拱座位移」如何影響雙曲拱壩拱座分析的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Rock compliance and abutment movement” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Abutment analysis for double-curvature arch dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "岸坡會在推力下變形，拱座向外移動可能改變拱壩內力分配。岩體等效模數受節理和尺度影響，不能直接使用完整岩芯模數代替現地反應。 假設簡化壓縮區長20 m、面積400 m²、岩體E=10 GPa、推力40 MN，δ=FL/EA=0.2 mm；均質單軸類比，非岸坡真實三維解。 把基礎截斷面固定得太近會人工增硬，可能得到過小位移和錯誤應力。若只靠調整岩體模數配合壩頂量測，其他邊界錯誤可能被隱藏。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「岩體柔度與拱座位移」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Abutments deform under thrust and outward movement changes arch force distribution. Jointing and scale affect rock-mass modulus, preventing direct substitution of intact-core modulus for field response. Assume compressed zone length 20 m, area 400 m², rock-mass E=10 GPa and force 40 MN. δ=FL/EA=0.2 mm, a uniform uniaxial analogy rather than a real three-dimensional solution. Fixing foundation boundaries too close artificially stiffens the model and produces small displacements with wrong stresses. Adjusting modulus solely to fit crest movement can hide errors in other boundary assumptions. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Rock compliance and abutment movement” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設簡化壓縮區長20 m、面積400 m²、岩體E=10 GPa、推力40 MN，δ=FL/EA=0.2 mm；均質單軸類比，非岸坡真實三維解。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume compressed zone length 20 m, area 400 m², rock-mass E=10 GPa and force 40 MN. δ=FL/EA=0.2 mm, a uniform uniaxial analogy rather than a real three-dimensional solution.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「完整岩芯彈性模數可以無條件等同整個節理岩體模數。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Intact-core elastic modulus can unconditionally represent the entire jointed rock mass.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「岩體柔度與拱座位移」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Rock compliance and abutment movement”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b233-v15-21-k1",
         "title": "岩體柔度與拱座位移",
         "titleEn": "Rock compliance and abutment movement",
         "text": "岸坡會在推力下變形，拱座向外移動可能改變拱壩內力分配。岩體等效模數受節理和尺度影響，不能直接使用完整岩芯模數代替現地反應。",
         "textEn": "Abutments deform under thrust and outward movement changes arch force distribution. Jointing and scale affect rock-mass modulus, preventing direct substitution of intact-core modulus for field response.",
