         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume compressed zone length 20 m, area 400 m², rock-mass E=10 GPa and force 40 MN. δ=FL/EA=0.2 mm, a uniform uniaxial analogy rather than a real three-dimensional solution.",
