       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「岩體柔度與拱座位移」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Rock compliance and abutment movement” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "比較現地變形試驗、節理調查與監測位移，建立模數範圍而非單值；改變基礎模型邊界距離和剛度，檢查壩體內力及拱座反力是否穩定。將完整岩芯與岩體模數的來源分開標示。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare field deformation tests, joint mapping and monitored movements to establish a modulus range. Vary foundation boundary distance and stiffness and check stability of dam forces and abutment reactions. Identify intact-core and rock-mass modulus evidence as separate information sources. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以岩體柔度與拱座位移編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。比較現地變形試驗、節理調查與監測位移，建立模數範圍而非單值；改變基礎模型邊界距離和剛度，檢查壩體內力及拱座反力是否穩定。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for rock compliance and abutment movement, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare field deformation tests, joint mapping and monitored movements to establish a modulus range. Vary foundation boundary distance and stiffness and check stability of dam forces and abutment reactions.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把基礎截斷面固定得太近會人工增硬，可能得到過小位移和錯誤應力。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Fixing foundation boundaries too close artificially stiffens the model and produces small displacements with wrong stresses. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b233-v15-23-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "比較現地變形試驗、節理調查與監測位移，建立模數範圍而非單值；改變基礎模型邊界距離和剛度，檢查壩體內力及拱座反力是否穩定。將完整岩芯與岩體模數的來源分開標示。",
         "textEn": "Compare field deformation tests, joint mapping and monitored movements to establish a modulus range. Vary foundation boundary distance and stiffness and check stability of dam forces and abutment reactions. Identify intact-core and rock-mass modulus evidence as separate information sources.",
