         "text": "以岩體柔度與拱座位移編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。比較現地變形試驗、節理調查與監測位移，建立模數範圍而非單值；改變基礎模型邊界距離和剛度，檢查壩體內力及拱座反力是否穩定。",
         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for rock compliance and abutment movement, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare field deformation tests, joint mapping and monitored movements to establish a modulus range. Vary foundation boundary distance and stiffness and check stability of dam forces and abutment reactions.",
