       "objective": "說明「封拱溫度與接縫閉合」如何影響雙曲拱壩拱座分析的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Closure temperature and joint closure” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Abutment analysis for double-curvature arch dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "拱壩接縫灌漿後形成不同於分離懸臂的整體作用，封拱溫度決定後續升溫壓縮和降溫張開傾向。溫度是結構初始狀態的一部分。 假設有效拱長200 m、α=10⁻⁵/K、相對封拱溫度下降8 K，自由縮短16 mm；真實拘束會轉成接縫位移和應力，非直接開縫總量。 把所有壩段視為同時同溫度閉合會忽略施工分期，局部灌漿不完整也可能保留柔弱面。若模型沒有記錄封拱狀態，溫度應力的符號可能被錯判。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「封拱溫度與接縫閉合」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Joint grouting creates an integrated arch distinct from separate cantilevers. Closure temperature establishes later warming compression and cooling-opening tendencies, making temperature part of the structural initial state. Assume effective arch length 200 m, α=10⁻⁵/K and cooling eight kelvin below closure temperature. Free shortening is 16 mm; actual restraint converts it into movement and stress rather than this exact total opening. Assuming simultaneous equal-temperature closure misses construction staging, and incomplete grouting leaves compliant interfaces. Without the closure state, even the sign of inferred thermal stress can be misinterpreted. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Closure temperature and joint closure” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設有效拱長200 m、α=10⁻⁵/K、相對封拱溫度下降8 K，自由縮短16 mm；真實拘束會轉成接縫位移和應力，非直接開縫總量。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume effective arch length 200 m, α=10⁻⁵/K and cooling eight kelvin below closure temperature.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「接縫灌漿溫度只影響施工方便，不影響後續拱壩受力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
