       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「封拱溫度與接縫閉合」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Closure temperature and joint closure” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "核對灌漿時的多點溫度而非單一氣溫，將接縫計零點與施工日期連結；比較後續同庫位不同溫度的變形，確認模型初始狀態可重現觀測。對各灌漿區塊保留自己的封拱溫度紀錄。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check multi-point grouting temperatures rather than ambient air alone and link joint-meter zeros to construction dates. Compare deformation at equal reservoir level but different temperature to test the initial-state model. Retain a separate closure-temperature record for every grouted block group. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以封拱溫度與接縫閉合編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。核對灌漿時的多點溫度而非單一氣溫，將接縫計零點與施工日期連結；比較後續同庫位不同溫度的變形，確認模型初始狀態可重現觀測。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for closure temperature and joint closure, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check multi-point grouting temperatures rather than ambient air alone and link joint-meter zeros to construction dates. Compare deformation at equal reservoir level but different temperature to test the initial-state model.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把所有壩段視為同時同溫度閉合會忽略施工分期，局部灌漿不完整也可能保留柔弱面。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Assuming simultaneous equal-temperature closure misses construction staging, and incomplete grouting leaves compliant interfaces. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b233-v15-27-k1",
