         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for closure temperature and joint closure, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check multi-point grouting temperatures rather than ambient air alone and link joint-meter zeros to construction dates. Compare deformation at equal reservoir level but different temperature to test the initial-state model.",
