       "objective": "從症狀倒推「封拱溫度與接縫閉合」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Closure temperature and joint closure” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把所有壩段視為同時同溫度閉合會忽略施工分期，局部灌漿不完整也可能保留柔弱面。若模型沒有記錄封拱狀態，溫度應力的符號可能被錯判。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Assuming simultaneous equal-temperature closure misses construction staging, and incomplete grouting leaves compliant interfaces. Without the closure state, even the sign of inferred thermal stress can be misinterpreted. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若模型沒有記錄封拱狀態，溫度應力的符號可能被錯判。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Without the closure state, even the sign of inferred thermal stress can be misinterpreted.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「接縫灌漿溫度只影響施工方便，不影響後續拱壩受力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Joint-grouting temperature affects convenience only and not later arch-dam structural behavior.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
