      {
       "id": "b233-v15-29",
       "title": "網格收斂與局部奇異：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Mesh convergence and singularity: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usace-arch-2",
        "b-src-water-manuals",
        "v15s-usace-gravity",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b233-v15-28"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「網格收斂與局部奇異」如何影響雙曲拱壩拱座分析的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Mesh convergence and singularity” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Abutment analysis for double-curvature arch dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "三維分析須區分真正的應力集中和幾何尖角造成的數值奇異。網格愈細不一定讓尖角最大應力收斂，應同時檢查位移、能量與有限區域平均。 假設兩次細化壩頂位移由12.0降至11.7 mm，相對差0.3/11.7=2.564%；此差只衡量該位移，不能保證局部應力已收斂。 只報最細網格最大應力可能讓數值奇異冒充材料失效，反之只看位移收斂也會漏掉接觸邊緣問題。收斂是特定輸出量的性質，不能概括全部結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「網格收斂與局部奇異」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Three-dimensional analysis must distinguish physical concentration from numerical singularities at sharp corners. Finer meshes may not converge the point maximum, requiring displacement, energy and finite-area averages to be checked together. Assume refined crest displacement changes from 12.0 to 11.7 mm. Relative difference is 2.564 percent, describing this displacement only rather than proving local stress convergence. Reporting only the finest-mesh maximum can mistake a singularity for material failure, while displacement convergence can miss contact-edge issues. Convergence applies to a specific output and cannot certify every model result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Mesh convergence and singularity” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設兩次細化壩頂位移由12.0降至11.7 mm，相對差0.3/11.7=2.564%；此差只衡量該位移，不能保證局部應力已收斂。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume refined crest displacement changes from 12.0 to 11.7 mm.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「壩頂位移收斂就能證明所有局部最大應力都已收斂。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Converged crest displacement proves convergence of every local maximum stress.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「網格收斂與局部奇異」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Mesh convergence and singularity”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b233-v15-29-k1",
         "title": "網格收斂與局部奇異",
         "titleEn": "Mesh convergence and singularity",
         "text": "三維分析須區分真正的應力集中和幾何尖角造成的數值奇異。網格愈細不一定讓尖角最大應力收斂，應同時檢查位移、能量與有限區域平均。",
         "textEn": "Three-dimensional analysis must distinguish physical concentration from numerical singularities at sharp corners. Finer meshes may not converge the point maximum, requiring displacement, energy and finite-area averages to be checked together.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-arch-2",
          "b-src-water-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b233-v15-29-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：壩頂位移收斂就能證明所有局部最大應力都已收斂。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Converged crest displacement proves convergence of every local maximum stress. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-arch-2",
          "b-src-water-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "關於「網格收斂與局部奇異」，下列哪一項敘述正確？",
        "questionEn": "Which statement about \"Mesh convergence and singularity\" is correct?",
        "options": [
         "壩頂位移收斂就能證明所有局部最大應力都已收斂。",
         "把峰值地面加速度乘壩重就能完整代表三維地震反應。",
         "三維分析須區分真正的應力集中和幾何尖角造成的數值奇異。"
