       ],
       "objective": "以數值模型估算「網格收斂與局部奇異」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。",
       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Mesh convergence and singularity” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設兩次細化壩頂位移由12.0降至11.7 mm，相對差0.3/11.7=2.564%；此差只衡量該位移，不能保證局部應力已收斂。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume refined crest displacement changes from 12.0 to 11.7 mm. Relative difference is 2.564 percent, describing this displacement only rather than proving local stress convergence. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：保持材料與荷載不變細化網格，分別追蹤位移、反力和局部平均應力；檢查尖角最大值是否隨單元尺寸無界增加，並以合理幾何圓角測試模型敏感性。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Refine meshes with unchanged materials and loads, tracking displacement, reactions and local average stress separately.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
       "checkEn": "Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b233-v15-30-k1",
         "title": "定量模型",
         "titleEn": "Quantitative model",
         "text": "教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設兩次細化壩頂位移由12.0降至11.7 mm，相對差0.3/11.7=2.564%；此差只衡量該位移，不能保證局部應力已收斂。",
         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume refined crest displacement changes from 12.0 to 11.7 mm. Relative difference is 2.564 percent, describing this displacement only rather than proving local stress convergence.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-arch-2",
          "b-src-water-manuals",
