       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for mesh convergence and singularity, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Refine meshes with unchanged materials and loads, tracking displacement, reactions and local average stress separately. Check whether corner maxima grow without bound and test sensitivity to physically reasonable geometric rounding.",
