       "objective": "說明「地震慣性與附加水質量」如何影響雙曲拱壩拱座分析的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Seismic inertia and added water mass” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Abutment analysis for double-curvature arch dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "地震作用同時包含壩體、基礎和庫水的動力互制，靜力慣性項只提供量級。附加水質量隨頻率與邊界改變，不能任意當成固定壩重增加。 取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。假設等效振動質量5 million kg、水平加速度0.1g，慣性力ma=4.905 MN；僅單模態量級，不含動力放大或真實庫水附加質量。 把峰值地面加速度直接乘全部壩重不能代表每點同相加速，基礎柔度與輻射阻尼也會改變反應。忽略水庫耦合可能錯估頻率和壩頂放大。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「地震慣性與附加水質量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Earthquake response involves dam, foundation and reservoir interaction. A static inertia term gives only a scale, while hydrodynamic added mass depends on frequency and boundaries rather than an arbitrary fixed weight increase. Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s². Assume equivalent vibrating mass 5 million kg and horizontal acceleration 0.1g. Inertia ma=4.905 MN, a single-mode scale without dynamic amplification or actual reservoir added mass. Peak ground acceleration times total weight does not mean every point accelerates in phase. Foundation compliance, radiation damping and reservoir coupling can change frequencies and crest amplification substantially. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Seismic inertia and added water mass” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s².",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「把峰值地面加速度乘壩重就能完整代表三維地震反應。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Peak ground acceleration times dam weight completely represents three-dimensional earthquake response.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「地震慣性與附加水質量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
