         "text": "教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。假設等效振動質量5 million kg、水平加速度0.1g，慣性力ma=4.905 MN；僅單模態量級，不含動力放大或真實庫水附加質量。",
         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s². Assume equivalent vibrating mass 5 million kg and horizontal acceleration 0.1g. Inertia ma=4.905 MN, a single-mode scale without dynamic amplification or actual reservoir added mass.",
         "sourceIds": [
