       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Seismic inertia and added water mass” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以觀測或辨識的模態檢查頻率與阻尼，核對輸入地震在基礎和自由場的定義；比較含水與無水模型的反應，保留頻率相關邊界而非只調總質量。以能量平衡檢查附加水質量模型的合理性。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check identified frequencies and damping and distinguish foundation input from free-field motion. Compare models with and without water, retaining frequency-dependent boundaries rather than adjusting total mass alone. Use an energy balance to check the plausibility of added-water-mass modeling. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
