       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for seismic inertia and added water mass, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check identified frequencies and damping and distinguish foundation input from free-field motion. Compare models with and without water, retaining frequency-dependent boundaries rather than adjusting total mass alone.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把峰值地面加速度直接乘全部壩重不能代表每點同相加速，基礎柔度與輻射阻尼也會改變反應。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Peak ground acceleration times total weight does not mean every point accelerates in phase. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
