       "objective": "從症狀倒推「地震慣性與附加水質量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Seismic inertia and added water mass” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把峰值地面加速度直接乘全部壩重不能代表每點同相加速，基礎柔度與輻射阻尼也會改變反應。忽略水庫耦合可能錯估頻率和壩頂放大。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Peak ground acceleration times total weight does not mean every point accelerates in phase. Foundation compliance, radiation damping and reservoir coupling can change frequencies and crest amplification substantially. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：忽略水庫耦合可能錯估頻率和壩頂放大。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Foundation compliance, radiation damping and reservoir coupling can change frequencies and crest amplification substantially.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「把峰值地面加速度乘壩重就能完整代表三維地震反應。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Peak ground acceleration times dam weight completely represents three-dimensional earthquake response.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
