         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：只要重新擬合後殘差變小，就證明原先結構異常已消失。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: A smaller residual after refitting proves the original structural anomaly has disappeared. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-arch-2",
          "b-src-water-manuals",
