       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Hydrothermal effects and monitoring residuals” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "高度相關的水位與溫度會讓係數難以識別，模型也可能把長期損傷吸收為時間趨勢。重新訓練前若未檢查原因，異常可能被數學上消除卻仍存在。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Correlated level and temperature make coefficients difficult to identify, and a time trend can absorb deterioration. Retraining without investigating causes may mathematically erase an anomaly while its physical source remains. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
