       "prerequisiteIds": [],
       "objective": "說明「堆石孔隙與密實」如何影響混凝土面板堆石壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Rockfill voids and density” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Concrete-face rockfill dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "堆石透過顆粒重排和局部破碎變密，現場乾密度反映總孔隙但不直接給出壓縮模數。顆粒尺寸遠大於一般試體時，尺寸效應必須獨立處理。 假設顆粒密度2700 kg/m³、乾密度2100 kg/m³，孔隙率n=1−ρd/ρs=0.2222；忽略顆粒內孔隙和含水修正誤差。 孔隙率相同的不同岩性可能有不同破碎和濕化壓縮，密度高也不必然代表長期變形小。若把料場小樣性質直接外推大粒徑填築，會漏掉尺度差異。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「堆石孔隙與密實」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Rockfill densifies by particle rearrangement and breakage. Dry density indicates bulk voids but does not directly give compressibility, and particles larger than normal specimens require separate treatment of scale effects. Assume particle density 2700 kg/m³ and dry density 2100 kg/m³. Porosity n=1−ρd/ρs=0.2222, excluding intraparticle pores and moisture-correction error. Different rock types at equal porosity can have different breakage and wetting compression. High density need not imply small long-term movement, and small quarry samples can miss full-scale particle effects. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Rockfill voids and density” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設顆粒密度2700 kg/m³、乾密度2100 kg/m³，孔隙率n=1−ρd/ρs=0.2222；忽略顆粒內孔隙和含水修正誤差。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume particle density 2700 kg/m³ and dry density 2100 kg/m³.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「堆石孔隙率相同就代表其壓縮模數和濕化變形完全相同。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Equal rockfill porosity means identical stiffness and wetting deformation.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「堆石孔隙與密實」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Rockfill voids and density”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b234-v15-01-k1",
         "title": "堆石孔隙與密實",
         "titleEn": "Rockfill voids and density",
         "text": "堆石透過顆粒重排和局部破碎變密，現場乾密度反映總孔隙但不直接給出壓縮模數。顆粒尺寸遠大於一般試體時，尺寸效應必須獨立處理。",
         "textEn": "Rockfill densifies by particle rearrangement and breakage. Dry density indicates bulk voids but does not directly give compressibility, and particles larger than normal specimens require separate treatment of scale effects.",
         "sourceIds": [
