         "text": "誤解：堆石孔隙率相同就代表其壓縮模數和濕化變形完全相同。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Equal rockfill porosity means identical stiffness and wetting deformation. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
