      {
       "id": "b234-v15-03",
       "title": "堆石孔隙與密實：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Rockfill voids and density: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usbr-embankment",
        "v15s-usbr-construction",
        "v15s-usbr-filters",
        "v15s-usace-gravity",
        "b-src-water"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b234-v15-02"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「堆石孔隙與密實」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Rockfill voids and density” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "在代表性試填區量測鋪層前後體積與乾質量，核對大粒徑取樣方法；將密度、沉降與級配破碎變化一起比較，確認結果不是細料流失造成的假密實。比較濕化前後的壓縮試驗以檢查密度代表性。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure trial-fill volume and dry mass before and after compaction and check large-particle sampling. Compare density, settlement and grading changes to ensure apparent densification is not an artifact of losing fines. Compare compression before and after wetting to test density representativeness. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以堆石孔隙與密實編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。在代表性試填區量測鋪層前後體積與乾質量，核對大粒徑取樣方法；將密度、沉降與級配破碎變化一起比較，確認結果不是細料流失造成的假密實。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for rockfill voids and density, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure trial-fill volume and dry mass before and after compaction and check large-particle sampling. Compare density, settlement and grading changes to ensure apparent densification is not an artifact of losing fines.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：孔隙率相同的不同岩性可能有不同破碎和濕化壓縮，密度高也不必然代表長期變形小。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Different rock types at equal porosity can have different breakage and wetting compression. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
