        {
         "id": "b234-v15-05-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：壩頂沉降量很小就能排除任何局部填築層的大變形。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Small crest settlement rules out large deformation in every individual fill layer. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
