         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume face thickness 0.4 m, curvature 0.001 m⁻¹ and centered neutral axis under linear bending. Surface strain κt/2=200 microstrain, excluding membrane strain.",
