       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for face curvature and tensile strain, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Estimate curvature from neighboring survey points and test sensitivity to spacing and differentiation noise. Compare opposite-face strains and crack direction, distinguishing rigid movement from local bending in the interpretation.",
