       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Perimeter-joint movement components” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "法向張開與剪向錯動對銅片或橡膠止水的影響不同，反覆循環也會累積疲勞。若只記錄合位移，可能把危險張開誤當較可容受的滑移。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Opening and shear act differently on metal or elastomeric waterstops, and cycles accumulate damage. Recording only a resultant can disguise critical opening as a more tolerable sliding movement. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
