    {
     "id": "b234-v15-s3",
     "title": "施工方法與施工階段控制",
     "titleEn": "Construction methods and stage control",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「趾板基礎接觸」與「墊層反濾相容」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Plinth foundation contact\" and \"Cushion-filter compatibility\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b234-v15-17",
       "title": "趾板基礎接觸：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Plinth foundation contact: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usbr-embankment",
        "v15s-usbr-construction",
        "v15s-usbr-filters",
        "v15s-usace-gravity",
        "b-src-water"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b234-v15-16"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「趾板基礎接觸」如何影響混凝土面板堆石壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Plinth foundation contact” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Concrete-face rockfill dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "趾板把面板防滲系統接到基岩，接觸連續性與基礎水壓共同影響功能。它不是只靠混凝土重量阻水，岩面弱帶和接縫繞流也必須追蹤。 假設趾板接觸面積60 m²、總正力12 MN、上浮3 MN，有效平均壓力(12−3)/60=0.15 MPa；均勻接觸且不含彎矩。 局部岩面凸起會造成接觸集中，弱帶沖蝕則可能形成繞流。若只用總重量除面積判斷完整接觸，會低估上浮和面板傳來偏心力的影響。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「趾板基礎接觸」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "The plinth connects the face sealing system to bedrock, with contact continuity and foundation pressure controlling performance. Concrete weight alone does not block seepage through weak seams or bypass joints. Assume plinth contact area 60 m², normal force 12 MN and uplift 3 MN. Mean effective pressure is 0.15 MPa, for uniform contact without moment. Rock high points concentrate contact while weak-seam erosion creates bypass flow. Dividing gross weight by area can understate uplift and eccentric actions transferred from the facing, giving a false impression of continuous contact. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Plinth foundation contact” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設趾板接觸面積60 m²、總正力12 MN、上浮3 MN，有效平均壓力(12−3)/60=0.15 MPa；均勻接觸且不含彎矩。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume plinth contact area 60 m², normal force 12 MN and uplift 3 MN.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「趾板混凝土足夠重就能自動封閉所有岩面裂隙。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A sufficiently heavy concrete plinth automatically seals every bedrock fracture.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「趾板基礎接觸」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Plinth foundation contact”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b234-v15-17-k1",
         "title": "趾板基礎接觸",
         "titleEn": "Plinth foundation contact",
         "text": "趾板把面板防滲系統接到基岩，接觸連續性與基礎水壓共同影響功能。它不是只靠混凝土重量阻水，岩面弱帶和接縫繞流也必須追蹤。",
         "textEn": "The plinth connects the face sealing system to bedrock, with contact continuity and foundation pressure controlling performance. Concrete weight alone does not block seepage through weak seams or bypass joints.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usbr-embankment",
          "v15s-usbr-construction",
          "v15s-usbr-filters",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "b-src-water"
