        },
        {
         "id": "b234-v15-17-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：趾板混凝土足夠重就能自動封閉所有岩面裂隙。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: A sufficiently heavy concrete plinth automatically seals every bedrock fracture. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
