         "text": "查驗岩面清理、地質素描和接觸取芯資料，將孔壓測點對應到弱帶；比較接縫位移與分區滲流，確認平均接觸假設沒有掩蓋局部脫開。將趾板合力位置與實際接觸區域互相核對。",
         "textEn": "Review cleaned-rock mapping and contact cores and relate pressure points to weak seams. Compare joint movement with zoned seepage to ensure a mean-contact assumption is not concealing local separation along the plinth. Cross-check the plinth resultant location against the actually contacting region.",
