       "objective": "從症狀倒推「趾板基礎接觸」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Plinth foundation contact” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "局部岩面凸起會造成接觸集中，弱帶沖蝕則可能形成繞流。若只用總重量除面積判斷完整接觸，會低估上浮和面板傳來偏心力的影響。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Rock high points concentrate contact while weak-seam erosion creates bypass flow. Dividing gross weight by area can understate uplift and eccentric actions transferred from the facing, giving a false impression of continuous contact. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若只用總重量除面積判斷完整接觸，會低估上浮和面板傳來偏心力的影響。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Dividing gross weight by area can understate uplift and eccentric actions transferred from the facing, giving a false impression of continuous contact.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「趾板混凝土足夠重就能自動封閉所有岩面裂隙。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A sufficiently heavy concrete plinth automatically seals every bedrock fracture.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
