       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Cushion-filter compatibility” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Concrete-face rockfill dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "面板墊層既提供平整支承，也需防止細料向粗堆石遷移。支承剛度和反濾能力是不同要求，級配必須與相鄰材料及施工離析一起檢查。 假設基料d85=0.8 mm、相鄰反濾料D15=2.4 mm，比值3；只是粒徑保持篩選，不取代土類適用性與滲流試驗。 墊層缺口可能同時造成漏流和面板脫空，局部細料流失未必立刻反映在總漏水量。只確認粒徑比合格，仍不能排除施工接頭或厚度不足。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「墊層反濾相容」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "The face cushion supplies even support and prevents fines migrating into coarse rockfill. Support stiffness and filtration are separate requirements, so grading must be checked with adjacent materials and placement segregation. Assume base d85=0.8 mm and adjacent filter D15=2.4 mm, giving ratio three. This screens retention geometry without replacing soil-specific applicability or seepage tests. A cushion gap can create leakage and support loss together, while local fines migration may not immediately change total leakage. Passing one grading ratio does not exclude construction discontinuities or insufficient layer thickness. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Cushion-filter compatibility” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
