       "instructionEn": "Sample placed material beneath the face and compare stockpile grading and fines. Use directionally relevant seepage tests to observe migration and check whether segregation or erosion reduces support uniformity. Inspect whether layer junctions create local discontinuities in the face cushion. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
