       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for cushion-filter compatibility, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Sample placed material beneath the face and compare stockpile grading and fines. Use directionally relevant seepage tests to observe migration and check whether segregation or erosion reduces support uniformity.",
