       "objective": "說明「分期蓄水與濕化沉降」如何影響混凝土面板堆石壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Staged filling and wetting settlement” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Concrete-face rockfill dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "蓄水會讓堆石受水壓並發生濕化變形，沉降速率可能落後水位。分期觀測的目的在辨認反應，不是用固定等待天數保證所有材料已穩定。 假設教學一階沉降S(t)=S∞(1−e^(−t/τ))，S∞=0.1 m、τ=10 days，20 days達86.47 mm；僅擬合模型，非真實材料定律。 材料破碎和應力重分配可能使長期趨勢偏離指數衰減，水位繼續變化也破壞單步載入假設。若把擬合漸近值當實際最終值，可能低估後續接縫位移。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「分期蓄水與濕化沉降」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Impoundment adds water loading and wetting deformation, with settlement potentially lagging stage. Staged observation identifies response rather than guaranteeing stabilization after a universal waiting duration. Assume teaching settlement S(t)=S∞(1−e^(−t/τ)), S∞=0.1 m and τ=10 days. At twenty days S=86.47 mm, a fitted model rather than a material law. Particle breakage and redistribution can depart from exponential decay, while changing water level violates a single-step load. Treating a fitted asymptote as a final value can understate later joint displacement. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Staged filling and wetting settlement” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設教學一階沉降S(t)=S∞(1−e^(−t/τ))，S∞=0.1 m、τ=10 days，20 days達86.47 mm；僅擬合模型，非真實材料定律。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume teaching settlement S(t)=S∞(1−e^(−t/τ)), S∞=0.1 m and τ=10 days.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「教學沉降曲線擬合良好就能保證最終沉降不再增加。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A good fit to the teaching settlement curve guarantees no further ultimate settlement.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
