      {
       "id": "b234-v15-31",
       "title": "分期蓄水與濕化沉降：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Staged filling and wetting settlement: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usbr-embankment",
        "v15s-usbr-construction",
        "v15s-usbr-filters",
        "v15s-usace-gravity",
        "b-src-water"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b234-v15-30"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「分期蓄水與濕化沉降」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Staged filling and wetting settlement” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "將水位階段、分層沉降和面板接縫同步作圖，檢查每次階段是否有不同時間常數；用後續資料驗證預測區間，不能只以早期擬合度宣稱趨勢可靠。保留每階段預測與後續實測的差異紀錄。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Plot reservoir stages, layer settlement and face joints together and check whether each stage has a different time constant. Validate prediction intervals on later data rather than relying only on an early fit. Retain a record of each stage prediction and subsequent measured discrepancy. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以分期蓄水與濕化沉降編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。將水位階段、分層沉降和面板接縫同步作圖，檢查每次階段是否有不同時間常數；用後續資料驗證預測區間，不能只以早期擬合度宣稱趨勢可靠。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for staged filling and wetting settlement, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Plot reservoir stages, layer settlement and face joints together and check whether each stage has a different time constant. Validate prediction intervals on later data rather than relying only on an early fit.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：材料破碎和應力重分配可能使長期趨勢偏離指數衰減，水位繼續變化也破壞單步載入假設。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Particle breakage and redistribution can depart from exponential decay, while changing water level violates a single-step load. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b234-v15-31-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
