         "text": "分區校核量水設施並保存雨量和庫位時序，以溫度或電導差辨認來源；將接縫開度事件與漏流延遲對照，再檢查水量閉合殘差是否超過量測不確定度。將清通排水管的時間與流量跳變逐項對照。",
         "textEn": "Calibrate sectional flow measurements and retain rain and level histories, using temperature or conductivity to distinguish sources. Compare joint events with leakage lag and test closure residuals against measurement uncertainty. Compare drain-clearing times individually against observed jumps in measured flow.",
