         "id": "b234-v15-37-k1",
         "title": "長期蠕變與變形預留",
         "titleEn": "Long-term creep and movement allowance",
         "text": "堆石長期變形受到應力、含水與顆粒破碎影響，常用對數時間關係只是經驗描述。短期壓實完成不表示服役期變形停止，接縫預留需檢查情境。",
         "textEn": "Long-term rockfill deformation depends on stress, moisture and breakage. Log-time relations are empirical descriptions; completed compaction does not end service movement, so joint allowance must be checked across scenarios.",
