         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume empirical increment ΔS=C ln(t2/t1), C=5 mm, t1=1 year and t2=10 years. Increment is 11.513 mm, a stable-stress fit not extrapolated to failure.",
