   "workedExample": {
    "title": "原創假想算例與邊界",
    "titleEn": "Original hypothetical example and boundaries",
    "text": "本課原創比較練習分兩個相互獨立的物理模型。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設心牆k=10⁻⁹ m/s、平均水力坡降5、通流面積1000 m²，達西Q=kiA=5×10⁻⁶ m³/s=0.005 L/s；均質無裂縫。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設乾土1000 t、初始含水率12%、目標16%，需加水(0.16−0.12)×1000=40 t；未含蒸發和混合損失，不是工地配方。先逐一圈出公式內的控制體、力方向或時間尺度，再把每項輸入的量綱換成一致單位。第二人只根據輸入重算結果，不抄第一人的中間數字。最後指出這兩個估算尚未包含的空間變化、非線性及量測誤差；若將結果用於另一座工程，必須重建其幾何、材料與邊界條件，不能挪用本練習的假設。 達西敏感度固定平均水力坡降5與通流面積1000 m²，只將k由10⁻⁹增至2×10⁻⁹ m/s。Q=kiA由5×10⁻⁶增至10⁻⁵ m³/s，即0.005增至0.010 L/s，恰為兩倍。這要求同一均質、無裂縫材料內仍可用線性達西流；若提高流量是裂縫或繞流造成，就不能只用調整均質k來解釋。",
    "textEn": "This original comparison exercise uses two independent physical models. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume core k=10⁻⁹ m/s, gradient five and flow area 1000 m². Darcy Q=5×10⁻⁶ m³/s=0.005 L/s, for homogeneous uncracked material. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume dry soil 1000 t, initial water content twelve percent and target sixteen percent. Added water is forty tonnes, excluding evaporation and mixing losses and not a field recipe. First identify the control volume, force direction or time scale in each relation, then convert every input to consistent units. A second reviewer recalculates from the inputs without copying intermediate numbers. Finally identify spatial variability, nonlinear effects and measurement errors omitted by both estimates. Transfer to another structure requires rebuilding its geometry, material description and boundary conditions; the assumed classroom inputs are not transferable design or operating parameters. For Darcy sensitivity, hold gradient five and flow area 1000 m² fixed, changing only k from 10⁻⁹ to 2×10⁻⁹ m/s. Q=kiA doubles from 5×10⁻⁶ to 10⁻⁵ m³/s, or 0.005 to 0.010 L/s. This assumes linear Darcy flow in the same homogeneous uncracked medium; increased flow from cracking or bypass cannot be explained solely by adjusting homogeneous k.",
    "assumptions": "數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。",
    "assumptionsEn": "Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.",
    "sourceScope": "原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。",
    "sourceScopeEn": "Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."
   },
   "dossier": {
    "facts": [
     "教學均質完整心牆達西流量0.005 L/s。",
     "教學乾土1000 t調整含水需加水40 t。",
     "教學孔隙比0.5、含水率0.15得到飽和度0.81。",
     "教學局部應力折減後水壓差為−20 kPa，僅篩選。",
     "教學排水帶達西能力1 L/s，未含出口損失。",
