       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「分區滲透功能」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Hydraulic functions of zones” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "將心牆、反濾和排水的粒徑與滲透資料分區保存，核對模型控制體；比較孔壓等值線和排水量，並用裂縫情境檢查完整土體達西估算會漏掉哪些流路。分別列出完整心牆流與缺陷集中流的證據。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Keep core, filter and drain grading and permeability separately and verify model control volumes. Compare pressure contours and discharge, using crack scenarios to identify paths omitted by the intact-soil Darcy estimate. List intact-core flow evidence separately from concentrated flow through defects. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以分區滲透功能編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。將心牆、反濾和排水的粒徑與滲透資料分區保存，核對模型控制體；比較孔壓等值線和排水量，並用裂縫情境檢查完整土體達西估算會漏掉哪些流路。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for hydraulic functions of zones, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Keep core, filter and drain grading and permeability separately and verify model control volumes. Compare pressure contours and discharge, using crack scenarios to identify paths omitted by the intact-soil Darcy estimate.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：小範圍裂縫可能主導總流量，即使心牆材料滲透率很低。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A small crack can dominate flow despite low intact-core permeability. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b235-v15-03-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
