       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「含水調整與乾土質量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Moisture adjustment on dry mass” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "先由烘乾試驗核對乾土質量，再對不同深度取樣檢查混合均勻；將加水計量與天候損失閉合，並比較壓實後孔壓、強度和滲透試驗而非只有含水平均。在壓實層底重新取樣檢查上濕下乾現象。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Verify dry mass by drying tests and sample several depths for mixing uniformity. Close added water against weather losses and compare post-compaction pore pressure, strength and permeability rather than mean moisture alone. Resample the compacted lift bottom to check for a wet-top dry-bottom profile. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以含水調整與乾土質量編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。先由烘乾試驗核對乾土質量，再對不同深度取樣檢查混合均勻；將加水計量與天候損失閉合，並比較壓實後孔壓、強度和滲透試驗而非只有含水平均。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for moisture adjustment on dry mass, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Verify dry mass by drying tests and sample several depths for mixing uniformity. Close added water against weather losses and compare post-compaction pore pressure, strength and permeability rather than mean moisture alone.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：表面灑水可能使上濕下乾，平均含水正確仍有弱層；誤用濕土重量會算錯補水量。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Surface wetting can leave wet tops and dry bottoms despite a correct mean. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
