         "text": "以含水調整與乾土質量編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。先由烘乾試驗核對乾土質量，再對不同深度取樣檢查混合均勻；將加水計量與天候損失閉合，並比較壓實後孔壓、強度和滲透試驗而非只有含水平均。",
         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for moisture adjustment on dry mass, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Verify dry mass by drying tests and sample several depths for mixing uniformity. Close added water against weather losses and compare post-compaction pore pressure, strength and permeability rather than mean moisture alone.",
