       "failure": "常見誤解：「乾密度達標就能直接證明土體已完全飽和且沒有大孔隙。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Acceptable dry density directly proves full saturation and absence of large voids.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
