       "instruction": "同批樣品核對比重、乾密度和含水量，檢查計算飽和度是否介於零與一；若不合理，回查單位、粗粒修正和取樣體積，再評估不同位置的變異。以體積和質量閉合檢查取樣體積是否失真。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check specific gravity, dry density and moisture on matched samples and ensure computed saturation lies between zero and one. Investigate units, coarse-particle corrections and sample volume before interpreting spatial variation. Use volume-mass closure to check whether the sampling volume is distorted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以密度孔隙與飽和度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。同批樣品核對比重、乾密度和含水量，檢查計算飽和度是否介於零與一；若不合理，回查單位、粗粒修正和取樣體積，再評估不同位置的變異。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for density void ratio and saturation, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check specific gravity, dry density and moisture on matched samples and ensure computed saturation lies between zero and one. Investigate units, coarse-particle corrections and sample volume before interpreting spatial variation.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：相態閉合正常仍不保證土體結構均勻，團塊間大孔隙可能與團塊內高密度共存。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Consistent phase relations do not prove uniform fabric: dense clods can coexist with large interclod voids. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
