         "id": "b235-v15-13-k1",
         "title": "水力劈裂與小主應力",
         "titleEn": "Hydraulic fracture and minor stress",
         "text": "心牆若因拱效應使小主壓應力降低，蓄水壓力可能沿弱面推開土體。簡單總應力比較只能提示敏感性，實際起裂還取決於抗拉、缺陷和應力路徑。",
         "textEn": "Arching can reduce the core minor compressive stress, allowing reservoir pressure to open weak planes. A simple total-stress comparison indicates sensitivity; initiation also depends on tension resistance, defects and stress history.",
