       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for core arching and differential settlement, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare layer settlement, total stress and pore pressure in core and shells, checking interface load-transfer direction. Test low-stress zones across stiffness ratios and retain the history of construction elevation differences.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：窄谷或陡峭岸坡容易形成複雜三維拱效應，單一二維係數可能不足。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
