       "objective": "從症狀倒推「心牆拱效應與沉降差」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Core arching and differential settlement” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "窄谷或陡峭岸坡容易形成複雜三維拱效應，單一二維係數可能不足。若只以心牆壓力降低當作減載好處，會忽略裂縫與水力劈裂敏感性提高。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Narrow valleys and steep abutments create three-dimensional arching beyond one two-dimensional coefficient. Viewing reduced core stress only as beneficial unloading overlooks increased sensitivity to cracking and hydraulic fracture. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若只以心牆壓力降低當作減載好處，會忽略裂縫與水力劈裂敏感性提高。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Viewing reduced core stress only as beneficial unloading overlooks increased sensitivity to cracking and hydraulic fracture.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「心牆拱效應降低壓應力，因此在所有情況下都提高安全。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Core arching lowers compression and therefore improves safety in every circumstance.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
