      {
       "id": "b235-v15-21",
       "title": "反濾保持與排水能力：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Filter retention and drainage capacity: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usbr-embankment",
        "v15s-usbr-construction",
        "v15s-usbr-filters",
        "b-src-water",
        "v15s-usace-gravity"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b235-v15-20"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「反濾保持與排水能力」如何影響心牆土石壩分區填築的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Filter retention and drainage capacity” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Zoned placement in earth-core rockfill dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "反濾材料要保持心牆細粒又提供足夠通水性，兩條要求需同時滿足。粒徑比只是初步條件，分散性土與間斷級配需要專門試驗。 假設基土d85=0.2 mm、反濾D15=0.6 mm，保持比3；另假設反濾k=10⁻⁴ m/s，不能由比值直接推得此k或接受標準。 施工離析會在局部形成過粗窗口，細料污染則降低排水性。只用料場平均曲線可能同時漏掉這兩種相反缺陷，不能代替鋪設連續性和界面驗證。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「反濾保持與排水能力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Filters must retain core particles while providing adequate flow capacity, requiring both conditions. Grain-size ratios are preliminary checks, while dispersive soils and gap grading require dedicated testing. Assume base d85=0.2 mm and filter D15=0.6 mm, giving retention ratio three. A separate assumed k=10⁻⁴ m/s is not derived from that ratio or an acceptance criterion. Segregation creates locally coarse windows while fines contamination reduces drainage. A stockpile-average curve can miss both opposing defects and cannot replace checks of placement continuity and zone interfaces. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Filter retention and drainage capacity” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設基土d85=0.2 mm、反濾D15=0.6 mm，保持比3；另假設反濾k=10⁻⁴ m/s，不能由比值直接推得此k或接受標準。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume base d85=0.2 mm and filter D15=0.6 mm, giving retention ratio three.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「反濾料粒徑保持比合格就能自動推得其滲透係數。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A passing particle-retention ratio automatically determines the filter permeability coefficient.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「反濾保持與排水能力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Filter retention and drainage capacity”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b235-v15-21-k1",
         "title": "反濾保持與排水能力",
         "titleEn": "Filter retention and drainage capacity",
         "text": "反濾材料要保持心牆細粒又提供足夠通水性，兩條要求需同時滿足。粒徑比只是初步條件，分散性土與間斷級配需要專門試驗。",
         "textEn": "Filters must retain core particles while providing adequate flow capacity, requiring both conditions. Grain-size ratios are preliminary checks, while dispersive soils and gap grading require dedicated testing.",
