        {
         "id": "b235-v15-25-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：排水料滲透係數很高就保證任何出口條件下都能充分排水。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: High drain permeability guarantees sufficient drainage under every outlet condition. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
