         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume drain k=0.01 m/s, flow area 2 m² and gradient 0.05. Q=0.001 m³/s=1 L/s, for steady saturated Darcy flow without outlet loss.",
