       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「排水帶流量與水頭」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Drain flow and hydraulic head” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "沿排水帶量測水頭並核對出口尾水，對照集水流量和降雨；檢查通流面積是否被壓縮或污染縮小，再以不同水頭下資料確認線性達西假設是否合理。將出口淹沒情境下的有效坡降重新計算。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure heads along the drain and check outlet tailwater against collected flow and rain. Inspect reduced area from deformation or contamination and use several heads to test the linear Darcy assumption. Recalculate effective gradients for the scenario with a submerged drain outlet. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以排水帶流量與水頭編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。沿排水帶量測水頭並核對出口尾水，對照集水流量和降雨；檢查通流面積是否被壓縮或污染縮小，再以不同水頭下資料確認線性達西假設是否合理。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for drain flow and hydraulic head, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure heads along the drain and check outlet tailwater against collected flow and rain. Inspect reduced area from deformation or contamination and use several heads to test the linear Darcy assumption.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：高流量時粗料可能出現非達西效應，出口被淹也會降低實際坡降。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Coarse drains can become non-Darcy at high flow, and submerged outlets reduce gradients. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
