       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Zone volumes and boundary contamination” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "局部混料占比小仍可能沿整條反濾帶形成堵塞，心牆被粗粒貫穿也可增加缺陷。若只按各料區進場重量驗收，空間錯位會被總量平衡掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A small mixed fraction can clog a continuous filter strip, while coarse intrusion damages the core. Acceptance based only on incoming material mass allows spatial misplacement to hide behind a correct total balance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若只按各料區進場重量驗收，空間錯位會被總量平衡掩蓋。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Acceptance based only on incoming material mass allows spatial misplacement to hide behind a correct total balance.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「各分區材料總重量正確就能證明所有分區位置與厚度正確。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Correct total material mass proves every zone is correctly located and dimensioned.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b235-v15-32-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "局部混料占比小仍可能沿整條反濾帶形成堵塞，心牆被粗粒貫穿也可增加缺陷。若只按各料區進場重量驗收，空間錯位會被總量平衡掩蓋。",
         "textEn": "A small mixed fraction can clog a continuous filter strip, while coarse intrusion damages the core. Acceptance based only on incoming material mass allows spatial misplacement to hide behind a correct total balance.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usbr-embankment",
          "v15s-usbr-construction",
          "v15s-usbr-filters",
          "b-src-water",
          "v15s-usace-gravity"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b235-v15-32-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usbr-embankment",
          "v15s-usbr-construction",
          "v15s-usbr-filters",
          "b-src-water",
          "v15s-usace-gravity"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "在「分區方量與邊界污染」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？",
        "questionEn": "When \"Zone volumes and boundary contamination\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?",
        "options": [
         "補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。",
         "新增填土重量造成的總應力一定全部立即轉成有效應力。",
         "局部混料占比小仍可能沿整條反濾帶形成堵塞，心牆被粗粒貫穿也可增加缺陷。"
