     "description": "本階段聚焦「施工孔壓與載重速率」與「快速退水與支承改變」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Construction pore pressure and loading rate\" and \"Rapid drawdown and lost support\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
