       "objective": "說明「施工孔壓與載重速率」如何影響心牆土石壩分區填築的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Construction pore pressure and loading rate” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Zoned placement in earth-core rockfill dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "快速加高會讓低滲透心牆來不及排水，新增總應力部分轉為孔壓。施工穩定必須使用相符的排水條件，不能以長期有效應力強度直接取代短期分析。 假設新增總應力100 kPa、量測孔壓增加70 kPa，該增量的有效應力增加30 kPa；以Δσ′=Δσ−Δu計，不等同整體ru。 儀器反應遲緩可能低估真正孔壓峰值，停工後仍在消散則說明長期狀態尚未建立。若把總應力增加全部當有效壓密，會高估即時抗剪能力。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「施工孔壓與載重速率」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Rapid raising can load a low-permeability core faster than it drains, converting part of added total stress into pore pressure. Construction stability requires matching drainage conditions rather than substituting long-term behavior. Assume added total stress 100 kPa and measured pore-pressure increase 70 kPa. Effective stress increases 30 kPa by Δσ′=Δσ−Δu, not a whole-dam ru value. Slow instruments can understate true pressure peaks, while continued dissipation shows long-term conditions are not established. Treating all added total stress as effective compression overstates immediate shear resistance. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Construction pore pressure and loading rate” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設新增總應力100 kPa、量測孔壓增加70 kPa，該增量的有效應力增加30 kPa；以Δσ′=Δσ−Δu計，不等同整體ru。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume added total stress 100 kPa and measured pore-pressure increase 70 kPa.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「新增填土重量造成的總應力一定全部立即轉成有效應力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"All total stress added by new fill immediately becomes effective stress.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「施工孔壓與載重速率」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Construction pore pressure and loading rate”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b235-v15-33-k1",
         "title": "施工孔壓與載重速率",
         "titleEn": "Construction pore pressure and loading rate",
         "text": "快速加高會讓低滲透心牆來不及排水，新增總應力部分轉為孔壓。施工穩定必須使用相符的排水條件，不能以長期有效應力強度直接取代短期分析。",
         "textEn": "Rapid raising can load a low-permeability core faster than it drains, converting part of added total stress into pore pressure. Construction stability requires matching drainage conditions rather than substituting long-term behavior.",
