         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume added total stress 100 kPa and measured pore-pressure increase 70 kPa. Effective stress increases 30 kPa by Δσ′=Δσ−Δu, not a whole-dam ru value.",
