       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b235-v15-34"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「施工孔壓與載重速率」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Construction pore pressure and loading rate” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "將每層填築重量、時間與孔壓歷線對齊，分辨載重上升和停工消散；核對土壓計及孔壓計零點，並以排水距離與材料滲透性檢查反應時間合理性。比對停工後孔壓消散曲線與施工載重紀錄。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Align lift weight and timing with pore-pressure histories, separating loading from dissipation during pauses. Check pressure-instrument zeros and assess response time using drainage distance and material permeability. Compare post-pause pressure dissipation curves against the recorded construction loading history. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以施工孔壓與載重速率編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。將每層填築重量、時間與孔壓歷線對齊，分辨載重上升和停工消散；核對土壓計及孔壓計零點，並以排水距離與材料滲透性檢查反應時間合理性。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for construction pore pressure and loading rate, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Align lift weight and timing with pore-pressure histories, separating loading from dissipation during pauses. Check pressure-instrument zeros and assess response time using drainage distance and material permeability.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：儀器反應遲緩可能低估真正孔壓峰值，停工後仍在消散則說明長期狀態尚未建立。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Slow instruments can understate true pressure peaks, while continued dissipation shows long-term conditions are not established. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b235-v15-35-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "將每層填築重量、時間與孔壓歷線對齊，分辨載重上升和停工消散；核對土壓計及孔壓計零點，並以排水距離與材料滲透性檢查反應時間合理性。比對停工後孔壓消散曲線與施工載重紀錄。",
         "textEn": "Align lift weight and timing with pore-pressure histories, separating loading from dissipation during pauses. Check pressure-instrument zeros and assess response time using drainage distance and material permeability. Compare post-pause pressure dissipation curves against the recorded construction loading history.",
         "sourceIds": [
