       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Construction pore pressure and loading rate” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "儀器反應遲緩可能低估真正孔壓峰值，停工後仍在消散則說明長期狀態尚未建立。若把總應力增加全部當有效壓密，會高估即時抗剪能力。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Slow instruments can understate true pressure peaks, while continued dissipation shows long-term conditions are not established. Treating all added total stress as effective compression overstates immediate shear resistance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若把總應力增加全部當有效壓密，會高估即時抗剪能力。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Treating all added total stress as effective compression overstates immediate shear resistance.",
