       "objective": "說明「快速退水與支承改變」如何影響心牆土石壩分區填築的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Rapid drawdown and lost support” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Zoned placement in earth-core rockfill dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "退水移除上游水體支承，但心牆與坡體孔壓可能來不及下降。外部水位低不代表內部已排水，穩定分析需使用時間相關的孔壓場。 假設某點總正應力180 kPa、退水後孔壓仍120 kPa，有效60 kPa；若誤假設孔壓已降40 kPa，會估140 kPa，高估2.333倍。 把退水後的最低庫位配上早已消散的孔壓會形成不真實荷載組合，忽略外水支承消失又會偏樂觀。慢速表面排水不能代表深部弱層同樣迅速排水。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「快速退水與支承改變」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Drawdown removes external upstream support while internal pore pressures can lag. Low reservoir level does not establish drained soil, so stability requires a time-dependent internal pressure field. Assume total normal stress 180 kPa and retained pore pressure 120 kPa, giving effective stress 60 kPa. Assuming pressure already fell to 40 kPa gives 140 kPa, an overestimate by factor 2.333. Combining minimum reservoir level with fully dissipated pressures can create an unrealistic load case, while retaining lost external support is optimistic. Surface drainage does not establish equally rapid drainage in deep weak layers. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Rapid drawdown and lost support” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設某點總正應力180 kPa、退水後孔壓仍120 kPa，有效60 kPa；若誤假設孔壓已降40 kPa，會估140 kPa，高估2.333倍。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume total normal stress 180 kPa and retained pore pressure 120 kPa, giving effective stress 60 kPa.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「水庫退到低水位時，壩內所有孔壓必定已同步降到最低。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"At low reservoir level every internal pore pressure has necessarily fallen to its minimum.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「快速退水與支承改變」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Rapid drawdown and lost support”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b235-v15-37-k1",
         "title": "快速退水與支承改變",
         "titleEn": "Rapid drawdown and lost support",
         "text": "退水移除上游水體支承，但心牆與坡體孔壓可能來不及下降。外部水位低不代表內部已排水，穩定分析需使用時間相關的孔壓場。",
         "textEn": "Drawdown removes external upstream support while internal pore pressures can lag. Low reservoir level does not establish drained soil, so stability requires a time-dependent internal pressure field.",
