       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「快速退水與支承改變」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Rapid drawdown and lost support” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "比較水庫退水率與坡內各深度孔壓消散，確認量測點涵蓋可能滑面；用同一時間截面重建外水支承與內部壓力，並對排水速度和土體強度做敏感度。把外水支承消失與內部孔壓消散分別建模。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare reservoir drawdown with pore-pressure dissipation at several depths and cover plausible slip surfaces. Reconstruct external support and internal pressure at the same instant and test drainage-rate and strength sensitivity. Model loss of external water support separately from internal pressure dissipation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以快速退水與支承改變編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。比較水庫退水率與坡內各深度孔壓消散，確認量測點涵蓋可能滑面；用同一時間截面重建外水支承與內部壓力，並對排水速度和土體強度做敏感度。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for rapid drawdown and lost support, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare reservoir drawdown with pore-pressure dissipation at several depths and cover plausible slip surfaces. Reconstruct external support and internal pressure at the same instant and test drainage-rate and strength sensitivity.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把退水後的最低庫位配上早已消散的孔壓會形成不真實荷載組合，忽略外水支承消失又會偏樂觀。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Combining minimum reservoir level with fully dissipated pressures can create an unrealistic load case, while retaining lost external support is optimistic. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
