   "workedExample": {
    "title": "原創假想算例與邊界",
    "titleEn": "Original hypothetical example and boundaries",
    "text": "本課原創比較練習分兩個相互獨立的物理模型。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設每100 kg礦料加入6 kg瀝青，按礦料為6%，按總重為6/106=5.6604%；僅分母換算，不是建議配比。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設理論最大密度2500 kg/m³、實測體積密度2450 kg/m³，空隙率1−2450/2500=2%；非任何專案接受上限。先逐一圈出公式內的控制體、力方向或時間尺度，再把每項輸入的量綱換成一致單位。第二人只根據輸入重算結果，不抄第一人的中間數字。最後指出這兩個估算尚未包含的空間變化、非線性及量測誤差；若將結果用於另一座工程，必須重建其幾何、材料與邊界條件，不能挪用本練習的假設。 空隙率敏感度固定理論最大密度2500 kg/m³，只將體積密度2450提高至2475 kg/m³。空隙率100(1−ρb/ρmax)由2%降至1%，是降低1個百分點而非降低1%。比較假定材料組成和測定方法不變；它不設定施工壓實目標，也未據此證明瀝青心牆的抗滲或低溫變形性能。",
    "textEn": "This original comparison exercise uses two independent physical models. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume six kilograms of bitumen per hundred kilograms of mineral material. Content is six percent of mineral mass but 5.6604 percent of total mass, a denominator conversion rather than a recommended mix. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume theoretical maximum density 2500 kg/m³ and measured bulk density 2450 kg/m³. Air void content is two percent, not a project acceptance limit. First identify the control volume, force direction or time scale in each relation, then convert every input to consistent units. A second reviewer recalculates from the inputs without copying intermediate numbers. Finally identify spatial variability, nonlinear effects and measurement errors omitted by both estimates. Transfer to another structure requires rebuilding its geometry, material description and boundary conditions; the assumed classroom inputs are not transferable design or operating parameters. Hold theoretical maximum density at 2500 kg/m³ and change only bulk density from 2450 to 2475 kg/m³. Air-void content 100(1−ρb/ρmax) drops from 2% to 1%, one percentage point rather than a 1% relative decrease. Composition and measurement method remain fixed. This comparison neither sets a compaction target nor establishes permeability or cold-temperature deformation performance.",
    "assumptions": "數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。",
    "assumptionsEn": "Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.",
    "sourceScope": "原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。",
    "sourceScopeEn": "Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."
   },
