       "objective": "說明「膠結料比例基準」如何影響瀝青混凝土心牆壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Binder proportion basis” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Asphalt-core embankment-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "瀝青含量可按礦料重量或混合料總重量表示，兩種百分比不能直接比較。配方必須先確認分母，再連結骨材表面覆蓋與孔隙填充，不能把道路配方直接移植到壩心牆。 假設每100 kg礦料加入6 kg瀝青，按礦料為6%，按總重為6/106=5.6604%；僅分母換算，不是建議配比。 把礦料百分比當總重百分比會系統性多加膠結料，反向誤用則可能缺料。即使含量相同，不同骨材形狀和細粉也會改變工作性與體積孔隙。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「膠結料比例基準」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Bitumen content may use mineral mass or total mixture mass as denominator, making the percentages noninterchangeable. Mixture interpretation must establish the basis before relating coating and void filling, rather than copying road asphalt into dam cores. Assume six kilograms of bitumen per hundred kilograms of mineral material. Content is six percent of mineral mass but 5.6604 percent of total mass, a denominator conversion rather than a recommended mix. Using a mineral-basis percentage as total-basis content systematically adds too much binder, while reversing the error underdoses it. Equal content also does not ensure equal workability or voids for different aggregates. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Binder proportion basis” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設每100 kg礦料加入6 kg瀝青，按礦料為6%，按總重為6/106=5.6604%；僅分母換算，不是建議配比。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume six kilograms of bitumen per hundred kilograms of mineral material.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「按礦料重量和按總混合料重量表示的瀝青百分比完全相同。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Bitumen percentages based on mineral mass and total mixture mass are identical.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「膠結料比例基準」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Binder proportion basis”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b236-v15-01-k1",
         "title": "膠結料比例基準",
         "titleEn": "Binder proportion basis",
         "text": "瀝青含量可按礦料重量或混合料總重量表示，兩種百分比不能直接比較。配方必須先確認分母，再連結骨材表面覆蓋與孔隙填充，不能把道路配方直接移植到壩心牆。",
         "textEn": "Bitumen content may use mineral mass or total mixture mass as denominator, making the percentages noninterchangeable. Mixture interpretation must establish the basis before relating coating and void filling, rather than copying road asphalt into dam cores.",
