         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume six kilograms of bitumen per hundred kilograms of mineral material. Content is six percent of mineral mass but 5.6604 percent of total mass, a denominator conversion rather than a recommended mix.",
