       "instruction": "核對拌合紀錄、萃取試驗和報表的分母定義，用同一批樣品重算兩種比例；另查含水或細粉是否計入礦料重量，將配方版本和批次標籤一併保存以便追溯。核對空容器皮重。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check denominator definitions in batch records, extraction tests and reports and recalculate both fractions for one sample. Verify moisture and filler treatment, retaining mixture versions and batch labels for traceability and consistent comparison. Verify empty-container tare independently. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以膠結料比例基準編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。核對拌合紀錄、萃取試驗和報表的分母定義，用同一批樣品重算兩種比例；另查含水或細粉是否計入礦料重量，將配方版本和批次標籤一併保存以便追溯。核對空容器皮重。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for binder proportion basis, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check denominator definitions in batch records, extraction tests and reports and recalculate both fractions for one sample. Verify moisture and filler treatment, retaining mixture versions and batch labels for traceability and consistent comparison. Verify empty-container tare independently.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把礦料百分比當總重百分比會系統性多加膠結料，反向誤用則可能缺料。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Using a mineral-basis percentage as total-basis content systematically adds too much binder, while reversing the error underdoses it. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
