       "objective": "從症狀倒推「膠結料比例基準」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Binder proportion basis” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把礦料百分比當總重百分比會系統性多加膠結料，反向誤用則可能缺料。即使含量相同，不同骨材形狀和細粉也會改變工作性與體積孔隙。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Using a mineral-basis percentage as total-basis content systematically adds too much binder, while reversing the error underdoses it. Equal content also does not ensure equal workability or voids for different aggregates. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：即使含量相同，不同骨材形狀和細粉也會改變工作性與體積孔隙。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Equal content also does not ensure equal workability or voids for different aggregates.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「按礦料重量和按總混合料重量表示的瀝青百分比完全相同。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Bitumen percentages based on mineral mass and total mixture mass are identical.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b236-v15-04-k1",
