         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "把礦料百分比當總重百分比會系統性多加膠結料，反向誤用則可能缺料。即使含量相同，不同骨材形狀和細粉也會改變工作性與體積孔隙。",
         "textEn": "Using a mineral-basis percentage as total-basis content systematically adds too much binder, while reversing the error underdoses it. Equal content also does not ensure equal workability or voids for different aggregates.",
