       "objective": "從症狀倒推「體積孔隙與連通性」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Air voids and connectivity” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "少量連通孔隙可能比較多封閉孔隙更影響漏流，取芯損傷又可能製造人工裂縫。只看空隙百分比，無法分辨施工缺陷與取樣過程造成的通道。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A small connected void fraction can transmit more flow than many isolated voids, and coring damage can create artificial cracks. Void percentage alone cannot distinguish construction defects from sampling-induced pathways. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：只看空隙百分比，無法分辨施工缺陷與取樣過程造成的通道。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Void percentage alone cannot distinguish construction defects from sampling-induced pathways.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「總孔隙率很低就能證明心牆不存在任何連通漏水通道。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Low total void content proves that no connected leakage path exists in the core.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b236-v15-08-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "少量連通孔隙可能比較多封閉孔隙更影響漏流，取芯損傷又可能製造人工裂縫。只看空隙百分比，無法分辨施工缺陷與取樣過程造成的通道。",
         "textEn": "A small connected void fraction can transmit more flow than many isolated voids, and coring damage can create artificial cracks. Void percentage alone cannot distinguish construction defects from sampling-induced pathways.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-asphalt-quxue",
          "v15s-asphalt-rate",
          "v15s-asphalt-model",
          "v15s-usbr-embankment",
