     "description": "本階段聚焦「黏彈遲滯與載重時間」與「熱收縮與相鄰材料」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Viscoelastic lag and loading time\" and \"Thermal contraction and neighboring materials\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
