       "objective": "說明「黏彈遲滯與載重時間」如何影響瀝青混凝土心牆壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Viscoelastic lag and loading time” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Asphalt-core embankment-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "瀝青混凝土的應變會隨載重時間與溫度發展，短時剛度不能直接代表長期變形。黏彈類比適合說明延遲反應，參數需由對應溫度和應力範圍試驗取得。 假設Kelvin-Voigt模型E=100 MPa、η=10⁹ Pa·s、恆應力0.1 MPa，時間常數10 s，t=20 s應變0.0008647；純教學小應變。 單一黏彈元件無法描述所有塑性與損傷，卸載殘餘應變可能超出模型。若把一個溫度下的模數永久固定，會錯估施工熱態與服役冷態的差異。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「黏彈遲滯與載重時間」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Asphalt-concrete strain develops with loading duration and temperature, so short-term stiffness does not represent long-term movement. A viscoelastic analogy illustrates delayed response but needs parameters tested at relevant temperatures and stresses. Assume Kelvin-Voigt E=100 MPa, η=10⁹ Pa·s and constant stress 0.1 MPa. Time constant is ten seconds and strain at twenty seconds is 0.0008647, a small-strain teaching model. One viscoelastic element cannot describe every plastic or damage mechanism, and residual strain may exceed it. Fixing modulus from one temperature misrepresents differences between warm construction and cool service conditions. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Viscoelastic lag and loading time” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設Kelvin-Voigt模型E=100 MPa、η=10⁹ Pa·s、恆應力0.1 MPa，時間常數10 s，t=20 s應變0.0008647；純教學小應變。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume Kelvin-Voigt E=100 MPa, η=10⁹ Pa·s and constant stress 0.1 MPa.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「短時間試驗得到的瀝青模數可以直接代表所有長期載重。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A short-duration asphalt modulus directly represents all long-term loading conditions.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「黏彈遲滯與載重時間」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Viscoelastic lag and loading time”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
