         "text": "瀝青混凝土的應變會隨載重時間與溫度發展，短時剛度不能直接代表長期變形。黏彈類比適合說明延遲反應，參數需由對應溫度和應力範圍試驗取得。",
         "textEn": "Asphalt-concrete strain develops with loading duration and temperature, so short-term stiffness does not represent long-term movement. A viscoelastic analogy illustrates delayed response but needs parameters tested at relevant temperatures and stresses.",
         "sourceIds": [
