       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「黏彈遲滯與載重時間」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Viscoelastic lag and loading time” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以多個載重持續時間量測蠕變和卸載回復，核對模型是否同時描述兩段；將試驗溫度、應變速率和圍壓寫在參數旁邊，另用未參與擬合的歷程驗證。再查卸載回復曲線。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure creep and unloading recovery over several durations and test whether one model fits both. Record temperature, strain rate and confinement beside parameters, then validate against a loading history excluded from calibration. Also compare recovery after removing the load. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以黏彈遲滯與載重時間編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以多個載重持續時間量測蠕變和卸載回復，核對模型是否同時描述兩段；將試驗溫度、應變速率和圍壓寫在參數旁邊，另用未參與擬合的歷程驗證。再查卸載回復曲線。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for viscoelastic lag and loading time, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure creep and unloading recovery over several durations and test whether one model fits both. Record temperature, strain rate and confinement beside parameters, then validate against a loading history excluded from calibration. Also compare recovery after removing the load.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：單一黏彈元件無法描述所有塑性與損傷，卸載殘餘應變可能超出模型。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: One viscoelastic element cannot describe every plastic or damage mechanism, and residual strain may exceed it. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b236-v15-11-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "以多個載重持續時間量測蠕變和卸載回復，核對模型是否同時描述兩段；將試驗溫度、應變速率和圍壓寫在參數旁邊，另用未參與擬合的歷程驗證。再查卸載回復曲線。",
         "textEn": "Measure creep and unloading recovery over several durations and test whether one model fits both. Record temperature, strain rate and confinement beside parameters, then validate against a loading history excluded from calibration. Also compare recovery after removing the load.",
