       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Viscoelastic lag and loading time” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "單一黏彈元件無法描述所有塑性與損傷，卸載殘餘應變可能超出模型。若把一個溫度下的模數永久固定，會錯估施工熱態與服役冷態的差異。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "One viscoelastic element cannot describe every plastic or damage mechanism, and residual strain may exceed it. Fixing modulus from one temperature misrepresents differences between warm construction and cool service conditions. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若把一個溫度下的模數永久固定，會錯估施工熱態與服役冷態的差異。",
