       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Thermal contraction and neighboring materials” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "同步記錄心牆與過渡料溫度和位移，以同時刻差值檢查相容；核對混合料熱性質試驗，再比較趾板接頭附近與壩中央區域的變形，確認自由收縮並未誤當實際張開。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Record core and transition temperatures and movements together and assess compatibility at matching times. Check mixture thermal tests and compare plinth-adjacent and central zones, ensuring free contraction is not mistaken for actual joint opening. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以熱收縮與相鄰材料編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。同步記錄心牆與過渡料溫度和位移，以同時刻差值檢查相容；核對混合料熱性質試驗，再比較趾板接頭附近與壩中央區域的變形，確認自由收縮並未誤當實際張開。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for thermal contraction and neighboring materials, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Record core and transition temperatures and movements together and assess compatibility at matching times. Check mixture thermal tests and compare plinth-adjacent and central zones, ensuring free contraction is not mistaken for actual joint opening.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：局部快速冷卻可能產生集中拉伸，而高溫黏性又會讓應力鬆弛。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Local rapid cooling concentrates tension, while warm viscous behavior relaxes stress. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
