       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Thermal contraction and neighboring materials” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "局部快速冷卻可能產生集中拉伸，而高溫黏性又會讓應力鬆弛。若直接用彈性拘束公式跨越整個溫度範圍，可能誇大或低估真正的接縫需求。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Local rapid cooling concentrates tension, while warm viscous behavior relaxes stress. Applying one elastic restraint formula across the whole temperature range can either exaggerate or understate actual joint demand. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若直接用彈性拘束公式跨越整個溫度範圍，可能誇大或低估真正的接縫需求。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Applying one elastic restraint formula across the whole temperature range can either exaggerate or understate actual joint demand.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「自由熱收縮量就是心牆接頭實際必然張開的寬度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Free thermal contraction is exactly the opening that must occur at the core connection.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
