       "objective": "說明「薄層供料與寬度」如何影響瀝青混凝土心牆壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Lift supply and core width” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Asphalt-core embankment-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "心牆體積遠小於壩殼，但必須與過渡區同步上升，否則缺乏側向支承或造成施工等待。寬度連續性比每日總方量更能反映防滲屏障是否完整。 假設一層長200 m、寬0.6 m、厚0.25 m，材料體積30 m³；若寬度局部少0.05 m持續20 m，缺量0.25 m³，不能靠別處超寬抵銷。 材料側向擠入過渡料可使表面寬度看似足夠但有效核心變薄，局部冷料團也會破壞連續性。把整層平均寬度當最小厚度，會漏掉控制滲流的窄點。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「薄層供料與寬度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Core volume is small relative to the shells but must rise compatibly with transitions to preserve support and avoid waiting. Width continuity reveals sealing integrity better than daily total material output alone. Assume lift length 200 m, width 0.6 m and thickness 0.25 m, giving 30 m³. A 0.05 m width deficit over 20 m loses 0.25 m³ and is not offset by excess elsewhere. Lateral intrusion into transition material can mask a thinner effective core, while cold clumps disrupt continuity. Treating mean width as minimum thickness misses narrow sections controlling seepage performance. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Lift supply and core width” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設一層長200 m、寬0.6 m、厚0.25 m，材料體積30 m³；若寬度局部少0.05 m持續20 m，缺量0.25 m³，不能靠別處超寬抵銷。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume lift length 200 m, width 0.6 m and thickness 0.25 m, giving 30 m³.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「其他位置多鋪材料就能補償任何局部心牆寬度不足。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Extra material elsewhere compensates for every local deficiency in core width.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「薄層供料與寬度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Lift supply and core width”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
