         "title": "薄層供料與寬度",
         "titleEn": "Lift supply and core width",
         "text": "心牆體積遠小於壩殼，但必須與過渡區同步上升，否則缺乏側向支承或造成施工等待。寬度連續性比每日總方量更能反映防滲屏障是否完整。",
         "textEn": "Core volume is small relative to the shells but must rise compatibly with transitions to preserve support and avoid waiting. Width continuity reveals sealing integrity better than daily total material output alone.",
         "sourceIds": [
