       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for lift supply and core width, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure compacted width and centerline by segment and compare delivery with transition height. Use spatial volume accounting to locate narrow sections, retaining warm and cooled dimensions rather than accepting the lift from delivery totals alone.",
