       "objective": "從症狀倒推「薄層供料與寬度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Lift supply and core width” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "材料側向擠入過渡料可使表面寬度看似足夠但有效核心變薄，局部冷料團也會破壞連續性。把整層平均寬度當最小厚度，會漏掉控制滲流的窄點。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Lateral intrusion into transition material can mask a thinner effective core, while cold clumps disrupt continuity. Treating mean width as minimum thickness misses narrow sections controlling seepage performance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：把整層平均寬度當最小厚度，會漏掉控制滲流的窄點。",
