       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「層間黏結與剪切」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Interlift bond and shear” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "把跨層芯樣與同層完整樣配對試驗，記錄破壞是在界面還是材料內；核對表面污染和溫度紀錄，再以滲透與顯微觀察確認剪力合格沒有掩蓋局部未黏結區。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Pair interface-crossing cores with intact specimens and record whether failure occurs at the joint or within material. Check contamination and temperature records and use permeability and microscopy to identify local unbonded areas hidden by acceptable peak strength. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以層間黏結與剪切編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。把跨層芯樣與同層完整樣配對試驗，記錄破壞是在界面還是材料內；核對表面污染和溫度紀錄，再以滲透與顯微觀察確認剪力合格沒有掩蓋局部未黏結區。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for interlift bond and shear, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Pair interface-crossing cores with intact specimens and record whether failure occurs at the joint or within material. Check contamination and temperature records and use permeability and microscopy to identify local unbonded areas hidden by acceptable peak strength.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：試體可能在完整材料先破壞而無法量得真正接縫能力，也可能因取芯熱損傷改變結果。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Failure in intact material may prevent measuring joint capacity, while coring heat can alter results. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
