       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Interlift bond and shear” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "試體可能在完整材料先破壞而無法量得真正接縫能力，也可能因取芯熱損傷改變結果。若只報最大剪力不記錄破壞面，便無法判讀層間品質。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Failure in intact material may prevent measuring joint capacity, while coring heat can alter results. Reporting peak force without the failure surface leaves the interlift quality interpretation incomplete and potentially misleading. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若只報最大剪力不記錄破壞面，便無法判讀層間品質。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Reporting peak force without the failure surface leaves the interlift quality interpretation incomplete and potentially misleading.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「瀝青材料具有延性就能保證所有施工層面完全黏結。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
