       "objective": "說明「過渡區剪應變相容」如何影響瀝青混凝土心牆壩施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Transition-zone shear compatibility” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Asphalt-core embankment-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "心牆和相鄰粗粒材料沉降不同，界面會傳遞剪力並形成局部剪應變。相對位移除以代表厚度只是幾何估算，真正變形可能集中在更薄區域。 假設相對位移4 mm分布於0.5 m厚區，工程剪應變γ=0.004/0.5=0.008，即0.8%；均勻剪切假設，非容許值。 把整個過渡層厚度當剪切帶會低估局部應變，反向只用極薄帶又可能過度保守。若沒有位移分布資料，不能把任選厚度的計算稱作實測材料應變。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「過渡區剪應變相容」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Differential settlement between core and coarse transition material transfers shear. Relative displacement divided by representative thickness is only geometric; actual deformation may localize within a much thinner band. Assume relative movement 4 mm distributed across thickness 0.5 m. Engineering shear strain is 0.008, or 0.8 percent, under uniform shear and not an allowable value. Using full transition thickness as a shear band understates local strain, while an arbitrarily thin band may be overly conservative. Without a displacement profile, the selected-width calculation is not a measured material strain. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Transition-zone shear compatibility” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設相對位移4 mm分布於0.5 m厚區，工程剪應變γ=0.004/0.5=0.008，即0.8%；均勻剪切假設，非容許值。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume relative movement 4 mm distributed across thickness 0.5 m.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「相對位移除以任意過渡層厚度就能得到精確局部剪應變。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Relative movement divided by any chosen transition thickness gives exact local shear strain.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「過渡區剪應變相容」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Transition-zone shear compatibility”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b236-v15-29-k1",
         "title": "過渡區剪應變相容",
         "titleEn": "Transition-zone shear compatibility",
         "text": "心牆和相鄰粗粒材料沉降不同，界面會傳遞剪力並形成局部剪應變。相對位移除以代表厚度只是幾何估算，真正變形可能集中在更薄區域。",
         "textEn": "Differential settlement between core and coarse transition material transfers shear. Relative displacement divided by representative thickness is only geometric; actual deformation may localize within a much thinner band.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-asphalt-quxue",
          "v15s-asphalt-rate",
          "v15s-asphalt-model",
          "v15s-usbr-embankment",
