        {
         "id": "b236-v15-29-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：相對位移除以任意過渡層厚度就能得到精確局部剪應變。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Relative movement divided by any chosen transition thickness gives exact local shear strain. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
