       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「過渡區剪應變相容」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Transition-zone shear compatibility” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "設置跨界面多個位移點辨認變形分布，對照過渡料粒徑與心牆溫度；將平均剪應變和局部最大值分開，並用相同尺度的試驗檢查是否出現界面滑移。固定標記間的量測長度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Use several displacement points across the interface to resolve deformation, comparing transition grading and core temperature. Separate mean and local maximum shear and test comparable scales for evidence of interface slip or localization. Keep the displacement gauge length explicitly defined. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以過渡區剪應變相容編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。設置跨界面多個位移點辨認變形分布，對照過渡料粒徑與心牆溫度；將平均剪應變和局部最大值分開，並用相同尺度的試驗檢查是否出現界面滑移。固定標記間的量測長度。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for transition-zone shear compatibility, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Use several displacement points across the interface to resolve deformation, comparing transition grading and core temperature. Separate mean and local maximum shear and test comparable scales for evidence of interface slip or localization. Keep the displacement gauge length explicitly defined.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把整個過渡層厚度當剪切帶會低估局部應變，反向只用極薄帶又可能過度保守。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Using full transition thickness as a shear band understates local strain, while an arbitrarily thin band may be overly conservative. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
