         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for transition-zone shear compatibility, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Use several displacement points across the interface to resolve deformation, comparing transition grading and core temperature. Separate mean and local maximum shear and test comparable scales for evidence of interface slip or localization. Keep the displacement gauge length explicitly defined.",
