       "objective": "從症狀倒推「過渡區剪應變相容」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Transition-zone shear compatibility” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把整個過渡層厚度當剪切帶會低估局部應變，反向只用極薄帶又可能過度保守。若沒有位移分布資料，不能把任選厚度的計算稱作實測材料應變。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Using full transition thickness as a shear band understates local strain, while an arbitrarily thin band may be overly conservative. Without a displacement profile, the selected-width calculation is not a measured material strain. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若沒有位移分布資料，不能把任選厚度的計算稱作實測材料應變。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Without a displacement profile, the selected-width calculation is not a measured material strain.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「相對位移除以任意過渡層厚度就能得到精確局部剪應變。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Relative movement divided by any chosen transition thickness gives exact local shear strain.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
