         "text": "把整個過渡層厚度當剪切帶會低估局部應變，反向只用極薄帶又可能過度保守。若沒有位移分布資料，不能把任選厚度的計算稱作實測材料應變。",
         "textEn": "Using full transition thickness as a shear band understates local strain, while an arbitrarily thin band may be overly conservative. Without a displacement profile, the selected-width calculation is not a measured material strain.",
         "sourceIds": [
