       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Sampling and missed defects” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Asphalt-core embankment-dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "抽樣能提供品質證據但不能證明每處完美，漏檢機率取決於缺陷分布與樣本獨立性。沿同一路徑取樣可能高度相關，不能用樣本數誇大信心。 假設每個獨立樣本遇缺陷機率0.05，取20個仍全未遇到的機率0.95²⁰=0.35849；僅獨立均勻假設，不是抽樣計畫建議。 連續缺陷帶可被集中取樣完全避開，零缺陷樣本不等於零缺陷工程。若檢測方法本身靈敏度不足，增加相同測試次數也可能無法發現指定缺陷。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「品質抽樣漏檢機率」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Sampling supplies evidence rather than proof of perfection. Miss probability depends on defect distribution and independence, while samples along one track can be highly correlated and overstate confidence. Assume independent defect probability 0.05 per sample. Twenty samples all miss defects with probability 0.95²⁰=0.35849, under uniform independence and not as a sampling-plan recommendation. Clustered samples can entirely avoid a continuous defect band, so zero observed defects do not establish zero actual defects. Limited detection sensitivity may persist even after repeating the same test many times. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Sampling and missed defects” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設每個獨立樣本遇缺陷機率0.05，取20個仍全未遇到的機率0.95²⁰=0.35849；僅獨立均勻假設，不是抽樣計畫建議。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume independent defect probability 0.05 per sample.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「連續二十個樣本沒有缺陷就能證明整個心牆完全無缺陷。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
