       "objective": "從症狀倒推「品質抽樣漏檢機率」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Sampling and missed defects” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "連續缺陷帶可被集中取樣完全避開，零缺陷樣本不等於零缺陷工程。若檢測方法本身靈敏度不足，增加相同測試次數也可能無法發現指定缺陷。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Clustered samples can entirely avoid a continuous defect band, so zero observed defects do not establish zero actual defects. Limited detection sensitivity may persist even after repeating the same test many times. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若檢測方法本身靈敏度不足，增加相同測試次數也可能無法發現指定缺陷。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Limited detection sensitivity may persist even after repeating the same test many times.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「連續二十個樣本沒有缺陷就能證明整個心牆完全無缺陷。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Twenty defect-free samples prove that the entire asphalt core is completely defect-free.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
