       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b236-v15-38"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「材料老化與保留試樣」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Material ageing and retained specimens” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以保留試樣和取芯建立同條件比較，核對儲存環境、試驗溫度和載重速率；同時報告剛度、延性與滲透，並檢查差異來自材料老化還是不同取樣位置與壓實程度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare retained and field-cored specimens under matched conditions, checking storage, test temperature and loading rate. Report stiffness, ductility and permeability together and distinguish ageing from different sample locations or compaction levels in the dam. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以材料老化與保留試樣編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以保留試樣和取芯建立同條件比較，核對儲存環境、試驗溫度和載重速率；同時報告剛度、延性與滲透，並檢查差異來自材料老化還是不同取樣位置與壓實程度。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for material ageing and retained specimens, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare retained and field-cored specimens under matched conditions, checking storage, test temperature and loading rate. Report stiffness, ductility and permeability together and distinguish ageing from different sample locations or compaction levels in the dam.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：保留試樣的氧氣暴露可能與深埋心牆不同，不能直接把其老化年限當現地壽命。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Retained specimens may see different oxygen exposure from a buried core, preventing direct conversion to service life. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b236-v15-39-k1",
