       "observation": "現場實務：以裂隙開度與流量編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以不同水頭測試流量線性並核對升降壓遲滯，將水試與漿試結果分開；對照孔壁裂隙和示蹤連通資料，確認流量變化不是封塞漏流或裂隙被壓開。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for fracture aperture and flow, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Test flow linearity at several heads and compare loading-unloading hysteresis, separating water and grout tests. Check mapped fractures and tracer connections and rule out packer leakage or pressure-induced opening before interpreting aperture changes.",
