       "objective": "從症狀倒推「裂隙開度與流量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Fracture aperture and flow” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把水力開度當作幾何平均寬度會錯估可灌性，壓力上升也可能改變裂隙本身。若只用一次流量反算唯一開度，會掩蓋多通道等效結果的不唯一性。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Hydraulic aperture is not geometric mean width, and pressure can change the fracture itself. Inferring one unique aperture from one flow measurement hides the nonuniqueness of several equivalent conducting channels. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若只用一次流量反算唯一開度，會掩蓋多通道等效結果的不唯一性。",
