        {
         "id": "b237-v15-05-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：只要岩體能透水，同一裂隙就必定能讓任何水泥漿通過。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Any water-conducting fracture necessarily admits every cement grout mixture. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
