       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「顆粒尺寸與可灌性」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Particle size and groutability” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "核對實際混合漿液的粒徑與聚集狀態，用代表性裂隙試驗比較進出漿濃度；觀察壓力升高是否伴隨流量降低和濾餅形成，再與水試的通水性分別判讀。檢查回漿是否富含細料。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check particle size and agglomeration in the mixed grout and compare inlet and outlet concentration in representative fracture tests. Observe pressure rise with declining flow and cake formation, keeping interpretation separate from water conductivity. Check whether returned grout is enriched in fines. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以顆粒尺寸與可灌性編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。核對實際混合漿液的粒徑與聚集狀態，用代表性裂隙試驗比較進出漿濃度；觀察壓力升高是否伴隨流量降低和濾餅形成，再與水試的通水性分別判讀。檢查回漿是否富含細料。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for particle size and groutability, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check particle size and agglomeration in the mixed grout and compare inlet and outlet concentration in representative fracture tests. Observe pressure rise with declining flow and cake formation, keeping interpretation separate from water conductivity. Check whether returned grout is enriched in fines.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：細度證書不能代表混合後沒有團聚，孔口濾堵可能讓壓力上升卻沒有深部填充。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A fineness certificate does not exclude agglomeration after mixing. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
