       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Entrance filtration can raise pressure without deep filling, so high injection pressure alone can conceal a locally blocked entrance rather than a continuous curtain.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「只要岩體能透水，同一裂隙就必定能讓任何水泥漿通過。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
