       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Yield stress and penetration length” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以流變儀量測同齡期與溫度的降伏和塑性黏度，檢查剪切歷史影響；用裂隙模型比對停止前緣，並將材料凝結、濾堵與降伏造成的停流分開辨認。比較靜置後再剪切的反應。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure yield stress and plastic viscosity at matched age and temperature, checking shear history. Compare stopped fronts in fracture models and distinguish arrest caused by setting, filtration and yield behavior rather than assigning one cause automatically. Compare response after rest and renewed shearing. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以降伏應力與滲入距離編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以流變儀量測同齡期與溫度的降伏和塑性黏度，檢查剪切歷史影響；用裂隙模型比對停止前緣，並將材料凝結、濾堵與降伏造成的停流分開辨認。比較靜置後再剪切的反應。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for yield stress and penetration length, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure yield stress and plastic viscosity at matched age and temperature, checking shear history. Compare stopped fronts in fracture models and distinguish arrest caused by setting, filtration and yield behavior rather than assigning one cause automatically. Compare response after rest and renewed shearing.",
