       "objective": "說明「孔段壓力與水頭修正」如何影響壩基帷幕灌漿的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Stage pressure and head correction” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam-foundation curtain grouting”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "泵端壓力經過管路損失與高程差後才成為孔段壓力，再扣地下水壓得到驅動差。把表壓直接當岩體有效注入壓，會混淆量測位置與參考基準。 取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。假設表壓500 kPa、下行漿柱20 m且密度1500 kg/m³、管損50 kPa、地下水壓200 kPa，有效差544.3 kPa；靜態高程修正示例。 管損隨流量改變，停泵讀值不能直接代表注入時孔段壓力。高程方向若用錯符號會產生巨大偏差，還可能把地下水自然壓力誤算為注入效果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「孔段壓力與水頭修正」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Pump pressure changes through line loss and elevation before reaching the test stage. Subtracting groundwater pressure gives the driving difference, so gauge readings cannot directly represent effective injection pressure in the rock. Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s². Assume gauge pressure 500 kPa, twenty-metre descending grout column at 1500 kg/m³, line loss 50 kPa and groundwater pressure 200 kPa. Effective difference is 544.3 kPa, a head-correction example. Line losses vary with flow, so stopped-pump readings do not represent flowing stage pressure. A wrong elevation sign creates large error and can confuse natural groundwater pressure with injection-driven response. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Stage pressure and head correction” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s².",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「泵端表壓可不經高程和地下水修正直接當成孔段有效壓力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Pump gauge pressure directly equals effective stage pressure without elevation or groundwater correction.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「孔段壓力與水頭修正」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Stage pressure and head correction”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b237-v15-13-k1",
         "title": "孔段壓力與水頭修正",
