       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「孔段壓力與水頭修正」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Stage pressure and head correction” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "記錄壓力計與孔段高程、漿密度及流量，獨立估算管損後對照孔內量測；停流和流動狀態分別核對，確認符號和表壓零點未隨設備移動而混淆。以靜止漿柱作零流量對照。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Record gauge and stage elevations, grout density and flow, comparing corrected estimates with downhole measurement. Check flowing and stopped conditions separately and verify signs and gauge zero after equipment relocation. Use a stationary grout column as a zero-flow comparison. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以孔段壓力與水頭修正編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。記錄壓力計與孔段高程、漿密度及流量，獨立估算管損後對照孔內量測；停流和流動狀態分別核對，確認符號和表壓零點未隨設備移動而混淆。以靜止漿柱作零流量對照。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for stage pressure and head correction, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Record gauge and stage elevations, grout density and flow, comparing corrected estimates with downhole measurement. Check flowing and stopped conditions separately and verify signs and gauge zero after equipment relocation. Use a stationary grout column as a zero-flow comparison.",
