         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for stage pressure and head correction, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Record gauge and stage elevations, grout density and flow, comparing corrected estimates with downhole measurement. Check flowing and stopped conditions separately and verify signs and gauge zero after equipment relocation. Use a stationary grout column as a zero-flow comparison.",
