       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Stage pressure and head correction” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "管損隨流量改變，停泵讀值不能直接代表注入時孔段壓力。高程方向若用錯符號會產生巨大偏差，還可能把地下水自然壓力誤算為注入效果。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Line losses vary with flow, so stopped-pump readings do not represent flowing stage pressure. A wrong elevation sign creates large error and can confuse natural groundwater pressure with injection-driven response. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：高程方向若用錯符號會產生巨大偏差，還可能把地下水自然壓力誤算為注入效果。",
