         "text": "注入壓力若推開節理會改變岩體結構，吸漿量增加不一定代表成功填充。抬動應與原位應力、覆蓋及孔壓共同判讀，不能由固定深度比例推定全部條件。",
         "textEn": "Injection can open joints and change rock structure, so increased take is not automatically successful filling. Jacking interpretation requires in-situ stress, cover and pore pressure rather than one universal depth rule.",
