       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b237-v15-18"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「岩體抬動與壓力邊界」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Rock jacking and pressure boundaries” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "同步量測孔壓、表面抬動和鄰孔回應，檢查壓流曲線突變是否伴隨幾何改變；以獨立水準基準排除儀器漂移，將可逆壓縮和不可逆張開分開記錄。記錄遠離孔口的參考點位移。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure pore pressure, uplift and neighboring-hole response synchronously and test whether pressure-flow breaks accompany movement. Use an independent leveling reference to exclude drift and distinguish reversible deformation from irreversible opening. Record movement at reference points away from the hole. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以岩體抬動與壓力邊界編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。同步量測孔壓、表面抬動和鄰孔回應，檢查壓流曲線突變是否伴隨幾何改變；以獨立水準基準排除儀器漂移，將可逆壓縮和不可逆張開分開記錄。記錄遠離孔口的參考點位移。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for rock jacking and pressure boundaries, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure pore pressure, uplift and neighboring-hole response synchronously and test whether pressure-flow breaks accompany movement. Use an independent leveling reference to exclude drift and distinguish reversible deformation from irreversible opening. Record movement at reference points away from the hole.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：高壓造成新通道可能短期增加吸漿量，卻把漿液帶到非目標區。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Pressure-created paths can increase take while diverting grout away from its target. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
