         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for rock jacking and pressure boundaries, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure pore pressure, uplift and neighboring-hole response synchronously and test whether pressure-flow breaks accompany movement. Use an independent leveling reference to exclude drift and distinguish reversible deformation from irreversible opening. Record movement at reference points away from the hole.",
