       "objective": "從症狀倒推「岩體抬動與壓力邊界」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Rock jacking and pressure boundaries” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "高壓造成新通道可能短期增加吸漿量，卻把漿液帶到非目標區。若只追求耗漿量而不查抬動和回流，可能損害既有接觸或鄰近構造。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Pressure-created paths can increase take while diverting grout away from its target. Pursuing consumption without checking movement and returns can damage existing contacts or adjacent structures instead of improving the intended barrier. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若只追求耗漿量而不查抬動和回流，可能損害既有接觸或鄰近構造。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Pursuing consumption without checking movement and returns can damage existing contacts or adjacent structures instead of improving the intended barrier.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「吸漿量突然增加就必定表示帷幕填充效果變得更好。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A sudden increase in grout take necessarily indicates improved curtain filling.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
