         "text": "高壓造成新通道可能短期增加吸漿量，卻把漿液帶到非目標區。若只追求耗漿量而不查抬動和回流，可能損害既有接觸或鄰近構造。",
         "textEn": "Pressure-created paths can increase take while diverting grout away from its target. Pursuing consumption without checking movement and returns can damage existing contacts or adjacent structures instead of improving the intended barrier.",
