        {
         "id": "b237-v15-21-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：供漿總體積就是硬化後留在目標裂隙中的有效填充體積。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Total supplied grout equals the hardened effective volume retained in targeted fractures. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
