         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume treatment zone 100×20×3 m with equivalent fillable void fraction 0.01. Ideal volume is 60 m³; delivery 90 m³ leaves 30 m³ requiring source accounting rather than proving improvement.",
