       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for grout take and void estimate, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Account separately for supply, returns, equipment storage and surface escape, checking volume and solids by stage. Compare takes with mapped fractures and determine whether extreme values reflect one channel rather than uniformly increased voids. Cross-check mass-based and volume-based accounting.",
