         "text": "教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設流量10 L/min、孔段5 m、有效試壓0.8 MPa，線性換算到1 MPa為10/5×1/0.8=2.5 L/(min·m)；非直接滲透係數。",
         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume flow 10 L/min, stage length 5 m and effective pressure 0.8 MPa. Linear normalization to 1 MPa gives 2.5 L/(min·m), not a permeability coefficient directly.",
