       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Water-test normalization” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "核對有效壓力、孔段長度與封塞密封，繪升降壓流量曲線測線性；只在相同流況下比較前後結果，並保留原始各級數據，避免標準化掩蓋遲滯或漏流。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Verify effective pressure, stage length and packer seal and plot ascending and descending pressure-flow curves. Compare before and after only under equivalent regimes, retaining raw stages so normalization does not conceal hysteresis or leakage. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以壓水試驗標準化編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。核對有效壓力、孔段長度與封塞密封，繪升降壓流量曲線測線性；只在相同流況下比較前後結果，並保留原始各級數據，避免標準化掩蓋遲滯或漏流。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for water-test normalization, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Verify effective pressure, stage length and packer seal and plot ascending and descending pressure-flow curves. Compare before and after only under equivalent regimes, retaining raw stages so normalization does not conceal hysteresis or leakage.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：同樣標準化數值可能來自不同裂隙幾何和各向異性，不能直接換成唯一k值。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
