       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Water-test normalization” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "同樣標準化數值可能來自不同裂隙幾何和各向異性，不能直接換成唯一k值。封塞旁漏或孔壁損傷也會提高讀數，需用獨立證據區分。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Equal normalized values can arise from different fracture geometries and anisotropy and do not determine a unique k. Packer bypass and drilling damage also raise readings and require separate evidence to distinguish. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：封塞旁漏或孔壁損傷也會提高讀數，需用獨立證據區分。",
