         "text": "深孔會偏離設計線，孔口間距相符不代表深部間距相符。帷幕連續性依實際孔跡與可達處理範圍判讀，不能只按平面鑽孔圖驗收。",
         "textEn": "Deep holes deviate from design lines, so correct collar spacing does not establish spacing at depth. Curtain continuity depends on actual trajectories and treatment reach rather than the plan of drill collars alone.",
