       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Borehole deviation and curtain continuity” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "用分段測斜重建三維孔跡，將相鄰孔在同高程的距離畫出；對照驗證孔與示蹤連通，檢查最大間隙位置，並保留磁性干擾和定位不確定度。將最大偏距位置納入覆蓋圖。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Reconstruct three-dimensional paths with staged surveys and plot spacing between adjacent holes at equal elevations. Compare verification holes and tracer connectivity, identifying largest gaps while retaining magnetic and positional uncertainties. Include maximum-deviation locations in the coverage map. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以鑽孔偏斜與帷幕連續編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。用分段測斜重建三維孔跡，將相鄰孔在同高程的距離畫出；對照驗證孔與示蹤連通，檢查最大間隙位置，並保留磁性干擾和定位不確定度。將最大偏距位置納入覆蓋圖。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for borehole deviation and curtain continuity, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Reconstruct three-dimensional paths with staged surveys and plot spacing between adjacent holes at equal elevations. Compare verification holes and tracer connectivity, identifying largest gaps while retaining magnetic and positional uncertainties. Include maximum-deviation locations in the coverage map.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：兩孔朝相反方向偏移會在深部拉開大缺口，同向偏移則可能讓整排偏離目標。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Opposing deviations open deep gaps, while common-direction deviation shifts the row away from its target. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
