       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Borehole deviation and curtain continuity” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "兩孔朝相反方向偏移會在深部拉開大缺口，同向偏移則可能讓整排偏離目標。僅看平均偏斜角，會漏掉局部曲折造成的最近或最遠間距。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Opposing deviations open deep gaps, while common-direction deviation shifts the row away from its target. Mean deviation angle misses local curvature controlling the closest and widest spacing between treatment paths. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：僅看平均偏斜角，會漏掉局部曲折造成的最近或最遠間距。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Mean deviation angle misses local curvature controlling the closest and widest spacing between treatment paths.",
