       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for successive-hole take trends, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Group takes by geology, stage length and effective pressure, checking mix concentration and stopping conditions. Use independent water tests or verification holes to determine whether low-take regions retain connected fractures not intersected by treatment. Compare different mixture batches separately.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：先前孔堵住入口會使後續孔吸漿少，卻可能留下更遠通道；濃漿用量的重量與稀漿體積也不可直接比較。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Earlier entrance blockage lowers later take while leaving distant paths, and dense-grout mass cannot directly compare with dilute-grout volume. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
