         "text": "教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設五孔段在近似線性流況下，按1 MPa有效試壓標準化的單位孔長流量為1、1、2、3、20 L/(min·m)。平均(1+1+2+3+20)/5=5.4 L/(min·m)，中位2 L/(min·m)；非直接滲透係數，異常高值不能因中位低而刪除。",
         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume five stage flows per unit length, linearly normalized to effective test pressure 1 MPa under approximately linear flow, are 1, 1, 2, 3 and 20 L/(min·m). Mean (1+1+2+3+20)/5 is 5.4 L/(min·m) and median is 2 L/(min·m). These are not direct permeability coefficients; the high value cannot be discarded because the median is low.",
         "sourceIds": [
