       "quiz": {
        "question": "依「獨立驗證與統計分布」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？",
        "questionEn": "According to the quantitative model for \"Independent verification and distributions\", which statement holds?",
        "options": [
         "漿液塑性黏度低就代表不需要壓力梯度也能無限滲入。",
