       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「獨立驗證與統計分布」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Independent verification and distributions” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "將驗證孔獨立於施工孔選址，繪出每孔段結果與不確定度；同時報平均、中位和高值位置，對高值回查地質連通及測試完整性，避免只用摘要統計宣布合格。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Locate verification holes independently from treatment holes and map stage results with uncertainty. Report mean, median and high-value locations, investigating geology and test integrity at extremes instead of declaring success from summary statistics alone. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以獨立驗證與統計分布編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。將驗證孔獨立於施工孔選址，繪出每孔段結果與不確定度；同時報平均、中位和高值位置，對高值回查地質連通及測試完整性，避免只用摘要統計宣布合格。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for independent verification and distributions, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Locate verification holes independently from treatment holes and map stage results with uncertainty. Report mean, median and high-value locations, investigating geology and test integrity at extremes instead of declaring success from summary statistics alone.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：低中位值可能掩蓋穿越整個帷幕的單一高透水帶，而高值也可能是測試漏流。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A low median can hide one permeable band crossing the curtain, while a high value can reflect test leakage. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
