         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for independent verification and distributions, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Locate verification holes independently from treatment holes and map stage results with uncertainty. Report mean, median and high-value locations, investigating geology and test integrity at extremes instead of declaring success from summary statistics alone.",
