       "objective": "從症狀倒推「獨立驗證與統計分布」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Independent verification and distributions” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "低中位值可能掩蓋穿越整個帷幕的單一高透水帶，而高值也可能是測試漏流。缺乏位置與原始曲線時，統計不能分辨真正缺口和儀器假象。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A low median can hide one permeable band crossing the curtain, while a high value can reflect test leakage. Without location and raw curves, statistics cannot distinguish a real gap from an instrumentation artifact. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：缺乏位置與原始曲線時，統計不能分辨真正缺口和儀器假象。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Without location and raw curves, statistics cannot distinguish a real gap from an instrumentation artifact.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「驗證結果中位數很低就能忽略少數高透水孔段。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A low verification median allows highly permeable individual stages to be ignored.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b237-v15-40-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "低中位值可能掩蓋穿越整個帷幕的單一高透水帶，而高值也可能是測試漏流。缺乏位置與原始曲線時，統計不能分辨真正缺口和儀器假象。",
         "textEn": "A low median can hide one permeable band crossing the curtain, while a high value can reflect test leakage. Without location and raw curves, statistics cannot distinguish a real gap from an instrumentation artifact.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-grout",
          "b-src-water",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-gravity"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b237-v15-40-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-grout",
          "b-src-water",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-gravity"
         ]
