       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for hydraulic resistance and gallery head, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure reservoir and outlet levels, drain flow and node pressure together, checking mass balance before fitting conductance. Compare residuals across reservoir stages and verify that changing outlet submergence has not been mistaken for changing rock permeability.",
