       "objective": "以數值模型估算「揚壓分布與合力」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。",
       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Uplift distribution and resultant” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：取淡水單位重γw=9.81 kN/m³。假設每米壩長底寬40 m，水頭在x=0、10、40 m為40、10、5 m，分段線性積分水頭面積475 m²，揚力9.81×475=4659.75 kN/m。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Use freshwater unit weight γw=9.81 kN/m³. Assume base width 40 m and heads 40, 10 and 5 m at x=0, 10 and 40 m. Piecewise-linear head area 475 m² gives uplift 4659.75 kN/m. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：把孔壓計高程統一到壩底基準，以獨立水位計核對壓力換算；畫出各段面積及量測間距，改用合理上下包絡重算揚力，檢查少數測點對整體積分的控制程度。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Reduce piezometer readings to a common base datum and cross-check conversion with an independent water-level measure.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
       "checkEn": "Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b238-v15-06-k1",
         "title": "定量模型",
         "titleEn": "Quantitative model",
         "text": "教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：取淡水單位重γw=9.81 kN/m³。假設每米壩長底寬40 m，水頭在x=0、10、40 m為40、10、5 m，分段線性積分水頭面積475 m²，揚力9.81×475=4659.75 kN/m。",
         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Use freshwater unit weight γw=9.81 kN/m³. Assume base width 40 m and heads 40, 10 and 5 m at x=0, 10 and 40 m. Piecewise-linear head area 475 m² gives uplift 4659.75 kN/m.",
         "sourceIds": [
