       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「揚壓分布與合力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Uplift distribution and resultant” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "把孔壓計高程統一到壩底基準，以獨立水位計核對壓力換算；畫出各段面積及量測間距，改用合理上下包絡重算揚力，檢查少數測點對整體積分的控制程度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Reduce piezometer readings to a common base datum and cross-check conversion with an independent water-level measure. Plot segment areas and spacing, then integrate plausible upper and lower envelopes to assess how sparse readings control total uplift. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以揚壓分布與合力編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。把孔壓計高程統一到壩底基準，以獨立水位計核對壓力換算；畫出各段面積及量測間距，改用合理上下包絡重算揚力，檢查少數測點對整體積分的控制程度。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for uplift distribution and resultant, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Reduce piezometer readings to a common base datum and cross-check conversion with an independent water-level measure. Plot segment areas and spacing, then integrate plausible upper and lower envelopes to assess how sparse readings control total uplift.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：測點間可能有局部高透水裂隙，線性插值會低估壓力峰值。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Conductive fractures between instruments can produce pressure peaks missed by linear interpolation. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
