         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for uplift distribution and resultant, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Reduce piezometer readings to a common base datum and cross-check conversion with an independent water-level measure. Plot segment areas and spacing, then integrate plausible upper and lower envelopes to assess how sparse readings control total uplift.",
