       "objective": "從症狀倒推「排水孔間距與覆蓋」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Drain spacing and coverage” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "實際裂隙各向異性可能讓影響區狹長而非圓形，兩孔接近也未必相通。單一試驗水位得到的範圍可能隨裂隙開合改變，不能永久視為固定覆蓋圖。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Anisotropic fractures create elongated rather than circular influence regions, and close drains may remain disconnected. Coverage observed at one reservoir level can change as fractures open or close and is not a permanent geometric guarantee. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
