       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Conductance trend comparison” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "在相近季節與穩定水位窗口計算導度，核對流量計零點和孔口出流狀態；比對鄰孔及上游孔壓的同步趨勢，區分單孔阻塞、共同出口回水與整片岩體供水改變。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Calculate conductance in comparable seasons and steady-level windows, verifying flow-meter zero and outlet conditions. Compare adjacent drains and upstream piezometers to distinguish local obstruction, shared backwater and a broader change in rock-water supply. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以導水能力的趨勢比較編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。在相近季節與穩定水位窗口計算導度，核對流量計零點和孔口出流狀態；比對鄰孔及上游孔壓的同步趨勢，區分單孔阻塞、共同出口回水與整片岩體供水改變。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for conductance trend comparison, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Calculate conductance in comparable seasons and steady-level windows, verifying flow-meter zero and outlet conditions. Compare adjacent drains and upstream piezometers to distinguish local obstruction, shared backwater and a broader change in rock-water supply.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：流量下降同時伴隨水頭升高通常比單獨流量變化更值得調查，但仍不能僅憑比值定位沉積位置。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
