       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Conductance trend comparison” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "流量下降同時伴隨水頭升高通常比單獨流量變化更值得調查，但仍不能僅憑比值定位沉積位置。管路漏失或量測分流也可能造成表觀導度下降而非孔內堵塞。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Lower flow with higher head is more informative than flow alone, but the ratio does not locate deposits. Leakage in collection pipes or unmeasured diversions can reduce apparent conductance without an obstruction inside the drain. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
