       "objective": "說明「量水堰校正與低流量」如何影響壩基排水廊道的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Weir calibration and low flow” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam-foundation drainage galleries”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "量水堰把水頭轉為流量，非線性指數使水位零點誤差在低流量時特別重要。自由出流、堰口形狀與接近流速都屬校正條件，淹沒後不能照搬原關係式。 率定係數1.4的單位為m^0.5/s。假設已校正九十度三角堰Q=1.4h^2.5，h以m、Q以m³/s，h=0.1 m得0.004427 m³/s；水頭偏高2%約使Q偏高5.08%。 附著物改變堰口形狀，薄水舌黏附也會讓理想曲線失效。若只提高儀器顯示位數而未控制零點與出流狀態，流量數字看似精細卻可能系統性偏差。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「量水堰校正與低流量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A measuring weir converts head into flow through a nonlinear relation, making zero errors especially important at low flow. Free discharge, notch geometry and approach velocity are calibration conditions that submerged operation invalidates. The calibrated coefficient 1.4 has units m^0.5/s. Assume calibrated ninety-degree notch relation Q=1.4h^2.5 with SI units. At h=0.1 m, Q=0.004427 m³/s; a two-percent head bias raises discharge by approximately 5.08 percent. Deposits alter notch geometry and clinging nappes invalidate the ideal rating. More display digits do not improve accuracy when zero and discharge conditions are uncontrolled, leaving precise-looking flow records with systematic error. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Weir calibration and low flow” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：率定係數1.4的單位為m^0.5/s。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: The calibrated coefficient 1.4 has units m^0.5/s.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「量水堰水頭偏差百分之二，計算流量也一定只偏差百分之二。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A two-percent weir-head error always produces exactly a two-percent discharge error.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「量水堰校正與低流量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Weir calibration and low flow”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
