       "instructionEn": "Cross-check discharge by independent volumetric timing and inspect head-reading location, notch condition and downstream submergence. Propagate zero offsets through the rating curve, comparing relative error and detectable changes particularly at low heads. Check side leakage from the measuring chamber. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以量水堰校正與低流量編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以獨立容積計時法交叉查流量，檢查水頭讀取位置、堰口清潔與下游淹沒；將零點偏移傳遞到整條率定曲線，尤其比較低水頭時的相對誤差與可辨識流量變化。查核量水槽的側向漏水。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for weir calibration and low flow, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Cross-check discharge by independent volumetric timing and inspect head-reading location, notch condition and downstream submergence. Propagate zero offsets through the rating curve, comparing relative error and detectable changes particularly at low heads. Check side leakage from the measuring chamber.",
