       "objective": "從症狀倒推「量水堰校正與低流量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Weir calibration and low flow” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "附著物改變堰口形狀，薄水舌黏附也會讓理想曲線失效。若只提高儀器顯示位數而未控制零點與出流狀態，流量數字看似精細卻可能系統性偏差。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Deposits alter notch geometry and clinging nappes invalidate the ideal rating. More display digits do not improve accuracy when zero and discharge conditions are uncontrolled, leaving precise-looking flow records with systematic error. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若只提高儀器顯示位數而未控制零點與出流狀態，流量數字看似精細卻可能系統性偏差。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: More display digits do not improve accuracy when zero and discharge conditions are uncontrolled, leaving precise-looking flow records with systematic error.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「量水堰水頭偏差百分之二，計算流量也一定只偏差百分之二。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A two-percent weir-head error always produces exactly a two-percent discharge error.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b238-v15-20-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "附著物改變堰口形狀，薄水舌黏附也會讓理想曲線失效。若只提高儀器顯示位數而未控制零點與出流狀態，流量數字看似精細卻可能系統性偏差。",
         "textEn": "Deposits alter notch geometry and clinging nappes invalidate the ideal rating. More display digits do not improve accuracy when zero and discharge conditions are uncontrolled, leaving precise-looking flow records with systematic error.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-joints",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b238-v15-20-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-joints",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "在「量水堰校正與低流量」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？",
        "questionEn": "When \"Weir calibration and low flow\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?",
        "options": [
         "症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。",
         "多台泵的銘牌流量總和大於平均入流，就能保證集水井永不溢流。",
         "附著物改變堰口形狀，薄水舌黏附也會讓理想曲線失效。"
        ],
        "optionsEn": [
         "Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.",
