        "answer": 2,
        "explanation": "附著物改變堰口形狀，薄水舌黏附也會讓理想曲線失效。 需以量測區分可能原因。",
        "explanationEn": "Deposits alter notch geometry and clinging nappes invalidate the ideal rating. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."
