      {
       "id": "b238-v15-21",
       "title": "集水井的暫態平衡：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Sump transient balance: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usace-gravity",
        "v15s-usbr-joints",
        "b-src-water"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b238-v15-20"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「集水井的暫態平衡」如何影響壩基排水廊道的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Sump transient balance” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam-foundation drainage galleries”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "廊道集水井具有有限儲水量，平均抽排能力足夠仍可能在短時入流尖峰溢流。水量平衡應追蹤啟停延遲與共同排出管的限制，而非只把泵銘牌流量相加。 假設有效容積12 m³，入流0.03 m³/s而可用排流0.02 m³/s，淨增加0.01 m³/s，從空井填滿需1200 s即20 min；流量恆定、無額外容積。 液位計被泡沫或沉積干擾會延遲啟動判讀，共同排管堵塞可能同時降低多台泵能力。若把全部幾何容積當有效容積，便會高估可用緩衝時間。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「集水井的暫態平衡」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A gallery sump has finite storage, so adequate average pumping can still fail during an inflow peak. Storage balance must track start delay and common-discharge restrictions rather than merely summing pump nameplate capacities. Assume usable storage 12 m³, inflow 0.03 m³/s and available discharge 0.02 m³/s. Constant net inflow 0.01 m³/s fills the initially empty sump in 1200 seconds, or twenty minutes. Foam or sediment interferes with level sensing, while a blocked shared line can reduce several pumps simultaneously. Counting total geometric volume as usable storage overestimates buffering time and conceals the effect of activation thresholds. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Sump transient balance” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設有效容積12 m³，入流0.03 m³/s而可用排流0.02 m³/s，淨增加0.01 m³/s，從空井填滿需1200 s即20 min；流量恆定、無額外容積。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume usable storage 12 m³, inflow 0.03 m³/s and available discharge 0.02 m³/s.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「多台泵的銘牌流量總和大於平均入流，就能保證集水井永不溢流。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Total nameplate pump capacity above average inflow guarantees that a sump never overflows.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「集水井的暫態平衡」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Sump transient balance”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b238-v15-21-k1",
         "title": "集水井的暫態平衡",
         "titleEn": "Sump transient balance",
         "text": "廊道集水井具有有限儲水量，平均抽排能力足夠仍可能在短時入流尖峰溢流。水量平衡應追蹤啟停延遲與共同排出管的限制，而非只把泵銘牌流量相加。",
         "textEn": "A gallery sump has finite storage, so adequate average pumping can still fail during an inflow peak. Storage balance must track start delay and common-discharge restrictions rather than merely summing pump nameplate capacities.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-joints",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b238-v15-21-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：多台泵的銘牌流量總和大於平均入流，就能保證集水井永不溢流。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Total nameplate pump capacity above average inflow guarantees that a sump never overflows. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-joints",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
