        "answer": 0,
        "explanation": "廊道集水井具有有限儲水量，平均抽排能力足夠仍可能在短時入流尖峰溢流。 其餘選項是常見誤解。",
        "explanationEn": "A gallery sump has finite storage, so adequate average pumping can still fail during an inflow peak. The other options are common misconceptions."
