         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume usable storage 12 m³, inflow 0.03 m³/s and available discharge 0.02 m³/s. Constant net inflow 0.01 m³/s fills the initially empty sump in 1200 seconds, or twenty minutes.",
         "sourceIds": [
