        "answer": 1,
        "explanation": "教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設有效容積12 m³，入流0.03 m³/s而可用排流0.02 m³/s，淨增加0.01 m³/s，從空井填滿需1200 s即20 min；流量恆定、無額外容積。 重算時請保留單位。",
        "explanationEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume usable storage 12 m³, inflow 0.03 m³/s and available discharge 0.02 m³/s. Keep units when recalculating."
