      {
       "id": "b238-v15-23",
       "title": "集水井的暫態平衡：試驗與驗證",
       "titleEn": "Sump transient balance: testing and verification",
       "estimatedMinutes": 25,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usace-gravity",
        "v15s-usbr-joints",
        "b-src-water"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b238-v15-22"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「集水井的暫態平衡」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Sump transient balance” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "把液位記錄換算成容積，對照實測入流與泵出量檢查水量閉合；用設備測試資料核對啟動延遲及共同管路背壓，並把電源中斷期間的可用儲水獨立計算。核對止回閥是否造成倒流。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Convert level records to volume and compare measured inflow and pumping to close the balance. Use equipment test evidence to check start delay and shared-line backpressure, calculating available storage separately during power interruption. Check reverse flow through the discharge check valve. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以集水井的暫態平衡編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。把液位記錄換算成容積，對照實測入流與泵出量檢查水量閉合；用設備測試資料核對啟動延遲及共同管路背壓，並把電源中斷期間的可用儲水獨立計算。核對止回閥是否造成倒流。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for sump transient balance, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Convert level records to volume and compare measured inflow and pumping to close the balance. Use equipment test evidence to check start delay and shared-line backpressure, calculating available storage separately during power interruption. Check reverse flow through the discharge check valve.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：液位計被泡沫或沉積干擾會延遲啟動判讀，共同排管堵塞可能同時降低多台泵能力。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Foam or sediment interferes with level sensing, while a blocked shared line can reduce several pumps simultaneously. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b238-v15-23-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "把液位記錄換算成容積，對照實測入流與泵出量檢查水量閉合；用設備測試資料核對啟動延遲及共同管路背壓，並把電源中斷期間的可用儲水獨立計算。核對止回閥是否造成倒流。",
         "textEn": "Convert level records to volume and compare measured inflow and pumping to close the balance. Use equipment test evidence to check start delay and shared-line backpressure, calculating available storage separately during power interruption. Check reverse flow through the discharge check valve.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-joints",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b238-v15-23-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "以集水井的暫態平衡編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。把液位記錄換算成容積，對照實測入流與泵出量檢查水量閉合；用設備測試資料核對啟動延遲及共同管路背壓，並把電源中斷期間的可用儲水獨立計算。核對止回閥是否造成倒流。",
         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for sump transient balance, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Convert level records to volume and compare measured inflow and pumping to close the balance. Use equipment test evidence to check start delay and shared-line backpressure, calculating available storage separately during power interruption. Check reverse flow through the discharge check valve.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-joints",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
