       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Gallery heat and ventilation scale” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設設備顯熱12 kW、空氣密度1.2 kg/m³、比熱1005 J/(kg·K)、容許教學溫升5 K，Q=12000/(1.2×1005×5)=1.990 m³/s；忽略潛熱與岩體交換。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume sensible heat 12 kW, air density 1.2 kg/m³, heat capacity 1005 J/(kg·K) and teaching rise 5 K. Flow is 1.990 m³/s, excluding latent heat and rock exchange. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：量測設備輸入與散熱比例，在進出口及支廊分別記錄溫濕度和風量；用煙流或等效非侵入示蹤確認短路與死角，將熱平衡殘差留給濕氣和岩體熱交換判讀。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Measure equipment power and heat fractions and record temperature, humidity and flow at inlets, outlets and branches.",
