       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「廊道熱量與通風尺度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Gallery heat and ventilation scale” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "量測設備輸入與散熱比例，在進出口及支廊分別記錄溫濕度和風量；用煙流或等效非侵入示蹤確認短路與死角，將熱平衡殘差留給濕氣和岩體熱交換判讀。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure equipment power and heat fractions and record temperature, humidity and flow at inlets, outlets and branches. Use appropriate nonintrusive tracing to identify short circuits and stagnant regions, retaining balance residuals for moisture and rock heat exchange. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以廊道熱量與通風尺度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。量測設備輸入與散熱比例，在進出口及支廊分別記錄溫濕度和風量；用煙流或等效非侵入示蹤確認短路與死角，將熱平衡殘差留給濕氣和岩體熱交換判讀。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for gallery heat and ventilation scale, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure equipment power and heat fractions and record temperature, humidity and flow at inlets, outlets and branches. Use appropriate nonintrusive tracing to identify short circuits and stagnant regions, retaining balance residuals for moisture and rock heat exchange.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：總風量符合估算仍可能有局部停滯區，濕氣凝結會影響設備與表面耐久。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Adequate total airflow can coexist with stagnant zones, and condensation affects equipment and surface durability. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b238-v15-27-k1",
