         "text": "量測設備輸入與散熱比例，在進出口及支廊分別記錄溫濕度和風量；用煙流或等效非侵入示蹤確認短路與死角，將熱平衡殘差留給濕氣和岩體熱交換判讀。",
         "textEn": "Measure equipment power and heat fractions and record temperature, humidity and flow at inlets, outlets and branches. Use appropriate nonintrusive tracing to identify short circuits and stagnant regions, retaining balance residuals for moisture and rock heat exchange.",
