         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for gallery heat and ventilation scale, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure equipment power and heat fractions and record temperature, humidity and flow at inlets, outlets and branches. Use appropriate nonintrusive tracing to identify short circuits and stagnant regions, retaining balance residuals for moisture and rock heat exchange.",
