       "objective": "從症狀倒推「廊道熱量與通風尺度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Gallery heat and ventilation scale” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "總風量符合估算仍可能有局部停滯區，濕氣凝結會影響設備與表面耐久。只用平均溫度判斷環境充分性，會漏掉獨立的氣體風險和人員活動需求。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Adequate total airflow can coexist with stagnant zones, and condensation affects equipment and surface durability. Average temperature alone overlooks separate gas hazards and occupancy requirements, so the heat calculation cannot establish overall environmental suitability. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：只用平均溫度判斷環境充分性，會漏掉獨立的氣體風險和人員活動需求。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Average temperature alone overlooks separate gas hazards and occupancy requirements, so the heat calculation cannot establish overall environmental suitability.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「只要顯熱通風計算合格，就不必再評估廊道氣體與濕度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Passing the sensible-heat ventilation calculation removes any need to assess gallery gases or humidity.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
