      {
       "id": "b238-v15-29",
       "title": "廊道開孔的應力集中：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Gallery opening stress concentration: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usace-gravity",
        "v15s-usbr-joints",
        "b-src-water"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b238-v15-28"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「廊道開孔的應力集中」如何影響壩基排水廊道的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Gallery opening stress concentration” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam-foundation drainage galleries”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "廊道是壩體或岩體中的開孔，周圍應力會重分布，局部峰值取決於形狀、遠場荷載與襯砌接觸。圓孔彈性解可用作數值模型的基準，但不代表矩形廊道真實角隅。 假設無內壓圓孔位於無限均質等向線彈性體，遠場單軸壓應力4 MPa，孔邊最大環向壓應力3σ=12 MPa；忽略節理與有限邊界。 尖角的數值應力峰值可能是理想幾何奇異而非可直接使用的材料應力，節理滑移又可能改變受力路徑。只比較最大值而不查平均區域和變形，會誤判損傷。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「廊道開孔的應力集中」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A gallery opening redistributes stress in concrete or rock, with local peaks controlled by geometry, far-field loading and lining contact. A circular elastic solution benchmarks numerical models but does not represent the corners of a rectangular gallery. Assume an unpressurized circular hole in an infinite homogeneous isotropic linear-elastic medium under uniaxial compression 4 MPa. Maximum boundary hoop compression is 12 MPa, excluding joints and finite boundaries. A sharp-corner peak can be a geometric singularity rather than directly usable material stress, while joint slip changes load paths. Comparing maxima without averaging-region and deformation checks can therefore misidentify damage or apparent numerical improvement. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Gallery opening stress concentration” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設無內壓圓孔位於無限均質等向線彈性體，遠場單軸壓應力4 MPa，孔邊最大環向壓應力3σ=12 MPa；忽略節理與有限邊界。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume an unpressurized circular hole in an infinite homogeneous isotropic linear-elastic medium under uniaxial compression 4 MPa.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「圓孔的三倍應力係數可直接套用到任何矩形廊道角隅。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"The circular-hole factor of three applies directly to every rectangular-gallery corner.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「廊道開孔的應力集中」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Gallery opening stress concentration”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b238-v15-29-k1",
         "title": "廊道開孔的應力集中",
         "titleEn": "Gallery opening stress concentration",
         "text": "廊道是壩體或岩體中的開孔，周圍應力會重分布，局部峰值取決於形狀、遠場荷載與襯砌接觸。圓孔彈性解可用作數值模型的基準，但不代表矩形廊道真實角隅。",
         "textEn": "A gallery opening redistributes stress in concrete or rock, with local peaks controlled by geometry, far-field loading and lining contact. A circular elastic solution benchmarks numerical models but does not represent the corners of a rectangular gallery.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-joints",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b238-v15-29-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：圓孔的三倍應力係數可直接套用到任何矩形廊道角隅。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: The circular-hole factor of three applies directly to every rectangular-gallery corner. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-joints",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "關於「廊道開孔的應力集中」，下列哪一項敘述正確？",
        "questionEn": "Which statement about \"Gallery opening stress concentration\" is correct?",
        "options": [
         "圓孔的三倍應力係數可直接套用到任何矩形廊道角隅。",
         "出水溶解物濃度比進水低，就能確定全部差值都沉積在排水孔內。",
         "廊道是壩體或岩體中的開孔，周圍應力會重分布，局部峰值取決於形狀、遠場荷載與襯砌接觸。"
