        "answer": 2,
        "explanation": "廊道是壩體或岩體中的開孔，周圍應力會重分布，局部峰值取決於形狀、遠場荷載與襯砌接觸。 其餘選項是常見誤解。",
        "explanationEn": "A gallery opening redistributes stress in concrete or rock, with local peaks controlled by geometry, far-field loading and lining contact. The other options are common misconceptions."
