       ],
       "objective": "以數值模型估算「廊道開孔的應力集中」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。",
       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Gallery opening stress concentration” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設無內壓圓孔位於無限均質等向線彈性體，遠場單軸壓應力4 MPa，孔邊最大環向壓應力3σ=12 MPa；忽略節理與有限邊界。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume an unpressurized circular hole in an infinite homogeneous isotropic linear-elastic medium under uniaxial compression 4 MPa. Maximum boundary hoop compression is 12 MPa, excluding joints and finite boundaries. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：先以圓孔基準檢查網格和符號，再換入實際斷面與接觸條件；比對不同位置應變及收斂量，分開溫度變形與荷載反應，並檢查局部峰值是否隨網格細化發散。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Benchmark mesh and signs against the circular solution before introducing actual geometry and contacts.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
       "checkEn": "Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b238-v15-30-k1",
         "title": "定量模型",
         "titleEn": "Quantitative model",
         "text": "教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設無內壓圓孔位於無限均質等向線彈性體，遠場單軸壓應力4 MPa，孔邊最大環向壓應力3σ=12 MPa；忽略節理與有限邊界。",
         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume an unpressurized circular hole in an infinite homogeneous isotropic linear-elastic medium under uniaxial compression 4 MPa. Maximum boundary hoop compression is 12 MPa, excluding joints and finite boundaries.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
