       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for gallery opening stress concentration, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Benchmark mesh and signs against the circular solution before introducing actual geometry and contacts. Compare strain and convergence at several locations, separate thermal movement from loading, and test whether local peaks diverge with mesh refinement.",
