     "description": "本階段聚焦「析出沉積與質量收支」與「壓力差的不確定度」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Precipitation deposits and mass balance\" and \"Pressure-difference uncertainty\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
