       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Precipitation deposits and mass balance” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "在同一水團停留時間下配對進出水採樣，分析懸浮與溶解部分並核對溫度酸鹼值；把預估累積量與實際沉積稱量及管徑變化對照，檢查是否有混合稀釋。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Pair inlet and outlet samples with travel time, separating suspended and dissolved fractions and recording temperature and pH. Compare predicted accumulation with measured deposits and diameter change, testing whether dilution rather than precipitation explains the concentration difference. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以析出沉積與質量收支編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。在同一水團停留時間下配對進出水採樣，分析懸浮與溶解部分並核對溫度酸鹼值；把預估累積量與實際沉積稱量及管徑變化對照，檢查是否有混合稀釋。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for precipitation deposits and mass balance, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Pair inlet and outlet samples with travel time, separating suspended and dissolved fractions and recording temperature and pH. Compare predicted accumulation with measured deposits and diameter change, testing whether dilution rather than precipitation explains the concentration difference.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：不同比例水源混合會造成濃度降低而沒有沉積，採樣瓶內反應也會改變結果。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
