      {
       "id": "b238-v15-37",
       "title": "壓力差的不確定度：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Pressure-difference uncertainty: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usace-gravity",
        "v15s-usbr-joints",
        "b-src-water"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b238-v15-36"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「壓力差的不確定度」如何影響壩基排水廊道的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Pressure-difference uncertainty” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam-foundation drainage galleries”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "判斷壓差趨勢需要把儀器隨機不確定度與共同系統偏差分開。兩個讀值的差可能抵消同源零點，也可能共享溫度誤差；是否相關決定合成規則。 假設兩壓力讀值的獨立零均值標準不確定度為2與3 kPa，壓差標準不確定度sqrt(2²+3²)=3.606 kPa；若相關係數0.5則為sqrt(13−6)=2.646 kPa。 把實際觀測偏差直接平方和開根號不是合成標準不確定度，忽略相關性也會高估或低估壓差誤差。小幅變化若低於量測可辨識尺度，不能逕自解讀成性能改善。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「壓力差的不確定度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Interpreting pressure differences requires separating random uncertainty from shared systematic bias. A common zero may cancel while temperature errors remain correlated, so covariance determines how the uncertainties of two readings combine. Assume independent zero-mean standard uncertainties 2 and 3 kPa. Difference uncertainty is 3.606 kPa; correlation 0.5 changes it to sqrt(13−6)=2.646 kPa, with systematic bias assessed separately. Root-summing observed offsets is not uncertainty propagation, and ignoring correlation can overstate or understate difference uncertainty. Changes below measurement resolution and uncertainty cannot automatically be interpreted as improved hydraulic performance. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Pressure-difference uncertainty” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設兩壓力讀值的獨立零均值標準不確定度為2與3 kPa，壓差標準不確定度sqrt(2²+3²)=3.606 kPa；若相關係數0.5則為sqrt(13−6)=2.646 kPa。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume independent zero-mean standard uncertainties 2 and 3 kPa.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「兩個壓力感測器的誤差不論是否相關都可以一律平方和開根號。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Errors of two pressure sensors can always be root-sum-squared regardless of correlation.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「壓力差的不確定度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Pressure-difference uncertainty”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b238-v15-37-k1",
         "title": "壓力差的不確定度",
         "titleEn": "Pressure-difference uncertainty",
         "text": "判斷壓差趨勢需要把儀器隨機不確定度與共同系統偏差分開。兩個讀值的差可能抵消同源零點，也可能共享溫度誤差；是否相關決定合成規則。",
         "textEn": "Interpreting pressure differences requires separating random uncertainty from shared systematic bias. A common zero may cancel while temperature errors remain correlated, so covariance determines how the uncertainties of two readings combine.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usace-gravity",
          "v15s-usbr-joints",
          "b-src-water"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b238-v15-37-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
