       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for pressure-difference uncertainty, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Calibrate both instruments against a common pressure source and record residual covariance, checking shared cabling and temperature compensation. Add uncertainty bands to trend plots and list uncorrected biases separately rather than treating resolution as accuracy. Compare differences before and after common-zero correction.",
