       "objective": "從症狀倒推「壓力差的不確定度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pressure-difference uncertainty” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "把實際觀測偏差直接平方和開根號不是合成標準不確定度，忽略相關性也會高估或低估壓差誤差。小幅變化若低於量測可辨識尺度，不能逕自解讀成性能改善。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Root-summing observed offsets is not uncertainty propagation, and ignoring correlation can overstate or understate difference uncertainty. Changes below measurement resolution and uncertainty cannot automatically be interpreted as improved hydraulic performance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：小幅變化若低於量測可辨識尺度，不能逕自解讀成性能改善。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Changes below measurement resolution and uncertainty cannot automatically be interpreted as improved hydraulic performance.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「兩個壓力感測器的誤差不論是否相關都可以一律平方和開根號。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
