   "workedExample": {
    "title": "原創假想算例與邊界",
    "titleEn": "Original hypothetical example and boundaries",
    "text": "本課原創比較練習分兩個相互獨立的物理模型。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設單塊長24 m、線膨脹係數10⁻⁵/K、均勻降溫12 K，自由收縮αLΔT=2.88 mm；不把它當兩塊接縫的直接實測開度。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設接縫面60×20 m、等效平均開度2 mm，幾何空隙2.4 m³；供漿2.8 m³扣回流0.2與管存0.1 m³，表觀留存2.5 m³，差0.1 m³需解釋。先逐一圈出公式內的控制體、力方向或時間尺度，再把每項輸入的量綱換成一致單位。第二人只根據輸入重算結果，不抄第一人的中間數字。最後指出這兩個估算尚未包含的空間變化、非線性及量測誤差；若將結果用於另一座工程，必須重建其幾何、材料與邊界條件，不能挪用本練習的假設。 自由熱收縮敏感度固定單塊長24 m與α=10⁻⁵/K，只將均勻降溫量由12增至18 K。ΔL=αLΔT由2.88增至4.32 mm，增加50%。比較保持自由收縮邊界；若塊體受到拘束，額外冷卻可能轉化為應力而非相同的位移，兩塊之間的接縫實際開度還取決於各自運動和接觸狀態。",
    "textEn": "This original comparison exercise uses two independent physical models. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume block length 24 m, expansion coefficient 10⁻⁵/K and uniform cooling 12 K. Free contraction is 2.88 mm, not directly the measured aperture between two restrained blocks. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume joint area 60×20 m and mean aperture 2 mm, giving 2.4 m³. Supply 2.8 minus return 0.2 and line storage 0.1 gives apparent retention 2.5 m³, requiring explanation of the difference. First identify the control volume, force direction or time scale in each relation, then convert every input to consistent units. A second reviewer recalculates from the inputs without copying intermediate numbers. Finally identify spatial variability, nonlinear effects and measurement errors omitted by both estimates. Transfer to another structure requires rebuilding its geometry, material description and boundary conditions; the assumed classroom inputs are not transferable design or operating parameters. For free-contraction sensitivity, hold block length at 24 m and α=10⁻⁵/K fixed, increasing only uniform cooling from 12 K to 18 K. ΔL=αLΔT rises from 2.88 to 4.32 mm, or 50%. The comparison retains free contraction; restraint may turn added cooling into stress rather than the same displacement, while actual joint aperture depends on both blocks and their contact state.",
    "assumptions": "數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。",
    "assumptionsEn": "Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.",
    "sourceScope": "原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。",
    "sourceScopeEn": "Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."
   },
   "dossier": {
    "facts": [
     "教學24 m混凝土塊降溫12 K，自由收縮2.88 mm。",
     "教學1200 m²接縫平均開度2 mm，幾何體積2.4 m³。",
     "教學理想縫寬0.3降至0.1 mm，層流減96.296%。",
     "教學10 m靜止漿柱壓力差176.58 kPa。",
     "教學薄層剛度200 GN/m，1 MN壓力造成5 micrometres壓縮。",
     "教學壓力衰減時間常數50 s、半衰時間34.657 s。"
    ],
    "factsEn": [
     "A teaching twenty-four-metre block cooling twelve kelvin contracts freely by 2.88 mm.",
     "Teaching joint area 1200 m² at two-millimetre aperture gives volume 2.4 m³.",
     "Teaching ideal gap decrease from 0.3 to 0.1 mm reduces laminar flow by 96.296 percent.",
     "Teaching stationary ten-metre grout column gives pressure difference 176.58 kPa.",
     "Teaching layer stiffness 200 GN/m gives five micrometres compression under 1 MN.",
     "Teaching pressure-decay time constant is fifty seconds and half-life 34.657 seconds."
    ],
    "timeline": [
     "1976　重力壩設計專書出版，提供混凝土分塊與接縫背景。",
     "1994　工兵團拱壩設計手冊出版，提供封拱與三維傳力背景。",
     "2017　工兵團灌漿技術手冊出版，作材料與驗證方法參照。"
    ],
    "timelineEn": [
     "1976 — Gravity-dam design guidance is published, providing context for concrete blocks and joints.",
     "1994 — USACE arch-dam guidance is published, supporting closure and three-dimensional load-transfer context.",
     "2017 — USACE Grouting Technology is published as a reference for materials and verification methods."
    ],
    "codes": [
     "美國工兵團拱壩設計手冊，EM 1110-2-2201，1994",
