   "stages": [
    {
     "id": "b239-v15-s1",
     "title": "水文條件、邊界與工程系統",
     "titleEn": "Hydrology, boundaries and engineering system",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「冷卻收縮與接縫開度」與「分區接縫的體積平衡」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Cooling contraction and joint aperture\" and \"Compartment grout-volume balance\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b239-v15-01",
       "title": "冷卻收縮與接縫開度：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Cooling contraction and joint aperture: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usace-arch-2",
        "v15s-usace-grout",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-joints"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [],
       "objective": "說明「冷卻收縮與接縫開度」如何影響大壩接縫灌漿的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Cooling contraction and joint aperture” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam contraction-joint grouting”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "分塊混凝土冷卻會收縮，接縫灌漿時的溫度決定後續可用的接觸狀態。自由收縮估算只給幾何尺度，實際開縫還受基礎約束、相鄰塊體與非均勻溫度控制。 假設單塊長24 m、線膨脹係數10⁻⁵/K、均勻降溫12 K，自由收縮αLΔT=2.88 mm；不把它當兩塊接縫的直接實測開度。 表面冷卻不代表塊體內部已達同溫，若僅依外氣溫度判讀封拱時機，會低估後續收縮。接縫閉合也可能只是局部接觸，並非全高同時形成傳力面。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「冷卻收縮與接縫開度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Cooling contracts concrete, and the thermal state at joint grouting influences later contact. Free contraction provides a geometric scale, while foundation restraint, neighboring blocks and nonuniform temperature determine actual aperture and its spatial distribution. Assume block length 24 m, expansion coefficient 10⁻⁵/K and uniform cooling 12 K. Free contraction is 2.88 mm, not directly the measured aperture between two restrained blocks. Surface cooling does not establish uniform internal temperature, so air temperature alone underestimates later contraction. Local joint closure can also occur before full-height contact, leaving an incomplete load-transfer surface despite a closed reading at one elevation. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Cooling contraction and joint aperture” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設單塊長24 m、線膨脹係數10⁻⁵/K、均勻降溫12 K，自由收縮αLΔT=2.88 mm；不把它當兩塊接縫的直接實測開度。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume block length 24 m, expansion coefficient 10⁻⁵/K and uniform cooling 12 K.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「用當日外氣溫度就能直接推定整塊混凝土的接縫開度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Daily air temperature directly determines the aperture throughout an entire concrete-block joint.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「冷卻收縮與接縫開度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Cooling contraction and joint aperture”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b239-v15-01-k1",
         "title": "冷卻收縮與接縫開度",
         "titleEn": "Cooling contraction and joint aperture",
         "text": "分塊混凝土冷卻會收縮，接縫灌漿時的溫度決定後續可用的接觸狀態。自由收縮估算只給幾何尺度，實際開縫還受基礎約束、相鄰塊體與非均勻溫度控制。",
         "textEn": "Cooling contracts concrete, and the thermal state at joint grouting influences later contact. Free contraction provides a geometric scale, while foundation restraint, neighboring blocks and nonuniform temperature determine actual aperture and its spatial distribution.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-arch-2",
          "v15s-usace-grout",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-joints"
         ]
