        {
         "id": "b239-v15-01-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：用當日外氣溫度就能直接推定整塊混凝土的接縫開度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Daily air temperature directly determines the aperture throughout an entire concrete-block joint. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
