       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「冷卻收縮與接縫開度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Cooling contraction and joint aperture” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "對照埋設溫度計與多高程縫寬計的時序，先分辨均勻冷卻及局部梯度；以獨立基準檢查儀器零點，再將實測開度與自由收縮界限比較，查明約束造成的差異。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare embedded temperatures and joint meters at several elevations, separating uniform cooling from local gradients. Check instrument zeros independently and compare observed aperture against free-contraction scale to identify the effect of restraint and differential block movement. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以冷卻收縮與接縫開度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。對照埋設溫度計與多高程縫寬計的時序，先分辨均勻冷卻及局部梯度；以獨立基準檢查儀器零點，再將實測開度與自由收縮界限比較，查明約束造成的差異。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for cooling contraction and joint aperture, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare embedded temperatures and joint meters at several elevations, separating uniform cooling from local gradients. Check instrument zeros independently and compare observed aperture against free-contraction scale to identify the effect of restraint and differential block movement.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：表面冷卻不代表塊體內部已達同溫，若僅依外氣溫度判讀封拱時機，會低估後續收縮。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Surface cooling does not establish uniform internal temperature, so air temperature alone underestimates later contraction. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
