      {
       "id": "b239-v15-05",
       "title": "分區接縫的體積平衡：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Compartment grout-volume balance: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usace-arch-2",
        "v15s-usace-grout",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-joints"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b239-v15-04"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「分區接縫的體積平衡」如何影響大壩接縫灌漿的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Compartment grout-volume balance” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam contraction-joint grouting”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "接縫灌漿應以分區幾何、管路容積和實際回流建立收支。平均開度乘面積只是初估，止漿邊界、鍵槽和局部接觸會造成體積分布不均。 假設接縫面60×20 m、等效平均開度2 mm，幾何空隙2.4 m³；供漿2.8 m³扣回流0.2與管存0.1 m³，表觀留存2.5 m³，差0.1 m³需解釋。 耗量超過理論空隙可能是外漏或鄰區串通，少於理論量也可能是入口濾堵。只用總量相近宣告充填完成，會掩蓋上部空洞或局部連通缺口。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「分區接縫的體積平衡」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Joint grouting requires compartment geometry, line storage and measured returns in its volume account. Mean aperture times area is only an estimate because seals, shear keys and localized contact create uneven available volume. Assume joint area 60×20 m and mean aperture 2 mm, giving 2.4 m³. Supply 2.8 minus return 0.2 and line storage 0.1 gives apparent retention 2.5 m³, requiring explanation of the difference. Excess take can indicate escape or communication with another compartment, while low take can reflect entrance blockage. Agreement in total volume alone hides upper voids and local connected gaps rather than establishing uniform filling. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Compartment grout-volume balance” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設接縫面60×20 m、等效平均開度2 mm，幾何空隙2.4 m³；供漿2.8 m³扣回流0.2與管存0.1 m³，表觀留存2.5 m³，差0.1 m³需解釋。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume joint area 60×20 m and mean aperture 2 mm, giving 2.4 m³.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「供漿體積與理論接縫體積相同，就能證明接縫每處都填滿。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Equal supplied and theoretical joint volumes prove that every part of the joint is filled.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「分區接縫的體積平衡」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Compartment grout-volume balance”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b239-v15-05-k1",
         "title": "分區接縫的體積平衡",
         "titleEn": "Compartment grout-volume balance",
         "text": "接縫灌漿應以分區幾何、管路容積和實際回流建立收支。平均開度乘面積只是初估，止漿邊界、鍵槽和局部接觸會造成體積分布不均。",
         "textEn": "Joint grouting requires compartment geometry, line storage and measured returns in its volume account. Mean aperture times area is only an estimate because seals, shear keys and localized contact create uneven available volume.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-arch-2",
          "v15s-usace-grout",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-joints"
         ]
