         "id": "b239-v15-05-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：供漿體積與理論接縫體積相同，就能證明接縫每處都填滿。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Equal supplied and theoretical joint volumes prove that every part of the joint is filled. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
