         "titleEn": "Quantitative model",
         "text": "教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設接縫面60×20 m、等效平均開度2 mm，幾何空隙2.4 m³；供漿2.8 m³扣回流0.2與管存0.1 m³，表觀留存2.5 m³，差0.1 m³需解釋。",
         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume joint area 60×20 m and mean aperture 2 mm, giving 2.4 m³. Supply 2.8 minus return 0.2 and line storage 0.1 gives apparent retention 2.5 m³, requiring explanation of the difference.",
         "sourceIds": [
