       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Compartment grout-volume balance” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "耗量超過理論空隙可能是外漏或鄰區串通，少於理論量也可能是入口濾堵。只用總量相近宣告充填完成，會掩蓋上部空洞或局部連通缺口。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Excess take can indicate escape or communication with another compartment, while low take can reflect entrance blockage. Agreement in total volume alone hides upper voids and local connected gaps rather than establishing uniform filling. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：只用總量相近宣告充填完成，會掩蓋上部空洞或局部連通缺口。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Agreement in total volume alone hides upper voids and local connected gaps rather than establishing uniform filling.",
