       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「殘留通道與立方敏感性」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Residual channels and cubic sensitivity” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "在相同水頭下比較前後滲流並追蹤各分區出口，核對是否把水轉移到未量測通道；用示蹤到達時間和溫度訊號交叉查連通性，避免只依總集水量估算殘留開度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare leakage at matched head and trace compartment outlets to detect diversion into unmeasured paths. Cross-check connectivity using tracer travel time and temperature signals rather than inferring residual aperture from total collection flow alone. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以殘留通道與立方敏感性編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。在相同水頭下比較前後滲流並追蹤各分區出口，核對是否把水轉移到未量測通道；用示蹤到達時間和溫度訊號交叉查連通性，避免只依總集水量估算殘留開度。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for residual channels and cubic sensitivity, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare leakage at matched head and trace compartment outlets to detect diversion into unmeasured paths. Cross-check connectivity using tracer travel time and temperature signals rather than inferring residual aperture from total collection flow alone.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：局部裂縫紊流、粗糙與壓力張開都會偏離立方律，旁路還可能繞過已填區。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
