       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Residual channels and cubic sensitivity” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "局部裂縫紊流、粗糙與壓力張開都會偏離立方律，旁路還可能繞過已填區。若把理想降幅當成材料保證，會漏掉真正控制滲漏的最薄弱連通段。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Turbulence, roughness and pressure-induced opening violate the cubic idealization, while bypasses avoid treated regions. Treating the ideal reduction as a material guarantee misses the weakest connected segment that actually governs leakage. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若把理想降幅當成材料保證，會漏掉真正控制滲漏的最薄弱連通段。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Treating the ideal reduction as a material guarantee misses the weakest connected segment that actually governs leakage.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「填滿接縫體積百分之九十，就一定能把滲漏流量降低百分之九十。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
