         "text": "灌入時連續的漿體可能因析水、沉降與體積變化在上緣留下空隙。新拌材料體積並不等於硬化填充體積，分區上部尤其需要獨立證據而非只看出漿顏色。",
         "textEn": "Initially continuous grout can leave upper voids through bleeding, settlement and volume change. Fresh volume is not hardened filled volume, and upper compartment regions require independent evidence rather than relying on the appearance of returns.",
