       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「析水與硬化後空隙」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Bleeding and hardened voids” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以現場同溫同齡期樣品量析水與沉降，記錄容器形狀對結果的影響；把分區頂部回流與後續接觸檢查對照，辨認自由水滯留、材料收縮和真正未充填的差別。比較受限薄縫試體的結果。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure bleeding and settlement in samples at matched temperature and age, recording container effects. Compare upper-compartment returns with later contact checks to distinguish retained free water, material shrinkage and genuinely unfilled regions. Compare results from a confined thin-gap specimen. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以析水與硬化後空隙編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以現場同溫同齡期樣品量析水與沉降，記錄容器形狀對結果的影響；把分區頂部回流與後續接觸檢查對照，辨認自由水滯留、材料收縮和真正未充填的差別。比較受限薄縫試體的結果。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for bleeding and hardened voids, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure bleeding and settlement in samples at matched temperature and age, recording container effects. Compare upper-compartment returns with later contact checks to distinguish retained free water, material shrinkage and genuinely unfilled regions. Compare results from a confined thin-gap specimen.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：小型量筒的析水比例不一定可直接放大到受限薄縫，泌水又可能沿通道外排。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
