       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Ignoring confinement and drainage can mistake an extreme geometric void for actual damage or overlook a localized unfilled pocket.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「只要新拌漿液充滿接縫，硬化後就不可能再形成任何空隙。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Once fresh grout fills a joint, no void can develop during hardening.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
