         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "小型量筒的析水比例不一定可直接放大到受限薄縫，泌水又可能沿通道外排。忽略拘束與水路會把最壞幾何空隙誤當實際缺陷，或相反漏掉局部空洞。",
         "textEn": "Cylinder bleeding does not scale directly to confined thin joints, and bleed water can leave through channels. Ignoring confinement and drainage can mistake an extreme geometric void for actual damage or overlook a localized unfilled pocket.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-arch-2",
          "v15s-usace-grout",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-joints"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b239-v15-20-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-arch-2",
          "v15s-usace-grout",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-joints"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
