         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume activation energy 40 kJ/mol and R=8.314 J/(mol·K). Relative rate at 303.15 K versus 293.15 K is 1.718, an idealized comparison rather than a setting-time guarantee.",
