       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b239-v15-22"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「溫度與材料反應速率」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Temperature and reaction rate” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "量測混合桶、輸送末端與試體溫度，將流動度和強度資料對照等效齡期；用不同溫度試驗檢查單一活化能是否適用，並保留發熱、失水與剪切歷史造成的偏差。核對試體失水與現地差異。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure temperatures at mixing, delivery and specimens and compare flowability and strength against equivalent age. Test whether one activation energy fits several temperatures, retaining discrepancies caused by self-heating, moisture loss and shear history. Check specimen moisture loss against field conditions. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以溫度與材料反應速率編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。量測混合桶、輸送末端與試體溫度，將流動度和強度資料對照等效齡期；用不同溫度試驗檢查單一活化能是否適用，並保留發熱、失水與剪切歷史造成的偏差。核對試體失水與現地差異。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for temperature and reaction rate, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure temperatures at mixing, delivery and specimens and compare flowability and strength against equivalent age. Test whether one activation energy fits several temperatures, retaining discrepancies caused by self-heating, moisture loss and shear history. Check specimen moisture loss against field conditions.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：材料反應不是全程單一速率，外加劑可改變誘導期，桶內發熱也會讓試體失去代表性。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Reaction does not follow one rate throughout; admixtures alter induction and self-heating changes sample representativeness. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
