         "textEn": "Measure temperatures at mixing, delivery and specimens and compare flowability and strength against equivalent age. Test whether one activation energy fits several temperatures, retaining discrepancies caused by self-heating, moisture loss and shear history. Check specimen moisture loss against field conditions.",
