         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for temperature and reaction rate, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure temperatures at mixing, delivery and specimens and compare flowability and strength against equivalent age. Test whether one activation energy fits several temperatures, retaining discrepancies caused by self-heating, moisture loss and shear history. Check specimen moisture loss against field conditions.",
