       "objective": "說明「填充層的法向柔度」如何影響大壩接縫灌漿的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Normal compliance of the filled layer” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam contraction-joint grouting”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "接縫傳力不只取決於漿材強度，也取決於厚度、接觸面積與閉合後的柔度。薄層線彈性估算可以比較變形量級，但局部未黏結、粗糙接觸與裂縫會讓有效剛度降低。 假設有效模數0.5 GPa、面積2 m²、厚5 mm，法向剛度EA/t=200 GN/m；壓力合力1 MN造成5 micrometres壓縮，完全接觸線彈性假設。 若有效接觸面積低於幾何面積，平均應力與剛度估算都會失真。接觸閉合具有非線性，用高載階段的斜率回推低載狀態會低估早期變形。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「填充層的法向柔度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Joint load transfer depends on thickness, contact area and compliance as well as grout strength. A thin-layer elastic estimate compares movement scales, while debonding, rough contacts and cracks reduce the effective stiffness from the ideal value. Assume effective modulus 0.5 GPa, area 2 m² and thickness 5 mm. Normal stiffness is 200 GN/m, giving five micrometres compression under 1 MN with full elastic contact. Effective area below geometric area distorts both average stress and stiffness. Contact closure is nonlinear, so extrapolating a high-load slope to the initial low-load regime underestimates early movement and conceals gaps. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Normal compliance of the filled layer” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設有效模數0.5 GPa、面積2 m²、厚5 mm，法向剛度EA/t=200 GN/m；壓力合力1 MN造成5 micrometres壓縮，完全接觸線彈性假設。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume effective modulus 0.5 GPa, area 2 m² and thickness 5 mm.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「漿材抗壓強度相同就代表不同厚度接縫具有相同法向剛度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Equal grout compressive strength means joints of different thickness have identical normal stiffness.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「填充層的法向柔度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Normal compliance of the filled layer”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
