         "text": "接縫傳力不只取決於漿材強度，也取決於厚度、接觸面積與閉合後的柔度。薄層線彈性估算可以比較變形量級，但局部未黏結、粗糙接觸與裂縫會讓有效剛度降低。",
         "textEn": "Joint load transfer depends on thickness, contact area and compliance as well as grout strength. A thin-layer elastic estimate compares movement scales, while debonding, rough contacts and cracks reduce the effective stiffness from the ideal value.",
         "sourceIds": [
