       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b239-v15-26"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「填充層的法向柔度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Normal compliance of the filled layer” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以可辨識小變形的量測配置比較載重和閉合曲線，先扣除設備與相鄰混凝土柔度；檢查卸載回線、空間分布和溫度漂移，判別材料壓縮是否混入接觸面重新貼合。檢查量測架本身的變形。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Measure load and closure with sufficient small-displacement resolution, subtracting equipment and adjacent-concrete compliance. Examine unloading loops, spatial variation and thermal drift to distinguish material compression from renewed contact between initially separated surfaces. Check deformation of the measurement frame itself. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以填充層的法向柔度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以可辨識小變形的量測配置比較載重和閉合曲線，先扣除設備與相鄰混凝土柔度；檢查卸載回線、空間分布和溫度漂移，判別材料壓縮是否混入接觸面重新貼合。檢查量測架本身的變形。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for normal compliance of the filled layer, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure load and closure with sufficient small-displacement resolution, subtracting equipment and adjacent-concrete compliance. Examine unloading loops, spatial variation and thermal drift to distinguish material compression from renewed contact between initially separated surfaces. Check deformation of the measurement frame itself.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：若有效接觸面積低於幾何面積，平均應力與剛度估算都會失真。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Effective area below geometric area distorts both average stress and stiffness. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b239-v15-27-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "以可辨識小變形的量測配置比較載重和閉合曲線，先扣除設備與相鄰混凝土柔度；檢查卸載回線、空間分布和溫度漂移，判別材料壓縮是否混入接觸面重新貼合。檢查量測架本身的變形。",
         "textEn": "Measure load and closure with sufficient small-displacement resolution, subtracting equipment and adjacent-concrete compliance. Examine unloading loops, spatial variation and thermal drift to distinguish material compression from renewed contact between initially separated surfaces. Check deformation of the measurement frame itself.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-arch-2",
          "v15s-usace-grout",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-joints"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b239-v15-27-k2",
         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "以填充層的法向柔度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以可辨識小變形的量測配置比較載重和閉合曲線，先扣除設備與相鄰混凝土柔度；檢查卸載回線、空間分布和溫度漂移，判別材料壓縮是否混入接觸面重新貼合。檢查量測架本身的變形。",
         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for normal compliance of the filled layer, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure load and closure with sufficient small-displacement resolution, subtracting equipment and adjacent-concrete compliance. Examine unloading loops, spatial variation and thermal drift to distinguish material compression from renewed contact between initially separated surfaces. Check deformation of the measurement frame itself.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-arch-2",
          "v15s-usace-grout",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-joints"
