       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b239-v15-27"
       ],
       "objective": "從症狀倒推「填充層的法向柔度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Normal compliance of the filled layer” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "若有效接觸面積低於幾何面積，平均應力與剛度估算都會失真。接觸閉合具有非線性，用高載階段的斜率回推低載狀態會低估早期變形。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Effective area below geometric area distorts both average stress and stiffness. Contact closure is nonlinear, so extrapolating a high-load slope to the initial low-load regime underestimates early movement and conceals gaps. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：接觸閉合具有非線性，用高載階段的斜率回推低載狀態會低估早期變形。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Contact closure is nonlinear, so extrapolating a high-load slope to the initial low-load regime underestimates early movement and conceals gaps.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「漿材抗壓強度相同就代表不同厚度接縫具有相同法向剛度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Equal grout compressive strength means joints of different thickness have identical normal stiffness.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b239-v15-28-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "若有效接觸面積低於幾何面積，平均應力與剛度估算都會失真。接觸閉合具有非線性，用高載階段的斜率回推低載狀態會低估早期變形。",
         "textEn": "Effective area below geometric area distorts both average stress and stiffness. Contact closure is nonlinear, so extrapolating a high-load slope to the initial low-load regime underestimates early movement and conceals gaps.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-arch-2",
          "v15s-usace-grout",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-joints"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b239-v15-28-k2",
         "title": "根因確認",
         "titleEn": "Root-cause confirmation",
         "text": "根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。",
         "textEn": "Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-arch-2",
          "v15s-usace-grout",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-joints"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "在「填充層的法向柔度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？",
        "questionEn": "When \"Normal compliance of the filled layer\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?",
        "options": [
         "所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。",
         "若有效接觸面積低於幾何面積，平均應力與剛度估算都會失真。",
         "接縫完成後的受力只取決於最終幾何，與施工順序和封拱溫度無關。"
