        "explanation": "若有效接觸面積低於幾何面積，平均應力與剛度估算都會失真。 需以量測區分可能原因。",
        "explanationEn": "Effective area below geometric area distorts both average stress and stiffness. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."
       },
       "unit": 7,
       "unitFacet": "failure"
