      {
       "id": "b239-v15-29",
       "title": "封拱後的荷載分配：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Load sharing after closure: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usace-arch-2",
        "v15s-usace-grout",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-joints"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b239-v15-28"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「封拱後的荷載分配」如何影響大壩接縫灌漿的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Load sharing after closure” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam contraction-joint grouting”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "接縫填充使原本分開的塊體形成新的傳力路徑，施工先後和當時溫度會留下初始應力。平行剛度模型可示範共同位移的分擔，但不能取代三維拱壩的分階段分析。 假設兩路徑剛度30及20 GN/m、共同承受10 MN，位移P/(k1+k2)=0.2 mm，分力6與4 MN；無初始間隙和預應力的線彈性示例。 若一條路徑尚有間隙，荷載不會立即按兩個剛度分配；溫度或混凝土徐變也會重新分配內力。只以最終幾何一次加載，會漏掉施工歷程造成的初始狀態。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「封拱後的荷載分配」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Filling joints creates load paths between previously separate blocks, while sequence and temperature establish initial stress. Parallel springs demonstrate compatible load sharing but do not replace staged three-dimensional analysis of an arch dam. Assume parallel stiffnesses 30 and 20 GN/m sharing 10 MN. Common displacement is 0.2 mm and forces are 6 and 4 MN, excluding initial gaps and prestress. A gapped path does not immediately share load in proportion to stiffness, and temperature or creep redistributes force. Loading only the final geometry misses the initial state created by the actual construction sequence. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Load sharing after closure” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設兩路徑剛度30及20 GN/m、共同承受10 MN，位移P/(k1+k2)=0.2 mm，分力6與4 MN；無初始間隙和預應力的線彈性示例。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume parallel stiffnesses 30 and 20 GN/m sharing 10 MN.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「接縫完成後的受力只取決於最終幾何，與施工順序和封拱溫度無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Post-grouting forces depend only on final geometry, regardless of sequence or closure temperature.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「封拱後的荷載分配」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Load sharing after closure”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b239-v15-29-k1",
         "title": "封拱後的荷載分配",
         "titleEn": "Load sharing after closure",
         "text": "接縫填充使原本分開的塊體形成新的傳力路徑，施工先後和當時溫度會留下初始應力。平行剛度模型可示範共同位移的分擔，但不能取代三維拱壩的分階段分析。",
         "textEn": "Filling joints creates load paths between previously separate blocks, while sequence and temperature establish initial stress. Parallel springs demonstrate compatible load sharing but do not replace staged three-dimensional analysis of an arch dam.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-arch-2",
          "v15s-usace-grout",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-joints"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b239-v15-29-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：接縫完成後的受力只取決於最終幾何，與施工順序和封拱溫度無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Post-grouting forces depend only on final geometry, regardless of sequence or closure temperature. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-arch-2",
          "v15s-usace-grout",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals",
          "v15s-usbr-joints"
         ]
        }
       ],
       "quiz": {
        "question": "關於「封拱後的荷載分配」，下列哪一項敘述正確？",
        "questionEn": "Which statement about \"Load sharing after closure\" is correct?",
        "options": [
         "接縫完成後的受力只取決於最終幾何，與施工順序和封拱溫度無關。",
         "只量到一個壓力半衰時間，就能唯一算出接縫的滲漏導度。",
         "接縫填充使原本分開的塊體形成新的傳力路徑，施工先後和當時溫度會留下初始應力。"
