        "answer": 2,
        "explanation": "接縫填充使原本分開的塊體形成新的傳力路徑，施工先後和當時溫度會留下初始應力。 其餘選項是常見誤解。",
        "explanationEn": "Filling joints creates load paths between previously separate blocks, while sequence and temperature establish initial stress. The other options are common misconceptions."
