       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b239-v15-29"
       ],
       "objective": "以數值模型估算「封拱後的荷載分配」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。",
       "objectiveEn": "Estimate the key quantities of “Load sharing after closure” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.",
       "instruction": "依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設兩路徑剛度30及20 GN/m、共同承受10 MN，位移P/(k1+k2)=0.2 mm，分力6與4 MN；無初始間隙和預應力的線彈性示例。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。",
       "instructionEn": "Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume parallel stiffnesses 30 and 20 GN/m sharing 10 MN. Common displacement is 0.2 mm and forces are 6 and 4 MN, excluding initial gaps and prestress. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.",
       "observation": "如何核對：在分階段模型中保存每步初始應變與接觸狀態，核對反力總和與共同位移；對照封拱前後應變計及壩頂位移，檢查量測變化是否與預測的新傳力路徑一致。",
       "observationEn": "How to cross-check: Preserve initial strains and contacts in staged analysis, checking reaction balance and compatible displacement.",
       "failure": "計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。",
       "failureEn": "Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.",
       "check": "依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。",
       "checkEn": "Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b239-v15-30-k1",
         "title": "定量模型",
         "titleEn": "Quantitative model",
         "text": "教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設兩路徑剛度30及20 GN/m、共同承受10 MN，位移P/(k1+k2)=0.2 mm，分力6與4 MN；無初始間隙和預應力的線彈性示例。",
         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume parallel stiffnesses 30 and 20 GN/m sharing 10 MN. Common displacement is 0.2 mm and forces are 6 and 4 MN, excluding initial gaps and prestress.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-arch-2",
          "v15s-usace-grout",
