       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「封拱後的荷載分配」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Load sharing after closure” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "在分階段模型中保存每步初始應變與接觸狀態，核對反力總和與共同位移；對照封拱前後應變計及壩頂位移，檢查量測變化是否與預測的新傳力路徑一致。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Preserve initial strains and contacts in staged analysis, checking reaction balance and compatible displacement. Compare strain gauges and crest movement before and after closure to test whether observed changes match the predicted new load path. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以封拱後的荷載分配編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。在分階段模型中保存每步初始應變與接觸狀態，核對反力總和與共同位移；對照封拱前後應變計及壩頂位移，檢查量測變化是否與預測的新傳力路徑一致。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for load sharing after closure, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Preserve initial strains and contacts in staged analysis, checking reaction balance and compatible displacement. Compare strain gauges and crest movement before and after closure to test whether observed changes match the predicted new load path.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：若一條路徑尚有間隙，荷載不會立即按兩個剛度分配；溫度或混凝土徐變也會重新分配內力。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: A gapped path does not immediately share load in proportion to stiffness, and temperature or creep redistributes force. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b239-v15-31-k1",
         "title": "驗證方法",
         "titleEn": "Verification method",
         "text": "在分階段模型中保存每步初始應變與接觸狀態，核對反力總和與共同位移；對照封拱前後應變計及壩頂位移，檢查量測變化是否與預測的新傳力路徑一致。",
         "textEn": "Preserve initial strains and contacts in staged analysis, checking reaction balance and compatible displacement. Compare strain gauges and crest movement before and after closure to test whether observed changes match the predicted new load path.",
