         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for load sharing after closure, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Preserve initial strains and contacts in staged analysis, checking reaction balance and compatible displacement. Compare strain gauges and crest movement before and after closure to test whether observed changes match the predicted new load path.",
