       "objective": "從症狀倒推「封拱後的荷載分配」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Load sharing after closure” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "若一條路徑尚有間隙，荷載不會立即按兩個剛度分配；溫度或混凝土徐變也會重新分配內力。只以最終幾何一次加載，會漏掉施工歷程造成的初始狀態。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A gapped path does not immediately share load in proportion to stiffness, and temperature or creep redistributes force. Loading only the final geometry misses the initial state created by the actual construction sequence. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：只以最終幾何一次加載，會漏掉施工歷程造成的初始狀態。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Loading only the final geometry misses the initial state created by the actual construction sequence.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「接縫完成後的受力只取決於最終幾何，與施工順序和封拱溫度無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Post-grouting forces depend only on final geometry, regardless of sequence or closure temperature.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b239-v15-32-k1",
         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "若一條路徑尚有間隙，荷載不會立即按兩個剛度分配；溫度或混凝土徐變也會重新分配內力。只以最終幾何一次加載，會漏掉施工歷程造成的初始狀態。",
         "textEn": "A gapped path does not immediately share load in proportion to stiffness, and temperature or creep redistributes force. Loading only the final geometry misses the initial state created by the actual construction sequence.",
         "sourceIds": [
