     "id": "b239-v15-s5",
     "title": "耐久、維護與工程交接",
     "titleEn": "Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「壓力衰減與漏失辨識」與「波速檢測與接觸證據」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Pressure decay and loss diagnosis\" and \"Wave velocity and contact evidence\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b239-v15-33",
       "title": "壓力衰減與漏失辨識：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Pressure decay and loss diagnosis: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
