       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「壓力衰減與漏失辨識」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pressure decay and loss diagnosis” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "先用已知密閉容積校正設備儲量，記錄溫度、含氣與閥件漏失，再擬合多時段壓力曲線；比較流量收支與壓力模型殘差，確認單指數衰減是否足以描述資料。另量閥件單獨封閉的漏率。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Calibrate equipment storage with a known sealed volume and record temperature, entrained air and valve leakage before fitting pressure segments. Compare flow balance and model residuals to determine whether one exponential adequately represents the observations. Measure valve leakage separately with the joint isolated. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以壓力衰減與漏失辨識編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。先用已知密閉容積校正設備儲量，記錄溫度、含氣與閥件漏失，再擬合多時段壓力曲線；比較流量收支與壓力模型殘差，確認單指數衰減是否足以描述資料。另量閥件單獨封閉的漏率。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for pressure decay and loss diagnosis, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Calibrate equipment storage with a known sealed volume and record temperature, entrained air and valve leakage before fitting pressure segments. Compare flow balance and model residuals to determine whether one exponential adequately represents the observations. Measure valve leakage separately with the joint isolated.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：壓力計漂移、閥漏與漿材凝結會產生非水力衰減，單一半衰時間無法分開導度和儲量。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Gauge drift, valve leakage and setting introduce nonhydraulic decay, while one half-life cannot separate storage from conductance. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
