         "textEn": "Calibrate equipment storage with a known sealed volume and record temperature, entrained air and valve leakage before fitting pressure segments. Compare flow balance and model residuals to determine whether one exponential adequately represents the observations. Measure valve leakage separately with the joint isolated.",
