       "objective": "從症狀倒推「壓力衰減與漏失辨識」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pressure decay and loss diagnosis” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "壓力計漂移、閥漏與漿材凝結會產生非水力衰減，單一半衰時間無法分開導度和儲量。若不獨立量測其中一項，就存在多組參數都能符合相同曲線。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Gauge drift, valve leakage and setting introduce nonhydraulic decay, while one half-life cannot separate storage from conductance. Without independent measurement, multiple parameter combinations fit the same curve and do not uniquely establish joint tightness. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若不獨立量測其中一項，就存在多組參數都能符合相同曲線。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Without independent measurement, multiple parameter combinations fit the same curve and do not uniquely establish joint tightness.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「只量到一個壓力半衰時間，就能唯一算出接縫的滲漏導度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"One measured pressure half-life uniquely determines the leakage conductance of a joint.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
       "knowledge": [
