         "text": "壓力計漂移、閥漏與漿材凝結會產生非水力衰減，單一半衰時間無法分開導度和儲量。若不獨立量測其中一項，就存在多組參數都能符合相同曲線。",
         "textEn": "Gauge drift, valve leakage and setting introduce nonhydraulic decay, while one half-life cannot separate storage from conductance. Without independent measurement, multiple parameter combinations fit the same curve and do not uniquely establish joint tightness.",
