       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for wave velocity and contact evidence, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Repeat measurements with matched coupling, temperature and moisture, testing travel-time reciprocity in several directions. Compare anomalies with aperture, borehole observations and loading response to verify that fast paths have not bypassed the interface being evaluated.",
