       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Wave velocity and contact evidence” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "首波拾取偏差可與小接縫延遲同量級，濕裂縫也可能傳波而不傳剪。將單一路徑速度直接換成全接縫黏結百分比，會把訊號品質與材料行為混為一談。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "First-arrival picking error can rival the joint delay, and a wet crack may transmit waves without shear capacity. Converting one velocity into a whole-joint bonded percentage confuses signal quality with actual mechanical behavior. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
