     "id": "b240-v15-s1",
     "title": "水文條件、邊界與工程系統",
     "titleEn": "Hydrology, boundaries and engineering system",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「施工期洪水暴露」與「明渠導流的過水能力」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Construction-period flood exposure\" and \"Open-channel diversion capacity\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b240-v15-01",
       "title": "施工期洪水暴露：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Construction-period flood exposure: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usace-coffer",
        "v15s-usbr-construction",
        "b-src-water",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [],
       "objective": "說明「施工期洪水暴露」如何影響大壩施工導流的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Construction-period flood exposure” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “River diversion during dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "施工導流的風險與暴露時間及洪水季節分布有關，重現期不是保證多久才發生一次。短期工程仍可能遇到大洪水，且後果隨開挖、圍堰和永久壩體所處階段改變。 假設每年超越機率0.05、各年獨立且平穩，三年內至少一次超越1−(1−0.05)³=0.142625即14.2625%；不代表季節施工窗口機率。 把全年機率直接按月份等比例縮小會忽略季節集中，連續年份的氣候相關性也會破壞獨立假設。即使超越機率相同，不同階段的損失與恢復時間仍可能完全不同。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「施工期洪水暴露」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Diversion risk depends on exposure duration and seasonal flood distribution. Return period is not a guaranteed waiting time, and consequences change as excavation, cofferdams and permanent works pass through different construction stages. Assume annual exceedance probability 0.05 with independent stationary years. At least one exceedance in three years has probability 0.142625, or 14.2625 percent, not a seasonal-window probability. Dividing annual probability in proportion to months ignores seasonality, and climate persistence violates independence. Equal exceedance probabilities can also correspond to very different losses and recovery times at different stages of construction. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Construction-period flood exposure” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設每年超越機率0.05、各年獨立且平穩，三年內至少一次超越1−(1−0.05)³=0.142625即14.2625%；不代表季節施工窗口機率。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume annual exceedance probability 0.05 with independent stationary years.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「二十年重現期洪水表示施工開始後前十九年都不可能發生。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"A twenty-year return period means that flood cannot occur during the first nineteen years.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「施工期洪水暴露」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Construction-period flood exposure”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b240-v15-01-k1",
         "title": "施工期洪水暴露",
         "titleEn": "Construction-period flood exposure",
         "text": "施工導流的風險與暴露時間及洪水季節分布有關，重現期不是保證多久才發生一次。短期工程仍可能遇到大洪水，且後果隨開挖、圍堰和永久壩體所處階段改變。",
         "textEn": "Diversion risk depends on exposure duration and seasonal flood distribution. Return period is not a guaranteed waiting time, and consequences change as excavation, cofferdams and permanent works pass through different construction stages.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-coffer",
          "v15s-usbr-construction",
          "b-src-water",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b240-v15-01-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：二十年重現期洪水表示施工開始後前十九年都不可能發生。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: A twenty-year return period means that flood cannot occur during the first nineteen years. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
