       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b240-v15-02"
       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「施工期洪水暴露」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Construction-period flood exposure” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以施工階段對應水文資料期間，區分全年年最大值與特定月份事件；查核長期趨勢和上游調控變更，將每階段暴露、洪峰不確定度及淹水後果列成可追溯的風險表。另列洪水樣本的季節涵蓋。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Match construction stages to hydrologic records, distinguishing annual maxima from events in selected months. Check long-term trends and upstream regulation changes, recording stage exposure, peak uncertainty and inundation consequences in a traceable risk assessment. Document seasonal coverage of the flood sample separately. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以施工期洪水暴露編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以施工階段對應水文資料期間，區分全年年最大值與特定月份事件；查核長期趨勢和上游調控變更，將每階段暴露、洪峰不確定度及淹水後果列成可追溯的風險表。另列洪水樣本的季節涵蓋。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for construction-period flood exposure, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Match construction stages to hydrologic records, distinguishing annual maxima from events in selected months. Check long-term trends and upstream regulation changes, recording stage exposure, peak uncertainty and inundation consequences in a traceable risk assessment. Document seasonal coverage of the flood sample separately.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把全年機率直接按月份等比例縮小會忽略季節集中，連續年份的氣候相關性也會破壞獨立假設。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Dividing annual probability in proportion to months ignores seasonality, and climate persistence violates independence. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
