         "textEn": "Match construction stages to hydrologic records, distinguishing annual maxima from events in selected months. Check long-term trends and upstream regulation changes, recording stage exposure, peak uncertainty and inundation consequences in a traceable risk assessment. Document seasonal coverage of the flood sample separately.",
