         "text": "把全年機率直接按月份等比例縮小會忽略季節集中，連續年份的氣候相關性也會破壞獨立假設。即使超越機率相同，不同階段的損失與恢復時間仍可能完全不同。",
         "textEn": "Dividing annual probability in proportion to months ignores seasonality, and climate persistence violates independence. Equal exceedance probabilities can also correspond to very different losses and recovery times at different stages of construction.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-coffer",
          "v15s-usbr-construction",
          "b-src-water",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals"
