      {
       "id": "b240-v15-05",
       "title": "明渠導流的過水能力：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Open-channel diversion capacity: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usace-coffer",
        "v15s-usbr-construction",
        "b-src-water",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b240-v15-04"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「明渠導流的過水能力」如何影響大壩施工導流的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Open-channel diversion capacity” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “River diversion during dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "明渠能力取決於斷面、水力半徑、坡度與粗糙度，不能只看開挖面積。均勻流公式可初估穩定長渠，但入口、彎道和下游回水需要另行評估。 SI制曼寧係數n的單位為s/m^(1/3)。假設矩形渠寬10 m、水深3 m、曼寧n=0.025、坡度0.001，A=30 m²、R=30/16=1.875 m，Q=AR^(2/3)S^0.5/n=57.701 m³/s；均勻流。 局部收縮或彎道可能先控制水位，堆料和漂流物又會降低有效斷面。若只增加平均水深來滿足公式流量，可能漏掉局部溢頂或岸坡沖蝕問題。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「明渠導流的過水能力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Open-channel capacity depends on section, hydraulic radius, slope and roughness, not excavated area alone. Uniform-flow relations estimate a long stable reach, while entrance effects, bends and downstream backwater require separate analysis. The SI Manning coefficient n has units s/m^(1/3). Assume rectangular width 10 m, depth 3 m, Manning n=0.025 and slope 0.001. Area is 30 m² and radius 1.875 m, giving uniform-flow capacity approximately 57.701 m³/s. A contraction or bend can control stage before the uniform reach does, while stored material and debris reduce effective area. Increasing assumed average depth to meet discharge can overlook local overtopping or bank erosion. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Open-channel diversion capacity” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：SI制曼寧係數n的單位為s/m^(1/3)。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: The SI Manning coefficient n has units s/m^(1/3).",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「導流明渠只要開挖面積相同，就一定具有相同的過流能力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Diversion channels with equal excavated area necessarily have identical flow capacity.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「明渠導流的過水能力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Open-channel diversion capacity”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b240-v15-05-k1",
         "title": "明渠導流的過水能力",
         "titleEn": "Open-channel diversion capacity",
         "text": "明渠能力取決於斷面、水力半徑、坡度與粗糙度，不能只看開挖面積。均勻流公式可初估穩定長渠，但入口、彎道和下游回水需要另行評估。",
         "textEn": "Open-channel capacity depends on section, hydraulic radius, slope and roughness, not excavated area alone. Uniform-flow relations estimate a long stable reach, while entrance effects, bends and downstream backwater require separate analysis.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-coffer",
          "v15s-usbr-construction",
          "b-src-water",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b240-v15-05-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：導流明渠只要開挖面積相同，就一定具有相同的過流能力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Diversion channels with equal excavated area necessarily have identical flow capacity. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-coffer",
          "v15s-usbr-construction",
          "b-src-water",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals"
         ]
        }
