         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: The SI Manning coefficient n has units s/m^(1/3). Assume rectangular width 10 m, depth 3 m, Manning n=0.025 and slope 0.001. Area is 30 m² and radius 1.875 m, giving uniform-flow capacity approximately 57.701 m³/s.",
         "sourceIds": [
