       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for open-channel diversion capacity, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check measured bed and water-surface profiles for near-uniform flow, recording roughness and obstructions by reach. Recalculate backwater for different tailwaters and verify section discharge with velocities rather than assuming bed slope always equals energy slope.",
