       "instruction": "局部收縮或彎道可能先控制水位，堆料和漂流物又會降低有效斷面。若只增加平均水深來滿足公式流量，可能漏掉局部溢頂或岸坡沖蝕問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "A contraction or bend can control stage before the uniform reach does, while stored material and debris reduce effective area. Increasing assumed average depth to meet discharge can overlook local overtopping or bank erosion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若只增加平均水深來滿足公式流量，可能漏掉局部溢頂或岸坡沖蝕問題。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Increasing assumed average depth to meet discharge can overlook local overtopping or bank erosion.",
