       "objective": "說明「滿流隧洞的沿程損失」如何影響大壩施工導流的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Full-flow tunnel friction loss” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “River diversion during dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "導流隧洞在滿流與自由水面流之間可能轉換，水力邊界先於公式選擇。滿管沿程損失與速度平方成正比，糙率和局部缺陷會改變所需上下游能量差。 取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。假設滿流圓洞直徑6 m、長500 m、Darcy摩阻係數0.02、流量100 m³/s，v=3.537 m/s，hf=f(L/D)v²/(2g)=1.063 m；不含入口出口損失。 使用滿管公式卻忽略洞內自由水面和空氣囊會誤估能力，Darcy與Fanning係數混用又會差四倍。轉換流況可能出現脈動，平均能量線不能完全描述瞬間壓力。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「滿流隧洞的沿程損失」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Diversion tunnels may transition between free-surface and pressurized flow, so boundary classification precedes equation choice. Full-flow friction scales with velocity squared, and roughness or defects change the required upstream-downstream energy difference. Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s². Assume full circular diameter 6 m, length 500 m, Darcy factor 0.02 and discharge 100 m³/s. Velocity is 3.537 m/s and friction loss 1.063 m, excluding entrance and exit losses. Applying full-pipe relations despite free surfaces or air pockets misstates capacity, and confusing Darcy with Fanning factors introduces a factor of four. Flow transitions can pulsate, beyond what an average energy line describes. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Full-flow tunnel friction loss” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s².",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「導流隧洞的摩阻係數不分Darcy或Fanning定義都能直接代入同一公式。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Darcy and Fanning friction factors can be used interchangeably in the same tunnel formula.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「滿流隧洞的沿程損失」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Full-flow tunnel friction loss”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
