         "text": "教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。假設滿流圓洞直徑6 m、長500 m、Darcy摩阻係數0.02、流量100 m³/s，v=3.537 m/s，hf=f(L/D)v²/(2g)=1.063 m；不含入口出口損失。",
         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s². Assume full circular diameter 6 m, length 500 m, Darcy factor 0.02 and discharge 100 m³/s. Velocity is 3.537 m/s and friction loss 1.063 m, excluding entrance and exit losses.",
