       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Full-flow tunnel friction loss” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "沿洞線建立壓力與能量線，確認洞頂是否持續被壓力水面覆蓋；把摩阻係數和接縫突出物分開做敏感度，並比對進出口水位與流量，檢查自由流轉滿流的遲滯。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Construct pressure and energy lines and verify whether the crown remains pressurized. Separate friction sensitivity from protruding joints, compare inlet and outlet levels with discharge, and investigate hysteresis during transitions between free-surface and full flow. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以滿流隧洞的沿程損失編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。沿洞線建立壓力與能量線，確認洞頂是否持續被壓力水面覆蓋；把摩阻係數和接縫突出物分開做敏感度，並比對進出口水位與流量，檢查自由流轉滿流的遲滯。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for full-flow tunnel friction loss, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Construct pressure and energy lines and verify whether the crown remains pressurized. Separate friction sensitivity from protruding joints, compare inlet and outlet levels with discharge, and investigate hysteresis during transitions between free-surface and full flow.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：使用滿管公式卻忽略洞內自由水面和空氣囊會誤估能力，Darcy與Fanning係數混用又會差四倍。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Applying full-pipe relations despite free surfaces or air pockets misstates capacity, and confusing Darcy with Fanning factors introduces a factor of four. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
