       "objective": "從症狀倒推「滿流隧洞的沿程損失」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Full-flow tunnel friction loss” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "使用滿管公式卻忽略洞內自由水面和空氣囊會誤估能力，Darcy與Fanning係數混用又會差四倍。轉換流況可能出現脈動，平均能量線不能完全描述瞬間壓力。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Applying full-pipe relations despite free surfaces or air pockets misstates capacity, and confusing Darcy with Fanning factors introduces a factor of four. Flow transitions can pulsate, beyond what an average energy line describes. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：轉換流況可能出現脈動，平均能量線不能完全描述瞬間壓力。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Flow transitions can pulsate, beyond what an average energy line describes.",
       "failure": "誤判風險：若相信「導流隧洞的摩阻係數不分Darcy或Fanning定義都能直接代入同一公式。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。",
       "failureEn": "Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Darcy and Fanning friction factors can be used interchangeably in the same tunnel formula.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.",
       "check": "完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。",
       "checkEn": "Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.",
