       "instructionEn": "Debris changes both loss coefficient and area, so a fixed coefficient can understate deterioration. Asymmetric flow creates one-sided pressure and scour even while total discharge appears adequate, affecting the entrance and adjacent banks. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：偏流造成單側壓力與沖刷，即使總流量尚可，也可能已影響入口結構或鄰近岸坡。",
