    {
     "id": "b240-v15-s3",
     "title": "施工方法與施工階段控制",
     "titleEn": "Construction methods and stage control",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「圍堰底部的揚壓作用」與「收縮流與沖刷相似」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Cofferdam base uplift\" and \"Contraction flow and scour similarity\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b240-v15-17",
       "title": "圍堰底部的揚壓作用：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Cofferdam base uplift: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "v15s-usace-coffer",
        "v15s-usbr-construction",
        "b-src-water",
        "v15s-usbr-manuals"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b240-v15-16"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「圍堰底部的揚壓作用」如何影響大壩施工導流的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Cofferdam base uplift” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “River diversion during dam construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "圍堰暫時擋水不代表可忽略滲流，基底孔壓會降低有效法向力並影響抗滑。簡化三角揚壓只適用所列邊界，排水、截水和分層地基會改變實際分布。 取淡水單位重γw=9.81 kN/m³。假設每米堰長底寬12 m、上游水頭8 m、下游0 m且線性衰減，揚力0.5×9.81×8×12=470.88 kN/m；堰重900 kN/m則有效重429.12 kN/m。 停抽後孔壓可能比外水位變動更快影響穩定，基底局部高壓也會被平均值掩蓋。若將堰體自重全部當摩擦法向力，會高估可動用抗滑能力。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「圍堰底部的揚壓作用」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Temporary cofferdams still experience seepage, and base pressure reduces effective normal force and sliding resistance. A triangular uplift diagram applies only to stated boundaries; drains, cutoffs and layered foundations alter the actual distribution. Use freshwater unit weight γw=9.81 kN/m³. Assume twelve-metre base, upstream head eight metres, zero downstream head and linear decline. Uplift is 470.88 kN/m; weight 900 kN/m leaves effective normal weight 429.12 kN/m before other forces. Pressure after pumping interruption can quickly change stability, and local high pressures disappear in averages. Treating total cofferdam weight as frictional normal force overestimates resistance because uplift reduces effective contact loading. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Cofferdam base uplift” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：取淡水單位重γw=9.81 kN/m³。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Use freshwater unit weight γw=9.81 kN/m³.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「圍堰只是臨時構造，所以抗滑計算可以不扣除基底揚壓。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Because a cofferdam is temporary, uplift can be omitted from its sliding calculation.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「圍堰底部的揚壓作用」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Cofferdam base uplift”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b240-v15-17-k1",
         "title": "圍堰底部的揚壓作用",
         "titleEn": "Cofferdam base uplift",
         "text": "圍堰暫時擋水不代表可忽略滲流，基底孔壓會降低有效法向力並影響抗滑。簡化三角揚壓只適用所列邊界，排水、截水和分層地基會改變實際分布。",
         "textEn": "Temporary cofferdams still experience seepage, and base pressure reduces effective normal force and sliding resistance. A triangular uplift diagram applies only to stated boundaries; drains, cutoffs and layered foundations alter the actual distribution.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-coffer",
          "v15s-usbr-construction",
          "b-src-water",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals"
         ]
        },
        {
         "id": "b240-v15-17-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：圍堰只是臨時構造，所以抗滑計算可以不扣除基底揚壓。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Because a cofferdam is temporary, uplift can be omitted from its sliding calculation. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
