       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「圍堰底部的揚壓作用」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Cofferdam base uplift” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "沿基底和出口配置對應剖面的水頭觀測，核對尾水與抽排水位變化；把量測分布積分後與假設三角圖比較，另查出口梯度和濁度，避免把抗滑與內部侵蝕問題混為一項。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Observe heads along the base and exit section, checking tailwater and pumping changes. Integrate measurements against the assumed triangle and assess exit gradient and turbidity separately so sliding and internal erosion are not treated as one mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以圍堰底部的揚壓作用編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。沿基底和出口配置對應剖面的水頭觀測，核對尾水與抽排水位變化；把量測分布積分後與假設三角圖比較，另查出口梯度和濁度，避免把抗滑與內部侵蝕問題混為一項。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for cofferdam base uplift, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Observe heads along the base and exit section, checking tailwater and pumping changes. Integrate measurements against the assumed triangle and assess exit gradient and turbidity separately so sliding and internal erosion are not treated as one mechanism.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：停抽後孔壓可能比外水位變動更快影響穩定，基底局部高壓也會被平均值掩蓋。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Pressure after pumping interruption can quickly change stability, and local high pressures disappear in averages. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
