         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "平均斷面流速可能漏掉貼岸高速射流，護底本身又會把沖刷轉移到末端。以某一瞬間無明顯變化判定穩定，可能忽略長時間淘刷或洪水退水期的破壞。",
         "textEn": "Section-average velocity misses bank-attached jets, while protection can shift scour to its downstream edge. Apparent short-term stability does not exclude cumulative erosion or failure during recession when support and hydraulic conditions change.",
