         "textEn": "Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume triangular excess flow lasting two hours and peaking at 60 m³/s. Required storage is 216000 m³; constant effective surface area 120000 m² gives stage rise 1.8 m, excluding changing outlet capacity.",
