       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「洪峰暫存與水位上升」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Flood storage and stage rise” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "用連續方程逐時段核對入流、出流與水位容積曲線，改變時間步長檢查數值守恆；將下游回水與淹沒敏感設施疊入高程圖，確認可用暫存不是單純地形空間。比較線性與非線性庫容曲線。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Check inflow, outflow and stage-storage through time and vary timestep to test numerical conservation. Overlay downstream backwater and vulnerable facilities on elevations, verifying that usable storage is not merely an unoccupied geometric volume. Compare linear and nonlinear stage-storage representations. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以洪峰暫存與水位上升編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。用連續方程逐時段核對入流、出流與水位容積曲線，改變時間步長檢查數值守恆；將下游回水與淹沒敏感設施疊入高程圖，確認可用暫存不是單純地形空間。比較線性與非線性庫容曲線。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for flood storage and stage rise, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check inflow, outflow and stage-storage through time and vary timestep to test numerical conservation. Overlay downstream backwater and vulnerable facilities on elevations, verifying that usable storage is not merely an unoccupied geometric volume. Compare linear and nonlinear stage-storage representations.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：出流能力通常隨水位上升改變，固定能力三角示例可能高估或低估暫存。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Outflow capacity usually changes with stage, making the fixed-capacity triangle potentially conservative or unconservative. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
