         "title": "現場實務",
         "titleEn": "Site practice",
         "text": "以洪峰暫存與水位上升編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。用連續方程逐時段核對入流、出流與水位容積曲線，改變時間步長檢查數值守恆；將下游回水與淹沒敏感設施疊入高程圖，確認可用暫存不是單純地形空間。比較線性與非線性庫容曲線。",
         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for flood storage and stage rise, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check inflow, outflow and stage-storage through time and vary timestep to test numerical conservation. Overlay downstream backwater and vulnerable facilities on elevations, verifying that usable storage is not merely an unoccupied geometric volume. Compare linear and nonlinear stage-storage representations.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "v15s-usace-coffer",
          "v15s-usbr-construction",
          "b-src-water",
          "v15s-usbr-manuals"
         ]
        }
