       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「基坑降水與滲流供給」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Excavation dewatering and seepage supply” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以抽水量、坑外孔壓和河水位同步反算等效供水，檢查停抽回復曲線辨認儲水與補注；分開雨水、施工用水及地下水收支，並記錄濁度以追查是否帶出細料。查核集水管是否混入地表逕流。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Compare pumping, outside piezometers and river stage to infer supply, using recovery curves to distinguish storage from recharge. Account separately for rainfall, process water and groundwater, recording turbidity to identify possible particle transport. Check surface-runoff entry into the collection system. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：以基坑降水與滲流供給編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。以抽水量、坑外孔壓和河水位同步反算等效供水，檢查停抽回復曲線辨認儲水與補注；分開雨水、施工用水及地下水收支，並記錄濁度以追查是否帶出細料。查核集水管是否混入地表逕流。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for excavation dewatering and seepage supply, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare pumping, outside piezometers and river stage to infer supply, using recovery curves to distinguish storage from recharge. Account separately for rainfall, process water and groundwater, recording turbidity to identify possible particle transport. Check surface-runoff entry into the collection system.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：抽水流量增加可能來自裂隙被開挖接通或施工水混入，未必是整體k變大。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Higher pumping can reflect newly exposed fractures or process water rather than increased bulk permeability. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
