         "textEn": "Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for excavation dewatering and seepage supply, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare pumping, outside piezometers and river stage to infer supply, using recovery curves to distinguish storage from recharge. Account separately for rainfall, process water and groundwater, recording turbidity to identify possible particle transport. Check surface-runoff entry into the collection system.",
