       "observationEn": "Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for diversion transitions and critical duration, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Build dependencies from actual completion criteria and verify whether inspections can truly run in parallel with work. Overlay duration on seasonal exposure and examine how delays change available diversion states, recording update responsibility and hydrologically triggered review decisions. Include shared-equipment occupancy explicitly in the schedule.",
