       "objective": "從症狀倒推「導流切換與關鍵工期」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。",
       "objectiveEn": "Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Diversion transitions and critical duration” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.",
       "instruction": "名義平行的工作可能共享設備或通道，隱藏資源限制會使計算工期過短。若把驗證當成可壓縮空檔，可能在尚未證明新通道能力時就失去原來的導流冗餘。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Nominally parallel tasks may share equipment or access, so hidden resource constraints shorten calculated duration unrealistically. Treating verification as expendable slack can remove previous diversion redundancy before the new route has demonstrated capacity. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
       "observation": "連結機制：若把驗證當成可壓縮空檔，可能在尚未證明新通道能力時就失去原來的導流冗餘。",
       "observationEn": "Link to the mechanism: Treating verification as expendable slack can remove previous diversion redundancy before the new route has demonstrated capacity.",
