   "workedExample": {
    "title": "原創假想算例與邊界",
    "titleEn": "Original hypothetical example and boundaries",
    "text": "整合算例輸入全為教學假設，先檢查總水頭與共同基準：z=142 m; gaugePressure=196.2 kPa; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; totalHead=142+196.2/9.81=162 m；再獨立檢查達西流量與梯度：k=0.00002 m/s; A=500 m2; deltaHead=12 m; L=50 m; Q=k*A*deltaHead/L=0.0024 m3/s。敏感度：相同幾何與滲透係數下，水頭差由12m增為15m，達西流量由0.0024增為0.0030m3/s，即增加25%；水頭降低仍流量上升才需另查通道變化。 兩個結果須按各自量綱解釋，不能直接相加或當成完整設計。採飽和等溫一維或集中參數示意，實際壩體可能非均質且具暫態儲水。 將比較同季節不同水位的導水指標並核對下游水頭實測作為獨立驗證，明確列出尚缺的現地輸入及其對結論的影響。",
    "textEn": "Every input in this integrated example is a teaching assumption. First examine Total head and common datum: z=142 m; gaugePressure=196.2 kPa; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; totalHead=142+196.2/9.81=162 m. Independently examine Darcy discharge and gradient: k=0.00002 m/s; A=500 m2; deltaHead=12 m; L=50 m; Q=k*A*deltaHead/L=0.0024 m3/s. Sensitivity: with unchanged geometry and conductivity, increasing head difference from12 to15m raises Darcy discharge from0.0024 to0.0030m3/s, or25 percent; rising flow despite falling head calls for a separate pathway investigation. Interpret each result in its own dimensions rather than adding them or treating them as a complete design. Saturated isothermal one-dimensional or lumped examples do not represent heterogeneous transient dam foundations. Use the following independent check: Compare conductance across stage bands in one season and verify measured downstream head. Identify missing field inputs and state which conclusions depend on them.",
    "assumptions": "數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。",
    "assumptionsEn": "Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.",
    "sourceScope": "原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。",
    "sourceScopeEn": "Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."
   },
