     "教學假設：達西流量與梯度；k=0.00002 m/s; A=500 m2; deltaHead=12 m; L=50 m; Q=k*A*deltaHead/L=0.0024 m3/s",
     "教學假設：三角堰率定水深；Calibrated free-flow rating Q=1.40*H**2.5 m3/s with H in m; H=0.10 m; Q=0.00442719 m3/s",
     "教學假設：集水分區水量平衡；Steady sump: measured=18 L/s; rainfallRunoff=5 L/s; maintenance=2 L/s; inferredSeepage=18-5-2=11 L/s",
