         "id": "b241-v15-01-k2",
         "title": "誤解辨析",
         "titleEn": "Misconception check",
         "text": "誤解：孔壓數值可以直接與不同高程的水位相比 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Pressure values can be compared directly with water level at any elevation Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
         "sourceIds": [
