         "textEn": "Compare surveyed sensor elevations against same-day manual standpipe readings. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Unsynchronized pressure or elevation references produce a persistent offset across the head series. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted.",
         "sourceIds": [
