       "failure": "常見誤解：「流量上升就足以證明壩體正在遭到侵蝕」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"Rising flow alone proves active erosion within the dam\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
