       ],
       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「達西流量與梯度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Darcy discharge and gradient” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以同時水頭差與集水流量建立分水位區間的散點圖。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「把降雨旁流併入滲流會誇大推估導水能力」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Plot simultaneous head difference and collected discharge in separate reservoir-stage bands. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Including rainfall bypass in seepage exaggerates inferred hydraulic conductance. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：交接時以以同時水頭差與集水流量建立分水位區間的散點圖作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對把降雨旁流併入滲流會誇大推估導水能力，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Plot simultaneous head difference and collected discharge in separate reservoir-stage bands. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Including rainfall bypass in seepage exaggerates inferred hydraulic conductance. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：把降雨旁流併入滲流會誇大推估導水能力。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Including rainfall bypass in seepage exaggerates inferred hydraulic conductance. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
