         "textEn": "Plot simultaneous head difference and collected discharge in separate reservoir-stage bands. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Including rainfall bypass in seepage exaggerates inferred hydraulic conductance. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted.",
