         "textEn": "Check the rating by timed-volume collection and record nappe ventilation and tailwater. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Applying a free-flow rating during submergence creates systematic discharge error. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted.",
         "sourceIds": [
