         "textEn": "At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Check the rating by timed-volume collection and record nappe ventilation and tailwater. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Applying a free-flow rating during submergence creates systematic discharge error. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
