         "textEn": "Applying a free-flow rating during submergence creates systematic discharge error. Diagnose it by the following check: Check the rating by timed-volume collection and record nappe ventilation and tailwater. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
