         "text": "誤解：所有集水槽流量都是穿越壩體的地下水 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。",
         "textEn": "Misconception: Every collected drainage flow is groundwater passing through the dam Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.",
