         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions: Steady sump: measured=18 L/s; rainfallRunoff=5 L/s; maintenance=2 L/s; inferredSeepage=18-5-2=11 L/s. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds.",
         "sourceIds": [
