       "instruction": "省略集水坑蓄水變化會把抽水週期誤讀為壩體滲流脈動。診斷時應採取以下查核：獨立量測地表截水溝與維護排放並核對集水坑水位穩定，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。",
       "instructionEn": "Ignoring sump storage turns pump cycling into an apparent seepage pulse. Diagnose it by the following check: Meter surface interception and maintenance releases independently and verify steady sump level. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.",
