         "text": "原創教學假設：First-order step: deltaHead=4 m; tau=6 h; elapsed=12 h; observedRise=4*(1-exp(-12/6))=3.45866 m。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。",
         "textEn": "Original teaching assumptions: First-order step: deltaHead=4 m; tau=6 h; elapsed=12 h; observedRise=4*(1-exp(-12/6))=3.45866 m. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds.",
