         "textEn": "Clogging-induced slow response can be mistaken for stable low pore pressure. Diagnose it by the following check: Compare an independent piezometer during a known stage change and inspect tip recovery tests. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
