       "observation": "現場實務：交接時以同步量測出水溫度並將同水頭的流量按黏度比正規化作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對未補償水溫就提高警戒線可能掩蓋真正導水通道增長，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Measure outlet temperature simultaneously and normalize like-head discharge by the viscosity ratio. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Raising triggers without temperature correction can conceal genuine pathway growth. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
