    {
     "id": "b241-v15-s4",
     "title": "試驗、量測與監測驗證",
     "titleEn": "Testing, measurement and monitoring",
     "description": "本階段聚焦「含砂濃度與輸砂」與「水頭正規化導水」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。",
     "descriptionEn": "This stage covers \"Suspended concentration and sediment flux\" and \"Head-normalized hydraulic conductance\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.",
     "steps": [
      {
       "id": "b241-v15-25",
       "title": "含砂濃度與輸砂：機制與系統路徑",
       "titleEn": "Suspended concentration and sediment flux: mechanism and system paths",
       "estimatedMinutes": 20,
       "simulationOnly": true,
       "sourceIds": [
        "b-src-water-manuals",
        "v15s-usbr-monitoring",
        "v15s-fema-seepage",
        "v15s-usbr-embankment-history"
       ],
       "prerequisiteIds": [
        "b241-v15-24"
       ],
       "objective": "說明「含砂濃度與輸砂」如何影響壩體滲流監測的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。",
       "objectiveEn": "Explain how “Suspended concentration and sediment flux” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Seepage monitoring in dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.",
       "instruction": "濁度是光學訊號而不是直接泥砂質量，顆粒粒徑、色澤與氣泡皆會改變率定關係。要估算輸砂需採水樣測懸浮固體濃度，再與同時流量相乘；清澈水也不能排除早期內部沖蝕，因顆粒可能在下游反濾中被攔住。 驗證時應同步採取重量法水樣與濁度訊號並記錄粒徑及流量，並辨識以下失效情境：氣泡提高濁度但沒有增加固體質量會引發錯誤輸砂警報。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「含砂濃度與輸砂」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "Turbidity is an optical signal rather than sediment mass; grain size, color and bubbles affect its calibration. Estimate sediment flux from sampled suspended concentration multiplied by simultaneous discharge. Clear water does not exclude early internal erosion because mobilized grains may remain trapped in downstream filters instead of reaching the outlet. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Pair gravimetric water samples with turbidity readings and document grain size and discharge. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Bubbles raise turbidity without adding solid mass and can trigger false sediment alarms. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Suspended concentration and sediment flux” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
       "observation": "量級提示：原創教學假設：Q=0.012 m3/s; sampledSSC=80 mg/L=0.080 kg/m3; massFlux=0.012*0.080*3600=3.456 kg/h。",
       "observationEn": "Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: Q=0.012 m3/s; sampledSSC=80 mg/L=0.080 kg/m3; massFlux=0.012*0.080*3600=3.456 kg/h.",
       "failure": "常見誤解：「濁度數字可以直接當作每公升泥砂重量」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。",
       "failureEn": "Common misconception: \"The turbidity number directly equals sediment mass per litre\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.",
       "check": "系統圖標明「含砂濃度與輸砂」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。",
       "checkEn": "The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Suspended concentration and sediment flux”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.",
       "knowledge": [
        {
         "id": "b241-v15-25-k1",
         "title": "含砂濃度與輸砂",
         "titleEn": "Suspended concentration and sediment flux",
         "text": "濁度是光學訊號而不是直接泥砂質量，顆粒粒徑、色澤與氣泡皆會改變率定關係。要估算輸砂需採水樣測懸浮固體濃度，再與同時流量相乘；清澈水也不能排除早期內部沖蝕，因顆粒可能在下游反濾中被攔住。",
         "textEn": "Turbidity is an optical signal rather than sediment mass; grain size, color and bubbles affect its calibration. Estimate sediment flux from sampled suspended concentration multiplied by simultaneous discharge.",
         "sourceIds": [
          "b-src-water-manuals",
