         "title": "失效模式",
         "titleEn": "Failure mode",
         "text": "誤用固定下游水頭會在尾水升高時製造假導水變化。診斷時應採取以下查核：比較同季節不同水位的導水指標並核對下游水頭實測，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。",
         "textEn": "Assuming fixed downstream head creates false conductance change when tailwater rises. Diagnose it by the following check: Compare conductance across stage bands in one season and verify measured downstream head. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.",
         "sourceIds": [
