       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Inject a timestamped test signal and measure latency from local logging to control-room display. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: A shared power failure removes evidence from both nominally redundant sensors. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
