       "instruction": "預測基線應含水位、溫度與降雨等解釋變數，再對量測殘差建立誤差範圍。獨立標準不確定度可用平方和開根號組合，共同校正偏差則不能當作獨立項相消。統計異常只是調查線索，是否啟動工程處置仍依失效模式與核准程序。 驗證時應以保留資料驗證基線殘差並分列共同偏差與獨立雜訊，並辨識以下失效情境：用同一事件重新擬合基線會把新滲流異常吸收到正常模型。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「基線殘差與不確定度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。",
       "instructionEn": "A baseline should explain stage, temperature and rainfall before assigning uncertainty to residuals. Independent standard uncertainties combine by root sum of squares; shared calibration bias cannot be treated as independent cancellation. A statistical anomaly is an investigation signal, while engineering action depends on failure mechanisms and approved response procedures. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Validate baseline residuals on held-out observations and separate shared bias from independent noise. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Refitting the baseline on the event itself absorbs a new seepage anomaly into normal behavior. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Baseline residual and uncertainty” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.",
