       "objective": "設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「基線殘差與不確定度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。",
       "objectiveEn": "Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Baseline residual and uncertainty” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.",
       "instruction": "以保留資料驗證基線殘差並分列共同偏差與獨立雜訊。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「用同一事件重新擬合基線會把新滲流異常吸收到正常模型」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。",
       "instructionEn": "Validate baseline residuals on held-out observations and separate shared bias from independent noise. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Refitting the baseline on the event itself absorbs a new seepage anomaly into normal behavior. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.",
       "observation": "現場實務：交接時以以保留資料驗證基線殘差並分列共同偏差與獨立雜訊作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對用同一事件重新擬合基線會把新滲流異常吸收到正常模型，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。",
       "observationEn": "Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Validate baseline residuals on held-out observations and separate shared bias from independent noise. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Refitting the baseline on the event itself absorbs a new seepage anomaly into normal behavior. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.",
       "failure": "注意干擾：用同一事件重新擬合基線會把新滲流異常吸收到正常模型。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。",
       "failureEn": "Watch for interference: Refitting the baseline on the event itself absorbs a new seepage anomaly into normal behavior. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.",
       "check": "提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。",
       "checkEn": "Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.",
       "knowledge": [
